#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE"
