msgstr "红色浆果味道最好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED"
msgid "I don't think heat improved them."
msgstr "我不觉得加热让它们变好了。"

