#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE"
