msgstr "糖果，糖果，糖果！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "This makes covering ground much easier."
msgstr "有了它，走路轻松多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
