msgstr "很重，不过我想这正是重点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
