msgstr "好多土豆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "只是一堆种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN"
msgid "A fern in a pot."
msgstr "盆里的蕨类植物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE"
msgid "This never ends well."
msgstr "这从来不会有好结果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY"
msgid "Please keep your hands off my things."
msgstr "请别碰我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Reassuringly dry."
msgstr "干得让人放心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Simple design, but functional."
msgstr "设计简单，但很实用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE"
msgid "I don't like the way he swings that paddle around."
msgstr "我不喜欢他挥舞桨的方式。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC"
msgid "A bird. I wonder if it's tasty."
msgstr "一只鸟。不知道好不好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD"
msgid "Got you."
msgstr "抓到你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING"
msgid "I bet I could sneak up on it now."
msgstr "我敢说现在能偷偷靠近它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with this."
msgstr "不知道能用这个做什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE"
msgid "Cookies."
msgstr "饼干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE"
msgid "I'm going to eat this whole thing."
msgstr "这一整个我都要吃掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED"
msgid "Roasting turned out well."
msgstr "烤得很成功。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN"
msgid "A warm glow from the inside. Lovely."
msgstr "从里面透出温暖的光。真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I could put a very large candle in there."
msgstr "里面可以放一支非常大的蜡烛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "Some seeds."
msgstr "一些种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "Excuse me, I'm just practicing."
msgstr "打扰了，我只是在练习。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "It's pretty."
msgstr "真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
msgid "Has science gone too far?"
msgstr "科学是不是走得太远了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM"
msgid "Odd."
msgstr "真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE"
msgid "Some sort of weird rock."
msgstr "某种奇怪的岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL"
msgid "I wonder where all the food goes. Probably somewhere unpleasant."
msgstr "不知道这些食物都到哪里去了。大概不是什么好地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't. Look. Up."
msgstr "不要。往。上。看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD"
