msgstr "它们和我们家的猪没什么不同。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING"
