#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
