msgstr "也许有一天它会回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING"
