#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST"
msgid "Vests are so in."
