msgstr "航海科学。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO"
