#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE"
