msgstr "他就不能自己去拿吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3"
msgid "Yeah, that looks like a Whaddayacallit! Or was it a Whatchamahoosit..."
msgstr "对，这看起来就是那个什么来着！还是那个叫什么的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4"
msgid "I found a tool! Maybe it's the one he's looking for?"
msgstr "我找到一件工具！也许就是他要找的那件？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5"
msgid "Looks like strange science equipment. Perhaps the old gentleman is looking for it."
msgstr "看起来像奇怪的科学设备。也许那位老先生正在找它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "So, who're we going to make walk it?"
msgstr "那么，我们要让谁走上去呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS"
msgid "So, who are we going to make walk it?"
msgstr "那么，我们要让谁走上去呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD"
msgid "It's not much fun, but a least it's pretty."
msgstr "这不是很有趣，但至少很漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK"
msgid "A walking stick. Sensible."
msgstr "一根手杖。很合理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE"
msgid "Couldn't we have made walls out of literally anything else?"
msgstr "我们就不能用别的东西来砌墙吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM"
msgid "Building is so much work."
msgstr "盖房子真费工夫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "It didn't keep the fire out."
msgstr "它没能挡住火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "This will keep all sorts of things out!"
msgstr "这能把各种东西都挡在外面！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "This seems like a bad idea."
msgstr "这似乎是个坏主意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "Safe for now."
msgstr "目前安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "I guess I could carry it."
msgstr "我想我能带上它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "And they'll huff and they'll puff!"
msgstr "任它们又吹又喘！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2"
msgid "And they'll huff and they'll puff!"
msgstr "任它们又吹又喘！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "Will those fit in my pockets?"
msgstr "这些装得进我的口袋吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP"
msgid "Scrap can still make a useful wall."
msgstr "废料也能砌成有用的墙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM"
msgid "I'll reinforce the camp with these."
msgstr "用这些加固营地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "It will do."
msgstr "这样就行了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2"
msgid "It will do."
msgstr "这样就行了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "These are surprisingly heavy."
msgstr "这些东西非常重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt!"
msgstr "烧焦了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Pointy!"
msgstr "尖尖的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "I don't enjoy hiding."
msgstr "我不喜欢躲躲藏藏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "Please stop following me."
msgstr "请别再跟着我了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "I rather like the look of it."
msgstr "我还挺喜欢它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "I'm not going in there."
msgstr "我不进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "Everyone has a nicer house than me."
msgstr "每个人的房子都比我的好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "A handsome tusk."
msgstr "一根漂亮的海象牙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER"
msgid "He finally snapped."
msgstr "他终于崩溃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Oh... s-should i start making a fire too?"
msgstr "哦……我、我也应该开始生火吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "您好，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "I think he's actually having fun."
msgstr "我觉得他其实玩得很开心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer confirmed. Stand down."
msgstr "确认为杀人者。停止行动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "Thank you, Walter. I suppose I owe you an apology for teasing."
msgstr "谢谢你，沃尔特。看来我得为之前取笑你道歉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "It doesn't suit me."
msgstr "它不适合我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER"
msgid "Please, watch it!"
msgstr "请小心一点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Stop it, %s! You're going to get in trouble!"
msgstr "住手，%s！你会惹上麻烦的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "您好，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST"
msgid "I'm guessing something went wrong."
msgstr "我猜是出了什么差错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer confirmed. Keep your distance."
msgstr "确认为杀人者。保持距离。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is always there when we need her."
msgstr "我们需要她的时候，%s 总是在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "Fire fire fire!"
msgstr "着火了，着火了，着火了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "The fire has gone out."
msgstr "火已经熄了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "It holds dark, forbidden secrets..."
msgstr "它蕴藏着黑暗、禁忌的秘密……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "You're a big mean!"
msgstr "你这个大坏蛋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Controlled burn in progress."
msgstr "正在进行受控焚烧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't just leave that lying around."
msgstr "不能就这样把它丢在这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Oh, come now."
msgstr "哦，别这样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGLET"
msgid "N-nice puppy..."
msgstr "好、好狗狗……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING"
msgid "That's what we were supposed to do, right?"
msgstr "我们本来就该这么做，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "I may've misunderstood."
msgstr "我可能误会了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "I need to put a torch in it."
msgstr "我得往里面放支火把。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "That looks much better."
msgstr "这样好看多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been serving up knuckle sandwiches."
msgstr "%s 一直在请人吃拳头三明治。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I don't think you were supposed to start that fire."
msgstr "我认为你不应该点燃那场大火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "您好，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST"
msgid "Did you mean to do that?"
msgstr "您是故意的吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "Stay back. Keep a safe distance."
msgstr "退后。保持安全距离。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "%s would never leave anyone behind."
msgstr "%s永远不会丢下任何人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Oh, that looks dangerous."
msgstr "哦，那看起来很危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "I think those bees are mad."
msgstr "我想那些蜜蜂气疯了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "I'd rather stay dry."
msgstr "我宁愿保持干爽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "That's more like it."
msgstr "这样好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Who put this water here?"
msgstr "谁把水放在这里的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "Sticky sweet."
msgstr "又黏又甜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "Well, that's one use for this fruit."
msgstr "嗯，这就是这种水果的用途之一。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "Just the thing for a hot summer day."
msgstr "炎热夏日正需要它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Juicy and warm."
msgstr "多汁且温暖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That's far too much water."
msgstr "水分实在太多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "I can grow these with enough time."
msgstr "只要有足够的时间，我就能种出这些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid "A large aquatic flower."
msgstr "一朵很大的水生花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "It's small now, but it'll get bigger."
msgstr "现在还小，但以后会更大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "Noted. I underestimated this one."
msgstr "记下了。我低估了这个。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Do I really want to grow more of these things?"
msgstr "我真的想再种这种东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "Hey... is that a fish inside?"
msgstr "嘿嘿……里面有鱼吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "The bigger the tree."
msgstr "树越大……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Is big tree root."
msgstr "是大树根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "Please, calm down, %s."
msgstr "请冷静，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You're supposed to put fires out when you're finished."
msgstr "用完火应该把它扑灭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello, %s."
msgstr "您好，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "I'll fetch you a heart, %s. Might I borrow your helm in return?"
msgstr "我去帮你找颗心，%s。作为回报，能借我你的头盔吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer confirmed. Maintain formation."
msgstr "确认为杀人者。保持阵形。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s doesn't let anyone fall in battle!"
msgstr "%s不会让任何人在战斗中倒下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "It's got a name scratched on the inside. A W, I think..."
msgstr "内侧刻了一个名字。我想是个W……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT"
msgid "Not suitable for me"
msgstr "不适合我"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD"
msgid "That shield looks pretty durable."
msgstr "那面盾牌看起来相当耐用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT"
msgid "Preserved just as it was."
msgstr "保持着原来的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Paper rubbed with beeswax. Neat."
