msgstr "哦，亮晶晶的。真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE"
