msgstr "哎呀。这可不是我说的那种庆祝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT"
