msgstr "它们的味道还是一样的，对吧？对吧……？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
