msgstr "小心，它可能有狂犬病。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
