msgstr "我发誓这只猴子在跟着我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
