msgid "The Red-Eyes Girl"
msgstr "红眼少女"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.ABIGAIL_TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.ABIGAIL_TENSEIGA"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. Not even Tenseiga can bring her back.\" - Louis"
msgstr "“对不起，就算是天生牙，也救不回她。”——露易丝"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_CLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_CLASS"
msgid "\"I'm not skipping class. I'm just studying somewhere with fresh air.\" - Kiritzuka"
msgstr "“我没翘课，只是换个空气好的地方自习。”——Kiritzuka"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_COLLECTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_COLLECTION"
msgid "\"A crowbar, some rebar, a baseball bat. What? Every girl has a collection.\" - Kiritzuka"
msgstr "“撬棍、钢筋、棒球棒。怎么了？哪个女生没点收藏。”——Kiritzuka"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_DOOR"
msgid "\"I only knocked. The door gave up on its own.\" - Kiritzuka"
msgstr "“我只是敲了一下门，是门自己先放弃的。”——Kiritzuka"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_TOFU
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.KIRITZUKA_TOFU"
msgid "\"It's soft tofu, it's soft tofu, it's soft... oops.\" - Kiritzuka"
msgstr "“是嫩豆腐，是嫩豆腐，是嫩……啊，碎了。”——Kiritzuka"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.TOKIJIN"
msgid "\"Tokijin's evil spirit is too strong. I can barely hold it back, let alone control it.\" - Louis"
msgstr "“斗鬼神的邪气太重了，我连压住它都很勉强，更别说驾驭它。”——露易丝"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WANDA_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WANDA_REDEYES"
msgid "\"How odd. Your past is lost in a white fog. I can't see a single timeline.\" - Wanda"
msgstr "“奇怪……你过去的时间线全被白雾遮住了，我一条也看不清。”——旺达"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WATHGRITHR_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WATHGRITHR_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Those crimson eyes! Loki himself has granted thee his power!\" - Wigfrid"
msgstr "“这双赤红之眼！是洛基亲自赐予你的力量！”——薇格弗德"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WAXWELL_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WAXWELL_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Magic didn't turn those eyes red. That's a curse, and not one from this world.\" - Maxwell"
msgstr "“你的眼睛不是被魔法染红的。那是诅咒，而且不属于这个世界。”——麦斯威尔"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WEBBER_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WEBBER_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Sorry, Miss Louis! We thought you were wearing red contact lenses.\" - Webber"
msgstr "“对不起，露易丝小姐！我们还以为你戴了红色的隐形眼镜。”——韦伯"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WICKERBOTTOM_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WICKERBOTTOM_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Science cannot explain why your eyes turn red, dear. Neither, I'm afraid, can magic.\" - Wickerbottom"
msgstr "“科学解释不了你的眼睛为什么会变红，亲爱的。恐怕魔法也解释不了。”——薇克巴顿"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WILSON_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WILSON_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Nothing out here is normal anyway. A girl with red eyes hardly stands out.\" - Wilson"
msgstr "“反正这里就没有正常的东西，一个红眼睛的女孩根本不算稀奇。”——威尔逊"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WINONA_KIRITZUKA
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WINONA_KIRITZUKA"
msgid "\"Kid, that's the third wrench you've bent this week.\" - Winona"
msgstr "“小妹，这礼拜你已经弄弯第三把扳手了。”——薇诺娜"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WOLFGANG_KIRITZUKA
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WOLFGANG_KIRITZUKA"
msgid "\"Tiny schoolgirl lifts more than Wolfgang? Wolfgang must train harder!\" - Wolfgang"
msgstr "“小小女学生比沃尔夫冈还能举？沃尔夫冈要更努力训练！”——沃尔夫冈"

#. STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WORTOX_REDEYES
msgctxt "STRINGS.M_LOADINGTIPS.WORTOX_REDEYES"
msgid "\"Hyuyu! Those red eyes of yours see what mortals can't, don't they?\" - Wortox"
msgstr "“呼呼！你这双红眼睛，看得见凡人看不见的东西吧？”——沃拓克斯"

