#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.1"
msgid "Gentle Brute..."
msgstr "温柔的怪力者……"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.2"
msgid "A barred door could not keep you out."
msgstr "一扇紧闭的门，挡不住你。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.3"
msgid "Yet if someone is within, you knock first."
msgstr "可门后若有人，你便会先敲门。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.4"
msgid "And when you help someone to their feet, you are just as careful."
msgstr "你伸手扶人时，也总是那样小心。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.5"
msgid "I once thought strength meant I need never ask leave again."
msgstr "我曾以为，有了力量，便不必再等谁应允。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.6"
msgid "Wherever I went, they made way for me."
msgstr "我走到哪里，哪里便有人让路。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.7"
msgid "In time, I understood why they stepped aside."
msgstr "后来，我才明白他们为何让路。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.8"
msgid "By then, it was too late."
msgstr "那时，已经太迟了。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.9"
msgid "You have the strength I once longed for, child."
msgstr "你有我曾渴求的力量，孩子。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.10"
msgid "And the patience I forsook long ago."
msgstr "也有我早就舍弃的耐心。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.11"
msgid "Do not apologize for your hands."
msgstr "别为你的双手道歉。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.KIRITZUKA.12"
msgid "When someone falls, they will still hope you reach for them."
msgstr "有人倒下时，仍会盼你伸手。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.1"
msgid "Red-Eyed Wanderer..."
msgstr "赤瞳的旅人……"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.2"
msgid "I do not know the patterns on your clothes."
msgstr "我认不得你衣上的纹样。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.3"
msgid "But I can see how you hold your blade."
msgstr "但你执刀的手，我看得清。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.4
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.4"
msgid "That skill is yours. None can take it from you."
msgstr "你的本事，谁也夺不走。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.5
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.5"
msgid "You believe that where there is a will, there is a way."
msgstr "你相信，只要有心，总能找到办法。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.6
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.6"
msgid "So firmly did I believe it, too."
msgstr "我也曾如此深信。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.7
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.7"
msgid "When one door would not open, I tried the next."
msgstr "一道门打不开，我便去开下一道。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.8
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.8"
msgid "When they begged me to turn back, I called them cowards."
msgstr "有人劝我回头，我还嫌他们胆怯。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.9
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.9"
msgid "In the end, I could not remember why I had set out."
msgstr "到了最后，我已记不起自己为何出发。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.10
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.10"
msgid "Yet when you draw your blade, you remember who stands behind you."
msgstr "可你拔刀时，仍记得身后站着谁。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.11
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.11"
msgid "I once had many standing behind me."
msgstr "我曾有许多人站在身后。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.12
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.12"
msgid "And to the last, I never once looked back at them."
msgstr "到最后，我竟没回头看过他们一眼。"

#. STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.13
msgctxt "STRINGS.STALKER_NPC_INSPECT.MANUTSAWEE.13"
msgid "...May those you protect return with you."
msgstr "……愿你所护之人，能与你一同归去。"

