msgid "Omelette, Ice Cream, California Roll, Unagi, Blue Cap, Berries, Juice Berries"
msgstr "蛋包饭、冰淇淋、加州卷、鳗鱼、蓝蘑菇、浆果、多汁浆果"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.2.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.2.title"
msgid "Favorite Food"
msgstr "最喜欢的食物"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.desc"
msgid "Shino has never been in a single fight. But doors come off their hinges when she opens them, desks crack when she leans on them, and classmates she pats on the shoulder wince for a week. Add her habit of skipping class, and the whole school is convinced she's a delinquent girl. She just wishes things were a little less fragile."
msgstr "Shino 从来没打过架。可她一推门，门就从合页上掉下来；往课桌上一靠，桌子就裂了；拍拍同学的肩膀，对方能疼上一个礼拜。再加上经常翘课，全校都认定她是不良少女。她只希望这世上的东西能结实一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.3.title"
msgid "School Life"
msgstr "校园生活"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.4.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.4.desc"
msgid "Like any ordinary high school girl, Shino enjoys wandering around town and collecting things she finds interesting. Her collection just happens to include crowbars, rebar, baseball bats, and pipe wrenches. Perfectly normal, if you ask her."
msgstr "和所有普通的女高中生一样，Shino 喜欢在街上闲逛，收集自己觉得有意思的东西。只不过她的收藏里碰巧有撬棍、钢筋、棒球棒和水管钳。问她的话，她会说这再正常不过了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.4.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.4.title"
msgid "Free Time"
msgstr "闲暇时光"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.5.desc
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.5.desc"
msgid "Of all the tests at the spring health check, Shino dreads the grip test most. Last year, the dynamometer started smoking the moment she squeezed it.\n\nThis year she came prepared. She spent the whole night before practicing on tofu. Twelve blocks crushed, three survived. Good enough.\n\nThe school had bought a new imported dynamometer with twice the range. Shino took a deep breath and pictured soft tofu in her hand. The needle passed fifty, then a hundred, hit the end of the dial, went half a lap further, and stuck there with a click.\n\n\"I-I was being gentle!\" she said. \"I practiced on tofu!\"\n\nBehind her, students whispered that she'd once beaten up an entire basketball team by herself. Really, she'd only gotten their ball out of a tree. The tree came with it.\n\nThe PE teacher stared for a long time, then put the dynamometer in a drawer and wrote two words on the form: Equipment malfunction.\n\nThe next year, a line of fine print appeared on the health check notice: \"The grip test may be waived in special cases.\" Shino was delighted. No more tofu practice."
msgstr "每年春天的体检，Shino 最怕的就是握力测试。去年她刚握下去，握力计就冒了一缕白烟。\n\n今年她做足了准备，前一天晚上在家捏了一整晚豆腐练手感。碎了十二块，成功了三块。她觉得够了。\n\n学校专门买了一台量程翻倍的进口握力计。Shino 深吸一口气，想象手里捧着的是一块嫩豆腐。指针过了五十，过了一百，转到尽头又多转了半圈，最后“咔”地一声卡住不动了。\n\n“我、我已经很轻了！”她慌忙解释，“我昨天练过豆腐的！”\n\n后面排队的同学窃窃私语，说她初中时一个人打趴了整个篮球队。其实她只是帮篮球队把卡在树上的球拿下来，拿的时候连树一起拔了。\n\n体育老师沉默了很久，把握力计收进抽屉，在记录表上写下四个字：设备故障。\n\n第二年，体检通知上多了一行小字：“握力测试项目视个人情况可免测。”Shino 很高兴，她终于不用再练豆腐了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.5.title
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_BIOS.kiritzuka.5.title"
msgid "Health Check"
msgstr "体检日"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_long_sleeved_top
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_long_sleeved_top"
msgid "\"I'm keeping my hands in my sleeves until it warms up.\""
msgstr "“暖和起来之前，我要把手藏在袖子里。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid"
msgid "\"Welcome home, Master. ...What? I like this one. A lot.\""
msgstr "“欢迎回来，主人。……干嘛？我就是很喜欢这套。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_kimono
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_kimono"
msgid "\"Kimono and an apron. Whoever thought of this is a genius.\""
msgstr "“和服配围裙。想出这种搭配的人是天才。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_victorian"
msgid "\"Long skirt, proper apron. Now nobody can tell I'm a delinquent.\""
msgstr "“长裙配正经围裙。这下谁也看不出我是不良少女了。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_classic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_classic"
msgid "\"Ruffles, ribbon, the whole set. Don't you dare take a picture.\""
msgstr "“荷叶边、蝴蝶结，全套都齐了。不许拍照。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_highcollar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_maid_highcollar"
msgid "\"Buttoned all the way up. It's just a school uniform with an apron.\""
msgstr "“扣子一路扣到顶。这不就是加了围裙的校服嘛。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_cape_cardigan
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_cape_cardigan"
msgid "\"Short cape, long sleeves. Perfect for skipping class in winter.\""
msgstr "“短披肩配长袖。冬天翘课正合适。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_shirt_tie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_shirt_tie"
msgid "\"The tie stays on.\""
msgstr "“领带就这样系着。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_none"
msgid "\"How am I a delinquent? I didn't lengthen my skirt.\""
msgstr "“我哪里不良了？我又没把裙子改长。”"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_short_skirt
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_QUOTES.kiritzuka_short_skirt"
msgid "\"A little shorter. That doesn't mean I'm running another lap.\""
msgstr "“裙子短了一点，也不代表我愿意再跑一圈。”"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "I don't have the machinery for that."
msgstr "我身上可没有那种机械装置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM"
msgid "They only answer to another merm."
msgstr "它们只听鱼人的话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER"
msgid "That's too potent to use carelessly."
msgstr "药效太强了，不能随便用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION"
msgid "I'll wait my turn."
msgstr "等轮到我再用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING"
msgid "Put out the fire before we carve!"
msgstr "先灭火再雕刻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE"
msgid "I'll carve mine after you."
msgstr "等你刻完再轮到我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "It's fully charged already."
msgstr "电已经充满了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "There's no charge left to take."
msgstr "里面已经没有电了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "One hat is enough for this snowman."
msgstr "雪人戴一顶帽子就够了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "I'll let you finish decorating."
msgstr "等你装饰完再说。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "It's melting too quickly!"
msgstr "它融化得太快了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "Even I can't reach that high."
msgstr "连我也够不到那么高。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "I'll wait for her to return before moving anything."
msgstr "等她回来再搬东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Just out of reach!"
msgstr "只差一点就抓住了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "You picked the wrong person to surprise!"
msgstr "想偷袭我，你可选错人了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY"
msgid "Let's finish setting up the course first."
msgstr "先把球场布置完整。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN"
msgid "It won't budge yet."
msgstr "现在还拔不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "I'll leave that modification to Winona."
msgstr "改装的事情还是交给薇诺娜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM"
msgid "That medicine is meant for merms."
msgstr "这种药是给鱼人用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE"
msgid "Nothing left inside."
msgstr "里面什么都没有了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK"
msgid "It won't budge yet."
msgstr "现在还拔不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1"
msgid "This isn't my racer."
msgstr "这不是我的参赛选手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2"
msgid "Ow! Fine, I'll leave you alone."
msgstr "痛！好吧，不碰你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED"
msgid "Almost! I'll try again."
msgstr "差一点！再试一次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM"
msgid "I should respect the merms' belongings."
msgstr "还是别动鱼人的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "I don't have the machinery for that."
msgstr "我身上可没有那种机械装置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER"
msgid "I'll let Wortox handle what's inside."
msgstr "里面的东西交给沃拓克斯处理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED"
msgid "I don't have permission to use this."
msgstr "我不能使用这个容器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE"
msgid "I'll wait until there's room."
msgstr "等有空位再泡吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT"
msgid "I don't have the machinery for that."
msgstr "我身上可没有那种机械装置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER"
msgid "I don't know how to store souls."
msgstr "我不会储存灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED"
msgid "I don't have permission to use this."
msgstr "我不能使用这个容器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE"
msgid "Too much damage. I can't repair it."
msgstr "损坏太严重了，我修不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE"
msgid "I shouldn't tamper with someone else's equipment."
msgstr "别随便动别人的装备。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE"
msgid "The judge isn't answering."
msgstr "裁判没有回应。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE"
msgid "He's judging another contest."
msgstr "他正在评判另一场比赛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING"
msgid "Get away from those spikes!"
msgstr "离那些尖刺远一点！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED"
msgid "That gave me a little extra strength!"
msgstr "感觉又多了一些力量！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION"
msgid "I can see things I couldn't before..."
msgstr "我看见以前看不到的东西了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED"
msgid "My steps feel lighter!"
msgstr "脚步轻快多了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER"
msgid "That's too potent to use carelessly."
msgstr "药效太强了，不能随便用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB"
msgid "Finally free! Keep that stuff away from me!"
msgstr "终于出来了！别让那些东西再碰到我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD"
msgid "I'm out of the water! Now, where's the shore?"
msgstr "离开水面了！岸在哪里？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO"
msgid "Wait! I wasn't ready to drop!"
msgstr "等等！我还没准备好落下去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED"
msgid "I can't keep swimming much longer!"
msgstr "我游不了多久了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM"
msgid "They need a merm to lead them."
msgstr "它们需要鱼人来带领。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED"
msgid "Hey! A little warning next time!"
msgstr "下次喷水前先提醒一下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE"
msgid "That doesn't sound like Charlie..."
msgstr "那声音听着不像查理……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK"
msgid "Show yourself!"
msgstr "出来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "The balm has worn off. Time to reapply it."
msgstr "药膏失效了，得再涂一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE"
msgid "Made it! I need a moment to steady myself."
msgstr "到了！让我先站稳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT"
msgid "I need a better place to use this."
msgstr "得换个地方使用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND"
msgid "Keep that hand away from the light!"
msgstr "别让那只手碰到灯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING"
msgid "It's back! Draw your weapons!"
msgstr "它回来了！准备武器！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES"
msgid "Watch out! They're falling from the sky!"
msgstr "小心！它们从天上掉下来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS"
msgid "Listen. There's a whole flock up there."
msgstr "听，上面有一大群鸟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS"
msgid "Two will have to do."
msgstr "两只应该够用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1"
msgid "My stomach is burning!"
msgstr "肚子里烧得好痛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2"
msgid "That was a terrible thing to swallow!"
msgstr "真不该把它吞下去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "Finally... the burning stopped."
msgstr "终于……不再灼痛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL"
msgid "Those buzzards have changed. Stay alert!"
msgstr "那些秃鹫变异了，小心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE"
msgid "No carving until the flames are out."
msgstr "火灭了才能雕刻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN"
msgid "The den broke! Watch your footing!"
msgstr "巢穴坏了！小心脚下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS"
msgid "This won't hold up in deeper water!"
msgstr "它撑不住深水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID"
msgid "There's no ground beneath me!"
msgstr "脚下没有地面了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT"
msgid "I'll find a clearer place to blow it."
msgstr "找个空旷些的地方再吹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE"
msgid "Something is digging up toward us. Get ready!"
msgstr "有东西正朝我们挖过来，准备！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY"
msgid "That rabbit looks unusual!"
msgstr "那只兔子很特别！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT"
msgid "Got you! You're quick, but so am I."
msgstr "抓住了！你很快，我也不慢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE"
msgid "Listen... something is moving underground."
msgstr "听……地下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1"
msgid "Your Majesty... shall we play another hand?"
msgstr "陛下……还要再来一局吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2"
msgid "Your Highness, the cards are ready."
msgstr "殿下，牌已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3"
msgid "A royal title for a card game?"
msgstr "打一场牌就有王室头衔了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING"
msgid "It's tracking me! Keep moving!"
msgstr "它在追踪我！不能停！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH"
msgid "It struck and vanished! Stay together!"
msgstr "它打完就消失了！别分散！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW"
msgid "I need more snow to keep rolling."
msgstr "雪不够了，滚不起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG"
msgid "That's as large as I can make it."
msgstr "已经滚到最大了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN"
msgid "There's your opening! Strike!"
msgstr "破绽出现了！动手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST"
msgid "They're helping us. Take the opening!"
msgstr "它们在帮我们，趁现在！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING"
msgid "Something must be blocking the destination."
msgstr "另一端可能出了问题。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK"
msgid "This weapon won't get through!"
msgstr "这把武器还伤不到它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS"
msgid "Something enormous is moving below us."
msgstr "有什么庞然大物正在地下移动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT"
msgid "That didn't take me anywhere."
msgstr "没能传送出去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN"
msgid "They need a little more time."
msgstr "还要再等一会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK"
msgid "Heads down! Incoming birds!"
msgstr "低头！鸟群冲过来了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1"
msgid "Hello, Abigail. Staying close to Wendy?"
msgstr "你好，阿比盖尔，在陪温蒂吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2"
msgid "I'll watch over Wendy too."
msgstr "我也会照看温蒂的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1"
msgid "You're looking stronger today."
msgstr "你今天看起来更有精神了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2"
msgid "Ready to help your sister?"
msgstr "准备好帮助姐姐了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1"
msgid "I'll be glad to fight beside you."
msgstr "很高兴能和你一起战斗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2"
msgid "Wendy has a dependable sister."
msgstr "温蒂有个可靠的妹妹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED"
msgid "It moved! Watch its reach."
msgstr "它动了！注意攻击范围。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll keep an eye on that statue."
msgstr "我会留意那尊雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL"
msgid "All right. Let's see what this trial demands."
msgstr "好，让我看看这场试炼的要求。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "You've changed. I'll watch your movements."
msgstr "你变了，我会留意你的动作。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT"
msgid "That's the one we came to find."
msgstr "我们要找的就是它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "Still fighting? Then so am I!"
msgstr "还要打？我奉陪！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM"
msgid "A fruit with a gem inside. Handle it carefully."
msgstr "里面有宝石的果实，得小心处理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION"
msgid "I don't like food that keeps moving."
msgstr "我不喜欢还在动的食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED"
msgid "Cooked through. That looks more reassuring."
msgstr "烤熟了，看着安心一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC"
msgid "Gems growing on a tree... I should remember this spot."
msgstr "树上长着宝石……得记住这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP"
msgid "We've harvested all we can for now."
msgstr "暂时没有东西可以收了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC"
msgid "Those branches look unsettling."
msgstr "那些枝条看着让人不安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP"
msgid "Only the stump remains."
msgstr "只剩树桩了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It has started growing."
msgstr "已经开始生长了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "It needs a different season to grow."
msgstr "要到合适的季节才能长。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "This ground doesn't suit it."
msgstr "这里的土壤不适合它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "I'll choose the planting spot carefully."
msgstr "得认真选个种植的位置。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED"
msgid "Let's see what grows from this."
msgstr "看看它能长成什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK"
msgid "Someone didn't make it out of here."
msgstr "有人没能离开这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE"
msgid "Useful armor, though the rabbits might disagree."
msgstr "铠甲很实用，不过兔子可能有别的想法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY"
msgid "A sturdy shell. I can work with that."
msgstr "甲壳够结实，可以试试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT"
msgid "Armor for the festivities!"
msgstr "节日用的骑士铠甲！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING"
msgid "Draw your weapons. Something is coming."
msgstr "准备武器，有东西要来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC"
msgid "This is meant for the ritual."
msgstr "这是仪式需要的祭品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL"
msgid "The offering is in place. Stay ready."
msgstr "祭品已经放好，保持警戒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC"
msgid "This claw should complete part of the offering."
msgstr "这只钳子应该能用作祭品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL"
msgid "The offering is in place. Stay ready."
msgstr "祭品已经放好，保持警戒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC"
msgid "We brought back what the ritual requires."
msgstr "仪式需要的东西带回来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL"
msgid "The offering is in place. Stay ready."
msgstr "祭品已经放好，保持警戒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE"
msgid "One game before practice won't hurt."
msgstr "练习前玩一局也无妨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "A delicate bandage. Better than an open wound."
msgstr "绷带虽然轻薄，总比放着伤口不管好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID"
msgid "Keep that acid away from my blade!"
msgstr "别让酸液沾到我的刀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Something large is hiding in there."
msgstr "里面藏着一个大家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT"
msgid "It's empty now. Don't linger."
msgstr "现在空了，别停留太久。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID"
msgid "The acid has made it even more dangerous."
msgstr "酸液让它更危险了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll need room to dodge those wings."
msgstr "得留出躲避翅膀的空间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT"
msgid "I hope the protection is worth the smell."
msgstr "希望它的防护值得忍受这股气味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW"
msgid "Even its shadow is dangerous."
msgstr "连它的暗影也这么危险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD"
msgid "Rest now, big fellow."
msgstr "安息吧，大家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER"
msgid "I'm sorry. You deserved to come home with me."
msgstr "对不起，你本该和我一起回家的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Stand clear of the burning feathers."
msgstr "离燃烧的羽毛远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dead. Something killed it here."
msgstr "它死了，有什么东西杀了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's moving again! Get back!"
msgstr "它又动了！退后！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP"
msgid "A quick repair until we reach shore."
msgstr "先补好，撑到岸边再说。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER"
msgid "Keep our supplies secured for the voyage."
msgstr "把航行用的物资收好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM"
msgid "An old design. Let's build it properly."
msgstr "古老的设计，认真把它造好吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING"
msgid "A little more protection around the hull."
msgstr "给船体多加一点保护。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT"
msgid "I'll fit this before we sail."
msgstr "出航前先装上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "Heat might let me repair these pieces."
msgstr "加热后也许能把碎片修好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Stand clear of the burning feathers."
msgstr "离燃烧的羽毛远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's dead. Something killed it here."
msgstr "它死了，有什么东西杀了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It's moving again! Get back!"
msgstr "它又动了！退后！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3"
msgid "Let's see which figure I got!"
msgstr "看看这次是哪一个摆件！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL"
msgid "A small target. I can manage that."
msgstr "目标虽小，我能打中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB"
msgid "The grip is different from a sword."
msgstr "握法和刀不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY"
msgid "I'll build a course worth practicing on."
msgstr "我要布置一个值得练习的球场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY"
msgid "A good course to warm up on."
msgstr "适合先练习几次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD"
msgid "Now that's a proper challenge!"
msgstr "这个难度才值得挑战！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM"
msgid "This should test my aim."
msgstr "可以练练准头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT"
msgid "I'll have to aim around it."
msgstr "得瞄准它旁边的空隙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN"
msgid "I'll need to account for the wind."
msgstr "得考虑风向。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE"
msgid "That blocks a direct shot."
msgstr "没法直接打过去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL"
msgid "Wait for it to lower, then strike."
msgstr "等它降下去再击球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER"
msgid "Timing matters here."
msgstr "这里要看准时机。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING"
msgid "That will send the ball flying."
msgstr "能把球弹出去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE"
msgid "I wonder where the ball comes out."
msgstr "球会从哪里出来呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE"
msgid "One clean shot into the hole."
msgstr "稳稳地把球打进洞里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT"
msgid "I'll put the goal right here."
msgstr "终点就设在这里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC"
msgid "I need a token before I can play."
msgstr "要先放一枚代币才能玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE"
msgid "The course isn't ready yet."
msgstr "球场还没准备好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING"
msgid "Watch this shot!"
msgstr "看我这一球！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT"
msgid "This marks the starting point."
msgstr "用来设置起点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "That's an edge worth respecting."
msgstr "这刀刃的锋利程度不能轻视。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED"
msgid "Even the ferns can't take this heat."
msgstr "连蕨类都受不了这里的热气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD"
msgid "That one won't attack again."
msgstr "这只不会再攻击了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC"
msgid "Small doesn't mean harmless."
msgstr "小也不能轻视。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Keep quiet while it's asleep."
msgstr "趁它睡着，轻一点走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING"
msgid "Move away from the fumes!"
msgstr "躲开那些气体！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS"
msgid "I shouldn't breathe that in."
msgstr "不能吸入那些气体。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll watch for changes in the vent."
msgstr "我会留意喷口的变化。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "That's far too hot to touch."
msgstr "太烫了，不能碰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "We need to get out of this air."
msgstr "得离开这片瘴气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "Check the rope before climbing."
msgstr "攀爬之前先检查绳子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE"
msgid "Don't let those spikes trap you."
msgstr "别被那些尖刺困住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER"
msgid "Take what we need before going through."
msgstr "进去之前带齐需要的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS"
msgid "Steady. I won't lower my blade."
msgstr "稳住，我不会放下刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2"
msgid "I'll watch what she does next."
msgstr "看看她接下来要做什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3"
msgid "I don't trust this performance."
msgstr "我不相信这场表演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW"
msgid "A reminder to watch the ceiling."
msgstr "提醒我留意头顶的敌人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS"
msgid "We survived. That's worth remembering."
msgstr "我们活下来了，值得纪念。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "He looks calmer as a statue."
msgstr "变成雕像以后安静多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "This one won't burst out of the ground."
msgstr "这一只不会突然钻出地面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW"
msgid "Stone is much easier to handle than the real thing."
msgstr "石雕比本尊好对付多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "A reminder of a cold, difficult fight."
msgstr "让我想起那场寒冷又艰难的战斗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN"
msgid "I'll remember where to strike next time."
msgstr "我会记住下次该攻击哪里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "A small trophy for a very large fight."
msgstr "战斗那么艰难，纪念品倒很小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "Proof that we held our ground."
msgstr "这是我们坚持战斗的证明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "The details are impressively precise."
msgstr "细节刻得很精确。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "Much easier to face when it can't move."
msgstr "不会动的时候就好对付多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW"
msgid "I prefer it this size."
msgstr "我更喜欢这个尺寸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "A knight for the celebration!"
msgstr "节庆的骑士雕像！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "A fine carving for the celebration."
msgstr "做工精致的节庆雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED"
msgid "A trap! Hands away from its teeth!"
msgstr "陷阱！手别靠近它的牙齿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COOLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COOLANT"
msgid "Keep it away from the drinking water."
msgstr "别把它和饮用水放在一起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY"
msgid "I could try a royal role."
msgstr "我也可以试试扮演公主。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "Watch for incoming shots!"
msgstr "小心射来的炮弹！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "It's blocking our approach."
msgstr "它挡住了我们靠近的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "Keep those claws away from the boat."
msgstr "别让钳子碰到船。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "A well-armored opponent. I'll look for an opening."
msgstr "护甲很厚，得找破绽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "You're much nicer at this size."
msgstr "这个大小可爱多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS"
msgid "Come along, little one."
msgstr "跟上，小家伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "Who's joining me for a game?"
msgstr "谁来和我玩一局？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "Useful for keeping things dry."
msgstr "可以用来防潮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "This should keep out even more moisture."
msgstr "这样能吸收更多水分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Sturdy and spacious. Just what we need."
msgstr "结实又宽敞，正是我们需要的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER"
msgid "Keep the elixirs safely packed."
msgstr "把灵药妥善装好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC"
msgid "It needs a connection to work."
msgstr "接通以后才能使用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED"
msgid "Connected. Watch your hands."
msgstr "接通了，小心别碰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM"
msgid "I'll leave space for a safe passage."
msgstr "安装时要留出安全的通道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED"
msgid "Dried nettles. Still handle them carefully."
msgstr "晒干的荨麻，还是要小心拿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Fish for the next journey."
msgstr "下次出行可以带上鱼干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED"
msgid "A little dried fish for the road."
msgstr "可以带在路上吃的小鱼干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED"
msgid "It needs to be inflated again."
msgstr "得重新充气。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC"
msgid "I'll watch until it disappears from sight."
msgstr "我想看着它慢慢飞远。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD"
msgid "Ready? Let's release it together."
msgstr "准备好了吗？一起放吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION"
msgid "I'll be glad to have this if I fall overboard."
msgstr "落水时有这个就放心多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED"
msgid "The light has gone out."
msgstr "它已经不发光了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED"
msgid "Dried leaves, ready to store."
msgstr "叶子晒干了，可以收起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED"
msgid "These should keep for later."
msgstr "晒干后可以留着以后用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC"
msgid "Too cold and brittle. It needs heat."
msgstr "冷却后太脆了，需要加热。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT"
msgid "Hot and ready. I'll work quickly."
msgstr "温度正好，抓紧时间用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM"
msgid "It's nearly cold. Better reheat it."
msgstr "快冷了，最好重新加热。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM"
msgid "Still warm enough for a little more work."
msgstr "还热着，可以再用一会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Too cold and brittle. It needs heat."
msgstr "冷却后太脆了，需要加热。"

