msgstr "得给灯笼重新做个架子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC"
