msgstr "这些灯笼让营地有了节日气氛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM"
