msgstr "看看能为节日做些什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM"
