#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.1"
