msgstr "鸟先生已经来了，叫两遍他也不会更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.2"
msgid "Why ring for him? He's literally right over there."
msgstr "还叫什么，他明明就在那边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.1"
msgid "Nobody home. Not even a hairball."
msgstr "没人在家，连个毛球都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.2"
msgid "I stuck my face in there for nothing."
msgstr "我白把脸凑进去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.1"
msgid "He's talking again. Wake me when the speech ends."
msgstr "他又在讲话了，讲完叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.2"
msgid "Busy, huh. Like a teacher pretending not to see me."
msgstr "忙是吧，跟假装没看见我的老师一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.1"
msgid "Two kittens isn't a game. That's a headcount."
msgstr "两只猫算什么游戏，这是点名。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.2"
msgid "Round up more of the little furballs first."
msgstr "先去多找几只小毛团来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.1"
msgid "Flat and empty. They'd just stand here waving."
msgstr "又平又空，它们只能站着冲我招手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.2"
msgid "Even I could find them with my eyes closed here."
msgstr "在这里我闭着眼都能找到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.1"
msgid "Once a day is plenty. Hide-and-seek isn't homework."
msgstr "一天一次够了，捉迷藏又不是作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.2
