msgid "They're tired. Honestly, me too."
msgstr "它们累了。说实话，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.1"
msgid "I could just bat it open. Probably shouldn't."
msgstr "我拿球棒砸开也行。还是算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.2"
msgid "Gates and school mornings. Both locked when I show up."
msgstr "这门跟学校早上一样，我一到就锁了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.1
