msgid "Too bad. It's got worse fashion sense than me."
msgstr "可惜，它的穿衣品味比我还差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.2
