msgstr "哔哔啵啵？不行，我说了没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.2"
msgid "Go find WX. This is its toy."
msgstr "去找WX吧，这是它的玩具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.1"
msgid "Should've learned to say “glorp” in school."
msgstr "早知道在学校学学说“咕噜噜”了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.2"
msgid "Fishy business. Wurt's job, not mine."
msgstr "鱼腥味的事，归沃特管，不归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.1"
msgid "Hands off. Willow would set my skirt on fire."
msgstr "别碰。薇洛会把我裙子点着的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.2"
msgid "He only gets big for her anyway."
msgstr "反正他只为她变大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.1"
msgid "Bare-handed counts as a real fight. Not allowed, apparently."
msgstr "空手上就算真打架了，好像不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.2"
msgid "No pillow? Then I'm just using it to sleep."
msgstr "没枕头？那我就直接睡这儿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.1"
msgid "Like a third energy drink. Bad idea."
msgstr "跟喝第三罐能量饮料一样，馊主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.2"
msgid "Abigail's maxed out. Don't overdo it."
msgstr "阿比盖尔已经到顶了，别加过头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.1"
msgid "The judge is busy. I'll just stand here looking bored."
msgstr "评委在忙。我就站这儿发呆好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.2"
msgid "Hold on. Even the beefalo look impatient."
msgstr "等等。连牛都等得不耐烦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.1"
msgid "One more scratch and I'm the one needing a statue."
msgstr "再掉一点血，要立雕像的就是我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.2"
msgid "Let me eat something first. Then I'll bleed for it."
msgstr "先让我吃点东西，再拿血喂它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.1"
msgid "Two bombs won't make it twice as nice."
msgstr "扔两颗也不会舒服两倍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.2"
msgid "The water's fizzy enough. Save it for next time."
msgstr "水已经够冒泡了，留着下次吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.1"
msgid "Can't soak in a window. Pass."
msgstr "总不能泡在玻璃里吧，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.2"
msgid "Whoever froze this hot spring owes me a bath."
msgstr "谁把温泉弄成这样的，欠我一次泡澡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.1"
msgid "Like the cafeteria line. Somebody hurry up."
msgstr "跟食堂排队一样，前面的快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.2"
msgid "Occupied. I'll lean here and look tough."
msgstr "有人在用。我靠这儿装酷好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.1"
msgid "Feeding two? I can barely feed myself."
msgstr "养两只？我连自己都快喂不饱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.2"
msgid "Mine would get jealous. Clingy little thing."
msgstr "我家那只会吃醋的，黏人精。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.1"
msgid "Crafting on a beefalo? My skirt's not built for this."
msgstr "骑在牛上做东西？我的裙子可不答应。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.2"
msgid "Hands full of reins. Gimme a sec."
msgstr "手里还抓着缰绳，等我一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.1"
msgid "Two tour guides at once? I'm not that lost."
msgstr "同时跟两个导游？我还没迷路到那份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.2"
msgid "Loyalty matters. Even to a fat cat."
msgstr "要讲义气，哪怕是对一只胖猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE.1"
msgid "The bird closed its mouth. Rude."
msgstr "那只鸟把嘴闭上了，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARNIVALGAME_FEED.TOO_LATE.2"
msgid "Ugh, these chicks are faster than my reflexes before lunch."
msgstr "啧，这些雏鸟比午饭前的我反应还快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING.1"
msgid "Roasted pumpkin, sure. Carved pumpkin, nope."
msgstr "烤南瓜可以，雕南瓜免谈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.BURNING.2"
msgid "Wait till it stops being a torch."
msgstr "等它别再当火把了再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE.1"
msgid "One face per pumpkin. Hands off."
msgstr "一个南瓜只能刻一张脸，别抢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CARVEPUMPKIN.INUSE.2"
msgid "Fine, you carve. I'll just criticize."
msgstr "行，你刻，我负责挑毛病。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING.1"
msgid "I'm not climbing into a flaming closet."
msgstr "我才不钻进着火的衣柜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING.2"
msgid "Great. Even the uniforms are on fire now."
msgstr "好啊，连制服都烧起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Changing is effort. Not today."
msgstr "换衣服很费劲的，今天免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nah. The uniform's comfy and I'm lazy."
msgstr "不了，校服舒服，我又懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE.1"
msgid "Knock knock. Hurry it up in there."
msgstr "咚咚，里面的快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE.2"
msgid "Somebody's in there. I'm not peeking."
msgstr "里面有人，我可不偷看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT.1"
msgid "I'm not grooming the air."
msgstr "我总不能给空气梳毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT.2"
msgid "No beefalo, no makeover. That's how it works."
msgstr "没牛就没法打扮，规矩就是这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR.1"
msgid "It's practically bald. Let it grow out."
msgstr "都快秃了，让它先长长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR.2"
msgid "Styling a shaved beefalo? Even I'm not that bored."
msgstr "给剃光的牛做造型？我还没无聊到那份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL.1"
msgid "Overcharging just makes things go boom."
msgstr "充过头只会砰的一声炸掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL.2"
msgid "Full, like me after three rice balls."
msgstr "满了，跟我吃完三个饭团一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE.1"
msgid "Dead battery. Same as my motivation."
msgstr "电池没电了，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE.2"
msgid "Nothing left in it. Squeezing won't help."
msgstr "里面空了，捏也捏不出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL.1"
msgid "That's not a catch. That's bait."
msgstr "这不叫渔获，这叫鱼饵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL.2"
msgid "Put it back. Let it grow up first."
msgstr "放回去吧，让它先长大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL.1"
msgid "The scale didn't even notice it."
msgstr "秤都没反应过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL.2"
msgid "My lunchbox is heavier than this."
msgstr "我的饭盒都比这个重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Air isn't a building material. Unfortunately."
msgstr "空气可不算建材，真遗憾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Came all this way with empty pockets. Smart."
msgstr "空着口袋跑过来，真聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE.1"
msgid "Too many cooks. I'll supervise."
msgstr "人手够多了，我负责监工。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE.2"
msgid "Fine, you build. I'll take a nap nearby."
msgstr "行，你来盖，我在旁边睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH.1"
msgid "These parts are for something else entirely."
msgstr "这些零件根本是别的东西的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH.2"
msgid "Like bringing math homework to art class."
msgstr "跟上美术课带数学作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED.1"
msgid "Nope. Even hitting it won't make it fit."
msgstr "不行，砸也砸不进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED.2"
msgid "Wrong part. I'm not forcing it."
msgstr "零件不对，我就不硬塞了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY.1"
msgid "Everything's rattling. Building now is asking for trouble."
msgstr "到处都在晃，这时候盖东西是找麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY.2"
msgid "Not yet. Let the world calm down first."
msgstr "还不行，先让这世界冷静一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My stomach says yes. Reality says no."
msgstr "我的肚子说可以，现实说不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nope. Guess I'm eating it raw."
msgstr "不行。看来只能生吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE.1"
msgid "Someone's using the pot. I'll hover hungrily."
msgstr "锅有人在用，我就饿着在旁边转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE.2"
msgid "Busy, huh. Make enough for two."
msgstr "在忙是吧，做两份啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR.1"
msgid "My arms aren't that long, you know."
msgstr "我的胳膊可没那么长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR.2"
msgid "Ugh, walking. The worst part of cooking."
msgstr "唉，还得走过去。做饭最烦这步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT.1"
msgid "Two hats looks dumb. Even for a snowman."
msgstr "戴两顶帽子很蠢，雪人也一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT.2"
msgid "One's enough. It's not a hat rack."
msgstr "一顶就够了，它又不是帽架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE.1"
msgid "Go ahead, artist. I'll judge after."
msgstr "画家您先请，我待会儿点评。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE.2"
msgid "Fine. Just don't give it a dumb face."
msgstr "行吧，别给它弄张傻脸就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING.1"
msgid "It's sweating. Poor guy's done for."
msgstr "它在冒汗，可怜家伙没救了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING.2"
msgid "Why dress up a puddle?"
msgstr "给一摊水打扮干嘛？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH.1"
msgid "Any taller and it'll need a ladder. Or Wolfgang."
msgstr "再高就得用梯子了，或者沃尔夫冈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH.2"
msgid "I'm strong, not tall. Big difference."
msgstr "我是力气大，不是个子高，差远了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE.1"
msgid "Moving her house without her? That's just stealing."
msgstr "人不在就搬她的房子？那叫偷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE.2"
msgid "Wait for Pearl. She'd scold me forever."
msgstr "等珍珠回来吧，不然她能骂我一辈子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING.1"
msgid "Pack up dinner mid-cook? Absolutely not."
msgstr "饭做到一半就收锅？想都别想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING.2"
msgid "Let it finish. I'm hungry, not crazy."
msgstr "等它做完。我是饿，不是傻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE.1"
msgid "Pulling it out from under you would be mean. Probably."
msgstr "从你手底下抽走太过分了，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE.2"
msgid "You're still using it. I'm patient. Sort of."
msgstr "你还在用，我有耐心。差不多吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY.1"
msgid "Stuff's still inside. Dumping it everywhere is messy."
msgstr "里面还有东西，撒一地太乱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY.2"
msgid "Can't fold it up full. It's not a magic bag."
msgstr "装满了没法收，又不是魔法袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED.1"
msgid "Got a handful of water. Great."
msgstr "抓了一手水，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED.2"
msgid "Slippery little thing. Come back here."
msgstr "滑溜溜的家伙，给我回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE.1"
msgid "Blank board, blank brain. Put something on it."
msgstr "板是空的，脑子也是空的，放点东西上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE.2"
msgid "I'm not drawing from memory. I skipped art class."
msgstr "我才不凭记忆画，美术课我都翘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS.1"
msgid "Seawater? I'd be pickling the garden."
msgstr "海水？那是在腌菜园子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS.2"
msgid "Plants want fresh water. Even I know that."
msgstr "植物要淡水，连我都知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP.1"
msgid "A pond rod out at sea? Even I'm not that lazy."
msgstr "拿池塘钓竿出海？我都没懒到这地步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP.2"
msgid "The line's way too short. Need a sea rod."
msgstr "线太短了，得用海钓竿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC.1"
msgid "It moved. Items aren't supposed to move."
msgstr "它动了。东西不该会动的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC.2"
msgid "Fake loot, huh? Meet my bat."
msgstr "假货是吧？尝尝我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART.1"
msgid "Her sister needs more than a heart. I tried."
msgstr "她妹妹要的不只是一颗心。我尽力了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART.2"
msgid "Didn't take. Abigail's stubborn, like someone I know."
msgstr "没起效。阿比盖尔真倔，跟某人一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY.1"
msgid "Hey. Hands busy? Fine, later."
msgstr "喂，手腾不开？行，待会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY.2"
msgid "You're occupied. I'll hang on to it."
msgstr "你在忙，我先拿着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE.1"
msgid "Some things stay broken. This is one."
msgstr "有些东西坏了就是坏了，这就是一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE.2"
msgid "The shadows aren't interested. Neither am I, honestly."
msgstr "暗影没兴趣，说实话我也没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING.1"
msgid "Ugh, the birds are still busy with someone else."
msgstr "唉，那些鸟还在陪别人玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING.2"
msgid "Somebody's mid-game. No cutting in line."
msgstr "有人正玩着呢，不许插队。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY.1"
msgid "Hole's not even set up. Golf is so slow."
msgstr "洞都没准备好，高尔夫真磨蹭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY.2"
msgid "Patience. Not my best subject."
msgstr "要有耐心。不是我拿手的科目。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM.1"
msgid "They only take bird money. Weird economy."
msgstr "这里只收鸟币，什么奇怪的经济。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM.2"
msgid "No token, no play. Cheapskates."
msgstr "没代币不让玩，小气鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD.1"
msgid "Ghosts can't hold stuff. Come back to life already."
msgstr "鬼魂拿不了东西，快点复活啦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD.2"
msgid "Sorry, your hands are kinda see-through right now."
msgstr "抱歉，你的手现在有点透明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE.1"
msgid "Same notes twice? I'm not that forgetful."
msgstr "同样的笔记要两遍？我没那么健忘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE.2"
msgid "Copy of a copy. Nothing new here."
msgstr "复印的复印件，没什么新东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL.1"
msgid "Stuffed already? Lucky. I'm never full."
msgstr "已经吃撑了？真好，我从来吃不饱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL.2"
msgid "It's still chewing. Manners, please."
msgstr "它还在嚼呢，讲点礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nope, they don't want it. Their loss."
msgstr "不，人家不要。他们的损失。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Rejected. Like my excuse notes."
msgstr "被拒了，跟我的请假条一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART.1"
msgid "A heart for a ghost? That's backwards."
msgstr "给鬼一颗心？顺序反了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART.2"
msgid "Nope. Ghost logic doesn't work like that."
msgstr "不行，鬼的规矩不是这样的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Needs a breather. Can relate."
msgstr "要歇口气是吧，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.KINGSTAFF_COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Not ready. Even royalty takes naps."
msgstr "还没好，王族也要午睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG.1"
msgid "A dead stump won't do. It wants the screaming kind."
msgstr "死木头不行，它要会尖叫的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG.2"
msgid "Ugh. Now I gotta go punch a Treeguard."
msgstr "唉，现在得去揍一棵树精了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM.1"
msgid "Mushroom farm, no mushrooms. Genius."
msgstr "蘑菇田里没蘑菇，天才。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM.2"
msgid "Seed it with a shroom first. Then nap."
msgstr "先放个蘑菇当种子，然后睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED.1"
msgid "Moon shrooms are too fancy for this log."
msgstr "月亮蘑菇对这根木头来说太高级了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED.2"
msgid "Nope. These weirdos only like moon dirt."
msgstr "不行，这些怪家伙只认月亮土。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL.1"
msgid "Winona's thing. I'd just hit it till it sparks."
msgstr "温诺娜的东西，我只会砸到冒火花。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL.2"
msgid "Engineering? I failed shop class. Kinda."
msgstr "工程？我工艺课挂科了。算是吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON.1"
msgid "No sky, no moon. Caves are the worst."
msgstr "没天就没月亮，洞穴最烦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON.2"
msgid "Gotta go up top for this to work."
msgstr "得回地面才行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY.1"
msgid "Ook? Yeah, she's not buying it."
msgstr "嗷嗷？算了，她不信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY.2"
msgid "Pirate monkeys only. I'm not hairy enough."
msgstr "只认海盗猴，我毛不够多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY.1"
msgid "Square peg, round hole. Classic."
msgstr "方榫圆孔，老套路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY.2"
msgid "Not the right key. Not even close."
msgstr "不是这把钥匙，差得远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH.1"
msgid "That's an ingredient, not a meal."
msgstr "这是食材，不是菜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH.2"
msgid "Raw stuff? Warly would faint."
msgstr "生的？沃利会晕过去的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM.1"
msgid "That's a rock. A boring one."
msgstr "这是石头，还是无聊的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM.2"
msgid "Shiny stuff only, apparently."
msgstr "看来只收亮晶晶的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE.1"
msgid "Even I can't punch this into a statue."
msgstr "就算是我也没法把它打成雕像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE.2"
msgid "Get some marble or something. Not this."
msgstr "去弄点大理石什么的，别用这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF.1"
msgid "Wrong stick. My bat wouldn't work either."
msgstr "棍子不对，我的球棒也不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF.2"
msgid "It's picky about magic sticks. Who knew."
msgstr "它挑法杖还挺挑，谁知道呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER.1"
msgid "Something's lurking. Let me bat it first."
msgstr "有东西在附近转，先让我抡它一棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER.2"
msgid "No games while monsters are around. Rules."
msgstr "怪物在旁边不能玩，规矩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY.1"
msgid "Too much junk on the ground. Like my desk."
msgstr "地上垃圾太多了，跟我课桌一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY.2"
msgid "Sweep up first. Ugh, chores."
msgstr "先打扫。唉，又是家务。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE.1"
msgid "Missed it. The fat king's done for today."
msgstr "错过了，胖国王今天收工了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE.2"
msgid "Dark already? Day went by while I napped."
msgstr "天都黑了？午睡一下一天就过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY.1"
msgid "Her Majesty's occupied. Rude, but okay."
msgstr "女王陛下没空。没礼貌，但行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY.2"
msgid "Wait for the monkey queen to finish. Again."
msgstr "又要等猴子女王忙完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I respect a good nap."
msgstr "嘘，我尊重好好睡觉的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "It's out cold. Lucky thing."
msgstr "睡得死死的，真幸福。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL.1"
msgid "Full up. Take the old one out first."
msgstr "满了，先把旧的拿出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL.2"
msgid "No room. Even cramming won't help."
msgstr "没位置，硬塞也没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT.1"
msgid "Lose the hat first, spider."
msgstr "先把帽子摘了，蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT.2"
msgid "That hat's in the way. Fashion victim."
msgstr "那顶帽子碍事，时尚受害者。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Still regrowing. Plants are so slow."
msgstr "还在长，植物真慢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Give it time. Like waiting for summer break."
msgstr "给它点时间，跟等暑假一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE.1"
msgid "It spat that out. Picky eater."
msgstr "它吐出来了，挑食鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE.2"
msgid "Rejected. Wrong flavor, I guess."
msgstr "被拒了，大概口味不对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM.1"
msgid "Color's off. It's like a dress code."
msgstr "颜色不对，跟校规着装一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM.2"
msgid "Nope. It wants a different shiny."
msgstr "不对，它要别的亮晶晶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM.1"
msgid "Pretty sure ribs don't go there."
msgstr "肋骨肯定不是放那儿的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM.2"
msgid "Bone puzzle failed. Biology was never my thing."
msgstr "骨头拼图失败，生物课我从来不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY.1"
msgid "Hands full? Fine, the whole pile can wait."
msgstr "手占着？行，这一堆都等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY.2"
msgid "Busy, huh. I'll dump it on you later."
msgstr "在忙是吧，我待会儿再全塞给你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD.1"
msgid "Ghosts don't carry stuff. Get revived first."
msgstr "鬼魂不拿东西，先复活吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD.2"
msgid "Hey, don't float away. This pile's yours."
msgstr "喂，别飘走，这一堆是你的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL.1"
msgid "Your pockets are worse than my school bag."
msgstr "你的口袋比我书包还乱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL.2"
msgid "No space. Toss some junk already."
msgstr "没地方了，快扔点垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Sleeping, huh. I get it. Totally."
msgstr "在睡啊。我懂，完全懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Nap first, presents later."
msgstr "先睡觉，礼物待会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY.1"
msgid "Hey. Stop doing stuff for a sec."
msgstr "喂，先停一下手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY.2"
msgid "Juggling again? I'll wait."
msgstr "又在忙东忙西？我等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD.1"
msgid "Your hands go right through it. Creepy."
msgstr "你的手直接穿过去了，好诡异。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD.2"
msgid "Come back alive and it's yours."
msgstr "活过来就给你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL.1"
msgid "You're stuffed like a bento box."
msgstr "你塞得跟便当盒一样满。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL.2"
msgid "No room? Drop something useless."
msgstr "没位置？扔掉点没用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Out cold. Envious, honestly."
msgstr "睡死了，说实话我好羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll leave it by your pillow. Kidding."
msgstr "我放你枕头边好了。开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE.1"
msgid "Same lure design. Copying homework again?"
msgstr "同样的鱼饵图？又在抄作业？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE.2"
msgid "Got this sketch. No need for a second copy."
msgstr "这张图有了，不用第二份。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER.1"
msgid "Not my circuits. WX would get grumpy."
msgstr "不是我的电路，WX会不高兴的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER.2"
msgid "Touching someone else's parts? Weird."
msgstr "碰别人的零件？好奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM.1"
msgid "Do I look scaly to you?"
msgstr "我看起来像长鳞片吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM.2"
msgid "Fish medicine for fish folk only."
msgstr "鱼的药只给鱼人用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY.1"
msgid "Eight legs, zero respect for me."
msgstr "八条腿，对我零尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY.2"
msgid "Spider whistle? I just sound off-key."
msgstr "蜘蛛哨？我吹出来只是跑调。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED.1"
msgid "It's tied up good. Not going anywhere."
msgstr "拴得很牢，哪儿也去不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED.2"
msgid "Double-knotting a beefalo is overkill."
msgstr "给牛打两个结太夸张了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD.1"
msgid "In heat again. Let it sort out its drama."
msgstr "又发情了，让它自己闹去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD.2"
msgid "Angry beefalo, no thanks. Let it cool off."
msgstr "生气的牛，免了，让它冷静冷静。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF.1"
msgid "Hitch what, the air?"
msgstr "拴什么，拴空气吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF.2"
msgid "No beefalo of my own. Gotta ring for one."
msgstr "我自己没牛，得摇铃找一头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER.1"
msgid "Come here, cow. I'm not walking over."
msgstr "过来，牛。我才不走过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER.2"
msgid "It's way out there. Rope's not that long."
msgstr "它在老远的地方，绳子没那么长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED.1"
msgid "One vote. I know how voting works."
msgstr "一人一票，我懂怎么投票。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED.2"
msgid "Picked one already. No take-backs."
msgstr "已经选了，不能反悔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT.1"
msgid "Not my competition. I'm just a spectator."
msgstr "不是我的比赛，我只是来看的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT.2"
msgid "I didn't sign up. Too much effort."
msgstr "我没报名，太费劲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE.1"
msgid "Taken. Guess I walk, like always."
msgstr "被占了，看来又得走路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE.2"
msgid "No double-riding. It'd collapse."
msgstr "不能两人骑，它会趴下的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Hey, wake up. I can't ride a pillow."
msgstr "喂，醒醒，我可不能骑枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Asleep, huh. Honestly, same."
msgstr "睡着了啊。说实话，我也想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT.1"
msgid "It's busy brawling. Respect."
msgstr "它在打架呢，尊重一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT.2"
msgid "Hopping on mid-fight? I'd get bucked off."
msgstr "打到一半跳上去？会被甩下来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR.1"
msgid "Overkill. Pond fish are tiny."
msgstr "太夸张了，池塘鱼小得很。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR.2"
msgid "Wrong rod. This one's for the ocean."
msgstr "钓竿不对，这根是海钓用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF.1"
msgid "Fancy cooking? I can burn toast, at best."
msgstr "高级料理？我最多会烤糊吐司。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF.2"
msgid "This needs a real chef. Not a hungry student."
msgstr "这得真厨师，不是饿肚子的学生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC.1"
msgid "Ask Maxwell. Spooky stuff is his hobby."
msgstr "问麦斯威尔，阴森的东西是他爱好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC.2"
msgid "Dark magic? I can barely do math."
msgstr "黑魔法？我连数学都快不会了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE.1"
msgid "Empty. Like my wallet."
msgstr "空的，跟我钱包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE.2"
msgid "Picked clean. Someone beat me to it."
msgstr "被摘光了，有人抢先了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK.1"
msgid "Won't budge. Even for me."
msgstr "纹丝不动，连我都拉不动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK.2"
msgid "Pulling harder would break it. Later."
msgstr "再用力就扯坏了，待会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES.1"
msgid "One more of those and I'm growing a tail."
msgstr "再拿一个我就要长尾巴了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES.2"
msgid "Too cursed. My pockets have limits."
msgstr "诅咒太多了，我的口袋也有底线。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE.1"
msgid "Go ahead, grab it. I'm not fighting over it."
msgstr "你拿吧，我不跟你抢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE.2"
msgid "Someone's got their hands on it. Fine."
msgstr "有人已经在拿了，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION.1"
msgid "Not mine to use. Leave it."
msgstr "不归我用，放着吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION.2"
msgid "Looks complicated. I'll stick to my bat."
msgstr "看着好复杂，我还是用球棒吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER.1"
msgid "Studying poop twice? Hard pass."
msgstr "研究两遍粪便？坚决不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER.2"
msgid "I already know what's in it. Gross."
msgstr "我已经知道里面是什么了，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Studied it. Not studying it again."
msgstr "研究过了，不研究第二遍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nothing new to learn. Can I nap now?"
msgstr "没什么新东西了，能睡觉了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED.1"
msgid "Too slow. Or it's too fast."
msgstr "太慢了。或者是它太快了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED.2"
msgid "Ugh, grabbed dirt."
msgstr "啧，抓了把土。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER.1"
msgid "Empty can. Gotta refill."
msgstr "壶空了，得去加水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER.2"
msgid "Shaking it won't make more water."
msgstr "晃也晃不出水来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER.1"
msgid "Dry can. Dry soil. Dry me."
msgstr "壶干了，土干了，我也干了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER.2"
msgid "Nothing left to pour. Back to the pond."
msgstr "没水可浇了，回池塘吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE.1"
msgid "Wrong shape. Puzzles aren't my thing."
msgstr "形状不对，拼图不是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPAIR.WRONGPIECE.2"
msgid "Whacking it in won't help either."
msgstr "砸进去也没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH.1"
msgid "Fussy food. Needs its own matching plate."
msgstr "讲究的菜，得配专属盘子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.MISMATCH.2"
msgid "Wrong plate. Who even cares? Apparently this does."
msgstr "盘子不对。谁在乎啊？看来它在乎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH.1"
msgid "Same plate again? Pointless."
msgstr "又换同样的盘子？没意义。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.REPLATE.SAMEDISH.2"
msgid "Plated already. Just let me eat it."
msgstr "已经装盘了，让我吃就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0.1"
msgid "Jumped the gun. Like the bell at school."
msgstr "抢拍了，跟学校铃响前就冲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING0.2"
msgid "Whoops, rushed it."
msgstr "哎呀，太急了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1.1"
msgid "Off-beat. Rowing's like PE class."
msgstr "节奏乱了，划船跟体育课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING1.2"
msgid "Ugh. Splashed instead of rowed."
msgstr "啧，光溅水没划动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2.1"
msgid "Strong arms, bad rhythm. Story of my life."
msgstr "力气大，节奏差，我的人生写照。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ROW_FAIL.BAD_TIMING2.2"
msgid "Who designed oars? So annoying."
msgstr "谁发明的桨啊，好烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Stuck shut. Don't make me bat it."
msgstr "卡死了，别逼我用球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Won't open. Not today, I guess."
msgstr "打不开，看来今天不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE.1"
msgid "Someone's digging in there. I'll wait."
msgstr "有人在里面翻，我等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.INUSE.2"
msgid "Fine, rummage away. Leave me snacks."
msgstr "行，你翻吧，给我留点零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM.1"
msgid "Fish-people property. No dry folks."
msgstr "鱼人的地盘，干巴巴的人免进。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAMERM.2"
msgid "I'd need gills to open this."
msgstr "得有鳃才能打开吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT.1"
msgid "Locked to WX. Robot privacy."
msgstr "只认WX，机器人隐私。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTAROBOT.2"
msgid "No bleeps from me, no access."
msgstr "我不会哔哔，进不去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF.1"
msgid "Hands off the chef's spice stash."
msgstr "别碰大厨的香料箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTMASTERCHEF.2"
msgid "Pro kitchen stuff. Amateurs keep out."
msgstr "专业厨具，外行免进。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.1"
msgid "Souls in a jar? Nope, not touching that."
msgstr "罐子里装灵魂？不碰，绝对不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.2"
msgid "Only the imp gets to peek in there."
msgstr "只有那个小恶魔能往里看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED.1"
msgid "Off limits. Like the teachers' lounge."
msgstr "禁止入内，跟教师办公室一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.RUMMAGE.RESTRICTED.2"
msgid "Not allowed in. Whatever."
msgstr "不让我翻，随便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT.1"
msgid "It's mid-fight. Saddling it now is suicide."
msgstr "它正在打架，这时候装鞍是找死。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SADDLE.TARGETINCOMBAT.2"
msgid "Calm down first, beefalo. Then we talk."
msgstr "牛，你先冷静，然后再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO.1"
msgid "Shaving an awake beefalo? I like my face."
msgstr "给醒着的牛剃毛？我还想要这张脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.AWAKEBEEFALO.2"
msgid "It's glaring at me. Not now."
msgstr "它在瞪我，现在不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nothing to trim. Not even fuzz."
msgstr "没东西可剃，连绒毛都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Razor's useless on this."
msgstr "剃刀对这个没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS.1"
msgid "Already bald. Poor thing's cold enough."
msgstr "已经秃了，可怜家伙已经够冷了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.NOBITS.2"
msgid "Shaved clean. Let it regrow."
msgstr "剃光了，让它再长吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO.1"
msgid "Not my cow. That'd be rude."
msgstr "不是我的牛，那样太没礼貌了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SHAVE.SOMEONEELSESBEEFALO.2"
msgid "Someone's pet. I'm not a hair thief."
msgstr "是别人的宠物，我又不是偷毛贼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR.1"
msgid "Too far. I'm not chasing it."
msgstr "太远了，我才不追。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SLAUGHTER.TOOFAR.2"
msgid "Fast little thing. Lucky it."
msgstr "跑得真快，算它走运。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE.1"
msgid "Packed hot spring. Like a school trip."
msgstr "温泉挤满了，跟修学旅行一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.SOAKIN.NOSPACE.2"
msgid "Scoot over, people. No? Fine."
msgstr "各位挪一挪。不挪？那算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS.1"
msgid "Empty track. Race against the wind?"
msgstr "跑道是空的，跟风赛跑吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.START_CARRAT_RACE.NO_RACERS.2"
msgid "No carrats, no race. Simple."
msgstr "没有胡萝卜鼠就没有比赛，很简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Full. Stop stuffing it."
msgstr "满了，别再塞了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "No space, like my locker."
msgstr "没空间了，跟我的储物柜一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE.1"
msgid "Somebody's in there already. Ugh."
msgstr "已经有人在用了，唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.INUSE.2"
msgid "Waiting again? Story of this place."
msgstr "又要等？这地方就这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED.1"
msgid "Wrong container for that. Obviously."
msgstr "放错容器了，很明显。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTALLOWED.2"
msgid "It won't take it. Picky box."
msgstr "它不收，挑剔的箱子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT.1"
msgid "Robot storage. Humans not welcome."
msgstr "机器人专用，人类不欢迎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTAROBOT.2"
msgid "WX's thing. It'd sulk if I touched it."
msgstr "是WX的东西，我碰了它会闹脾气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF.1"
msgid "Chef-only stuff. I'd mess it up anyway."
msgstr "大厨专用，反正我会弄砸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTMASTERCHEF.2"
msgid "Hands off, says the spice rack."
msgstr "香料架说：别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.1"
msgid "Soul jars give me the creeps."
msgstr "灵魂罐让我起鸡皮疙瘩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.NOTSOULJARHANDLER.2"
msgid "Not my job to bottle souls."
msgstr "装灵魂不是我的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED.1"
msgid "Nope, not my storage."
msgstr "不行，不是我的柜子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.STORE.RESTRICTED.2"
msgid "Locked to someone else. Boring."
msgstr "只认别人，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN.1"
msgid "Too hard. I'd fall asleep halfway through."
msgstr "太难了，看到一半我就会睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.CANTLEARN.2"
msgid "Nope. Brain's full of snacks."
msgstr "不行，脑子里装满零食了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN.1"
msgid "Already got it. I'm lazy, not dumb."
msgstr "已经会了，我是懒，不是笨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.KNOWN.2"
msgid "Learned that one. Moving on."
msgstr "那个学过了，下一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND.1"
msgid "Can't read in the dark. My eyes aren't that good."
msgstr "黑漆漆的看不了，我眼神没那么好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.MESSAGEBOTTLEMANAGER_NOT_FOUND.2"
msgid "Need light to read this scribble."
msgstr "得有光才看得清这潦草的字。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND.1"
msgid "Treasure map with no X? Useless."
msgstr "没打叉的藏宝图？没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.STASH_MAP_NOT_FOUND.2"
msgid "Where's the loot? This map's lying."
msgstr "宝藏在哪？这地图在骗人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD.1"
msgid "Wrong place. Somebody else's world."
msgstr "地方不对，是别人的世界。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.TEACH.WRONGWORLD.2"
msgid "Nothing on here matches. Useless."
msgstr "上面一个都对不上，没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.UNLOCK.WRONGKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.UNLOCK.WRONGKEY.1"
msgid "Nope. Doesn't even turn."
msgstr "不行，转都转不动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.UNLOCK.WRONGKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.UNLOCK.WRONGKEY.2"
msgid "I could just break it. Tempting."
msgstr "我直接砸开也行，好诱人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED.1"
msgid "Taken. Someone else rang for it."
msgstr "被领走了，别人摇铃叫过它了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_ALREADY_USED.2"
msgid "Somebody's beefalo already. Find another."
msgstr "已经是别人的牛了，再找一头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY.1"
msgid "One beefalo already eats more than I do. Pass."
msgstr "一头牛就比我还能吃了，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_HAS_BEEF_ALREADY.2"
msgid "Two-timing my beefalo? It'd sulk for a week."
msgstr "脚踏两头牛？它会闹一星期脾气的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET.1"
msgid "Ringing at it won't turn it into a beefalo."
msgstr "对着它摇铃，它也变不成牛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.BEEF_BELL_INVALID_TARGET.2"
msgid "Nope. Not fluffy enough to count."
msgstr "不行，毛不够多，不算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE.1"
msgid "I hit it too hard, didn't I."
msgstr "是不是我下手太重了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.CANNOT_FIX_DRONE.2"
msgid "Winona's gonna yell at me for this one."
msgstr "这个肯定要被薇诺娜骂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE.1"
msgid "Touching other people's stuff gets you detention."
msgstr "乱碰别人的东西是要留堂的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEITEMON.NOT_MINE.2"
msgid "Not mine. Not my problem either."
msgstr "不是我的，也不归我管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS.1"
msgid "The big guy's still guarding it. Deal with him first."
msgstr "大块头还守着呢，先收拾他。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.KLAUS.2"
msgid "Not with that chained-up weirdo watching me."
msgstr "那个拴链子的怪家伙盯着，拆不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY.1"
msgid "Wrong one. This place loves making me run errands."
msgstr "不对。这地方就爱让我跑腿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.QUAGMIRE_WRONGKEY.2"
msgid "This key's for some other lock. Ugh."
msgstr "这把钥匙是开别的锁的。烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY.1"
msgid "Wrong key. Can I just smash it?"
msgstr "钥匙不对。能直接砸开吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.USEKLAUSSACKKEY.WRONGKEY.2"
msgid "Doesn't fit. Like trying my locker key on the vending machine."
msgstr "插不进去。就像拿储物柜钥匙开自动贩卖机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Wrapping air? Even I'm not that lazy."
msgstr "包空气？我还没懒到这种地步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRAPBUNDLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "An empty gift. Perfect for the class rep."
msgstr "空礼包，正适合送给班长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My handwriting's bad enough already. Leave it."
msgstr "我的字本来就丑，别改了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nah. Writing is homework, and I don't do homework."
msgstr "不写。写字就是作业，我不写作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE.1"
msgid "Someone's hogging it. Like the last seat on the bus."
msgstr "有人占着，跟公交车上最后一个座一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.WRITE.INUSE.2"
msgid "Hurry up, it's a sign, not an essay."
msgstr "快点，写个牌子而已，又不是写作文。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE.1"
msgid "The judge is busy at a different stage. Popular guy."
msgstr "裁判在别的场子忙，挺吃香嘛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.ALREADYACTIVE.2"
msgid "Guess I wait my turn. Like the cafeteria line."
msgstr "得排队了，跟食堂打饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK.1"
msgid "This stage is missing something. Probably the judge."
msgstr "这台子少了点什么。大概是裁判。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.DOESNTWORK.2"
msgid "Nothing's happening. Did I set it up wrong?"
msgstr "没动静。是我装错了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE.1"
msgid "Hello? Is the judge skipping too?"
msgstr "喂？裁判也逃课了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.NORESPONSE.2"
msgid "He's ignoring me. Rude."
msgstr "他不理我。真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE.1"
msgid "The contest's already going. Can't start it twice."
msgstr "比赛已经开始了，不能再开一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_STARTCONTEST.RIGHTTHERE.2"
msgid "Patience. Even I can wait sometimes."
msgstr "急什么，连我都能等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN.1"
msgid "Got this pattern already. Waste of paper."
msgstr "这个花样早有了，浪费纸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.YOTB_UNLOCKSKIN.ALREADYKNOWN.2"
msgid "Same design again? I'm not sewing it twice."
msgstr "又是这款？我才不缝第二遍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nope. Not happening."
msgstr "不行，没戏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL_GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is it me, or is this thing just stubborn?"
msgstr "是我的问题，还是这东西太倔？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT.1"
msgid "Look at me, being productive."
msgstr "看看我，居然这么勤快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT.2"
msgid "Done. That counts as today's effort."
msgstr "完成。今天的努力就到这了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE.1"
msgid "Nobody at school's gonna believe this."
msgstr "说给学校的人听，肯定没人信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACCOMPLISHMENT_DONE.2"
msgid "All done. Can I take a nap now?"
msgstr "全做完了。能睡午觉了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS.1"
msgid "Bats again, and these ones are dripping something gross."
msgstr "又是蝙蝠，这批身上还滴着恶心的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ACIDBATS.2"
msgid "Batter up. Just don't splash acid on my bat."
msgstr "来吧。就是别把酸溅到我的球棒上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL.1"
msgid "Great. Back to square one."
msgstr "好吧，又回到原点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ADVENTUREFAIL.2"
msgid "That didn't count. Practice round."
msgstr "刚才不算，那是练习赛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE.1"
msgid "Whoa, stuff just popped into my head. Wish tests worked like this."
msgstr "哇，东西直接跑进脑子里了。考试要是这样就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NEW_KNOWLEDGE.2"
msgid "Free knowledge. Best class I've ever had."
msgstr "免费的知识，我上过最好的一堂课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER.1"
msgid "Dead. Like my phone during finals."
msgstr "没电了。跟期末时的手机一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_NO_POWER.2"
msgid "Somebody forgot to pay the electric bill."
msgstr "有人忘了交电费吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE.1"
msgid "Heard this one. Skip to the next chapter."
msgstr "这段听过了，跳到下一章。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ARCHIVE_OLD_KNOWLEDGE.2"
msgid "Reruns. Boring."
msgstr "重播啊，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Even stronger than usual? Stuff's gonna break."
msgstr "比平时还有劲？东西要遭殃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ATTACK.2"
msgid "My bat's gonna love this."
msgstr "我的球棒会喜欢这个的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.1"
msgid "Zappy bat. Home run guaranteed."
msgstr "带电球棒，必出全垒打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.2"
msgid "My hair's standing up. Whatever, time to hit stuff."
msgstr "头发都竖起来了。算了，去打东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.1"
msgid "Rain can do whatever it wants now."
msgstr "雨想怎么下就怎么下吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.2"
msgid "Waterproof. Better than every umbrella I've ever lost."
msgstr "防水了，比我弄丢的哪把伞都好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.1"
msgid "Feels like wearing three jackets. Nice."
msgstr "感觉像穿了三件外套，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.2"
msgid "Go ahead, hit me. Won't do much."
msgstr "来打啊，没多大用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.1"
msgid "Wide awake. That's weird for me."
msgstr "清醒得很。这对我来说可不正常。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.2"
msgid "Eyes wide open. My teachers would cry."
msgstr "眼睛睁这么大，老师看了会哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.1"
msgid "Working fast means napping sooner."
msgstr "干得快，就能早点睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ATTACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.2"
msgid "I could chop down a whole forest. Won't, though."
msgstr "感觉能砍光一整片林子。不过我不砍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST.1"
msgid "Booo... seriously?"
msgstr "呜……不是吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BECOMEGHOST.2"
msgid "Oooh... I didn't even eat lunch yet..."
msgstr "呜……午饭还没吃呢……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BEES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BEES.1"
msgid "Buzz off! I'm swinging!"
msgstr "滚开！我要挥棒了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BEES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BEES.2"
msgid "Ow, ow, they're all over me!"
msgstr "痛痛痛，全扑过来了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK.1"
msgid "Water's coming in! Grab a patch!"
msgstr "进水了！拿补丁来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_LEAK.2"
msgid "Who punched a hole in the boat? Wasn't me."
msgstr "谁把船打穿了？不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK.1"
msgid "My uniform's getting soaked! Do something!"
msgstr "制服要湿透了！快想办法！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINK.2"
msgid "Can't swim with a bat in my hand!"
msgstr "拿着球棒可游不了泳！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG.1"
msgid "It came back just to hit my face. Rude."
msgstr "它回来专打我的脸，真过分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BOOMERANG.2"
msgid "Hey! I'm not the target!"
msgstr "喂！我不是靶子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION.1"
msgid "Bring it on, creepy trees."
msgstr "放马过来吧，怪树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BRAVERY_POTION.2"
msgid "Feeling brave. Or maybe just full."
msgstr "胆子大了，也可能只是吃饱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BURNT.1"
msgid "Ow ow ow!"
msgstr "烫烫烫！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_BURNT.2"
msgid "Yikes, my fingers!"
msgstr "哇，我的手指！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF.1"
msgid "Hey, fluffball. Over here."
msgstr "喂，毛球，过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CALL_BEEF.2"
msgid "Quit grazing and come carry me."
msgstr "别吃草了，过来驮我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX.1"
msgid "Still fixable. Barely."
msgstr "还能修，勉强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANFIX.2"
msgid "A few smacks and it'll be fine."
msgstr "敲几下就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS.1"
msgid "Not enough stuff. Gotta go gather more, ugh."
msgstr "东西不够，又得去捡，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_INGREDIENTS.2"
msgid "Can't make it out of thin air."
msgstr "总不能凭空变出来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION.1"
msgid "Need a proper workbench for this one."
msgstr "这个得找个正经工作台。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_STATION.2"
msgid "Not here. Where'd that machine go?"
msgstr "这里不行。那台机器哪去了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH.1"
msgid "We haven't covered this in class yet."
msgstr "课上还没讲到这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANNOT_BUILD.NO_TECH.2"
msgid "No clue how. Don't look at me."
msgstr "完全不会，别看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST.1"
msgid "Too far from the stage. Nobody'll notice it."
msgstr "离台子太远了，没人会注意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANTBUILDHERE_YOTB_POST.2"
msgid "Wrong spot. It has to go by the arena."
msgstr "位置不对，得放在赛场旁边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE.1"
msgid "Clingy curse. Worse than a chain letter."
msgstr "黏人的诅咒，比连锁信还烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CANT_ESCAPE_CURSE.2"
msgid "Still cursed. Great."
msgstr "还被诅咒着，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP.1"
msgid "Hey, napping is my job. Run!"
msgstr "喂，睡觉是我的活，你快跑！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_FELL_ASLEEP.2"
msgid "Wake up! I'm not carrying you to the finish."
msgstr "醒醒！我可不会抱你到终点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED.1"
msgid "Hey! Eyes forward!"
msgstr "喂！看前面！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_STUNNED.2"
msgid "Dizzy already? It barely started."
msgstr "这就晕了？才刚开始啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING.1"
msgid "Even I run faster than that in P.E."
msgstr "体育课上我都比你跑得快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_ERROR_WALKING.2"
msgid "Strolling? This isn't a field trip."
msgstr "散步呢？又不是春游。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE.1"
msgid "Go, go! Win me some snacks."
msgstr "冲冲冲！给我赢点零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CARRAT_START_RACE.2"
msgid "And they're off. Wake me at the finish."
msgstr "出发了。到终点再叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN.1"
msgid "Rocks! Cover your head!"
msgstr "石头！护住头！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CAVEIN.2"
msgid "Run! This place is falling apart!"
msgstr "快跑！这里要塌了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE.1"
msgid "Hot seat! Like, actually hot!"
msgstr "屁股烫！是真的烫！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHAIR_ON_FIRE.2"
msgid "Who set the chair on fire? Not funny."
msgstr "谁把椅子点着了？一点也不好笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE.1"
msgid "Hey. Quit hiding in the dark."
msgstr "喂，别躲在黑里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE.2"
msgid "Something's breathing. Not funny."
msgstr "有东西在喘气，不好笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Hey! Who hit me?!"
msgstr "喂！谁打我？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CHARLIE_ATTACK.2"
msgid "Cheap shot! Fight me in the light!"
msgstr "偷袭！有本事到亮处来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COLD.1"
msgid "Freezing. The skirt was a bad call."
msgstr "冻死了。穿裙子真是失策。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COLD.2"
msgid "Can't feel my fingers. Need a fire."
msgstr "手指没知觉了，要火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT.1"
msgid "Used it up. Which way was north again?"
msgstr "用坏了。北边是哪边来着？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COMPASS_OUT.2"
msgid "No compass. Guess I'm guessing."
msgstr "指南针没了，只能靠猜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP.1"
msgid "Mmh... five more minutes would've been perfect."
msgstr "嗯……再睡五分钟就完美了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_COZY_SLEEP.2"
msgid "Best nap ever. Don't talk to me yet."
msgstr "睡得太爽了，先别跟我说话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL.1"
msgid "Short again. My stuff keeps vanishing."
msgstr "又不够。东西老是不见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_CRAFTING_FAIL.2"
msgid "Can't make it. Someone lend me some."
msgstr "做不出来，谁借我点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DAMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DAMP.1"
msgid "Great, wet socks."
msgstr "好嘛，袜子湿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DAMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DAMP.2"
msgid "Forgot my umbrella. Again."
msgstr "又忘带伞了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "Something huge is coming. One eye, probably."
msgstr "有个大家伙要来了，估计是独眼的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "Ground's shaking. Not my stomach this time."
msgstr "地在震。这回不是我肚子在叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN.1"
msgid "Bye. Don't wait up."
msgstr "拜拜，别等我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DESPAWN.2"
msgid "Going home? Hope there's dinner."
msgstr "回家吗？希望有晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Aw, I'm back to just regular strong."
msgstr "啊，又变回普通的大力气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ATTACK.2"
msgid "Buff's gone. Still strong enough, though."
msgstr "效果没了。不过力气还是够用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.1"
msgid "Zap's gone. My hair can finally lie flat."
msgstr "电没了，头发总算能趴下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_ELECTRICATTACK.2"
msgid "Back to a regular bat."
msgstr "又变回普通球棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.1"
msgid "Waterproofing's gone. Uniform's in danger."
msgstr "防水没了，制服危险了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_MOISTUREIMMUNITY.2"
msgid "Ugh, I can feel the drizzle again."
msgstr "啧，又能感觉到毛毛雨了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.1"
msgid "That armored feeling's gone. Careful now."
msgstr "那种穿了盔甲的感觉没了，小心点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_PLAYERABSORPTION.2"
msgid "Getting hit is gonna hurt again. Lame."
msgstr "挨打又要疼了，没劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.1"
msgid "Yawn... knew it wouldn't last."
msgstr "哈欠……就知道撑不久。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_SLEEPRESISTANCE.2"
msgid "My eyelids weigh a ton now..."
msgstr "眼皮重得要命……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.1"
msgid "Back to my usual lazy speed."
msgstr "又回到平时的懒散速度了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DETACH_BUFF_WORKEFFECTIVENESS.2"
msgid "Hands feel slow. Break time?"
msgstr "手慢下来了，休息一下？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING.1"
msgid "Moved it. Looks less sickly now."
msgstr "挪了个地方，看着没那么病恹恹了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DIG_DISEASE_WARNING.2"
msgid "There. Fresh dirt, fresh start."
msgstr "好了，换新土，重新开始。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING.1"
msgid "That spike's glowing, move!"
msgstr "那根刺在发光，快跑！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DREADSTONE_SPIKE_EXPLODING.2"
msgid "Nope, nope, my bat can't hit that back!"
msgstr "不行不行，这个球棒打不回去！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DUSK.1"
msgid "Sun's clocking out. Lucky."
msgstr "太阳下班了，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_DUSK.2"
msgid "Getting dark. Somebody light a fire."
msgstr "天要黑了，谁去生个火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Food. Good."
msgstr "吃的，好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Not bad. Got seconds?"
msgstr "还行，还有吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID.1"
msgid "Even I won't eat that."
msgstr "这个连我都不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.INVALID.2"
msgid "My stomach says no."
msgstr "我的胃说不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL.1"
msgid "Ugh... that was a mistake."
msgstr "呃……吃错东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.PAINFUL.2"
msgid "Ow, my stomach... worse than cafeteria curry."
msgstr "哎哟，肚子……比食堂咖喱还要命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED.1"
msgid "Blegh. That was way past expired."
msgstr "呸，这早就过期了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.SPOILED.2"
msgid "Gross. It was fuzzy."
msgstr "恶心，都长毛了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE.1"
msgid "Soggy. Like a bento left in a hot locker."
msgstr "软塌塌的，跟放在热柜子里的便当一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.STALE.2"
msgid "Meh. Edible, barely."
msgstr "嗯，勉强能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY.1"
msgid "No way. Give it to someone else."
msgstr "绝对不要，给别人吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EAT.YUCKY.2"
msgid "I'd rather starve. Okay, not really, but still no."
msgstr "宁可饿着。好吧也不至于，但还是不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING.1"
msgid "Eating alone at a feast? Lonely."
msgstr "宴会一个人吃？太冷清了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EATING_NOT_FEASTING.2"
msgid "Hey, sit down already, the food's getting cold."
msgstr "喂，快坐下，饭要凉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED.1"
msgid "Whoa, that kicked in hard."
msgstr "哇，劲儿上来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_BOOSTED.2"
msgid "Extra-strong brew. Wendy's been busy."
msgstr "加强版，温蒂没闲着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION.1"
msgid "Everything's glowy. Hi, ghosts."
msgstr "到处都亮晶晶的，嗨，幽灵们。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_GHOSTVISION.2"
msgid "Seeing dead people. Not a fan."
msgstr "能看到死人了，不太喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED.1"
msgid "Zoom. Late-for-class speed."
msgstr "冲。迟到时的速度。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_PLAYER_SPEED.2"
msgid "Legs feel light. Snack run!"
msgstr "腿好轻，去买零食！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER.1"
msgid "Whoa, my head's spinning."
msgstr "哇，头在转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ELIXIR_TOO_SUPER.2"
msgid "Too much. Feels like five energy drinks."
msgstr "太猛了，像喝了五罐能量饮料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK.1"
msgid "Pitch black. Anyone?"
msgstr "一片漆黑。有人吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_DARK.2"
msgid "Too dark. Something's gonna bite me."
msgstr "太黑了，会有东西咬我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT.1"
msgid "Ah, light. Much better."
msgstr "啊，有光了，好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ENTER_LIGHT.2"
msgid "Phew. Nothing's grabbing me here."
msgstr "呼，这里不会被抓走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB.1"
msgid "Gross, I'm all slimy."
msgstr "恶心，全身黏糊糊的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EXIT_GELBLOB.2"
msgid "Escaped the jelly. Never eating jelly again."
msgstr "逃出果冻了，再也不吃果冻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE.1"
msgid "A giant eyeball in the sky. Sure, why not."
msgstr "天上一颗大眼球。行吧，有什么不可能的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_ARRIVE.2"
msgid "Stop staring at me, creep."
msgstr "别盯着我看，变态。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY.1"
msgid "Running away? Coward."
msgstr "逃了？胆小鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYAWAY.2"
msgid "Bye. Don't come back. Ever."
msgstr "拜拜，永远别回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK.1"
msgid "Ugh, it came back. Clingy."
msgstr "啧，又回来了，真黏人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_EYEOFTERROR_FLYBACK.2"
msgid "Round two? I'm sleepy."
msgstr "第二轮？我困了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT.1"
msgid "No more breeze. Back to sweating."
msgstr "没风了，又要出汗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FAN_OUT.2"
msgid "Used it up. Waved too hard."
msgstr "用坏了，扇太用力了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED.1"
msgid "Studying poop. School never taught me this."
msgstr "研究粪便，学校可没教过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FERTILIZER_RESEARCHED.2"
msgid "Great, now I'm a manure expert."
msgstr "好了，我成肥料专家了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE.1"
msgid "Phew, my stomach's back. Lesson learned."
msgstr "呼，肚子好了。长记性了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FIRENETTLE_TOXIN_DONE.2"
msgid "Burning's gone. That plant's on my list now."
msgstr "不烧了。那棵草我记住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN.1"
msgid "A flare. Someone wants attention."
msgstr "信号弹，有人想引起注意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLARE_SEEN.2"
msgid "Huh, fireworks? Guess I'll go look."
msgstr "嗯？烟花？去看看吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD.1"
msgid "Okay, floaty, you're my best friend now."
msgstr "好了，救生圈，你现在是我最好的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_HELD.2"
msgid "Phew, something to hold onto."
msgstr "呼，总算有东西可以抓了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO.1"
msgid "Hey! Come back, floaty!"
msgstr "喂！救生圈回来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOATER_LETGO.2"
msgid "Don't ditch me now, I'm still in the water!"
msgstr "现在别丢下我，我还在水里！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED.1"
msgid "Arms are jelly... where's the shore..."
msgstr "手臂软了……岸在哪……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FLOAT_SWIM_TIRED.2"
msgid "Should've paid attention in swim class..."
msgstr "游泳课应该好好上的……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM.1"
msgid "Free! Like when the last bell rings."
msgstr "自由了！跟放学铃响一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_FREEDOM.2"
msgid "Out at last. Snack time."
msgstr "终于出来了，吃零食去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM.1"
msgid "The fish guys are having a meeting."
msgstr "鱼人们在开会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GATHER_MERM.2"
msgid "Lots of merms over there. Wurt's friends?"
msgstr "那边好多鱼人，是沃特的朋友？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN.1"
msgid "Too many ghosts around. It's giving me chills."
msgstr "幽灵太多了，凉飕飕的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GHOSTDRAIN.2"
msgid "Somebody revive these guys already."
msgstr "谁快把他们复活吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED.1"
msgid "Pfft! Warn me before you spray!"
msgstr "噗！喷之前说一声啊！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GOT_DECON_MISTED.2"
msgid "Great, now I smell like cleaning fluid."
msgstr "好了，现在一身清洁剂味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE.1"
msgid "That's not the usual thing in the dark."
msgstr "黑暗里那个不是平常那家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE.2"
msgid "Weird. Something different is lurking."
msgstr "奇怪，潜着的东西不一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Ow! What was that?!"
msgstr "痛！那是什么？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_GRUE_NOCHARLIE_ATTACK.2"
msgid "Hey! Teeth! In the dark!"
msgstr "喂！有牙！黑里有牙！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE.1"
msgid "Salve's worn off. Stay out of the acid rain."
msgstr "药膏失效了，别淋酸雨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_ACIDBUFF_DONE.2"
msgid "Need another coat before I start sizzling."
msgstr "得再涂一层，不然要滋滋响了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE.1"
msgid "Heat's getting to me again. Ugh."
msgstr "又被热到了，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLEBUFF_DONE.2"
msgid "Salve's gone. These vents are cooking me."
msgstr "药膏没了，这些喷气口要把我烤熟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE.1"
msgid "Ugh, dizzy. That shell ride was rough."
msgstr "呃，好晕。坐贝壳也太颠了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_ARRIVE.2"
msgid "Here. My stomach's still back there somewhere."
msgstr "到了。我的胃好像还落在那边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT.1"
msgid "Didn't work. The shell's being picky."
msgstr "没用，贝壳挑地方呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HERMITCRAB_SHELL_BADTELEPORTPOINT.2"
msgid "Can't land there? Fine, pick another spot."
msgstr "那里不能落？行，换一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH.1"
msgid "Whoa, my brain actually grew."
msgstr "哇，脑子居然变大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HIGHRESEARCH.2"
msgid "That's a whole semester in one go."
msgstr "一下学了一整个学期。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOT.1"
msgid "Melting... someone get me ice cream."
msgstr "要化了……谁给我冰淇淋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOT.2"
msgid "Too hot to move. I'm lying down."
msgstr "热得动不了，我躺下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS.1"
msgid "Dogs incoming. Batter up."
msgstr "狗来了，准备挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HOUNDS.2"
msgid "Hounds? I just wanted a nap."
msgstr "猎犬？我只是想睡个午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY.1"
msgid "My stomach's louder than I am now."
msgstr "我肚子叫得比我说话还响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNGRY.2"
msgid "Feed me before I bite something."
msgstr "快喂我，不然我要咬东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK.1"
msgid "Nope, not that path. Too sketchy."
msgstr "那条不走，太可疑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_AVOID_FORK.2"
msgid "Gut says this one's safer."
msgstr "直觉说这条安全点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.1"
msgid "It's right around here. Get ready."
msgstr "就在附近，准备好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_BEAST_NEARBY.2"
msgid "Smells like a big animal. Dinner?"
msgstr "有大动物的味道，晚饭？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.1"
msgid "Lost it. Whatever."
msgstr "跟丢了，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL.2"
msgid "Tracks just stop? Did it fly away?"
msgstr "脚印没了？它飞走了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.1"
msgid "Mud everywhere and not one print. Great."
msgstr "到处是泥，就是没脚印。真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_LOST_TRAIL_SPRING.2"
msgid "Spring rain ruins everything."
msgstr "春雨把什么都毁了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK.1"
msgid "Two trails? One of them's gotta be trouble."
msgstr "两条路？总有一条有问题。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_START_FORK.2"
msgid "Choices. I hate choices."
msgstr "要选啊，我最讨厌选了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK.1"
msgid "Picked right. Lucky guess."
msgstr "选对了，蒙的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_SUCCESSFUL_FORK.2"
msgid "There it is. Told you I had a good feeling."
msgstr "就在那，我就说感觉对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK.1"
msgid "Uh oh. Wrong turn, I think."
msgstr "糟了，好像走错了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_HUNT_WRONG_FORK.2"
msgid "This doesn't smell like dinner. Smells like trouble."
msgstr "这味道不像晚饭，像麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER.1"
msgid "Still hungry? You and me both."
msgstr "还饿？咱俩一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INSUFFICIENTFERTILIZER.2"
msgid "Not enough poop yet. Gross thing to say."
msgstr "肥还不够。这话说出来都恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL.1"
msgid "No room. Even my skirt pockets are stuffed."
msgstr "没地方了，连裙子口袋都塞满了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_INV_FULL.2"
msgid "Can't carry more. Gotta toss something."
msgstr "拿不下了，得扔点什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING.1"
msgid "Food! Nobody touch my plate."
msgstr "开饭！谁都别碰我的盘子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_IS_FEASTING.2"
msgid "Feast time. Best part of winter."
msgstr "宴会时间，冬天最棒的部分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD.1"
msgid "Hey, little guy. You lost?"
msgstr "嘿，小家伙，走丢了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_FOUND_IN_THE_WILD.2"
msgid "A kitcoon out here? Come here, fuzzball."
msgstr "这里有只小浣猫？过来，小毛团。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE.1"
msgid "That's everyone. Do I get a prize?"
msgstr "全齐了，有奖品吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_LAST_ONE.2"
msgid "Gotcha, final one. Game over."
msgstr "抓到最后一只，游戏结束。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE.1"
msgid "One more. Come out already."
msgstr "还差一只，快出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_FOUND_ONE_MORE.2"
msgid "Just one left. Probably napping somewhere."
msgstr "就剩一只，估计在哪睡着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME.1"
msgid "Lost to a bunch of kittens. Embarrassing."
msgstr "输给一群小猫，丢人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_LOSEGAME.2"
msgid "Fine, you win. I wasn't trying anyway."
msgstr "行，你们赢了，反正我也没认真。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1"
msgid "Hurry, hurry, where are they?"
msgstr "快快快，在哪呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2"
msgid "Clock's ticking. Like the last minute of a test."
msgstr "时间要到了，像考试最后一分钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR.1"
msgid "Too far out. Kitcoons aren't that sneaky."
msgstr "太远了，小浣猫没那么会藏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR.2"
msgid "Pretty sure I wandered off. Oops."
msgstr "我好像跑偏了，哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN.1"
msgid "Okay, back in the right area."
msgstr "好，回到正确的范围了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDANDSEEK_TOOFAR_RETURN.2"
msgid "Here again. They gotta be close."
msgstr "又回来了，肯定就在附近。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN.1"
msgid "Fine, I'll play. Just one round."
msgstr "行，我玩，就一局。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_JOIN.2"
msgid "Sure, it beats doing homework."
msgstr "行啊，总比写作业强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START.1"
msgid "Ready or not, here I come."
msgstr "不管藏没藏好，我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_START.2"
msgid "Okay, eyes open. Kitten hunting time."
msgstr "好，睁眼了，抓小猫时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP.1"
msgid "Deer incoming! Cheater."
msgstr "鹿来了！作弊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_CALLFORHELP.2"
msgid "Calling friends? I don't even have that many."
msgstr "叫朋友？我都没那么多朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE.1"
msgid "Uh oh, now he's mad."
msgstr "糟了，他生气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_ENRAGE.2"
msgid "He got way stronger! Run!"
msgstr "他变强好多！快跑！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED.1"
msgid "He's loose! This is gonna hurt."
msgstr "他挣开了！这下要疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED.2"
msgid "No more chains? Round two, then."
msgstr "链子没了？那来第二回合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT.1"
msgid "Ugh... who turned off the lights..."
msgstr "呃……谁把灯关了……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT.2"
msgid "Seeing stars... and not the pretty kind..."
msgstr "眼冒金星……不是好看的那种……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED.1"
msgid "No zap. My hair survived."
msgstr "没被电到，发型保住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED.2"
msgid "Ha. Nice try, sky."
msgstr "哈，老天你想得美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND.1"
msgid "Hands off my fire!"
msgstr "别碰我的火！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND.2"
msgid "Creepy hand, get lost before I bat you."
msgstr "怪手，滚开，不然我一棒打过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH.1"
msgid "That's it? I learn more while napping."
msgstr "就这？我睡觉学到的都比这多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH.2"
msgid "Barely anything. Waste of a lesson."
msgstr "几乎没东西，白上一课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING.1"
msgid "Here comes the moon thing. Get ready."
msgstr "月亮那东西来了，准备好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING.2"
msgid "Again? It never gives up."
msgstr "又来？它就是不放弃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES.1"
msgid "Birds falling from the sky? Gross."
msgstr "鸟从天上掉下来？好恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES.2"
msgid "Now it's raining birds. This place is nuts."
msgstr "现在开始下鸟了，这地方疯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS.1"
msgid "The birds are freaking out up there."
msgstr "上面的鸟在发疯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS.2"
msgid "Something's spooking the birds. Not good."
msgstr "有东西惊着鸟了，不妙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX.1"
msgid "Something big just tore open out there."
msgstr "外面有什么大东西裂开了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX.2"
msgid "The rift's at full size. Great, more trouble."
msgstr "裂隙到最大了，好嘛，又多了麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS.1"
msgid "No more wind-up buddies. They'd start a club."
msgstr "发条小弟不能再多了，会自己组社团的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS.2"
msgid "That's my limit. I can't babysit a whole army."
msgstr "到上限了，我可带不了一整支军队。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN.1"
msgid "Big red flare. Somebody's asking for a fight."
msgstr "大红信号弹，有人在找打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN.2"
msgid "Who fired that? Whatever's coming won't be friendly."
msgstr "谁放的？要来的东西肯定不友好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE.1"
msgid "Okay. My stomach and I are talking again."
msgstr "好了，我和我的胃和好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE.2"
msgid "Phew. Cooled down at last."
msgstr "呼，总算降温了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1.1"
msgid "Huh, why do I want bananas so bad?"
msgstr "嗯？怎么突然好想吃香蕉？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1.2"
msgid "Feels weird. Like I'm growing fur."
msgstr "怪怪的，好像要长毛了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE.1"
msgid "I'm a monkey?! This is not my look."
msgstr "我变成猴子了？！这不是我的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE.2"
msgid "Ugh, a tail. My skirt doesn't sit right."
msgstr "啧，有尾巴了，裙子穿着不对劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK.1"
msgid "Human again. No more bananas, please."
msgstr "变回人了，别再给我香蕉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK.2"
msgid "Tail's gone. Good riddance."
msgstr "尾巴没了，走好不送。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW.1"
msgid "Almost cracked. Keep swinging."
msgstr "快裂开了，继续砸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW.2"
msgid "Nearly there. My arm's not even tired."
msgstr "就快了，手都还没酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED.1"
msgid "Something shiny inside. Gotta break it out."
msgstr "里面有亮闪闪的东西，得砸出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_MED.2"
msgid "Halfway. This glass is tougher than it looks."
msgstr "一半了，这玻璃比看着硬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL.1"
msgid "There. Didn't even break it."
msgstr "好了，居然没砸坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_REVEAL.2"
msgid "Got it. That was satisfying."
msgstr "到手，真解压。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW.1"
msgid "One good swing should do it."
msgstr "再来一棒就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_LOW.2"
msgid "So close. Don't crack the good part."
msgstr "差一点了，别把里面的东西敲坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED.1"
msgid "There's a shape in there. Looks like a statue."
msgstr "里面有个形状，像是雕像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_MED.2"
msgid "Still more to go. Stubborn rock."
msgstr "还早，这石头真倔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL.1"
msgid "Ooh, a little statue. Kinda cute."
msgstr "哦，一个小雕像，还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.IDOL_REVEAL.2"
msgid "Done. Who carved this thing anyway?"
msgstr "好了。这东西到底谁雕的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW.1"
msgid "One more tap and it's mine."
msgstr "再敲一下就是我的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_LOW.2"
msgid "It's cracking like a stubborn walnut."
msgstr "裂开了，跟颗倔核桃似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED.1"
msgid "Something's glowing inside. Keep going."
msgstr "里面在发光，继续。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_MED.2"
msgid "Hard shell. My bat's doing all the work."
msgstr "壳好硬，全靠我的球棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL.1"
msgid "There. A weird glowy seed thing."
msgstr "好了，一个奇怪的发光种子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.SEED_REVEAL.2"
msgid "Out it comes. Can I eat it? No? Fine."
msgstr "出来了。能吃吗？不能？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.1"
msgid "Nothing happened. Wasted my stuff."
msgstr "什么也没发生，浪费材料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.2"
msgid "Did I mess up the recipe? Probably."
msgstr "配方弄错了？大概是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.1"
msgid "Ugh, bugs! Not on my legs!"
msgstr "啧，虫子！别叮我腿！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.2"
msgid "Buzzing in my ear. I'm swatting everything."
msgstr "在我耳边嗡嗡叫，全拍死。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.1"
msgid "Hey, big guy, don't collapse under me."
msgstr "喂，大块头，别在我身下倒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.2"
msgid "Easy there. Let's get you patched up before anything else."
msgstr "慢点，先给你治一治再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.1"
msgid "Those buzzards look like they leveled up over break."
msgstr "这些秃鹫放了个假，好像升级了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.2"
msgid "Great, the vultures came back glowing. Who asked for that?"
msgstr "好嘛，秃鹫发着光回来了，谁要这个啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.1"
msgid "Not unwrapping presents with monsters breathing down my neck."
msgstr "怪物在后面喘气，我才不拆礼物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.2"
msgid "Gifts can wait. Bat first."
msgstr "礼物等一下，先抡球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.1"
msgid "Napping now? Something would bite my face."
msgstr "现在午睡？脸会被咬的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.2"
msgid "Even I can't nap with that thing hovering around."
msgstr "那玩意在旁边转，连我都睡不了午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.1"
msgid "Sleep now and I'm someone's midnight snack."
msgstr "现在睡，我就成别人的夜宵了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.2"
msgid "Deal with whatever's lurking, then bedtime."
msgstr "先把附近躲着的东西解决，再睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.1"
msgid "The sun's glaring at me. No way I'm dozing off."
msgstr "太阳一直瞪着我，根本睡不着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.2"
msgid "Sleeping in broad daylight? I only do that in class."
msgstr "大白天睡觉？我只在课上这么干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.1"
msgid "My body says it's still daytime up there."
msgstr "身体告诉我，上面还是白天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.2"
msgid "Caves are dark, but my eyelids aren't buying it."
msgstr "洞里是黑，可眼皮不买账。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.1"
msgid "My stomach's growling louder than an alarm clock."
msgstr "肚子叫得比闹钟还响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.2"
msgid "Snack, then nap. That's the proper order."
msgstr "先吃零食再午睡，顺序不能乱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.1"
msgid "My stomach's throwing a tantrum. Food first."
msgstr "肚子在闹脾气，先吃东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.2"
msgid "I'd just dream about food and wake up sadder."
msgstr "睡了也只会梦到吃的，醒来更难过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.1"
msgid "Opening presents on a beefalo? It'd eat the wrapping."
msgstr "骑在牛上拆礼物？包装纸会被它吃掉的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.2"
msgid "Hands are busy with the reins. Let me hop down."
msgstr "手还抓着缰绳呢，我先下来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.1"
msgid "A nap this late is just called sleeping."
msgstr "这么晚了还午睡，那叫睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.2"
msgid "Siesta's for afternoons. Even I know that much."
msgstr "午睡是下午的事，这点我还是懂的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.1"
msgid "Something down here keeps breathing. Not napping."
msgstr "这下面有东西一直在喘气，不午睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.2"
msgid "Can't relax. It's probably night up there anyway."
msgstr "放松不下来，上面估计都天黑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.1"
msgid "A flaming jack-o'-lantern already. Skipped a step."
msgstr "直接成火焰南瓜灯了，跳了一步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.2"
msgid "Carving a burning pumpkin? I like my eyebrows."
msgstr "刻着火的南瓜？我还想要眉毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.1"
msgid "Sleeping in flames? That's not a nap, that's a barbecue."
msgstr "在火里睡？那不叫午睡，叫烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.2"
msgid "Bed's burning. Guess I'm staying up."
msgstr "床烧了，看来要熬夜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.1"
msgid "My outfits! Somebody grab water!"
msgstr "我的衣服！谁快拿水来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.2"
msgid "Changing now means changing into ashes."
msgstr "现在换衣服，只能换成灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.1"
msgid "Huh. Nothing jumped out. Kinda disappointed."
msgstr "咦，什么都没跳出来，有点失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.2"
msgid "Safe. My bat was ready for nothing."
msgstr "安全。球棒白准备了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.1"
msgid "That went everywhere except the water."
msgstr "甩到哪都行，就是没进水里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.2"
msgid "Oops. I swung it like my bat."
msgstr "哎呀，我当成球棒抡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.1"
msgid "That fish ditched me like I ditch homeroom."
msgstr "那条鱼甩掉我，跟我逃班会一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.2"
msgid "Bye, dinner. I'll remember your face."
msgstr "再见，晚饭。我记住你的脸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.1"
msgid "Snapped? I didn't even pull that hard."
msgstr "断了？我都没怎么用力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.2"
msgid "Too strong for my own good again."
msgstr "又是力气太大惹的祸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.1"
msgid "The line's all floppy. Reel, reel."
msgstr "线都松垮了，收，收。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.2"
msgid "Slack line, lazy fish. Wake up, both of you."
msgstr "线松了，鱼也懒。都给我醒醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.1"
msgid "Whoa, that shadow's bigger than our classroom."
msgstr "哇，那影子比我们教室还大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.2"
msgid "Something's swimming up. Get the bat ready."
msgstr "有东西游上来了，准备好球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.1"
msgid "Wait, was I supposed to memorize this?"
msgstr "等下，这个要背的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.2"
msgid "Ad-libbing. Nobody noticed, right?"
msgstr "我即兴发挥的，没人发现吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.1"
msgid "Oops. Their house was holding the boat together."
msgstr "糟了，原来是它们的窝在撑着船。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.2"
msgid "No den, no boat. Swimming time, I guess."
msgstr "窝没了，船也没了，看来要游泳了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.1"
msgid "Turn back, this tub won't survive the deep end."
msgstr "掉头，这破船去不了深水区。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.2"
msgid "Deep water's off-limits. Like the teachers' lounge."
msgstr "深水禁止入内，跟教师办公室一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.1"
msgid "Hey! I'm not birdseed!"
msgstr "喂！我又不是鸟食！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.2"
msgid "Peck me again and see what happens."
msgstr "再啄一下试试看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.1"
msgid "The trees turned to stone? Even they got bored stiff."
msgstr "树变成石头了？连它们都闷僵了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.2"
msgid "Crackling like that... are the trees cramping up?"
msgstr "咔咔响……树是抽筋了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.1"
msgid "Ew, this smells like the gym locker room."
msgstr "呃，这味道像体育馆更衣室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.2"
msgid "Pretty sure plants aren't supposed to smell like that."
msgstr "植物应该不是这个味道吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.1"
msgid "Monkeys with boats? Batting practice, then."
msgstr "猴子开船来了？那就练击球吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.2"
msgid "Hide the snacks, the pirates are here."
msgstr "把零食藏好，海盗来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.1"
msgid "Mystery seed. Hope it's something tasty."
msgstr "神秘种子，希望是好吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.2"
msgid "Planting blind. Like guessing on a test."
msgstr "闭眼种，跟考试蒙答案一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.1"
msgid "Ow. Wanda, your watch needs a cushion."
msgstr "哎哟。旺达，你的表该配个垫子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Spat out of nowhere again. My head's spinning."
msgstr "又被凭空吐出来了，头好晕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.1"
msgid "Whoa, whoa! Not falling, not today!"
msgstr "哇哇！不掉，今天不掉！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.2"
msgid "Nope, that's a bottomless pit. Backing up."
msgstr "不行，那是无底洞，往后退。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.1"
msgid "Rocks from the ceiling. Worse than pop quizzes."
msgstr "天花板掉石头，比突击测验还糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.2"
msgid "Earthquake drill? I'd hide under a desk if I had one."
msgstr "地震演习？要是有桌子我就钻下去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.1"
msgid "Even rabbits are picky about where they show up."
msgstr "兔子出场也挑地方的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.2"
msgid "Try somewhere with actual dirt, I guess."
msgstr "大概得换个有土的地方吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1"
msgid "That rumble sounds angry. Bat's ready."
msgstr "这动静听起来很生气，球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2"
msgid "Uh oh, I think I annoyed the rabbit boss."
msgstr "糟糕，好像惹到兔子老大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.1"
msgid "Shiny bunny. Gotta catch that one."
msgstr "闪亮的兔子，非抓不可。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.2"
msgid "Lucky rabbit? Then come share some luck."
msgstr "幸运兔？那分我点运气吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.1"
msgid "Hah, couldn't outrun me."
msgstr "哈，跑不过我吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.2"
msgid "Lucky rabbit, lucky me. Nap earned."
msgstr "幸运兔，幸运的我，可以睡一觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1"
msgid "Ground's rumbling softly. Moles? Rabbits?"
msgstr "地面在轻轻震，鼹鼠？兔子？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2"
msgid "Someone's digging down there. Polite knock, at least."
msgstr "下面有人在挖，至少还挺客气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.1"
msgid "Bounced right off. Rude."
msgstr "直接弹回来了，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.2"
msgid "A shield? That's cheating."
msgstr "护盾？这是作弊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.1"
msgid "My brain's full. No more new stuff."
msgstr "脑子满了，别再塞新东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.2"
msgid "Learned something. Feels weird."
msgstr "学到东西了，感觉怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Ugh, I'm back. Did I miss lunch?"
msgstr "呃，我回来了。午饭错过了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Owe you one. Don't make it a big deal."
msgstr "欠你一次，别到处说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.1"
msgid "There. Try not to die again, okay?"
msgstr "好了，别再死了行吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Welcome back. You owe me a snack."
msgstr "欢迎回来，你欠我一份零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Hang in there. Almost done."
msgstr "撑住，快好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Stay put. Not that you can go anywhere."
msgstr "别乱走。虽然你也走不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.1"
msgid "Everything respawned. Like homework on Monday."
msgstr "全都刷回来了，跟周一的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.2"
msgid "The ruins hit reset. My arms didn't."
msgstr "遗迹重置了，我的胳膊可没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.1"
msgid "Picky chest. Fine, another combo."
msgstr "挑剔的箱子，行，再换一组。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.2"
msgid "Rejected. Story of my report cards."
msgstr "被退回了，跟我的成绩单一个命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.1"
msgid "Yes! Didn't even need to cheat."
msgstr "好！都不用作弊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.2"
msgid "It liked that. Can I take the reward now?"
msgstr "它满意了，奖励能拿了吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.1"
msgid "Old news. I've got notes on this."
msgstr "老新闻了，我有笔记。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.2"
msgid "Copying it twice won't get me extra credit."
msgstr "抄两遍也不会加分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.1"
msgid "Stop tailing me like a hall monitor!"
msgstr "别像值周生那样跟着我！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.2"
msgid "Go bother someone else, you glowy thing!"
msgstr "去烦别人吧，发光的家伙！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.1"
msgid "Invisible and bitey. Fight fair!"
msgstr "又隐身又咬人，公平点打！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.2"
msgid "Ow! Come out where my bat can see you."
msgstr "疼！出来让我的球棒看见你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.1"
msgid "Whoa, the rift keeps growing. Not my problem... right?"
msgstr "哇，裂隙还在变大，不关我的事……吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.2"
msgid "Shadows pouring out. Way creepier than the old gym."
msgstr "影子一直往外冒，比旧体育馆还瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.1"
msgid "Tree umbrella. Better than nothing."
msgstr "树做的伞，总比没有好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.2"
msgid "I'll just stand here until the rain gets bored."
msgstr "我就站这儿，等雨自己腻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.1"
msgid "Bone cage? Let me out, I've got swinging to do."
msgstr "骨头笼子？放我出去，我还要抡球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.2"
msgid "Ugh, stuck. Somebody break these bones."
msgstr "呃，卡住了，谁来把骨头敲断。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.1"
msgid "Let go! I'm not a trellis!"
msgstr "放开！我不是花架！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.2"
msgid "Clingy plants. Worse than clingy classmates."
msgstr "黏人的植物，比黏人的同学还烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.1"
msgid "Can't roll a snowball out of mud."
msgstr "泥巴可滚不成雪球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.2"
msgid "Wait for more snow. Or a nap."
msgstr "等雪多一点。或者先睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.1"
msgid "This thing's bigger than me already."
msgstr "这玩意已经比我还大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.2"
msgid "Even with my strength, that's the limit."
msgstr "就算是我的力气，也就到这了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.1"
msgid "I'm a sponge now. A sad, grumpy sponge."
msgstr "我现在是块海绵，又丧又暴躁的海绵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.2"
msgid "Wringing out my skirt in front of everyone? No way."
msgstr "当着大家拧裙子？才不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.1"
msgid "Who's there? I'm not scared, just asking."
msgstr "谁？我没怕，就是问问。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.2"
msgid "Nope, didn't see a thing. Moving on."
msgstr "不，我什么都没看见，走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.1"
msgid "Stay down. I'm not doing this twice."
msgstr "趴好，我可不想再来一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.2"
msgid "One good stomp. Sit there and think about it."
msgstr "狠狠一脚，在那儿好好反省。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.1"
msgid "Ow! Prickly jerk."
msgstr "哎哟！带刺的家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.2"
msgid "Why's everything here so pointy?"
msgstr "这里的东西怎么都这么尖？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.1"
msgid "No more smoke. The shadows will notice me now."
msgstr "没烟了，影子要发现我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.2"
msgid "Out of fuel. Gotta feed it again."
msgstr "没燃料了，又得喂它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Fine, go nap. I'll do it alone."
msgstr "行，你去睡吧，我自己来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.2"
msgid "Ditched by a cat. That's a first."
msgstr "被猫甩了，头一回。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.1"
msgid "...Sorry, big cat. Rest well."
msgstr "……对不起，大猫，好好休息。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.2"
msgid "Hey, wake up... no, it's not waking."
msgstr "喂，醒醒……不行，醒不过来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.1"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, don't meow so loud."
msgstr "好啦好啦，别叫那么大声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.2"
msgid "Mm, I'm coming. Stop staring."
msgstr "嗯，来了，别盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.1"
msgid "Beaten to it. Whatever, I'm tired anyway."
msgstr "被抢先了。算了，反正我也累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.2"
msgid "Aw, someone snagged that kitten first."
msgstr "哎，那只小猫被人先抓走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.1"
msgid "Kitty, kitty. I can hear you."
msgstr "猫猫，猫猫，我听见你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.2"
msgid "Getting warmer. Check behind the bushes."
msgstr "越来越近了，看看灌木后面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1"
msgid "All found. Finally, nap time."
msgstr "全找到了，终于能睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2"
msgid "No more kittens. Good, my legs are done."
msgstr "没小猫了，正好，我腿也废了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.1"
msgid "Nose to the ground. I'll follow."
msgstr "鼻子贴地了，我跟着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.2"
msgid "Hide and seek with kittens. Could be worse."
msgstr "跟小猫玩捉迷藏，还不算太糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.1"
msgid "Coming, coming. Don't rush me."
msgstr "来了来了，别催。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.2"
msgid "Sorry, got distracted by a snack."
msgstr "抱歉，被零食分心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.1"
msgid "Hopped back underground. Coward."
msgstr "跳回地底了，胆小鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.2"
msgid "Great. All that hitting for nothing."
msgstr "好嘛，打了半天白打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.1"
msgid "Hey, don't burrow away! Get back here!"
msgstr "喂，别钻回去！给我回来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.2"
msgid "Hurry, hit it before it digs in!"
msgstr "快，趁它钻下去前打！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.1"
msgid "Whoops. Wet hands, bad idea."
msgstr "哎呀，手湿了，真不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.2"
msgid "Butterfingers. Don't laugh."
msgstr "手滑了，不许笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.1"
msgid "That's like hitting a wall with chopsticks."
msgstr "这就像拿筷子敲墙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.2"
msgid "Not even my strength can fix a bad tool."
msgstr "工具不行，力气再大也没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.1"
msgid "Dark! Don't let Charlie get me."
msgstr "黑了！别让查理抓到我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.2"
msgid "Torch is dead. Fire, anyone?"
msgstr "火把没了，有人有火吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.1"
msgid "Sand everywhere. In my shoes, too."
msgstr "到处都是沙，鞋里也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.2"
msgid "Lazy Deserter? Finally something that gets me."
msgstr "懒人传送塔？总算有东西懂我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.1"
msgid "Ow! Who leaves traps lying around?"
msgstr "疼！谁乱放陷阱啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.2"
msgid "Not looking where I walk. Again."
msgstr "又没看路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.1"
msgid "Ouch. Come back when you're finished."
msgstr "嗷，等你做完再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.2"
msgid "This thing's still under construction. Hands off."
msgstr "这东西还在施工，别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.1"
msgid "Shadows helping me? Weird, but okay."
msgstr "影子在帮我？怪怪的，不过行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.2"
msgid "Truce for now. Don't get any ideas."
msgstr "先停战，别打歪主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.1"
msgid "Dud. Something's off on the other end."
msgstr "没用。那头肯定出问题了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.2"
msgid "Stepped on it, nothing. Am I too heavy?"
msgstr "踩上去没反应，我太重了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.1"
msgid "Spat out by the sea. Gross."
msgstr "被海吐出来了，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.2"
msgid "Sand in my hair. I hate the beach."
msgstr "头发里全是沙，讨厌海滩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.1"
msgid "Poor thing's worn out. Snack break."
msgstr "小家伙累坏了，吃点零食歇会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.2"
msgid "Too tired to run. I get it, buddy."
msgstr "累得跑不动了，我懂你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.1"
msgid "Barely a scratch. My bat feels insulted."
msgstr "连划痕都没有，球棒被侮辱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.2"
msgid "Like hitting a fridge with a pillow."
msgstr "就像拿枕头打冰箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.1"
msgid "Rain on my uniform. Great."
msgstr "雨打在制服上，太好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.2"
msgid "Getting damp. Hope my socks survive."
msgstr "开始湿了，希望袜子能撑住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.1"
msgid "Squishy shoes. The worst feeling."
msgstr "鞋子吱吱响，最难受了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.2"
msgid "Wet to the bone. Wake me when it's dry."
msgstr "湿透了，等干了再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.1"
msgid "Missed. This is worse than a claw machine."
msgstr "没抓到，比娃娃机还坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.2"
msgid "Close, but the claw hates me."
msgstr "差一点，那爪子讨厌我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.1"
msgid "Just seawater. Wow, what a prize."
msgstr "只有海水，哇，真是大奖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.2"
msgid "Empty claw. Maybe there's nothing down there."
msgstr "爪子空的，下面可能什么都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.1"
msgid "Full belly, warm heart. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "肚子饱了，心也暖了，别告诉别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.2"
msgid "Feast mood. Fine, I'm a little happy."
msgstr "过节的气氛，好吧，我有点开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.1"
msgid "Feast's over. Boring again."
msgstr "宴会结束了，又无聊了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.2"
msgid "That warm feeling's gone. Got any leftovers?"
msgstr "暖暖的感觉没了，有剩菜吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.1"
msgid "Slimy. I'm showering twice tonight."
msgstr "黏糊糊的，今晚要洗两遍澡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.2"
msgid "Eaten and spat out. Rude worm."
msgstr "被吃了又吐出来，没礼貌的虫子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.1"
msgid "Ground's wiggling. Get ready to swing."
msgstr "地在扭，准备抡球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.2"
msgid "Worms again? I'm not bait."
msgstr "又是蠕虫？我不是鱼饵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.1"
msgid "Something huge is coming. Huger than huge."
msgstr "有巨大的东西过来了，超级巨大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.2"
msgid "Whoa, the whole floor's rumbling."
msgstr "哇，整个地面都在震。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.1"
msgid "Wortox, your heart's on vacation."
msgstr "沃拓克斯，你的心放假去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.2"
msgid "Teleport failed. Guess I'm walking there."
msgstr "传送失败，看来得走过去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.1"
msgid "Beefalo fashion. My life is so weird."
msgstr "牛的时装，我的人生真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.2"
msgid "New pattern. Should I make my own uniform too?"
msgstr "新款式，要不要也给自己做套制服？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.1"
msgid "No boat near the start line. Nobody's racing."
msgstr "起点旁边没船，谁也比不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.2"
msgid "Bring a boat over first, genius."
msgstr "先把船开过来啊，天才。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.1"
msgid "Race to where, exactly? There's no checkpoints."
msgstr "要比到哪儿去？连检查点都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.2"
msgid "Gotta set the course first. Ugh, more work."
msgstr "先得设赛道，呃，又多活了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.1"
msgid "Too many boats, not enough room."
msgstr "船太多，位置不够。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.2"
msgid "Someone has to sit this one out."
msgstr "得有人退出这一轮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Still recharging? Like me before noon."
msgstr "还在充能？跟我中午前一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Busy, huh. I'll come back after a nap."
msgstr "忙着呢？我睡一觉再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Crazy birds! Shoo, shoo!"
msgstr "疯鸟！走开走开！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.2"
msgid "Aim for someone else, you glowing pigeons!"
msgstr "去瞄准别人，发光的鸽子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'm done. Too much effort."
msgstr "不打了，太费劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "You're boring. I'm leaving."
msgstr "你好无聊，我走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.1"
msgid "Go roll in the mud. We're done."
msgstr "去泥里打滚吧，到此为止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.2"
msgid "Okay, okay, you win the staring contest."
msgstr "好好好，瞪眼比赛你赢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.1"
msgid "Run, then. I'm sitting down."
msgstr "跑吧，我坐下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.2"
msgid "Keep your tail. I'm out."
msgstr "尾巴留着吧，我不追了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.1"
msgid "Go on, scuttle off."
msgstr "走吧，爬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.2"
msgid "Done. Don't let me see you again."
msgstr "结束，别再让我看见你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "Truce. You have too many legs for this."
msgstr "休战，你腿太多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "Fine, you win. Now shoo."
msgstr "行，你赢了。走开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Small flower, big responsibility."
msgstr "小小一朵花，责任很大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep my bat away from it."
msgstr "我会让球棒离它远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.1"
msgid "Okay, I'm not picking that up."
msgstr "好吧，那个我不捡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.2"
msgid "The flower moved. I saw it. Don't laugh."
msgstr "花动了，我看见了。别笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET.1"
msgid "My pocket feels cold. Take it back."
msgstr "我兜里凉飕飕的，拿回去吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET.2"
msgid "It's wiggling. I don't like wiggling."
msgstr "它在扭。我不喜欢会扭的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1.1"
msgid "Same as me in first period."
msgstr "跟我第一节课一个样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1.2"
msgid "Droopy. Needs a nap, probably."
msgstr "蔫蔫的，大概要睡个午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2.1"
msgid "Perking up. Good for her."
msgstr "精神起来了，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2.2"
msgid "Halfway awake. I know that feeling."
msgstr "醒了一半。我懂那感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3.1"
msgid "Fully bloomed. More awake than me."
msgstr "开满了，比我还清醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3.2"
msgid "Looks ready to kick some butt."
msgstr "看着随时能去揍人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG.1"
msgid "Makes my stomach twist. And not from hunger."
msgstr "看得我胃里打结，还不是饿的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG.2"
msgid "Can I not stare at it anymore?"
msgstr "我能不盯着它了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM.1"
msgid "Something's stirring. I'll just stand back."
msgstr "有点动静了，我站远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM.2"
msgid "Feels like waiting outside the teacher's office."
msgstr "感觉像在办公室门口等老师。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON.1"
msgid "Any second now. Wendy, get ready."
msgstr "随时都会出来，温蒂，准备好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON.2"
msgid "The air's getting chilly. Here she comes."
msgstr "空气变凉了，她要来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "Heavy. Makes a great paperweight."
msgstr "很重。拿来压纸刚好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "Drop it and the boat stays put. Like me in bed."
msgstr "放下去船就不动了。跟我赖床一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wants a gift or it shakes the ground. Extortion."
msgstr "不给礼物就震地，这是敲诈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Big sand cat. Pet it? No."
msgstr "沙子里的大猫。摸一下？算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.1"
msgid "Grumpy. Feed it something before it quakes."
msgstr "不高兴了。赶紧喂点东西，不然要地震。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.2"
msgid "Ugh. Sinkholes incoming."
msgstr "唉，要塌坑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.1"
msgid "Happy cat. Now let me sleep."
msgstr "猫开心了，让我睡会吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.2"
msgid "Paid my dues. Like lunch money."
msgstr "交过保护费了。跟午饭钱一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.1"
msgid "A hat that steals the ground. Rude."
msgstr "会偷地皮的帽子。真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.2"
msgid "Smells like the Antlion's den."
msgstr "有股蚁狮窝的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "It beeps toward buried stuff. Treasure hunt time."
msgstr "它会朝埋着的东西响，寻宝时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "Points the way to something. Hopefully food."
msgstr "给我指路，希望是吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "Dragon scales. Fire can't touch me."
msgstr "龙鳞，火烧不到我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "Shiny and scaly. Like a fancy fish."
msgstr "亮晶晶的鳞片，像条高级鱼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.1"
msgid "Fixes itself when my head's a mess. Convenient."
msgstr "我脑子越乱它修得越快，挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.2"
msgid "Spiky and dark. Very delinquent chic."
msgstr "带刺又黑，很有不良少女风。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.1"
msgid "Grass suit. Itchy all over."
msgstr "草编铠甲，浑身痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.2"
msgid "Basically a scarecrow costume."
msgstr "基本就是稻草人戏服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.1"
msgid "Heavy as a fridge. I can still carry it, though."
msgstr "跟冰箱一样重，不过我还背得动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.2"
msgid "Slow, but nothing gets through."
msgstr "慢是慢，但什么都打不进来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.1"
msgid "Keeps me from getting hungry? ...Fine, I'll wear it."
msgstr "能让我不那么饿？……行吧，我穿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.2"
msgid "A squishy hat monster around my waist. Ew."
msgstr "腰上缠着软乎乎的帽子怪，咦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.1"
msgid "Wooden armor. I feel like a cupboard."
msgstr "木头盔甲，感觉自己像个柜子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.2"
msgid "Knock knock. Yep, solid."
msgstr "咚咚，嗯，挺结实。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.1"
msgid "Hit me and you get poked. Fair deal."
msgstr "打我就挨扎，很公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.2"
msgid "Wormwood's thorny armor. Looks itchy."
msgstr "沃姆伍德的荆棘甲，看着就痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1"
msgid "Spiky moon armor. Hugs are cancelled."
msgstr "带刺的月亮甲，拥抱取消。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2"
msgid "Wormwood wearing this looks like a cactus."
msgstr "沃姆伍德穿上像棵仙人掌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.1"
msgid "Wearing nightmares. What a fashion statement."
msgstr "穿着噩梦，真是时尚宣言。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.2"
msgid "Every hit makes the voices louder."
msgstr "每挨一下，那些声音就更大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Whatever it was, it's dust now."
msgstr "不管是什么，现在都是灰了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Achoo. It's up my nose now."
msgstr "阿嚏，钻我鼻子里了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.1"
msgid "Chester's bone burned up. Poor guy."
msgstr "切斯特的骨头烧没了。可怜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.2"
msgid "Can't take it through, huh. Should've known."
msgstr "不能带过去啊。早该知道的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.1"
msgid "Glommer's flower, now just ash."
msgstr "格罗姆的花，只剩灰了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.2"
msgid "So it doesn't travel. Noted."
msgstr "原来带不走啊，记住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.1"
msgid "No idea what this was. Doesn't matter now."
msgstr "不知道原来是什么。反正现在无所谓了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.2"
msgid "Gone in a puff. Like my weekend."
msgstr "噗一下就没了，跟我的周末一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.1"
msgid "Chopping trees is Woodie's job, not mine."
msgstr "砍树是伍迪的活，不是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.2"
msgid "Swings like a bat, just sharper."
msgstr "挥起来像球棒，就是更锋利。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.1"
msgid "More pockets for snacks."
msgstr "更多口袋装零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.2"
msgid "Straps dig into my shoulders. Worth it."
msgstr "背带勒肩膀，但值得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.1"
msgid "Pop it with my bat? Tempting."
msgstr "拿球棒戳爆它？好想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.2"
msgid "Wes twists them into animals. Kinda cute."
msgstr "韦斯能把它扭成动物，还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.1"
msgid "A balloon hat. Everyone's gonna laugh."
msgstr "气球帽子，大家肯定会笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.2"
msgid "Wes thinks I'll wear this? Cute."
msgstr "韦斯觉得我会戴这个？想得美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.1"
msgid "Pop it and there's confetti everywhere. Who cleans that?"
msgstr "一戳爆满地彩纸，谁来扫？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.2"
msgid "A balloon full of balloons. Overkill."
msgstr "气球里装满气球，太夸张了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.1"
msgid "Out of air. Like me after PE."
msgstr "没气了，跟我上完体育课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.2"
msgid "Sad little balloon."
msgstr "可怜的小气球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Speed balloon. Finally, I can be less late."
msgstr "加速气球，终于能少迟到一点了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Move faster for free? Sure, I'll take it."
msgstr "白捡的速度？行，我收下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.1"
msgid "Wes's balloons. I'll run out of breath first."
msgstr "韦斯的气球，我会先没气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.2"
msgid "Floppy rubber. Party not included."
msgstr "软趴趴的橡胶，不包派对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.1"
msgid "A floaty vest. Better than drowning, I guess."
msgstr "漂浮背心，总比淹死强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.2"
msgid "I look like a party decoration."
msgstr "我看起来像个派对装饰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.1"
msgid "Honey bandage. Sticky and sweet."
msgstr "蜂蜜绷带，又黏又甜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.2"
msgid "Bandaged up. Now I really look like a delinquent."
msgstr "缠上绷带，看着更像不良少女了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "Butterfly bandage. Very girly."
msgstr "蝴蝶绷带，很少女。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "Wrap a scratch in wings. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "用翅膀包伤口，算可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.1"
msgid "Dripping acid now. Gross upgrade."
msgstr "现在还滴酸液，恶心升级了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.2"
msgid "Even the bats got worse. Great."
msgstr "连蝙蝠都变更糟了，好极了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Batilisk versus my bat. Guess who wins."
msgstr "蝙蝠对我的球棒，猜谁赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Screeching in the dark. Shut up."
msgstr "黑暗里尖叫，闭嘴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.1"
msgid "Heals me when I hit stuff? Fine by me."
msgstr "打东西还能回血？我没意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.2"
msgid "Bats on a stick. Literally a bat bat."
msgstr "棍子上绑着蝙蝠，真·蝙蝠棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "Lunchbox for songs. Can't eat them."
msgstr "装歌的饭盒，可惜不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "Wigfrid organizes better than me."
msgstr "薇格弗德比我会收拾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.1"
msgid "A song so my bat lasts longer? Neat."
msgstr "唱首歌球棒就更耐用？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.2"
msgid "Singing to weapons. Wigfrid's weird."
msgstr "对着武器唱歌，薇格弗德好怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.1"
msgid "Willow should hear this one."
msgstr "该让薇洛听听这首。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.2"
msgid "Don't burn? I'd hum along to that."
msgstr "不怕火？这首我能跟着哼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.1"
msgid "Hit stuff, feel better. I get it."
msgstr "打东西，身体就好了。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.2"
msgid "A healing song. Cheaper than the nurse."
msgstr "回血歌，比校医便宜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.1"
msgid "Scary words. Like a pop quiz."
msgstr "吓人的话，像突击小测验。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.2"
msgid "Make them run? Saves my bat some swings."
msgstr "把它们吓跑？省得我挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.1"
msgid "Wake up song. I need that every morning."
msgstr "起床歌，我每天早上都需要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.2"
msgid "Singing beats CPR, I guess."
msgstr "唱歌比心肺复苏强吧，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.1"
msgid "Too cringe. You say it, Wigfrid."
msgstr "太尴尬了。你来喊吧，薇格弗德。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.2"
msgid "My face does the taunting just fine."
msgstr "我这张脸就够挑衅的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.1"
msgid "Bonk the shadows with music. Cool."
msgstr "用音乐敲暗影的头，酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.2"
msgid "Shadow-busting tunes. Catchy, sort of."
msgstr "打暗影的曲子，有点洗脑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.1"
msgid "Group singing. Like a school choir, ugh."
msgstr "大合唱，像学校合唱团，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.2"
msgid "Calms everyone down. Even the scaredy-cats."
msgstr "大家都能静下来，连胆小鬼也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.1"
msgid "Like music class, but useful."
msgstr "像音乐课，但是有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.2"
msgid "Sing, punch, and stay sane. Got it."
msgstr "唱、打、保持清醒。明白。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.1"
msgid "Even the moon gets beat up here."
msgstr "在这连月亮都要挨揍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.2"
msgid "Fight the glowing stuff with a song. Okay."
msgstr "用歌对付会发光的东西，行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.1"
msgid "Eats everything in sight. Respect, honestly."
msgstr "看到什么吃什么。说实话，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.2"
msgid "Hands off my snack stash, big guy."
msgstr "别碰我的零食，大家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.1"
msgid "Toasty, and I get hungry slower. Perfect for napping."
msgstr "暖和，还不容易饿。最适合睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.2"
msgid "Basically hugging a bear's belly. Don't tell it."
msgstr "等于抱着熊的肚子。别告诉它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.1"
msgid "Big fluffy rug. I could sleep on it."
msgstr "大毛毯，能睡在上面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.2"
msgid "Took a fight to get this. The bear lost."
msgstr "打了一架才拿到，熊输了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.1"
msgid "Fluffy. Dangerously fluffy."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，危险级别的毛茸茸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.2"
msgid "Five more minutes. Or five more hours."
msgstr "再睡五分钟，或者五个小时。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.1"
msgid "Straw bed. Comfier than my desk."
msgstr "草席，比课桌睡着舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.2"
msgid "Lie down, close eyes, done. Perfect."
msgstr "躺下，闭眼，完事，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Buzzing like the school bell. Annoying."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，跟上课铃一样烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Busy little worker. Unlike me."
msgstr "勤劳的小工蜂，不像我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.1"
msgid "Angry in my pocket. Can't blame it."
msgstr "在口袋里生气，能理解。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.2"
msgid "Calm down, I'll let you go. Maybe."
msgstr "冷静点，会放你走的。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp. So much for honey toast."
msgstr "烧成炭了，我的蜂蜜吐司没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.2"
msgid "Bees moved out. Can't blame them."
msgstr "蜜蜂都搬走了，不怪它们。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.1"
msgid "Overflowing. Grab it before the bees notice."
msgstr "满出来了，趁蜜蜂没注意赶紧拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.2"
msgid "Sweet jackpot. I'm taking all of it."
msgstr "甜蜜大奖，我全要了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A bee apartment. Rent's paid in honey."
msgstr "蜜蜂公寓，房租用蜂蜜交。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bees are hard workers. Unlike someone."
msgstr "蜜蜂真勤快，不像某人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.1"
msgid "Empty. Bees, get to work."
msgstr "空的。蜜蜂，干活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.2"
msgid "Zero honey. My toast stays plain."
msgstr "一点蜂蜜都没，吐司只能干吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.1"
msgid "Honey time. Hat on first."
msgstr "收蜂蜜了，先戴好帽子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.2"
msgid "Sweet stuff. Getting stung is worth it."
msgstr "甜的，被蛰也值。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.1"
msgid "A little honey. Not worth getting stung yet."
msgstr "就一点，还不值得挨蛰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.2"
msgid "Halfway there. Patience isn't my thing."
msgstr "一半了，耐心不是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.1"
msgid "So much meat. Feels bad, though."
msgstr "好多肉。就是心里有点不好受。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.2"
msgid "Down for good. Should've left it alone."
msgstr "倒下了。早知道就别惹它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.1"
msgid "Hey. Get up. ...That's an order."
msgstr "喂，起来。……这是命令。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.2"
msgid "You were the only one who never complained."
msgstr "只有你从来不抱怨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.1"
msgid "Getting used to me. Weird feeling."
msgstr "开始习惯我了，感觉怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.2"
msgid "Fluffy and obedient. Better than my classmates."
msgstr "毛茸茸又听话，比我同学强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Following me like a lost puppy. A huge one."
msgstr "跟着我像只走丢的小狗。超大号的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "Okay, okay. I'll share snacks later."
msgstr "好啦好啦，待会分你零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big, hairy, and chewing nonstop. Relatable."
msgstr "又大又毛，嘴还不停嚼。挺像我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Leave it alone and it leaves you alone."
msgstr "你不惹它，它就不惹你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.1"
msgid "My ride, my pillow, my buddy."
msgstr "我的坐骑，我的枕头，我的伙伴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.2"
msgid "You're the only one who gets me."
msgstr "只有你懂我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.1"
msgid "Looks embarrassed. Sorry, I needed the wool."
msgstr "看着好害羞。抱歉，我需要毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.2"
msgid "Like a bad haircut on picture day."
msgstr "跟拍证件照那天剪坏头发一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.1"
msgid "Grumpy beast. ...Okay, we're similar."
msgstr "暴躁的家伙。……好吧，跟我挺像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.2"
msgid "Stop snorting at me. I'll snort back."
msgstr "别冲我喷鼻子，我也会喷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.1"
msgid "Round and lazy. Living my dream."
msgstr "圆滚滚又懒，过着我梦想的生活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.2"
msgid "Somebody's been snacking. Good for you."
msgstr "有谁在偷吃零食啊。干得好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.1"
msgid "Fast and no walking. Perfect combo."
msgstr "又快又不用走，完美组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.2"
msgid "Giddy up. Don't buck me off."
msgstr "驾！别把我甩下来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Snoring louder than my dad."
msgstr "打呼比我爸还响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Can I nap on you? No? Fine."
msgstr "能靠着你睡会吗？不行？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.1"
msgid "Horns on my head. Now I look tough."
msgstr "头上长角，看着更凶了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.2"
msgid "Beefalo think I'm one of them. Weird friends."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛把我当同类，怪朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.1"
msgid "Bees can't get me now. Ha."
msgstr "蜜蜂碰不到我了，哈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.2"
msgid "Net on my face. Feels like beekeeper cosplay."
msgstr "脸上罩纱网，像养蜂人cos。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.1"
msgid "Honey inside, pain outside."
msgstr "里面有蜜，外面有痛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.2"
msgid "Poke it with the bat? ...Better not."
msgstr "用球棒捅一下？……还是算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.1"
msgid "A pot of angry bees. Surprise."
msgstr "一罐愤怒的蜜蜂，惊喜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.2"
msgid "Don't trip over it. Looking at you, Wes."
msgstr "别绊到它，说你呢，韦斯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.1"
msgid "Queen of buzz. My ears are dying."
msgstr "嗡嗡女王，我耳朵要聋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.2"
msgid "Royalty, huh. Doesn't mean you can sting me."
msgstr "女王是吧。也不能随便蛰我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.1"
msgid "Smells like honey. Can't eat it, though."
msgstr "有蜂蜜味，可惜不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.2"
msgid "Could polish my bat with it."
msgstr "能拿来擦球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.1"
msgid "Poor bear. Looks like he lost a fight."
msgstr "可怜的熊，像打架输了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.2"
msgid "Stuffing everywhere. Don't let her see me holding it."
msgstr "棉花漏一地。别让她看见在我手上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells like a campfire. Kind of cozy."
msgstr "一股篝火味，还挺暖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "He's seen things. Mostly fire."
msgstr "他见过大场面。主要是火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.1"
msgid "A handful of berries. Small, but they make me happy."
msgstr "一把浆果，不多，但吃了就开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.2"
msgid "Sour and sweet. Just how I like it."
msgstr "酸酸甜甜的，我就喜欢这个味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.1"
msgid "Juice everywhere. Totally worth it."
msgstr "汁水到处都是，但完全值得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.2"
msgid "Okay, these are my favorite."
msgstr "好吧，这个是我的最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.1"
msgid "Bare as my homework sheet. Feed it some poop."
msgstr "光秃秃的，跟我的作业本一样。喂点粪吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.2"
msgid "It's on strike until someone brings manure."
msgstr "没人送肥料，它就罢工了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "Roasted berries? Not the snack I wanted."
msgstr "烤浆果？不是我想要的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Hey, my snack's on fire!"
msgstr "喂，我的零食着火了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Can't be saved. Dig it up before it spreads."
msgstr "救不回来了，趁没传开先挖掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Worse off than me in flu season."
msgstr "比我流感季还惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Looks like it's catching something. Keep it away from the others."
msgstr "像是染上什么了。离别的远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Pale and spotty. Did it skip breakfast too?"
msgstr "又白又有斑，它也没吃早饭吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Free food. Best kind of food."
msgstr "免费的吃的，最好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Just a few. Okay, maybe a lot."
msgstr "就摘几个。好吧，可能挺多的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "Empty. Who ate them all? ...Oh, me."
msgstr "空了。谁吃光的？……哦，我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "Grow faster. I'm already hungry again."
msgstr "长快点，我又饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Dried up like a cafeteria sandwich."
msgstr "干得跟食堂的三明治一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.2"
msgid "Same, buddy. Summer's the worst."
msgstr "我懂，兄弟。夏天最烦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.1"
msgid "Even the juicy ones need feeding. Typical."
msgstr "多汁的也要喂，真麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll go find some poop."
msgstr "行吧，我去找点粪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.1"
msgid "Those were the good berries!"
msgstr "那可是好吃的那种浆果！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.2"
msgid "Sweet berries and smoke. Bad combo."
msgstr "甜浆果配烟，难吃的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Sick all over. Shame, it was the tasty kind."
msgstr "整棵都病了。可惜，还是好吃的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Out it goes. Sorry, buddy."
msgstr "只能挖掉了。抱歉啦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Hang in there. I still want your berries."
msgstr "撑住啊，我还想吃你的果子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Something's off. Its leaves look gross."
msgstr "不太对劲，叶子看着好恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wait, I'm always hungry. Picking now."
msgstr "等等，我一直都饿。现在就摘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Watch out, they spill everywhere when picked."
msgstr "小心，一摘就撒一地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left. Back to waiting."
msgstr "一个不剩，又得等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.2"
msgid "Come back tomorrow, like a cafeteria special."
msgstr "明天再来，跟食堂限定菜一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Shriveled up. Same as my motivation."
msgstr "蔫了，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.2"
msgid "It's sulking in the heat. I get it."
msgstr "热得它都闹脾气了。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.1"
msgid "Sorry, little guy. That one's on me."
msgstr "对不起啊小家伙，是我的错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.2"
msgid "Forgot again, didn't I. Really forgot."
msgstr "又忘了，是吧。真的忘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Empty cage. Kinda sad, honestly."
msgstr "空笼子，说实话挺凄凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs a bird. Someone go catch one."
msgstr "得放只鸟，谁去抓一只。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "Fine, fine. Food's coming."
msgstr "好啦好啦，饭来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "Hungry? Same. Let's both complain."
msgstr "饿了？我也是。一起抱怨吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "Lays eggs, eats, sleeps. Ideal life."
msgstr "下蛋，吃，睡。理想人生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "Hey, bird. Don't look at me like that."
msgstr "喂，鸟。别那样看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.1"
msgid "Just bones. I feel bad now."
msgstr "只剩骨头了，我有点愧疚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.2"
msgid "Should probably clean that out."
msgstr "大概该清理一下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. Lucky thing gets to nap anytime."
msgstr "嘘。能随时睡觉，真羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Sleeping in class, huh? Respect."
msgstr "上课睡觉是吧？佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.1"
msgid "It looks miserable. Where's the food?"
msgstr "看着好惨，吃的呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.2"
msgid "Hang in there, I'm getting seeds!"
msgstr "撑住，我去拿种子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.1"
msgid "Birds are dumber than they look."
msgstr "鸟比看起来还笨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.2"
msgid "Catch a bird without chasing it. Nice."
msgstr "不用追就能抓鸟，好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.1"
msgid "Tiny egg. I'd need like ten."
msgstr "小小的蛋，得要十个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.2"
msgid "Fragile. Like my patience."
msgstr "很脆弱，跟我的耐心一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.1"
msgid "Breathe out, set stuff on fire. Willow would love it."
msgstr "吹口气就着火，薇洛肯定爱死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.2"
msgid "One wrong puff and the forest's gone."
msgstr "吹错一口，整片林子就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.1"
msgid "Pew. Okay, it's more like pff."
msgstr "咻。好吧，更像是噗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.2"
msgid "Takes lung power. I'd rather swing."
msgstr "得靠肺活量，我宁愿抡棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.1"
msgid "Knockout dart. I want one for morning class."
msgstr "催眠镖，早课我也想来一发。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.2"
msgid "Don't sneeze. Seriously."
msgstr "别打喷嚏，认真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.1"
msgid "Electric dart. Zap without touching."
msgstr "带电的飞镖，不碰就能电。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.2"
msgid "Spitting lightning. Pretty cool, honestly."
msgstr "吐闪电，说实话挺酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.1"
msgid "Blue and funny-looking. I like it anyway."
msgstr "蓝蓝的，长得好怪。可我就是喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.2"
msgid "Heals you, and it's kinda tasty. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "能回血，还挺好吃的。别告诉别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Blue and out at night. Kinda creepy."
msgstr "蓝的，还晚上出来，有点瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Night owl mushroom. Same as me before a test."
msgstr "夜猫子蘑菇。跟我考试前一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "Hiding. It's waiting for night."
msgstr "躲着呢，在等天黑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "Underground. Can't blame it, I'd hide too."
msgstr "在地下。不怪它，我也想躲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "Gone. Nothing to do but wait."
msgstr "没了，只能等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "Took it already. Grow back faster."
msgstr "已经拿走了，快点再长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.1"
msgid "Planks. Smells like woodshop class."
msgstr "木板，一股木工课的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.2"
msgid "I could snap these over my knee. Shouldn't, though."
msgstr "我能用膝盖掰断，不过还是算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.1"
msgid "Keep it handy for the leaks."
msgstr "堵漏用的，随身带着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.2"
msgid "Fixing holes beats swimming home."
msgstr "补洞总比游回家强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.1"
msgid "Seaweed tape. Works on boats, apparently."
msgstr "海带胶布。听说能补船。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.2"
msgid "Smells like the ocean. Because it is."
msgstr "一股海味。因为本来就是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.1"
msgid "Seaweed bumper. Softer than my pillow."
msgstr "海带缓冲垫。比我的枕头还软。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.2"
msgid "Bumping into rocks hurts less with this."
msgstr "有了它，撞礁石就没那么疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.1"
msgid "Shells for armor. The boat's getting fancy."
msgstr "贝壳当护甲。船越来越讲究了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.2"
msgid "Tougher than kelp. Still have to place each one."
msgstr "比海带结实。还是得一个个装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.1"
msgid "A cannon. Finally, something louder than my alarm."
msgstr "大炮。终于有比我闹钟还响的东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.2"
msgid "My bat's better, but okay."
msgstr "我的球棒更好用，不过行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.1"
msgid "A boat made of grass. It's going to leak."
msgstr "草做的船。肯定会漏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Can I just swim instead? No? Fine."
msgstr "我能直接游过去吗？不行？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.1"
msgid "Seasick already, and it's still folded up."
msgstr "还没展开我就晕船了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.2"
msgid "A boat in a bundle. Somehow."
msgstr "打成一包的船。也不知道怎么做到的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "It's working. Come here, boat."
msgstr "开始工作了。船，过来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "Humming like a fridge. That means it's on."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，跟冰箱一样。说明开着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Switch it on and the boat comes to me. Like delivery."
msgstr "打开它船就会过来。跟外卖一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Carry it around and the boat tags along. Neat."
msgstr "带着它走，船就跟过来。不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.1"
msgid "The boat follows a beacon. Like a lost puppy."
msgstr "船会跟着信标走。像只迷路的小狗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.2"
msgid "Another gadget to assemble. Sigh."
msgstr "又一个要组装的玩意。唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.1"
msgid "Spins the boat. I'm gonna get dizzy."
msgstr "能让船转。我会晕的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.2"
msgid "Turning without the wheel. Lazier. I like it."
msgstr "不用舵也能转。更省事，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.1"
msgid "Ashes. Too bad. Totally upset."
msgstr "灰烬，好可惜，我很难过。真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom's gonna lecture somebody."
msgstr "薇克巴顿要训人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A bookshelf in the wild. Ugh."
msgstr "野外居然有书架，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Books everywhere. Gives me test flashbacks."
msgstr "全是书，想起考试了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.1"
msgid "A book that buzzes. No thanks."
msgstr "会嗡嗡响的书，免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.2"
msgid "Bees on paper. Stings in real life."
msgstr "纸上的蜜蜂，现实里蛰人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.1"
msgid "Reading summons birds? Weird."
msgstr "读书就能召鸟？怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.2"
msgid "Bird book. Can I eat them after?"
msgstr "鸟类书，召来以后能吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.1"
msgid "Lightning from a book? Scary."
msgstr "书里召雷？吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.2"
msgid "Read it near Wilson. Kidding."
msgstr "在威尔逊旁边念。开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.1"
msgid "A fire book. Willow's favorite, probably."
msgstr "火焰书，大概是薇洛的最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.2"
msgid "Hot reading. Don't touch the pages."
msgstr "烫手的读物，别碰书页。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.1"
msgid "Fish come to you? Sounds lazy-friendly."
msgstr "鱼自己来？很适合懒人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.2"
msgid "Fishing book. Smells like the sea already."
msgstr "钓鱼书，已经有海腥味了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.1"
msgid "Gardening by reading? Lazy. I like it."
msgstr "读书就能种地？够懒，喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.2"
msgid "Plants grow while I nap. Perfect."
msgstr "我睡觉它长菜，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "Upgraded farming book. Food faster."
msgstr "升级版种地书，吃得更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "Fancy cover, but the veggies matter more."
msgstr "封面挺高级，但菜更重要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.1"
msgid "A book that glows. Study at night? No."
msgstr "会发光的书。晚上学习？不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.2"
msgid "Nightlight in book form. Handy."
msgstr "书形小夜灯，好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "Brighter book. Harder to nap near."
msgstr "更亮的书，在旁边更难睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "Glows like a vending machine at night."
msgstr "跟晚上的自动售货机一样亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.1"
msgid "Moon control. Teacher's pet stuff."
msgstr "控制月亮，学霸的玩意儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.2"
msgid "Flip pages, flip the moon. Wild."
msgstr "翻书就能翻月亮，离谱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.1"
msgid "Summon rain? Cancel PE, maybe."
msgstr "召雨？说不定能取消体育课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.2"
msgid "Rain on command. My hair says no."
msgstr "说下就下的雨，我头发拒绝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.1"
msgid "A book about building stuff. Nerdy."
msgstr "讲做东西的书，好书呆子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.2"
msgid "Shortcut to inventions. I like shortcuts."
msgstr "发明的捷径，我喜欢捷径。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.1"
msgid "More trees, more chopping. Pass."
msgstr "树多了，砍得也多。不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.2"
msgid "Woodie will love this one."
msgstr "伍迪会爱死这本。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.1"
msgid "Finally, a book I can finish. In my dreams."
msgstr "终于有本能读完的书了，在梦里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.2"
msgid "Better than any lullaby."
msgstr "比什么摇篮曲都管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.1"
msgid "Change the weather by reading? Neat."
msgstr "读书就能改天气？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.2"
msgid "Air conditioning in a book. Finally."
msgstr "书里装了空调，终于。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.1"
msgid "Slimy stuff pops out? Gross."
msgstr "会冒出黏糊糊的东西？恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.2"
msgid "Opening this is a bad idea."
msgstr "打开这本是馊主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.1"
msgid "Spider book. Webber might like it."
msgstr "蜘蛛书，韦伯也许会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.2"
msgid "Sticky pages. Ew."
msgstr "书页黏糊糊的，咦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.1"
msgid "It always comes back. Like homework."
msgstr "它总会飞回来，跟作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.2"
msgid "Miss the catch and it hits your face. Ask me how I know."
msgstr "没接住就砸脸上，别问我怎么知道的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.1"
msgid "Catching bugs. Feels like summer break."
msgstr "抓虫子，有暑假的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.2"
msgid "Butterflies, hold still for once."
msgstr "蝴蝶，你就不能停一下吗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.1"
msgid "Gift wrap for leftovers."
msgstr "给剩饭用的礼品包装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.2"
msgid "Wrapping is tedious. Unwrapping is fun."
msgstr "包起来好麻烦，拆开倒挺好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "Giant bunny. Cute until it punches you."
msgstr "大兔子，打你之前还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "Fluffy guard. Don't stare back."
msgstr "毛茸茸的守卫，别跟它对视。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.1"
msgid "Hide in a bush. Skip class forever."
msgstr "躲进灌木，永远翘课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.2"
msgid "Nobody can find me now. Perfect nap spot."
msgstr "谁都找不到我，完美的午睡点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Flutters around with no homework. Lucky."
msgstr "到处飞，还不用写作业，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Land on my nose. I dare you."
msgstr "落我鼻子上试试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.1"
msgid "Caught it. Now what?"
msgstr "抓到了。然后呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.2"
msgid "Plant it and it becomes a flower. Weird."
msgstr "种下去就变成花，好奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "Snackable, apparently. Tastes like dusty paper."
msgstr "居然能吃。味道像落灰的纸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "Pretty. Might stick them on my bag."
msgstr "挺好看，贴书包上吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Looks like a grumpy hall monitor."
msgstr "长得像个板着脸的纪律委员。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could bat it, but my hands would pay."
msgstr "拿棒子抡它也行，就是手要遭殃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.1"
msgid "Took the good part. It kept the attitude."
msgstr "好吃的我拿走了，脾气留给它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Even bald, it still wants to fight."
msgstr "秃了还想跟我打架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.1"
msgid "Feed it before the dark comes!"
msgstr "黑暗来之前快喂点柴！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.2"
msgid "Just embers. Hurry up, somebody."
msgstr "只剩火星了，谁快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Campfire. Marshmallows would be nice."
msgstr "篝火，要是有棉花糖就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Warm. Sleepy. Don't move me."
msgstr "暖和，犯困，别挪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.1"
msgid "Whoa, my eyebrows!"
msgstr "哇，我的眉毛！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.2"
msgid "Willow, did you do this?"
msgstr "薇洛，是你干的吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.1"
msgid "Getting dim. I'm not fetching wood."
msgstr "越来越暗了，我才不去捡柴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.2"
msgid "Weak fire. Feed it before it sulks out."
msgstr "火苗没劲了，赶紧喂，别让它闹脾气灭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Cozy. Wake me if anything happens."
msgstr "舒服，有事再叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Nice fire. Perfect for roasting something."
msgstr "火正好，适合烤点东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.1"
msgid "Dead. Should've fed it."
msgstr "灭了，早该添柴的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.2"
msgid "Cold ashes. Great."
msgstr "一堆冷灰，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.1"
msgid "Old lady stick. Fast old lady, though."
msgstr "老奶奶的拐杖，不过是飞快的老奶奶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.2"
msgid "Gets me to the food faster. Approved."
msgstr "能更快走到吃的面前，批准。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.1"
msgid "Basically a big rock. I could throw it myself."
msgstr "就是一块大石头。我自己都能扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.2"
msgid "Load it, then boom. Simple."
msgstr "装进去，砰。简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.1"
msgid "The saw's toast. So are the chairs."
msgstr "锯子烧了，椅子也没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.2"
msgid "A burnt woodshop. Ironic."
msgstr "木工台被烧了，挺讽刺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Build a chair, then sit on it. Perfect plan."
msgstr "做把椅子，然后坐上去，完美计划。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Woodshop class, but nobody grades it."
msgstr "木工课，不过没人打分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.1"
msgid "Crunchy. Better than the school salad."
msgstr "脆脆的，比学校的沙拉好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.2"
msgid "Rabbit food. Fine, I'll eat it."
msgstr "兔子吃的东西。行吧，我吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.1"
msgid "It's waving at me. Come here, lunch."
msgstr "它在朝我招手。过来吧，午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.2"
msgid "Free carrot in the ground. Lucky."
msgstr "地里白捡的胡萝卜，运气不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.1"
msgid "Fire! Save the maps, forget the desk!"
msgstr "着火了！救地图，别管桌子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.2"
msgid "Somebody's homework is going up in smoke."
msgstr "谁的作业正在冒烟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.1"
msgid "Now we're all lost. Again."
msgstr "这下大家又都迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ashes don't make a good map."
msgstr "灰可画不出地图。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Map-making. Geography class strikes again."
msgstr "画地图，地理课又来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Copy my map? Fine, just don't lose it."
msgstr "抄我的地图？行，别弄丢就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.1"
msgid "Fluffy raccoon cat. Gimme."
msgstr "毛茸茸的浣熊猫，给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.2"
msgid "Napping in a hollow stump. Living the life."
msgstr "睡在树洞里，过得真滋润。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.1"
msgid "Catcoon tails on my head. Sorry, kitty."
msgstr "头上顶着浣猫尾巴，抱歉啦小猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.2"
msgid "Feels like a cat sleeping on my head."
msgstr "像有只猫睡在我头上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.1"
msgid "Banana! Finally, a proper snack."
msgstr "香蕉！总算有正经零食了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.2"
msgid "Peel and eat. Simple. Love it."
msgstr "剥了就吃，简单，喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.1"
msgid "Bananas in a cave. Who's complaining? Not me."
msgstr "洞里有香蕉，谁抱怨？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.2"
msgid "Wolfgang would climb this. I'll just shake it."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈会爬上去。我直接摇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.1"
msgid "Smells like the barbecue I didn't get to eat."
msgstr "闻着像我没吃上的烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.2"
msgid "Could draw on Wes's face with this."
msgstr "能拿这个在韦斯脸上画画。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.1"
msgid "A walking backpack. Best friend."
msgstr "会走路的书包，最好的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.2"
msgid "Your tongue's out again. Cute."
msgstr "舌头又伸出来了，可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It's staring at me. Creepy but useful."
msgstr "它盯着我看。吓人，但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A bone with an eye. Totally normal."
msgstr "长眼睛的骨头，正常得很。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.1"
msgid "Napping. Lucky bone."
msgstr "在睡觉，好命的骨头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.2"
msgid "Chester's coming back soon, right?"
msgstr "切斯特很快就回来了吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "Makes boxes hold more. Wish it worked on my stomach."
msgstr "让箱子能装更多。要是能用在我胃上就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "One snap and the chest gets bigger inside. Lazy magic."
msgstr "装上去，箱子里面就变大了。懒人魔法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.1"
msgid "Blue sparks fading. Feed it!"
msgstr "蓝火星快没了，快喂！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.2"
msgid "About to go out. Bye, cool air."
msgstr "快灭了，凉风也要没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Blue fire. Summer's best friend."
msgstr "蓝色的火，夏天最好的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Like sitting in front of the fridge."
msgstr "跟坐在冰箱前一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.1"
msgid "Brr, turn it down!"
msgstr "好冷，调小点！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.2"
msgid "Way too strong. Now I'm freezing."
msgstr "太猛了，我都要冻僵了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.1"
msgid "Getting weak. More fuel, please."
msgstr "变弱了，麻烦加点燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.2"
msgid "The chill's fading. Summer's winning."
msgstr "凉意在消失，夏天要赢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Cool and comfy. I'm not moving."
msgstr "凉快又舒服，我不走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Like an air conditioner in a heatwave."
msgstr "像热浪里的空调。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.1"
msgid "Gone. Back to sweating."
msgstr "灭了，又要流汗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.2"
msgid "Cold fire's dead. Ironically, now it's hot."
msgstr "冷火灭了，讽刺的是现在变热了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.1"
msgid "Feed it something, it's dying on me."
msgstr "快喂点东西，它快不行了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.2"
msgid "Cold fire, almost out. Even sadder than a normal one."
msgstr "冷火要灭了，比普通的还凄凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A campfire that does the opposite. Weird, but I like it."
msgstr "反着来的篝火。怪是怪，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Perfect spot for a summer nap."
msgstr "夏天午睡的好地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.1"
msgid "Blue flames this big? Feels like a freezer."
msgstr "蓝火这么旺？跟冰柜似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.2"
msgid "Okay, now I'm actually cold. Turn it down."
msgstr "好了，现在真冷了。小点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.1"
msgid "It's shrinking. Someone toss in some grass."
msgstr "火变小了。谁丢点草进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.2"
msgid "Weak. Like me before lunch."
msgstr "没劲了，跟午饭前的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Way better than a classroom with no AC."
msgstr "比没空调的教室强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Ahh. I'm not moving from here."
msgstr "啊——我不挪窝了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.1"
msgid "Dead. The heat's coming back already."
msgstr "灭了。热气又回来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.2"
msgid "Just needs fuel. I'll do it later. Maybe."
msgstr "加点燃料就行。待会再弄。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.1"
msgid "Right side of the map."
msgstr "地图的右边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.2"
msgid "The sun rises there. Way too early."
msgstr "太阳从那边升起，太早了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Needle's spinning. Same as my head."
msgstr "指针在乱转，跟我脑子一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A compass. Still doesn't point to food."
msgstr "指南针，可惜不指向吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.1"
msgid "Up. North. Whatever."
msgstr "上，北，随便吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.2"
msgid "Pointing north. Cold that way, probably."
msgstr "指着北，那边估计挺冷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.1"
msgid "Up and to the right."
msgstr "右上方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.2"
msgid "Between north and east. Thanks, compass."
msgstr "北和东中间，谢了指南针。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.1"
msgid "Up and to the left."
msgstr "左上方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.2"
msgid "Halfway between north and west."
msgstr "北和西的中间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.1"
msgid "Downward. South, I mean."
msgstr "往下，我是说南边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.2"
msgid "The warm way, maybe."
msgstr "暖和的那边，也许。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.1"
msgid "Down and to the right."
msgstr "右下方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.2"
msgid "Kind of south, kind of east."
msgstr "有点南，有点东。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.1"
msgid "Down and to the left."
msgstr "左下方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.2"
msgid "Sunset side, roughly."
msgstr "大概是日落那一侧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.1"
msgid "Where the sun goes to sleep. Lucky."
msgstr "太阳去睡觉的方向，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.2"
msgid "Left on the map. I know that much."
msgstr "地图上的左边，这个我还是知道的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.1"
msgid "Perfect mix. Don't touch it."
msgstr "比例刚好，别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.2"
msgid "Even the rot is more balanced than my grades."
msgstr "连烂菜都比我成绩稳定。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burned trash. Still trash."
msgstr "烧过的垃圾，还是垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.2"
msgid "Who sets compost on fire? Weirdo."
msgstr "谁会把堆肥点了？怪人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.1"
msgid "Dusty in there. Toss in some veggie scraps."
msgstr "里面干巴巴的，扔点菜叶进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.2"
msgid "Needs something mushy. Leftovers, maybe."
msgstr "得加点软烂的，剩饭什么的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A box of garbage I'm supposed to take care of."
msgstr "一箱我还得照顾的垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Plants eat this? Glad I'm not a plant."
msgstr "植物吃这个？还好我不是植物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.1"
msgid "Soggy. Throw some twigs in."
msgstr "湿哒哒的，丢点树枝进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.2"
msgid "Like a lunchbox left out in the rain."
msgstr "像淋了雨的便当盒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.1"
msgid "Poop in a wrapper. Gift of the year."
msgstr "包装好的粪，年度最佳礼物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.2"
msgid "Smells like the school garden. Worse, actually."
msgstr "闻着像学校花圃，不，更糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.1"
msgid "Pictures of food. Torture."
msgstr "满是食物的图片，折磨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.2"
msgid "Reading recipes beats reading textbooks."
msgstr "看菜谱比看课本强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.1"
msgid "A spiky shell on my head. Very punk."
msgstr "头顶带刺的壳，很朋克。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.2"
msgid "Hit me and you get poked. Fair trade."
msgstr "打我就会被扎，很公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "No pot, no stew. I'm devastated."
msgstr "没锅就没炖菜，我崩溃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burned black. My dinner plans too."
msgstr "烧黑了，我的晚饭计划也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "Ugh. I'll starve before this is done."
msgstr "唉，等它好我都饿死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "Staring at it won't help, huh."
msgstr "光盯着也没用，是吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "Smells good. Hurry up, hurry up."
msgstr "好香，快点快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Bowl ready. Chopsticks ready."
msgstr "碗准备好了，筷子也准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.1"
msgid "Food! Out of my way."
msgstr "开饭！让开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.2"
msgid "Finally. I'm eating first, no complaints."
msgstr "终于好了。我先吃，不许有意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Empty pot. Empty stomach. Coincidence?"
msgstr "空锅，空肚子，巧合吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Someone toss in ingredients. I'll supervise."
msgstr "谁放点食材进去，我负责监督。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Black like a delinquent's jacket."
msgstr "黑得跟不良少年的外套一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Caw all you want. I'm still not getting up early."
msgstr "随便叫，我还是不早起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.1"
msgid "Caught you. Now be quiet."
msgstr "抓到了，安静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.2"
msgid "Into the birdcage, birdy."
msgstr "进笼子吧，小鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.1"
msgid "Itchy. Don't stuff it in my skirt pocket."
msgstr "扎人。别往我裙子口袋里塞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.2"
msgid "Grass. Ropes, torches, whatever."
msgstr "草。做绳子、火把，随便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.1"
msgid "Square rocks. A neat freak's dream."
msgstr "方方正正的石头，强迫症的最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.2"
msgid "Good for building. Or a pillow, if I'm desperate."
msgstr "盖房正好，实在没办法也能当枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Autumn leaves, on fire. Not as pretty."
msgstr "秋叶着火了，可没那么好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Fire! Somebody stop it spreading."
msgstr "着火了！谁拦一下别让它蔓延。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "No more leaves. No more anything."
msgstr "叶子没了，什么都没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Blackened birch. Sad."
msgstr "烧黑的桦树，真惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Bye bye, birchnuts."
msgstr "再见了，桦木果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Stump's done. My arms are next."
msgstr "树桩是完了，接下来是我的胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Birchnuts up there. Snack tree."
msgstr "上面有桦木果，零食树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Falling leaves. Reminds me of cleaning duty."
msgstr "叶子一直掉，让我想起值日。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.1"
msgid "A tree with a face? And it's angry?"
msgstr "长了脸的树？还在生气？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.2"
msgid "Whoa, roots coming at me. Chill."
msgstr "哇，树根冲过来了，冷静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "One eye and zero chill."
msgstr "就一只眼，脾气还暴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "Swinging for the eye. Hold still."
msgstr "瞄准眼睛挥棒。别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.1"
msgid "Sandstorm, do your worst."
msgstr "沙尘暴，尽管来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.2"
msgid "Now I can actually see in the storm."
msgstr "这下沙尘暴里也看得见了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.1"
msgid "Building land on the ocean. Ambitious."
msgstr "在海上造陆地。真有野心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.2"
msgid "Lay it down plank by plank. So many planks."
msgstr "一块块铺。木板好多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.1"
msgid "Posts make the dock look finished. That's it."
msgstr "装上柱子码头才像样。就这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Dock decorations. Wurt might perch on these."
msgstr "码头的装饰。沃特说不定会蹲在上面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "A giant bug on fire. My worst nightmare."
msgstr "着火的大虫子，我最怕的噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "Lounging in lava. Never cold, I bet."
msgstr "躺在岩浆里，肯定从来不冷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Made from a giant fly's scales. Still holds my snacks."
msgstr "用大苍蝇的鳞片做的。照样装零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Willow can't burn this one either. Good."
msgstr "薇洛也烧不了这个。很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "Fireproof and roomy. It's better at life than me."
msgstr "防火还能装。比我会过日子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "One chest for everything. I'm done building."
msgstr "一个箱子装下所有。我不造了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A dragon's belly turned into a heater. Fair enough."
msgstr "龙的肚子做成暖炉，也行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Can I toast bread on this?"
msgstr "能在上面烤面包吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.1"
msgid "Who smashed it? Not me. Probably."
msgstr "谁砸的？不是我。应该吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.2"
msgid "Broken and still warm. Stubborn thing."
msgstr "坏了还热乎，挺倔的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.1"
msgid "My face is melting. I'm out."
msgstr "脸要化了，我撤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.2"
msgid "This is a sauna, not a heater."
msgstr "这是桑拿，不是暖炉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Cozy. Wake me in spring."
msgstr "舒服，春天再叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Best seat in camp. Mine now."
msgstr "营地最好的位子，归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.1"
msgid "Looks like a villain's helmet. Kinda cool."
msgstr "像反派的头盔，有点酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.2"
msgid "Nobody's going to bother me in this."
msgstr "戴这个没人敢来烦我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.1"
msgid "A drumstick! Best part of the bird."
msgstr "鸡腿！鸟身上最好的部分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.2"
msgid "Fried would be better. Can't have everything."
msgstr "炸的更好，没法什么都有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.1"
msgid "Lightweight. Could toss it like a ball."
msgstr "好轻，能当球扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.2"
msgid "My bat's heavier than this."
msgstr "我的球棒都比这重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.1"
msgid "Freezes stuff when you hit it."
msgstr "砸中东西会冻住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.2"
msgid "Ice pack for workouts."
msgstr "健身用冰袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.1"
msgid "Shiny and heavy. Annoying combo."
msgstr "又亮又重，烦人的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.2"
msgid "Wolfgang lifts this for fun? Seriously?"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈举这个当玩？真的假的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.1"
msgid "Golden dumbbell. Rich muscle guy."
msgstr "黄金哑铃，有钱的肌肉男。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.2"
msgid "Could've been a hundred lunches."
msgstr "本来能换一百顿午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.1"
msgid "A hot rock on a stick. Toasty workout."
msgstr "棍子上插块热石头，暖和的锻炼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.2"
msgid "Hand warmer and dumbbell. Efficient."
msgstr "暖手宝加哑铃，效率高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.1"
msgid "Heavy. Fine, I'll lift it anyway."
msgstr "好重。行吧，还是举得动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.2"
msgid "Stone weights. So old-school."
msgstr "石头哑铃，好复古。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.1"
msgid "Swing it and things catch fire. Cool."
msgstr "抡一下东西就着火，酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.2"
msgid "Hot hot hot. Put it down."
msgstr "烫烫烫，放下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.1"
msgid "Fluffy rabbit ears. Okay, fine."
msgstr "毛茸茸的兔子耳罩，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.2"
msgid "Perfect for ignoring lectures."
msgstr "无视唠叨的绝佳装备。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "A lunchbox for ghost medicine."
msgstr "装幽灵药的便当盒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "Neatly packed. Wendy's tidier than me."
msgstr "收得整整齐齐，温蒂比我爱干净。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Tea time's cancelled."
msgstr "下午茶取消了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Fancy furniture, now just charcoal."
msgstr "花哨的家具，现在只剩炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "A table with nothing on it. Like my lunchbox."
msgstr "空空的桌子。跟我的饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Put some flowers on it, I guess."
msgstr "放点花上去吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.1"
msgid "Glowing nicely. Good for reading manga."
msgstr "亮得刚好。适合看漫画。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.2"
msgid "Fresh light. Cozy enough to doze off."
msgstr "光很新鲜。舒服得想打盹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Flowers on a table. Pretty fancy for the wilderness."
msgstr "桌上放花。在野外算很讲究了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom would put her tea here."
msgstr "薇克巴顿会在这里放茶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "It's flickering. Kinda like me in first period."
msgstr "一闪一闪的。跟第一节课的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "Getting dim. Find another glowy thing."
msgstr "越来越暗。再找个发光的东西吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.1"
msgid "Droopy flowers. Same energy as me on Monday."
msgstr "花蔫了。跟周一的我一个状态。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.2"
msgid "Dead flowers don't count as decorations."
msgstr "枯花可不算装饰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.1"
msgid "Big tree, big fire. Back off."
msgstr "大树大火，退后。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.2"
msgid "Free bonfire. Shame about the wood."
msgstr "免费篝火，可惜木头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy tree. Not edible."
msgstr "烤脆的树，不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.2"
msgid "Charcoal on a stick."
msgstr "插在地上的木炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Stump. Good place to sit, at least."
msgstr "树桩，至少能坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Plant a pinecone and wait, I guess."
msgstr "种个松果等着吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A pine tree. Smells like air freshener."
msgstr "松树，闻起来像空气清新剂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Could I punch this down? Better use an axe."
msgstr "我能一拳打倒它吗？还是用斧头吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Skinny tree, quick fire."
msgstr "瘦树，烧得快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Even the lonely pines aren't safe."
msgstr "连孤零零的松树都不安全。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp. Like my cooking."
msgstr "烧成炭了，跟我做的饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Nothing left but a black stick."
msgstr "只剩一根黑棍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Stump. No pinecone to replant either."
msgstr "树桩，也没松果能补种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Done here. Arms are sore."
msgstr "这里完事了，胳膊酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A lumpy tree. Kinda ugly, kinda cute."
msgstr "疙疙瘩瘩的树，有点丑，有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Logs only. No bonus prizes."
msgstr "只有木头，没有附赠品。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.1"
msgid "An eyeball staring at the sky for me. Thanks, I guess."
msgstr "一颗眼球替我盯着天空。算是谢了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.2"
msgid "Rain or sun, it's got me covered. Just stop blinking."
msgstr "下雨出太阳都能挡。就是别再眨眼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.1"
msgid "Gardening club stuff. I never joined."
msgstr "园艺社的东西，我可没入社。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.2"
msgid "One swing, one hole. Easy enough."
msgstr "挥一下一个坑，挺简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.1"
msgid "It does the plowing for me? Best tool ever."
msgstr "替我耕地？最强工具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.2"
msgid "Drop it, let it rattle around. I'll nap."
msgstr "放下让它自己哐哐干活，我睡会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.1"
msgid "Big feathery fan. Someone fan me, please."
msgstr "大羽毛扇，谁来给我扇扇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.2"
msgid "Whoosh. Heatwave canceled."
msgstr "呼——热浪取消了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.1"
msgid "Birds come flocking. I don't have seeds, go away."
msgstr "鸟都飞过来了，我没种子，走开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.2"
msgid "Looks like a carnival costume."
msgstr "像嘉年华的戏服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.1"
msgid "Writing with a feather. So old-school."
msgstr "用羽毛写字，好复古。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.2"
msgid "Good for signs. Bad for my handwriting."
msgstr "写路牌还行，我的字就没救了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.1"
msgid "Zaps whatever touches it. So don't."
msgstr "碰到就会电人。所以别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.2"
msgid "Needs power to work. Like me and snacks."
msgstr "得通电才能用。跟我需要零食一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.1"
msgid "A door for the fence, so the beefalo can't just stroll out."
msgstr "栅栏的门。免得牛自己溜出去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Gotta remember to close it, too."
msgstr "还得记得关上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Wooden fence. Keeps the critters in, mostly."
msgstr "木栅栏。能把小动物关住，大部分吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Placing these one by one is so tedious."
msgstr "一根根摆，好麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.1"
msgid "Looks like a sword. Louis might want it."
msgstr "看着像把剑。路易斯可能会想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.2"
msgid "Whack a fence and it turns. My kind of tool."
msgstr "打一下栅栏就会转。这才是我喜欢的工具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.1"
msgid "A bucket of poop. Living the dream."
msgstr "一桶粪，人生巅峰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.2"
msgid "Plants like this? Their taste is awful."
msgstr "植物喜欢这个？口味太差了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Little floating lights. Kinda pretty."
msgstr "飘着的小灯，还挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Catch them for a lantern? Too much effort."
msgstr "抓来做灯？太费劲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.1"
msgid "A night-light in my pocket. Handy."
msgstr "口袋里的小夜灯，方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.2"
msgid "Don't escape. I need you for the dark."
msgstr "别跑，天黑还得靠你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.1"
msgid "Hot dog. Not the tasty kind."
msgstr "热狗。不是能吃的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.2"
msgid "Even dying, it sets stuff on fire."
msgstr "死了还要放火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.1"
msgid "Barely glowing. Logs, now!"
msgstr "就剩一点亮，快拿木头！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.2"
msgid "Don't you die on me."
msgstr "别在我面前灭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A real fire pit. Fancier than a campfire."
msgstr "正经的火坑，比篝火讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stone ring, safe fire. Even Willow can't ruin it."
msgstr "围着石头，火很安全，连薇洛都弄不坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.1"
msgid "Roaring! Back up a bit."
msgstr "烧得好旺！往后退点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.2"
msgid "Hot, hot, hot. My skirt's gonna catch."
msgstr "好烫好烫，裙子要着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.1"
msgid "Getting weak. Like me after running laps."
msgstr "火变弱了，跟我跑完圈一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.2"
msgid "Who's on fire duty? Not me."
msgstr "谁值班管火？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Perfect. I could sleep right here."
msgstr "完美，我能直接睡这儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Nice and steady. Good fire."
msgstr "又稳又旺，好火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.1"
msgid "Out. Somebody light it before dark."
msgstr "灭了，天黑前谁去点上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.2"
msgid "Empty pit. Cold and sad."
msgstr "空火坑，又冷又惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.1"
msgid "Point, burn. No effort at all."
msgstr "一指就烧，毫不费力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.2"
msgid "Lights campfires from far away. Lazy and efficient."
msgstr "远远就能点篝火，又懒又高效。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.1"
msgid "It's getting hungry. I know the feeling."
msgstr "它饿了。我懂这种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.2"
msgid "Feed it before it quits on us."
msgstr "趁它罢工前喂一喂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.1"
msgid "Sleeping on the job. I respect it, but no."
msgstr "上班睡觉。我理解，但不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.2"
msgid "Flip the switch. It won't wake up by itself."
msgstr "开一下开关。它自己不会醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.1"
msgid "Throws snowballs at fires. Wish it did my homework too."
msgstr "看到火就扔雪球。要是还能帮我写作业就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.2"
msgid "Go ahead, Willow. Try something."
msgstr "来吧，薇洛。试试看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.1"
msgid "Sit, wait, maybe nap. My kind of sport."
msgstr "坐着等，顺便睡觉。我喜欢的运动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.2"
msgid "If nothing bites, I'm going home to eat."
msgstr "要是没东西上钩，我就回去吃饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.1"
msgid "Like a crowded train at rush hour."
msgstr "跟早高峰的电车一样挤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.2"
msgid "They're still alive in there. Fresh lunch later."
msgstr "它们在里面还活着。等会儿就是新鲜午餐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.1"
msgid "Pointy rock. A teacher would confiscate this."
msgstr "尖石头。老师看见肯定没收。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.2"
msgid "Good for an axe. Or for throwing."
msgstr "能做斧子。或者拿来扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.1"
msgid "Doubles as a pillow. Very important."
msgstr "还能当枕头。这很重要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.2"
msgid "I'd rather nap on it than sink."
msgstr "比起沉下去，我更想在上面睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells nice. Makes me sleepy."
msgstr "好香，闻着想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Picking flowers isn't really my thing. ...Okay, just one."
msgstr "摘花不太像我。……好吧，就一朵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.1"
msgid "A rose. Who's trying to confess to me?"
msgstr "玫瑰？谁想跟我告白？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.2"
msgid "Fancy. Wendy might want this."
msgstr "挺讲究的。温蒂可能会要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "Flower crown. Not my style. Okay, it's cute."
msgstr "花环，不是我的风格。好吧，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "Smells nice. Calms me down a bit."
msgstr "闻着挺香，让人平静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.1"
msgid "Glowing bulbs. Cave streetlamps."
msgstr "发光的球，洞里的路灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.2"
msgid "Pick it and it's dark again. Ugh."
msgstr "摘了又黑了，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.1"
msgid "Made from a pig. Smells like it too."
msgstr "用猪皮做的，闻着也像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.2"
msgid "Head protection. Great for headbutts."
msgstr "护头的，用来撞人正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.1"
msgid "Croaked. Literally."
msgstr "这下彻底不呱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.2"
msgid "Frog legs for dinner? Maybe."
msgstr "晚饭吃田鸡腿？说不定。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Croaking all day. Give it a rest."
msgstr "整天呱呱叫，歇会吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Slimy little thief. Hands off my bag."
msgstr "黏糊糊的小偷，别碰我的包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet for once. Nice."
msgstr "难得安静，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Napping. Shh, don't wake the noisy one."
msgstr "在睡觉。嘘，别吵醒这个吵闹的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "Flowers on your head. Very spooky-cute."
msgstr "头上顶花，又阴森又可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "Do the flowers need watering? Ugh."
msgstr "这花还得浇水吗？烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Ghost energy drink. Strong stuff."
msgstr "幽灵能量饮料，劲儿大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.2"
msgid "She'll hit like me after this."
msgstr "喝完她就跟我一样能打了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.1"
msgid "Quick fix for ghosts. Lucky."
msgstr "幽灵的速效药，真好命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.2"
msgid "Wish I had one for being sleepy."
msgstr "要是有治困的就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Glows like a nightlight. Kinda cute."
msgstr "跟小夜灯一样亮，还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.2"
msgid "Moon juice for ghosts. Okay then."
msgstr "给幽灵喝的月亮汁，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.1"
msgid "Punch her, get punched. Fair."
msgstr "揍她就被揍回来，公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.2"
msgid "She bites back. I respect that."
msgstr "她会还手，我欣赏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.1"
msgid "Save it for later. Don't drink it, Wendy."
msgstr "留着以后用。温蒂，别喝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.2"
msgid "A welcome-back drink for her."
msgstr "给她准备的欢迎回来饮料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Dark and gloopy. Smells like a nightmare."
msgstr "又黑又稠，一股噩梦味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Even the bottle looks moody."
msgstr "连瓶子都一脸郁闷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.1"
msgid "A ghost bodyguard in a bottle."
msgstr "装在瓶子里的幽灵保镖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.2"
msgid "Like a shield, but for the dead."
msgstr "跟盾一样，就是给死人用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.1"
msgid "Healing at my homework speed."
msgstr "回血速度跟我写作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.2"
msgid "Steady and lazy. My kind of medicine."
msgstr "慢悠悠的，我喜欢这种药。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.1"
msgid "Zoom zoom, ghost girl."
msgstr "嗖嗖的，幽灵妹妹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.2"
msgid "Faster than me running late to class."
msgstr "比我上学迟到时跑得还快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fuzzy, buzzy, and slimy. Weird combo."
msgstr "毛茸茸、嗡嗡响、还黏糊糊，奇怪的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stop following me. ...Okay, you can stay."
msgstr "别跟着我了。……好吧，你留下吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Snoring softly. I could nap right next to it."
msgstr "轻轻打呼，我能挨着它一起睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Shh. Glommer's out cold."
msgstr "嘘，格罗姆睡死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.1"
msgid "Wilted. Something happened to Glommer."
msgstr "蔫了。格罗姆出事了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.2"
msgid "No sparkle left. That's sad."
msgstr "一点光都没了，好难过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Glommer's favorite. Carry it and it follows."
msgstr "格罗姆最喜欢的。带着它，它就跟着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pretty enough for a hairpin."
msgstr "漂亮得能当发卡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "Pure fashion. I'll take it."
msgstr "纯粹为了好看，我收下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "Like swim goggles, but cooler."
msgstr "像泳镜，但更酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.1"
msgid "Fancy axe. Trees won't know the difference."
msgstr "高级斧头，树又分不出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.2"
msgid "Shiny and lasts longer, so I chop more. Hmm."
msgstr "闪亮亮的，更耐用，意味着我要砍更多。嗯……"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.1"
msgid "Gold to break rocks. Rich people stuff."
msgstr "用金子敲石头，有钱人的玩法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.2"
msgid "Shiny and sturdy. I could flatten a mountain."
msgstr "又亮又结实，我能敲平一座山。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.1"
msgid "Golden pitchfork. The ground's getting spoiled."
msgstr "金叉子，地皮都被宠坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.2"
msgid "Shiny fork. I still can't eat with it."
msgstr "亮闪闪的叉子，可还是不能吃饭用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.1"
msgid "Fancy shovel. Dirt doesn't care."
msgstr "高级铲子，泥土才不在乎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.2"
msgid "Gold digging, literally."
msgstr "真·拿金子挖土。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.1"
msgid "Gold, for digging dirt. Rich people are weird."
msgstr "金的，拿来刨土。有钱人真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.2"
msgid "At least it won't break so fast."
msgstr "至少不那么容易坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.1"
msgid "Gold. Still not as nice as a melon bun."
msgstr "金子。还是没有菠萝包香。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.2"
msgid "Wilson gets excited over this stuff. Weird."
msgstr "威尔逊见了这个就兴奋，奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.1"
msgid "Out of juice. Fertilizer time."
msgstr "没劲了，该上肥了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.2"
msgid "This grass gave up. Can't blame it."
msgstr "这草放弃了，不能怪它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.1"
msgid "Whoosh. There goes the grass."
msgstr "呼的一下，草没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.2"
msgid "Fire! Bye, future rope."
msgstr "着火了！再见，未来的绳子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Rotten grass. Dig it up before it spreads."
msgstr "烂掉的草，趁没传开挖掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Gross. Don't touch it."
msgstr "恶心，别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Looks a bit sickly."
msgstr "看起来病恹恹的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Hmm, that's not a healthy green."
msgstr "嗯，这绿色不太健康。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grass. Soft enough for a nap."
msgstr "草，软得能睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Ropes, torches, everything starts here."
msgstr "绳子、火把，什么都得从这开始。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.1"
msgid "Bald. Give it some time."
msgstr "秃了，给它点时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Nothing left. Come back later."
msgstr "什么都没了，晚点再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Fried by the sun. Same, grass."
msgstr "被太阳晒干了。我也是，草。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.2"
msgid "Crunchy and brown. Summer's the worst."
msgstr "又脆又黄，夏天最烦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "Flowery. Not my style, but whatever."
msgstr "花里胡哨的，不是我的风格，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "Pretty parasol. Pretty useless in a storm."
msgstr "好看的花伞，暴雨里好看没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Empty jar. Don't put snacks in it."
msgstr "空罐子。别往里塞零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Waiting for a tenant."
msgstr "在等住户。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.1"
msgid "Someone's in there. I'll knock softly."
msgstr "里面有人，我轻点敲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.2"
msgid "Rest well. I won't shake it."
msgstr "好好休息，我不摇你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.1"
msgid "Green and wobbly. My brain says no."
msgstr "绿绿的还晃悠，我的脑子说不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.2"
msgid "Eat it and the world gets weird. Weirder."
msgstr "吃了世界就变怪。更怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Green and slimy-looking. Totally not suspicious."
msgstr "绿得黏糊糊的，一点也不可疑呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Picks the evening shift. Good work-life balance."
msgstr "专挑傍晚上班，作息挺健康。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "Wait till dusk. Or just go home."
msgstr "等傍晚吧。或者干脆回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "Still hiding. Same as me in PE class."
msgstr "还躲着，跟我上体育课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "Picked clean. Nothing left to see."
msgstr "采光了，没什么好看的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "Empty spot. Moving on."
msgstr "空了，走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.1"
msgid "Boom in a pouch. Handle with care. Or don't."
msgstr "装在袋里的爆炸，小心拿。或者别拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.2"
msgid "One spark and goodbye, eyebrows."
msgstr "一点火星，眉毛就拜拜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.1"
msgid "Smells good. Don't eat the weapon."
msgstr "好香，别吃武器。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.2"
msgid "It'll spoil. My metal one never does."
msgstr "它会坏的，我的金属棒永远不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.1"
msgid "Smashing stuff is the best part of my day."
msgstr "砸东西是我一天里最爽的事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.2"
msgid "Hand me this and nothing's safe."
msgstr "把这个给我，什么都不安全了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.1"
msgid "Floral shirt. Very vacation."
msgstr "花衬衫，度假感满满。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.2"
msgid "Looks like an uncle at the beach. I love it."
msgstr "像海边的大叔，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.1"
msgid "Slap it on and stop whining."
msgstr "抹上就别哼哼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.2"
msgid "Smells like the nurse's office."
msgstr "一股医务室的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID.1"
msgid "Sticky goop for acid rain. Gross but useful."
msgstr "防酸雨的黏糊糊，恶心但有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_ACID.2"
msgid "Rub it on before the sky starts burning."
msgstr "天上下酸雨之前先抹上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.1"
msgid "Cool rock. Like a chilled juice can."
msgstr "冰凉的石头，像冰镇果汁罐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.2"
msgid "Pressing it on my forehead. Bliss."
msgstr "贴在额头上，爽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.1"
msgid "Ow, ow. Frostbite rock."
msgstr "疼疼疼，冻伤石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.2"
msgid "Colder than the teacher's glare."
msgstr "比老师的眼神还冷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A rock that holds heat. Smarter than most rocks."
msgstr "能存温度的石头，比大多数石头聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Room temperature. Boring."
msgstr "常温的，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.1"
msgid "Hot hot hot. Pocket heater ready."
msgstr "烫烫烫，暖宝宝准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.2"
msgid "Like a roasted sweet potato. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "像刚烤好的红薯，饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.1"
msgid "Toasty. I could nap hugging this."
msgstr "暖暖的，抱着能睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.2"
msgid "Better than a convenience store hand warmer."
msgstr "比便利店的暖宝宝还好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.1"
msgid "Sticky fingers, happy me."
msgstr "手指黏黏的，我很开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.2"
msgid "Barely ever spoils. Like my laziness."
msgstr "放多久都不怎么坏。跟我的懒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.1"
msgid "Bad dog. Very bad dog."
msgstr "坏狗，非常坏的狗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.2"
msgid "Sit! ...No? Bat, then."
msgstr "坐下！……不听？那就球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.1"
msgid "Souvenir from a bad dog."
msgstr "坏狗留下的纪念品。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.2"
msgid "Could make a necklace. Too edgy?"
msgstr "能做条项链，会不会太中二？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.1"
msgid "Chew on it when it's hot out."
msgstr "天热的时候嚼一嚼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.2"
msgid "Melting already. Hurry up."
msgstr "已经在化了，快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.1"
msgid "Midnight snack station. Don't judge."
msgstr "半夜加餐站。别这么看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.2"
msgid "Cold inside. I'd crawl in during summer."
msgstr "里面凉快。夏天我都想钻进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.1"
msgid "Ice on my head. Brain freeze, hat edition."
msgstr "头顶冰块，帽子版脑冻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.2"
msgid "Cold and dripping. Like a melting popsicle."
msgstr "又冷又滴水，像化掉的冰棍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.1"
msgid "Cold dog. My bat's gonna freeze."
msgstr "冰狗，球棒都要冻住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.2"
msgid "Frosty breath. Like a fridge that bites."
msgstr "呼的都是冷气，像会咬人的冰箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.1"
msgid "A cooler bag. Snacks stay fresh."
msgstr "保温袋，零食保鲜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.2"
msgid "Cold back. Nice in summer."
msgstr "后背凉凉的，夏天正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.1"
msgid "Freeze them, then bonk. Simple plan."
msgstr "先冻住，再敲。简单的计划。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.2"
msgid "Brr. Great for summer, bad for fingers."
msgstr "嘶，夏天好用，就是冻手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Glasses that see through junk. Good for finding snacks."
msgstr "能看穿破烂的眼镜，找零食正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looking through these makes my eyes tired."
msgstr "戴着看久了眼睛好累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.1"
msgid "One sip and lunch comes right back up."
msgstr "喝一口，午饭全吐出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.2"
msgid "Wasting food is a crime. This does it on purpose."
msgstr "浪费粮食是犯罪，这玩意儿是故意的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.1"
msgid "Seaweed on my head. Smells like low tide."
msgstr "头上顶海带，一股退潮味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.2"
msgid "Keeps my head calm. And damp."
msgstr "让脑袋冷静，也潮乎乎的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Red stripes. An angry delinquent bee."
msgstr "红条纹，暴躁的不良蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bat's ready. Bring it."
msgstr "球棒准备好了，来啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.1"
msgid "Holding an angry bee. Why did I do this."
msgstr "抓着一只暴躁的蜂。我干嘛要这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.2"
msgid "It's glaring at me. Don't."
msgstr "它在瞪我。别这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.1"
msgid "Chains and a bad attitude. Delinquent?"
msgstr "铁链加臭脾气，也是不良吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.2"
msgid "So you're the one hoarding loot."
msgstr "原来是你在囤宝贝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.1"
msgid "Big nose, big meat."
msgstr "大鼻子，大块肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.2"
msgid "Running away again? I'm too tired for this."
msgstr "又跑？我累得不想追了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.1"
msgid "Fluffy trunk thing. I wanna hug it."
msgstr "毛茸茸的长鼻子，好想抱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.2"
msgid "Winter coat, winter dinner."
msgstr "冬天的外套，冬天的晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.1"
msgid "Naughty list? Me? ...Fair."
msgstr "坏孩子名单？我？……也对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.2"
msgid "Drop that sack, thief."
msgstr "把袋子放下，小偷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.1"
msgid "It doesn't burn down in my hand. Nice."
msgstr "不会在手里烧完，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.2"
msgid "Swap in some light bulbs and it's good as new."
msgstr "换点荧光果进去就跟新的一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.1"
msgid "Chopped too many, huh. My bad."
msgstr "砍太多了是吧。我的错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.2"
msgid "Woodie, your fan club's here."
msgstr "伍迪，你的粉丝团来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.1"
msgid "Mini Treeguard. Less scary this size."
msgstr "小号树精，这个尺寸不吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.2"
msgid "Woodie's arts and crafts. Not bad."
msgstr "伍迪的手工课作品，还不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.1"
msgid "Moss on a rock. Desperate times."
msgstr "石头上的苔，真是饿急了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.2"
msgid "Eat it quickly before I taste it."
msgstr "趁没尝出味快吞下去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.1"
msgid "A giant needle. I'm not scared. Totally not."
msgstr "好大的针，我才不怕，真的不怕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.2"
msgid "Raises max health. I still hate shots."
msgstr "能加血量上限，但我还是讨厌打针。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.1"
msgid "Glowing fruit. Can I eat it? Yes."
msgstr "会发光的果子。能吃吗？能。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.2"
msgid "A light snack. Literally."
msgstr "名副其实的“亮眼”零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.1"
msgid "Pretty sure she sleeps with it."
msgstr "我怀疑她睡觉都攥着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.2"
msgid "Can it toast marshmallows? Asking for me."
msgstr "能烤棉花糖吗？替我自己问的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.1"
msgid "It's glowing. Kinda like a nightlight."
msgstr "在发光。有点像小夜灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.2"
msgid "Ate a whole lightning bolt and it's fine. Respect."
msgstr "吞了整道雷还没事。佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Taller than me, so it gets hit first."
msgstr "比我高，所以先挨劈的是它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Lightning, go over there. Not me."
msgstr "雷，去那边。别找我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.1"
msgid "It's making a face at me."
msgstr "它在冲我做鬼脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.2"
msgid "A log with feelings. Burning it feels mean."
msgstr "有感情的木头，烧了好像有点过分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.1"
msgid "Smells like a barbecue. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "闻起来像烧烤。我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.2"
msgid "Willow, was this you?"
msgstr "薇洛，是你干的吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Logs again. My arms are tired."
msgstr "又是木头，手都酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Good enough for a fire. Done for today."
msgstr "够生个火了。今天收工。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.1"
msgid "A chest in the shadows. Bet my lost socks are in there."
msgstr "暗影里的箱子，我丢的袜子估计都在里面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.2"
msgid "Convenient, sure. Creepy, also sure."
msgstr "方便是方便，瘆人也是真瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.1"
msgid "Bird feathers turned into cloth. Home ec, but harder."
msgstr "鸟毛织成布，家政课加强版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.2"
msgid "So soft. Feels wasted on a boat."
msgstr "软软的，用在船上太可惜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.1"
msgid "Eat it and you fall asleep. Sounds great, actually."
msgstr "吃了就会睡着。听起来挺好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.2"
msgid "Don't scream. Please don't scream."
msgstr "别叫。拜托别叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.1"
msgid "Fancy rock. Would make a nice suit of armor."
msgstr "高级石头，能做套盔甲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.2"
msgid "Smooth and cold. Like the school hallway floor."
msgstr "又滑又凉，像学校走廊的地板。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.1"
msgid "A bean that grows rocks. Science gave up."
msgstr "能长出石头的豆子，科学放弃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.2"
msgid "Not edible. I checked. Kind of."
msgstr "不能吃，我试过。差不多吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "A torch nobody can hold."
msgstr "一根谁都拿不住的火把。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Good. One less thing poking me."
msgstr "挺好，少一个扎我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Charcoal with a bad attitude."
msgstr "脾气很差的木炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even dead it won't let me sit on it."
msgstr "死了都不让我坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Just a stump. Still glaring at me."
msgstr "只剩个树桩，还在瞪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Won that one. My arms are tired though."
msgstr "赢了。手臂有点酸就是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tree that skipped the nice-guy phase."
msgstr "一棵直接跳过温柔期的树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Who plants a hedgehog in a swamp?"
msgstr "谁在沼泽里种了只刺猬啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.1"
msgid "A lamp for the mast. Night sailing, ugh."
msgstr "装在桅杆上的灯。夜里还要开船，唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.2"
msgid "Light up the boat so we don't hit rocks."
msgstr "照亮船，免得撞上礁石。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.1"
msgid "Lightning at sea is way worse. Trust me."
msgstr "海上打雷更可怕。相信我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.2"
msgid "Stick it on the mast and hope."
msgstr "插在桅杆上，然后祈祷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM.1"
msgid "Let the wind do the work."
msgstr "让风去干活吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM.2"
msgid "A sail means less rowing. Sold."
msgstr "有帆就不用多划。成交。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM.1"
msgid "Made from that big bird's feathers. Sorry, bird."
msgstr "用那只大鸟的羽毛做的。抱歉了，鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS_ITEM.2"
msgid "A faster sail means an earlier lunch break."
msgstr "帆越快，午饭就越早。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.1"
msgid "Real meat! Finally, a real meal."
msgstr "真的肉！总算有正经饭吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.2"
msgid "Grill it and give me the biggest piece."
msgstr "烤了吧，最大块给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.1"
msgid "Smoked a little too hard."
msgstr "熏得有点过头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.2"
msgid "No jerky for me. This is a tragedy."
msgstr "我的肉干没了，这是悲剧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.1"
msgid "Jerky! Best snack in the world."
msgstr "肉干！世上最好吃的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.2"
msgid "Chewy and salty. Perfect for skipping class."
msgstr "有嚼劲又咸香，翘课必备。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Dried kelp? Fine, I'll snack on it."
msgstr "海带干？行吧，当零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Not meat, but still chewable."
msgstr "不是肉，但还能嚼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.1"
msgid "Staring won't dry it faster. I tried."
msgstr "盯着也不会干得快，我试过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.2"
msgid "Hanging there like laundry. Tasty laundry."
msgstr "挂着像晾衣服，好吃的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "Soggy meat. Nobody wants that."
msgstr "湿哒哒的肉，谁要啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "Rain, go away. My jerky's crying."
msgstr "雨快走开，我的肉干在哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Kelp's wet again. Guess it misses the sea."
msgstr "海带又湿了，大概是想家了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Rain ruins everything. Even snacks."
msgstr "下雨毁了一切，连零食也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Still floppy. Give it time."
msgstr "还软塌塌的，再等等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Smells like the beach over here."
msgstr "这边一股海边味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Empty rack. Where's the meat?"
msgstr "架子空着，肉呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Jerky factory, currently closed."
msgstr "肉干工厂，暂停营业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.1"
msgid "Basically a come-fight-me sign."
msgstr "基本就是个“来打我”的牌子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.2"
msgid "Fire this and trouble comes running."
msgstr "一放这个，麻烦就跑过来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.1"
msgid "Fish-faced and grumpy. Wurt's cousin?"
msgstr "鱼脸还暴躁，沃特的亲戚？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.2"
msgid "Stay in your swamp. I'll stay over here."
msgstr "你待你的沼泽，我待这边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.1"
msgid "Fishy face mask. Very fashionable. Not."
msgstr "鱼脸面具，非常时尚。才怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.2"
msgid "Do I look like a merm? Don't answer."
msgstr "我像鱼人吗？别回答。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.1"
msgid "All that work, gone. Sucks."
msgstr "辛苦一场全没了，真惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like grilled fish now."
msgstr "现在一股烤鱼味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Damp, smelly, but somebody's home."
msgstr "又潮又臭，但总归是谁的家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better built than my homework."
msgstr "比我的作业做得认真。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.1"
msgid "The royal carpet's toast. Literally."
msgstr "皇家地毯烤焦了，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Someone's not getting crowned today."
msgstr "今天有人当不成国王了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fancy rug for a fish king? Sure."
msgstr "给鱼王铺地毯？行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Half-done. Like most of my projects."
msgstr "做了一半。跟我大部分事情一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.1"
msgid "Members only. Like the student council room."
msgstr "会员专用，跟学生会室似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.2"
msgid "Bet my bat beats anything in there."
msgstr "我赌我的球棒比里面哪件都强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "Shiny new gear. Fish privilege."
msgstr "闪亮新装备，鱼人特权。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "Fancier now. Still no visitors allowed."
msgstr "更高级了，照样谢绝参观。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.1"
msgid "Smells like a wet tool closet."
msgstr "闻着像受潮的工具间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.2"
msgid "Even fish do chores more than me."
msgstr "连鱼都比我勤快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "Nicer shed. Same fishy smell."
msgstr "棚子更好了，鱼腥味一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "If they lend me a pickaxe, I'll be impressed."
msgstr "要是肯借我把镐子，我就服了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt gym. Darn. So sad."
msgstr "健身房烧了，哎呀，好可惜哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.2"
msgid "Wolfgang's gonna cry."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈要哭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Lifting stuff for fun? Wolfgang, why."
msgstr "举东西当乐子？沃尔夫冈，为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'm strong already. I'll skip it."
msgstr "我已经够壮了，就不练了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.1"
msgid "A flashlight on my head. So dorky."
msgstr "头顶手电筒，土死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.2"
msgid "Now I can swing the bat and see what I'm hitting."
msgstr "这下能边挥棒边看清打的是啥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.1"
msgid "A pinwheel. Very elementary school."
msgstr "风车，像小学生玩的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.2"
msgid "Run, get breeze, sweat more. Pointless."
msgstr "跑起来有风，结果出更多汗，白忙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.1"
msgid "Pew. Now everyone knows I'm lost."
msgstr "咻，这下大家都知道我迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.2"
msgid "A tiny firework. Not as fun as a real one."
msgstr "小烟花，没真烟花好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.1"
msgid "Horns and metal. Bullies come in all shapes."
msgstr "犄角加铁壳，霸凌的什么样都有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.2"
msgid "Lure it into a pillar. Work smarter."
msgstr "引它撞柱子，用脑子打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.1"
msgid "Everything's green. Like a cheap spy movie."
msgstr "满眼都是绿的，像廉价间谍片。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.2"
msgid "Wearing a mole on my face. Great life choices."
msgstr "脸上戴只鼹鼠，人生选择真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.1"
msgid "Purple meat. Hard pass."
msgstr "紫色的肉，绝对不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.2"
msgid "Toss it to a pig. Just one piece, though."
msgstr "扔给猪吧。就一块。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.1"
msgid "No moon, no point. Just like class."
msgstr "没月亮就没意义。跟上课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.2"
msgid "Staring at rocks instead of the moon. Thrilling."
msgstr "不看月亮看石头。真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A puddle that tells you the moon's mood."
msgstr "能看出月亮心情的水坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Easier than looking up. I approve."
msgstr "比抬头省事。我同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.1"
msgid "Glass where the water used to be. Can't drink that."
msgstr "原来是水的地方变成玻璃了。没法喝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.2"
msgid "Something froze it solid. Not ice, though."
msgstr "有东西把它冻住了。但不是冰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.1"
msgid "Big round moon. Looks like a rice cracker."
msgstr "又大又圆的月亮。像块仙贝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.2"
msgid "Pigs go wild tonight. Bat's ready."
msgstr "今晚猪人要发狂。球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.1"
msgid "No moon. Perfect for sleeping, if nothing bit."
msgstr "没月亮。很适合睡觉，前提是没东西咬人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.2"
msgid "Pitch black. Keep the torch close."
msgstr "黑漆漆的。火把拿近点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.1"
msgid "Someone's taking bites out of it."
msgstr "有人在一口口啃它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.2"
msgid "Getting thinner. Lucky moon."
msgstr "越来越瘦了。月亮真好命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.1"
msgid "Growing. It must be eating well."
msgstr "在变胖。看来吃得不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.2"
msgid "Almost full. Werepig season's coming."
msgstr "快满了。猪人变身的日子要到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.1"
msgid "Rock with an empty eye socket. Fill it."
msgstr "石头上空着个眼眶，填上吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.2"
msgid "Pick a gem, any gem. Too many choices."
msgstr "挑颗宝石，随便哪颗。选择太多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "Potato-powered vision. Science is ridiculous."
msgstr "土豆供电的视力，科学真离谱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "Looks silly, but I can see in the moonstorm."
msgstr "看着傻，但月亮风暴里看得清。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.1"
msgid "Honking so loud I can't nap."
msgstr "叫得这么响，我都没法午睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.2"
msgid "Guarding a giant egg. Mama's mad."
msgstr "护着个大蛋。妈妈生气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Buzz off, bloodsucker."
msgstr "滚开，吸血鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Itchy just looking at it."
msgstr "看着就痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.1"
msgid "Gotcha. Revenge time."
msgstr "抓到你了，报仇时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.2"
msgid "Full of blood. A gross water balloon."
msgstr "装满了血，恶心的水气球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.1"
msgid "A bomb full of bugs. Great idea. Not."
msgstr "装满虫子的炸弹，好主意。才怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.2"
msgid "Buzzing in a bag. Creepy."
msgstr "袋子里在嗡嗡响，瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.1"
msgid "Bug juice for plants? Gross."
msgstr "给植物喝虫汁？恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.2"
msgid "Smells worse than the school drain."
msgstr "比学校下水道还难闻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.1"
msgid "Fish band-aid. Stinky band-aid."
msgstr "鱼用创可贴，臭的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.2"
msgid "Rub it on yourself, merms. Not me."
msgstr "鱼人自己涂，别往我身上抹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.1"
msgid "Smells like a summer night of getting bitten."
msgstr "闻着像夏天晚上被叮的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.2"
msgid "Who bottles mosquito sweat? Seriously."
msgstr "谁会把蚊子的汗装瓶啊，认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.1"
msgid "All gone. So much for mushroom soup."
msgstr "全没了，蘑菇汤泡汤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.2"
msgid "Black and crispy. Even I wouldn't eat that."
msgstr "又黑又脆，我都不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing growing. Just a log in a box."
msgstr "啥也没长，就一截木头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Toss a mushroom in, it does the rest."
msgstr "丢个蘑菇进去，剩下它自己来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.1"
msgid "Lots of mushrooms. Dinner's sorted."
msgstr "好多蘑菇，晚饭有着落了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.2"
msgid "So crowded. Like the cafeteria at noon."
msgstr "挤成这样，跟中午食堂似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.1"
msgid "The log gave up. Can't blame it."
msgstr "木头累垮了，不怪它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.2"
msgid "Used up. Someone fetch another living log."
msgstr "用坏了，谁去再弄根活木。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.1"
msgid "Mushrooms are hibernating. Smart guys."
msgstr "蘑菇在冬眠，聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.2"
msgid "Buried in snow. I want to hibernate too."
msgstr "埋在雪里了，我也想冬眠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.1"
msgid "A few mushrooms. Not enough for a meal."
msgstr "就几朵，凑不成一顿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.2"
msgid "Slow growers. Like me in the morning."
msgstr "长得真慢，跟早上的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.1"
msgid "Packed full. I'm grabbing them all."
msgstr "塞满了，全拿走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.2"
msgid "Any more and they'll pop out on their own."
msgstr "再多就要自己蹦出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Charcoal lamp. Not very bright."
msgstr "木炭台灯，不怎么亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like grilled mushroom. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "一股烤蘑菇味，饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "A lamp with nothing in it. Useless."
msgstr "空着的灯，没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "Stuff some light bulbs in. I'll wait."
msgstr "塞点荧光果进去，我等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.1"
msgid "A giant mushroom nightlight. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "巨型蘑菇小夜灯，算可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.2"
msgid "Perfect for napping under."
msgstr "在下面睡午觉正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.1"
msgid "Rainbow lamp, now only comes in black."
msgstr "彩虹灯，现在只剩黑色了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burned so fast. Mushrooms really can't take heat."
msgstr "烧得真快，蘑菇果然怕火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.1"
msgid "Spores change the color. Too many decisions."
msgstr "孢子能换颜色。选择太多，头疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.2"
msgid "Lights off. Even the lamp's skipping work."
msgstr "灯灭着，连灯都在翘班。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.1"
msgid "So colorful. Like a karaoke room."
msgstr "五颜六色的，像KTV包厢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.2"
msgid "Fancy lighting. Doesn't match this dump of a camp."
msgstr "灯这么花哨，跟这破营地不搭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.1"
msgid "A cookie that makes spiders drop from above? Okay."
msgstr "让蜘蛛从天上掉下来的饼干？行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.2"
msgid "Not touching it. Not eating it."
msgstr "不碰，也不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.1"
msgid "Makes nurse spiders. Nicer than the school nurse."
msgstr "能变出护士蜘蛛，比校医态度好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.2"
msgid "Healing cookie, but only if you've got eight legs."
msgstr "疗伤饼干，前提是你有八条腿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.1"
msgid "Turns spiders into turtles? Weird snack."
msgstr "能把蜘蛛变成缩头乌龟？奇怪的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.2"
msgid "Hide in a shell. Wish I could do that in class."
msgstr "缩进壳里，上课时我也想这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.1"
msgid "Moon cookie. Sounds tasty, but it's not for me."
msgstr "月亮饼干，听着好吃，可惜不是给我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.2"
msgid "It glows a bit. Snacks shouldn't glow."
msgstr "还有点发光，零食不该发光。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.1"
msgid "A cookie for spitting spiders. Gross."
msgstr "吐口水蜘蛛的饼干，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.2"
msgid "Spitting is rude. Tell them that."
msgstr "吐口水不礼貌，跟它们说一声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "Spider snack with a fighting spirit."
msgstr "带着斗志的蜘蛛零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "Looks like a cookie. Smells like it isn't."
msgstr "看着像饼干，闻着不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.1"
msgid "Spiders that swim. Thanks, I hate it."
msgstr "会游泳的蜘蛛，谢谢，我很讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.2"
msgid "Water spider snack. Keep it far from my bath."
msgstr "水蜘蛛零食，离我洗澡的地方远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.1"
msgid "Red light made of nightmares. Who designs these."
msgstr "用噩梦做的红光，谁设计的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.2"
msgid "Feels like it's staring back at me."
msgstr "感觉它也在盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.1"
msgid "Gooey black stuff. Don't touch it."
msgstr "黏糊糊的黑东西，别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.2"
msgid "Smells like a bad dream."
msgstr "闻着像一场噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.1"
msgid "Glowing club. Fun at night."
msgstr "会发光的棒子，晚上挺好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.2"
msgid "Zappy. My hair's standing up already."
msgstr "滋滋响，头发都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.1"
msgid "A dark sword. Louis would have opinions."
msgstr "黑暗之剑，路易斯肯定有意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.2"
msgid "It whispers. Shut up, sword."
msgstr "它在低语。闭嘴，剑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.1"
msgid "Explosive stuff. I like it."
msgstr "能做炸药的东西，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.2"
msgid "Smells weird. Gunpowder material, right?"
msgstr "味道怪怪的，是做火药的吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.1"
msgid "An arm workout I never asked for."
msgstr "我从来没想要的手臂锻炼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.2"
msgid "With my strength, we'll cross the sea in no time."
msgstr "以我的力气，很快就能横渡大海。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.1"
msgid "Light wood, fast strokes. Less sweating."
msgstr "木头轻，划得快。少流点汗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.2"
msgid "Made from beach junk, and it rows better. Funny."
msgstr "海滩上的漂流木做的，反而更好划。真好笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.1"
msgid "A net that fishes while I nap. Perfect."
msgstr "我睡觉时它帮我捕鱼。完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.2"
msgid "Fishing on autopilot. Should've been invented sooner."
msgstr "自动捕鱼。早该发明了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "An empty bowl waiting for seaweed."
msgstr "一个空碗，在等海带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Gotta feed the merms before they listen."
msgstr "得先喂鱼人，它们才听话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.1"
msgid "Stop adding. It's overflowing."
msgstr "别放了，都溢出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.2"
msgid "Kelp party. Not my kind of party."
msgstr "海带派对，不是我的派对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.1"
msgid "Half a bowl. Like a cafeteria serving."
msgstr "半碗，跟食堂打的饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.2"
msgid "Not enough yet. Go dive for more."
msgstr "还不够，再下水捞点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fancier bowl, same empty."
msgstr "碗变高级了，照样是空的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nice pot. Shame it's got nothing in it."
msgstr "锅不错，可惜啥也没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.1"
msgid "Enough seaweed for an army of fish."
msgstr "够喂一整支鱼军队了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.2"
msgid "Done. My arms smell like the ocean."
msgstr "好了。我手上一股海腥味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.1"
msgid "Halfway there. Keep going, not me."
msgstr "到一半了。继续加，别找我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.2"
msgid "Some kelp. The merms want more, probably."
msgstr "有点海带了，鱼人大概还想要更多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.1"
msgid "Clank clank boom. My ears hurt."
msgstr "叮叮咣咣，耳朵疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.2"
msgid "Pigs follow me around. Like a weird parade."
msgstr "猪会跟着我走，像个怪游行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.1"
msgid "A lullaby for monsters. Works on me too."
msgstr "怪物的摇篮曲，对我也管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.2"
msgid "Blow once and everything naps. My kind of song."
msgstr "吹一下全都睡了，我喜欢的曲子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.1"
msgid "Blank. Like my test answers."
msgstr "空白的，跟我的考卷一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.2"
msgid "Could fold a paper plane. Or not."
msgstr "能折纸飞机。或者不折。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.1"
msgid "Waddle, waddle. Cute, but they bite."
msgstr "摇啊摇。挺可爱，就是咬人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.2"
msgid "Don't touch their eggs. Learned that one fast."
msgstr "别碰它们的蛋，这个我学得很快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.1"
msgid "Smells sweet. Not edible though. ...Wait, is it?"
msgstr "闻着甜，应该不能吃。……等等，能吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.2"
msgid "Crumpled in my pocket already. Whatever."
msgstr "在口袋里都揉皱了，随便吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.1"
msgid "Rocks, meet my arms."
msgstr "石头，来认识一下我的胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.2"
msgid "Breaking rocks is easy. I'm just strong."
msgstr "敲石头很简单，我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.1"
msgid "A pig on my back. Smells like one too."
msgstr "背上一头猪，味道也像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.2"
msgid "Fits everything. Even Chester's jealous."
msgstr "什么都塞得下，切斯特都嫉妒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp. Rent's gonna be cheap."
msgstr "烧焦了，房租应该很便宜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ash and a door frame. Rough."
msgstr "就剩灰和门框了，惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.1"
msgid "Somebody's home. Napping, probably. Jealous."
msgstr "有人在家。八成在睡觉，羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.2"
msgid "Peeking at me? Rude."
msgstr "偷看我？没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Weird shape. Who designed this?"
msgstr "形状好怪，谁设计的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A whole house for one pig. Fancy."
msgstr "一只猪住一整栋房子，阔气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.1"
msgid "Lights out. Is it bedtime already? Nice."
msgstr "灯灭了。已经睡觉时间了？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.2"
msgid "Hiding from me? Smart pig."
msgstr "躲着我？聪明的猪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.1"
msgid "Lazing on a throne all day. Dream job."
msgstr "整天躺在宝座上，梦想职业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.2"
msgid "Here, meat. Now gimme gold."
msgstr "给，肉。快给我金子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.1"
msgid "Hit too hard. Oops."
msgstr "下手太重了。哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.2"
msgid "Sorry, piggy. Rest easy."
msgstr "对不起啦，小猪。好好休息。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "You're my errand boy now. Go chop that tree."
msgstr "你现在是我的跑腿了。去砍那棵树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "Good pig. Don't get any ideas."
msgstr "乖猪。别打什么歪主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hungry? Same. Let's not fight over it."
msgstr "饿了？我也是。别为这个打架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A pig in pants. This island's weird."
msgstr "穿裤子的猪。这岛真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.1"
msgid "Glaring at me like a hall monitor."
msgstr "跟纪律委员一样瞪着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.2"
msgid "Relax, I'm not here for your king."
msgstr "放松，我不是冲你们国王来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.1"
msgid "Full moon? That's why he's so cranky."
msgstr "满月啊？难怪他脾气这么差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.2"
msgid "Okay, bat time. Sorry, pal."
msgstr "好吧，该上球棒了。抱歉，兄弟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.1"
msgid "A skull flag. Very edgy."
msgstr "骷髅旗。好中二。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.2"
msgid "Looks like the monkeys' style. Not mine."
msgstr "像是猴子们的风格。不是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.1"
msgid "Peeling up the ground like a sticker."
msgstr "把地皮像贴纸一样撕下来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.2"
msgid "Not really a weapon. Don't ask."
msgstr "这不算武器，别问。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.1"
msgid "A garden on my head. Who thought of this."
msgstr "头上顶个菜园，谁想的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.2"
msgid "Looks like homework I'd skip."
msgstr "看着就像我会翘掉的作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.1"
msgid "Tiny tools. My fingers are too big for this."
msgstr "这么小的工具，我手指太粗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.2"
msgid "Taking watches apart? I'd just smash them."
msgstr "拆表这种事，我只会直接砸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rewind the boo-boo. Neat trick."
msgstr "把伤倒带回去，挺厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wanda's watch. Better than a bandage."
msgstr "旺达的表，比绷带好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "Ticking back up. Don't get hurt yet."
msgstr "还在走回来，先别受伤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "Cooldown. Like waiting for the lunch bell."
msgstr "冷却中，跟等午饭铃一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.1"
msgid "Gears that tick on their own. No thanks."
msgstr "自己会走的齿轮，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.2"
msgid "If I drop one, it's gone forever."
msgstr "掉一个就再也找不着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A watch that opens a hole in time. Normal stuff."
msgstr "能在时间上开洞的表，很正常。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Everyone hop in. I'm not walking back."
msgstr "大家跳进去，我可不走回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "Portal's on break. Same as me."
msgstr "传送门在休息，跟我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "Not yet. Even a time hole needs time. Ha."
msgstr "还没好，时间的洞也要时间，哈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rewind to where I was. My legs thank Wanda."
msgstr "倒回原来的地方，我的腿谢谢旺达。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Marks a spot to go back to. Like a bookmark."
msgstr "记住一个能回去的地方，跟书签一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "Still ticking. Give it time."
msgstr "还在走，等一会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "Can't rewind yet. Ugh."
msgstr "还倒不回去，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda's revive watch. Good news for ghosts."
msgstr "旺达的复活表，鬼魂们有救了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Ticking someone back to life. Weird, but useful."
msgstr "滴答一下就活过来，怪，但有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "Nobody die right now, okay?"
msgstr "现在谁都别死，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "Still winding up. Hang in there."
msgstr "还在上发条，撑住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Step back a few seconds. Handy for dodging."
msgstr "往回退几秒，躲东西正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wish this worked on my test answers."
msgstr "要是能用来改考试答案就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "Wait for it. Tick, tick."
msgstr "等着，滴答滴答。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "Still cooling down. Don't get hit."
msgstr "还在冷却，别挨打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Heavier than it looks. I like it."
msgstr "比看着沉，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Not as good as my bat, but it hits hard."
msgstr "没我的球棒好，但打起来挺狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.1"
msgid "Comes with a free pet. One that does chores, too."
msgstr "附赠一只宠物，还会帮忙干活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.2"
msgid "Pirate hat. Do I have to say \"arr\" now?"
msgstr "海盗帽。现在是不是得喊“啊哈”了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.1"
msgid "Fishing? So much waiting. ...Fine."
msgstr "钓鱼？要等好久。……行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.2"
msgid "Frogs come out of there. Pass."
msgstr "青蛙都从那里出来。算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.1"
msgid "Fertilizer. Also known as gross."
msgstr "肥料。俗称恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.2"
msgid "Don't step in it. Don't step in it."
msgstr "别踩到。千万别踩到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.1"
msgid "Louder than the school PA."
msgstr "比学校广播还吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.2"
msgid "I could crush stuff by hand. Too lazy though."
msgstr "我徒手也能碾碎。就是懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "Wake me when it's done."
msgstr "好了叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "My stomach is filing a complaint."
msgstr "我的胃在投诉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "Smells good. Hurry up, pot."
msgstr "好香。锅，快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Spoon's ready. I'm ready. Just you now."
msgstr "勺子准备好了，我也准备好了，就差你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.1"
msgid "Mine. Big portion."
msgstr "我的。要大份。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.2"
msgid "Finally. Move, I'm first in line."
msgstr "终于好了。让开，我排第一。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.1"
msgid "An empty pot is a sad pot."
msgstr "空锅是一口悲伤的锅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Warly, it's hungry. So am I."
msgstr "沃利，锅饿了。我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Warly's bento box, but bigger."
msgstr "沃利的便当盒，大号版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Best thing anyone's ever carried."
msgstr "这是别人背过的最好的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.1"
msgid "Campfire to go. Like takeout."
msgstr "外带篝火，跟外卖一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Walter's camping gear. Pretty handy."
msgstr "沃尔特的露营装备，挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.1"
msgid "Done. Now give it to me."
msgstr "好了，现在给我吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.2"
msgid "Smells fancy. Tastes fancy, hopefully."
msgstr "闻着挺高级，希望吃着也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cafeteria food could use one of these."
msgstr "学校食堂真该来一台。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Sprinkle stuff on food. Why so many steps?"
msgstr "往饭上撒点东西，干嘛这么多步骤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.1"
msgid "A nap you can carry. Love it."
msgstr "能背着走的午觉，爱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Roll it out anywhere. Skip class anywhere."
msgstr "哪都能铺，哪都能逃课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "The bird beak looks thirsty too."
msgstr "鸟嘴看着也渴了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Big can, big trip to refill it."
msgstr "壶这么大，打一次水得跑老远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Made from a bird's beak. Kinda gross, works great."
msgstr "用鸟嘴做的，有点恶心，但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Heavy? Nah. Not for me."
msgstr "重？不，对我来说不重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.1"
msgid "That face is grinning at me. Creepy."
msgstr "那张脸在冲我笑，瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.2"
msgid "All that pumpkin and none of it went into pie."
msgstr "这么大个南瓜，一口派都没做成。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.1"
msgid "Finally, something I'm allowed to hit."
msgstr "终于有个能随便打的东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.2"
msgid "Let's see how high the number goes with my bat."
msgstr "看看用球棒能打出多少。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.1"
msgid "Pretty color. Feels like it's whispering."
msgstr "颜色挺好看，感觉在说悄悄话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.2"
msgid "Purple. Maxwell's favorite, probably."
msgstr "紫色的，大概是麦斯威尔的最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fast little thing. Not chasing it."
msgstr "跑得真快，懒得追。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Fluffy. Also dinner. Tough choice."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，也是晚饭。好难选。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.1"
msgid "Your heart's beating so fast. Calm down."
msgstr "你心跳好快，冷静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.2"
msgid "Stop wiggling. I'm not gonna eat you. Yet."
msgstr "别扭来扭去，我还没打算吃你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A hole. I want to crawl in and nap."
msgstr "一个洞，好想钻进去睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone's hiding in there. Come out, I won't bite."
msgstr "有人躲在里面。出来吧，我不咬人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.1"
msgid "Closed for the season. Like the school pool."
msgstr "季节性关闭，跟学校泳池一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.2"
msgid "Caved in from the rain. Bunnies stay home."
msgstr "雨水把洞冲塌了，兔子们闭门不出。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "The bunnymen won't be happy about this."
msgstr "兔人肯定不高兴了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Carrot house, well done. Way too well done."
msgstr "胡萝卜屋，全熟了。熟过头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bunnymen live in a giant carrot. Weird flex."
msgstr "兔人住在大胡萝卜里。真会显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Knock, and something big and fluffy answers."
msgstr "敲敲门，会有毛茸茸的大家伙出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.1"
msgid "Rain? Don't care anymore."
msgstr "下雨？无所谓了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.2"
msgid "Crinkly and plasticky. Like a trash bag."
msgstr "沙沙响，像塑料垃圾袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.1"
msgid "Uncool, but dry."
msgstr "不酷，但是干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.2"
msgid "Keeps the rain off. Mostly."
msgstr "能挡雨，大部分吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.1"
msgid "Forecast: ashes, with a chance of more ashes."
msgstr "预报：灰烬，局部还有灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.2"
msgid "Didn't see that coming, did it."
msgstr "这个它没预测到吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "If it says rain, I'm skipping today."
msgstr "要是说下雨，我今天就翘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A weather report on a stick. Still no umbrella, though."
msgstr "插在杆子上的天气预报。可还是没伞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.1"
msgid "Good for beefalo. Not for my bangs."
msgstr "给牛剃毛还行，别碰我刘海。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.2"
msgid "Wilson keeps eyeing his beard with this."
msgstr "威尔逊老拿着它盯自己的胡子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.1"
msgid "Red means stop. Even I know that."
msgstr "红色就是停。这我还是懂的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.2"
msgid "Cook it first. Raw, it bites back."
msgstr "先煮熟。生吃会反咬一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pops out during the day. Show-off."
msgstr "白天就冒出来，爱出风头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pretty. Probably poison. Classic."
msgstr "好看，八成有毒。经典。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "Still napping underground. Lucky."
msgstr "还在地下睡觉，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "Come back in daytime, I guess."
msgstr "白天再来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "Just a hole now. Wait for it to grow back."
msgstr "只剩个坑，等它再长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "Someone beat me to it. Probably me."
msgstr "被人抢先了。可能是我自己。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.1"
msgid "Whoever lit the swamp, it wasn't me."
msgstr "谁把沼泽点了，反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.2"
msgid "Bye-bye, papyrus homework."
msgstr "再见了，莎草纸作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grass that grows up to my skirt. Annoying."
msgstr "长到我裙子那么高的草，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pick a bunch and blow a panflute. Or not."
msgstr "采一把做排箫。算了，懒得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left but stubble."
msgstr "就剩一截茬了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Come back later. Way later."
msgstr "晚点再来吧。很晚很晚那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.1"
msgid "Basically a dust brick. Who collects this?"
msgstr "基本就是灰砖，谁收集这个？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.2"
msgid "Ah... ah... nope, held it in."
msgstr "啊……啊……没事，忍住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.1"
msgid "Like wearing my own patch of shade."
msgstr "像穿了块树荫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.2"
msgid "Summer gear. Still sweating, just less."
msgstr "夏装，还在出汗，少了点而已。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.1"
msgid "The science machine's toast. Class cancelled!"
msgstr "科学机器烤糊了，停课！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burnt. Not my fault this time."
msgstr "烧了，这次真不是我干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A science machine. Like the school lab, but louder."
msgstr "科学机器，像学校实验室，就是更吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wilson's favorite toy."
msgstr "威尔逊最喜欢的玩具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.1"
msgid "All that alchemy, turned into charcoal."
msgstr "炼了半天金，炼成炭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the gold bits melted."
msgstr "连金子部分都化了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Alchemy engine. Sounds like an extra-credit class."
msgstr "炼金引擎，听着像加分课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Spins and clanks. Learning's noisy."
msgstr "又转又响，学习真吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.1"
msgid "Shadow stuff burns too, huh."
msgstr "暗影的东西也会烧啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.2"
msgid "Good. That thing gave me the creeps."
msgstr "也好，那东西让我发毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Shadow manipulator. Sounds like a bad club name."
msgstr "暗影操纵者，听着像个很土的社团名。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It whispers. I'd rather hear my teacher drone on."
msgstr "它在低语，我宁愿听老师念经。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.1"
msgid "No more rabbit tricks. Shame."
msgstr "兔子戏法变不了了，可惜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burned the prestihatitator. Don't make me say that again."
msgstr "灵子分解器烧了，这名字我也不想再念了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A magic hat on a table. School talent show vibes."
msgstr "桌上放顶魔术帽，校园才艺表演既视感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feed it a rabbit, get magic. Weird deal."
msgstr "喂只兔子就能学魔法，奇怪的交易。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.1"
msgid "Swish, new look. Like a makeover show."
msgstr "唰一下就换新样子，像改造节目。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.2"
msgid "One sweep and it's redone. Wish it did homework too."
msgstr "一扫就换装，要是还能写作业就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.1"
msgid "It burned before I even got to use it."
msgstr "还没用上就烧了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the meat effigy got cooked."
msgstr "连肉块雕像都烤熟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Made of meat and a chunk of my health. Gross."
msgstr "用肉和我的一截血做的。恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A spare me, sort of. Looks like Wilson, though."
msgstr "算是备用的我。不过长得像威尔逊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.1"
msgid "A telltale heart. Gross, but it works."
msgstr "告密的心，恶心，但管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.2"
msgid "Squeeze a heart to bring someone back. Okay then."
msgstr "捏颗心就能把人救回来，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Red bird. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "红色的鸟，算可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hopping around like it's late for class."
msgstr "蹦蹦跳跳的，像上课要迟到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.1"
msgid "Tiny and warm. Don't poop on me."
msgstr "小小的还暖暖的。别拉我身上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.2"
msgid "Got you. The birdcage is waiting."
msgstr "抓到你了，鸟笼在等你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A fluffy snowball with wings."
msgstr "长翅膀的毛绒雪球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Doesn't it get cold? I'm freezing."
msgstr "它不冷吗？我都要冻死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.1"
msgid "Better than a hand warmer."
msgstr "比暖宝宝还管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.2"
msgid "Shivering. Me too, bud."
msgstr "在发抖。我也是，伙计。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.1"
msgid "Heavy. Make someone else carry them."
msgstr "好重，让别人背吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.2"
msgid "Could crush these with my bare hands. Won't, though."
msgstr "徒手就能捏碎。不过懒得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.1"
msgid "Melting shell. Rough day, huh?"
msgstr "壳都化了，今天不顺吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.2"
msgid "Acid rain did this. Poor rock lobster."
msgstr "酸雨弄的吧，可怜的石虾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.1"
msgid "Pretending to be a rock. I do that in class."
msgstr "装成石头，我上课也这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.2"
msgid "Knock knock. Nobody home?"
msgstr "咚咚，没人在家？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rock lobster. My bat won't even dent it."
msgstr "石虾，球棒都敲不出坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Chewing on rocks. Is that crunchy?"
msgstr "在嚼石头，脆吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.1"
msgid "I could tie up anyone who bugs me."
msgstr "谁烦我就把谁捆起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.2"
msgid "Jump rope? No thanks, too much exercise."
msgstr "跳绳？不了，运动量太大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.1"
msgid "A bridge over the gap. Don't look down."
msgstr "跨过缺口的桥。别往下看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.2"
msgid "It'll sway a bit. I'll pretend it's a hammock."
msgstr "会有点晃。就当是吊床吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rose-tinted. Everything looks less annoying."
msgstr "粉色镜片，什么都没那么烦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Fancy specs. I'd sit on them by accident."
msgstr "这么精致的眼镜，我肯定会一屁股坐坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.1"
msgid "Fancy saddle. The beefalo looks smug now."
msgstr "好高级的鞍，牛都得意起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.2"
msgid "Riding into battle in style, huh."
msgstr "骑着去打仗还挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.1"
msgid "Salt keeps it fresh. Like pickling, but lazier."
msgstr "盐能保鲜。跟腌菜一样，只是更省事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.2"
msgid "Food doesn't spoil in here. Neither does my laziness."
msgstr "食物在这里不会坏。我的懒也不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.1"
msgid "A snack bar for cows. They lick it all day."
msgstr "牛的零食吧。舔一整天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.2"
msgid "Keeps the herd from wandering. Like a vending machine."
msgstr "能让牛群不乱跑。跟自动贩卖机一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.1"
msgid "Bigger block, fewer refills. Lazy approved."
msgstr "盐块更大，少补几次。懒人认证。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.2"
msgid "The beefalo are gonna be so thirsty."
msgstr "那些牛会渴坏的吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.1"
msgid "Up in smoke. Twigs, gone."
msgstr "一下就冒烟了，树枝没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.2"
msgid "Ah, that one's done for."
msgstr "啊，那棵完蛋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Diseased twigs? No thanks."
msgstr "生病的树枝？不要了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.2"
msgid "It's beyond saving. Bye, sapling."
msgstr "救不回来了，再见，树苗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with this one."
msgstr "这棵不太对劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Wilting a bit. Hope it's not catching."
msgstr "有点打蔫，希望别传染。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Twigs. Not great for a bat."
msgstr "树枝，做球棒可不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Skinny little tree. Snap, snap."
msgstr "细细的小树，掰，掰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.1"
msgid "No twigs left. Patience, I guess."
msgstr "没树枝了，耐心等吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.2"
msgid "Picked clean. By me, yes."
msgstr "采光了。对，是我干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Too hot for twigs too."
msgstr "树枝也怕热。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.2"
msgid "Dried up like old bread."
msgstr "干得像隔夜面包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.1"
msgid "Someone grab water! Not me, I'm watching."
msgstr "谁去拿水！不是我，我在看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.2"
msgid "Its outfit's on fire. Fashion disaster."
msgstr "它的衣服着火了。时尚灾难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp. Crows win this round."
msgstr "烧成炭了。这回乌鸦赢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the pumpkin head is toast."
msgstr "连南瓜头都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Stands in a field all day doing nothing. Relatable."
msgstr "整天站在地里啥也不干。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wanna swap clothes? Mine's just a uniform, though."
msgstr "跟我换衣服吗？不过我的只是校服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.1"
msgid "Just a lump for now. Like my art projects."
msgstr "现在只是一坨，跟我的美术作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.2"
msgid "Chip, chip. I'd rather just hit it once."
msgstr "一点点凿，我宁愿一棒子敲下去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "No more art class."
msgstr "美术课没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burnt potter's wheel. Sad."
msgstr "烧焦的陶艺台，可惜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing to carve. Bring me a rock."
msgstr "没东西雕，给我搬块石头来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty wheel. Free period."
msgstr "空着呢，自习课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.1"
msgid "Look at that. I'm basically an artist."
msgstr "瞧瞧，我简直是艺术家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.2"
msgid "Not bad. Better than my school sculpture."
msgstr "还不错，比我在学校做的强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.1"
msgid "Somebody burned down boat school."
msgstr "航海学校被烧了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.2"
msgid "Guess I'm not learning to sail today."
msgstr "看来今天学不了开船了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Think tank? I don't think, I nap."
msgstr "智囊团？我不思考，我睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Boat class. At least it smells like the sea."
msgstr "航海课，至少闻着有海的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.1"
msgid "A tiny bag just for seeds. Cute."
msgstr "专门装种子的小袋子，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.2"
msgid "Organized seeds. Look at me, a responsible farmer."
msgstr "种子整整齐齐，看我多像个靠谱农民。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.1"
msgid "Bird food. I'm not that desperate. Yet."
msgstr "鸟食，我还没那么饿。暂时。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant them? Gardening's so slow."
msgstr "种下去？种地太慢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.1"
msgid "It watches the area so I don't have to."
msgstr "它帮我盯着，我就不用盯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.2"
msgid "Better lookout than any hall monitor."
msgstr "比学校纪律委员看得还牢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.1"
msgid "Home ec was the one class I didn't skip."
msgstr "家政课是我唯一没翘的课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.2"
msgid "Needle and thread. Don't let me prick myself."
msgstr "针和线，别让我扎到自己。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Outfit's gone, and so is the model."
msgstr "衣服没了，模特也没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.2"
msgid "Charcoal isn't really in fashion."
msgstr "炭黑可不流行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "No head, no complaints. Lucky."
msgstr "没有头，也不会抱怨。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It wears my stuff better than I do."
msgstr "我的衣服它穿得比我还好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.1"
msgid "Tape fixes everything. Even my skirt."
msgstr "胶带万能，连我的裙子都能补。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.2"
msgid "Easier than sewing. I hate sewing."
msgstr "比缝针省事，我最烦缝针了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.1"
msgid "Digging holes. Feels like detention."
msgstr "挖坑，跟罚劳动似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.2"
msgid "Don't ask me to dig up graves."
msgstr "别让我去挖坟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Who burns a nap spot? That's just evil."
msgstr "谁会烧午睡的地方？太过分了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Afternoon plans: ruined."
msgstr "下午的计划：泡汤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Napping in broad daylight. My true calling."
msgstr "大白天睡午觉。我的天职。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better than the school roof. Shadier, too."
msgstr "比学校天台好。还更阴凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.1"
msgid "Soft. Could make a nice pillow... no, gross."
msgstr "软软的，能做个枕头……不了，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.2"
msgid "Webber says it's fine. Webber is a spider."
msgstr "韦伯说没事。可韦伯是蜘蛛啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bare and lonely. Kind of sad."
msgstr "空荡荡的，有点寂寞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wendy keeps it clean. I'll help. Just this once."
msgstr "温蒂一直收拾着。我帮一下，就这一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.1"
msgid "Pretty. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "挺好看的。别说是我说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.2"
msgid "Full of flowers. Nice job, Wendy."
msgstr "插满花了，温蒂，干得好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "Okay, I'm not crying. Shut up."
msgstr "好了，我没哭。闭嘴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "Feels like someone humming far away."
msgstr "像有人在很远的地方哼歌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.1"
msgid "Those flowers feel wrong. Swap them?"
msgstr "这些花感觉不对，换掉吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.2"
msgid "Gloomy bouquet. Even for Wendy."
msgstr "好阴沉的花束，对温蒂来说也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.1"
msgid "Getting there. Couple more."
msgstr "快了，再来几朵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.2"
msgid "Half full. Go pick more, I'll watch."
msgstr "插了一半。去多摘点，我看着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.1"
msgid "Sleep in a bag. Can I use it on myself?"
msgstr "装在袋子里的睡眠，能用在我自己身上吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.2"
msgid "Throw it and everyone naps. Even me, if I'm close."
msgstr "扔出去大家都睡，离太近我也睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A baby bat that shoots rocks."
msgstr "能射石头的迷你球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "My throwing arm is better. Just saying."
msgstr "我扔得更准，随便说说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "Walter's pencil case for rocks."
msgstr "沃尔特装石头的笔袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "Neater than my desk drawer."
msgstr "比我课桌抽屉整齐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "Creepy little rocks. They feel heavy."
msgstr "阴森的小石子，手感很沉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "Shadow pebbles. Don't lose them."
msgstr "暗影石子，别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.1"
msgid "Ice ball. Freeze 'em, then bat 'em."
msgstr "冰球，先冻住再抡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.2"
msgid "Cold to hold. My fingers hate it."
msgstr "拿着好冰，手指讨厌它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.1"
msgid "Goo in a ball. Gross but useful."
msgstr "一团黏液，恶心但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.2"
msgid "Like jelly. Not the edible kind."
msgstr "像果冻，不是能吃的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.1"
msgid "Shooting money. Rich kid move."
msgstr "拿钱打人，有钱人的做法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.2"
msgid "Could buy so much food with that."
msgstr "那些能买好多吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.1"
msgid "Boom ammo. Keep it away from Willow."
msgstr "会爆的弹药，离薇洛远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.2"
msgid "Walter's getting scary."
msgstr "沃尔特越来越吓人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.1"
msgid "Sticky and sweet. Can I eat it?"
msgstr "又黏又甜，能吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.2"
msgid "Wasting honey on enemies. Criminal."
msgstr "把蜂蜜浪费在敌人身上，犯罪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.1"
msgid "Nightmare in pellet form. Creepy."
msgstr "压成弹丸的噩梦，瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.2"
msgid "Shivers just holding it."
msgstr "拿着就打寒颤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.1"
msgid "Veggie ammo. Still not edible."
msgstr "蔬菜弹药，照样不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.2"
msgid "Tough shells. Plants are getting aggressive."
msgstr "外壳好硬，植物都变凶了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.1"
msgid "Heavy little balls. Ouch."
msgstr "沉甸甸的小球，疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.2"
msgid "Fancy marble for a fancy bruise."
msgstr "高级大理石打出高级淤青。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "Sharp. Like my comebacks."
msgstr "很利，跟我吐槽一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "Shiny glass bits. Pretty, but ouch."
msgstr "亮晶晶的玻璃渣，好看，但扎手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.1"
msgid "Gross. Walter, wash your hands."
msgstr "恶心。沃尔特，去洗手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.2"
msgid "Worst ammo ever. Effective, though."
msgstr "史上最烂的弹药，但确实管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.1"
msgid "Shiny enough to blind somebody."
msgstr "亮得能把人晃瞎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.2"
msgid "A tiny star for flinging."
msgstr "能弹出去的小星星。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.1"
msgid "Just a rock. Honest and simple."
msgstr "就是块石头，朴实无华。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.2"
msgid "I could throw these by hand."
msgstr "我徒手就能扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.1"
msgid "Shooting junk. Recycling, I guess."
msgstr "拿废品当弹药，也算回收利用吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.2"
msgid "Bits and bolts. Hope it flies straight."
msgstr "零零碎碎的，希望能飞直。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.1"
msgid "Slows them down. Like a Monday."
msgstr "让它们变慢，跟星期一一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.2"
msgid "Makes things as sluggish as me."
msgstr "让东西跟我一样慢吞吞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.1"
msgid "Bee butt ammo. Double ouch."
msgstr "蜜蜂屁股弹，双倍疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.2"
msgid "Pointy end goes forward, Walter."
msgstr "尖的那头朝前，沃尔特。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.1"
msgid "Ancient stuff as ammo? Wasteful."
msgstr "拿远古的东西当子弹？浪费。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.2"
msgid "Fancy rock goes pew."
msgstr "高级石头，咻一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.1"
msgid "Tool kit for nerds. Walter loves it."
msgstr "书呆子的工具包，沃尔特爱死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.2"
msgid "Upgrading toys. Boys."
msgstr "升级玩具，男生啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.1"
msgid "Pig skin. Snaps back hard."
msgstr "猪皮做的，弹得很猛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.2"
msgid "Smells like pigs. Works, though."
msgstr "有股猪味，但能用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.1"
msgid "Stretchy and gross. Like old gum."
msgstr "又弹又恶心，像嚼过的口香糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.2"
msgid "Snaps like a tentacle. Because it is one."
msgstr "弹起来像触手，因为它就是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.1"
msgid "Spooky slingshot. Very Halloween."
msgstr "阴森的弹弓，很万圣节。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.2"
msgid "Hope it wasn't someone's arm."
msgstr "希望不是谁的胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.1"
msgid "A jewelry store slingshot."
msgstr "珠宝店出品的弹弓。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.2"
msgid "Fancier than my school bag."
msgstr "比我书包还华丽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.1"
msgid "Half-built. Like Walter's attention span."
msgstr "做了一半，跟沃尔特的专注力一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.2"
msgid "Missing pieces. Can't swing it like this."
msgstr "缺零件，这样没法用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.1"
msgid "Wobbly handle. Looks like dessert."
msgstr "软趴趴的握把，像甜点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.2"
msgid "Squishy. I'd squeeze it to pieces."
msgstr "软乎乎的，我会捏碎的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.1"
msgid "Smooth grip. Fancy slingshot."
msgstr "顺滑握把，弹弓都讲究了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.2"
msgid "Silk? My bat gets tape. Unfair."
msgstr "丝绸？我的球棒只有胶布，不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.1"
msgid "Sticky grip. Like the cafeteria tables."
msgstr "黏手的握把，跟食堂桌子一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.2"
msgid "Won't drop it. Won't let go either."
msgstr "掉不了，也放不开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "Dark cloth wrap. Looks cool, honestly."
msgstr "黑布缠的，说实话挺帅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "Feels like holding a shadow."
msgstr "像握着一团影子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.1"
msgid "Eats rocks. And I thought I had a big appetite."
msgstr "吃石头的。我还以为我胃口大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.2"
msgid "Don't hit it with fire. It goes boom."
msgstr "别用火烧它，会炸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.1"
msgid "Bite-sized. Gone in one bite."
msgstr "一口的量，一口就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.2"
msgid "A morsel. My stomach laughs at this."
msgstr "就一小块，我的胃都笑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A bottle of seaweed soup nobody should drink."
msgstr "一瓶谁都不该喝的海带汤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Smells kind of fishy. Plants are into that?"
msgstr "有股鱼腥味，植物爱这口？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.1"
msgid "Peak stink. Perfect for plants, apparently."
msgstr "臭到巅峰，据说对植物正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.2"
msgid "I'm not opening this. You do it."
msgstr "我不打开，你来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.1"
msgid "Halfway to gross. Leave it be."
msgstr "臭到一半了，别管它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.2"
msgid "Starting to bubble. Like a failed science project."
msgstr "开始冒泡了，像失败的理科作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.1"
msgid "A pointy stick. Classic."
msgstr "尖棍子，经典。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.2"
msgid "I'd rather swing than poke."
msgstr "比起戳，我更喜欢抡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.1"
msgid "Pointy. My bat's still better."
msgstr "挺尖的。我的球棒还是更好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.2"
msgid "She polishes it more than I do homework."
msgstr "她擦它比我写作业还勤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.1"
msgid "Zappy spear. My hair would frizz."
msgstr "带电的矛，我头发会炸毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.2"
msgid "Like a lightning rod you swing."
msgstr "能挥着玩的避雷针。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.1"
msgid "Snacks stay fresh in here. I like it."
msgstr "零食在里面能放很久。喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.2"
msgid "A school bag, but only for food. Perfect."
msgstr "只装吃的的书包，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.1"
msgid "My bat hits harder with this in me."
msgstr "吃了这个，我的球棒都抡得更狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.2"
msgid "Burns going in. Burns going out. Pass."
msgstr "进去辣，出来也辣。不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.1"
msgid "Smells strong enough to scare monsters."
msgstr "味道冲得能吓跑怪物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.2"
msgid "Eat this and nobody sits next to me. Fine."
msgstr "吃了就没人坐我旁边了。挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.1"
msgid "Makes food stick to your ribs longer."
msgstr "饭吃下去更顶饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.2"
msgid "A pinch. Not a fistful, Warly."
msgstr "一小撮就行。不是一大把，沃利。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.1"
msgid "Sweet stuff makes chores go faster. Kind of."
msgstr "吃点甜的干活快点。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.2"
msgid "Don't tell me it's healthy. I don't care."
msgstr "别跟我说健不健康，我不在乎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.1"
msgid "One bat swing. Too easy."
msgstr "一棒就完事，太简单了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.2"
msgid "Gross. Don't splat on my shoes."
msgstr "恶心，别溅到我鞋上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Eight legs, zero manners."
msgstr "八条腿，零礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Come at me and you get the bat."
msgstr "敢过来就吃我一棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Snoozing. I'd join it if it weren't a spider."
msgstr "在打盹。要不是蜘蛛我也一起睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Shh. Let sleeping spiders lie."
msgstr "嘘，睡着的蜘蛛别惹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.1"
msgid "Webby mess. Someone should clean this."
msgstr "全是网，该有人打扫了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.2"
msgid "Spider apartment. The whole floor is sticky."
msgstr "蜘蛛公寓，地板全是黏的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.1"
msgid "Decorating a spider den. That's a hobby, I guess."
msgstr "给蜘蛛窝装修，也算一种爱好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.2"
msgid "Glitter for spiders. Now I've seen everything."
msgstr "给蜘蛛的亮片，真是什么都见过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.1"
msgid "Squishy. Gross. Webber says it's cute."
msgstr "软乎乎的，好恶心。韦伯说很可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.2"
msgid "A bag of baby spiders. Hard pass."
msgstr "一袋小蜘蛛，绝对不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.1"
msgid "Spider medicine. Sticky."
msgstr "蜘蛛用的药，黏糊糊的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'm not putting that on my scrapes."
msgstr "我才不往伤口上抹这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.1"
msgid "Shoo, spiders. Sadly, it only works for Webber."
msgstr "蜘蛛走开，可惜只有韦伯能用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.2"
msgid "Webber gets all the cool toys."
msgstr "好东西都让韦伯拿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.1"
msgid "Tough guy, huh. Not tough enough."
msgstr "装硬汉是吧。还不够硬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.2"
msgid "Finally. My arms hurt now."
msgstr "总算完了，手都疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Stripes mean trouble. Like a gym teacher."
msgstr "有条纹的就是麻烦，跟体育老师一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Lunging at me? Batter up."
msgstr "扑过来？来，击球手就位。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even the tough ones need naps. Respect."
msgstr "再凶也得午睡，尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Tiptoe past. Quietly."
msgstr "踮着脚过去，小声点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.1"
msgid "Blow this and spiders come running. Nope."
msgstr "一吹蜘蛛就跑过来，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.2"
msgid "Webber's whistle. Like a PE teacher, but for spiders."
msgstr "韦伯的哨子，像体育老师，只不过管蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.1"
msgid "A tornado on a stick. Overkill."
msgstr "棍子上的龙卷风，太夸张了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.2"
msgid "Send a twister and watch. Lazy combat."
msgstr "放个龙卷风看戏，懒人打法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1"
msgid "Steering. Not my strong point."
msgstr "掌舵。不是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Who's driving? Not it."
msgstr "谁来开船？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.1"
msgid "Summer vacation hat. Where's the beach?"
msgstr "暑假帽子，海滩在哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.2"
msgid "Makes me look like a farmer. Whatever."
msgstr "戴着像农民，随便吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.1"
msgid "Dreadstone's heavy. Good thing I'm strong."
msgstr "绝望石很重。还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.2"
msgid "Looks spooky even half-done."
msgstr "才搭一半就很吓人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.1"
msgid "Needs more rocks. Ugh, more carrying."
msgstr "还要更多石头。唉，又要搬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.2"
msgid "Half a pillar holds up half a ceiling, probably."
msgstr "半根柱子大概能撑住半个天花板。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.1"
msgid "Very preppy. Like the student council guys."
msgstr "很乖学生风，像学生会那帮人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.2"
msgid "Makes me feel calmer. Annoying, but true."
msgstr "穿上心情平静点，烦但是真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.1"
msgid "Fishing homework. Lures, bobbers, ugh."
msgstr "钓鱼作业，鱼饵浮漂，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.2"
msgid "Feed it a lure and it teaches me new tricks."
msgstr "给它个鱼饵，它就教我新花样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.1"
msgid "All legs and attitude."
msgstr "全是腿和脾气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.2"
msgid "Big eye, bad temper. Like my homeroom teacher."
msgstr "大眼睛，坏脾气，跟我班主任一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.1"
msgid "Breakfast for three. Or one, if it's me."
msgstr "够三个人吃早饭。是我的话就一个人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.2"
msgid "Keep it warm and it'll hatch. Or just fry it."
msgstr "保温就会孵出来。或者直接煎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.1"
msgid "My bed. My precious bed."
msgstr "我的床。我宝贵的床。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Guess it's sleeping on the ground. Again."
msgstr "看来又要睡地上了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wake me up next season."
msgstr "下个季节再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Sleeping makes me hungry, but it's worth it."
msgstr "睡一觉会饿，但值得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.1"
msgid "Something's wiggling in the swamp. Nope."
msgstr "沼泽里有东西在扭，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.2"
msgid "Spiky and slimy. Hit it from far away."
msgstr "又尖又黏，离远点打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.1"
msgid "Ancient tech for butterflies. Overkill."
msgstr "拿远古科技抓蝴蝶，太夸张。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.2"
msgid "Fancy net. The bugs should feel honored."
msgstr "这么高级的网，虫子该觉得荣幸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.1"
msgid "Weeds turned into medicine. Nice glow-up."
msgstr "杂草变成药，逆袭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.2"
msgid "Heals slowly. Same speed I do homework."
msgstr "慢慢回血，跟我写作业一个速度。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Biggest toad I've ever seen. Gross."
msgstr "见过最大的蛤蟆，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Mushroom hat, sludge face."
msgstr "顶着蘑菇帽，一脸黏液。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.1"
msgid "Now it's really mad. Run!"
msgstr "这下真生气了。跑！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.2"
msgid "Oh great, it's even angrier."
msgstr "好极了，更生气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.1"
msgid "I'd look like a magician. Maybe pull out a rabbit."
msgstr "戴着像魔术师，大概能变出只兔子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.2"
msgid "Keeps me sane, I guess. Still lame."
msgstr "能让我理智点吧，还是很土。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.1"
msgid "Pull a rabbit out and I'll eat it."
msgstr "要是能变出兔子，我就直接吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.2"
msgid "Maxwell's hat. Smells like old stage dust."
msgstr "麦斯威尔的帽子，一股老舞台的灰味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.1"
msgid "Fire on a stick. Classic."
msgstr "棍子上的火，经典款。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.2"
msgid "Better than holding up my phone light."
msgstr "比打手机电筒强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Someone's calling. Ugh, fine, I'm coming."
msgstr "有人在叫。好吧，我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Free ride. Get on before it closes."
msgstr "免费传送。趁它关之前快上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Saves walking. My favorite kind of magic."
msgstr "能省走路。我最喜欢的那种魔法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Sand that moves people. Weirder than a school bus."
msgstr "能把人送走的沙子。比校车还怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.1"
msgid "Electrical doodad. WX probably wants it."
msgstr "电子小玩意，WX大概想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.2"
msgid "Tiny and complicated. Physics class flashbacks."
msgstr "又小又复杂，想起物理课了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.1"
msgid "Rabbits fall for this? Dumb."
msgstr "兔子会上这当？笨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.2"
msgid "Lazy hunting. My favorite kind."
msgstr "躺着打猎，我最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.1"
msgid "Thorns in the ground. Classic prank."
msgstr "地上埋刺，经典恶作剧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.2"
msgid "Step here and it's ouch time."
msgstr "踩上去就要疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.1"
msgid "Chomp. That's gotta hurt."
msgstr "咔嚓，肯定很疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.2"
msgid "Hide it in the grass and wait. Sneaky."
msgstr "藏在草里等着，真阴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.1"
msgid "Bye, everything I hoarded."
msgstr "再见了，我囤的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Should've used the fireproof one. Too late now."
msgstr "早该用防火的那个。现在晚了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Out of sight, out of mind. That's how I clean."
msgstr "眼不见心不烦。我就是这么收拾的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Like my school locker. Don't open it."
msgstr "跟我学校的储物柜一样。别打开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "Stuff more in, organize never."
msgstr "多塞点，永远不用整理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "Bigger stacks, fewer chests. That's math I like."
msgstr "堆得多，箱子少。这种算术我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.1"
msgid "Tree jam. Looks edible. It isn't."
msgstr "树果酱，看着能吃，其实不能。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.2"
msgid "Trees get a growth spurt and I don't. Unfair."
msgstr "树能突然长高，我不能，不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.1"
msgid "A fork for giants. Where's the giant pasta?"
msgstr "巨人的叉子，巨人的意面呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.2"
msgid "Smack the water and stuff explodes. I like it."
msgstr "拍一下水面就炸开，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.1"
msgid "Breezy, and it keeps a little rain off."
msgstr "通风，还能挡点雨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.2"
msgid "Made from a koalefant trunk. Try not to think about it."
msgstr "用考拉象鼻子做的，别多想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.1"
msgid "Puffy and warm. I look like a marshmallow."
msgstr "鼓鼓的，暖和，像个棉花糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.2"
msgid "Could sleep in this thing. Might actually do that."
msgstr "穿着就能直接睡，说不定真会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.1"
msgid "Floor tiles, made to order."
msgstr "地皮现做，按需定制。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.2"
msgid "Terra Firma Tamper. Who names these things?"
msgstr "土地夯实器？谁起的名字啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.1"
msgid "Snaps like my pencil during a test."
msgstr "跟考试时的铅笔一样，一折就断。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.2"
msgid "Stick collecting. Very exciting. Not."
msgstr "捡树枝，好刺激哦。才怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "Better than holding my bag over my head."
msgstr "比把书包顶头上强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "Rain? Bring it."
msgstr "下雨？来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.1"
msgid "Grandpa vibes, but I'll take the speed."
msgstr "很有老爷爷感，但速度我要了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.2"
msgid "Would make a decent bat too."
msgstr "拿来当球棒也凑合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Creepy, but tough. Like a certain senpai I know."
msgstr "很阴森，但很硬。跟我认识的某个学姐一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Holding it gives me goosebumps."
msgstr "拿着就起鸡皮疙瘩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM.1"
msgid "A hay wall. Even the three little pigs knew better."
msgstr "草做的墙。连三只小猪都知道不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM.2"
msgid "Good for one hit, maybe."
msgstr "大概能挡一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM.1"
msgid "Looks like cheese, hits like a rock."
msgstr "看着像奶酪，硬得像石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM.2"
msgid "Even my bat would bounce off this."
msgstr "连我的球棒都会被弹开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM.1"
msgid "Junk wall. Cheaper than a real one."
msgstr "废料墙。比真墙便宜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM.2"
msgid "Stack the trash and call it a wall."
msgstr "垃圾堆起来，就叫墙了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Heavy, but I can carry a whole stack."
msgstr "很重，但我能扛一整摞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Stone wall. Let the hounds chew on this."
msgstr "石墙。让猎犬啃去吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.1"
msgid "Pointy logs. Better than nothing."
msgstr "削尖的木头。总比没有强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.2"
msgid "A wall I could break with one swing."
msgstr "我挥一下就能打烂的墙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.1"
msgid "Old man with darts and dogs. Scary grandpa."
msgstr "带吹箭带狗的老头，可怕的爷爷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.2"
msgid "Nice hat. Mine now."
msgstr "帽子不错，归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.1"
msgid "Scout hat. Very try-hard."
msgstr "童子军帽，很用力的样子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.2"
msgid "Badges and everything. So eager."
msgstr "还有徽章，好积极。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.1"
msgid "Water fight? I'll win."
msgstr "打水仗？我赢定了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.2"
msgid "Good for fires. Better for pranks."
msgstr "能灭火，更适合恶作剧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing but air in here."
msgstr "里面只有空气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Bone dry. Like Wilson's jokes."
msgstr "干巴巴的，跟威尔逊的笑话一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Plants are needier than a class pet."
msgstr "植物比班级宠物还难伺候。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Splish splash. So thrilling."
msgstr "哗啦哗啦，好刺激哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.1"
msgid "A snack I can wear. Can I take a bite?"
msgstr "能戴的零食，能咬一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.2"
msgid "Sticky hair all day. Worth it to stay cool."
msgstr "头发黏一整天，为了凉快也值。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.1"
msgid "Pumps seawater onto fires. Unlimited supply."
msgstr "抽海水灭火。用都用不完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.2"
msgid "Pump, pump, pump. My arms, again."
msgstr "压，压，压。又是我的手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT.1"
msgid "Loud hat for a loud person."
msgstr "吵闹的人戴吵闹的帽子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT.2"
msgid "Wigfrid wears it like a crown."
msgstr "薇格弗德戴得跟王冠似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT.1"
msgid "Too fancy. I'd get mistaken for a class rep."
msgstr "太正式了，会被当成班长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT.2"
msgid "More horns, more glory, more neck pain."
msgstr "角更多，更威风，脖子更酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD.1"
msgid "Block, then bonk. Simple."
msgstr "先挡，再敲。简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD.2"
msgid "Heavy? Not for me."
msgstr "重？对我来说不重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER.1"
msgid "Like the wrapper on a convenience store sandwich."
msgstr "像便利店三明治的包装纸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER.2"
msgid "Crinkly. Good for wrapping bundles."
msgstr "皱巴巴的，用来打包正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Maxwell's diary? No thanks, my sanity's low enough."
msgstr "麦斯威尔的日记？算了，我的理智本来就不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks like homework that bites back."
msgstr "看着像会反咬一口的作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE.1"
msgid "A grave she made for herself. Heavy."
msgstr "她给自己准备的坟，好沉重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE.2"
msgid "Not touching it. That one's hers."
msgstr "我不碰，那是她的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER.1"
msgid "Lucy, does he really eat this?"
msgstr "露西，他真的吃这个？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER.2"
msgid "Chewing on wood is a beaver thing, I guess."
msgstr "啃木头大概是河狸的习惯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE.1"
msgid "Honk. No thanks."
msgstr "嘎。不用了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE.2"
msgid "Looks like a craft project gone wrong."
msgstr "像手工课做砸了的作品。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE.1"
msgid "Big antlers. Bigger appetite, probably."
msgstr "角好大，饭量估计更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE.2"
msgid "Eat that and you'd punch like me."
msgstr "吃了就能跟我一样会揍人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHIP.1"
msgid "Snap! Okay, that's kinda fun."
msgstr "啪！好吧，有点好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WHIP.2"
msgid "Made of cat tails. Kinda harsh, honestly."
msgstr "用猫尾巴做的，说实话有点狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A claw machine, but for sunken treasure."
msgstr "抓娃娃机，不过抓的是沉在海底的宝贝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Why dive when a machine can do it."
msgstr "机器能捞，干嘛要潜水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM.1"
msgid "Got something. Please be food."
msgstr "抓到东西了。拜托是吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM.2"
msgid "It's just dangling there. Go grab it."
msgstr "就吊在那儿。去拿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.1"
msgid "Cranking, cranking. My arm's getting tired."
msgstr "摇啊摇。手都酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.2"
msgid "Something's coming up. Hope it's not a monster."
msgstr "有东西上来了。希望不是怪物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.1"
msgid "Gems don't burn, but everything else does!"
msgstr "宝石不怕火，别的可都怕！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Fire! Grab the gems and run!"
msgstr "着火了！抢了宝石快跑！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.1"
msgid "Expensive charcoal."
msgstr "好贵的一堆炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.2"
msgid "Hope somebody pulled the gems out first."
msgstr "希望有人先把宝石拿出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Eats gems for breakfast. Fancy."
msgstr "早饭吃宝石，真讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It glows a little. Kinda pretty, actually."
msgstr "还会微微发光，其实挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.1"
msgid "The gem's nearly used up."
msgstr "宝石快耗完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.2"
msgid "Running on fumes. Same as me before lunch."
msgstr "快撑不住了，跟我午饭前一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.1"
msgid "Needs a gem to wake up."
msgstr "得放颗宝石才能叫醒它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.2"
msgid "Just sitting there. Like me in first period."
msgstr "就这么杵着，跟我第一节课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.1"
msgid "It's sparking! I'm not touching that."
msgstr "在冒火花！我才不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.2"
msgid "Unplug something before it blows!"
msgstr "快拔掉点什么，别炸了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.1"
msgid "The battery's burning, that can't be good!"
msgstr "电池在烧，这肯定不妙！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.2"
msgid "A wooden generator. Great idea, Winona."
msgstr "木头做的发电机，好主意啊薇诺娜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.1"
msgid "All that nitre, gone up in smoke."
msgstr "那么多硝石，全烧没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.2"
msgid "Can't even power a flashlight now."
msgstr "现在连手电筒都带不动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Feed it nitre and it keeps humming."
msgstr "喂点硝石，它就一直嗡嗡响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hums like the classroom fridge."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，跟教室的冰箱一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.1"
msgid "It's getting sleepy. I know the feeling."
msgstr "它快没劲了，我懂这种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.2"
msgid "Somebody toss in more nitre."
msgstr "谁再往里塞点硝石。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.1"
msgid "Dead quiet. Like class after a pop quiz."
msgstr "安静得像突击小测后的教室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.2"
msgid "Empty. Needs a refill."
msgstr "空了，得补燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.1"
msgid "Winona's gonna yell at someone for this!"
msgstr "薇诺娜肯定要骂人了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.2"
msgid "Guess it's attacking itself now!"
msgstr "这下它开始打自己了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Toast. Crispy, useless toast."
msgstr "烤焦了，又脆又没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Guess I'm the camp guard again."
msgstr "看来又得我来看营地了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It throws rocks so I don't have to swing."
msgstr "它扔石头，我就不用挥球棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Decent aim. Better than the school baseball team."
msgstr "准头不错，比学校棒球队强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.1"
msgid "Needs electricity, just like my phone."
msgstr "跟我手机一样，离不开电。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.2"
msgid "Just a pile of wood and rocks now."
msgstr "现在就是一堆木头和石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "Sleeping on duty? Same."
msgstr "站岗还睡觉？我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "Nothing to shoot, so it's napping."
msgstr "没东西打，就打盹了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.1"
msgid "Fully charged. Let's go."
msgstr "满电了，走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.2"
msgid "Good to go. Point and press."
msgstr "可以了，对准按就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.1"
msgid "Give it a sec."
msgstr "等它一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.2"
msgid "Not yet. Patience, apparently."
msgstr "还没好，看来得有点耐心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Winona's remote. Better than a TV remote."
msgstr "薇诺娜的遥控器，比电视遥控器好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bossing machines around from far away. Nice."
msgstr "隔老远指挥机器，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.1"
msgid "Dead. Click click, nothing."
msgstr "没反应，咔哒咔哒白按。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.2"
msgid "Batteries not included, huh."
msgstr "原来不送电池啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.1"
msgid "That's way too much light!"
msgstr "这光也太亮过头了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.2"
msgid "Who set the lamp on fire?!"
msgstr "谁把灯点着了？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Just a black stick now."
msgstr "现在就剩一根黑棍子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Back to tripping in the dark."
msgstr "又要摸黑摔跤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It follows me around like a stage spotlight."
msgstr "它会跟着我照，跟舞台追光似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Great, now the dark can't sneak up on me."
msgstr "好，这下黑暗里的东西偷袭不了我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "A lamp with no power is just furniture."
msgstr "没电的灯就是个摆设。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "Somebody plug it in already."
msgstr "谁快去给它接上电。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "Daytime. Nobody needs it now."
msgstr "白天，用不着它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "Resting its eyes. Smart lamp."
msgstr "闭目养神，这灯挺聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.1"
msgid "Full battery. More energy than me."
msgstr "满电了，比我有精神。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.2"
msgid "Okay, go tidy up. I'll supervise."
msgstr "好，去收拾吧，我负责监督。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.1"
msgid "Charging. Take your time, really."
msgstr "充着吧，真的不急。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.2"
msgid "Even robots need a break. Respect."
msgstr "机器人也要歇着，有道理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A robot that tidies up for me. Best invention ever."
msgstr "替我收拾东西的机器人，最棒的发明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Tidier than my room will ever be."
msgstr "比我房间整齐多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.1"
msgid "Passed out. Relatable."
msgstr "累趴了，能理解。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.2"
msgid "Poor thing, ran out of juice."
msgstr "可怜，没电了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "Shh, it's napping."
msgstr "嘘，它在打盹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "Lucky. I want a nap too."
msgstr "真好，我也想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.1"
msgid "Umbrella express, all set."
msgstr "雨伞快线，准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.2"
msgid "Charged. Zip, and I'm there."
msgstr "充好了，嗖一下就到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.1"
msgid "Still charging. I'll just stand here."
msgstr "还在充，我就站这儿等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.2"
msgid "Not ready. My legs are crying."
msgstr "还没好，我的腿在哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "An umbrella that teleports? Rain's the least of it."
msgstr "能传送的伞？挡雨反倒是次要的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Open it and poof, no walking. I love it."
msgstr "一撑开就不用走路，我爱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.1"
msgid "Just a normal umbrella now. Lame."
msgstr "现在就是把普通伞，没劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.2"
msgid "Dead battery. Guess I'm walking."
msgstr "没电了，看来只能走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.1"
msgid "Fire! Don't teleport into that!"
msgstr "着火了！别往那儿传！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.2"
msgid "Great, now it's a barbecue pad."
msgstr "好嘛，现在成烧烤台了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt to a crisp. Walking it is."
msgstr "烧成渣了，只能走路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.2"
msgid "Teleport onto ashes? No thanks."
msgstr "传送到一堆灰上？不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Plop it down and I never walk this way again."
msgstr "往这一放，以后再也不用走这段路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A shortcut pad. Lazy people's best friend."
msgstr "近路垫子，懒人最好的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.1"
msgid "Needs electricity before it'll take me anywhere."
msgstr "得先通电才能带我走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.2"
msgid "Stepped on it. Nothing happened."
msgstr "踩上去了，什么也没发生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.1"
msgid "Pom-pom on top. Don't laugh."
msgstr "顶上有绒球，不许笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.2"
msgid "Cozy. Makes me want to sleep."
msgstr "暖和得想睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.1"
msgid "It finally felt the heat itself."
msgstr "这下它自己也感受到热度了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.2"
msgid "Last reading: way too hot. Then nothing."
msgstr "最后的读数：太热了。然后就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Red means sweat, blue means hug the fire."
msgstr "红的就流汗，蓝的就抱着火堆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A thermometer. Like the nurse's office, minus the day off."
msgstr "温度计。跟医务室一样，就是不能请假。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.1"
msgid "Smells tasty. I'm not that hungry. Yet."
msgstr "闻着挺香。我还没饿到那份上。暂时。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.2"
msgid "Dog snacks. Hands off, Shino."
msgstr "狗零食。手拿开，忍乃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.1"
msgid "Tweet. Ugh, I hate that sound."
msgstr "哔，烦，我讨厌这个声音。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.2"
msgid "Blow it near me and you're dead, Wolfgang."
msgstr "敢在我旁边吹，沃尔夫冈你就完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.1"
msgid "A wooden helmet. Heavy but tough."
msgstr "木头头盔，重但结实。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.2"
msgid "Harder than my head. Barely."
msgstr "比我脑袋硬。勉强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A mouth in the ground. Nope."
msgstr "地上长了张嘴。不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is it breathing? It's breathing."
msgstr "它在喘气？它在喘气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.1"
msgid "Okay, it's open. Holding my nose."
msgstr "好，开了。捏着鼻子进。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.2"
msgid "Shortcut. Worth the slime, barely."
msgstr "近路。勉强值得一身黏液。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.1"
msgid "A grabby bag. Very imp of him."
msgstr "抓东西的袋子，很有小恶魔风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.2"
msgid "Wortox's sack. Bet it's full of stolen snacks."
msgstr "沃托克斯的袋子，里面估计全是偷来的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.1"
msgid "Wortox's fur. Kinda fluffy, kinda creepy."
msgstr "沃托克斯的毛，毛茸茸的，有点瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.2"
msgid "Wish my hair was that useful."
msgstr "要是我的头发也这么有用就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.1"
msgid "Souls in a jar. Like a snack jar, but wrong."
msgstr "罐子里装灵魂，像零食罐，就是不太对劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.2"
msgid "Don't shake it. Something's floating in there."
msgstr "别晃，里面有东西在飘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Glowy swamp stuff. Too sparkly for mud."
msgstr "发光的沼泽玩意儿，泥巴不该这么闪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR.2"
msgid "Moon gunk. Don't spill it on my uniform."
msgstr "月亮黏糊，别洒我校服上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Feels like it's staring back. Rude."
msgstr "感觉它在回瞪我，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Dark swamp goo. Why's it in your pocket?"
msgstr "黑乎乎的沼泽泥，干嘛揣兜里？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.1"
msgid "It's a thing. That's all I've got."
msgstr "是个东西。我就知道这么多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks boring. Like most things."
msgstr "看着很无聊，跟大多数东西一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.1"
msgid "Happy plant. Good for you."
msgstr "开心的植物，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.2"
msgid "Look at it thriving. Unlike me in math class."
msgstr "长得真欢，跟数学课上的我完全不同。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.1"
msgid "Something's bugging it. Ugh, gotta figure out what."
msgstr "有什么在困扰它，呃，还得查原因。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.2"
msgid "Looks like me on a Monday morning."
msgstr "看着跟周一早上的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.1"
msgid "It's lonely. Needs a few buddies of the same kind."
msgstr "它很孤单，需要几个同类伙伴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.2"
msgid "Even plants hate eating lunch alone."
msgstr "连植物都讨厌一个人吃午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.1"
msgid "It wants attention. Like a needy underclassman."
msgstr "它想被关注，跟黏人的学弟一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll chat with you. Don't expect much."
msgstr "好吧，跟你聊几句，别期待太多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.1"
msgid "Weeds crowding it. Time for some bat weeding."
msgstr "杂草挤着它，该用球棒除草了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.2"
msgid "Those weeds are bullying it."
msgstr "那些杂草在欺负它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.1"
msgid "It's thirsty. I'm thirsty too, honestly."
msgstr "它渴了。说实话我也渴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.2"
msgid "Dry as a textbook. Needs water."
msgstr "干得像课本，要浇水了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.1"
msgid "It's starving too. I get that."
msgstr "它也饿着，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.2"
msgid "Needs some manure. Not touching it bare-handed."
msgstr "需要点粪肥，我可不空手碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.1"
msgid "Packed like a train at rush hour."
msgstr "挤得像高峰期的电车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.2"
msgid "Too many neighbors. Give it some space."
msgstr "邻居太多了，给它点空间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.1"
msgid "Wrong season. It's sulking."
msgstr "季节不对，它在闹脾气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.2"
msgid "Planted at the wrong time. My bad."
msgstr "种错时间了，怪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.1"
msgid "Yikes, it's having a total meltdown."
msgstr "哎呀，它彻底崩溃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.2"
msgid "Poor thing's miserable. Lots of problems at once."
msgstr "可怜的家伙，问题一大堆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.1"
msgid "Smoking. Stomp it out before it goes up."
msgstr "冒烟了，趁没烧起来踩灭它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.2"
msgid "Smells like burnt toast. Uh oh."
msgstr "有烤焦吐司的味道，糟了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.1"
msgid "Can't see a thing. Could be anything."
msgstr "什么都看不见，可能是任何东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.2"
msgid "I'm not squinting in the dark. Light, please."
msgstr "我才不在黑暗里眯眼看，给点光。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.1"
msgid "That was crunchy. Eggs shouldn't be crunchy."
msgstr "嘎嘣脆的，蛋不该是脆的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.2"
msgid "Don't think about it. Just swallow."
msgstr "别想了，咽下去就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1"
msgid "Sweet and warm. Okay, I like this one."
msgstr "又甜又暖，好吧，这个我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2"
msgid "Mm, holiday flavor. Got seconds?"
msgstr "嗯，节日的味道，还有第二份吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.1"
msgid "That big mouth's furious. We failed."
msgstr "那张大嘴气炸了，我们挂科了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.2"
msgid "Should've cooked faster. Or napped less."
msgstr "该做快点的。或者少睡点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.1"
msgid "Charcoal special. Nobody's eating that."
msgstr "木炭特供，谁也不会吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.2"
msgid "Oops. I looked away for one second."
msgstr "哎呀，我就移开眼睛一秒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE.1"
msgid "That's just a pot of random junk."
msgstr "这就是一锅乱七八糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_NOTRECIPE.2"
msgid "Even I wouldn't eat that, and I eat anything."
msgstr "连我都不吃，我可是什么都吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN.1"
msgid "It's full! Time to go home and sleep."
msgstr "它吃饱了！回家睡觉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_WIN.2"
msgid "Passed. Barely, but passed."
msgstr "及格了，勉强也算及格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "It moved. I'm not imagining it."
msgstr "它动了。不是我的错觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "Hey, statues are supposed to stay still."
msgstr "喂，雕像就该老实站着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Creepy statue. Keeping my bat ready."
msgstr "诡异的雕像，球棒先备着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feels like it's staring at me. Rude."
msgstr "感觉它在盯着我，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.1"
msgid "A test with no teacher. Can I skip it?"
msgstr "没有老师的考试，能逃吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.2"
msgid "Trials, exams, same thing. I hate both."
msgstr "试炼和考试一个样，我都讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.1"
msgid "A trophy for doing chores? Sure."
msgstr "干杂活也有奖杯？行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.2"
msgid "Achievements. Like a report card, but nicer."
msgstr "成就，像成绩单，不过友好一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.1"
msgid "Squirrels would fight me for this."
msgstr "松鼠会为了这个跟我打架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.2"
msgid "A tiny tree wearing a hat. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "戴帽子的小树，算可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.1"
msgid "Crunchy. Needs salt."
msgstr "脆脆的，缺点盐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.2"
msgid "One bite and it's gone. Need ten more."
msgstr "一口就没了，还要十个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Grow faster. I'm not watching all day."
msgstr "长快点，我可不会盯一整天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.2"
msgid "The little guy's trying. More than I can say for me."
msgstr "小家伙挺努力，比我强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.1"
msgid "A door to nowhere good. Pass."
msgstr "通往不妙地方的门，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Looks like Maxwell's taste in decor."
msgstr "一看就是麦斯威尔的装修品味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.1"
msgid "Too bright. I can't nap with this on."
msgstr "太亮了，戴着没法睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.2"
msgid "A crown? Do I look like a class president?"
msgstr "王冠？我看起来像班长吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.1"
msgid "Pretty. Could use it as a hair clip."
msgstr "挺好看，拿来当发卡也行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.2"
msgid "A bit of some celestial whatever. Still sparkly."
msgstr "什么天体的碎片，反正亮晶晶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.1"
msgid "Stuck in a cage. Like me in homeroom."
msgstr "被关着，跟我在班会上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.2"
msgid "Serves it right for being so annoying."
msgstr "谁让它那么烦人，活该。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.1"
msgid "Down already? It's coming back, isn't it."
msgstr "倒了？它还会回来的吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.2"
msgid "Break time. Short one, probably."
msgstr "休息时间，估计很短。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A giant rolling rock. I'll bat it back."
msgstr "滚来滚去的大石头，我给它打回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stop rolling around! I'm getting dizzy."
msgstr "别滚了！我都晕了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.1"
msgid "This again? Did it get a power-up?"
msgstr "又是这家伙？还升级了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.2"
msgid "Like a retake exam, but harder."
msgstr "像补考，还更难了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.1"
msgid "The big glowy one. Found it."
msgstr "那个发光的大家伙，找到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.2"
msgid "So this is the boss of all the glowy ghosts."
msgstr "原来它就是那些发光幽灵的老大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.1"
msgid "Down again. Please stay down."
msgstr "又倒了，拜托别再起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.2"
msgid "Two rounds. My arms are noodles."
msgstr "打了两轮，胳膊都软成面条了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Now it has spikes? That's cheating."
msgstr "现在还长刺？犯规。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Round two. Somebody get me a drink."
msgstr "第二轮，谁给我拿瓶水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.1"
msgid "Pointy. My shoes won't survive this."
msgstr "尖尖的，我的鞋扛不住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.2"
msgid "A spike garden. Nobody asked for that."
msgstr "长了一地的刺，谁要啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.1"
msgid "Third form? Very final boss."
msgstr "第三形态？很有大魔王的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.2"
msgid "Floating and glowing. Show-off."
msgstr "又飘又发光，显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.1"
msgid "Is it actually done? Poke it with the bat."
msgstr "真的结束了？拿球棒戳戳看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.2"
msgid "Quiet. Too quiet. I don't trust it."
msgstr "安静了，太安静了，我不信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.1"
msgid "Glowing ball of leftovers. Not touching it."
msgstr "一团发光的残渣，我不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.2"
msgid "It's still buzzing. Like a broken fridge."
msgstr "还在嗡嗡响，像坏掉的冰箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.1"
msgid "A trap that makes you sleepy? Honestly, tempting."
msgstr "让人犯困的陷阱？说实话，有点诱人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.2"
msgid "Must stay awake. Just like math class."
msgstr "一定要醒着，跟上数学课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.1"
msgid "Fourth form?! Who designed this fight?"
msgstr "第四形态？！谁设计的这场仗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.2"
msgid "Fine. I'll swing until it stops getting up."
msgstr "行，我打到它起不来为止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.1"
msgid "Wear it and dying becomes optional. Nice."
msgstr "戴着它，死不死都能商量。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.2"
msgid "A fancy necklace with a second-chance feature."
msgstr "带复活功能的项链，挺高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.1"
msgid "Drop it and the boat stays put. Like me in bed."
msgstr "抛下去船就不动了，跟赖床的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.2"
msgid "Heavy. I could probably throw it, though."
msgstr "很重。不过我大概能扔出去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.1"
msgid "A gem fruit. Bet it breaks teeth."
msgstr "宝石果子，咬一口牙就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.2"
msgid "Shiny fruit I can't eat. Unfair."
msgstr "亮晶晶的果子却不能吃，不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.1"
msgid "Twitching. Food shouldn't twitch."
msgstr "它在抽动。食物不该抽动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.2"
msgid "Looks like an eyeball. Nope."
msgstr "长得像眼珠子，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooked. Smells... edible, I guess."
msgstr "熟了，闻着……大概能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll eat it. With my eyes closed."
msgstr "行吧，我吃。闭着眼吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tree that grows gems. Money trees are real."
msgstr "长宝石的树，摇钱树原来是真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If I shake it hard enough, will gems fall?"
msgstr "使劲摇一摇，会掉宝石吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.1"
msgid "Nothing left to take. Moving on."
msgstr "没东西可拿了，走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.2"
msgid "Sad stump. It did its best."
msgstr "可怜的树桩，它尽力了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "This tree gives me the creeps. The branches twitch."
msgstr "这棵树让我发毛，树枝还会抽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feels like it's watching me in the dark."
msgstr "感觉它在黑暗里盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.1"
msgid "Just a stump. Finally it stopped staring."
msgstr "只剩树桩，总算不盯着我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.2"
msgid "Nothing left but roots. Fine by me."
msgstr "只剩树根了，我无所谓。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grow up already. I did, kinda."
msgstr "快长大吧，我都长大了，算是吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A baby tree. Probably older than me anyway."
msgstr "一棵小树苗，说不定比我年纪还大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.1"
msgid "It's waiting for its season. Like me and summer break."
msgstr "它在等对的季节，跟我等暑假一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.2"
msgid "Not its time. It's hibernating, like me."
msgstr "还没到时候，它跟我一样在冬眠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.1"
msgid "It hates this soil. Picky tree."
msgstr "它讨厌这块土，挑剔的树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.2"
msgid "Wrong ground. I don't want to dig it up again, though."
msgstr "地方不对。但我不想再挖一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.1"
msgid "A tree in my pocket. Weird."
msgstr "口袋里揣着一棵树，怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.2"
msgid "Plant it somewhere fancy. It's an antique."
msgstr "种个讲究的地方，它可是老古董。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.1"
msgid "Mystery seed. Could be a gem tree. Could be nothing."
msgstr "神秘种子，也许是宝石树，也许什么都不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.2"
msgid "Big seed. Bet it takes forever."
msgstr "种子这么大，肯定要长很久。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.1"
msgid "Ancient science. Older than my teacher, even."
msgstr "古代科学，比我们老师还老。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.2"
msgid "Glowing away. Somebody forgot to turn it off."
msgstr "还亮着，谁忘了关。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.1"
msgid "Broken. Did I do that? No? Good."
msgstr "坏了。是我弄的？不是？那就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.2"
msgid "Needs fixing. I'm not the fixing type."
msgstr "得修一下，我不是会修东西的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.1"
msgid "Something lived here once. Now it's just a shell."
msgstr "这里以前住过什么，现在只剩个壳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.2"
msgid "Creepy husk. Don't wake it up."
msgstr "诡异的空壳，别把它吵醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.1"
msgid "Ancient art. Looks like a bad dream."
msgstr "古代艺术品，像一场噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.2"
msgid "Who carved this? They needed a better hobby."
msgstr "谁雕的？该找点别的爱好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.1"
msgid "Footprints. Probably something tasty."
msgstr "脚印，大概是好吃的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.2"
msgid "Somebody walked here. Not me, I'd have sat down."
msgstr "有谁走过这里。不是我，我会坐下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.1"
msgid "Tiny fish with legs. Absolutely not."
msgstr "长腿的小鱼，绝对不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.2"
msgid "Smells like the sea and bad decisions."
msgstr "一股大海和馊主意的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.1"
msgid "Maybe the big sandy lady wants it."
msgstr "那位沙子大姐说不定想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.2"
msgid "An old toy. Somebody's childhood, gone."
msgstr "旧玩具，某人的童年没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.1"
msgid "Library guard. Shhh, I'm about to hit you."
msgstr "图书馆保安。嘘，我要揍你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.2"
msgid "Big metal bug. Bat's ready."
msgstr "金属大虫子，球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.1"
msgid "Out of batteries. Good."
msgstr "没电了，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.2"
msgid "Just a pile of parts now."
msgstr "现在就是一堆零件。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Ancient pot, ancient ashes."
msgstr "古代的锅，古代的灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Nothing to cook in now. My stomach's crying."
msgstr "没锅做饭了，肚子在哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "Slow cooker. Wake me when it's done."
msgstr "慢炖锅，好了叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "Taking forever. I'll go count the floor tiles."
msgstr "慢死了，我数地砖去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "Smells close. Get the bowls."
msgstr "闻着快好了，拿碗来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Just a sec. Don't stir it, I'm starving."
msgstr "再等一下，别搅了，我饿死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.1"
msgid "Food's ready! Ancient cooking, let's go."
msgstr "饭好了！古代料理，开吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.2"
msgid "Done. Somebody taste it first. Not me."
msgstr "做好了，谁先尝一口。别找我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Empty. The ancients ate everything too."
msgstr "空的，古人也吃光了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Clean it out and cook something. Later."
msgstr "清理干净再做饭吧。待会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.1"
msgid "A box of knowledge. Like a textbook, but locked."
msgstr "一盒知识，像上了锁的课本。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.2"
msgid "Could I just smash it open?"
msgstr "能直接砸开吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A knowledge vending machine. Got any snacks?"
msgstr "知识自动售货机。有零食吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Press it and something comes out. Hopefully."
msgstr "按一下会掉东西出来。但愿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "Out of order. Like every vending machine at school."
msgstr "坏了，跟学校的售货机一个德行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "Find the power first. Ugh."
msgstr "先找电源。唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.1"
msgid "More moon stuff. They were obsessed."
msgstr "又是月亮的东西，他们是真着迷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.2"
msgid "Moon fans. Like Louis with her katanas."
msgstr "月亮迷，跟路易斯迷武士刀一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.1"
msgid "A music puzzle. I failed recorder in grade school."
msgstr "音乐谜题。我小学竖笛都没及格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.2"
msgid "Gotta get the order right. I hate memorizing."
msgstr "顺序得对。我最讨厌背东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big ring, no show. Disappointing."
msgstr "这么大的环，什么都不发生，失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Maybe it just needs a kick."
msgstr "也许踹一脚就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "Dead portal. Nobody's going anywhere."
msgstr "门坏了，谁也去不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "Dusty and silent. Like the school library."
msgstr "灰扑扑又安静，跟学校图书馆一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It points the way. The lazy way to hunt treasure."
msgstr "它在指路，最省事的寻宝方法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Beeping means close, right? I'm guessing."
msgstr "响了就是近了吧？我猜的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.1"
msgid "Nothing here. Pick it up and move."
msgstr "这里没了，拿起来换地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.2"
msgid "It's done searching. So am I."
msgstr "它不找了，我也不找了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.1"
msgid "Ancient writing. Still neater than my notes."
msgstr "古代文字，还是比我的笔记好认。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.2"
msgid "Looks important. I'll pretend I understood."
msgstr "看着很重要，我假装看懂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.1"
msgid "Squiggles everywhere. Maybe it's a menu."
msgstr "到处都是弯弯绕绕，也许是菜单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom could read this. Not me."
msgstr "薇克巴顿能看懂，我不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.1"
msgid "More carvings. My eyes are closing."
msgstr "又是雕刻，我眼皮在打架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.2"
msgid "Is there a summary? A short one?"
msgstr "有没有总结？短点的那种？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.1"
msgid "These symbols are giving me a headache."
msgstr "这些符号看得我头疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.2"
msgid "If this is a test, I'm turning in a blank."
msgstr "要是考试，我交白卷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.1"
msgid "Last one. I didn't read any of them."
msgstr "最后一块，我一块都没读。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.2"
msgid "That's enough reading for a lifetime."
msgstr "这辈子的字都看完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A security desk. I've dodged hall monitors before."
msgstr "保安台啊，风纪委员我都躲过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feels like it's going to tell on me."
msgstr "感觉它要去告老师。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "Nobody's guarding. Perfect for sneaking."
msgstr "没人看守，正好溜进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "Even guards get breaks. Lucky."
msgstr "保安也能休息，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.1"
msgid "A floating light. Chasing it sounds tiring."
msgstr "飘着的光，追起来好累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.2"
msgid "It's leading somewhere. Hope it's lunch."
msgstr "它在带路，希望是去吃饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.1"
msgid "Empty slot. Needs something shiny."
msgstr "空槽，需要亮晶晶的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.2"
msgid "A gem goes here. Hope I didn't trade it away."
msgstr "宝石放这里。希望我没拿去换东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.1"
msgid "Click. That's the sound of success."
msgstr "咔哒，成功的声音。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.2"
msgid "It's glowing. Did I actually solve something?"
msgstr "亮了，我居然解开了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.1"
msgid "Ancient armor. Like a really sturdy cardigan."
msgstr "古代护甲，像件特别结实的开衫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.2"
msgid "Protects well. Doesn't match my skirt, though."
msgstr "防护很好，就是跟裙子不搭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.1"
msgid "Rattles when I walk. Very spooky. Very loud."
msgstr "走路咔咔响，很吓人，也很吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.2"
msgid "Somebody's ribs, now my armor. Sorry."
msgstr "某人的肋骨，现在是我的盔甲。抱歉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.1"
msgid "A shell to hide in during roll call."
msgstr "点名的时候能躲进去的壳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.2"
msgid "Slow and safe. My kind of lifestyle."
msgstr "又慢又安全，我喜欢的生活方式。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.1"
msgid "The longer I fight, the faster I go. Neat."
msgstr "打得越久跑得越快，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.2"
msgid "Clanky armor. Everyone will hear me skipping class."
msgstr "叮叮当当的，逃课全被听见了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.1"
msgid "Wearing carrots. The rabbits are gonna stare."
msgstr "身上挂着胡萝卜，兔子们会盯着看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.2"
msgid "I smell like a salad now. Great."
msgstr "我现在一身沙拉味。真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "Plant armor. Wormwood, is this your cousin?"
msgstr "植物护甲。沃姆伍德，这是你亲戚？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "Leafy armor that glows. Fashion, sort of."
msgstr "会发光的叶子护甲，算是时尚吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.1"
msgid "Wearing rocks. My shoulders are complaining."
msgstr "穿着石头，肩膀在抗议。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.2"
msgid "Go ahead, hit me. I dare you."
msgstr "来打我啊，尽管来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "Wearing nothing but shadows. Sounds edgy."
msgstr "身上只穿着影子，听着好中二。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "Feels like it's wearing me, not the other way around."
msgstr "感觉是它在穿我，不是我穿它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.1"
msgid "Knight armor. Do I have to joust now?"
msgstr "骑士盔甲，现在要去比武吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.2"
msgid "Clanky. Everyone will hear me coming."
msgstr "哐哐响，谁都能听见我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.1"
msgid "Now it points to nowhere."
msgstr "现在不知道指向哪了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burnt sign. Guess I'm lost."
msgstr "牌子烧了，看来我迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Follow the arrow. Or don't. I'm not your mom."
msgstr "跟着箭头走。不走也行，我又不是你妈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody thought ahead. Not me."
msgstr "有人提前想好了，不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "Blank sign. I'll draw a cat."
msgstr "空白的牌子，我画只猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "Just write \"this way.\" Done."
msgstr "写个“这边”就完事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.1"
msgid "It used to point somewhere. Now it points at nothing."
msgstr "以前指着个方向，现在什么也不指了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.2"
msgid "No more directions. Guess I'm wandering."
msgstr "没方向了，那就随便逛吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "An arrow. Even I can follow that."
msgstr "一个箭头，连我都看得懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That way, huh. Is there food that way?"
msgstr "往那边啊，那边有吃的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "Points somewhere, but where?"
msgstr "指着个方向，可到底去哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "An arrow with no destination. Kinda like my future plans."
msgstr "没写目的地的箭头，跟我的人生规划一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.1"
msgid "Asparagus. It's like a green pencil."
msgstr "芦笋，像根绿色铅笔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.2"
msgid "Warly could make this taste good. I can't."
msgstr "沃利能把它做得好吃，我不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.1"
msgid "Green soup. Needs meat. Lots of it."
msgstr "绿色的汤，得加肉，很多肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.2"
msgid "Healthy. Which means not filling."
msgstr "很健康，也就是说吃不饱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.1"
msgid "Roasted asparagus. Still tastes like grass."
msgstr "烤芦笋，还是一股草味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.2"
msgid "Soft now. I'll pretend it's fries."
msgstr "软了，我就当它是薯条。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "This could be a bat. A sad green bat."
msgstr "这都能当球棒了，可怜的绿球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Giant asparagus. Who's eating all this?"
msgstr "巨型芦笋，谁吃得完？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Seeds. Long road to dinner."
msgstr "种子，离晚饭还远着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant these and wait. Sounds boring."
msgstr "种下去然后等，听着就无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.1"
msgid "It's humming. Something big's coming."
msgstr "在嗡嗡响，有大东西要来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.2"
msgid "Charging up. Unlike me in the morning."
msgstr "在充能，不像我早上那样没电。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Resting. Smart gate."
msgstr "在休息，聪明的门。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Out of juice. Come back later."
msgstr "没劲了，过会再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "It's shaking! Run, don't walk!"
msgstr "在晃！快跑，别磨蹭！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "Uh oh. This place is falling apart."
msgstr "糟了，这地方要塌了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.1"
msgid "A giant door to nowhere. Classic."
msgstr "通往哪儿都不知道的大门，真经典。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.2"
msgid "Probably needs some kind of key. Ugh, homework."
msgstr "大概要什么钥匙吧。烦，又是作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.1"
msgid "Glowing like that, it's practically begging us."
msgstr "亮成这样，简直在求我们进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.2"
msgid "Okay, it's on. Somebody else go first."
msgstr "好，开了。谁先进去，反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.1"
msgid "Bad feeling. Really bad. Bat's ready, though."
msgstr "感觉很不妙。不过球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.2"
msgid "Everything's shaking. I didn't sign up for this."
msgstr "到处都在晃。我可没报名参加这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.1"
msgid "Heavy for a key. What's it open, a castle?"
msgstr "钥匙也这么沉。开城堡的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.2"
msgid "Looks like something I'd lose in a day."
msgstr "这种东西我一天就能弄丢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "Dark. Perfect for a nap, honestly."
msgstr "黑漆漆的，说实话挺适合睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "Someone forgot to pay the electric bill."
msgstr "有人忘交电费了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.1"
msgid "Creepy lamp. Who picked this decor?"
msgstr "好阴森的灯。谁选的装修风格？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.2"
msgid "It's bright, but not the good kind of bright."
msgstr "是亮了，但亮得不太对劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.1"
msgid "Worse than my English textbook."
msgstr "比我的英语课本还难懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.2"
msgid "Maybe Wickerbottom can read it. I'll pass."
msgstr "薇克巴顿也许看得懂。我就算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Squishy. Why is it squishy."
msgstr "软趴趴的。为什么是软的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Took it off the big bat. Doesn't mean I like it."
msgstr "从大蝙蝠身上拿的，不代表我喜欢它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "There. My part's done, can I sit down?"
msgstr "好了，我的份做完了，能坐下吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Placed it. If something explodes, not my fault."
msgstr "放上去了。要是爆炸可不怪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rock lobster claw. Wonder if it tastes like crab."
msgstr "石虾的钳子。不知道有没有螃蟹味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Heavy, but I've carried worse. Like my school bag."
msgstr "挺沉，不过我背过更沉的，比如书包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "In place. One less thing to carry."
msgstr "放好了，又少拿一样东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Claw's in. Hurry up and do the magic part."
msgstr "钳子放进去了。快点施法吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Slimy worm bits. My hands will never be clean again."
msgstr "黏糊糊的虫子碎块，我的手再也洗不干净了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Whoever needs this, take it already."
msgstr "谁要这个，赶紧拿走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "Worm part's in. Going to wipe my hands now."
msgstr "虫子那块放好了，我去擦手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Okay, that's set. Wake me when it starts."
msgstr "好，放好了。开始了再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.1"
msgid "Hungry and scared. That's me right before lunch."
msgstr "又饿又怕，跟我午饭前一模一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.2"
msgid "Everyone's so skinny in this picture. Bad harvest, probably."
msgstr "画里的人都好瘦，大概是收成不好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.1"
msgid "Totally faded. Like my notes after the rain."
msgstr "全褪色了，像我淋过雨的笔记。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.2"
msgid "Can't tell. Skip to the next page."
msgstr "看不出来，翻下一页吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.1"
msgid "Black stuff everywhere. Looks like nightmare fuel."
msgstr "到处都是黑乎乎的，像是噩梦燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.2"
msgid "So the whole city got swallowed. Great."
msgstr "整座城都被吞了啊。真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.1"
msgid "Took their skin off? Gross. Moving on."
msgstr "把皮脱了？好恶心，看下一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.2"
msgid "Changed inside, huh. Bet they regretted it."
msgstr "里面变了啊，肯定后悔了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.1"
msgid "Built all this and still lost it. Kinda sad."
msgstr "建了这么多还是没了，有点惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.2"
msgid "That's a lot of work. I would've skipped."
msgstr "这得多费劲啊。换我就翘掉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.1"
msgid "Creepy statue. Not touching it."
msgstr "诡异的雕像，不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.2"
msgid "Its face keeps changing. Or am I just sleepy?"
msgstr "它的脸一直在变。还是我太困了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fluffy little thing. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "毛茸茸的小家伙。别跟别人说是我说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Small now. Give it a year and it'll stink."
msgstr "现在还小，过一年就臭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Sleeping right out in the open. I respect that."
msgstr "就地睡觉，我很欣赏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Lucky. I want a nap too."
msgstr "真好命，我也想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.1"
msgid "Proper breakfast. I'd actually wake up for this."
msgstr "像样的早饭，为这个我愿意起床。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.2"
msgid "Crispy bacon. Nobody touch my plate."
msgstr "培根脆脆的。谁都别碰我的盘子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.1"
msgid "A great yokai's sword? Way too dramatic."
msgstr "大妖怪的刀？也太中二了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.2"
msgid "My bat never needs sharpening. Just saying."
msgstr "我的球棒从来不用磨，随便说说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.1"
msgid "Just one more hand. Then sleep. Probably."
msgstr "再打一把就睡。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.2"
msgid "Jokers, chips, multipliers. Better than math class."
msgstr "小丑、筹码、倍率，比数学课有意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.1"
msgid "A whole bush of bananas. Snack time."
msgstr "一整丛香蕉，零食时间到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.2"
msgid "Hope the monkeys don't get here first."
msgstr "希望别被猴子抢先。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.1"
msgid "Sweet and thick. Beats the vending machine stuff."
msgstr "又甜又浓，比自动贩卖机的强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.2"
msgid "One more glass, please. Two, actually."
msgstr "再来一杯。不，两杯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.1"
msgid "Ice pop on a stick. Summer's saved."
msgstr "带棍的冰棍，夏天有救了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.2"
msgid "Brain freeze. Worth it."
msgstr "脑袋冻住了。值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.1"
msgid "Little rocks with legs inside. No thanks."
msgstr "里面带腿的小石头，不了谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.2"
msgid "Scrape it off the boat, sure. Eat it? Hmm."
msgstr "从船上刮下来可以，吃？再说吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.1"
msgid "Hide it in bread and I won't ask questions."
msgstr "藏进饼里我就不追问了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.2"
msgid "Kinda like a convenience store wrap."
msgstr "有点像便利店的卷饼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.1"
msgid "The fish is looking at me. Stop it."
msgstr "这鱼在看我。别看了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.2"
msgid "Who thought stuffing a head was a good idea?"
msgstr "谁想出来往鱼头里塞东西的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.1"
msgid "Sushi's sushi. I'll eat it."
msgstr "寿司就是寿司，我吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.2"
msgid "Pretty fancy for something scraped off a boat."
msgstr "从船底刮下来的，倒弄得挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Chewy. Like an eraser that tastes like the sea."
msgstr "嚼着像一块海水味的橡皮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll eat it. Don't look at me."
msgstr "行吧，我吃。别看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.1"
msgid "Warly's being fancy again. Not complaining."
msgstr "沃利又讲究起来了，我不抱怨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.2"
msgid "Twirl, slurp, gone. Next plate."
msgstr "卷一卷，吸一口，没了。下一盘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.1"
msgid "Even I can't punch through that. Annoying."
msgstr "连我都打不穿，真烦人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.2"
msgid "Huge rock, zero chance. Forget it."
msgstr "这么大块石头，没戏，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells like bat. Big bat."
msgstr "一股蝙蝠味。还是大蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's make noise somewhere else."
msgstr "要吵去别处吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.1"
msgid "Empty. Guess it went out shopping."
msgstr "空的，估计出去买东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.2"
msgid "Nobody home. Can I nap in here?"
msgstr "没人在家。我能在里面睡会儿吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.1"
msgid "Bats sleep all day. My kind of animal."
msgstr "蝙蝠白天都在睡，跟我是一类。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.2"
msgid "One sneeze and they'll all come out."
msgstr "打个喷嚏它们就全出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.1"
msgid "Hot springs plus this? I'm not getting out."
msgstr "温泉加这个？我不出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.2"
msgid "Smells like candy. I know, don't eat it."
msgstr "闻着像糖，我知道，不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.1"
msgid "A nose. Just a nose. Why."
msgstr "一个鼻子。就一个鼻子。为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.2"
msgid "It's still kind of twitching."
msgstr "它好像还在抽动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.1"
msgid "Milk on your head. Wolfgang would love this."
msgstr "头顶喝奶，沃尔夫冈肯定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.2"
msgid "Wearing this to class would get me suspended."
msgstr "戴这个上课会被停学的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Grilled nose. The menu here is insane."
msgstr "烤鼻子。这里的菜单太离谱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells fine. Looks terrible."
msgstr "闻着还行，看着太糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.1"
msgid "Leathery. Like a cheap school bag."
msgstr "皮皮的，像个劣质书包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.2"
msgid "Bat wing. Sounds like a witch's shopping list."
msgstr "蝙蝠翅膀，像女巫的购物清单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.1"
msgid "Kinda like chicken wings. Kinda."
msgstr "有点像鸡翅。就一点点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.2"
msgid "Crispy. I'll pretend it's from a food stall."
msgstr "脆脆的，就当是路边摊买的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.1"
msgid "Now it's spitting acid? So unfair."
msgstr "现在还吐酸液？太赖皮了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.2"
msgid "Don't let that stuff touch my uniform."
msgstr "别让那玩意沾到我的校服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Finally, a bat bigger than mine."
msgstr "终于碰到比我的球棒还大的蝙蝠了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Flapping that much must be exhausting."
msgstr "扇成那样，不累吗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.1"
msgid "Wearing a dead bat. Fashion's weird here."
msgstr "头戴死蝙蝠，这里的时尚真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.2"
msgid "If it starts flapping, I'm throwing it."
msgstr "它要是扇起来，我就扔掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Went all shadowy. Classic second phase."
msgstr "变成影子了，经典的第二阶段。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Darker and angrier. Same as me in the morning."
msgstr "更黑更暴躁，跟我早上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.1"
msgid "Wilson shaved again, didn't he."
msgstr "威尔逊又刮胡子了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.2"
msgid "Fluffy and gross at the same time."
msgstr "又蓬松又恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Barbecue nobody's gonna eat."
msgstr "没人要吃的烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Fire's big enough to roast marshmallows."
msgstr "这火够大，可以烤棉花糖了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Finally lying down. Should've done that sooner."
msgstr "总算躺下了，早该这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Big fluffy carpet. Way too smelly, though."
msgstr "好大一张毛地毯，就是太臭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Hey, stay dead. No overtime allowed."
msgstr "喂，死透一点。不许加时。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Twitching again. Bats out, everyone."
msgstr "又在抽动了。都把球棒拿出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.1"
msgid "A fridge made of fur. My snacks will love it."
msgstr "毛做的冰箱，我的零食会喜欢的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.2"
msgid "It's cold inside. Can I sleep in there too?"
msgstr "里面凉凉的，我能钻进去睡吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "A sewing pattern for cows. Seriously."
msgstr "给牛做衣服的纸样。认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Home ec homework, beefalo edition."
msgstr "家政课作业，皮弗娄牛版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.1"
msgid "The old crab lady's gonna be upset."
msgstr "螃蟹奶奶要伤心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like burnt honey. Not even the good kind."
msgstr "一股烧焦的蜂蜜味，还不是好闻的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.1"
msgid "Packed with honey. Can I lick the lid?"
msgstr "满满的蜂蜜。能舔盖子吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.2"
msgid "Ask her first. I'm not getting yelled at."
msgstr "先问她，我可不想挨骂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Neat little box. She keeps it nice."
msgstr "小箱子挺整洁，她打理得好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Buzzing nonstop. Do bees never get tired?"
msgstr "一直嗡嗡响，蜜蜂都不累吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.1"
msgid "Empty. The bees are slacking off like me."
msgstr "空的。蜜蜂跟我一样在偷懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.2"
msgid "Come back later. Or never."
msgstr "晚点再来，或者不来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.1"
msgid "Honey's ready. My toast is ready too."
msgstr "蜂蜜好了，我的吐司也准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.2"
msgid "Full. Grab it before the bees change their minds."
msgstr "满了。趁蜜蜂没反悔赶紧拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.1"
msgid "A little bit in there. Tempting."
msgstr "里面有一点，有点心动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.2"
msgid "Half full. Like my attention span."
msgstr "装了一半，跟我的注意力差不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.1"
msgid "Grass bricks. A cow lunchbox."
msgstr "草砖头，牛的便当。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.2"
msgid "I'm hungry, but not that hungry."
msgstr "我是饿，但没饿到这个份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.1"
msgid "Cow candy. Don't tempt me."
msgstr "牛的糖果，别诱惑我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.2"
msgid "Feed it to the beefalo before I eat it."
msgstr "趁我还没吃，快拿去喂牛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "Warm, scratchy, and smelly. Two out of three ain't bad."
msgstr "暖和、扎人、还臭。三样占两样好的，不算差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "Could make a decent pillow out of this."
msgstr "能拿来做个不错的枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.1"
msgid "No more beefalo makeovers. The beefalo's relieved."
msgstr "没得给牛打扮了，牛松了口气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like barbecue. Sadly, no meat."
msgstr "闻着像烤肉，可惜没肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A beauty salon for beefalo. Seriously?"
msgstr "给牛开的美容院，认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Empty. Bring a model in."
msgstr "空着呢，牵个模特来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "Hold still, big guy. This won't take long. Maybe."
msgstr "别动，大块头，很快就好。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "Fancy hat for the beefalo? Sure, why not."
msgstr "给牛戴个花帽子？行啊，为啥不。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.1"
msgid "A beauty salon for cows. Sure."
msgstr "给牛开的美容院，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.2"
msgid "Setting this up is more work than brushing my own hair."
msgstr "装这个比梳我自己的头发还费劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.1"
msgid "Ring it and the beefalo's mine. Easier than making friends."
msgstr "一摇铃牛就归我了，比交朋友容易。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.2"
msgid "Sounds like the school bell. I hate it already."
msgstr "跟上课铃一个声，已经开始讨厌了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.1"
msgid "Calm down, I'm not here for your queen. Mostly."
msgstr "冷静点，我不是冲你们女王来的。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.2"
msgid "Chubby bees with an attitude."
msgstr "脾气很差的胖蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.1"
msgid "Mosquitoes in a jar. Who even does that."
msgstr "罐子里装蚊子，谁会干这种事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.2"
msgid "Maxwell's prank in a jar. So like him."
msgstr "装在罐子里的恶作剧，真像麦斯威尔干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Giant lump of honey. Don't lick it."
msgstr "一大坨蜂蜜，别舔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something's sleeping under there. Something big."
msgstr "下面有东西在睡。很大的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.1"
msgid "Growing again. Can't it take a break?"
msgstr "又在长了，不能歇会儿吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.2"
msgid "Give it a few days and it's a problem again."
msgstr "再过几天又是个麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.1"
msgid "That's a whole apartment building of bees."
msgstr "那是一整栋楼的蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.2"
msgid "Hit it and the queen comes out. I'll wait."
msgstr "一打它女王就出来，我先等等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.1"
msgid "Smells like honey. Don't let me lick it."
msgstr "闻着像蜂蜜，别让我舔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.2"
msgid "Spray it on and things stop rotting. Can it do my homework?"
msgstr "喷一下就不坏了。能喷作业吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.1"
msgid "Horns and a shell? Pick one, buddy."
msgstr "又有角又有壳？你选一个吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.2"
msgid "Biggest beetle I've ever seen. Bat's ready."
msgstr "见过最大的甲虫，球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.1"
msgid "Sounds like the school bell. Is class over?"
msgstr "像下课铃。放学了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.2"
msgid "Ring it next to my ear and you're dead."
msgstr "在我耳边摇你就完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Go get 'em, Bernie. I'll watch."
msgstr "上吧，伯尼，我在旁边看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.2"
msgid "A teddy bear doing my job. Nice."
msgstr "泰迪熊在替我干活，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.1"
msgid "Whoa, Bernie hit a growth spurt."
msgstr "哇，伯尼长高了一大截。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.2"
msgid "Big enough to give me a piggyback. Can it?"
msgstr "大到能背我了。能吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm berries. Weird, but I'm into it."
msgstr "热乎乎的浆果，有点怪，但我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.2"
msgid "One handful isn't enough. Got more?"
msgstr "一把根本不够，还有吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.1"
msgid "Super juicy. I don't care if it drips on my skirt."
msgstr "汁好多，滴到裙子上我也不在乎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.2"
msgid "These spoil fast. Good thing I eat faster."
msgstr "这个坏得快，好在我吃得更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.1"
msgid "Jam on its own? Hand me a spoon."
msgstr "单吃果酱？给我勺子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.2"
msgid "Needs toast. Or pancakes. Or both."
msgstr "得配吐司。或者松饼。或者都要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.1"
msgid "Coconut rice cake. Warly's spoiling us."
msgstr "椰香米糕，沃利太惯着我们了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.2"
msgid "Smells like a bakery. Hands off, it's mine."
msgstr "闻着像面包店。别动，是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.1"
msgid "Where's the rest of it? Actually, don't tell me."
msgstr "剩下的身体在哪？算了，别告诉我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.2"
msgid "That's one huge shoe size."
msgstr "这鞋码可真大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.1"
msgid "Angry little nuts. Batting practice time."
msgstr "生气的小坚果，正好练击球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.2"
msgid "They bite? Nuts aren't supposed to bite."
msgstr "还咬人？坚果不应该咬人吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Overcooked chicken. Very overcooked."
msgstr "烤过头的鸡。非常过头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Burn faster. My nose can't take it."
msgstr "烧快点，我鼻子受不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Poor thing. Okay, let's go."
msgstr "怪可怜的。好了，走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Don't poke it with my bat."
msgstr "别用我的球棒戳它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "No no no. Birds don't come back."
msgstr "不不不，鸟可不会复活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Something's crawling into it. Gross!"
msgstr "有东西钻进去了，恶心！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.1"
msgid "Sunny side up. My morning's saved."
msgstr "太阳蛋，我的早上有救了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Tiny egg. I need like five."
msgstr "这么小，得来五个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.1"
msgid "Its eyes are glowing. Not a normal bird."
msgstr "眼睛在发光，不是正常的鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.2"
msgid "A crow with a moon problem."
msgstr "得了月亮病的乌鸦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.1"
msgid "Spitting at people? Rude."
msgstr "朝人吐口水？没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.2"
msgid "Hit it before it spits again."
msgstr "趁它没再吐，先打它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.1"
msgid "A chess piece that shoots. How is that fair?"
msgstr "会开枪的棋子，这公平吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.2"
msgid "I never liked chess anyway."
msgstr "反正我本来就不喜欢下棋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.1"
msgid "Zapped. Now my hair's sticking up."
msgstr "被电了，头发都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.2"
msgid "That stung. Well, I'm awake now."
msgstr "好麻。这下彻底醒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "Rusty and angry. Like my old bike."
msgstr "又锈又凶，像我那辆旧自行车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "Somebody take this thing to a repair shop."
msgstr "谁把这东西送去修一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.1"
msgid "Skull and bones. Kinda cool, not gonna lie."
msgstr "骷髅加骨头，说实话挺酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.2"
msgid "Monkeys love this flag. Bad sign."
msgstr "猴子最喜欢这面旗，不是好兆头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.1"
msgid "Fire darts. Don't blow the wrong way."
msgstr "火焰飞镖，别吹反了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.2"
msgid "Fighting without moving. I like it."
msgstr "站着不动就能打，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.1"
msgid "Molten darts. Spicy."
msgstr "熔岩飞镖，够辣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.2"
msgid "Takes too much breath. I'd rather swing."
msgstr "太费气了，我宁愿挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.1"
msgid "Like a cold drink hanging on my neck."
msgstr "像脖子上挂了瓶冰饮料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.2"
msgid "Freezes whoever hits me, too. Serves them right."
msgstr "谁打我还会被冻住，活该。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.1"
msgid "Pretty. Could trade it for snacks."
msgstr "挺好看，能拿去换零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.2"
msgid "Hold it on your forehead in summer. Trust me."
msgstr "夏天贴在额头上，信我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "It's always watching. Kinda creepy."
msgstr "它一直盯着，有点吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "Like a pin on a map. A staring pin."
msgstr "像地图上的图钉，会盯人的图钉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.1"
msgid "Paper with instructions. Homework again."
msgstr "带说明的纸，又是作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.2"
msgid "I'll read it. Later. Maybe."
msgstr "会看的。晚点。也许吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.1"
msgid "Fancy paper. Probably something good."
msgstr "纸都这么讲究，应该是好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.2"
msgid "Rare stuff. Feels like a lucky gacha pull."
msgstr "稀有货，像抽卡抽到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooked blue mushroom. Way better than it looks."
msgstr "煮熟的蓝蘑菇，比看起来好吃多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Weird taste. Weirdly addictive."
msgstr "味道很怪，怪得让人上瘾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.1"
msgid "Tiny pig, big attitude."
msgstr "小猪个子小，脾气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.2"
msgid "Charge at me and you're a home run."
msgstr "敢冲过来就打你个全垒打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.1"
msgid "Too big to be bacon. Too mean, too."
msgstr "大到做不成培根，脾气也太坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.2"
msgid "Can we just forfeit? No? Fine."
msgstr "能弃权吗？不能？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.1"
msgid "Somebody steered like an idiot."
msgstr "有人开船太离谱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.2"
msgid "Good firewood now, at least."
msgstr "至少能当柴火了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.1"
msgid "Wood floating around. Free stuff."
msgstr "漂着的木头，白捡的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.2"
msgid "Wasn't me. I wasn't steering."
msgstr "不是我，我没掌舵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.1"
msgid "Another boat bites the dust."
msgstr "又一艘船完蛋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.2"
msgid "Kinda sad, honestly. Just a little."
msgstr "说实话有点难过。就一点点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.1"
msgid "Checkpoint. Like a school stamp rally."
msgstr "检查点，像学校的集章活动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.2"
msgid "Do I get a snack for passing it?"
msgstr "过了这里有零食吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "Checkpoints. Like attendance, but on water."
msgstr "检查点，像点名，只是在水上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "Throw it. Hope it lands somewhere sensible."
msgstr "扔出去，希望落在合理的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.1"
msgid "That monkey's cheating. I can feel it."
msgstr "那只猴子在作弊，我感觉得到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.2"
msgid "Racing a monkey. My life has peaked."
msgstr "跟猴子赛船，我的人生到顶了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.1"
msgid "A rock in the way. Of course."
msgstr "路中间一块石头，果然。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.2"
msgid "Steer around it. Or I'll punch it."
msgstr "绕过去。不然我一拳打碎它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.1"
msgid "Monkey rocks. Bet they're stuffed with bananas."
msgstr "猴子的石头，里面肯定塞满香蕉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.2"
msgid "They put these here on purpose. Petty."
msgstr "故意放这儿的，真小心眼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "Throw it in their way. Very sportsmanlike."
msgstr "扔到别人前面，真有体育精神。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "Sabotage in a box. I like it."
msgstr "装在盒子里的捣乱工具，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "Throw a rock in the sea. Instant obstacle."
msgstr "往海里扔块石头，障碍物就有了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "Hope nobody crashes into this. Okay, I kinda hope."
msgstr "希望没人撞上。好吧，其实有点期待。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.1"
msgid "A cheer squad of one. Cute."
msgstr "一个人的啦啦队，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.2"
msgid "Keep flapping. Maybe I'll win."
msgstr "继续扇翅膀，说不定我能赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.1"
msgid "Ready, set... can I go home?"
msgstr "预备，跑……能回家吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.2"
msgid "Starting line. Sports day flashbacks."
msgstr "起跑线，想起运动会了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "Toss it in the water and that's the start. Lazy setup, I like it."
msgstr "往水里一扔就是起点，偷懒的设置，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "The race begins here. My nap ends here."
msgstr "比赛从这开始，我的午觉到这结束。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "An old box. Hope nothing's living in it."
msgstr "旧箱子，希望里面没住着东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "Plenty of room. My snacks are going in here."
msgstr "空间很大，零食都塞这里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.1"
msgid "Built by ancient people. And it still floats?"
msgstr "古代人造的，还能浮起来？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Looks like a museum piece. Can we ride it?"
msgstr "像博物馆展品，能坐吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.1"
msgid "Made from the Crab King. Crunchy armor."
msgstr "用帝王蟹做的，脆脆的护甲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.2"
msgid "Crash all you want now. Kidding."
msgstr "现在随便撞了。开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.1"
msgid "Crab shell bumpers. Fancy."
msgstr "蟹壳保险杠，挺高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.2"
msgid "Set it up and I can steer badly in peace."
msgstr "装好就能安心乱开船了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.1"
msgid "Seaweed padding. Smells like miso soup."
msgstr "海带垫子，闻着像味噌汤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.2"
msgid "Squishy. Like a cheap pillow."
msgstr "软软的，像便宜的枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.1"
msgid "Seashells on the boat. Beach vibes."
msgstr "船边挂贝壳，海滩风。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.2"
msgid "Hard edges. Don't scrape my knees."
msgstr "边上硬邦邦的，别刮到我膝盖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.1"
msgid "Dragon-themed bumper. Very festive."
msgstr "龙主题的保险杠，很有节日气氛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.2"
msgid "Bump into rivals. Totally legal."
msgstr "撞对手，完全合法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.1"
msgid "Bumpers. For when I crash. Which I will."
msgstr "防撞垫，给我撞船时用。我肯定会撞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.2"
msgid "Soft edges for the boat. Smart."
msgstr "给船装软边，聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.1"
msgid "Ready to fire. Point it at the monkeys."
msgstr "可以开炮了，对准猴子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.2"
msgid "One pull and boom. Easy."
msgstr "一拉就砰，简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A cannon on a boat. Pirate stuff."
msgstr "船上的大炮，海盗风。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Empty. Can I just throw rocks with it?"
msgstr "空的。能用它扔石头吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.1"
msgid "Empty again. Who's on ammo duty?"
msgstr "又空了。谁负责装弹？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.2"
msgid "Guess I'll swing the bat instead."
msgstr "那我只好挥球棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.1"
msgid "Water's coming in. My socks!"
msgstr "进水了，我的袜子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.2"
msgid "Hole in the boat. Not my fault this time."
msgstr "船漏了，这次不怪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "We're being pulled. No rowing, nice."
msgstr "被拉着走了，不用划，好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "Magnet's working. I can nap now."
msgstr "磁铁起作用了，我可以睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big magnet. Keep the crowbar away from it."
msgstr "大磁铁，撬棍离远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Science homework, but actually useful."
msgstr "物理作业，不过真有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.1"
msgid "Louis's surfboard. My balance isn't that good."
msgstr "露易丝的冲浪板，我平衡没那么好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.2"
msgid "One wave and I'm swimming."
msgstr "一个浪我就得游泳了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.1"
msgid "Spins the boat. Don't make me dizzy."
msgstr "转船的，别把我转晕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.2"
msgid "Less steering for me. Great."
msgstr "我少掌点舵，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "Like hugging a beefalo. Minus the grunting."
msgstr "像抱着皮弗娄牛，只是不会哼哼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "Fluffy. Kinda stinky. Still comfy."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，有点臭，但还是舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.1"
msgid "Cuddling seaweed. Wurt might like it."
msgstr "抱着海带睡，沃特可能会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.2"
msgid "Squishy and damp. Hard pass."
msgstr "软塌塌湿乎乎，坚决不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.1"
msgid "Big flowery hug pillow. Nap time."
msgstr "花瓣大抱枕，午睡时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.2"
msgid "Soft and fragrant. I'm not sharing."
msgstr "又软又香，我不分给别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "Scratchy. My face would hate me."
msgstr "扎人，我的脸会恨我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "A hug pillow that hugs back. With splinters."
msgstr "会回抱你的抱枕，还附带扎刺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "A bomb that bursts into light. Pretty, then painful."
msgstr "炸开是光的炸弹，先好看后疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "Throw it far. Then farther."
msgstr "扔远点，再远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.1"
msgid "A plant bomb. Wormwood, are you okay?"
msgstr "植物炸弹。沃姆伍德，你还好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.2"
msgid "Glowing seed bomb. Throw it far."
msgstr "发光的种子炸弹，扔远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.1"
msgid "Crunchy bits. Don't ask whose."
msgstr "碎渣渣，别问是谁的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.2"
msgid "Hard as my homeroom teacher's heart."
msgstr "跟我班主任的心一样硬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.1"
msgid "Hot soup. I'll drink it slowly. Kidding, it's gone."
msgstr "热汤，我慢慢喝。开玩笑的，喝完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.2"
msgid "Smells rich. Probably simmered forever."
msgstr "闻着好浓，肯定炖了很久。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.1"
msgid "Big bowl of meat. Nap time right after."
msgstr "一大碗肉，吃完正好午睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.2"
msgid "Stew this thick counts as three meals."
msgstr "这么浓的炖肉，够顶三顿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.1"
msgid "Summons rock monsters? Who writes books like this."
msgstr "能召唤石头怪？谁写这种书。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.2"
msgid "Too thick. I'd use it as a pillow."
msgstr "太厚了，我拿来当枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.1"
msgid "Turns enemies to stone. Do teachers have one?"
msgstr "能把敌人变成石头。老师也有一本吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.2"
msgid "Petrify them, then whack them. Simple."
msgstr "先石化，再一棒，简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.1"
msgid "Read it and plants grow? Lazy farming."
msgstr "读一下植物就长？懒人种田。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom's farming cheat sheet."
msgstr "薇克巴顿的种田小抄。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.1"
msgid "Where's the other one? Somebody's hopping."
msgstr "另一只呢？有人在单脚跳吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.2"
msgid "Smells like the sea. And feet."
msgstr "一股海水味，还有脚臭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.1"
msgid "Broke already? Cheap stuff."
msgstr "这就坏了？质量真差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.2"
msgid "Wasn't me. Okay, maybe it was me."
msgstr "不是我弄的。好吧，可能是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.1"
msgid "Cracked. Even volcano tools give up."
msgstr "裂了，连火山工具都撑不住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.2"
msgid "Too lazy to fix it. Someone else?"
msgstr "我懒得修，换个人？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.1"
msgid "Brushing a beefalo's hair. My hair's jealous."
msgstr "给牛梳毛，我的头发都要嫉妒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.2"
msgid "The beefalo's enjoying it. Lucky guy, getting pampered."
msgstr "牛还挺享受，有人伺候真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Free seaweed. Pull it up."
msgstr "免费的海带，拔起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Swaying like a ponytail."
msgstr "飘得像马尾辫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.1"
msgid "Somebody beat me to it."
msgstr "有人先下手了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.2"
msgid "Bald now. Give it some time."
msgstr "秃了，等它长回来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.1"
msgid "Stick it in the ocean and forget about it."
msgstr "插进海里就不用管了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.2"
msgid "Looks like a sad noodle."
msgstr "像一根没精神的面条。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.1"
msgid "Wrapped up nice. Like a present."
msgstr "包得挺好，像礼物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.2"
msgid "Don't remember what's inside. Surprise."
msgstr "不记得里面是啥了，惊喜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.1"
msgid "Don't tell the bunnymen."
msgstr "别让兔人知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.2"
msgid "Warm and meaty. Dinner's sorted."
msgstr "热乎乎有肉，晚饭解决了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.1"
msgid "Crispy spiky bush. Still not touching it."
msgstr "烧脆的刺丛，还是别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.2"
msgid "Who set the swamp on fire? Willow?"
msgstr "谁放火烧的沼泽？薇洛？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.1"
msgid "Butter from butterflies. Don't think about it."
msgstr "蝴蝶掉出来的黄油，别细想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.2"
msgid "Rare stuff. Saving it for a fancy breakfast."
msgstr "稀罕东西，留着做一顿好早饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.1"
msgid "Wings in a muffin? The cafeteria's served worse."
msgstr "松饼里有翅膀？食堂做过更糟的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.2"
msgid "Looks normal. That's what worries me."
msgstr "看着挺正常，所以才担心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.1"
msgid "Bald bird with bad manners."
msgstr "没毛又没礼貌的鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.2"
msgid "Circling like a hall monitor."
msgstr "转来转去，像纪律委员。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Roasted buzzard. Nobody's eating that."
msgstr "烤秃鹫，没人会吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Smoke's in my eyes. Ugh."
msgstr "烟进眼睛了，烦死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Finally stopped circling."
msgstr "总算不转圈了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Lying in the sun. Not the good kind of tanning."
msgstr "躺着晒太阳，不是那种日光浴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Hey! Dead things stay down!"
msgstr "喂！死了就老实躺着！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Glowing now? That can't be good."
msgstr "现在还发光？肯定不是好事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.1"
msgid "Leaves hiding meat. Sneaky, I like it."
msgstr "菜叶子里藏肉，狡猾，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.2"
msgid "Like a cabbage burrito. More, please."
msgstr "像卷心菜卷饼，再来点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.1"
msgid "A pink flower on a spiky jerk. Cute."
msgstr "带刺的家伙开了朵粉花，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.2"
msgid "Edible too? Even better."
msgstr "还能吃？那更好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.1"
msgid "Spiky snack. My mouth already hurts."
msgstr "带刺的零食，我嘴已经疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.2"
msgid "Eating this raw is a punishment game."
msgstr "生吃这个是惩罚游戏吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "No more spikes. Tastes kinda like cucumber."
msgstr "刺没了，吃着有点像黄瓜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Cool and juicy. Good for hot days."
msgstr "清凉多汁，天热正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.1"
msgid "Sushi! Finally, real food."
msgstr "寿司！终于有正经吃的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.2"
msgid "Seaweed, rice, fish. Perfect bento."
msgstr "海苔、米饭、鱼，完美便当。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Chirpy little thing. Too cheerful for me."
msgstr "叽叽喳喳的，对我来说太开朗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Sings in the morning? We can't be friends."
msgstr "早上唱歌？那我们做不了朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.1"
msgid "So soft. I'm being super gentle, see?"
msgstr "好软。我很轻的，看到没？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.2"
msgid "Hold still. I won't crush you, promise."
msgstr "别动。我保证不会捏扁你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.1"
msgid "Poor thing's wheezing. The cave air's bad."
msgstr "可怜的小家伙在喘，洞里空气不好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.2"
msgid "Hang in there, bird. Don't die on me."
msgstr "撑住啊，小鸟。别死在我手上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.1"
msgid "Trick or treat. Mostly treat, please."
msgstr "不给糖就捣蛋。最好是给糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.2"
msgid "The bag's big. My appetite's bigger."
msgstr "袋子很大，我的胃口更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Confetti everywhere. Who's cleaning this up?"
msgstr "到处都是彩纸，谁来扫？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Taking a breather? Same, cannon. Same."
msgstr "在歇气啊。我懂，大炮，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Party cannon. Shoots fun, apparently."
msgstr "派对礼炮，据说发射的是快乐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Loud and colorful. Like the school festival."
msgstr "又吵又花哨，像学园祭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.1"
msgid "\"Some assembly required.\" My least favorite words."
msgstr "“需要组装”，我最讨厌的四个字。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.2"
msgid "Box says easy setup. Liar."
msgstr "盒子上写安装简单，骗人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.1"
msgid "Colorful flags. Very festival."
msgstr "彩旗，很有节日感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.2"
msgid "Hang it up and call it decorating. Done."
msgstr "挂上去就算布置完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.1"
msgid "Hanging banners. Last time was the school festival."
msgstr "挂彩旗，上次弄这个还是学园祭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.2"
msgid "Someone else can climb up. I'll hand stuff over."
msgstr "爬高的让别人来，我负责递东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.1"
msgid "Tiny ride. Too small for me, sadly."
msgstr "迷你游乐设施，可惜我坐不下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.2"
msgid "Spinning eggs. Now I want breakfast."
msgstr "转圈的蛋，看得我想吃早饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.1"
msgid "Mystery box. Please be something good."
msgstr "盲盒，求求出个好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.2"
msgid "Shake it. Hmm, sounds like plastic."
msgstr "摇一摇。嗯，听着像塑料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Same one again. The gacha hates me."
msgstr "又是同一个，扭蛋讨厌我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Common. It's going at the back of the shelf."
msgstr "普通款，放架子最后面吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.1"
msgid "A rare one! Okay, I'm a little happy."
msgstr "稀有款！好吧，我有点开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.2"
msgid "Nobody touch it. It's going on my desk."
msgstr "谁都别碰，放我桌上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.1"
msgid "Kinda rare. I'll pretend I'm not excited."
msgstr "有点稀有，我假装不激动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.2"
msgid "Better than a duplicate. Barely."
msgstr "比重复的强。就强一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.1"
msgid "Blind boxes. Where all my allowance goes."
msgstr "盲盒啊，零花钱就是这么没的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.2"
msgid "Shake it first. Feels like a common one."
msgstr "先摇一摇，感觉是普通款。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.1"
msgid "Second series. Same old trick to take my tokens."
msgstr "第二弹，还是老一套骗我的代币。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.2"
msgid "If it's the same one again, I'm smashing the box."
msgstr "要是又开出一样的，我就把盒子砸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3.1"
msgid "Third series already? My shelf is full."
msgstr "都第三弹了？我架子都摆满了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3.2"
msgid "There's a secret rare in here, I can feel it. Probably not."
msgstr "里面肯定有隐藏款，我能感觉到。大概没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP.1"
msgid "Cute lamp. Like a festival lantern."
msgstr "可爱的灯，像庙会的灯笼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP.2"
msgid "Glows soft. Good light for napping."
msgstr "光很柔，适合睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT.1"
msgid "Lanterns are nice. Assembling them isn't."
msgstr "灯笼挺好看，装起来就不好玩了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT.2"
msgid "It'll be pretty at night. If I'm still awake."
msgstr "晚上会很好看。前提是我还醒着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT.1"
msgid "Even this plant has a better schedule than me."
msgstr "这盆草的作息都比我规律。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT.2"
msgid "Put it by the window. Classroom vibes."
msgstr "摆窗边吧，教室同款。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT.1"
msgid "Fake plant. Never dies. Perfect roommate."
msgstr "假花，永远不会死，完美室友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT.2"
msgid "A potted plant that doesn't need watering. My kind of plant."
msgstr "不用浇水的盆栽，很适合我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA.1"
msgid "Corn in tea. Who thought of that?"
msgstr "茶里放玉米，谁想出来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA.2"
msgid "Drink and snack in one cup. Efficient."
msgstr "一杯里有喝有吃，效率高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD.1"
msgid "Looks like worms. Not stealing a bite, promise."
msgstr "看着像虫子。放心，我不偷吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD.2"
msgid "Bird snacks. Why do they eat better than me."
msgstr "鸟零食。凭什么它们吃得比我好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT.1"
msgid "Feeding hungry chicks. I relate to them."
msgstr "喂饥饿的小鸟，我太懂它们了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT.2"
msgid "Throwing worms into mouths. Gross, but fun."
msgstr "往嘴里扔虫子，有点恶心，但好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST.1"
msgid "Lots of hungry mouths in one little box."
msgstr "小小一个窝，全是饿肚子的嘴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST.2"
msgid "Baby birds are always yelling for food. Relatable."
msgstr "小鸟一直喊饿，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Paying to feed birds. What a scam."
msgstr "花钱喂鸟，这不是坑人吗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "No token, no birdies. Harsh."
msgstr "没代币就没小鸟，真狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Open wide. Yeah, you too."
msgstr "张嘴。对，你也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Who's hungry? Everyone. Got it."
msgstr "谁饿了？全都饿了，懂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL.1"
msgid "Tiny ball. My bat could send it to the moon."
msgstr "这么小的球，我一棒能打上月亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL.2"
msgid "If I lose this, we're playing without it."
msgstr "要是弄丢了，就当没这个球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB.1"
msgid "A bat for people who hate running."
msgstr "给懒得跑的人用的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB.2"
msgid "Swinging gently is harder than swinging hard."
msgstr "轻轻挥比用力挥还难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY.1"
msgid "Design my own course? Feels like homework."
msgstr "自己设计场地？跟写作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY.2"
msgid "I'll put every hole downhill. Problem solved."
msgstr "我把每个洞都放在下坡，问题解决。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY.1"
msgid "Mini golf? I'll just swing like it's baseball."
msgstr "迷你高尔夫？我当棒球打就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY.2"
msgid "Beginner course. Even I can't mess this up."
msgstr "新手场地，我应该也不会打砸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD.1"
msgid "Hard mode. I'll just swing harder."
msgstr "困难模式，用力打就是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD.2"
msgid "If the ball breaks, it's the course's fault."
msgstr "球要是打碎了，算场地的错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM.1"
msgid "Middle difficulty. My favorite place to coast."
msgstr "中等难度，最适合我混过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM.2"
msgid "A few obstacles. I'll hit right through them."
msgstr "有点障碍，硬打过去就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT.1"
msgid "A cardboard bird blocking me. Rude."
msgstr "纸板鸟挡我路，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT.2"
msgid "Want me to just hit through it?"
msgstr "要不我直接打穿过去？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN.1"
msgid "Nice breeze, though. Maybe I'll nap here."
msgstr "风倒挺舒服，在这儿睡一觉算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN.2"
msgid "Who brings a fan to mini golf?"
msgstr "谁会在迷你高尔夫里放风扇啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE.1"
msgid "A fence. I could jump it, but the ball can't."
msgstr "围栏而已，我能跳，球可不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE.2"
msgid "Detours in a game too? Like the walk to school."
msgstr "游戏里也要绕路？跟上学路一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL.1"
msgid "Up, down, up, down. Pick one already."
msgstr "上去下来上去下来，到底选哪个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL.2"
msgid "Timing stuff. Not my strong point."
msgstr "要卡时机的，不是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER.1"
msgid "Round and round, like my brain in math class."
msgstr "转啊转，跟我上数学课的脑子一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER.2"
msgid "Stop for one second, would you?"
msgstr "你就不能停一秒吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING.1"
msgid "Boing. Same thing my bat does, just quieter."
msgstr "嘣的一下，跟我球棒的效果差不多，就是安静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING.2"
msgid "One bounce and it's someone else's problem."
msgstr "弹一下就成别人的事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE.1"
msgid "A tiny wormhole. Cute, but still gross."
msgstr "小号的虫洞，挺可爱，但还是有点恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE.2"
msgid "Does it eat the ball? Does it chew?"
msgstr "它会吃球吗？会嚼吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE.1"
msgid "Small hole. Bigger would be nicer."
msgstr "洞太小了，大一点多好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE.2"
msgid "One good putt and I can go rest."
msgstr "推进去一杆，我就能去歇着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT.1"
msgid "Wait, I have to dig the hole myself?"
msgstr "等等，洞还要我自己挖？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT.2"
msgid "Put it somewhere close. I'm not walking far."
msgstr "放近点，我不想走太远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "No token, no swing. Stingy."
msgstr "没代币不给打，真小气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pockets are empty. Again."
msgstr "口袋又是空的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "No hole, no game. Even I know that."
msgstr "没洞玩什么，这我都懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "Nothing to aim at. Whatever, nap time."
msgstr "没东西可打。算了，睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Quiet. I'm concentrating. Kind of."
msgstr "安静，我在集中精神。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Easy does it. Gentle swing this time."
msgstr "放轻松，这次轻轻挥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT.1"
msgid "Once it's set up, someone else can carry the clubs."
msgstr "摆好以后，球杆就让别人拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT.2"
msgid "Starting line for a very slow game."
msgstr "一个超慢游戏的起点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK.1"
msgid "You're like a kid skipping class. I'd know."
msgstr "你跟逃课的学生一样，我很清楚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK.2"
msgid "Little fluffball, the pen's that way."
msgstr "小毛球，窝在那边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT.1"
msgid "Herding chicks. Like a class trip, but fluffier."
msgstr "赶小鸟，像带班级春游，就是更毛茸茸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT.2"
msgid "They'll run everywhere. I'm not chasing them."
msgstr "它们肯定到处乱跑，我可不追。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Chasing chicks costs money? Unbelievable."
msgstr "追小鸟还要钱？离谱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Can't play broke. Story of my life."
msgstr "没钱就不能玩，我的人生写照。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Why won't you go in? It's right there!"
msgstr "怎么就是不进去？就在那儿啊！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "This is like rounding up the class after lunch."
msgstr "跟午休后把全班赶回教室一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Just a card. Nothing to remember yet."
msgstr "就一张卡，还没东西可记。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Good thing there's no quiz after."
msgstr "还好之后不考试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Or that one. No, this. Probably."
msgstr "还是那张？不，这张。应该吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Trust me. My gut's better than my memory."
msgstr "信我，我的直觉比记性好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT.1"
msgid "I forget homework instantly. This'll be rough."
msgstr "作业我转头就忘，这个够呛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT.2"
msgid "Just remember which egg it was. Easy. Probably."
msgstr "记住是哪个蛋而已，简单。应该吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Memory game. I forget homework, not this."
msgstr "记忆游戏？作业会忘，这个不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better than studying, at least."
msgstr "至少比复习强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Don't talk, I'll forget."
msgstr "别说话，我会忘的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Wait, which one was the egg again?"
msgstr "等等，蛋刚才在哪张来着？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT.1"
msgid "Drop it and see where it lands. Like my grades."
msgstr "丢下去看落哪，跟我的成绩一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT.2"
msgid "So many pegs. So many pieces. So much effort."
msgstr "好多钉子，好多零件，好麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Everything here eats my tokens."
msgstr "这里每样东西都吃我的代币。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Drop a puck, watch it bounce. Thrilling."
msgstr "丢个圆片看它弹，真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Bounce left. Left! Ugh."
msgstr "往左弹，左边！唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "No skill needed. My kind of game."
msgstr "不需要技术，正合我意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pushing it harder won't help either. Probably."
msgstr "用力按也没用吧，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A big shiny button I'm not allowed to press."
msgstr "一个亮晶晶又不让按的大按钮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Smash it. That I can do."
msgstr "猛按就对了，这个我在行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Careful, don't break it. Again."
msgstr "小心，别又按坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd rather just hit the targets with my bat."
msgstr "我宁愿直接拿球棒去敲靶子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT.2"
msgid "Aiming takes focus. I don't have much."
msgstr "瞄准要专心，我可没多少专心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Shooting gallery. I'd rather use my bat."
msgstr "打靶？我还是更想用球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks fun. Wallet says no."
msgstr "看着好玩，钱包说不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Steady hands. Don't sneeze."
msgstr "手要稳，别打喷嚏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Pretend each target is a test paper."
msgstr "就当每个靶子都是试卷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Just a hole until something pops out."
msgstr "冒东西之前就是个洞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Whack-a-mole, but the mole's a bird."
msgstr "打地鼠，只不过地鼠是鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Pop up one more time. I dare you."
msgstr "你再冒一次试试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Hold still and this'll be over fast."
msgstr "别动，很快就结束了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT.1"
msgid "Spin and pray. Like guessing answers on a test."
msgstr "转一转，全靠运气。跟考试蒙答案一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT.2"
msgid "Watching it spin is making me sleepy."
msgstr "看它转着转着，我就困了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Gambling for kids. Sure, why not."
msgstr "小孩子的赌博，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A wheel of fate. Mine's always \"bad luck.\""
msgstr "命运之轮？我的永远是“倒霉”。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Come on, land on the snack one."
msgstr "快，停到有零食的那格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Slow down... slow down... ugh, figures."
msgstr "慢点……慢点……唉，果然。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL.1"
msgid "One good kick and it's over the trees."
msgstr "我用力一脚能踢过树顶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL.2"
msgid "PE class flashbacks. Pass."
msgstr "想起体育课了，算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID.1"
msgid "Little birds, big noise. Like a first-year class."
msgstr "鸟不大，吵得像一年级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID.2"
msgid "Skipping too? Smart kids."
msgstr "也在逃课？聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN.1"
msgid "Shiny little coins. My pockets feel lighter already."
msgstr "亮闪闪的小币，兜里已经变轻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN.2"
msgid "Can't buy food with these? Useless."
msgstr "这个不能买吃的？没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST.1"
msgid "Too much energy. Share some with me."
msgstr "精力太旺盛了，分我一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST.2"
msgid "Loud, feathery, and selling tickets. Classic."
msgstr "又吵又毛茸茸还卖票，老套路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tree and nothing else. Like my desk."
msgstr "一棵树，别的啥也没有，跟我课桌一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs decorations. Someone else can hang them."
msgstr "要装饰，让别人去挂吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2.1"
msgid "Getting there. Slowly. Like me in the morning."
msgstr "快好了，慢慢来，跟我早上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2.2"
msgid "Halfway festive. Good enough? No? Fine."
msgstr "有一半节日气氛了。够了吧？不够？行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3.1"
msgid "All decked out. Where are the food stalls?"
msgstr "全布置好了，小吃摊在哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3.2"
msgid "Pretty nice. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "还挺好看的。别说是我说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT.1"
msgid "A whole tree in a box. Kinda impressive."
msgstr "一整棵树装在盒子里，有点厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT.2"
msgid "No tree, no fair. Even birds have rules."
msgstr "没有树就没有游园会，鸟也挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Everything good costs too many tickets."
msgstr "好东西都要好多张券。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Window shopping. My specialty."
msgstr "只看不买，我的专长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT.1"
msgid "Prizes better be good. Not erasers again."
msgstr "奖品最好像样点，别又是橡皮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT.2"
msgid "Building my own prize booth feels like cheating. Good."
msgstr "自己搭奖品摊，感觉像作弊。不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Just a scrap of paper with big dreams."
msgstr "一张有远大梦想的小纸片。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Lonely little ticket. Needs friends."
msgstr "孤零零一张，得给它凑伴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.1"
msgid "Look at this pile. I'm rich!"
msgstr "看这一大叠，我发财了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.2"
msgid "Worth all that bird-chasing."
msgstr "追了那么多鸟，值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.1"
msgid "A small stack. Better than nothing."
msgstr "一小叠，总比没有好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.2"
msgid "Can't get the big prize yet. Patience."
msgstr "还换不到大奖，忍着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "Bird snacks. Not human snacks. Sadly."
msgstr "鸟零食，不是人零食，可惜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "Seeds for the crows. They can have them."
msgstr "给乌鸦的种子，归它们了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.1"
msgid "Feathers around my neck. Very festive, very itchy."
msgstr "脖子上一圈羽毛，很有节日感，也很痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.2"
msgid "Looks like a school play costume. I'd be the tree."
msgstr "像学校话剧的戏服。我肯定演树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.1"
msgid "A cloak with wings. I'm still not flying to class."
msgstr "带翅膀的斗篷。我也不会飞去上课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.2"
msgid "Shady enough to nap under."
msgstr "遮阴遮得刚好，能在底下睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.1"
msgid "Small and light. Like my effort in P.E."
msgstr "又小又轻，跟我体育课出的力一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.2"
msgid "Wearing birds now. Hope they don't peck."
msgstr "身上披着鸟，希望别啄我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "A moon glass saw blade. Furniture time, I guess."
msgstr "月光玻璃锯片，那就做家具吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "Cuts wood neater than my handwriting."
msgstr "切得比我写字还工整。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "Tired from all that running, huh."
msgstr "跑累了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "Guess it's just a carrot now."
msgstr "现在就只是根胡萝卜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My lunch is running away. Again."
msgstr "我的午饭又跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A vegetable with legs. Nope."
msgstr "长腿的蔬菜，不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.1"
msgid "Stop wiggling. You're tickling me."
msgstr "别扭了，好痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.2"
msgid "Pocket snack. Literally."
msgstr "名副其实的口袋零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Napping in the dirt. Respect."
msgstr "在土里睡觉，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Shh. Fellow nap lover."
msgstr "嘘，同道中人在睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.1"
msgid "Death didn't slow it down at all."
msgstr "死了都没跑慢一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.2"
msgid "A ghost carrot? This world's so weird."
msgstr "幽灵胡萝卜？这世界太怪了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Sweeter warm. Still not meat."
msgstr "热的更甜，但还不是肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Cafeteria carrots, but less sad."
msgstr "跟食堂胡萝卜一样，但没那么惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Could use this as a bat. Tempting."
msgstr "能当球棒用了，有点心动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Huge. Even I'd get sick of it."
msgstr "这么大，连我都会吃腻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tiny seeds, long wait. Boring."
msgstr "种子小，等得久，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant it and forget it. My style."
msgstr "种下去就忘掉，我的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Moved out. Can't blame it."
msgstr "搬走了，也不能怪它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty stump. Maybe I'll nap inside."
msgstr "空树桩，我进去睡一觉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cozy little hideout. Jealous."
msgstr "舒服的小窝，羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone fluffy's napping in there, I bet."
msgstr "里面肯定有毛茸茸的在睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.1"
msgid "A fake mouse. Cats fall for anything."
msgstr "假老鼠，猫什么都信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.2"
msgid "Squeaky toy. Don't throw it at my face."
msgstr "会叫的玩具，别往我脸上扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Heavy? Not for me. Still annoying."
msgstr "重？对我来说不重，就是烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Who drops rocks everywhere? The Antlion, that's who."
msgstr "谁到处扔石头？蚁狮呗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.1"
msgid "Stacked rocks. Like homework, it keeps piling up."
msgstr "石头叠石头，跟作业一样越堆越多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.2"
msgid "Bottom one first. Then I'm resting."
msgstr "先弄底下那块，然后我休息。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.1"
msgid "Who burned the snack tree? Seriously."
msgstr "谁把零食树烧了？认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.2"
msgid "Ashes. My lunch plans are ruined."
msgstr "一堆灰，我的午饭计划泡汤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm and mushy. Dessert time."
msgstr "热乎乎软绵绵，甜点时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.2"
msgid "Grilled banana. Fancy for a cave."
msgstr "烤香蕉，在洞里算高级了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.1"
msgid "Plugged up. I could punch it open."
msgstr "堵住了，我一拳就能打开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.2"
msgid "A hole with a lid. Like a giant manhole."
msgstr "带盖的洞，像个大井盖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.1"
msgid "Full? Even the caves are crowded?"
msgstr "满了？洞里也挤？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.2"
msgid "Guess I'll wait. Maybe nap first."
msgstr "那就等等吧，先睡一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Closed. Fine, fewer bats for me."
msgstr "关着呢。也好，少碰几只蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Down there's off-limits. Like the teachers' lounge."
msgstr "下面不让去，跟教师办公室一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.1"
msgid "Dark, damp, and full of bats. Great."
msgstr "又黑又潮还都是蝙蝠，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.2"
msgid "Down we go. Bring snacks."
msgstr "下去吧，带上零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.1"
msgid "Deeper? I'm already far from my bed."
msgstr "还要更深？我已经离床够远了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.2"
msgid "Basement of a basement. Great."
msgstr "地下室的地下室，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.1"
msgid "Everyone wants sunlight. Me too."
msgstr "大家都想晒太阳，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.2"
msgid "Upstairs is crowded? Ugh, fine."
msgstr "上面挤满了？唉，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Stuck down here. Like detention."
msgstr "被困在下面了，跟留堂一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The stairs are right there and I still can't leave."
msgstr "楼梯就在眼前，还是出不去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.1"
msgid "Finally. Sunlight, here I come."
msgstr "终于，太阳我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.2"
msgid "Stairs. Ugh. Still worth it."
msgstr "要爬楼梯，唉，但值得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.1"
msgid "How do you grow without sun? Teach me."
msgstr "没太阳怎么长的？教教我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.2"
msgid "Fluffy little plant. Kinda cute."
msgstr "毛茸茸的小草，有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.1"
msgid "Crispy. Like me in summer."
msgstr "干巴巴的，跟夏天的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.2"
msgid "Poor thing gave up. I get it."
msgstr "可怜，它放弃了。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.1"
msgid "Good. No more hot air."
msgstr "很好，不会再喷热气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.2"
msgid "That's what you get for bugging me."
msgstr "谁让你惹我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bugs that breathe steam. Gross."
msgstr "会喷蒸汽的虫子，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "One swing and you're a pancake."
msgstr "一棒下去你就成饼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Tiptoe. Let it nap like a civilized bug."
msgstr "踮脚走，让它像文明虫子一样睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Sleeping bugs are the best bugs."
msgstr "睡着的虫子是最好的虫子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.1"
msgid "Hot breath! Gross, gross, gross."
msgstr "热气！恶心死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.2"
msgid "Whoa, steamy. Not getting my uniform wet."
msgstr "哇，好多蒸汽，别弄湿我的制服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.1"
msgid "Smells like the chem lab. Nope."
msgstr "一股化学实验室的味道，不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.2"
msgid "Holding my breath. For like five seconds."
msgstr "憋气，大概能撑五秒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A rock with a hole. Suspicious."
msgstr "带孔的石头，可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Calm now, but I don't trust it."
msgstr "现在安静，但我信不过它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.1"
msgid "Could grill a snack on this."
msgstr "能在上面烤零食了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.2"
msgid "Toasty. Nice in winter, bad right now."
msgstr "热乎乎的，冬天还好，现在不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.1"
msgid "Gross purple air. I'm out."
msgstr "恶心的紫气，我走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.2"
msgid "Breathing this can't be good for naps."
msgstr "吸这个肯定睡不好觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.1"
msgid "Climbing? Like gym class. Ugh."
msgstr "爬绳？跟体育课一样，唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.2"
msgid "Who tied this up there, anyway?"
msgstr "到底是谁把它绑上去的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.1"
msgid "Fancy raw fish. Where's the rest?"
msgstr "高级生鱼，剩下的呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.2"
msgid "Sour and fresh. Gone in one bite."
msgstr "酸酸的挺鲜，一口就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.1"
msgid "Spikes. Great. Watch the skirt."
msgstr "地刺，真好。小心裙子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.2"
msgid "Step wrong and that's a hole in my shoe."
msgstr "踩错一步，鞋就破个洞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.1"
msgid "Where does this go? Somewhere worse, probably."
msgstr "通到哪？大概是更糟的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.2"
msgid "Last check. Snacks? Bat? Okay."
msgstr "最后检查：零食？球棒？好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.1"
msgid "Fine. Let's get this over with."
msgstr "行吧，赶紧打完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.2"
msgid "Bat's ready. Are you?"
msgstr "球棒准备好了，你呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.1"
msgid "Shadow hands. Keep them off my stuff."
msgstr "影子手，别碰我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.2"
msgid "Grabby. Like a kid at the snack counter."
msgstr "爱抓东西，跟小卖部的小孩一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.1"
msgid "Got something to say? Say it to my bat."
msgstr "有话说？跟我的球棒说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.2"
msgid "Booing from the cheap seats. Classy."
msgstr "在便宜座位上起哄，真有素质。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.1"
msgid "Reading aloud? Worse than class."
msgstr "大声朗读？比上课还糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.2"
msgid "A script. Can I just ad-lib?"
msgstr "剧本？我能即兴发挥吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.1"
msgid "So that's the queen everyone talks about."
msgstr "这就是大家说的那个女王。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.2"
msgid "She looks tired. Same here."
msgstr "她看起来很累，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.1"
msgid "Another scene? This play's long."
msgstr "又一幕？这戏真长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.2"
msgid "Plot twist? I wasn't paying attention."
msgstr "剧情反转了？我没在听。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.1"
msgid "Final act, hopefully. I'm sleepy."
msgstr "希望是最后一幕，我困了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.2"
msgid "Okay, now I'm actually curious."
msgstr "好吧，现在我真有点好奇了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.1"
msgid "Stage fright? Nah. Stage laziness."
msgstr "怯场？不，是懒得上场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.2"
msgid "Holds up the stage. More useful than me."
msgstr "撑着舞台，比我有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.1"
msgid "Broken robot bits. Someone didn't take care of them."
msgstr "坏掉的机器零件，没人好好保养。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.2"
msgid "Looks like my bike after I rode it."
msgstr "跟我骑过的自行车一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.1"
msgid "Junk pile, version two."
msgstr "破烂堆，第二弹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.2"
msgid "Gears and springs everywhere. Messy."
msgstr "到处是齿轮弹簧，真乱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.1"
msgid "Clockwork graveyard. Kinda sad."
msgstr "发条墓地，有点惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.2"
msgid "Something might still twitch in there."
msgstr "里面说不定还会抽动一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.1"
msgid "Bet I could lift it. Not gonna try."
msgstr "我应该能抬起来，但不想试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.2"
msgid "Stone anchor. Won't hold a boat, won't float."
msgstr "石头锚，拴不住船也浮不起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.1"
msgid "Quiet sandbox monster. Way better."
msgstr "安静的沙坑怪，好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.2"
msgid "No earthquakes from you, okay?"
msgstr "你可别再地震了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Creepy wings. Stone suits it."
msgstr "翅膀阴森森的，做成石头正合适。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Looks like it's about to screech."
msgstr "看着像随时要尖叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.1"
msgid "Big, fuzzy, and finally not hungry."
msgstr "又大又毛，终于不饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.2"
msgid "Same appetite as me. Respect, kind of."
msgstr "跟我一样能吃，算是佩服吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED.1"
msgid "Armored bear. Still a grump."
msgstr "穿盔甲的熊，还是个臭脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED.2"
msgid "Glad it's stone. That thing hit hard."
msgstr "还好是石头，那家伙打人很疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO.1"
msgid "Low-maintenance pet. Perfect."
msgstr "不用照顾的宠物，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO.2"
msgid "Fuzzy, but cold to the touch."
msgstr "看着毛茸茸，摸着冰凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN.1"
msgid "Her Majesty, now with zero buzzing."
msgstr "女王陛下，现在一点嗡嗡声都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN.2"
msgid "Wish it came with honey."
msgstr "要是附带蜂蜜就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Looks wise. Probably isn't."
msgstr "看着很聪明，其实大概不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pointy hat. Like a teacher's dunce cap."
msgstr "尖帽子，像惩罚学生的笨蛋帽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE.1"
msgid "Stay put! I'm warning you."
msgstr "老实待着！我警告你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE.2"
msgid "Statues aren't supposed to wiggle!"
msgstr "雕像不该扭来扭去吧！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY.1"
msgid "Pretty, and it won't fly off. Nice."
msgstr "好看，还不会飞走，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY.2"
msgid "A stone butterfly. Kind of elegant."
msgstr "石头蝴蝶，挺优雅的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT.1"
msgid "That carrat worked hard. Unlike me."
msgstr "那只胡萝卜鼠很努力，不像我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT.2"
msgid "First place. Doesn't happen often for me."
msgstr "第一名，我可不常拿到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON.1"
msgid "Stone cat. No hairballs, at least."
msgstr "石头猫，至少不吐毛球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON.2"
msgid "Cute. Too hard to cuddle, though."
msgstr "可爱，就是太硬抱不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS.1"
msgid "A trophy for the hardest homework ever."
msgstr "史上最难作业的奖杯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CHARLIE_BOSS.2"
msgid "She looks better standing still."
msgstr "她站着不动反而好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND.1"
msgid "A statue of a statue. Weird."
msgstr "雕像的雕像，好怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND.2"
msgid "Good doggy. Stay. Forever."
msgstr "乖狗狗，待着，永远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG.1"
msgid "It's even heavier than it looks."
msgstr "比看起来还要重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG.2"
msgid "Big clay doggy. Still scary."
msgstr "大泥狗，还是吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING.1"
msgid "Can't eat it, though. Shame."
msgstr "可惜不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING.2"
msgid "King of crabs, now a lawn ornament."
msgstr "螃蟹之王，现在是院子摆设。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER.1"
msgid "Chains and all. Glad he's free now."
msgstr "连锁链都刻了。还好他现在自由了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER.2"
msgid "Big pig, big fists. I respect that."
msgstr "大猪大拳头，我尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2.1"
msgid "Even the garbage looks fancy in stone."
msgstr "连垃圾做成石头都显得高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2.2"
msgid "Scrap pig. Same guy, worse hobby."
msgstr "破烂猪，同一个人，爱好更差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "One eye, always staring. Like a hall monitor."
msgstr "独眼一直盯着，像值日生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "Winter's worst. Now a decoration."
msgstr "冬天最烦的家伙，现在当装饰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED.1"
msgid "Crystal eye. Still glaring."
msgstr "水晶眼睛，还在瞪人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED.2"
msgid "Did they have to make it shiny?"
msgstr "非要弄得亮晶晶的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM.1"
msgid "A worm got a trophy before I did."
msgstr "一条虫都比我先拿到奖杯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM.2"
msgid "Teeth everywhere. Not cute."
msgstr "到处是牙，一点都不可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "No fire, no lava. Finally relaxing."
msgstr "没火没岩浆，终于能放松了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "Stone dragonfly. Can't burn my stuff now."
msgstr "石头龙蝇，再也烧不了我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR.1"
msgid "Stop staring. It's rude."
msgstr "别盯着看，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR.2"
msgid "Big eyeball. Gives me exam anxiety."
msgstr "大眼珠子，让我想起考试焦虑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.1"
msgid "Too fancy. Makes me feel underdressed."
msgstr "太正式了，衬得我穿得很随便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL.2"
msgid "Stiff collar, stiff face. School photo day."
msgstr "领子硬脸也硬，学校拍照日。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3.1"
msgid "Celestial champion, now a paperweight."
msgstr "天体英雄，现在是镇纸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3.2"
msgid "Stays put and glows. Better than the real one."
msgstr "不动还发光，比真的强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA.1"
msgid "Stone fruit. Mean joke."
msgstr "石头水果，恶劣的玩笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA.2"
msgid "Looks delicious. Breaks teeth."
msgstr "看着好吃，能崩掉牙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON.1"
msgid "Finally, a kitcoon I don't have to search for."
msgstr "终于有只不用找的小浣猫了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON.2"
msgid "Tiny and cute. Okay, I like this one."
msgstr "又小又可爱，好吧，我喜欢这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS.1"
msgid "Creepy Santa. Hard pass."
msgstr "恐怖圣诞老人，免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS.2"
msgid "Antlers and chains. Very festive."
msgstr "鹿角加锁链，节日气氛满满。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A horse that never runs. My kind of horse."
msgstr "从来不跑的马，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stone pony. Can't ride it to school."
msgstr "石头小马，不能骑去上学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE.1"
msgid "Don't even think about it."
msgstr "想都别想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE.2"
msgid "Gallop at me and I'll bat you."
msgstr "你敢冲过来我就一棒子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "Big bird, big trouble. Not anymore."
msgstr "大鸟大麻烦，现在不是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "Looks hungry for fish. Same."
msgstr "看着想吃鱼，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT.1"
msgid "Bunny statue. Doesn't smell like carrots."
msgstr "兔子雕像，没胡萝卜味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT.2"
msgid "Big ears, stone heart."
msgstr "大耳朵，石头心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR.1"
msgid "That guardian chased me so much. Now look at it."
msgstr "那守卫追我那么久，现在看看它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR.2"
msgid "Big horns. Still looks angry."
msgstr "大角，还是一脸生气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON.1"
msgid "The moon, but heavy. Weird."
msgstr "月亮，但很重。好怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON.2"
msgid "Nice nightlight. Without the light."
msgstr "不错的夜灯，就是不亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE.1"
msgid "Pretty face. Seems lonely, though."
msgstr "脸挺好看，就是有点寂寞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE.2"
msgid "Art class would make me draw this."
msgstr "美术课肯定要我画这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN.1"
msgid "Just a pawn. Like me in class."
msgstr "只是个小兵，跟我在班上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN.2"
msgid "Small fry. I kind of like it."
msgstr "小角色，我还挺喜欢的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE.1"
msgid "A giant stone pipe. Very gentleman."
msgstr "巨大的石头烟斗，很绅士。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE.2"
msgid "Maxwell would like this one."
msgstr "麦斯威尔会喜欢这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Shadow shell, stone version. Safer."
msgstr "影子壳的石头版，安全多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROCKYBOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Pinchy claws, frozen in place. Good."
msgstr "钳子定住了，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A castle-shaped headache."
msgstr "城堡形状的麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Big, square, and stubborn. Like a classroom door."
msgstr "又大又方又倔，跟教室门一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.1"
msgid "Charging statues? Seriously?"
msgstr "雕像还会冲锋？认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.2"
msgid "Brace yourself. Or just run."
msgstr "做好准备，或者直接跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI.1"
msgid "Sharky guy. Still looks smug."
msgstr "鲨鱼小子，还是一脸得意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI.2"
msgid "Big fins, bigger attitude."
msgstr "鳍很大，脾气更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN.1"
msgid "Stone's a good look on you. Stay that way."
msgstr "石头很适合你，就这样别变。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHROUDEN.2"
msgid "Creepy even standing still."
msgstr "就算不动也让人发毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER.1"
msgid "Skeleton statue. Science class vibes."
msgstr "骨架雕像，生物课既视感。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER.2"
msgid "Big spooky bones. Stay put."
msgstr "一堆吓人的骨头，老实待着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL.1"
msgid "Big toad, small brain. Now stone."
msgstr "大蛤蟆小脑袋，现在是石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL.2"
msgid "Looks squishy. Isn't."
msgstr "看着软乎乎，其实不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR.1"
msgid "Two eyes, double staring. Great."
msgstr "两只眼睛，双倍盯人，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR.2"
msgid "Twins? More like double trouble."
msgstr "双胞胎？是双倍麻烦吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1"
msgid "Guarding nothing now. Easy job."
msgstr "现在什么都不守，轻松的工作。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2"
msgid "Stiff as a hall monitor."
msgstr "跟纪律委员一样死板。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Moon stuff. Glowy, but not edible."
msgstr "月亮的东西，会发光但不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR.2"
msgid "That fight was way too long. Nice statue, though."
msgstr "那场打太久了。雕像倒还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1"
msgid "Big robot. Wagstaff's hobby got out of hand."
msgstr "大机器人，瓦格斯塔夫的爱好失控了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2"
msgid "WX-78 would have opinions on this."
msgstr "WX-78肯定对这个有意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED.1"
msgid "Possessed doggy, now a lawn ornament."
msgstr "被附身的狗，现在是院子摆设。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED.2"
msgid "Stone version doesn't growl. Good."
msgstr "石头版不会低吼，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS.1"
msgid "Huge worm. Makes me wanna sit down."
msgstr "巨大的虫子，看得我想坐下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS.2"
msgid "Glad it can't burrow anymore."
msgstr "还好它再也钻不了地了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Shadow worm, stuck in stone. Nice."
msgstr "影子虫被封在石头里，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Looks almost cool now. Almost."
msgstr "现在看着还挺酷，就差一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD.1"
msgid "Dragon boat trophy. My arms still hurt."
msgstr "龙舟奖杯，我的胳膊还在疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD.2"
msgid "Proof I paddled. Once."
msgstr "证明我划过船，就一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH.1"
msgid "Shiny horse. Fancy."
msgstr "亮闪闪的马，高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH.2"
msgid "A matching set? Okay, cute."
msgstr "还是一套的？好吧，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.1"
msgid "Shiny, like it's worth a lot. Can't sell it, though."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，看着很值钱，可惜卖不掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.2"
msgid "Real gold? Probably not. Still nice."
msgstr "真金？大概不是，还是挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.1"
msgid "A chest with teeth? Nope."
msgstr "长牙的箱子？不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.2"
msgid "Bite me and you're getting batted."
msgstr "敢咬我就吃我一棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.1"
msgid "Smells like the cafeteria trash bin."
msgstr "闻着像食堂的泔水桶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.2"
msgid "Don't even think about it, stomach."
msgstr "肚子，你想都别想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Clay doggy, not cute."
msgstr "泥巴狗，一点都不可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bad dog! Sit! Break!"
msgstr "坏狗！坐下！碎掉！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.1"
msgid "Totally a normal statue. Totally."
msgstr "绝对是普通雕像，绝对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.2"
msgid "Don't blink. I'm watching you."
msgstr "别眨眼，我盯着你呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big clay mutt. Time to play ball."
msgstr "大泥狗，来打一局吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Too heavy to run. Too angry to stop."
msgstr "重得跑不快，凶得停不下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.1"
msgid "I swear it's breathing."
msgstr "我发誓它在呼吸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.2"
msgid "Big statue. Bigger bad feeling."
msgstr "雕像很大，不祥的预感更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.1"
msgid "Overstuffed. Like my school bag."
msgstr "塞太满了，跟我书包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.2"
msgid "Who packed this? Not me."
msgstr "谁装的？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.1"
msgid "Smells like the cafeteria trash. Gross."
msgstr "闻起来像食堂垃圾桶，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.2"
msgid "Plants love this stuff? Weird taste."
msgstr "植物喜欢这个？口味真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.1"
msgid "Blueprints. Homework with extra steps."
msgstr "蓝图，步骤更多的作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.2"
msgid "Lots of lines. Someone explain it to me."
msgstr "好多线，谁来给我讲讲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.1"
msgid "Eat this and I'll fall asleep. Tempting."
msgstr "吃了就会睡着，有点心动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.2"
msgid "It's quiet now, at least. No screaming."
msgstr "至少现在安静了，不叫了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.1"
msgid "Juicy. This is the good stuff."
msgstr "多汁，这才是好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.2"
msgid "Meat! Finally a real meal."
msgstr "肉！终于有顿正经饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.1"
msgid "Still smells weird. No thanks."
msgstr "还是有怪味，不了谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.2"
msgid "Gross, even cooked. Webber can have it."
msgstr "熟了也恶心，给韦伯吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.1"
msgid "One bite and it's gone. More."
msgstr "一口就没了，再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.2"
msgid "Snack-sized meat. Where's the main course?"
msgstr "零食大小的肉，正餐呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.1"
msgid "Spiky little pest. Batter up."
msgstr "带刺的小害虫，准备挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.2"
msgid "Hey! Find your own boat."
msgstr "喂！自己找船去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.1"
msgid "Make a helmet out of it and nobody can bonk me."
msgstr "拿它做顶头盔，谁也敲不到我脑袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.2"
msgid "Looks like a cookie. Tastes like regret, probably."
msgstr "长得像饼干，吃下去估计只剩后悔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A recipe? Just tell me what it tastes like."
msgstr "菜谱？直接告诉我好不好吃就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "My class notes are messier than this, honestly."
msgstr "说实话，我的课堂笔记比这还乱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.1"
msgid "Smells like the chemistry lab. Not drinking it."
msgstr "一股化学实验室的味道。不喝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.2"
msgid "Pour it on my head in summer, maybe."
msgstr "夏天往头上浇一点，说不定有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.1"
msgid "Fluffy. I could use it as a pillow."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，能拿来当枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.2"
msgid "Somewhere, a catcoon's having a bad day."
msgstr "某只浣猫今天肯定过得很惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.1"
msgid "Gnawing on it raw takes too much effort."
msgstr "生啃太费劲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.2"
msgid "Throw it on the fire and wait for the pop."
msgstr "丢火里，等它噼啪响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.1"
msgid "Popcorn. Now I just need a movie."
msgstr "爆米花。就差一部电影了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.2"
msgid "One handful, then another, then it's gone."
msgstr "一把，再一把，然后就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I could swing this like a bat."
msgstr "这个能直接当球棒挥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Popcorn for the whole class. Maybe two classes."
msgstr "够全班吃爆米花了。说不定两个班。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tiny now. Popcorn later. Probably."
msgstr "现在小小的，以后是爆米花。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Can I just eat them? No? Fine."
msgstr "能直接吃吗？不行？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.1"
msgid "Hitting things with a hammer? Finally, a role I get."
msgstr "拿锤子敲东西？总算有个我懂的角色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.2"
msgid "The apron's fine. The sweating part, no thanks."
msgstr "围裙还行，出汗就免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.1"
msgid "Stand still and look creepy. I can do that."
msgstr "站着不动、看着吓人，这我会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.2"
msgid "Those button eyes are judging me."
msgstr "那对纽扣眼睛在审视我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.1"
msgid "Jingly bells? Everyone will hear me napping."
msgstr "还有铃铛？我打盹全场都听得见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.2"
msgid "The teacher would say this fits me perfectly."
msgstr "老师肯定会说这角色很适合我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.1"
msgid "Does the king get to sit the whole play?"
msgstr "国王能全程坐着吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.2"
msgid "First order as king: nap time for everyone."
msgstr "国王第一道命令：全员午睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.1"
msgid "Whoever looks at me sees themselves. Not my problem."
msgstr "谁看我就看到自己，跟我无关。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.2"
msgid "Shiny. I'll be blinding the front row."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，前排要被晃瞎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.1"
msgid "A princess with a bat. That's the twist."
msgstr "拿球棒的公主，这就是反转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.2"
msgid "Fluffy skirt. Way longer than my uniform's."
msgstr "蓬蓬裙，比我校服裙子长多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.1"
msgid "Off with their heads? Sounds like a lot of work."
msgstr "砍掉他们的头？听着好累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.2"
msgid "Queens probably get the good snacks backstage."
msgstr "演女王的后台点心应该比较好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.1"
msgid "Standing still is my best skill. Perfect casting."
msgstr "一动不动是我的强项，选角完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.2"
msgid "Trees can nap on stage, right? Asking for me."
msgstr "树可以在台上打盹吧？替我自己问的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A little shrine. Feed it, I guess."
msgstr "小神龛，喂点东西吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's dark. Somebody get the fuel."
msgstr "黑着呢，谁去拿燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.1"
msgid "Glowing. Feels like a lamb's watching me."
msgstr "亮了，感觉有只羊在看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.2"
msgid "Warm and cozy. Good for napping next to."
msgstr "暖暖的，适合在旁边睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Halfway built. Like my homework."
msgstr "建了一半，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stack another stone and call it done."
msgstr "再堆一块石头就算完工。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.1"
msgid "Warm light. Good spot for a nap."
msgstr "光很暖，适合打个盹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.2"
msgid "Feels a bit like a shrine at night."
msgstr "有点像晚上的神社。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "All that stonework and it's just sitting dark."
msgstr "砌了这么多石头，结果黑着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Big and fancy, but it still needs feeding."
msgstr "又大又气派，还是得喂燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.1"
msgid "Feels like someone's about to start a sermon."
msgstr "感觉有人要开始布道了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.2"
msgid "Bright enough to read by. Not that I will."
msgstr "亮得能看书了。虽然我不会看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.1"
msgid "Way too small for my head."
msgstr "我的头戴不下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.2"
msgid "Some lamb's gonna come looking for this."
msgstr "肯定有只小羊会回来找它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "Move over. I want those cushions too."
msgstr "挪一挪，我也想要那几个靠垫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "If lounging was a club, it'd be president."
msgstr "要是有躺平社，它就是社长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A king? Looks more like a rock with legs."
msgstr "国王？看着像长了腿的石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "All those gems on its back. Show-off."
msgstr "背上镶这么多宝石，真爱显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.1"
msgid "Just a big shell for now. Let it stay that way."
msgstr "现在只是个大壳，就这样挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.2"
msgid "Feels like a vending machine that takes gems."
msgstr "感觉像只收宝石的自动售货机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.1"
msgid "Crabs with artillery. That's just unfair."
msgstr "螃蟹配大炮，太不讲理了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.2"
msgid "Smash the tower and the shooting stops."
msgstr "把塔砸了就不打了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.1"
msgid "That claw could crack my bat in half."
msgstr "这钳子能把我的球棒夹断。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.2"
msgid "Smack it before it grabs the boat."
msgstr "趁它抓船之前先揍它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.1"
msgid "Ice in the ocean? Who ordered that."
msgstr "海里冒冰墙？谁点的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.2"
msgid "Smash through or go around. Smashing's faster."
msgstr "砸过去还是绕过去？砸比较快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.1"
msgid "They just keep scuttling out. Like students at lunch."
msgstr "一直往外爬，跟午饭铃响的学生一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.2"
msgid "Little crabs. Dinner keeps walking toward me."
msgstr "小螃蟹。晚饭自己走过来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.1"
msgid "A knight in a shell. Still a crab."
msgstr "穿壳的骑士，说到底还是螃蟹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.2"
msgid "Hit it harder. Then harder again."
msgstr "用力打，再用力点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.1"
msgid "Knock knock. Anyone wanna be my pet?"
msgstr "咚咚，有谁想当我的宠物吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.2"
msgid "A whole den of fluffballs. Pick the laziest."
msgstr "一窝毛团，挑最懒的那只。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.1"
msgid "Your head's a lightbulb. Handy for night walks."
msgstr "你的头就是个灯泡，晚上散步正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.2"
msgid "Little sprout, don't wander into the dark alone."
msgstr "小芽芽，别一个人往黑处跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.1"
msgid "Warm little guy. Perfect for winter."
msgstr "暖乎乎的小家伙，冬天刚好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.2"
msgid "Don't set my skirt on fire, okay?"
msgstr "别把我裙子点着了，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.1"
msgid "Hungry too? Same."
msgstr "你也饿了？我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.2"
msgid "Fine, you're on my team now."
msgstr "行吧，你现在是我这边的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.1"
msgid "Staring contest? You'll win. I'll be asleep."
msgstr "比瞪眼？你赢，我会先睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.2"
msgid "One eye, zero blinking. Kinda impressive."
msgstr "一只眼，从不眨，还挺厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.1"
msgid "Flapping that hard with wings that small."
msgstr "翅膀那么小，扇得这么卖力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.2"
msgid "Fuzzy and round. Like a flying rice ball."
msgstr "毛茸茸圆滚滚，像会飞的饭团。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.1"
msgid "You nap more than me. Respect."
msgstr "你比我还能睡，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.2"
msgid "Purr louder. It helps me sleep."
msgstr "呼噜声大一点，助眠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.1"
msgid "Fluffy and quiet. Best kind of follower."
msgstr "又软又安静，最好的跟班。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.2"
msgid "Don't start a cult, okay? Just stay cute."
msgstr "别去开什么教派，乖乖可爱就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.1"
msgid "You glow brighter than my phone screen."
msgstr "你比我手机屏幕还亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.2"
msgid "Little moth, don't fly into the fire."
msgstr "小飞蛾，别往火里扑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.1"
msgid "Gobble all you want, just not my snacks."
msgstr "随你咕咕叫，别碰我的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.2"
msgid "A turkey that likes me. That's a first."
msgstr "居然有火鸡喜欢我，头一回。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.1"
msgid "Good boy. Way nicer than the hounds."
msgstr "乖狗狗，比猎犬们好多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.2"
msgid "Sit. Okay, never mind, I'll sit."
msgstr "坐下。算了，我坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.1"
msgid "Somebody snacked without sharing. Rude."
msgstr "有人偷吃还不分我，过分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.2"
msgid "Just crumbs? Not even worth bending over."
msgstr "就剩点渣？不值得弯腰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.1"
msgid "Hold it too long and I'll grow a tail."
msgstr "拿太久会长尾巴的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.2"
msgid "Pretty, but it smells like monkey business."
msgstr "挺好看，但一股猴子的坏心眼味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.1"
msgid "A wooden sword? My bat hits harder."
msgstr "木头剑？我的球棒打得更狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.2"
msgid "Pirate cosplay prop. Kinda cheap."
msgstr "海盗cosplay道具，有点廉价。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.1"
msgid "Tastes like the bottom of a cave."
msgstr "吃起来像洞穴底的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.2"
msgid "Eat it fast. It goes bad before I'm even hungry."
msgstr "赶紧吃，我还没饿它就坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.1"
msgid "More paper means more homework. Pass."
msgstr "纸多了作业就多，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.2"
msgid "Hollow inside. Could make a straw."
msgstr "里面是空的，能做吸管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big, angry, and loud. Like a gym teacher."
msgstr "又大又凶又吵，像体育老师。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Okay, he's free. My bad. Bat time."
msgstr "好吧，他自由了，怪我。该上球棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.1"
msgid "Looks like detention, but way worse."
msgstr "看着像留堂，但惨多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.2"
msgid "Hey, big guy. Who locked you up here?"
msgstr "喂，大块头，谁把你锁在这儿的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.1"
msgid "He's under the pile like me under blankets."
msgstr "他埋在垃圾堆里，跟我埋在被子里一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.2"
msgid "Digging him out sounds like a bad idea."
msgstr "把他挖出来听着就不是好主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Built himself out of scrap. Kind of impressive."
msgstr "拿废铁把自己装起来了，还挺厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Calm for now. Let's keep it that way."
msgstr "暂时挺安分的，保持住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.1"
msgid "Okay, he's mad. Bat's ready."
msgstr "好，他生气了。球棒准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.2"
msgid "Swinging junk around like that is cheating."
msgstr "抡着破铜烂铁乱打，算作弊吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.1"
msgid "My bat just bounced off. Rude."
msgstr "球棒直接被弹回来了，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.2"
msgid "Gonna need a pickaxe for this, not muscles."
msgstr "这得用镐子，光靠力气不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Those chains are holding something big."
msgstr "这些锁链拴着的东西不小。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hit it enough and it'll crack. Probably."
msgstr "多砸几下应该会裂。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.1"
msgid "Even I'm not hungry enough for that."
msgstr "我再饿也不吃这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.2"
msgid "Looks tasty. That's the scary part."
msgstr "看着很好吃，这才吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.1"
msgid "Something big died here. Not me, at least."
msgstr "这里死过个大家伙，还好不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.2"
msgid "Beach trip's ruined. Bones everywhere."
msgstr "海边度假泡汤了，满地骨头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.1"
msgid "Old Maid? I always lose that one."
msgstr "抽鬼牌？我每次都输。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.2"
msgid "Shuffling's too much work. Somebody deal."
msgstr "洗牌太累了，谁来发牌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.1"
msgid "Pretty, but I can't eat it."
msgstr "好看，可惜不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.2"
msgid "Fancy table thing. Makes me want dinner."
msgstr "桌上的高级摆件，看得我想吃晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing in it. Kind of like my lunchbox."
msgstr "里面空空的，跟我的饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Go pick some flowers. Not me, though."
msgstr "去摘点花吧，不过别叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.1"
msgid "Glowing flowers. Fancy."
msgstr "会发光的花，挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.2"
msgid "A night light that smells nice. Good deal."
msgstr "闻着香的小夜灯，划算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Flowers in a vase. Very girly. Fine."
msgstr "花瓶插花，很少女。行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks nice. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "挺好看的，别告诉别人我这么说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "Flickering. Like me in first period."
msgstr "一闪一闪的，跟我第一节课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "Running out of glow. Same, honestly."
msgstr "快没电了，说实话我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.1"
msgid "Droopy. I know the feeling."
msgstr "蔫了，我懂这感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.2"
msgid "Dead flowers. Somebody forgot to care."
msgstr "花死了，有人忘了照顾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.1"
msgid "A desk lamp. Now I can't pretend I can't see the homework."
msgstr "台灯，这下没法装看不见作业了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.2"
msgid "Cozy light. Good for napping under."
msgstr "柔和的灯光，适合在下面睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Better than anything I drew in art class."
msgstr "比我美术课画的强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A picture. I'll pretend I get it."
msgstr "一幅画，我就假装看得懂吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.1"
msgid "Blank. Like my test paper."
msgstr "空白的，跟我的考卷一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.2"
msgid "Somebody draw something. I'll just doodle a bat."
msgstr "谁来画点什么，我只会画根球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.1"
msgid "Someone's face in a frame. Hope it's not mine."
msgstr "框里有张脸，希望不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.2"
msgid "Fancy frame. Makes the room look less like a cave."
msgstr "高级相框，让屋子不那么像山洞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.1"
msgid "Antlers that big? My neck hurts just looking."
msgstr "角那么大？看得我脖子都疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.2"
msgid "Nice rack. Shame if it fell off."
msgstr "角挺漂亮，掉了就可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "No eyes, and it still walks better than me half-asleep."
msgstr "没眼睛都比我半睡半醒走得稳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Calm little deer. Wish I was that chill."
msgstr "很淡定的鹿，真想像它一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Smells like a barbecue. A really big, weird one."
msgstr "一股烧烤味。超大号的怪烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Burn it all. Then I can finally relax."
msgstr "全烧掉，我就能安心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Poke it with the bat. Just to be sure."
msgstr "拿球棒戳一下，确认一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Finally quiet. Nap time."
msgstr "终于安静了，该午睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "No, no, stay down! You lost already!"
msgstr "不不不，躺好！你已经输了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Overtime? I didn't sign up for overtime!"
msgstr "加时赛？我可没报名加时！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That big eye's still watching. Creepy, but it works."
msgstr "那只大眼睛还在盯着，吓人但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Summer's way less sweaty with this around."
msgstr "有它在，夏天没那么热了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.1"
msgid "An empty socket. Somebody go fetch an eyeball."
msgstr "空眼眶，谁去拿颗眼球来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.2"
msgid "Nothing's looking back. Weirdly, that's worse."
msgstr "没东西回看我，反而更怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.1"
msgid "A giant eyeball watching everything. Like a homeroom teacher."
msgstr "一只大眼睛盯着一切，跟班主任一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.2"
msgid "Put it down and the whole area turns into a freezer."
msgstr "放下去这一片都变冰柜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.1"
msgid "It's squishy. Why is it squishy."
msgstr "软乎乎的。为什么是软的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.2"
msgid "Bigger than my head. And it's staring."
msgstr "比我的头还大，还在瞪人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.1"
msgid "Weird shape. What lock even fits this?"
msgstr "形状好怪，什么锁能配这个？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.2"
msgid "Looks like a fancy back scratcher."
msgstr "看着像高级痒痒挠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.1"
msgid "Gems stuck in its head? That has to hurt."
msgstr "宝石塞在头上？肯定很疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.2"
msgid "Sorry, deer. Your boss is getting hit first."
msgstr "对不起了鹿，先揍你老板。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Picked clean. Like the bread at the school store."
msgstr "被拔光了，跟小卖部的面包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nothing left. Not even worth crouching for."
msgstr "什么都没剩，不值得蹲下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.1"
msgid "Little packet that says don't eat. So I won't."
msgstr "小袋子写着别吃，那我就不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.2"
msgid "Toss it in the bag. Soggy snacks are the worst."
msgstr "丢进包里，受潮的零食最难吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.1"
msgid "The premium kind. Like the big chip bag."
msgstr "高级款，像大包装薯片。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.2"
msgid "Extra strong. My socks will be bone dry."
msgstr "加强版，我的袜子能干透。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.1"
msgid "Feels like cheating. I like it."
msgstr "感觉像作弊，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.2"
msgid "Does everything? Great, I'll do nothing."
msgstr "什么都能干？好，那我什么都不干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.1"
msgid "Even with my strength? That's suspicious."
msgstr "我的力气都不行？可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.2"
msgid "Guess it's not meant for me. Whatever."
msgstr "看来不是给我用的，随便吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.1"
msgid "Something went this way. Ugh, follow it."
msgstr "有东西往这边走了。唉，跟上吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.2"
msgid "Kicking it might be faster than digging."
msgstr "踢一脚可能比挖还快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.1"
msgid "My legs say we're nowhere close."
msgstr "我的腿说离得还远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.2"
msgid "Silent. Like me when the teacher asks a question."
msgstr "一声不吭，跟我被老师点名时一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A stick that beeps. Better than a map, I guess."
msgstr "会响的棍子，比地图强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Point it around and hope for the best."
msgstr "到处指一指，碰碰运气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.1"
msgid "It's going crazy! Somewhere right here!"
msgstr "它响疯了！就在这儿！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.2"
msgid "Loud beeping. Like my alarm I keep ignoring."
msgstr "响个不停，像我一直无视的闹钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.1"
msgid "Little beeps. Keep walking, I guess."
msgstr "小声响了几下，继续走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.2"
msgid "Getting somewhere. Slowly."
msgstr "有点眉目了，慢慢来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.1"
msgid "Faster beeps. My feet better be worth it."
msgstr "响得更快了，我的脚可别白走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.2"
msgid "Close. Like the bell before lunch."
msgstr "快了，像午饭前的铃声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Some weird machine. Kick it and see?"
msgstr "奇怪的机器，踢一脚试试？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "There's a slot here. Something goes in."
msgstr "这里有个槽，应该要插东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.1"
msgid "Almost there. Where'd that big key go?"
msgstr "就差一点，那把大钥匙去哪了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.2"
msgid "It's waiting. I hate waiting."
msgstr "它在等，我最讨厌等了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.1"
msgid "Clicked into place. That was oddly satisfying."
msgstr "咔哒一声卡进去了，莫名爽快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.2"
msgid "Done. Can I go home now?"
msgstr "好了，我能回家了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.1"
msgid "A stick with a gizmo on it. Sure, I'll carry it."
msgstr "带个小机关的棍子，行，我拿着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.2"
msgid "Looks important. Too bad I'm the one holding it."
msgstr "看着挺重要，可惜拿着的是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Dressing up a beefalo like a doll? Pfft."
msgstr "把牛打扮成娃娃？噗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Frills for a beefalo. It'll hate me."
msgstr "给牛加花边，它会恨我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.1"
msgid "A dragon boat in a box. Some assembly required. Ugh."
msgstr "盒装龙舟，需要组装。烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.2"
msgid "Racing on water? I'll be the one napping in back."
msgstr "水上比赛？我负责在后面睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.1"
msgid "A whole boat folded up. Heavy, but not for me."
msgstr "整条船叠起来了，很重，但对我不算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.2"
msgid "Boat in a backpack. Who came up with this?"
msgstr "背包里装条船，谁想出来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.1"
msgid "The middle part. No glory, all walking."
msgstr "中间那段，没风头，光走路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.2"
msgid "Stuck in the middle again. Like seating charts."
msgstr "又被夹在中间，跟排座位一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.1"
msgid "My tongue is already sweating."
msgstr "我的舌头已经在冒汗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.2"
msgid "Spicy salad? Salad shouldn't fight back."
msgstr "辣沙拉？沙拉不该还手吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.1"
msgid "Spiky outside, pink inside. Like Willow."
msgstr "外面扎手，里面粉嫩，像薇洛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.2"
msgid "Looks fancy. Tastes like nothing much."
msgstr "看着很高级，吃着没啥味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm fruit. Weird, but I'll eat it."
msgstr "热水果，怪是怪，但我吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells sweeter now. Hand it over."
msgstr "现在闻着更甜了，给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Heavy. Good thing I'm strong."
msgstr "好沉。还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Even a dragon would struggle with this one."
msgstr "这个龙来了也啃不完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "So many tiny seeds. Who's counting? Not me."
msgstr "这么多小籽，谁要数？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Black dots. Like poppy seeds, but harder work."
msgstr "黑点点，跟芝麻似的，就是更费事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.1"
msgid "Being the head means everyone follows me. Scary."
msgstr "当龙头就是大家都跟着我，好可怕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.2"
msgid "Big dragon face. Fits my mood."
msgstr "大龙脸，跟我心情挺配。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.1"
msgid "Hands off. This one's got my name on it."
msgstr "别碰，这份写着我的名字。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.2"
msgid "Sweet, warm, and all mine."
msgstr "又甜又热，全归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.1"
msgid "The tail. Lowest effort, best job."
msgstr "龙尾，最省力，最好的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.2"
msgid "I'll wiggle a bit back here. Maybe."
msgstr "我在后面摆两下吧。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.1"
msgid "Like holding a hot water bottle."
msgstr "像抱着个暖水袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.2"
msgid "Shiny and hot. Good for something fireproof."
msgstr "又亮又烫，能做防火的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "It feels like it's whispering. Shut up, rock."
msgstr "好像在小声说话。闭嘴，石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "Heavy and dark. Like my mood on Mondays."
msgstr "又沉又黑，像我周一的心情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.1"
msgid "Mining in the dark next to scary rocks. Fun."
msgstr "在黑暗里挖吓人的石头，真好玩呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.2"
msgid "That glow's not friendly at all."
msgstr "那光一点都不友善。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.1"
msgid "Smells like the beach. Salty."
msgstr "一股海边的味道，咸咸的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.2"
msgid "Smooth and twisty. Somebody's art project."
msgstr "又光滑又弯，像谁的美术作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Salty smoke. Not the good kind of barbecue."
msgstr "带咸味的烟，不是好吃的那种烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Thought wet wood couldn't burn. Wrong."
msgstr "以为湿木头烧不起来，想错了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Just charcoal and sea air now."
msgstr "现在只剩木炭和海风了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Dead twice. Rough life."
msgstr "死了两回，惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Done chopping. Stump's someone else's problem."
msgstr "砍完了，树桩交给别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Short and stubby. Like my attention span."
msgstr "又矮又短，像我的注意力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Looks like a sea monster's skeleton."
msgstr "看着像海怪的骨架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Twisted all weird. Rough swim, huh?"
msgstr "扭成这样，漂得很辛苦吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.1"
msgid "Crispy skin. Best part. Mine."
msgstr "皮脆脆的，最好吃的部分，归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.2"
msgid "Holding it like a mic. Thank you, thank you."
msgstr "拿着像话筒。谢谢，谢谢大家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.1"
msgid "Bananas at home. Lazy-girl farming."
msgstr "在家门口种香蕉，懒人农业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.2"
msgid "Dirt everywhere. Better grow good bananas."
msgstr "弄得满手泥，最好结好香蕉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.1"
msgid "Bush in hand. Snacks in the future."
msgstr "手里拿灌木，将来有零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.2"
msgid "Kinda prickly. Hope it's worth it."
msgstr "有点扎，希望值得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.1"
msgid "Juicy berries close by. Life's good."
msgstr "多汁浆果就在门口，人生美好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.2"
msgid "Heavy for a bush. Must be full of juice."
msgstr "作为灌木挺沉，应该汁很多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.1"
msgid "A grass tuft in my hand. Glamorous."
msgstr "手里一撮草，真体面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.2"
msgid "Plant it, water it, forget it. Easy."
msgstr "种下，浇水，忘掉。简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.1"
msgid "Spiky little thing. Carry it with two fingers."
msgstr "扎手的小东西，用两根手指拎着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.2"
msgid "Plant it near the gate. Free security."
msgstr "种在门口，免费保安。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.1"
msgid "Looks like a monkey's tail. Hope no monkey wants it back."
msgstr "像猴子尾巴，希望没有猴子来讨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.2"
msgid "Soft and floppy. Kinda cute, actually."
msgstr "软软垂垂的，其实有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Plant it already. My arms are tired."
msgstr "快种下吧，我胳膊酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Twigs on demand. Very convenient."
msgstr "随用随取的树枝，很方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.1"
msgid "A trap that bites. Put it where enemies walk."
msgstr "会咬的陷阱，放在敌人走的路上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.2"
msgid "Just don't step on it myself. Again."
msgstr "只要我自己别踩到就行。又一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.1"
msgid "Smells like the boys' locker room."
msgstr "闻着像男生更衣室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.2"
msgid "Spiky and stinky. Who decided this was food?"
msgstr "又扎又臭，谁决定它能吃的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooking it was a mistake. The whole camp knows."
msgstr "煮它是个错误，整个营地都闻到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot and stinky. Webber might like it."
msgstr "又热又臭，韦伯说不定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "A giant stink bomb. Great harvest."
msgstr "巨型臭气弹，丰收啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Grew this big just to annoy me."
msgstr "长这么大就是为了气我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Smells already. They're seeds. How."
msgstr "种子都有味了，怎么做到的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant them far away. Like, other-island far."
msgstr "种远一点。远到另一个岛那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.1"
msgid "Looks like candy. Pretty sure it's not for me."
msgstr "看着像糖，但肯定不是给我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.2"
msgid "Fluffy and dusty. Moth dessert."
msgstr "又蓬又带灰，飞蛾的甜点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.1"
msgid "Sweeping all day? You'd be great on cleaning duty."
msgstr "扫一整天？你去值日肯定很棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.2"
msgid "Go ahead, clean up after me too."
msgstr "顺便把我的也打扫了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.1"
msgid "A cozy little bed. Room for one more?"
msgstr "温馨小床，再挤一个行吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.2"
msgid "Even moths get to clock out. Lucky."
msgstr "连飞蛾都能下班，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.1"
msgid "Slippery. My bat works better than my hands."
msgstr "滑溜溜的，用球棒比用手好使。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.2"
msgid "Wiggly noodle fish. Don't wrap around my arm."
msgstr "扭来扭去的面条鱼，别缠我胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.1"
msgid "Grilled eel. Just need rice."
msgstr "烤鳗鱼，就差米饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.2"
msgid "Finally stopped wiggling. Good."
msgstr "总算不扭了，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.1"
msgid "Purple and squishy. Not exactly appetizing."
msgstr "紫色软趴趴的，看着没胃口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.2"
msgid "The school cafeteria loved serving these. I didn't."
msgstr "学校食堂最爱上这个，我不爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft and mushy now. At least it's warm."
msgstr "现在软烂烂的，至少是热的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Needs garlic. Lots of garlic."
msgstr "得放蒜，放很多蒜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "That's not an eggplant, that's a punching bag."
msgstr "这不是茄子，是沙袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Big purple blimp. Who's eating all that?"
msgstr "紫色大飞艇，谁吃得完？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Eggplant seeds. Do I have to?"
msgstr "茄子种子。非种不可吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant it and pretend it's something better."
msgstr "种了就当它是别的好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.1"
msgid "Willow's little fire friend. Kinda cute."
msgstr "薇洛的小火苗朋友，有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.2"
msgid "Floating fire. Lazy-friendly lighting."
msgstr "会飘的火，懒人照明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.1"
msgid "A mask that eats. We have that in common."
msgstr "会吃东西的面具，跟我有共同点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.2"
msgid "Wearing an eye on my face. Fashion."
msgstr "把眼睛戴在脸上，时尚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.1"
msgid "Giant flying eyeball. Stop glaring at me."
msgstr "巨型飞天眼球，别瞪我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.2"
msgid "Home run. Just aim for the pupil."
msgstr "本垒打，对准瞳孔就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.1"
msgid "Little peepers. Like nosy classmates."
msgstr "小偷窥眼，跟八卦同学似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.2"
msgid "So many eyes. None of them blink."
msgstr "这么多眼睛，没一个眨的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.1"
msgid "Smash it now. Fewer eyes later."
msgstr "现在砸，以后少几只眼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.2"
msgid "Wriggling on the ground. Bat, please."
msgstr "在地上扭来扭去。球棒，拜托了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.1"
msgid "Little eyes on stalks. What are you looking at?"
msgstr "茎上长眼睛，看什么看？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.2"
msgid "Rude plants. Stop staring."
msgstr "没礼貌的植物，别盯着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.1"
msgid "A tower that shoots lasers. Better than a guard dog."
msgstr "会射激光的塔，比看门狗强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.2"
msgid "Finally, something that fights while I nap."
msgstr "终于有东西能在我午睡时帮忙打了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.1"
msgid "An eyeball that shoots. Don't stare back."
msgstr "会射击的眼珠子，别跟它对视。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.2"
msgid "A guard that never sleeps. Unlike me."
msgstr "从来不睡的守卫，跟我正相反。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "No veggies this time. Shame. Kinda."
msgstr "这回没菜了，可惜。有一点点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Black dirt. Doesn't look good for dinner."
msgstr "黑土一片，晚饭看来没戏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Empty plot. My motivation's empty too."
msgstr "空地一块，我的干劲也是空的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Dirt, waiting. Seeds, somewhere. Me, tired."
msgstr "土在等，种子在某处，我很累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.1"
msgid "Staring at it won't help. I tried."
msgstr "盯着看没用，我试过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.2"
msgid "Grow faster, I'm hungry."
msgstr "快点长，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.1"
msgid "The dirt's hungry too. Join the club."
msgstr "土也饿了，欢迎加入。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.2"
msgid "Poop again? Farming's so glamorous."
msgstr "又要粪？种田真体面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.1"
msgid "Water! Anyone! My veggies!"
msgstr "水！谁来！我的菜！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.2"
msgid "That's my food burning. Not cool."
msgstr "那是我的饭在烧，一点都不好笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.1"
msgid "Ripe. Picking it before anyone else does."
msgstr "熟了，趁别人没动先摘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.2"
msgid "Good job, plant. Now come here."
msgstr "干得好，植物。过来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Whoa, giant. Is it mine to carry, though?"
msgstr "哇，巨大。不会要我搬吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "It's huge. Good thing I can lift anything."
msgstr "好大一个。还好我什么都搬得动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.1"
msgid "A weed. Of course. Figures."
msgstr "杂草。果然，就知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.2"
msgid "I raised a weed. Great parenting."
msgstr "我养出了一棵杂草，教育真成功。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A plant. That's all I got."
msgstr "一棵植物。我只知道这么多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Green and leafy. Could be anything."
msgstr "绿绿的有叶子，什么都有可能。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.1"
msgid "Hang in there. I'm waiting too."
msgstr "加油，我也在等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.2"
msgid "Taking its time, like me getting up."
msgstr "慢吞吞的，跟我起床一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.1"
msgid "Mush. Smelly mush."
msgstr "一滩烂泥，臭的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.2"
msgid "My fault? Probably. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "我的错？大概吧。别告诉别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "A giant pile of rot. I'm sad and grossed out."
msgstr "巨大一坨烂菜，又难过又恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "All that food, gone. Someone hold me."
msgstr "那么多吃的，没了。谁来抱抱我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.1"
msgid "Just dirt for now. Hurry up, seed."
msgstr "现在只有土，快点吧种子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.2"
msgid "It's sleeping. I get it."
msgstr "它在睡觉，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.1"
msgid "A machine that does chores? My dream."
msgstr "会干活的机器？我的梦想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.2"
msgid "Drop it and walk away. Perfect farming."
msgstr "放下就走，完美种田法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.1"
msgid "Junk in the dirt. Like cleaning my room."
msgstr "土里一堆杂物，跟收拾我房间一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.2"
msgid "Rocks and roots. Bat might work."
msgstr "石头和树根，球棒应该管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.1"
msgid "Bright like a highlighter."
msgstr "亮得像荧光笔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.2"
msgid "Stick it in my hair? Nah, too flashy."
msgstr "插头发上？算了，太显眼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.1"
msgid "Matches my mood."
msgstr "跟我的心情很搭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.2"
msgid "Crows are smart. Smarter than me in math, probably."
msgstr "乌鸦很聪明，数学可能比我好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.1"
msgid "Red like a school badge."
msgstr "红得像校徽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.2"
msgid "Use it as a bookmark. In a book I won't read."
msgstr "当书签用，夹在我不会读的书里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.1"
msgid "Blue and fluffy. Cold weather style."
msgstr "蓝色蓬蓬的，冬季款。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.2"
msgid "Pretty. But it's freezing, so who cares."
msgstr "挺好看，但冻死了，谁在乎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Stuck in a chair forever. Worse than class."
msgstr "永远困在椅子上，比上课还惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.2"
msgid "Looks lonely. Hang on, I'll figure something out."
msgstr "看着好孤单。等着，我想想办法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.1"
msgid "Wooden fence. One kick and it's gone."
msgstr "木栅栏，一脚就倒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.2"
msgid "Keeps the beefalo in. Hopefully."
msgstr "能把牛关住。但愿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Just posts for now. Harmless. Probably."
msgstr "现在只是几根柱子，没危险。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs a partner post. Like a buddy system."
msgstr "得找根柱子配对，跟结伴制一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.1"
msgid "Buzzing. My hair's standing up."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，我头发都立起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.2"
msgid "Touching it would be very dumb. Even for me."
msgstr "摸它太蠢了，就算是我也不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.1"
msgid "A door in a fence. Revolutionary."
msgstr "栅栏上开个门，真革命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.2"
msgid "Swings open. Swings shut. Exciting stuff."
msgstr "开了，关了，真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.1"
msgid "Made of trash. Still a fence."
msgstr "垃圾做的，也算栅栏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.2"
msgid "Rusty and wobbly. Don't lean on it."
msgstr "又锈又晃，别靠上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.1"
msgid "Decorated fish. Almost too pretty to eat. Almost."
msgstr "装饰过的鱼，漂亮得舍不得吃。差点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.2"
msgid "Holiday dinner. Finally, something to look forward to."
msgstr "节日大餐，终于有盼头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "A holiday sweater for a beefalo. Adorable."
msgstr "给牛穿的节日毛衣，可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Matching outfits. I'm not wearing one, though."
msgstr "还是配套款。我可不穿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.1"
msgid "Squishy and sweet. Like a jam bun."
msgstr "软软甜甜的，像果酱面包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.2"
msgid "Wasps love these. So do I. Back off, wasps."
msgstr "黄蜂爱吃，我也爱吃。滚开黄蜂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.1"
msgid "Sweet pasta. I'm confused, but eating."
msgstr "甜的意面，我很困惑，但我在吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.2"
msgid "Weird combo. Tastes better than the cafeteria."
msgstr "奇怪的组合，比食堂好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.1"
msgid "Festival food. Just need a yukata."
msgstr "庙会小吃，就差一件浴衣了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.2"
msgid "Fig on a stick. Eat while walking."
msgstr "签子上的无花果，边走边吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm and gooey. Perfect for a lazy day."
msgstr "又热又黏，适合懒洋洋的一天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Even sweeter now. My teeth are scared."
msgstr "更甜了，我的牙在发抖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.1"
msgid "Calling meteors down? Feels like overkill."
msgstr "召陨石下来？有点小题大做了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.2"
msgid "Fire from the sky. Please aim it carefully."
msgstr "天上掉火，请瞄准一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.1"
msgid "Loud and annoying. Willow's favorite."
msgstr "又吵又烦，薇洛最爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.2"
msgid "Bang bang. There goes my nap."
msgstr "砰砰砰，我的午觉没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.1"
msgid "Burns just standing near it. Like Willow mad."
msgstr "站在旁边都烫，跟生气的薇洛一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.2"
msgid "Spicy plant. Not the edible kind."
msgstr "辣辣的植物，不是能吃的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.1"
msgid "Still feels warm. Sneaky plant."
msgstr "摸着还是温的，阴险的植物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.2"
msgid "Dried out but grumpy. Relatable."
msgstr "干了还脾气差，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.1"
msgid "A pen that sets fires. Detention material."
msgstr "能点火的笔，够留校察看了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.2"
msgid "Click it and things burn. Don't give it to Willow."
msgstr "按一下就着火，千万别给薇洛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.1"
msgid "Flopping around. Stop it, I'm trying to hold you."
msgstr "扑腾个不停，别动，我在拿你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.2"
msgid "Raw fish. Sashimi or grill? Grill. Less work."
msgstr "生鱼，刺身还是烤？烤，省事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.1"
msgid "Fishing with a net? Finally, someone gets me."
msgstr "用网捕鱼？总算有人懂我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.2"
msgid "Throw it, nap, pull it back. Perfect plan."
msgstr "扔出去，睡一觉，再拉回来。完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.1"
msgid "Big fish. Big lunch. Big nap after."
msgstr "大鱼，大午饭，饭后睡大觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.2"
msgid "Raw? I'm hungry, but not that hungry."
msgstr "生的？我是饿，但还没饿到那份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Smells good. Nobody touch my portion."
msgstr "好香。谁也别碰我那份。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Cafeteria fish was never this good."
msgstr "食堂的鱼可从来没这么好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Chewy enough to keep me awake in class."
msgstr "嚼劲大到上课都能保持清醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Fish jerky. Snack for the road."
msgstr "鱼干。路上的零嘴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.1"
msgid "Tiny. Did it shrink when I caught it?"
msgstr "好小。抓上来就缩水了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.2"
msgid "That's an appetizer at best."
msgstr "顶多算开胃菜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooked it, and it got even smaller."
msgstr "烤完更小了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.2"
msgid "Barely a snack. Got any more?"
msgstr "塞牙缝都不够。还有吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.1"
msgid "Pocket-sized. Good for sneaking snacks in class."
msgstr "口袋大小，上课偷吃正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.2"
msgid "Salty little thing. Kinda addictive."
msgstr "咸咸的小东西，有点上瘾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.1"
msgid "Fish on a stick. No fork needed."
msgstr "串在棍子上的鱼，连叉子都省了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.2"
msgid "Like the frozen kind, but less sad."
msgstr "跟冷冻的差不多，就是没那么寒酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.1"
msgid "Tacos. Now I'm actually awake."
msgstr "塔可。这下我真的醒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.2"
msgid "Don't drop the filling. Again."
msgstr "馅别又掉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "Not burnt. Somebody clap."
msgstr "没烤糊。来个人鼓掌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "Fish for dinner. Could be worse."
msgstr "晚饭吃鱼，还凑合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.1"
msgid "Flat. Like my mood on Mondays."
msgstr "扁了，像我周一的心情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.2"
msgid "Gave up on flying. Relatable."
msgstr "它放弃飞了，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Floating up there. I'd like to float too."
msgstr "在上面飘着，我也想飘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pretty. Make a wish or something."
msgstr "挺好看，许个愿什么的吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.1"
msgid "Holding it down so it doesn't escape."
msgstr "按着它，别让它跑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.2"
msgid "Let go and it floats. Easy job."
msgstr "一松手就飘上去，轻松的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.1"
msgid "I'm not a bee, you know."
msgstr "我又不是蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.2"
msgid "Pretty, but it won't fill me up."
msgstr "好看是好看，就是吃不饱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.1"
msgid "Lights out. Just like me in class."
msgstr "灯灭了。跟我上课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.2"
msgid "It needs a rest too, huh."
msgstr "它也要歇一歇啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.1"
msgid "Even the petals look like they're glaring."
msgstr "连花瓣都像在瞪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.2"
msgid "Nope. Not picking that one."
msgstr "不要。这朵我不摘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.1"
msgid "Somebody forgot to water you, huh."
msgstr "有人忘了给你浇水吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.2"
msgid "Too hot for flowers. Too hot for me too."
msgstr "天太热，花受不了，我也受不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.1"
msgid "Leafy stuff. Wormwood might want it."
msgstr "一堆叶子。沃姆伍德可能想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.2"
msgid "Could be a salad. Could be a blanket."
msgstr "能当沙拉，也能当被子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.1"
msgid "Crispy leaves. Tea time later."
msgstr "脆脆的叶子，待会泡茶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.2"
msgid "Dried out like my motivation."
msgstr "干得跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.1"
msgid "What was I doing again? Whatever."
msgstr "我刚才要干嘛来着？算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.2"
msgid "Funny name. Hard to forget, actually."
msgstr "名字挺怪，反而忘不掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.1"
msgid "Dried flowers. Smells like grandma's drawer."
msgstr "干花，闻着像奶奶的抽屉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.2"
msgid "Crumbles if I squeeze. So I won't."
msgstr "一捏就碎。那我就不捏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "A tux for a beefalo. What's the occasion?"
msgstr "给牛穿礼服？什么场合啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Fancier than my school uniform."
msgstr "比我的校服还讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.1"
msgid "Old bones. Feels like a jigsaw nobody asked for."
msgstr "老骨头。像是没人想玩的拼图。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.2"
msgid "Heavy. Good thing I'm strong."
msgstr "挺沉的。还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.1"
msgid "All done. Now it's staring at me."
msgstr "拼完了。现在它在盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.2"
msgid "Perfect skeleton. Better than my homework."
msgstr "骨架完美。比我的作业强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.1"
msgid "Its head's on backwards. Kinda funny."
msgstr "脑袋装反了。有点好笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.2"
msgid "Modern art? Sure, let's call it that."
msgstr "现代艺术？行，就这么叫吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Missing pieces. Like my attendance record."
msgstr "缺了好几块，跟我的出勤表一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Half a skeleton. Need more bones."
msgstr "半副骨架，还得找骨头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.1"
msgid "Did you lose a fight with lightning?"
msgstr "你是跟闪电打架输了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.2"
msgid "You look... different. Kinda tough, actually."
msgstr "你看起来……不太一样。还挺酷的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.1"
msgid "Fancy breakfast. I'll eat it in bed."
msgstr "这么讲究的早饭，我要躺床上吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.2"
msgid "Fruit and pancakes. Finally, real food."
msgstr "水果配薄饼。总算有正经吃的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.1"
msgid "A bug that does chores. Can you do my homework too?"
msgstr "会干活的虫子。能帮我写作业吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.2"
msgid "Buzz around the garden, not my face."
msgstr "去菜园嗡嗡，别在我脸上转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.1"
msgid "Fish stuffed with frog. Sounds like a dare."
msgstr "鱼里塞青蛙，跟打赌似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.2"
msgid "Looks fancy. Tastes like a swamp?"
msgstr "看着讲究。吃起来像沼泽？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.1"
msgid "Sandwich. Don't ask what's inside, just eat."
msgstr "三明治。别问里面是什么，吃就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.2"
msgid "Bread makes everything okay. Mostly."
msgstr "有面包夹着就都还行。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.1"
msgid "Still twitching. Gross."
msgstr "还在抽动。好恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.2"
msgid "Frogs kick hard. Now they're just legs."
msgstr "青蛙踢人挺狠，现在只剩腿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.1"
msgid "Tastes like chicken. Everyone says that."
msgstr "像鸡肉。大家都这么说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.2"
msgid "Crispy. I'll pretend it's a drumstick."
msgstr "脆脆的。就当它是鸡腿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.1"
msgid "Fig and frog. Who thought of this?"
msgstr "无花果配青蛙，谁想出来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.2"
msgid "Sweet outside, frog inside. It's a trap."
msgstr "外面甜，里面是青蛙。是陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.1"
msgid "Brain freeze. Worth it."
msgstr "脑子冻住了。值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.2"
msgid "Banana slush. Summer's finally bearable."
msgstr "香蕉冰沙，夏天总算能熬了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A little green lizard. Don't bite me."
msgstr "绿色的小蜥蜴。别咬我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Are you a fruit or a pet?"
msgstr "你到底是水果还是宠物？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1"
msgid "Red and grumpy. We'd get along."
msgstr "红了还一脸不爽，咱俩合得来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2"
msgid "Watch out, it breathes fire now."
msgstr "小心，它现在会喷火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Napping in the sun. I'm jealous."
msgstr "在太阳底下打盹，好羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Sleeping like that... Mind if I join?"
msgstr "睡得那么香……我也一起？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.1"
msgid "Shoo. My veggies aren't your buffet."
msgstr "去去去。我的菜不是你的自助餐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.2"
msgid "Hold still, bug. I'm swinging."
msgstr "别乱动，小虫子。我要挥棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.1"
msgid "A fruit that calls a helper. Weird but handy."
msgstr "能叫来帮手的果子，怪但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.2"
msgid "Don't eat it. It's somebody's house, probably."
msgstr "别吃，大概是谁的家吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.1"
msgid "A cup of fruit. Healthy, kind of."
msgstr "一杯水果，算是健康吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.2"
msgid "Mixing fruit doesn't make it dessert. Still eating it."
msgstr "水果混一起也算不上甜点。照样吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A cold axe is just a heavy stick."
msgstr "凉掉的斧头就是根重棍子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs a warm-up. Same as me in the morning."
msgstr "得先热身，跟我早上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT.1"
msgid "Toasty! Trees, line up."
msgstr "热乎乎的！树都排好队。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.HOT.2"
msgid "Hot enough to cook lunch on."
msgstr "热到能煎午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM.1"
msgid "Lukewarm. Like cafeteria soup."
msgstr "温吞吞的，像食堂的汤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.LUKEWARM.2"
msgid "Running out of steam. Me too."
msgstr "没劲了，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM.1"
msgid "Warm enough. A few more trees, then a break."
msgstr "还够热，再砍几棵就休息。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.WARM.2"
msgid "Nice and warm. Good hand warmer, too."
msgstr "暖暖的，还能当暖手宝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cold hammer. Still heavy, though."
msgstr "冷锤子，但还是挺沉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Heat it up. Smashing cold is less fun."
msgstr "先加热，冷着砸没意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.HOT.1"
msgid "Hot hammer. Everything's getting smashed."
msgstr "锤子热了，统统砸烂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.HOT.2"
msgid "Burning hot. Even better than my bat. Don't tell it."
msgstr "烫得很，比我的球棒还好用。别告诉它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.LUKEWARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.LUKEWARM.1"
msgid "Losing heat. My arm's still fine."
msgstr "热度没了，我的胳膊还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.LUKEWARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.LUKEWARM.2"
msgid "Lukewarm hammer. Sad."
msgstr "温吞吞的锤子，好惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.WARM.1"
msgid "Got some warmth left. Few more smashes."
msgstr "还有点热，再砸几下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEHAMMER.WARM.2"
msgid "Warm hammer, happy me."
msgstr "锤子暖暖的，我也开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cold pickaxe. Rocks are laughing at me."
msgstr "冷掉的镐子，石头在笑我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs heat before it's useful. Like instant noodles."
msgstr "得加热才有用，跟泡面一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.HOT.1"
msgid "Hot pick, soft rocks. Let's go."
msgstr "镐子热了，石头软了，开工。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.HOT.2"
msgid "Smells like a barbecue. Why am I hungry now?"
msgstr "闻着像烧烤，怎么饿了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.LUKEWARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.LUKEWARM.1"
msgid "Cooling off. Hurry up, rocks."
msgstr "快凉了，石头快点碎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.LUKEWARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.LUKEWARM.2"
msgid "Lukewarm. The worst temperature."
msgstr "温吞吞的，最差的温度。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM.1"
msgid "Warm-ish. Mine fast before it quits."
msgstr "还温着，趁它罢工前赶紧挖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEPICKAXE.WARM.2"
msgid "Some heat left. Good enough for a few rocks."
msgstr "还剩点热度，够挖几块石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Ice-cold shovel. Digging is boring enough already."
msgstr "冰凉的铲子，挖坑本来就够无聊了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Warm it up first. I'm not doing this cold."
msgstr "先加热，我才不冷着干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.HOT.1"
msgid "Hot shovel. Dirt goes flying."
msgstr "铲子热了，土到处飞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.HOT.2"
msgid "Digging with a frying pan, basically."
msgstr "基本上就是拿平底锅挖土。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.LUKEWARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.LUKEWARM.1"
msgid "Lukewarm. My enthusiasm is the same."
msgstr "温吞吞的，跟我的热情一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.LUKEWARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.LUKEWARM.2"
msgid "Almost cold. One more hole."
msgstr "快凉了，再挖一个坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.WARM.1"
msgid "Warm enough. Let's not waste it."
msgstr "还挺热，别浪费。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLESHOVEL.WARM.2"
msgid "A cozy shovel. Weird thing to say."
msgstr "暖和的铲子，说出来好奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cold hoe. Farming's slow enough already."
msgstr "冷锄头，种地本来就够慢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs a warm-up before the dirt cooperates."
msgstr "得先热一热，土才听话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT.1"
msgid "Hot hoe. The soil's toasted now."
msgstr "锄头热了，土都烤香了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.HOT.2"
msgid "Hurry, before it cools and I get lazy."
msgstr "快点，趁它没凉我还没懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM.1"
msgid "Cooling down. Farming break soon."
msgstr "快凉了，马上可以歇了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.LUKEWARM.2"
msgid "Nearly cold. Wormwood can finish the rest."
msgstr "快凉透了，剩下的给沃姆伍德。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.1"
msgid "Warm enough. A couple more rows."
msgstr "还热着，再锄几行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.2"
msgid "Feels nice in cold hands."
msgstr "冷手拿着挺舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.1"
msgid "Fluffy. Would make a good pillow."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，做枕头正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.2"
msgid "Somebody's shedding. Big somebody."
msgstr "有谁在掉毛。个子很大的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.1"
msgid "Lumpy shadow thing. Batter up."
msgstr "一坨影子怪。准备挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.2"
msgid "Ugh, like a bad dream that ate other bad dreams."
msgstr "呃，像是吞了别的噩梦的噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.1"
msgid "Don't hit it! Wait, can I bat it away?"
msgstr "别打它！等等，能一棒子打飞吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.2"
msgid "Rolling bomb. Nope, I'm out."
msgstr "会滚的炸弹。不了，我先走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.1"
msgid "Stone dog. Better than a real one."
msgstr "石头狗，比真狗好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.2"
msgid "It's frozen mid-bark. Rude."
msgstr "叫到一半就定住了。没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.1"
msgid "Stone pig, angry face. Relatable."
msgstr "石头猪，一脸怒气。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.2"
msgid "If it wakes up, I'm swinging first."
msgstr "要是醒了，我先动手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.1"
msgid "Keeps vampires away. And friends."
msgstr "能驱吸血鬼，也能驱朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.2"
msgid "My breath is going to be a weapon."
msgstr "我的口气要变成武器了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft and sweet now. Who knew."
msgstr "现在软软甜甜的，谁想得到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.2"
msgid "Roasted garlic. Smells like a real kitchen."
msgstr "烤大蒜，闻着像正经厨房。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Giant garlic. Enough to scare off an army."
msgstr "巨型大蒜，够吓跑一整支军队。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Big enough to share with the whole class."
msgstr "大得够全班分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Plant it and wait. Waiting's my specialty."
msgstr "种下去等着。等待是我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny seeds, huge smell later."
msgstr "种子小小的，以后味道可大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.1"
msgid "Perfect for summer. I'm melting."
msgstr "夏天正好，我快化了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.2"
msgid "Tomato soup that forgot to heat up."
msgstr "忘了加热的番茄汤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.1"
msgid "WX-78 is going to want these."
msgstr "WX-78肯定想要这些。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.2"
msgid "Clunky little wheels. Good for crafting."
msgstr "笨重的小轮子，做东西用得上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Jelly that moves. Not the dessert kind."
msgstr "会动的果冻，不是甜点那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Gross. Whack it from far away."
msgstr "好恶心。离远点打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.1"
msgid "Hang on! I'll smack you out!"
msgstr "撑住！我把你砸出来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.2"
msgid "Hey, quit napping in there!"
msgstr "喂，别在里面睡啊！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "My stuff's in there. Give it back."
msgstr "我的东西在里面，还给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Hit it until it spits it out."
msgstr "打到它吐出来为止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.1"
msgid "Bottled goo. Don't shake it."
msgstr "装瓶的黏液，别摇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.2"
msgid "Looks like jelly. Do not eat."
msgstr "看着像果冻。不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.1"
msgid "Food in jelly. Kinda like a bento."
msgstr "食物泡在果冻里，有点像便当。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.2"
msgid "Packed full. Like my bag before break."
msgstr "塞满了，跟我放假前的书包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nothing in there. Not even jelly snacks."
msgstr "里面什么都没有，连果冻零食都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Put something in. Preferably food."
msgstr "放点东西进去吧，最好是吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.1"
msgid "Food stuck in jelly. Kinda looks like dessert."
msgstr "食物封在果冻里，看着像甜点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.2"
msgid "Squishy fridge. Don't poke it."
msgstr "软乎乎的冰箱，别戳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.1"
msgid "Needs a purple gem. Go find one."
msgstr "要放紫宝石。去找一颗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.2"
msgid "Empty slot. It's staring at me."
msgstr "空着一个槽，它在看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.1"
msgid "Glowing now. Guess that worked."
msgstr "现在亮了，应该成功了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.2"
msgid "Done. I'm not touching it again."
msgstr "好了，我不再碰它了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Burning. At least it won't get back up."
msgstr "烧起来了，至少不会再爬起来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Smells awful. Let's go."
msgstr "味道难闻，走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Dead. Don't look at me, I didn't do it."
msgstr "死了。别看我，不是我干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's not moving. Good."
msgstr "不动了。很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Nope, it's getting up. Bat ready."
msgstr "不对，它要起来了。球棒准备。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Stay dead! Is that so hard?"
msgstr "老实死着！有那么难吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.1"
msgid "Floaty moon ghost. It keeps staring."
msgstr "飘来飘去的月亮鬼，一直盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.2"
msgid "Whispering at me? Use your words."
msgstr "对我嘀咕什么？说清楚点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.1"
msgid "Got one. Stop wiggling."
msgstr "抓到了，别扭来扭去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.2"
msgid "Glowy pet. Don't think it likes me."
msgstr "发光宠物，它好像不喜欢我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A cage with nothing in it. Kinda sad."
msgstr "笼子里什么都没有，有点凄凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Catching ghosts is a whole hobby, huh."
msgstr "抓幽灵还成爱好了啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.1"
msgid "This one looks like a hall monitor."
msgstr "这个看着像纪律委员。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.2"
msgid "Big and glowy. Probably hits hard."
msgstr "又大又亮，下手应该很重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.1"
msgid "Even angrier than before. Great."
msgstr "比之前更凶了。真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.2"
msgid "It leveled up. I didn't."
msgstr "它升级了，我没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.1"
msgid "Boo yourself. I'm not scared."
msgstr "你才吓人。我不怕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.2"
msgid "Floating around all day. Must be nice."
msgstr "成天飘着，挺舒服吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.1"
msgid "Wendy would like this one."
msgstr "温蒂会喜欢这朵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.2"
msgid "Glowing petals. Kinda spooky, kinda pretty."
msgstr "发光的花瓣，有点吓人，也有点好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.1"
msgid "Go on, rest. You've earned it."
msgstr "去吧，好好休息，你辛苦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.2"
msgid "Free now. Don't haunt me, okay?"
msgstr "自由了。别来缠我，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.1"
msgid "A present. Hope it's food."
msgstr "礼物。希望是吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.2"
msgid "Wrapped so nicely. Ripping it anyway."
msgstr "包得这么好看，我照样撕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.1"
msgid "I'll wrap it so badly they'll know it's from me."
msgstr "包得这么丑，一看就是我送的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.2"
msgid "Ripping it open is the fun part. Wrapping's not."
msgstr "拆开才好玩，包起来就没意思了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.1"
msgid "A house made of snacks. Dream home."
msgstr "零食做的房子，梦想之家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.2"
msgid "One bite of the wall. Nobody'll notice."
msgstr "啃一口墙，没人会发现。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.1"
msgid "Run, cookie, run. I'm faster."
msgstr "跑吧，饼干，我比你快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.2"
msgid "A cookie with legs. My snack's escaping!"
msgstr "长腿的饼干，零食要跑了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.1"
msgid "Too big to dunk in milk."
msgstr "太大了，没法泡牛奶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.2"
msgid "Sweet-smelling and furious. Run first, eat later!"
msgstr "闻着甜，脾气爆。先跑，回头再吃！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.1"
msgid "Shiny block. Smash it?"
msgstr "亮晶晶的方块，砸了吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.2"
msgid "Glass this thick might stop my bat."
msgstr "这么厚的玻璃也许能挡住我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.1"
msgid "Great against shadows. Bad for my fingers."
msgstr "砍影怪很好用，对我手指不太友好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.2"
msgid "A glass sword. Louis would ask to borrow it."
msgstr "玻璃剑，路易斯肯定要借。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.1"
msgid "Sharp glass sticking out of the ground. Lovely."
msgstr "地里冒出尖玻璃，真美好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.2"
msgid "Nobody sit down here. I mean it."
msgstr "谁都别在这坐下。我认真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.1"
msgid "Gooey. Glommer, really?"
msgstr "黏糊糊的。格罗姆，你认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.2"
msgid "Fertilizer, fuel, and my nightmares."
msgstr "能当肥料，能当燃料，还能当我的噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.1"
msgid "Tiny wings. Can't fly me anywhere."
msgstr "小翅膀，带不动我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.2"
msgid "Kinda sparkly. Kinda sad."
msgstr "有点闪，也有点可怜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.1"
msgid "It glows. Will my stomach glow after?"
msgstr "会发光。吃完我的肚子也会亮吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.2"
msgid "Dessert that doubles as a nightlight."
msgstr "能当夜灯的甜点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.1"
msgid "Lost your horn? Like me losing my bat."
msgstr "角没了？跟我丢了球棒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.2"
msgid "Now it's just a big grumpy fish."
msgstr "现在就是条脾气不好的大鱼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Hornless buddy. Still tagging along?"
msgstr "没角的小伙伴，还跟着啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll do the hitting."
msgstr "别担心，打架交给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "A whale bodyguard. Fancy."
msgstr "鲸鱼当保镖，挺排场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "Good, it's on my side now."
msgstr "很好，它现在站我这边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Unicorn of the sea. A mean one, too."
msgstr "海里的独角兽，还很凶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stay away from my boat, pointy."
msgstr "离我的船远点，尖脑袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.1"
msgid "Pointy souvenir. Better than a keychain."
msgstr "尖尖的纪念品，比钥匙扣强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.2"
msgid "Could I swing this like a bat?"
msgstr "这个能当球棒挥吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.1"
msgid "Tingly milk. That's not how milk works."
msgstr "麻麻的牛奶，牛奶不该是这样的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.2"
msgid "One sip and my hair stands up."
msgstr "喝一口头发就竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.1"
msgid "Perfect pillow stuffing. Collect more."
msgstr "做枕头的好材料，多捡点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.2"
msgid "That giant goose dropped it. Good riddance."
msgstr "那只巨鹅掉的。走了正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.1"
msgid "A big lizard covered in grass. Lazy camouflage."
msgstr "长满草的大蜥蜴。伪装真敷衍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.2"
msgid "Leave it alone and it leaves me alone. Deal."
msgstr "我不惹它，它不惹我。成交。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Looks sick. Go see a doctor."
msgstr "看着病了，去看医生吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Its grass is all patchy now. Poor thing."
msgstr "身上的草都秃了，真可怜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Come back, I need your tail."
msgstr "回来，我要你的尾巴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Running away? I'm too sleepy to chase."
msgstr "跑了？我困得追不动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.1"
msgid "Pour it on rice. Or everything."
msgstr "浇在饭上，或者浇在所有东西上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.2"
msgid "Gravy. Instantly makes things edible."
msgstr "肉汁，什么都能变好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.1"
msgid "Cheaper crafting. Wish there was one for exams."
msgstr "做东西更省料，考试也能省就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.2"
msgid "Saves materials. Saves trips. Saves me."
msgstr "省材料，省跑腿，省我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.1"
msgid "Green gem. Makes stuff cheaper to build, right?"
msgstr "绿宝石。做东西能省材料，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.2"
msgid "Shiny. Don't let the crows see."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，别让乌鸦看见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.1"
msgid "Green eye. It's watching me back."
msgstr "绿眼睛，它也在看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.2"
msgid "Lazy navigation. My favorite kind."
msgstr "偷懒的认路方式，我最喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.1"
msgid "An undo button for building. Wish life had one."
msgstr "建造的撤销键，人生要是也有就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.2"
msgid "Takes things apart neatly. Unlike my bat."
msgstr "拆得整整齐齐，不像我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Calms my head down. Weird mushroom."
msgstr "吃了脑子都清醒了，怪蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Green and squishy. Still eating it."
msgstr "绿绿的，软软的，照吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.1"
msgid "Glowy pond. Looks like a fancy aquarium."
msgstr "发光的池子，像个高级水族馆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.2"
msgid "Not swimming in it. Glass in my socks? No."
msgstr "我不下去游，袜子里进玻璃？不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.1"
msgid "Puddle-sized and still sparkly."
msgstr "水坑那么大，还挺闪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.2"
msgid "Small pool. Good enough for my feet."
msgstr "小池子，泡泡脚倒够了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.1"
msgid "Green mush. Surprisingly good."
msgstr "绿色的糊糊，意外好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.2"
msgid "Need chips. Lots of chips."
msgstr "要薯片，很多很多薯片。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.1"
msgid "Bat droppings. Shares a name with my bat. Shameful."
msgstr "蝙蝠拉的。跟我的球棒同名，真丢人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.2"
msgid "Good for the garden. Bad for my nose."
msgstr "对菜园好，对我鼻子不好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.1"
msgid "An apple, but sweet enough to count as dessert."
msgstr "苹果裹糖，总算算甜点了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.2"
msgid "Sticky fingers incoming."
msgstr "手又要黏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.1"
msgid "A tentacle lollipop. Bite it before it bites me."
msgstr "触手棒棒糖。在它咬我之前先咬它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.2"
msgid "Swirly. Looks like it'd wiggle."
msgstr "一圈一圈的，看着会扭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.1"
msgid "Chocolate pig. Sorry, piggy."
msgstr "巧克力小猪。对不起了，小猪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.2"
msgid "Pigs are way cuter when they're edible."
msgstr "能吃的猪可爱多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.1"
msgid "Wiggly candy. My appetite is fading."
msgstr "会扭的糖，我的食欲没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.2"
msgid "Looks like bugs. Tastes like... I'm not checking."
msgstr "像虫子。味道……我不想知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.1"
msgid "My jaw gave up before the candy did."
msgstr "糖还没化，我下巴先投降了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.2"
msgid "Looks like a tiny planet. Lick it?"
msgstr "像个小星球。舔一下？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.1"
msgid "Sweet, then spicy. Betrayal."
msgstr "先甜后辣。背叛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.2"
msgid "My tongue's on fire. Worth it, maybe."
msgstr "舌头着火了。也许值吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.1"
msgid "Candy corn. People either love it or lie."
msgstr "糖玉米。要么爱吃，要么撒谎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.2"
msgid "Three colors, one flavor: sugar."
msgstr "三种颜色，一种味道：糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.1"
msgid "Wait, this is just corn."
msgstr "等等，这就是玉米啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.2"
msgid "Who hands out vegetables as candy?"
msgstr "谁拿蔬菜当糖发啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4.1"
msgid "Webber, don't watch me eat this."
msgstr "韦伯，别看我吃这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_4.2"
msgid "Chewy legs. Bite the head first."
msgstr "腿嚼着有劲，先咬头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5.1"
msgid "Catcoon-shaped. Too cute to bite. Biting anyway."
msgstr "浣猫形状的，可爱到舍不得咬。照咬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_5.2"
msgid "My teeth just filed a complaint."
msgstr "我的牙刚刚投诉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6.1"
msgid "These aren't real raisins, are they."
msgstr "这不是真的葡萄干吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_6.2"
msgid "Suspicious. Give them to Wolfgang."
msgstr "可疑。给沃尔夫冈吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7.1"
msgid "Healthy candy. The worst kind."
msgstr "健康的糖，最糟糕的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_7.2"
msgid "Somebody's grandma handed these out."
msgstr "肯定是谁家奶奶发的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8.1"
msgid "Ghost on a stick. Sweeter than the real ones."
msgstr "棍子上的幽灵，比真的甜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_8.2"
msgid "Licking a ghost. Weird sentence."
msgstr "舔幽灵。这句话好怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9.1"
msgid "A gummy worm. The birds would be jealous."
msgstr "软糖虫子，鸟都要嫉妒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_9.2"
msgid "Slurp it like a noodle."
msgstr "像面条一样吸进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY.1"
msgid "Liquid courage. I already have plenty."
msgstr "瓶装勇气。我本来就不缺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_BRAVERY.2"
msgid "Bottoms up. Trees, bring it on."
msgstr "干了。树们，放马过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT.1"
msgid "Big dose. Hope it's not homework-flavored."
msgstr "大剂量。希望不是作业味的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_POTENT.2"
msgid "Chugging this feels like a bad idea. Doing it anyway."
msgstr "一口闷感觉不太妙。还是闷了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK.1"
msgid "Weak stuff. Like decaf."
msgstr "效果真弱，跟无咖啡因的一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_DRINKS_WEAK.2"
msgid "Barely a sip. Did someone drink half?"
msgstr "就一小口。是谁先喝了一半？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX.1"
msgid "Party trick for campfires. Willow would approve."
msgstr "篝火上的小把戏，薇洛会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_FIRE_FX.2"
msgid "Pretty flames. Still won't cook any faster."
msgstr "火是好看了，煮饭可不会更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON.1"
msgid "Moon juice. Things change when you pour it."
msgstr "月亮汁，倒上去东西就变了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENPOTION_MOON.2"
msgid "Glowy bottle. Probably not for drinking."
msgstr "发光的瓶子，大概不能喝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1.1"
msgid "Cute ghost. Nicer than real ones."
msgstr "可爱的幽灵，比真的友善。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_1.2"
msgid "Boo. That's it, that's the decoration."
msgstr "“呜——”。就这样，装饰完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_10.1"
msgid "Spooky decoration. Not that spooky."
msgstr "吓人的装饰，也没多吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_10.2"
msgid "Last one. Then I'm taking a nap."
msgstr "最后一个，挂完我要去睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2.1"
msgid "A bat. Sadly not the kind I swing."
msgstr "蝙蝠。可惜不是我手里这种球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_2.2"
msgid "Upside down, just like me on the sofa."
msgstr "倒挂着，跟我躺沙发一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3.1"
msgid "Small and spooky. Fine, it's cute."
msgstr "又小又阴森。好吧，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_3.2"
msgid "Hang it on a tree and call it festive."
msgstr "挂树上就算有节日气氛了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4.1"
msgid "Tentacle on a string. Please don't slap me."
msgstr "挂着的触手。千万别甩我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_4.2"
msgid "At least this one won't burst out of a swamp."
msgstr "至少这根不会从沼泽里冒出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5.1"
msgid "Dangling spider. Webber, is this your cousin?"
msgstr "吊着的蜘蛛。韦伯，这是你亲戚吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_5.2"
msgid "Good thing it's fake. I'd have screamed."
msgstr "还好是假的，不然我就叫出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6.1"
msgid "Fake crow. Won't steal my snacks."
msgstr "假乌鸦，不会偷我的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_6.2"
msgid "Black bird, black mood. Matches me."
msgstr "黑鸟，坏心情，跟我挺配。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_7.1"
msgid "Lumpy little guy. I respect that."
msgstr "歪歪扭扭的小家伙，我尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_7.2"
msgid "Home ec class flashbacks."
msgstr "想起家政课了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_8.1"
msgid "Looks like my earphones after class."
msgstr "像我下课后的耳机线。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_8.2"
msgid "Who tied this? I'm not untangling it."
msgstr "谁绑的？我才不解。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_9.1"
msgid "Hang it up front where I can see it."
msgstr "挂在前面，我能看见的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEEN_ORNAMENT_9.2"
msgid "Don't tell anyone, but I'm keeping this."
msgstr "别告诉别人，这个我要留着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.1"
msgid "Heavy? Nah. One hand's fine."
msgstr "重？还好，一只手就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.2"
msgid "A hammer this fancy. My bat's getting jealous."
msgstr "这么气派的锤子，我的球棒要吃醋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "Fluffy and smelly. Weapon of mass annoyance."
msgstr "又蓬又臭，烦人级大杀器。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "Warm pillow, warm hits."
msgstr "暖和的枕头，暖和的一击。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.1"
msgid "Slimy pillow. Perfect for slapping Wilson."
msgstr "黏糊糊的枕头，正好拍威尔逊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.2"
msgid "Smells like the beach. The gross part."
msgstr "一股海滩味，恶心的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.1"
msgid "Flowery pillow. Hits soft, smells sweet."
msgstr "花瓣枕头，打着软，闻着香。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.2"
msgid "Gentle weapon. Not my style, but fine."
msgstr "温柔的武器，不是我的风格，凑合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "A metal pillow. That's just a club with extra steps."
msgstr "钢丝枕头，就是绕了个弯的棍子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "Finally, a pillow that matches my strength."
msgstr "总算有配得上我力气的枕头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.1"
msgid "Small knife, heavy vibe. Not touching it."
msgstr "小刀，气氛很重。我不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.2"
msgid "Sharp. I'll stick to blunt things."
msgstr "很锋利。我还是用钝的东西吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.1"
msgid "A catcoon gift. I'll pass."
msgstr "浣猫的礼物，免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.2"
msgid "Gross, but there might be something inside."
msgstr "恶心，但里面可能有东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.1"
msgid "Warm goo. Feels like a hot spring for bruises."
msgstr "热乎乎的药膏，像是给淤青泡温泉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.2"
msgid "Smells like rocks. Works, though."
msgstr "闻着一股石头味，但有效。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.1"
msgid "Wave it and people feel better. Easy job."
msgstr "挥一挥大家就好了，轻松的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.2"
msgid "More reliable than the school nurse."
msgstr "比校医靠谱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.1"
msgid "A hound made of thorns. Ouch, just looking."
msgstr "荆棘做的狗，看着就疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.2"
msgid "Leafy dog. Still a dog. Still biting."
msgstr "长叶子的狗，还是狗，还是会咬人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.1"
msgid "Something's growling in there."
msgstr "里面有东西在叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.2"
msgid "Bushes don't usually breathe. Just saying."
msgstr "草丛一般不会喘气。只是说说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.1"
msgid "She's grumpier than me. Impressive."
msgstr "她比我还难伺候。厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.2"
msgid "I'll help a bit. Don't make a big deal of it."
msgstr "我帮一点忙，别弄得多大事似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.1"
msgid "Spicy tea. Winter's worst enemy."
msgstr "辣辣的茶，冬天的克星。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.2"
msgid "One sip and my ears are warm."
msgstr "喝一口耳朵都暖了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.1"
msgid "Leaf tea. Tastes like a forest."
msgstr "叶子茶，喝着像森林。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.2"
msgid "Plain, but it's warm. That's enough."
msgstr "很普通，但热乎，够了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.1"
msgid "Calming tea. I might fall asleep."
msgstr "安神茶，我可能要睡着了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.2"
msgid "Blue tea? Pretty, at least."
msgstr "蓝色的茶？至少挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "Moon flower tea. Feels fancy."
msgstr "月树花泡的茶，挺高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "Tastes like moonlight. Whatever that means."
msgstr "喝着像月光。不管那是什么意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.1"
msgid "Flower tea. Sweet and gentle."
msgstr "花茶，又甜又温和。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.2"
msgid "Fancy tea party. Pinky out."
msgstr "高级茶会，翘起小拇指。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.1"
msgid "Dark tea. Tastes like a bad mood."
msgstr "黑乎乎的茶，喝着像坏心情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.2"
msgid "Brave enough to drink it? Sure. Watch me."
msgstr "敢不敢喝？当然。看着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.1"
msgid "Succulent tea. Summer survival kit."
msgstr "多肉茶，夏天的救命药。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.2"
msgid "Cool and refreshing. Another cup, please."
msgstr "清凉解渴，再来一杯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.1"
msgid "Bitter. That means it's healthy, right?"
msgstr "苦的。苦的就是健康的，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.2"
msgid "Tea from garden weeds. Sure, why not."
msgstr "用菜园的杂草泡的茶。行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Dark and lonely. Kinda like the school at night."
msgstr "又黑又冷清，像晚上的学校。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "Someone should fix this. Not me, though."
msgstr "得有人修一下，反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A nice lamp. Grandma has taste."
msgstr "挺好看的灯，老奶奶有品味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bright enough that I can't pretend I'm lost."
msgstr "亮到我没法装迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.1"
msgid "A little light for her island. Cute."
msgstr "给她小岛的小灯，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.2"
msgid "Carrying furniture again. Story of my life."
msgstr "又在搬家具，我的人生就是这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.1"
msgid "Moving day. My back already hurts."
msgstr "搬家日，我腰已经开始疼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.2"
msgid "Grandma's moving. Guess I'm the strong one."
msgstr "老奶奶要搬家，看来力气活归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.1"
msgid "Big shell. Smells like the ocean."
msgstr "大贝壳，有海的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.2"
msgid "Fragile cargo. Hands off, everyone."
msgstr "易碎品，都别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Open for business. Any free snacks?"
msgstr "开张了，有免费点心吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Tea time. Best class of the day."
msgstr "下午茶时间，一天里最棒的一节课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.1"
msgid "Smells good. Hurry up a little."
msgstr "好香，稍微快点嘛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.2"
msgid "Waiting for tea is a good excuse to nap."
msgstr "等茶正好是睡觉的借口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.1"
msgid "Who burned the tea shop? Was it Willow?"
msgstr "谁把茶铺烧了？是薇洛吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.2"
msgid "Charcoal tea. Not on the menu."
msgstr "炭烧茶，菜单上可没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Closed. Just like my motivation."
msgstr "关门了，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "No tea yet? Then I'm napping on the steps."
msgstr "还没茶？那我在台阶上睡会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.1"
msgid "Bath bomb fizz. Wake me in an hour."
msgstr "浴盐泡泡，一小时后叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.2"
msgid "Bubbles everywhere. This is the life."
msgstr "到处都是泡泡，这才叫生活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.1"
msgid "A dry hot spring is just a hole."
msgstr "干掉的温泉就是个坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. My dreams of soaking, crushed."
msgstr "空的。泡澡的梦碎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Steamy. Five minutes, then I'm going in."
msgstr "冒着热气。再等五分钟我就进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hot spring. Best thing on this whole sea."
msgstr "温泉，整片海上最好的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.1"
msgid "A hot spring under construction. Fine, I'll lift stuff."
msgstr "温泉在施工，好吧，重的我来搬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.2"
msgid "Soaking later is the only reason I'm helping."
msgstr "我帮忙只是为了等会能泡澡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.1"
msgid "Nicer than my room, honestly."
msgstr "说实话，比我房间还好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.2"
msgid "Look at that. We did good."
msgstr "看看，我们干得不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Kinda shabby. She deserves better."
msgstr "有点破，她值得更好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A few planks would fix it. Probably."
msgstr "补几块木板就能修好。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.1"
msgid "Laundry day. Even out here."
msgstr "洗衣日，在这里也逃不掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.2"
msgid "Her clothes are cleaner than mine."
msgstr "她的衣服比我的还干净。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.1"
msgid "Jingly. Kinda relaxing, actually."
msgstr "叮叮当当的，其实挺放松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.2"
msgid "A wind chime. Perfect nap music."
msgstr "风铃，正好当午睡音乐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.1"
msgid "A gift from Pearl. Guess I did okay."
msgstr "珍珠送的礼物。看来我做得还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.2"
msgid "Hope it's food. It's never food."
msgstr "希望是吃的。每次都不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.1"
msgid "Shells. Can't eat them. Sigh."
msgstr "贝壳。不能吃。唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.2"
msgid "Collecting shells like a kid at the beach."
msgstr "跟在海边捡贝壳的小孩似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.1"
msgid "Cracked... I didn't mean to."
msgstr "裂了……我不是故意的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.2"
msgid "Maybe she won't notice. She'll notice."
msgstr "她也许不会发现。她肯定会发现。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.1"
msgid "Shiny. I'd better not drop it."
msgstr "亮晶晶的，我可别弄掉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.2"
msgid "Heavy for something so small. Must be precious."
msgstr "这么小却沉甸甸的，一定很珍贵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.1"
msgid "That blade gives me goosebumps."
msgstr "那把刀让我起鸡皮疙瘩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.2"
msgid "Louis can keep that one. I'll stick with my bat."
msgstr "那把给路易斯吧，我用球棒就好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.1"
msgid "A bee crown. Am I queen now?"
msgstr "蜜蜂王冠。我现在是女王了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.2"
msgid "Sticky crown. Worth it for the calm."
msgstr "黏黏的王冠，为了安心值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.1"
msgid "Shiny metal bar. Feels expensive."
msgstr "亮闪闪的金属条，感觉很贵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.2"
msgid "Could forge a new bat out of this."
msgstr "能拿来打一根新球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.1"
msgid "Cozy. Mind if I nap here?"
msgstr "挺舒适的，我在这睡会儿行吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.2"
msgid "Knock first. Manners, I guess."
msgstr "先敲门。礼貌嘛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Whatever it said, it's ash now."
msgstr "不管写了啥，现在都是灰了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.2"
msgid "A burnt sign. Very helpful."
msgstr "烧焦的牌子，真有帮助。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Somebody wrote on it. Neater than my notes."
msgstr "有人写了字，比我的笔记工整。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Signs are for people who get lost. Not me. Probably."
msgstr "牌子是给迷路的人看的。不是我。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "Blank. Like my homework."
msgstr "空白的，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "Should I write something? Nah, too much effort."
msgstr "要写点啥吗？算了，懒得写。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.1"
msgid "Smells sweet. Leftover honey, maybe?"
msgstr "闻着甜，可能还剩点蜜？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.2"
msgid "Waxy. Good for building a bee box."
msgstr "蜡蜡的，可以做蜂箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.1"
msgid "Honey on ham. Genius."
msgstr "火腿抹蜂蜜，天才。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.2"
msgid "I'd skip class for this. Again."
msgstr "为这个我可以再逃一次课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.1"
msgid "Sticky nuggets. Lick your fingers after."
msgstr "黏黏的肉块，吃完舔手指。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.2"
msgid "Fast food, survival edition."
msgstr "快餐，荒野求生版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.1"
msgid "Loud enough to wake me up. That's saying something."
msgstr "响得能把我吵醒。这可不容易。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.2"
msgid "A beefalo horn. Somebody's having a bad hair day."
msgstr "牛角。有头牛今天形象很糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.1"
msgid "Darker than regular nightmare fuel. Gross."
msgstr "比普通的噩梦燃料还黑。恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.2"
msgid "It's squirming. Put it down."
msgstr "它在蠕动。放下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.1"
msgid "Lucky charm? Can it get me out of tests?"
msgstr "幸运符？能让我不用考试吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.2"
msgid "No horse around. Where'd this come from?"
msgstr "附近又没马，哪来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.1"
msgid "Spicy enough to sweat in winter."
msgstr "辣得冬天都出汗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.2"
msgid "Warly, did you want me to breathe fire?"
msgstr "沃利，你是想让我喷火吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.1"
msgid "Fizzing like soda. Can I drink it?"
msgstr "跟汽水一样冒泡。能喝吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.2"
msgid "A bath bomb? Fancy. Too bad I can't jump in."
msgstr "泡澡球？挺讲究的，可惜不能跳进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Somebody drank the whole thing, right?"
msgstr "肯定有人把水全喝光了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Dry. Just like my motivation."
msgstr "干了。跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Warm water outdoors. Beats the school pool."
msgstr "露天的温水，比学校泳池强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If I fall asleep in there, just leave me."
msgstr "我要是在里面睡着了，别管我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.1"
msgid "Can't soak in that anymore. Lame."
msgstr "这下没法泡了，真没劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.2"
msgid "Guess I'm smashing it out. Bat time."
msgstr "那就敲出来吧，该球棒出场了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.1"
msgid "Somebody's leftovers. Not mine, I hope."
msgstr "谁吃剩的？别是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.2"
msgid "Kick it and it rattles. Creepy."
msgstr "踢一脚还哗啦响，瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Smells like the cafeteria burned lunch again."
msgstr "跟食堂又把午饭烧糊了一个味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Good. Stay down this time."
msgstr "很好，这次给我躺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hope it's actually dead this time."
msgstr "希望这回是真的死透了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Poke it with the bat first. Just in case."
msgstr "先拿球棒戳一戳，以防万一。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Hey, nobody said you could get up."
msgstr "喂，谁让你起来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Nope. Burn it before it finishes."
msgstr "不行，趁它还没起来赶紧烧了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.1"
msgid "A whole dorm full of dogs. Noisy neighbors."
msgstr "一整栋狗宿舍。邻居肯定很吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.2"
msgid "Bones outside means trouble inside."
msgstr "外面全是骨头，里面肯定不好惹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.1"
msgid "Spitting teeth at things. Real classy."
msgstr "朝别人吐牙齿，真有格调。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.2"
msgid "Whose mouth was this in before mine?"
msgstr "在我之前是谁的嘴碰过这个？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.1"
msgid "Blow this and hounds get friendly? Doubt it."
msgstr "吹一下猎犬就变友好？我不信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2"
msgid "A whistle. Like the gym teacher, but useful."
msgstr "哨子，跟体育老师一样，但有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.1"
msgid "Even I'm not that hungry."
msgstr "我再饿也没饿到这份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.2"
msgid "Nope. Absolutely, completely nope."
msgstr "不要。绝对、完全不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooking it only made it worse."
msgstr "煮了反而更恶心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Who even made this? Step forward."
msgstr "谁做的？站出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Drying it doesn't make it a snack."
msgstr "晒干了也不算零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Label it. Big red letters."
msgstr "贴个标签，红色大字的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.1"
msgid "A walking box. Works harder than me."
msgstr "会走路的箱子，比我还勤快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.2"
msgid "That tongue's kind of gross. Still cute."
msgstr "舌头有点恶心，但还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A fish in a bowl. Don't drop it."
msgstr "碗里装着鱼，别摔了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Carry this around and get a free backpack."
msgstr "揣着这个就能白捡一个背包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.1"
msgid "The fish looks lonely. Me too, kind of."
msgstr "鱼看着挺寂寞的。我也有点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.2"
msgid "Give it a day. Even I need naps."
msgstr "给它一天吧，我也要睡午觉的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big ice cube. Wish I had a drink."
msgstr "好大一块冰，可惜没饮料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If the boat hits that, we're swimming home."
msgstr "船撞上去，我们就得游回去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.1"
msgid "Gone. So much for shaved ice."
msgstr "没了。刨冰也泡汤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.2"
msgid "Good. One less thing to steer around."
msgstr "也好，少一个要绕的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.1"
msgid "Should've chipped some off for later."
msgstr "早知道先敲一块留着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.2"
msgid "Just sea. Very boring sea."
msgstr "只剩海了。很无聊的海。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.1"
msgid "Brain freeze is totally worth it."
msgstr "冻到脑壳疼也值。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.2"
msgid "Don't even ask. I'm not sharing."
msgstr "别问了，不分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.1"
msgid "Holding it makes my fingers go numb."
msgstr "拿着手指都冻麻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.2"
msgid "Great for keeping drinks cold. Kidding."
msgstr "拿来冰饮料正好。开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.1"
msgid "Even colder? Is there a limit?"
msgstr "还能更冷？有上限吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.2"
msgid "One zap and they're a popsicle."
msgstr "一下就把它们冻成冰棍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Icy beefalo fashion. Style over warmth."
msgstr "给牛穿的冰系衣服，要风度不要温度。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Nice pattern. Who's sewing it? Not me."
msgstr "图样还行。谁来缝？反正不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Okay, my head's being weird again."
msgstr "好吧，脑子又开始不对劲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Blocking the road. Move it, rock."
msgstr "挡路了。让开，石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "I could step right over it."
msgstr "一脚就能跨过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "Something about it still bugs me."
msgstr "不知道为什么还是有点膈应。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.1"
msgid "Still sleepy. Still hungry. Still me."
msgstr "还是困，还是饿，还是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.2"
msgid "Skirt's fine, bat's fine. Good enough."
msgstr "裙子没事，球棒没事，够了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.1"
msgid "One swing of the bat and they snap."
msgstr "球棒一抡就断了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.2"
msgid "These grabby plants have no manners."
msgstr "这些乱抓人的草真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.1"
msgid "Sticky fingers all day now."
msgstr "手指要黏一整天了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.2"
msgid "Spoon? Who needs a spoon."
msgstr "勺子？要什么勺子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.1"
msgid "Healing candy? This place got one thing right."
msgstr "能回血的糖？这地方总算做对了一件事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.2"
msgid "One more. Okay, two more."
msgstr "再来一颗。好吧，两颗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.1"
msgid "Digging through trash. What a glamorous life."
msgstr "翻垃圾。多么光鲜的人生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.2"
msgid "Looks like the back row of my classroom."
msgstr "跟我们教室后排一个样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Grab it and run. Simple."
msgstr "抢了就跑，很简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "One wrong pull and it's an avalanche."
msgstr "抽错一下就要雪崩了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Messier than my locker. Barely."
msgstr "比我的储物柜还乱。勉强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something's living in there, I bet."
msgstr "我打赌里面住着什么东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.1"
msgid "Omelette! Where's the ketchup? I need it now."
msgstr "煎蛋卷！番茄酱呢？我现在就要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.2"
msgid "Eggs for breakfast. Best way to start the day."
msgstr "早饭吃蛋，一天就该这么开始。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.1"
msgid "Meat on a stick. Festival food."
msgstr "肉串，庙会标配。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.2"
msgid "Careful with the stick. Don't poke an eye out."
msgstr "小心签子，别戳到眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.1"
msgid "Creepy, like a test I didn't study for."
msgstr "跟没复习就去考试一样瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.2"
msgid "A black blade? Louis has dark taste."
msgstr "黑色的刀？Louis口味挺重啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.1"
msgid "Louis would yell at me for touching this."
msgstr "我要是碰了，Louis肯定会骂我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.2"
msgid "Sharp enough to slice bread. Tempting."
msgstr "锋利到能切面包，有点心动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.1"
msgid "Almost a sword. Almost."
msgstr "差一点就是刀了。差一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.2"
msgid "You finish it, Louis. I'm napping."
msgstr "Louis你来弄完吧，我去睡会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.1"
msgid "Slimy. Like a wet sock."
msgstr "黏糊糊的，跟湿袜子一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.2"
msgid "Could I wrap onigiri with this?"
msgstr "能拿来包饭团吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm seaweed. Weirdly comforting."
msgstr "热乎乎的海带，莫名安心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Tastes like the ocean gave up."
msgstr "吃起来像大海放弃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.1"
msgid "Crunchy now. Good for snacking in class."
msgstr "脆了，上课偷吃正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.2"
msgid "Just like the convenience store seaweed chips."
msgstr "跟便利店的海苔片一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "No gem, just a fancy stick."
msgstr "没宝石就是根花哨的棍子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty socket. Looks unfinished."
msgstr "空着个槽，看着像没做完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Swing it like a bat? Probably not allowed."
msgstr "当球棒挥？估计不行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Makes me look like the principal."
msgstr "拿着像校长似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.1"
msgid "Great. Now the kittens will never forgive us."
msgstr "完了，小猫不会原谅我们的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.2"
msgid "Charcoal. Not even fun charcoal."
msgstr "成焦炭了，玩都没法玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It wobbles. Even I want to swat it."
msgstr "晃来晃去的，我都想拍一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "More fun than homework, that's for sure."
msgstr "反正比作业好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT.1"
msgid "Cat furniture. Fancier than my room."
msgstr "猫家具，比我房间还高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1_KIT.2"
msgid "Kittens get toys, I get chores. Unfair."
msgstr "小猫有玩具，我只有家务。不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT.1"
msgid "Who let fire near the cat toys?"
msgstr "谁让火靠近猫玩具的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ash. The kittens look so disappointed."
msgstr "成灰了。小猫一脸失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "So simple, and they still go crazy for it."
msgstr "这么简单的玩具，它们都玩疯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Can I play too? Kidding. Mostly."
msgstr "我也能玩吗？开玩笑的，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT.1"
msgid "More cat stuff. They're spoiled."
msgstr "又是猫的东西，被宠坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR2_KIT.2"
msgid "Build it, then watch them ignore it."
msgstr "搭好它，然后看它们无视它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.1"
msgid "Their home's gone. Now I'm mad."
msgstr "它们的窝没了。我生气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.2"
msgid "Rebuild it. Today. No excuses."
msgstr "重建，今天就弄，没得商量。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A cat nap house. I want in too."
msgstr "猫的午睡屋。我也想进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Too small for me. Unfair."
msgstr "我进不去。不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.1"
msgid "Hide and seek. I used to win by falling asleep."
msgstr "捉迷藏。我以前都是睡着了赢的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.2"
msgid "Come out, or no snacks."
msgstr "出来，不然没零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1"
msgid "Hurry, hurry. Check under that bush."
msgstr "快快快，看看那丛灌木下面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2"
msgid "Losing to kittens would be so embarrassing."
msgstr "输给小猫就太丢人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.1"
msgid "A cat house. They'll nap more than me."
msgstr "猫窝，它们会比我还能睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.2"
msgid "Set this up and the kittens will come. Hopefully."
msgstr "搭好了小猫就会来。希望吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.1"
msgid "Orange like autumn leaves. Cozy."
msgstr "跟秋叶一样橙，暖暖的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.2"
msgid "Stop climbing trees, you'll get stuck."
msgstr "别爬树了，会下不来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.1"
msgid "Big ears. Bet it hears my stomach growling."
msgstr "耳朵这么大，肯定听得见我肚子叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.2"
msgid "Sandy paws. Don't walk on my bed."
msgstr "爪子全是沙，别踩我床。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.1"
msgid "A classic forest kitty. Good."
msgstr "标准的森林小猫。很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.2"
msgid "Shh. Stay quiet and you can nap on my lap."
msgstr "嘘，安静点就能睡我腿上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS.1"
msgid "Basically a lawn with a tail."
msgstr "简直是一块长尾巴的草坪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_GRASS.2"
msgid "Nearly stepped on you. Make some noise."
msgstr "差点踩到你，出点声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH.1"
msgid "Smells a bit swampy. Still cute."
msgstr "有点沼泽味，但还是可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MARSH.2"
msgid "Did Wurt teach you to like mud?"
msgstr "是沃特教你喜欢泥巴的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON.1"
msgid "Glowy and weird. Just like that island."
msgstr "发着光，怪怪的，跟那座岛一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_MOON.2"
msgid "Don't go mutating on me, okay?"
msgstr "别给我变异啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.1"
msgid "Naming a cat. I'm going with \"Bat.\""
msgstr "给猫起名，就叫“球棒”吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.2"
msgid "Name tag. Like a school ID, but cuter."
msgstr "名牌，跟学生证一样，就是可爱点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.1"
msgid "Tough little thing. Respect."
msgstr "小东西还挺硬，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.2"
msgid "Rock-colored. Perfect camouflage for naps."
msgstr "石头色的，睡觉都不怕被发现。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.1"
msgid "Spotty, like a tiny cheetah."
msgstr "斑点像只迷你猎豹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.2"
msgid "Racing the beefalo again? You'll lose."
msgstr "又跟牛赛跑？你会输的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.1"
msgid "Festive kitten. Maybe it brings luck."
msgstr "过节的小猫，说不定是招财猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.2"
msgid "So fancy. More dressed up than me."
msgstr "打扮得比我还讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.1"
msgid "An antler key. The deer must be furious."
msgstr "鹿角当钥匙，鹿肯定气坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.2"
msgid "Weird-shaped key. Better not lose it."
msgstr "形状真怪的钥匙，别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.1"
msgid "A loot bag. Christmas came early."
msgstr "战利品袋，圣诞节提前了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.2"
msgid "Opening it feels like a trap. Doing it anyway."
msgstr "打开像是陷阱，那也得开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.1"
msgid "A chess piece that fights back. I hate chess."
msgstr "会还手的棋子。我最讨厌下棋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.2"
msgid "Clip-clop all day. Doesn't it get tired?"
msgstr "整天咔哒咔哒的，不累吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "Rusty and cranky. Like a teacher on Monday."
msgstr "生锈还暴躁，跟周一的老师一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "One good swing and it falls apart."
msgstr "一棒子下去就散架了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.1"
msgid "Good horse. Stay close, snacks later."
msgstr "好马，跟紧点，待会给零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.2"
msgid "Having a bodyguard is kind of nice."
msgstr "有个保镖还挺不错的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.1"
msgid "Ditching me already? Fine, whatever."
msgstr "这么快就跟别人跑了？行吧，随便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.2"
msgid "Good. One less thing for me to babysit."
msgstr "也好，我少带一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A festive knight? Ribbons don't fool me."
msgstr "过节版的骑士？丝带可骗不了我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "All dressed up. Maybe it's friendly."
msgstr "打扮得这么漂亮，也许挺友好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.1"
msgid "Dinner's here. Who's carving?"
msgstr "晚饭到了，谁来切？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.2"
msgid "Poor thing. Smells delicious, though."
msgstr "可怜的家伙，不过闻着好香。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.1"
msgid "Figs in a trunk. Who comes up with this?"
msgstr "象鼻里塞无花果，谁想出来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.2"
msgid "Looks weird. Smells amazing. I'm in."
msgstr "看着怪，闻着香。我吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.1"
msgid "Fancy mounting. Louis has expensive taste."
msgstr "装具这么讲究，Louis品味真贵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.2"
msgid "Too pretty to swing. My bat's easier."
msgstr "漂亮得舍不得挥，还是球棒顺手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.1"
msgid "Smells like Krampus. Gross."
msgstr "一股坎普斯味，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.2"
msgid "So much room I could nap inside."
msgstr "空间这么大，我都能睡进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.1"
msgid "Potato pancakes. My kind of food."
msgstr "土豆饼。我爱吃这种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.2"
msgid "Greasy fingers, happy stomach."
msgstr "手是油的，肚子是开心的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.1"
msgid "Basically a wall I can wear."
msgstr "简直是把墙穿身上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.2"
msgid "Good for standing still. My specialty."
msgstr "适合站着不动，我的强项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.1"
msgid "Heavy, but I'm strong. No problem."
msgstr "重是重，但我力气大，没事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.2"
msgid "Like a schoolbag full of textbooks."
msgstr "像背了一书包课本。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.1"
msgid "Basically a gym uniform."
msgstr "跟体育服差不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.2"
msgid "Woven reeds? Hope nobody brings fire."
msgstr "芦苇编的？希望没人带火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.1"
msgid "Feathers. Perfect for skipping class faster."
msgstr "有羽毛，翘课都能跑更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.2"
msgid "Lighter than my homework."
msgstr "比我的作业还轻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.1"
msgid "Plain wooden armor. Gets the job done."
msgstr "普通木甲，够用了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.2"
msgid "Not too heavy, not too flimsy. Boring, but fine."
msgstr "不重不轻，无聊但还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.1"
msgid "Spiky armor. Hug me and regret it."
msgstr "带刺的甲，谁抱我谁后悔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.2"
msgid "Hit harder in this? Sounds good."
msgstr "穿这个打得更狠？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.1"
msgid "Silky. Almost feels like pajamas."
msgstr "滑滑的，差点以为是睡衣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.2"
msgid "Faster cooldowns mean faster naps."
msgstr "冷却快，午睡也来得快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.1"
msgid "Extra padding. Lazy defense, my style."
msgstr "多垫一层，懒人防御，我的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.2"
msgid "Makes me harder to knock down."
msgstr "穿上就没那么容易被打趴下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.1"
msgid "Waving flags at us? Rude."
msgstr "冲我们挥旗子？没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.2"
msgid "That flag's buffing them. Bat it down."
msgstr "旗子在给它们加成，敲倒它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.1"
msgid "Willow's bear, but bigger and angrier."
msgstr "薇洛的熊，变大变凶了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.2"
msgid "Go on, big guy. Take the hits for me."
msgstr "去吧大块头，替我挨打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.1"
msgid "Big talk from the guy in the stands."
msgstr "坐看台上的人话真多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.2"
msgid "Bet he's never fought anything himself."
msgstr "我打赌他自己从来没动过手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "A crown for hitting harder. Fancy."
msgstr "打得更狠的王冠，真讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "Like a prom queen with a bat."
msgstr "像拿着球棒的舞会女王。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.1"
msgid "A rock buddy. Doesn't complain. Nice."
msgstr "石头搭档，不抱怨，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.2"
msgid "Tough, but don't expect conversation."
msgstr "挺能打，但别指望它聊天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.1"
msgid "Too many eyes. Like a teacher's stare."
msgstr "眼睛太多了，像被老师盯着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.2"
msgid "A magic hat. Not my department."
msgstr "法术帽子，不归我管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.1"
msgid "Feathers on my head. Running away just got easier."
msgstr "头上插羽毛，跑路更方便了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.2"
msgid "Pretty, and I dodge trouble faster."
msgstr "好看，还能更快躲开麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.1"
msgid "Throwing fire? Willow's dream come true."
msgstr "扔火？薇洛梦想成真了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.2"
msgid "Like dodgeball, but it explodes."
msgstr "像躲避球，不过会爆炸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "Flowers that help heal. Cute."
msgstr "能帮忙治疗的花，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "Faster healing. Great for lazy people."
msgstr "治疗来得快，适合懒人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.1"
msgid "Health trickles back, like my energy after lunch."
msgstr "体力一点点回来，跟午饭后的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.2"
msgid "A flower ring. Kind of girly. I'll wear it."
msgstr "花环，有点少女。我戴就是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.1"
msgid "Big sword. Louis would get way too excited."
msgstr "这么大的剑，Louis肯定兴奋坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.2"
msgid "Heavier than my bat. Interesting."
msgstr "比我的球棒还重，有意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.1"
msgid "A lock with no key. Like my locker."
msgstr "有锁没钥匙，跟我的储物柜一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.2"
msgid "Where's the key? Everyone check your pockets."
msgstr "钥匙呢？大家翻翻口袋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.1"
msgid "Key's in. Now we just wait."
msgstr "钥匙插好了，等着就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.2"
msgid "Done. Can I go home yet?"
msgstr "好了。可以回家了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "Spiky helmet. Headbutts are allowed now."
msgstr "带刺的头盔，可以头槌了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "A little extra damage. I'll take it."
msgstr "多一点伤害，我收下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.1"
msgid "Woodie's axe? Does it still talk here?"
msgstr "伍迪的斧子？在这里也会说话吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.2"
msgid "Throw, catch, don't drop it on your foot."
msgstr "扔出去，接住，别砸到脚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Our ticket home. Don't lose it."
msgstr "回家的门票，别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks like a giant drain. Lovely."
msgstr "像个巨大的下水道。真美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.1"
msgid "Finally. Home time."
msgstr "总算放学了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.2"
msgid "It's open. Last one through buys lunch."
msgstr "开了。最后过去的请吃午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.1"
msgid "A tiara? On me? Seriously?"
msgstr "王冠？给我戴？认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.2"
msgid "Less waiting around. I like that."
msgstr "少等一会，这我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.1"
msgid "A glowing plant helmet. Hope it doesn't take root."
msgstr "发光的植物头盔，希望别在我头上生根。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.2"
msgid "Looks like a giant flower bud. Very me. Not."
msgstr "像个大花苞，很适合我。才怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.1"
msgid "Fancy glowy gear, fixed with glowy tape. Classic."
msgstr "高级发光装备，用发光胶带修。很经典。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.2"
msgid "Basically a first-aid kit for armor."
msgstr "说白了就是盔甲用的急救包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.1"
msgid "Moon workbench, some assembly required."
msgstr "月亮工作台，需要自己组装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.2"
msgid "Glowy parts in a box. Like a fancy toy set."
msgstr "盒子里一堆发光零件，像高级玩具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.1"
msgid "Bubbling green stuff. The chem teacher would love this."
msgstr "冒绿泡的东西，化学老师肯定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.2"
msgid "If it explodes, I was never here."
msgstr "要是炸了，我可不在场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.1"
msgid "A blank scroll. Perfect for doodling in class."
msgstr "空白卷轴，很适合上课涂鸦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.2"
msgid "Write the map down and share it. Saves explaining."
msgstr "把地图记下来分享，省得解释。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD.1"
msgid "A lamp for night racing. Who races at night?"
msgstr "夜间比赛用的灯，谁晚上比赛啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM_YOTD.2"
msgid "Shiny dragon lamp. At least it looks cool."
msgstr "亮闪闪的龙灯，至少挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM.1"
msgid "A festive mast. The wind does the work. Nice."
msgstr "喜庆的桅杆，风来干活，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD_ITEM.2"
msgid "Sail up, then I can rest."
msgstr "帆升起来，我就能休息了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Empty rack, empty stomach. Sad combo."
msgstr "空架子，空肚子，悲伤组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "Nobody's drying anything. What a waste of space."
msgstr "什么都没晾，浪费地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.1"
msgid "Smoked a little too hard."
msgstr "熏过头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.2"
msgid "Well, nothing's getting dried here now."
msgstr "好吧，现在这里什么都晾不了了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.1"
msgid "Jerky time. Nobody touch it."
msgstr "肉干时间到，谁都别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.2"
msgid "Chewy snacks for class. Perfect."
msgstr "上课嚼的零食，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "All crispy now. Snack secured."
msgstr "晒脆了，零食到手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Not meat, but I'll still eat it."
msgstr "不是肉，但我照样吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.1"
msgid "Salt! Food just got way better."
msgstr "盐！饭菜立马变好吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.2"
msgid "Seawater turned into seasoning. Science, I guess."
msgstr "海水变调料，大概是科学吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.1"
msgid "Staring at it won't make it faster. I'll stare anyway."
msgstr "盯着也不会快，我还是要盯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.2"
msgid "Smells tasty already. Mean."
msgstr "已经闻着好香了，好过分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "Wet jerky. Nobody wants that."
msgstr "湿肉干，谁要啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "The sky really hates my snacks."
msgstr "老天真的讨厌我的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Soggy greens. Like a school lunch."
msgstr "泡软的菜，跟学校午饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Dear rain, please take a break."
msgstr "雨啊，请休息一下吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Still floppy. Give it time."
msgstr "还软塌塌的，再等等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Almost crunchy. Almost."
msgstr "快脆了，就差一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A big rack. My kind of furniture."
msgstr "大号晾架，我喜欢的家具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.2"
msgid "More hooks means more snacks. Simple math."
msgstr "钩子越多零食越多，简单数学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.1"
msgid "Tiny glowing boat. Kinda adorable."
msgstr "小小的发光船，有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.2"
msgid "Let it float away. Like my homework."
msgstr "让它漂走吧，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.1"
msgid "A tiny sign. For tiny labels."
msgstr "小牌子，贴小标签用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.2"
msgid "Put it by the chests so I stop opening the wrong one."
msgstr "插在箱子旁边，省得我老开错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.1"
msgid "Glass axe. Cuts trees like butter."
msgstr "玻璃斧，砍树跟切黄油一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.2"
msgid "Looks fragile, but hits hard. Like me."
msgstr "看着易碎，打起来狠。跟我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.1"
msgid "A little moon statue. Looks like it's judging me."
msgstr "小小的月亮雕像，像在评判我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.2"
msgid "The key to the portal? Weird-shaped key."
msgstr "传送门的钥匙？形状挺怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.1"
msgid "Chop, mine, chop. One tool, half the luggage."
msgstr "砍、挖、砍，一件工具，行李减半。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.2"
msgid "Thulecite tool. Fancy and practical."
msgstr "铥矿做的，好看又实用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.1"
msgid "A sleeping cap. Finally, official nap gear."
msgstr "睡帽，终于有正式的午睡装备了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.2"
msgid "Five more minutes. Make that five hours."
msgstr "再睡五分钟。不对，五小时。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.1"
msgid "Quiet. Good time for a nap."
msgstr "很安静，适合睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.2"
msgid "Nothing's crawling out. For now."
msgstr "暂时没东西爬出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.1"
msgid "The nightmares are dozing off. Me too."
msgstr "噩梦要睡了，我也想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.2"
msgid "Hang in there. Almost calm."
msgstr "撑住，快平静了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.1"
msgid "Dead silent. Not even a flicker."
msgstr "一点动静都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.2"
msgid "Guess the nightmares don't reach this far."
msgstr "看来噩梦到不了这里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.1"
msgid "Full nightmare. Great, just great."
msgstr "噩梦全开，好极了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.2"
msgid "Monsters everywhere. Keep the bat handy."
msgstr "到处是怪，球棒拿好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.1"
msgid "Calming down. Finally."
msgstr "在平静下来了，总算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.2"
msgid "The worst is over. I think."
msgstr "最糟的过去了，我觉得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.1"
msgid "Something's stirring. I don't like it."
msgstr "有东西在动，我不喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.2"
msgid "The medallion's twitchy. Bad sign."
msgstr "勋章在抖，不是好兆头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.1"
msgid "Here they come. Bat ready."
msgstr "它们来了，球棒准备。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.2"
msgid "Getting worse fast. Like a pop quiz."
msgstr "越来越糟，像突击测验。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "Gardening goggles. Wormwood's secret envy."
msgstr "园艺护目镜，沃姆伍德偷偷羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "I know what the plants want. Still not doing it."
msgstr "知道植物想要啥了，但我还是不想干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.1"
msgid "A little ball. Even my eraser looks fancier."
msgstr "就一个小球，我的橡皮都比它讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.2"
msgid "Staring at this thing makes me sleepy."
msgstr "盯着它看，我就犯困。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.1"
msgid "Same color as egg yolk. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "跟蛋黄一个颜色，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.2"
msgid "Bright enough to wake me up. Almost."
msgstr "亮得差点把我叫醒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.1"
msgid "The crow didn't need all those feathers anyway."
msgstr "反正乌鸦也用不着那么多毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.2"
msgid "Black on dark water. Good luck seeing it."
msgstr "黑的放在深水上，祝我看得见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.1"
msgid "Took this off that giant goose. She owes me."
msgstr "从那只大鹅身上拿的，算她欠我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.2"
msgid "Big feather, big throw. Less walking."
msgstr "毛大，甩得远，少走几步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "That bird kept dive-bombing me. Now it's my float."
msgstr "那鸟老往我身上扑，现在归我当浮标了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "Fanciest float out here. Fish should feel honored."
msgstr "最高档的浮标，鱼该觉得荣幸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.1"
msgid "Sporty, huh. More sporty than me, anyway."
msgstr "运动款？反正比我爱运动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll stare at this one for a while."
msgstr "行吧，那就盯这个看一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.1"
msgid "Fish probably think it's a cherry."
msgstr "鱼八成以为是樱桃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.2"
msgid "Stop-sign red. Fish, stop right here."
msgstr "红得像停车标志。鱼，到此为止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.1"
msgid "A snowbird donated this. Not willingly."
msgstr "雪雀捐的。不太情愿就是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.2"
msgid "Fluffy. I'd rather use it as a pillow."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，我更想拿来当枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.1"
msgid "A lure that makes fish sleepy. Finally, someone gets me."
msgstr "让鱼犯困的饵，总算有谁懂我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.2"
msgid "Sleepy fish don't fight back. Smart."
msgstr "犯困的鱼不会挣扎，聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.1"
msgid "For heavyweights. The fish, not me."
msgstr "钓重量级的。说的是鱼，不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.2"
msgid "Big fish only. Small fry, go home."
msgstr "只要大鱼，小鱼回家去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.1"
msgid "Fish like rain. I like umbrellas."
msgstr "鱼喜欢下雨，我喜欢打伞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.2"
msgid "Pearl made this one. Don't lose it."
msgstr "珍珀做的，别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.1"
msgid "Snow fishing? My fingers vote no."
msgstr "下雪钓鱼？我手指投反对票。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.2"
msgid "Pearl's lure for frozen days. She thinks of everything."
msgstr "珍珀做的雪天专用饵，她想得真周到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.1"
msgid "Big fish at night. Bigger yawn from me."
msgstr "夜里钓大鱼，我的哈欠更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.2"
msgid "Blue and shiny, like a vending machine at midnight."
msgstr "蓝光闪闪，像半夜的自动贩卖机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.1"
msgid "Dusk lure for the bigger guys."
msgstr "傍晚钓大家伙的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.2"
msgid "Looks like a hair clip. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "像个发夹。别说是我说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.1"
msgid "It spins. Fish get dizzy and bite?"
msgstr "它会转，鱼转晕了就咬钩？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.2"
msgid "For the big ones when the sun's up."
msgstr "太阳出来时钓大鱼用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.1"
msgid "Night fishing. I'd rather be sleeping."
msgstr "夜钓？我宁可睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.2"
msgid "Even fish stay up late. Bad habit."
msgstr "鱼也熬夜，坏习惯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.1"
msgid "Fish have dinner time too, huh."
msgstr "鱼也有晚饭时间啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.2"
msgid "Green for evening. Who decided these rules?"
msgstr "傍晚用绿的，这规矩谁定的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.1"
msgid "Shiny spoon. Can I eat soup with it after?"
msgstr "亮晶晶的勺子，钓完能喝汤吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.2"
msgid "Little fish like red in the sunshine, apparently."
msgstr "据说小鱼大太阳底下就爱红色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.1"
msgid "Casting is easy. Reeling in is the part I hate."
msgstr "甩竿简单，收线才烦人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.2"
msgid "If I fall asleep, the fish wins."
msgstr "我要是睡着了，就算鱼赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.1"
msgid "The lazy amulet. Gear made for me, at last."
msgstr "懒人护符，总算有为我做的装备了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.2"
msgid "Stuff just flies to me. Like snacks should."
msgstr "东西自己飞过来，零食就该这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.1"
msgid "Point, zip, done. Walking's overrated."
msgstr "一指一闪，走路被高估了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.2"
msgid "Short-range teleport. A lifesaver for being late."
msgstr "短距离瞬移，迟到救星。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.1"
msgid "Lucky fan. Hope luck means snacks."
msgstr "幸运扇子，希望幸运就是零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.2"
msgid "Fan me while I nap, okay?"
msgstr "我睡觉的时候帮我扇扇，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Roast gobbler shrine. Not the roast I wanted."
msgstr "烤火鸡神龛，不是我想要的那种烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burnt. The gobblers are gonna be smug about this."
msgstr "烧了，火鸡们要偷笑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "It wants a bush. Gobblers love berries."
msgstr "它想要灌木，火鸡最爱浆果了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty spot. Even shrines want snacks."
msgstr "空着一块，神龛也想要零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Gobbler stuff. They'd better not steal my berries."
msgstr "火鸡的东西，别来偷我的浆果就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Year of the Gobbler. Sounds delicious."
msgstr "火鸡年，听着就好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.1"
msgid "Old-school music box. Maxwell would like it."
msgstr "老古董音乐盒，麦斯威尔会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.2"
msgid "Play something I can sleep to."
msgstr "放点能让我睡着的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "Pickaxe and hammer in one. Two jobs, one swing."
msgstr "镐子锤子二合一，一下干两份活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "Rocks don't stand a chance. Neither do walls."
msgstr "石头扛不住，墙也扛不住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Pig shrine's charred. Smells kinda like bacon."
msgstr "猪神龛焦了，闻着有点像培根。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Toast. The pigs won't be happy."
msgstr "烤糊了，猪人们肯定不高兴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Meat goes here. I'm trying not to eat it."
msgstr "肉要放这里。我在忍着不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty plate. I know that feeling."
msgstr "空盘子，我懂这种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Year of the Pig King. He's so lazy. Respect."
msgstr "猪王年，他那么懒，我敬他。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pig festival. Wrestling, food, then more food."
msgstr "猪节，摔跤、吃饭、再吃饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.1"
msgid "Who carries a scale around? Oh. Me."
msgstr "谁会随身带秤啊。哦，我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.2"
msgid "Weighing fish feels like a school checkup for them."
msgstr "给鱼称体重，跟学校体检似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.1"
msgid "A plant that just sits there. Relatable."
msgstr "一盆只会待着的植物，懂它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.2"
msgid "Decor for camp. Makes it look less like a dump."
msgstr "给营地装点一下，看着不那么像垃圾场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells like pumpkin pie in here. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "里面一股南瓜派味，饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Great for hiding my face when the teacher calls on me."
msgstr "老师点名时正好拿来挡脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.1"
msgid "Gotta carve it first. Knife, not bat."
msgstr "得先雕一下。用刀，不是球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.2"
msgid "Just a plain pumpkin on my head. Very stylish."
msgstr "就这么顶个南瓜，真时髦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.1"
msgid "Wearing this, I see things I'd rather not."
msgstr "戴上它，会看见不想看的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.2"
msgid "My head's buzzing. Worse than a math class."
msgstr "脑袋嗡嗡的，比数学课还难受。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.1"
msgid "A spinning plate of songs. Don't eat it."
msgstr "会转的唱片，别拿来吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.2"
msgid "Scratch it and it's ruined. Careful."
msgstr "划一下就毁了，小心点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.1"
msgid "Red and glowy. Very New Year."
msgstr "红红的亮亮的，很有年味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.2"
msgid "Pretty light. Doesn't need batteries, at least."
msgstr "好看的灯，至少不用电池。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.1"
msgid "A crown. Do I look like a princess now?"
msgstr "皇冠？我现在像公主吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.2"
msgid "It throws up a shield sometimes. Nice backup."
msgstr "有时会冒出护盾，靠谱的后手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.1"
msgid "Summons tentacles sometimes. My bat doesn't do that."
msgstr "有时会召唤触手，我的球棒可不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.2"
msgid "Fancy club. Still a club. I approve."
msgstr "高级棍子，还是棍子，我认可。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.1"
msgid "Pry the saddle off. Not my favorite job."
msgstr "把鞍撬下来，不是什么好差事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.2"
msgid "Looks like a can opener. Sadly, it isn't."
msgstr "看着像开罐器，可惜不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.1"
msgid "A seat that walks for me. Perfect."
msgstr "会自己走路的座位，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.2"
msgid "Basic, but my legs don't care."
msgstr "普通款，不过我的腿不挑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.1"
msgid "Speed saddle. Late-for-class mode."
msgstr "加速鞍，赶上课专用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.2"
msgid "Light as a feather. Thanks, butterflies."
msgstr "轻得像羽毛。谢了，蝴蝶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Comfy enough to doze off on. Probably a bad idea."
msgstr "舒服到能睡着，大概不是好主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.2"
msgid "A saddle with a dark aura. Very delinquent of it."
msgstr "带黑气的鞍，挺有不良风范。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.1"
msgid "Fighting from up high. My bat still reaches."
msgstr "坐高点打，球棒照样够得着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.2"
msgid "The beefalo takes the hits. Works for me."
msgstr "挨打让牛来，我没意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.1"
msgid "It's always hungry. Okay, we get along."
msgstr "它总是饿着，好吧，我们合得来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.2"
msgid "Stop whispering in my ear. I'm trying to nap."
msgstr "别在我耳边嘀咕，我要睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.1"
msgid "Ring it and something comes back wrong."
msgstr "一摇铃，回来的东西就不对劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.2"
msgid "Like a school bell, but for the undead."
msgstr "跟上课铃一样，只是给亡灵听的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.1"
msgid "A shadowy workbench in a box. Feels cursed."
msgstr "盒子里装着暗影工作台，感觉被诅咒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.2"
msgid "Maxwell's kind of thing. I'll set it up anyway."
msgstr "麦斯威尔那一挂的东西，我还是装上吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.1"
msgid "Turns junk into shells. Like a vending machine."
msgstr "把破烂变成贝壳，跟自动售货机似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.2"
msgid "Feeding it materials is homework I didn't sign up for."
msgstr "给它喂材料，是我没报名的作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "Digs and tills. Farming's still a chore, though."
msgstr "能挖能耕，种地还是麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "Glowing shovel. Even digging looks cool now."
msgstr "会发光的铲子，连挖土都显得帅了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "Bouncing shots. Like dodgeball, but meaner."
msgstr "会弹射的光弹，像躲避球，但更狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "A magic stick. I prefer my bat, but fine."
msgstr "魔法棒，我更喜欢球棒，不过行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hard and cold. Still a chair, though."
msgstr "又硬又凉，但好歹是椅子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stone chair. Even I can't break this one. Probably."
msgstr "石头椅子，连我都弄不坏。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "Taken again? Unfair."
msgstr "又被占了？不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll sit on the ground."
msgstr "行，我坐地上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.1"
msgid "Cute, chubby leaves. Like little dumplings."
msgstr "叶子胖乎乎的，像小饺子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.2"
msgid "Forget to water it and it's fine. My kind of pet."
msgstr "忘了浇水也没事，我喜欢这种宠物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "A glowing plant sword. Cuts shadows nicely."
msgstr "发光的植物剑，砍影子很顺手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "It hums like a fridge. Kinda calming."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，像冰箱，还挺安神。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.1"
msgid "Who sets a feast table on fire?"
msgstr "谁会把宴会桌点着啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.2"
msgid "No table, so I'll eat standing up. Still eating."
msgstr "没桌子就站着吃，反正要吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big table. Room for a lot of plates."
msgstr "桌子很大，能摆好多盘子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "An empty table makes me sad. Fill it."
msgstr "空桌子看着就难过，快摆满。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.1"
msgid "Food's out. Nobody stand between me and it."
msgstr "菜上来了，谁也别挡在我前面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.2"
msgid "Feast time. Best part of any holiday."
msgstr "开席了，节日最棒的就是这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.1"
msgid "That's not feast food. Have some respect."
msgstr "那不是宴席菜，尊重一下好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.2"
msgid "Even I know that doesn't go on a feast table."
msgstr "连我都知道那个不能上宴席。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.1"
msgid "No gems, no teleport. Walking again? Ugh."
msgstr "没宝石传不了，又得走路？烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.2"
msgid "Three slots, zero gems. Great."
msgstr "三个槽，零颗宝石，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.1"
msgid "Gems are in. Beam me home."
msgstr "宝石放好了，把我传回家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.2"
msgid "All set. Now nobody has to walk back."
msgstr "都弄好了，这下谁都不用走回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.1"
msgid "Where will it send me? Hopefully near a bed."
msgstr "会把我传到哪？最好是床边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.2"
msgid "One wave and I'm gone. Like skipping class, but farther."
msgstr "一挥就到别处了，跟逃课一样，就是更远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.1"
msgid "Fancy ancient rock. Worth the trip, barely."
msgstr "高级古代石头，勉强值得跑一趟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.2"
msgid "Greenish and heavy. Smashes nicely."
msgstr "绿绿的，沉甸甸，砸起来挺爽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cold trap. Nothing's gonna care."
msgstr "冷掉的陷阱，谁都不怕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Not dangerous right now. Kind of boring."
msgstr "现在不危险，有点无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.1"
msgid "Hot hot hot! Why am I holding this?"
msgstr "烫烫烫！我拿着它干嘛？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.2"
msgid "Ow. My hands are not oven mitts."
msgstr "痛，我的手不是隔热手套。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.1"
msgid "Steaming. Something's getting a nasty surprise."
msgstr "冒着热气，谁要倒霉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.2"
msgid "Perfect for roasting monster feet."
msgstr "正好烤怪物的脚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.1"
msgid "Warming up. Stay back a bit."
msgstr "在升温，退后点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.2"
msgid "Could warm my hands. Could also burn them."
msgstr "能暖手，也能烫手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.1"
msgid "Grilled fish wasn't the plan!"
msgstr "没打算做烤鱼啊！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.2"
msgid "My record's smoking. Literally."
msgstr "我的纪录在冒烟，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.1"
msgid "Champion fish, champion ash."
msgstr "冠军鱼变成冠军灰了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.2"
msgid "All that waiting by the water, for this."
msgstr "在水边等了那么久，就换来这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Show off a fish? Fine, if it's a big one."
msgstr "拿鱼出来炫？行，得够大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A display case for fish. People here must be bored too."
msgstr "专门展示鱼的柜子，看来大家也挺无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.1"
msgid "My giant veggie is roasting! Without seasoning!"
msgstr "我的巨型菜在烤！还没放调料！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.2"
msgid "Put it out! That's dinner for a week!"
msgstr "快灭火！那可是一周的饭！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.1"
msgid "So much farming, gone. I'm going back to bed."
msgstr "种了那么久，全没了。我回去睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the scale's burnt. Nothing left to brag about."
msgstr "连秤都烧了，没得炫耀了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Weighing vegetables. Like a grocery store contest."
msgstr "称蔬菜，跟菜市场比赛似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bring something huge. Small stuff's embarrassing."
msgstr "拿个大的来，小的丢人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.1"
msgid "That's it? My lunchbox weighs more."
msgstr "就这？我的饭盒都比它重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.2"
msgid "Barely moved the needle. Embarrassing."
msgstr "指针都没怎么动，丢人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.1"
msgid "Fancy library floor. I'd still nap on it."
msgstr "高级图书馆地板，我照样能睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom would approve. Very quiet floor."
msgstr "薇克巴顿会喜欢的，很安静的地板。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.1"
msgid "A rug made of beard hair. Who thought this was okay?"
msgstr "胡子毛编的地毯，谁觉得这行得通？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.2"
msgid "Wilson's beard? Please say no."
msgstr "威尔逊的胡子？拜托说不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.1"
msgid "Carpet. My feet appreciate it a little."
msgstr "地毯，脚稍微舒服一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.2"
msgid "Good for lying on when I'm too lazy to find a bed."
msgstr "懒得找床时可以直接躺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.1"
msgid "Fluffier carpet. Now we're talking."
msgstr "更蓬松的地毯，这才像样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.2"
msgid "I could nap right here. Don't wake me."
msgstr "我能直接在这儿睡，别叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.1"
msgid "It smells like bats. Don't ask why."
msgstr "一股蝙蝠味，别问为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.2"
msgid "Dark ground for dark places. Fitting."
msgstr "暗处用的暗地皮，挺搭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.1"
msgid "Checkered. Like a giant chessboard."
msgstr "格子的，像个大棋盘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.2"
msgid "Maxwell would love this. Very him."
msgstr "麦斯威尔肯定喜欢，很像他的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.1"
msgid "Bricks. Tough enough to test my bat on."
msgstr "砖头，够硬，能试试我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.2"
msgid "Looks like a cult floor. Because it is."
msgstr "看着像邪教地板，因为它就是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.1"
msgid "Shiny floor. Feels like I should take my shoes off."
msgstr "地板闪闪的，感觉该脱鞋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.2"
msgid "Gold tiles. Some cult has money."
msgstr "金地砖，哪个教团挺有钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.1"
msgid "Autumn colors. Pretty, until you have to sweep."
msgstr "秋天的颜色，好看，直到要扫地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.2"
msgid "Birchnut trees live here. Some of them bite."
msgstr "桦果树长在这儿，有些还会咬人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.1"
msgid "Hot, dry, and full of tumbleweeds. No thanks."
msgstr "又热又干，还全是风滚草，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.2"
msgid "Perfect for a sandcastle. If I cared."
msgstr "很适合堆沙堡，如果我在乎的话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "Made from Dragonfly scales. She won't miss them."
msgstr "龙蝇的鳞片做的，她不会想念的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "Fire stops here. Willow, take note."
msgstr "火到这儿就停。薇洛，记住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST.1"
msgid "Forest floor to go. Portable nature."
msgstr "外带的森林地，便携大自然。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOREST.2"
msgid "Pine needles everywhere. Itchy."
msgstr "全是松针，扎得慌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS.1"
msgid "Blue fungus turf. Looks like a bruise."
msgstr "蓝色菌地，看着像淤青。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS.2"
msgid "Soft, but I'm not lying on it."
msgstr "挺软，但我不躺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN.1"
msgid "Green fungus floor. Same color as moldy bread."
msgstr "绿菌地，跟发霉的面包一个色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_GREEN.2"
msgid "Squishy green stuff. Webber would roll around on it."
msgstr "绿色软乎乎的，韦伯肯定会在上面打滚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON.1"
msgid "Glowing fungus dirt. Don't lick it."
msgstr "会发光的菌土，别舔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_MOON.2"
msgid "Moon mushrooms make you sleepy. I don't need help."
msgstr "月亮蘑菇会让人犯困，我不需要帮忙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED.1"
msgid "Red mushroom turf. Like a pizza without cheese."
msgstr "红菌地，像没放芝士的披萨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_FUNGUS_RED.2"
msgid "Spongy and red. Weird, but okay."
msgstr "软软红红的，怪但还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS.1"
msgid "Grass. Good for lying on and watching clouds."
msgstr "草地，适合躺着看云。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_GRASS.2"
msgid "Plain old grass. Like the field I skip PE on."
msgstr "普通草地，跟我逃体育课的操场一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH.1"
msgid "Swampy. Mosquitoes included, probably."
msgstr "沼泽地，八成送蚊子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MARSH.2"
msgid "Merm home turf. Literally."
msgstr "鱼人的主场，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR.1"
msgid "Crater turf. Lumpy like bad mashed potatoes."
msgstr "陨坑地皮，坑坑洼洼像没捣好的土豆泥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_METEOR.2"
msgid "Grey and dusty. Smells like space, maybe."
msgstr "灰扑扑的，大概是太空的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MONKEY_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MONKEY_GROUND.1"
msgid "Took it from the monkeys. They stole my stuff first."
msgstr "从猴子那拿的，谁让它们先偷我东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MONKEY_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MONKEY_GROUND.2"
msgid "Still smells like bananas. And pirates."
msgstr "还有股香蕉味，还有海盗味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_BLUE.1"
msgid "Blue like a swimming pool. Too bad it's not one."
msgstr "蓝得像游泳池，可惜不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_BLUE.2"
msgid "Calming. Might fall asleep on it."
msgstr "看着挺安神，可能会睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_GREY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_GREY.1"
msgid "Grey tiles. As exciting as a Monday."
msgstr "灰色瓷砖，跟星期一一样无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_GREY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_GREY.2"
msgid "Doesn't show dirt. Very practical."
msgstr "不显脏，很实用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_RED.1"
msgid "Same red as the marks on my test papers."
msgstr "跟我试卷上的红叉一个颜色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MOSAIC_RED.2"
msgid "Feels like an angry kitchen."
msgstr "像个发火的厨房。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD.1"
msgid "Mud. Somebody's going to slip. Not me."
msgstr "泥地，肯定有人会滑倒。不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_MUD.2"
msgid "Wurt would love this. Nice and soggy."
msgstr "沃特会喜欢的，湿漉漉的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH.1"
msgid "From the moon island. The pebbles are kinda pretty."
msgstr "月岛来的，石子还挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_PEBBLEBEACH.2"
msgid "Good for skipping stones. Not for napping."
msgstr "适合打水漂，不适合睡午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD.1"
msgid "A road. Now I can walk faster and complain less."
msgstr "有路了，走得快，抱怨少。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROAD.2"
msgid "Cobblestones. Like the street outside school."
msgstr "鹅卵石路，跟学校门口那条一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY.1"
msgid "Rocks. My bat's favorite target."
msgstr "石头，球棒最爱的目标。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ROCKY.2"
msgid "Hard as a teacher's heart."
msgstr "跟老师的心一样硬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK.1"
msgid "Ancient bricks. Someone had too much free time."
msgstr "古代砖块，有人太闲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK.2"
msgid "Older than my school. Probably sturdier too."
msgstr "比我们学校还老，应该也更结实。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK_GLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK_GLOW.1"
msgid "Glowing bricks. Saves on torches."
msgstr "会发光的砖，省火把了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK_GLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSBRICK_GLOW.2"
msgid "Spooky glow. Good for ghost stories."
msgstr "阴森森的光，适合讲鬼故事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES.1"
msgid "Old tiles. Wonder who mopped them."
msgstr "旧瓷砖，不知道谁拖的地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES.2"
msgid "Ancient people had nice taste. Shame they're gone."
msgstr "古人品味不错，可惜都不在了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES_GLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES_GLOW.1"
msgid "Night light built into the floor. Handy for midnight snacks."
msgstr "地板自带夜灯，半夜找零食方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES_GLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTILES_GLOW.2"
msgid "Glowing tiles. Like a fancy disco."
msgstr "发光地砖，像高级迪厅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM.1"
msgid "Trim tiles. For people who care about borders."
msgstr "镶边砖，给在乎边框的人用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM.2"
msgid "Decorations mean more work. Pass."
msgstr "装饰就是多干活，跳过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM_GLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM_GLOW.1"
msgid "Glowing trim. Fancy outline."
msgstr "发光的边框，挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM_GLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_RUINSTRIM_GLOW.2"
msgid "Now I won't trip over the edge at night."
msgstr "这下晚上不会被边绊倒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA.1"
msgid "Beefalo country. They'll want it back."
msgstr "牛的地盘，它们会想要回去的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA.2"
msgid "Dry and yellow. Like toast left out too long."
msgstr "又干又黄，像放太久的吐司。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH.1"
msgid "Smells a little like the sea. And crabs."
msgstr "有点海的味道，还有螃蟹味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH.2"
msgid "Beach floor at home. Vacation without the trip."
msgstr "家里铺沙滩，不用出门就度假。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE.1"
msgid "Slimy. Gross. I'm wiping my hands on Wilson."
msgstr "黏糊糊的，恶心。我拿威尔逊擦手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE.2"
msgid "Squishy underfoot. Like stepping on jelly."
msgstr "踩着软软的，像踩果冻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK.1"
msgid "Cold stone. My feet hate it."
msgstr "冰凉的石头，脚很讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK.2"
msgid "Rock from way down below. Heavy and boring."
msgstr "地底下的石头，又沉又无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT.1"
msgid "Vault floor. Feels like I'm being watched."
msgstr "宝库地板，总觉得有人在看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT.2"
msgid "Stone tiles from the vault. Heavier than my schoolbag."
msgstr "宝库的石砖，比书包还沉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT.1"
msgid "Still warm. Nice for cold feet."
msgstr "还热乎着，冷脚正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT.2"
msgid "Smells a bit like boiled eggs."
msgstr "有点煮鸡蛋的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR.1"
msgid "Nice for napping on. If it weren't so hard."
msgstr "适合在上面午睡，要是没那么硬就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR.2"
msgid "Just like the classroom floor. Ugh, memories."
msgstr "跟教室地板一模一样，想起来就烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.1"
msgid "Shiny orb. Probably important. Probably."
msgstr "亮晶晶的球，大概很重要。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.2"
msgid "Looks like a giant marble. Can I keep it?"
msgstr "像颗大玻璃珠，能给我吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.1"
msgid "Blueprints. My eyes are glazing over."
msgstr "图纸，看得我眼睛发直。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.2"
msgid "Building a guard pillar. Sounds like extra homework."
msgstr "要造守卫柱，听着像额外作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.1"
msgid "Perfect for napping in class. Nobody sees my face."
msgstr "上课睡觉正合适，谁也看不见脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.2"
msgid "Hood up. Leave me alone."
msgstr "帽子一拉，别理我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.1"
msgid "Gets bigger every hit. Like my appetite."
msgstr "每打一下就变大，跟我的饭量一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.2"
msgid "If it hits my face, I'm blaming the shadows."
msgstr "要是砸我脸上，就怪暗影。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.1"
msgid "Home economics, but evil."
msgstr "家政课，邪恶版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.2"
msgid "Sewing again? I'd rather just buy new ones."
msgstr "又要缝？我宁可买新的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.1"
msgid "It talks while I work. Can it shut up?"
msgstr "干活时还一直说话，能闭嘴吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.2"
msgid "Looks scary, used for picking veggies. Lame."
msgstr "看着吓人，结果拿来割菜。逊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "Big enough to share. Don't push it."
msgstr "够大，可以一起撑。别得寸进尺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "Who needs a creepy umbrella? Me, when it rains acid."
msgstr "谁要这么阴森的伞？下酸雨的时候的我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.1"
msgid "Building a giant robot? Sounds like a bad idea. I'm in."
msgstr "造巨型机器人？听着就是馊主意，算我一个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.2"
msgid "Too heavy for normal people. Good thing I'm not normal."
msgstr "普通人搬不动，还好我不普通。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.1"
msgid "Robot pieces. Like the world's worst puzzle."
msgstr "机器人零件，像世界上最烂的拼图。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.2"
msgid "If I hit these together hard enough, will it work?"
msgstr "用力敲到一起，能不能用？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.1"
msgid "Screws and bolts. Don't ask me where they go."
msgstr "螺丝螺帽，别问我该拧哪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.2"
msgid "Winona would love this. I just hit things."
msgstr "薇诺娜会喜欢的，我只会敲东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.1"
msgid "It keeps calculating stuff. Worse than a math test."
msgstr "一直在算东西，比数学考试还烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.2"
msgid "A helmet that thinks for me. Finally."
msgstr "替我动脑子的头盔，总算等到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.1"
msgid "Metal floor. My feet are gonna be cold."
msgstr "铁地板，脚要冻死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.2"
msgid "Looks like a gym floor. I hate gym."
msgstr "像体育馆地板，我讨厌体育课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM.1"
msgid "Toughest wall around. Also the heaviest to carry."
msgstr "最结实的墙，搬起来也最沉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Even my bat can't dent this one. Probably."
msgstr "连我的球棒都打不坏它。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.1"
msgid "My uniform! I don't even like it, but still!"
msgstr "我的校服！虽然不喜欢，但也别烧啊！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Fire! Somebody grab the skirts!"
msgstr "着火了！谁去把裙子抢出来！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Guess I'm wearing this outfit forever."
msgstr "看来我得一直穿这身了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.2"
msgid "A pile of ash. Fashion's over."
msgstr "一堆灰，时尚到此为止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Uniform again. Saves thinking."
msgstr "还是穿校服吧，省得想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Too many options. I'll just close it."
msgstr "选项太多了，关上算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Of course the torch shrine caught fire."
msgstr "放火把的神龛着火，倒也不意外。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Water! Or I'll just bat it out."
msgstr "水呢！不然我拿球棒拍灭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "The puppies' shrine is toast."
msgstr "小狗的神龛烤焦了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Should've kept the torch away from the wood."
msgstr "早该让火把离木头远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Needs a torch? Like a dog needs a stick?"
msgstr "要放火把？像狗狗要叼树枝那样？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Torch goes here. Don't ask me why."
msgstr "火把放这里。别问我为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Varg year. I hope the toys bark."
msgstr "座狼年，希望玩具会叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A doggy festival. I could get behind that."
msgstr "狗狗节，这我能接受。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.1"
msgid "Smells done. My stomach agrees."
msgstr "闻着快好了，肚子也同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.2"
msgid "A couple more minutes. I can survive that. Barely."
msgstr "再几分钟，我能撑住。勉强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.1"
msgid "Staring at the oven won't speed it up. I'll stare anyway."
msgstr "盯着烤炉也不会变快。我还是要盯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.2"
msgid "Something's roasting. Don't let me nap through it."
msgstr "在烤东西了，别让我睡过头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.1"
msgid "Done! Hands off, first bite's mine."
msgstr "好了！别动，第一口是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.2"
msgid "Smells amazing. Who cooked this? Me? Nice."
msgstr "好香。谁做的？我？厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A whole oven just for the holidays. Fancy."
msgstr "专门过节用的烤炉，真讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Holiday food tastes better. That's science."
msgstr "节日的饭就是更好吃，这是科学。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.1"
msgid "No tree, no presents. Great."
msgstr "没有树，就没有礼物。好极了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ashes for the holidays. Very festive."
msgstr "过节过出一堆灰，真有气氛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "An empty pot. Waiting on me again."
msgstr "空空的花盆，又在等我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Plant something, then decorate it. Two chores."
msgstr "先种再装饰，两份活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Can I fly on it instead of sweeping?"
msgstr "能骑它飞吗？我不想扫地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Cleaning duty follows me everywhere, huh."
msgstr "值日到哪都躲不掉啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.1"
msgid "It sweeps by itself? Finally, a reliable classmate."
msgstr "它自己会扫？终于有个靠谱的同学了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.2"
msgid "Spooky broom. Still just a broom."
msgstr "诡异的扫帚，说到底还是扫帚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.1"
msgid "Toast chair. Not sitting there."
msgstr "烤焦的椅子，我不坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.2"
msgid "It's a chair-shaped pile of charcoal now."
msgstr "现在是一堆椅子形状的炭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A chair. My favorite place in the world."
msgstr "椅子，世界上我最喜欢的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wooden and creaky. Like the ones at school."
msgstr "木头的，嘎吱响，跟学校的一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "Taken. Move over, I'm tired."
msgstr "被占了，挪一挪，我累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "Hey, that was my seat."
msgstr "喂，那是我的位子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE.1"
msgid "Bee chip. Does WX buzz now?"
msgstr "蜜蜂芯片，WX会嗡嗡叫吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE.2"
msgid "Heals while doing nothing. I respect that."
msgstr "什么都不干也能回血，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_CHESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_CHESS.1"
msgid "Clockworks follow WX now? They used to chase me."
msgstr "发条怪现在跟着WX？它们以前追我来着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_CHESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_CHESS.2"
msgid "A knight on our side. Feels weird."
msgstr "骑士站我们这边，感觉怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_COLD.1"
msgid "Air conditioning for robots. Can I borrow it in summer?"
msgstr "机器人的空调，夏天能借我吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_COLD.2"
msgid "Keeps WX chill. Unlike its personality."
msgstr "让WX保持冷静，跟它的脾气不一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_DIGESTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_DIGESTION.1"
msgid "Digestion upgrade. Can WX eat my vegetables for me?"
msgstr "消化升级，WX能帮我吃掉蔬菜吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_DIGESTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_DIGESTION.2"
msgid "A tummy circuit. Hope it's not picky."
msgstr "肚子电路，希望它别挑食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_HEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_HEAT.1"
msgid "A heater chip. Perfect for winter naps."
msgstr "暖气芯片，冬天睡觉正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_HEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_HEAT.2"
msgid "WX as a hand warmer. I'll stand closer."
msgstr "把WX当暖手宝，我站近点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT.1"
msgid "Saves me carrying torches. I'll just follow WX."
msgstr "省得我拿火把，跟着WX走就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT.2"
msgid "A glowing robot. Bugs will love it."
msgstr "会发光的机器人，虫子会爱死它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT2.1"
msgid "Brighter. Turn it down, I'm trying to sleep."
msgstr "更亮了，调暗点，我要睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_LIGHT2.2"
msgid "A walking lighthouse now."
msgstr "现在是会走的灯塔了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH.1"
msgid "More health for WX. Fewer repairs for us."
msgstr "WX血多了，我们修得少。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH.2"
msgid "Toughens up the tin can."
msgstr "让铁罐头更抗揍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2.1"
msgid "Even tougher. Like a bigger lunchbox."
msgstr "更结实了，像加大号饭盒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHEALTH2.2"
msgid "With this, WX might survive my bat. Maybe."
msgstr "装上它，WX说不定能扛住我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER.1"
msgid "A bigger stomach for WX. Where do I sign up?"
msgstr "给WX扩胃，我能报名吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER.2"
msgid "Eats more, gets hungry slower. Dream circuit."
msgstr "吃得多饿得慢，梦中的电路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER1.1"
msgid "Tiny stomach upgrade. I could use one."
msgstr "小号胃升级，我也想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXHUNGER1.2"
msgid "Room for one more snack. Just one."
msgstr "能多装一份零食，就一份。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY.1"
msgid "Makes WX less cranky? Doubt it."
msgstr "能让WX少发点脾气？我不信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY.2"
msgid "A brain upgrade. Do they sell these before exams?"
msgstr "大脑升级，考试前能买吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1.1"
msgid "A little calm in a chip. I need a lot."
msgstr "芯片里装着一点冷静，我需要一大堆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MAXSANITY1.2"
msgid "Small brain boost. Don't expect miracles."
msgstr "小小的脑力加成，别指望奇迹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED.1"
msgid "A speed chip. Can I install it in my legs?"
msgstr "加速芯片，能装我腿上吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED.2"
msgid "Makes WX zoom. Never late again."
msgstr "让WX飞快，再也不会迟到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2.1"
msgid "Faster still? WX's going to lap me."
msgstr "还要更快？WX要套我圈了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MOVESPEED2.2"
msgid "Too fast. Stop showing off."
msgstr "太快了，别显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MUSIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MUSIC.1"
msgid "WX's built-in speaker. Please, no 3 a.m. concerts."
msgstr "WX自带音箱，拜托别半夜三点开演唱会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MUSIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_MUSIC.2"
msgid "Plants like the music, apparently. Weird plants."
msgstr "据说植物喜欢这音乐，怪植物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION.1"
msgid "Now WX can find me napping anywhere, even in the dark."
msgstr "现在WX在黑暗里也能找到我睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_NIGHTVISION.2"
msgid "Bumping into trees at night is over for WX."
msgstr "WX晚上再也不会撞树了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_RADAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_RADAR.1"
msgid "A built-in map. WX never gets lost. Show-off."
msgstr "自带地图，WX从来不迷路，显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_RADAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_RADAR.2"
msgid "Like a phone with GPS. I miss my phone."
msgstr "像手机导航，我想我的手机了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SCREECH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SCREECH.1"
msgid "A loud chip. Louder than our homeroom teacher."
msgstr "吵闹芯片，比班主任还吵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SCREECH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SCREECH.2"
msgid "My ears are ringing just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着耳朵就开始嗡嗡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING.1"
msgid "A shield chip. Like a helmet for the whole body."
msgstr "护盾芯片，像全身头盔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SHIELDING.2"
msgid "WX gets tougher. Fewer repairs, more napping."
msgstr "WX更耐打，修理少，午睡多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SPIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SPIN.1"
msgid "Spin attack? Even I'd get dizzy."
msgstr "旋转攻击？我都要晕了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SPIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_SPIN.2"
msgid "A spinning robot. Like a washing machine with fists."
msgstr "会转的机器人，像带拳头的洗衣机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "More stuff per slot. My schoolbag needs this."
msgstr "每格能塞更多东西，我书包需要这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "Stack it high. Less sorting for me."
msgstr "堆得高高的，我少整理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER.1"
msgid "Zaps anyone who hits WX. Fair."
msgstr "谁打WX就电谁，公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_TASER.2"
msgid "Don't high-five WX after this one."
msgstr "装了这个就别跟WX击掌了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A spare body. I just want a spare day off."
msgstr "备用身体？我只想要个备用假期。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_BACKUPBODY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Creepy. It's just standing there, waiting."
msgstr "有点吓人，它就站着等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT.1"
msgid "A flying spy. Perfect for checking if class started."
msgstr "会飞的侦察兵，用来看上课没正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_SCOUT.2"
msgid "It goes out, I stay put. Good deal."
msgstr "它出去，我待着，好买卖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A remote that zaps things. Better than a TV remote."
msgstr "能电东西的遥控器，比电视遥控器强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP_REMOTE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Click, zap. That's all there is to it."
msgstr "按一下，电一下，就这么简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER.1"
msgid "A trap for those floaty moon things."
msgstr "抓那些飘来飘去的月亮东西的陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_GESTALTTRAPPER.2"
msgid "Like catching fireflies, but creepier."
msgstr "像抓萤火虫，就是更瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER.1"
msgid "Pulls chips out of WX. Sounds painful."
msgstr "从WX身上拔芯片，听着就疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_MODULEREMOVER.2"
msgid "Like tooth pliers, but for robots."
msgstr "像拔牙钳，就是给机器人用的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM.1"
msgid "The flying scanner, folded up. Kinda cute."
msgstr "会飞的扫描仪折起来了，有点可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_ITEM.2"
msgid "Done scanning? Good, back in the bag."
msgstr "扫完了？好，回包里去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER.1"
msgid "Weakens enemies. Then my bat finishes the job."
msgstr "先削弱敌人，再让球棒收尾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_DEBUFFER.2"
msgid "A shadow that makes things weaker. Spooky teamwork."
msgstr "让敌人变弱的影子，瘆人的配合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER.1"
msgid "A shadowy little helper. Does it do homework?"
msgstr "影子小帮手，会写作业吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SHADOWDRONE_HARVESTER.2"
msgid "Shadow minion that gathers. Maxwell's probably jealous."
msgstr "会采集的影子随从，麦斯威尔大概要嫉妒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.1"
msgid "Static, static, more static. Real exciting."
msgstr "杂音、杂音，还是杂音。真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.2"
msgid "Any music on there? Or just weather?"
msgstr "有音乐吗？还是只有天气预报？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.1"
msgid "Makes me faster too. Late? Never again. Well, less."
msgstr "还能跑快点。迟到？再也不……少一点吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.2"
msgid "Like wearing a little sun around my neck."
msgstr "像脖子上挂了个小太阳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.1"
msgid "A tiny star on demand. Cozier than a heater."
msgstr "随叫随到的小星星，比暖炉还舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.2"
msgid "Summon a star, then nap next to it."
msgstr "叫出一颗星星，在旁边睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Smells like burnt hair. Gross."
msgstr "一股烧焦的毛味，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "No beefalo pageant this year, then."
msgstr "那今年的牛选美没戏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Wants wool? Go shave a beefalo, I guess."
msgstr "要牛毛？那就去剃一头牛吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. The beefalo's waiting too."
msgstr "空的。牛也在等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Beefalo fashion show. Mine wears what I say."
msgstr "牛的时装秀，我家的穿什么我说了算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Dressing up a cow. My life's gotten weird."
msgstr "给牛打扮，我的人生越来越怪了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1.1"
msgid "A torn bit of pattern. Like my notes."
msgstr "撕破的图样，跟我的笔记一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_1.2"
msgid "Scrap of a design. Where's the rest?"
msgstr "设计图的碎片，剩下的呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2.1"
msgid "Another piece. Collecting stuff is tiring."
msgstr "又一片，收集东西好累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_2.2"
msgid "Half a pattern. Half a beefalo outfit, I guess."
msgstr "半张图样，大概是半套牛衣服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3.1"
msgid "One more scrap. This is a scavenger hunt."
msgstr "又一片碎纸，这是寻宝游戏吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_PATTERN_FRAGMENT_3.2"
msgid "Bits and pieces. My patience is in pieces too."
msgstr "零零碎碎，我的耐心也碎了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.1"
msgid "Tie the beefalo here so it doesn't wander off."
msgstr "把牛拴在这，别让它乱跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.2"
msgid "A post. My beefalo's runway, apparently."
msgstr "一根柱子，据说是我家牛的T台。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Sewing for beefalo. What a world."
msgstr "给牛缝衣服，什么世道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'm better at breaking things than sewing them."
msgstr "比起缝东西，我更擅长弄坏东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.1"
msgid "A beefalo beauty contest. Seriously?"
msgstr "皮弗娄牛选美大赛？认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Heavy stage parts. Fine, leave it to me."
msgstr "舞台零件好重。行，交给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Roasted carrot shrine. Not edible."
msgstr "烤胡萝卜神龛，不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "The carrats' racing dreams, gone."
msgstr "胡萝卜鼠的赛跑梦，没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Carrat, carrot. The answer's in the name."
msgstr "胡萝卜鼠，胡萝卜。答案写在名字里了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. I'd put a carrot in, if I hadn't eaten them all."
msgstr "空的。要是胡萝卜没被我吃光，就放一根。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Carrat racing gear. Mine's gonna be the laziest."
msgstr "胡萝卜鼠比赛用品，我的那只肯定最懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Training a rat to run. P.E. for vegetables."
msgstr "训练老鼠赛跑，蔬菜的体育课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM.1"
msgid "Direction training. Some of us need that too."
msgstr "方向训练，有些人也需要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION_ITEM.2"
msgid "Teaching a rat left from right. Good luck."
msgstr "教老鼠分左右，祝好运。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM.1"
msgid "Reflex training. My reflexes are fine when food's involved."
msgstr "反应训练，有吃的时候我反应很快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION_ITEM.2"
msgid "Teaching a carrot to dodge. Sure."
msgstr "教胡萝卜躲闪，好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM.1"
msgid "A treadmill for a carrot. Wow."
msgstr "给胡萝卜用的跑步机，哇哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED_ITEM.2"
msgid "Speed training. Better it than me."
msgstr "速度训练，它练总比我练好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM.1"
msgid "Stamina training? I'd fail this."
msgstr "耐力训练？我肯定不及格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA_ITEM.2"
msgid "Make it run laps. Like gym class."
msgstr "让它跑圈，跟体育课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.1"
msgid "Checkpoints so the carrat doesn't cheat. Smart."
msgstr "设检查点免得胡萝卜鼠作弊，聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Little flags for a little rat. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "小旗子给小老鼠，算是可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.1"
msgid "The finish line. Best part of any race."
msgstr "终点线，比赛最好的部分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.2"
msgid "Put this down and we're done. Love that."
msgstr "放下它就结束了，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.1"
msgid "Carrot rat race. Even rats have sports day."
msgstr "胡萝卜鼠赛跑，连老鼠都有运动会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.2"
msgid "Ready, set, go. Then I nap."
msgstr "预备，跑。然后我睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.1"
msgid "Weighing carrats. Don't weigh me."
msgstr "给胡萝卜鼠称重，别称我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.2"
msgid "A scale. I'm not stepping on it."
msgstr "一个秤，我才不站上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "Mystery seeds. Hope they're snacks."
msgstr "神秘种子，希望是能吃的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "A pack of seeds. Planting takes so long, though."
msgstr "一包种子，可是种起来好慢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.1"
msgid "Fancy seeds. Wormwood would freak out."
msgstr "高级种子，沃姆伍德会激动坏的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.2"
msgid "Rare stuff. Better not drop it."
msgstr "稀有货，别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "An anchor so the boat stays put. Like me on weekends."
msgstr "让船别乱跑的锚，跟周末的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "Heavy enough to stop a dragon. Perfect workout."
msgstr "重到能拦住龙，正好锻炼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "A dragon shrine that burned. Ironic."
msgstr "龙的神龛被烧了，真讽刺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even a dragon couldn't handle this heat."
msgstr "连龙都受不了这个温度。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Feed it charcoal. Weird diet."
msgstr "喂它木炭，口味真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. Dragons get hungry too, huh."
msgstr "空的。龙也会饿啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Dragon boat racing. I'll just paddle hard."
msgstr "龙舟赛，我用力划就是了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Year of the Dragon. Sounds cooler than it'll be."
msgstr "龙年，听起来比实际酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.1"
msgid "Fancy oar. My arms are already tired."
msgstr "花哨的桨，我胳膊已经酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.2"
msgid "Watch me row faster than anyone. If I feel like it."
msgstr "看我划得比谁都快。如果我想的话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1"
msgid "Steering is hard. I'll just go straight."
msgstr "转方向好难，我就直着开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Dragon wheel. Very festive. Very heavy."
msgstr "龙头舵轮，很喜庆，也很重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.1"
msgid "A rocking chair kit. Grandma vibes. I approve."
msgstr "摇椅零件，老奶奶的气息，我赞成。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.2"
msgid "Rock, rock, sleep. Best plan ever."
msgstr "摇啊摇，睡着了。最棒的计划。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "The horse shrine's just charcoal now."
msgstr "马的神龛成木炭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "All that prep, gone. I need a nap."
msgstr "准备那么久，全没了。我要睡一会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing in it yet. Bribe it with something?"
msgstr "里面还空着，拿点东西贿赂一下？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Probably wants an offering. Everyone wants something."
msgstr "大概想要供品。谁都想要点什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Horse year. Giddyup, I guess."
msgstr "马年。驾，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Knight stuff. Do I get a horse? No? Boring."
msgstr "骑士用品。给我马吗？不给？无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.1"
msgid "A horse on a stick. Giddy up, I guess."
msgstr "棍子上的马，驾，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.2"
msgid "Feels like kindergarten. Not complaining."
msgstr "像回到幼儿园，我没意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.1"
msgid "A whole roast. Hands off, it's mine."
msgstr "一整只烤肉，别动，是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.2"
msgid "Smells amazing. I'm drooling a little."
msgstr "香死了，我口水都快流了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.1"
msgid "Mud pie. Pigs can have it."
msgstr "泥巴派，给猪吃吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.2"
msgid "Even I'm not that hungry."
msgstr "我再饿也没饿到这份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.1"
msgid "Fish on a stick. Easy to eat while walking."
msgstr "签子上的鱼，边走边吃很方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.2"
msgid "Skewers. The best food shape."
msgstr "烤串，最棒的食物形态。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.1"
msgid "A bunny decoration. Kinda cute. Don't stare."
msgstr "兔子装饰，有点可爱。别盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.2"
msgid "Hop over and stick it somewhere festive."
msgstr "蹦过去，找个喜庆的地方放。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.1"
msgid "Another bunny thing. The rabbits are everywhere."
msgstr "又是兔子的东西，到处都是兔子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.2"
msgid "Decor. Makes the base look less like a dump."
msgstr "装饰品，让营地看着不那么像垃圾场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.1"
msgid "A fighting ring for pillows. Finally a sport I like."
msgstr "枕头格斗场，总算有我喜欢的运动了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.2"
msgid "Set this up and nobody escapes my pillow."
msgstr "搭好了，谁都逃不过我的枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.1"
msgid "Sweet and orange. Rabbits have good taste."
msgstr "甜甜的、橘色的，兔子品味不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.2"
msgid "Bet I could eat ten of these."
msgstr "我赌我能吃十个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.1"
msgid "Looks suspicious. Smells delicious. Eating it."
msgstr "看着可疑，闻着好香，吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.2"
msgid "Who dyed this? Doesn't matter, it's food."
msgstr "谁染的颜色？不重要，能吃就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.1"
msgid "Jiggly. Like the gym teacher's belly."
msgstr "抖来抖去，像体育老师的肚子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.2"
msgid "Jelly. Dessert counts as a meal, right?"
msgstr "果冻，甜点也算一顿饭吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.1"
msgid "Too cute to eat. Eating it anyway."
msgstr "可爱到舍不得吃。还是吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.2"
msgid "Ears first or tail first? Tough call."
msgstr "先吃耳朵还是尾巴？好难选。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Bunny shrine's burnt. Hope the bunnymen don't blame me."
msgstr "兔子神龛烧了，希望兔人别怪我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like charred carrots. Not appetizing."
msgstr "一股烧焦胡萝卜味，没胃口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Rabbits like carrots. Probably works."
msgstr "兔子喜欢胡萝卜，应该行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty bowl. Same as my lunchbox by ten a.m."
msgstr "空碗，跟我上午十点的饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rabbit year means pillow fights, right? I'm in."
msgstr "兔年有枕头大战对吧？我参加。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bunny ears for everyone. Not me, though."
msgstr "大家都戴兔耳朵。我就算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.1"
msgid "A challenge token. Bring it on."
msgstr "挑战令牌，来啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.2"
msgid "Hand this over and it's pillow time. I'm not holding back."
msgstr "递过去就开打，我可不会手下留情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.1"
msgid "Snake-themed lamp. Kinda cool."
msgstr "蛇主题的灯，挺酷的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.2"
msgid "Hang it up somewhere I don't trip over it."
msgstr "挂在我不会绊倒的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt. The snakes won't miss it."
msgstr "烧了，蛇应该不会想念它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Shop's closed. Permanently."
msgstr "店关门了，永久的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Monster meat? Finally, someone who'll take it."
msgstr "怪物肉？终于有谁肯要了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. Guess snakes skip breakfast too."
msgstr "空的。蛇也不吃早饭吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Snake year. Hope nothing slithers into my bag."
msgstr "蛇年，希望没东西钻进我包里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Trading time. I'll haggle. Badly."
msgstr "交易时间，我来砍价。砍不下来那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt. Poor kitties."
msgstr "烧了，可怜的猫猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "No kitten toys this year. I'm actually sad."
msgstr "今年没有猫玩具了，我是真难过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Cats love feathers. I'll wave one around."
msgstr "猫都喜欢羽毛，我来晃一根。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty. The kittens are judging me."
msgstr "空的。小猫在用眼神批评我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cat festival. Best festival."
msgstr "猫节，最棒的节。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Kitten stuff. I'm not going soft. Shut up."
msgstr "猫咪用品。我才没心软。闭嘴。"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Lycoris Satchel"
msgstr "莉可丽丝书包"

#. STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.RECIPE_DESC.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "A bookbag with twin brass buckles."
msgstr "配有两枚黄铜带扣的书包。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "I don't think my field notes count as homework."
msgstr "我的野外笔记应该不算作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.1"
msgid "Can we plug it with a rock and go home?"
msgstr "拿块石头堵上，然后回家行不行？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.2"
msgid "Every time it glows, more homework walks out."
msgstr "它一亮，就有新作业走出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "My swings were already heavy. Now they're ridiculous."
msgstr "我本来就打得重，这下离谱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "Looks dumb, but my bat likes it."
msgstr "样子傻了点，我的球棒倒挺喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.1"
msgid "Flowers on my head means I'm the nurse now?"
msgstr "头上戴花就得当保健委员了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.2"
msgid "Fine, I'll heal. Don't make me do it twice."
msgstr "行，我来治。别让我治第二遍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.1"
msgid "A baby made of lava. Who thought that was a good idea?"
msgstr "岩浆做的宝宝，谁想出来的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.2"
msgid "Cute until it sets your shoes on fire."
msgstr "挺可爱的，直到它把你鞋点着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.1"
msgid "Looks like a burnt rice ball now."
msgstr "现在看着像烤焦的饭团。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.2"
msgid "Chilled out, huh? Same as me after lunch."
msgstr "冷静下来了？跟我午饭后一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Warmer than my blanket. Can I sleep on it?"
msgstr "比我被子还暖，能枕着睡吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Whatever's in there, I'm not babysitting it."
msgstr "里面不管是什么，我都不带孩子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.1"
msgid "Shivering egg. Somebody find it a fire."
msgstr "蛋在发抖，谁去给它找堆火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.2"
msgid "Cold eggs hatch nothing. Even I know that."
msgstr "凉的蛋孵不出东西，这我都知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.1"
msgid "Cozy enough that I'm jealous."
msgstr "舒服得我都嫉妒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.2"
msgid "Perfect temperature. Now hatch quietly."
msgstr "温度刚好，安静地孵吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.1"
msgid "Full belly, happy pet. I get it, honestly."
msgstr "肚子饱了就开心，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.2"
msgid "Look at it, napping like me in math class."
msgstr "看它，跟我上数学课一样打盹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My little space heater with legs."
msgstr "长了腿的小暖炉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Keep close, but not that close."
msgstr "跟紧点，但别那么紧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "Hungry again? You and me both."
msgstr "又饿了？咱俩一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "Its eyes are on my bag. Rude."
msgstr "它盯着我的包，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.1"
msgid "Hang in there, I'm grabbing some ashes."
msgstr "撑住，我去弄点灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.2"
msgid "Please don't eat my stuff out of desperation."
msgstr "饿急了也别吃我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.1"
msgid "A baby tooth. Do I put it under my pillow?"
msgstr "乳牙啊，要放枕头底下吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.2"
msgid "Tiny tooth, big responsibility. Ugh."
msgstr "小小一颗牙，责任可不小。烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.1"
msgid "Just a rock now. Boring."
msgstr "现在就是块石头，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.2"
msgid "Hard enough to test my bat on."
msgstr "够硬，拿来试球棒正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.1"
msgid "Spit that hot? Gross and dangerous."
msgstr "吐口水都这么烫？又恶心又危险。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.2"
msgid "My shoes would melt. Walking around."
msgstr "鞋会化的，绕路吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.1"
msgid "Perfect for roasting stuff. Not for swimming."
msgstr "烤东西正好，游泳就算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.2"
msgid "Even the summer classroom wasn't this bad."
msgstr "夏天的教室都没这么热。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.1"
msgid "A rock. By lava. Groundbreaking."
msgstr "一块石头，在岩浆旁边。真了不起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.2"
msgid "Looks like every other rock, just sweatier."
msgstr "跟别的石头一样，就是出汗多点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.1"
msgid "Fake meat. Tastes like a lie."
msgstr "假肉，吃着像谎言。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.2"
msgid "My stomach can't tell. My tongue can."
msgstr "胃分不出来，舌头分得出。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.1"
msgid "Jumping in would be fun if I weren't so lazy."
msgstr "要不是懒，跳进去应该挺好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.2"
msgid "Perfect nap spot, minus the bugs."
msgstr "睡午觉的好地方，除了虫子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.1"
msgid "A burger is a burger. Hand it over."
msgstr "汉堡就是汉堡，拿来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.2"
msgid "Veggie burger pretending to be cool."
msgstr "装酷的素汉堡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.1"
msgid "Fluffy fake meat. That's a lot of effort for a leaf."
msgstr "蓬松的假肉，为片叶子费这么大劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.2"
msgid "If it collapses, I'm blaming Warly."
msgstr "要是塌了，就怪沃利。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.1"
msgid "Even the skinny tree wants a fight?"
msgstr "瘦巴巴的树也要打架？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.2"
msgid "Sorry about the chopping. Kinda."
msgstr "砍树的事对不起，算是吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.1"
msgid "A crab with a night light. Fancy."
msgstr "自带小夜灯的螃蟹，挺讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.2"
msgid "Better than a flashlight, and it walks itself."
msgstr "比手电好，还会自己走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.1"
msgid "Glowing bug. Don't fly into my face."
msgstr "发光的虫，别往我脸上飞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.2"
msgid "Like fireflies at a summer festival, but clingier."
msgstr "像夏日祭的萤火虫，就是更黏人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.1"
msgid "Its hair's standing up. Mine too."
msgstr "它毛都竖起来了，我的也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.2"
msgid "Walking battery. Keep your distance."
msgstr "行走的电池，离远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grumpy face. We'd get along."
msgstr "一脸不爽，我们应该合得来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Those horns look like they'd hurt."
msgstr "那对角看着就疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.1"
msgid "Would this make my bat zap people?"
msgstr "装到球棒上能电人吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.2"
msgid "Tingly. Like when your leg falls asleep."
msgstr "麻麻的，跟腿睡着了一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.1"
msgid "Little guy, go tell your dad I'm not scared."
msgstr "小家伙，回去告诉你爸我不怕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.2"
msgid "Hiding behind his dad. Typical."
msgstr "躲在他爸后面，经典。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.1"
msgid "A tree with a face. Nope."
msgstr "长脸的树，算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.2"
msgid "Bet it sleeps better than me."
msgstr "它肯定睡得比我好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.1"
msgid "Root with a heartbeat? Creepy."
msgstr "根还在跳？好瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.2"
msgid "Plant it and it'll stare at me forever."
msgstr "种下去它就会一直盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Small and already judging me."
msgstr "这么小就开始打量我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Grow slowly. Take your time. Like, years."
msgstr "慢慢长，别急，几年都行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.1"
msgid "Fancy soup. I'll pretend I'm rich."
msgstr "高级汤，假装我是有钱人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.2"
msgid "Slurping is allowed out here, right?"
msgstr "在这儿喝汤出声没关系吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.1"
msgid "Lobster? Did I win something?"
msgstr "龙虾？我中奖了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.2"
msgid "Fancy dinner and no teacher yelling. Paradise."
msgstr "高级晚餐，没有老师骂人，天堂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.1"
msgid "Big bug wearing a crown. Swat time."
msgstr "戴王冠的大虫子，该拍了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.2"
msgid "Your Highness, get off my garden."
msgstr "陛下，离开我的菜地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.1"
msgid "Dusty toy. Somebody's kid misses it."
msgstr "积灰的玩具，哪个孩子在想它吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.2"
msgid "Not mine. Not touching it."
msgstr "不是我的，不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.1"
msgid "Looks like it's waiting for its owner."
msgstr "看着像在等主人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.2"
msgid "I'll leave it. Probably."
msgstr "我不动它，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.1"
msgid "Kinda creepy for a toy."
msgstr "作为玩具有点吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.2"
msgid "Who plays with something like that?"
msgstr "谁会玩这种东西？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.1"
msgid "Old toy. Older than my grandma, maybe."
msgstr "旧玩具，说不定比我奶奶还老。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.2"
msgid "Pretty sure somebody's watching it."
msgstr "肯定有谁在看着它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.1"
msgid "Lonely little thing."
msgstr "孤零零的小东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.2"
msgid "Kinda cute. Don't tell anyone I said that."
msgstr "有点可爱。别说是我说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.1"
msgid "My hand goes right through. Rude."
msgstr "手直接穿过去了，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.2"
msgid "Is it here or not? Make up your mind."
msgstr "到底在不在？给个准话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.1"
msgid "Some kid cried over this, I bet."
msgstr "肯定有小孩为它哭过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.2"
msgid "Worn out from being hugged too much."
msgstr "被抱太多次，都磨旧了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.1"
msgid "Ghost stuff is Wendy's department."
msgstr "鬼魂的事归温蒂管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.2"
msgid "Abigail might know who it belongs to."
msgstr "阿比盖尔也许知道是谁的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.1"
msgid "Feels chilly around it."
msgstr "它周围凉飕飕的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.2"
msgid "Guess I'm holding onto this for someone."
msgstr "看来我得替谁收着它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.1"
msgid "Kept this long, it must matter a lot."
msgstr "留了这么久，一定很重要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.2"
msgid "Smells like an old attic."
msgstr "有股旧阁楼的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.1"
msgid "Shiny. Lunch money for a week."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，够一周午饭钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.2"
msgid "Lucky gold? I'll take all the luck I can get."
msgstr "幸运金块？运气多少我都要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.1"
msgid "Your axe is staring at me."
msgstr "你的斧头在盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.2"
msgid "A talking axe. Wish my bat could talk."
msgstr "会说话的斧头，真想让我的球棒也开口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.1"
msgid "It's lumpy. Like my bed hair."
msgstr "疙疙瘩瘩的，跟我起床的头发一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Ugly little tree. I kinda like it."
msgstr "丑丑的小树，我还挺喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.1"
msgid "Moon frog with weird eyes. Pass."
msgstr "月亮青蛙，眼神怪怪的，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.2"
msgid "Glowing eyes don't make you cool, frog."
msgstr "眼睛发光不代表你很酷，青蛙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1"
msgid "Tough shell. Would my bat crack it?"
msgstr "壳真硬，我的球棒能敲开吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2"
msgid "Brightshade leftovers. Might be useful."
msgstr "亮茄留下的，可能有用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.1"
msgid "Shiny rock from space? Probably."
msgstr "从天上来的亮石头？大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.2"
msgid "Bet it breaks nicely with one swing."
msgstr "一棒下去应该碎得很漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.1"
msgid "Big glowing hole. Hard pass on jumping in."
msgstr "发光的大洞，我才不跳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Looks like trouble. Glowing trouble."
msgstr "看着就麻烦，还是发光的麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.1"
msgid "Weeds this big? Who's gardening here?"
msgstr "杂草长这么大？谁在种的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.2"
msgid "Brightshade. I'll clear a path with my bat."
msgstr "亮茄。我用球棒开条路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.1"
msgid "Grabby vine. Hands to yourself."
msgstr "爱抓人的藤，手放好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.2"
msgid "Wiggly end. Whack it before it wraps."
msgstr "那头在扭，缠上来之前先敲它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.1"
msgid "Moon workshop. Shop class, but brighter."
msgstr "月亮工坊，像亮一点的工艺课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.2"
msgid "Everything here costs a ton of materials."
msgstr "这里做什么都要一堆材料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.1"
msgid "Floating rocks shouldn't walk around."
msgstr "飘着的石头不该到处走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.2"
msgid "Looking at it makes me want to nap."
msgstr "看着它就想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.1"
msgid "Feels warm. Weird for a seed."
msgstr "有点暖，作为种子挺怪的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.2"
msgid "Holding it makes my palm tingle."
msgstr "握着它手心麻麻的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.1"
msgid "Free meat? Nothing's free. The canteen taught me that."
msgstr "白给的肉？没有白给的事，食堂教会我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.2"
msgid "Eyeballs everywhere. Nope."
msgstr "到处都是眼球，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.1"
msgid "Plant it near enemies, not near my bed."
msgstr "种在敌人旁边，别种我床边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.2"
msgid "A gift that eats things. Lovely."
msgstr "会吃东西的礼物，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.1"
msgid "Fish soaked in lye. Wigfrid, you eat it."
msgstr "碱水泡的鱼，薇格弗德你吃吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.2"
msgid "Jelly fish. Not the swimming kind."
msgstr "果冻一样的鱼，不是会游的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.1"
msgid "Cute headband. Not doing chores though."
msgstr "发箍挺可爱，但我不干家务。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.2"
msgid "Louis would look better in this. Probably."
msgstr "露易丝戴应该更好看吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "Giant bird, giant attitude."
msgstr "大鸟脾气也大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "Sky's huge. Go bother someone else."
msgstr "天那么大，去烦别人吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.1"
msgid "Fish breath, even after it's dead."
msgstr "死了嘴里还有鱼腥味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.2"
msgid "Could swat seagulls with this."
msgstr "这能拿来拍海鸥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.1"
msgid "Fancy pen material. Not that I'd write notes."
msgstr "拿来做笔挺好，虽然我不记笔记。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.2"
msgid "Soft. Would make a good pillow."
msgstr "软软的，做枕头不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Stuck on that throne? Bad luck, buddy."
msgstr "被困在王座上？倒霉啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.2"
msgid "He looks tired. Same, honestly."
msgstr "他看起来很累，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.1"
msgid "Silent soup. My favorite kind."
msgstr "安静的汤，我最喜欢这种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.2"
msgid "Eat it before it remembers how to yell."
msgstr "趁它想起怎么叫之前喝了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Louder than the morning bell. Shut up!"
msgstr "比早铃还吵，闭嘴！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Stop following me, you noisy radish!"
msgstr "别跟着我，吵死人的萝卜！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooked and calm. Should've done that sooner."
msgstr "煮熟就老实了，早该这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells good. Weird, considering."
msgstr "闻着挺香，想想还挺怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.1"
msgid "Leafy top, screamy bottom."
msgstr "上面是叶子，下面是尖叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.2"
msgid "It's sleeping. Lucky."
msgstr "它在睡觉，真好命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.1"
msgid "Fluffy enough for a pencil case charm."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，挂笔袋上正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.2"
msgid "Bunnymen won't miss it. Hopefully."
msgstr "兔人应该不会想它吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Marble growing from the ground. Sure, why not."
msgstr "地里长出大理石，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Still tiny. Wake me when it's a shrub."
msgstr "还小着呢，长成灌木再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.1"
msgid "Fancy pillar in the middle of nowhere."
msgstr "荒郊野外立个华丽柱子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.2"
msgid "One swing won't do it. Ten might."
msgstr "一棒不够，十棒也许行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.1"
msgid "A bush made of rock. Nature's being weird again."
msgstr "石头做的灌木，大自然又在犯迷糊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.2"
msgid "Pickaxe time. Ugh, heavy work."
msgstr "该拿镐了，好累的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.1"
msgid "Stone tree. Shade's free at least."
msgstr "石头树，至少乘凉不要钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.2"
msgid "Mine it? Hope my arms survive."
msgstr "挖它？但愿我的胳膊撑得住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "Spiky and on fire. Double nope."
msgstr "带刺还着火，双倍不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Burn, prickly thing. Burn."
msgstr "烧吧，扎人的东西，烧吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy thorns. Still not touching it."
msgstr "刺烤脆了，我还是不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.2"
msgid "Fire did my chores for me."
msgstr "火替我干活了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Spiky bush. Who needs twigs this bad?"
msgstr "带刺的灌木，谁那么缺树枝？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Picking this is like a punishment drill."
msgstr "摘这个跟罚练一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left but thorns and regret."
msgstr "只剩刺和后悔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "My fingers need a bandage break."
msgstr "手指得贴创可贴歇会了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.1"
msgid "Swamp weeds. Not even Wormwood's excited."
msgstr "沼泽杂草，连沃姆伍德都不兴奋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.2"
msgid "Just there to look soggy."
msgstr "就在那里湿哒哒的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.1"
msgid "Mashed potatoes. Zero chewing, maximum lazy."
msgstr "土豆泥，不用嚼，懒人福音。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.2"
msgid "Comfort food. I need a lot of comfort."
msgstr "安慰食物，我需要很多安慰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.1"
msgid "Ancient architect. Did they draw blueprints in their sleep too?"
msgstr "古代建筑师，他们也在梦里画图吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.2"
msgid "Fancy patterns. Way too much homework for a mask."
msgstr "花纹这么复杂，做个面具跟写作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.1"
msgid "Handmaid mask. Ancient part-time job?"
msgstr "侍女面具，古代的打工吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.2"
msgid "Old and fragile. Like my motivation."
msgstr "又旧又脆，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.1"
msgid "Masons carried rocks all day? No thanks."
msgstr "石匠整天搬石头？不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.2"
msgid "Built like a brick. Fitting."
msgstr "跟砖一样结实，挺配。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.1"
msgid "Wearing this, I'd smash things professionally."
msgstr "戴上它，我砸东西就算专业的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.2"
msgid "Smells like soot. Very authentic."
msgstr "一股煤灰味，挺正宗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.1"
msgid "Something about this one gives me chills."
msgstr "这个让我有点发毛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.2"
msgid "Feels like the main villain's mask."
msgstr "感觉是大反派戴的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.1"
msgid "Broken doll face. Perfect for a haunted house."
msgstr "裂开的人偶脸，适合鬼屋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.2"
msgid "Somebody glue this before it gives me nightmares."
msgstr "谁来粘一下，免得我做噩梦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT.1"
msgid "Smiling forever? Sounds exhausting."
msgstr "永远在笑？听着就累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLHAT.2"
msgid "Doll roles just stand there being pretty. Easy."
msgstr "演人偶就站着装好看，轻松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT.1"
msgid "Glued back together. Like my school bag."
msgstr "粘回去了，跟我的书包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLREPAIREDHAT.2"
msgid "Scars give it character, I guess."
msgstr "有疤才有个性吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT.1"
msgid "The fool? Who cast me as this?"
msgstr "小丑？谁给我分的角色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_FOOLHAT.2"
msgid "Jokes are easy. Making people laugh isn't."
msgstr "说笑话容易，逗人笑难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT.1"
msgid "Halfwit role. Rude casting."
msgstr "傻瓜角色？选角真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_HALFWITHAT.2"
msgid "People already think I'm a slacker. No mask needed."
msgstr "别人本来就觉得我是混日子的，不用面具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT.1"
msgid "King for a day? Do I get to skip class?"
msgstr "当一天国王？能不上课吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_KINGHAT.2"
msgid "Crown's heavy. Being in charge sounds tiring."
msgstr "王冠好重，管事听着就累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT.1"
msgid "Mirror mask. Great, now I have to fix my hair."
msgstr "镜子面具，好了，现在得梳头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_MIRRORHAT.2"
msgid "Whoever looks at me sees themselves. Creepy."
msgstr "谁看我都看到自己，怪吓人的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT.1"
msgid "Princess? Me? The script's broken."
msgstr "公主？我？剧本坏了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_PRINCESSHAT.2"
msgid "Do I have to curtsy? Hard pass."
msgstr "还得行屈膝礼？我拒绝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT.1"
msgid "Queen role. At least I get to boss people around."
msgstr "女王角色，至少能使唤人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_QUEENHAT.2"
msgid "Shiny and proud. Not really my style."
msgstr "闪亮又高傲，不太是我的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT.1"
msgid "Sage role? Teachers would laugh."
msgstr "演贤者？老师会笑出声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_SAGEHAT.2"
msgid "Looks wise. Too bad the wearer's me."
msgstr "看着挺有智慧，可惜戴的是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT.1"
msgid "Yes-man role. I can't even fake that."
msgstr "马屁精角色，我装都装不来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TOADYHAT.2"
msgid "Nodding all day? My neck says no."
msgstr "整天点头？我脖子不同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT.1"
msgid "Tree role. Finally, a part I'm built for."
msgstr "演树，终于有适合我的角色了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_TREEHAT.2"
msgid "Can I nap on stage if I'm a tree?"
msgstr "演树的话能在台上睡觉吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.1"
msgid "Sails do the work. I just sit. Perfect."
msgstr "帆干活，我坐着，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.2"
msgid "Raise it, lower it, raise it again. Tiring."
msgstr "升起来，放下去，再升起来，累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.1"
msgid "Dragon lamp. Festival vibes on the sea."
msgstr "龙灯，海上也有节日气氛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.2"
msgid "Bright enough to scare off the dark, hopefully."
msgstr "够亮，希望能吓跑黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "Made from that bird? Good, payback."
msgstr "用那只鸟做的？好，报仇了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "Feathers catch wind better. Who knew."
msgstr "羽毛更兜风，谁知道呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.1"
msgid "Dragon sail. Feels like a parade float."
msgstr "龙帆，像游行花车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.2"
msgid "Looks fierce. The boat, not me."
msgstr "看着很凶。说的是船，不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.1"
msgid "Nice suit. Doesn't make you less annoying."
msgstr "西装不错，但你还是烦人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.2"
msgid "Show me a card trick and maybe I'll listen."
msgstr "变个扑克魔术，我也许会听。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.1"
msgid "Giant head, giant ego."
msgstr "大脑袋，大架子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.2"
msgid "Talking stone face. I've seen scarier in the staff room."
msgstr "会说话的石脸，教员室里我见过更凶的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.1"
msgid "Magic lamp? Free light, I'll take it."
msgstr "魔法灯？免费照明，我收下了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.2"
msgid "Probably a trap. Most nice things are."
msgstr "八成是陷阱，好东西大多是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.1"
msgid "Locked. Like the school roof door."
msgstr "锁着，跟学校天台的门一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.2"
msgid "If I hit it hard enough, does that count as a key?"
msgstr "我用力敲，算不算钥匙？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.1"
msgid "Same song on repeat. Worse than the school bell."
msgstr "同一首歌循环，比上课铃还烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.2"
msgid "Fancy record player. Got anything newer?"
msgstr "老式留声机，有新一点的歌吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.1"
msgid "Sit on that? I'd rather sit on a rock."
msgstr "坐那个？我宁愿坐石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.2"
msgid "Looks like a detention chair, but evil."
msgstr "像留堂用的椅子，还更邪恶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.1"
msgid "Meatballs again? I'm not complaining. Much."
msgstr "又是肉丸？我没抱怨，没怎么抱怨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.2"
msgid "Toss anything in a pot and boom, meatballs."
msgstr "往锅里随便扔，嘭，肉丸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Pearl's going to be so mad."
msgstr "珍珠肯定气坏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Charcoal rack. Not my fault. Probably."
msgstr "烤成炭的架子，不怪我，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.1"
msgid "Jerky's ready. Just one bite won't hurt, right?"
msgstr "肉干好了，偷吃一口没事吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.2"
msgid "Done! Let's take it before the birds do."
msgstr "好了！趁鸟来之前收了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Crispy seaweed time. Not bad."
msgstr "脆海苔时间，还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Finished drying. Even faster than my homework."
msgstr "晾完了，比我写作业还快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.1"
msgid "Watching it won't make it dry faster."
msgstr "盯着看也不会干得更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.2"
msgid "Patience. Not my strong suit."
msgstr "要耐心，这不是我的长项。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "Soggy jerky. Sad."
msgstr "泡水的肉干，好惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "Rain, take a day off for once."
msgstr "雨啊，偶尔也请个假吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Wet seaweed stays wet seaweed."
msgstr "湿海带还是湿海带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Should've built a roof. Too late now."
msgstr "早该搭个棚子，现在晚了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Seaweed's taking its sweet time."
msgstr "海带慢悠悠的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "No rush. I'll nap meanwhile."
msgstr "不急，我先睡一会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pearl's drying rack. I'll borrow a spot."
msgstr "珍珠的晾架，借个位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Empty rack, empty stomach."
msgstr "架子空空，肚子也空空。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.1"
msgid "Salad with meat. Finally, a salad I respect."
msgstr "带肉的沙拉，终于有我认可的沙拉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.2"
msgid "Healthy-ish. Good enough for me."
msgstr "算是健康吧，对我够了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Chewy. Good for when I'm bored."
msgstr "有嚼劲，无聊的时候正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Lasts forever. My snacks never last that long."
msgstr "能放很久，我的零食从没撑过这么久。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.1"
msgid "Smells like the swamp. Pass."
msgstr "一股沼泽味，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.2"
msgid "Merm fashion. Not my size, not my style."
msgstr "鱼人的时尚，尺寸不对，风格也不对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.1"
msgid "Fancier fish helmet. Still fishy."
msgstr "高级鱼头盔，还是腥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.2"
msgid "Wurt's crew gets the good stuff now."
msgstr "沃特的手下现在用好东西了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Grilled fish smell, but nope."
msgstr "烤鱼味，但不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Burning it is probably for the best."
msgstr "烧了大概最好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Don't look at me, I didn't do it."
msgstr "别看我，不是我干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Rest in peace, fishy guy."
msgstr "安息吧，鱼人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Wait, is it moving?!"
msgstr "等等，它在动？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Stay down! Please!"
msgstr "躺好！拜托！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.1"
msgid "Big guy with a spear. Not picking a fight."
msgstr "拿矛的大块头，不惹了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.2"
msgid "Guard duty all day? I'd fall asleep."
msgstr "整天站岗？我会睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Shiny guard. Moon must be bored."
msgstr "发光的守卫，月亮闲得慌吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.2"
msgid "Glowing and grumpy. Weird combo."
msgstr "又亮又凶，奇怪的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Shadow guard. Looks like it skipped sleep for a week."
msgstr "暗影守卫，像一周没睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Creepy merm. Keep it on our side."
msgstr "怪吓人的鱼人，最好站我们这边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.1"
msgid "Smoky fish on a stick. Gross."
msgstr "插在棍子上的熏鱼，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ash and stink. Great combo."
msgstr "灰加臭，绝配。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Who decorates with heads? Gross."
msgstr "谁拿脑袋当装饰？真恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Smells like a fish market on a hot day."
msgstr "像大热天的鱼市。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt fish shack. Smells like dinner gone wrong."
msgstr "烧焦的鱼窝，像做砸的晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Homeless merms are angry merms."
msgstr "没家的鱼人是生气的鱼人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rotten wood and fish. Cozy for them, I guess."
msgstr "烂木头加鱼，对他们来说挺舒服吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Knock and run? Tempting."
msgstr "敲门就跑？有点想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.1"
msgid "Big belly, big crown. Living the dream."
msgstr "大肚子大王冠，人生赢家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.2"
msgid "Lazy king. I respect that."
msgstr "懒散的国王，我尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Burnt throne. Kingdom's on hold."
msgstr "王座烧了，王国暂停营业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Nobody's sitting there now."
msgstr "现在没人坐了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A rug as a throne. Low budget."
msgstr "拿毯子当王座，预算不高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks soft. Can I nap on it?"
msgstr "看着挺软，能在上面睡吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.1"
msgid "No king, no motivation. Same."
msgstr "没国王就没干劲，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.2"
msgid "Bored guards. Feels like a school with no teacher."
msgstr "无聊的守卫，像没老师的学校。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.1"
msgid "Fishy fortress, fully staffed."
msgstr "鱼人堡垒，满员上岗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.2"
msgid "With a king around, they're actually working."
msgstr "有国王在，他们总算干活了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Glowing merm. Looks like it ate a lantern."
msgstr "发光的鱼人，像吞了盏灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.2"
msgid "Moon makeover. Not an improvement."
msgstr "月亮改造，没变好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.1"
msgid "Prince? Bet he still can't do his own chores."
msgstr "王子？肯定还是不会自己干活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.2"
msgid "Feed him enough and he's royalty. Easy job."
msgstr "喂饱了就成王族，轻松的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Gloomy merm. Did it lose a bet?"
msgstr "阴沉的鱼人，打赌输了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Dark and drippy. Don't come closer."
msgstr "又暗又滴水，别过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.1"
msgid "Merm multitool. Grip's slimy."
msgstr "鱼人的多用工具，握把黏黏的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.2"
msgid "Does everything badly. Relatable."
msgstr "啥都能干，啥都干不好。我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "Upgraded. Still smells like a pond."
msgstr "升级了，还是一股池塘味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "Finally less wobbly."
msgstr "总算不那么晃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.1"
msgid "A letter in a bottle. Better not be a love letter."
msgstr "瓶中信，最好别是情书。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.2"
msgid "Treasure map? Please say treasure map."
msgstr "藏宝图？拜托是藏宝图。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing inside. Story of my lunchbox."
msgstr "里面什么都没有，跟我饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2"
msgid "Could write my own note. Too lazy, though."
msgstr "可以自己写一封，不过太懒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.1"
msgid "Gooey white stuff. Hard pass for breakfast."
msgstr "黏糊糊的白东西，早饭不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.2"
msgid "Smells weird. Where did this even come from?"
msgstr "气味怪怪的，从哪弄来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.1"
msgid "Heavy little brick. Nice for throwing."
msgstr "沉甸甸的小砖，扔起来不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.2"
msgid "Could weld this onto my bat, right?"
msgstr "能焊到我的球棒上吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nice drawing. Better than my notebook doodles."
msgstr "画得不错，比我笔记本上的涂鸦强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Labels everything. Somebody's organized."
msgstr "什么都贴标签，谁这么讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.1"
msgid "Blank. Like my test paper."
msgstr "空白的，跟我的考卷一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.2"
msgid "Draw something on it? Later. Maybe."
msgstr "在上面画点什么？以后吧，也许。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.1"
msgid "Big fancy chest. Open up, already."
msgstr "又大又华丽的箱子，快打开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.2"
msgid "If it's another trap, I'm smashing it."
msgstr "要再是陷阱，我就砸了它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.1"
msgid "Big horn. That thing hit like a truck."
msgstr "好大的角，那家伙撞起来像卡车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.2"
msgid "Trophy. Not that anyone at school would believe me."
msgstr "战利品。可学校里没人会信。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.1"
msgid "Slimy and cold. Gross in a whole new way."
msgstr "黏糊糊还冰凉，换了种恶心法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.2"
msgid "Hold it now while it's safe, I guess."
msgstr "趁现在安全拿着吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Still warm. Pocket heater, but gross."
msgstr "还热着，像暖宝宝，就是恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Squishy and hot. Not putting it near my face."
msgstr "又软又烫，别拿到我脸边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.1"
msgid "Roasted gland. The name alone kills my appetite."
msgstr "烤腺体，光听名字就没胃口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.2"
msgid "If I'm starving, maybe. I'm not that starving."
msgstr "饿极了也许吃，现在还没到那地步。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.1"
msgid "Shrine maiden outfit. Louis pulls this off better."
msgstr "巫女服，露易丝穿更合适。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.2"
msgid "Sweeping shrine steps all day? I'd nap on them."
msgstr "整天扫神社台阶？我会在上面睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.1"
msgid "Long reach. Lazy fighting at its finest."
msgstr "够得远，懒人打架最好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.2"
msgid "Louis might like it. My bat's jealous."
msgstr "露易丝可能喜欢。我的球棒吃醋了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.1"
msgid "Whack-a-mole! Where's my bat?"
msgstr "打地鼠！我的球棒呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.2"
msgid "Stealing my rocks again? Thief."
msgstr "又偷我的石头？小偷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.1"
msgid "Wiggly. Stop squirming."
msgstr "扭来扭去的，别乱动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.2"
msgid "Caught you. No more stealing my flint."
msgstr "抓到你了，不准再偷我的燧石。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.1"
msgid "Dirt's moving. That's not normal."
msgstr "土在动，这不正常。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.2"
msgid "Bet it's hiding my missing rocks."
msgstr "我丢的石头肯定被它藏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.1"
msgid "Mole plus bat. Somebody mixed the wrong recipes."
msgstr "鼹鼠加蝙蝠，谁配错方子了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.2"
msgid "Sniff all you want, I don't have snacks."
msgstr "随便闻，我没带零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.1"
msgid "Smells like a gym locker."
msgstr "像体育馆储物柜的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.2"
msgid "Lumpy dirt pile with treasure inside. Maybe."
msgstr "里面也许有宝贝的土堆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.1"
msgid "Tiny dirt house. Cozier than my desk."
msgstr "小小的土房子，比我课桌舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.2"
msgid "Dig it up and get my stuff back."
msgstr "挖开拿回我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.1"
msgid "Splumonkey, hands off my bag."
msgstr "穴居猴，别碰我的包。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.2"
msgid "Throwing poop? Real mature."
msgstr "扔便便？真成熟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.1"
msgid "Smells like a gym locker full of bananas."
msgstr "闻着像塞满香蕉的体育柜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.2"
msgid "One swing and the whole family comes out screaming."
msgstr "一棒下去，全家都会尖叫着冲出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Guess the monkeys are homeless now. Not my problem."
msgstr "猴子们没家了。不关我事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like burnt toast and wet fur."
msgstr "一股烤焦吐司加湿毛的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Napping up there must beat any classroom."
msgstr "在上面午睡，肯定比教室舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bet they don't have to do homework."
msgstr "他们肯定不用写作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.1"
msgid "It's like a vending machine that never takes my coins."
msgstr "像台永远不收我硬币的自动贩卖机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Hey, spit out some snacks next time."
msgstr "喂，下次吐点零食出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.1"
msgid "Junk. Still beats sitting through math class."
msgstr "破烂。不过总比上数学课强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.2"
msgid "Somebody's trash, now my trash."
msgstr "别人的垃圾，现在是我的垃圾了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.1"
msgid "Who carved this? Way too much free time."
msgstr "谁雕的？闲得也太过分了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.2"
msgid "Looks like a totem pole for bananas."
msgstr "像是给香蕉立的图腾柱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.1"
msgid "She's got more attitude than our class rep."
msgstr "她比我们班长还会摆架子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.2"
msgid "Your Majesty, any chance you share snacks?"
msgstr "女王陛下，零食分我一点不行吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.1"
msgid "Fluffy reeds. Could make a decent pillow."
msgstr "毛茸茸的芦苇，能做个枕头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.2"
msgid "Looks just like a tail. Monkeys must be jealous."
msgstr "长得真像尾巴，猴子们怕是要嫉妒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.1"
msgid "Captain me. First order: nap time."
msgstr "我当船长，第一道命令：午睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.2"
msgid "Pirates sure love fancy hats."
msgstr "海盗是真喜欢花里胡哨的帽子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.1"
msgid "A bandana. Now I really look like a delinquent."
msgstr "绑上头巾，我更像不良少女了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.2"
msgid "Smells a little like monkey. Whatever."
msgstr "有点猴子味。算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.1"
msgid "Even the cafeteria isn't this bad."
msgstr "连食堂都没这么难吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.2"
msgid "Layers of regret, baked to perfection."
msgstr "一层又一层的后悔，烤得刚刚好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Chewy enough to break my jaw. Almost."
msgstr "硬得差点把我下巴嚼断。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Monster jerky. Only on desperate days."
msgstr "怪物肉干，只有走投无路时才吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.1"
msgid "Raw monster meat, but fancy. Still no."
msgstr "生怪物肉，摆得再漂亮也不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.2"
msgid "Warly, I know you tried. I'm still not eating it."
msgstr "沃利，我知道你尽力了，但我还是不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.1"
msgid "Somebody already smashed it. Wasn't me this time."
msgstr "早被人砸坏了，这次真不是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.2"
msgid "Broken stone thing. Looks like the school statue."
msgstr "破石头台子，跟学校那座雕像似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's a hole right in the middle. Staff goes there?"
msgstr "中间有个洞，是插法杖的吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feels like it wants me to put something in."
msgstr "感觉它在等我放点什么进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.1"
msgid "Now it's a night-light on a stick."
msgstr "现在变成带杆的小夜灯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.2"
msgid "Finally done. Can I go home now?"
msgstr "总算完事了，能回家了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.1"
msgid "Waiting for the full moon. Wake me when it's time."
msgstr "等满月是吧，到时候叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.2"
msgid "Guess I'll sit here and not fall asleep. Probably."
msgstr "那我就坐这儿，尽量不睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.1"
msgid "Nope. Like putting my key in the wrong locker."
msgstr "不对，就像钥匙插错了柜子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.2"
msgid "It's sulking. Try the blue one."
msgstr "它在闹脾气，换蓝色那根试试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Green wings. Looks kind of radioactive."
msgstr "绿色翅膀，看着像有辐射。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Flutter somewhere else, I'm trying to nap."
msgstr "去别处飞，我要睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.1"
msgid "Caught it. Easy."
msgstr "抓到了，小意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.2"
msgid "Stop wriggling, I'm not going to squish you."
msgstr "别乱动，我又不会捏扁你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "Could sell these as fancy bookmarks."
msgstr "拿来当高级书签能卖钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "Edible, apparently. Tastes like moonlight and paper."
msgstr "据说能吃，味道像月光拌纸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Plant it and wait. My favorite kind of work."
msgstr "种下去然后等，我最喜欢这种活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Nature here makes zero sense."
msgstr "这里的大自然完全不讲道理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "Don't keep it in my skirt pocket."
msgstr "别放裙子口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "Sharp enough to cut paper. Or homework."
msgstr "锋利到能割纸，或者割作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.1"
msgid "It's buzzing. Like my phone during class."
msgstr "它在嗡嗡响，跟上课时我的手机一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.2"
msgid "Glowing glass. Better make something before it fades."
msgstr "会发光的玻璃，得趁它没暗下去做点东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.1"
msgid "Hit it with the bat and it sparkles."
msgstr "拿球棒敲一下就闪闪发光。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.2"
msgid "My reflection looks sleepy. As usual."
msgstr "里面映出来的我一脸困样，照常。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.1"
msgid "Lobster dinner's hiding in there."
msgstr "龙虾晚餐就躲在里面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.2"
msgid "Knock knock. Come out so I can cook you."
msgstr "咚咚，出来让我煮了你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.1"
msgid "Heavy. I'll carry it anyway."
msgstr "挺沉，不过照样搬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.2"
msgid "Moon souvenir. Better than a keychain."
msgstr "月亮纪念品，比钥匙扣强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.1"
msgid "It floats around like it's too cool for me."
msgstr "飘来飘去，好像瞧不起我似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.2"
msgid "Smash it? No, wait. Probably important."
msgstr "砸开？算了，估计挺重要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.1"
msgid "Bat time. Stand back."
msgstr "该球棒出场了，让开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.2"
msgid "Looks like it's hiding something. Typical rock."
msgstr "感觉藏着什么，石头都这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.1"
msgid "Spiders with glass on their backs. Fantastic."
msgstr "背上长玻璃的蜘蛛，真是太棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2"
msgid "Webber, are these your cousins too?"
msgstr "韦伯，这些也是你亲戚？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Lost its spark. Like me in first period."
msgstr "没劲了，跟早上第一节课的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Plain glass. Boring."
msgstr "普通玻璃，无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.1"
msgid "Humming like a fridge at night."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，像半夜的冰箱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.2"
msgid "Careful, it might zap me."
msgstr "小心，可能会电我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.1"
msgid "Jumpy little thing. Hold still."
msgstr "跳来跳去的小东西，别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.2"
msgid "Shocking. Literally."
msgstr "真够“电”人的，字面意义上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.1"
msgid "Crackling like bad headphones."
msgstr "噼啪响，像坏掉的耳机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.2"
msgid "Wagstaff, you deal with this one."
msgstr "瓦格斯塔夫，这个你来弄。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.1"
msgid "An empty jar. Like my lunchbox at noon."
msgstr "空罐子，跟我中午的饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.2"
msgid "Waiting for something to zap into it."
msgstr "等着有东西被电进去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.1"
msgid "Bottled lightning. Great paperweight."
msgstr "装瓶的闪电，当镇纸不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.2"
msgid "Don't shake it. I mean it."
msgstr "别晃它，我是认真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.1"
msgid "Floating sparks. Get lost."
msgstr "飘着的电火花，滚远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2"
msgid "It wanders around like me skipping class."
msgstr "到处乱逛，跟我逃课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Stop whispering. It's creepy."
msgstr "别嘀咕了，怪吓人的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Talking altar. Louder, I wasn't listening."
msgstr "会说话的祭坛。大声点，我刚没听。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.1"
msgid "Half done. Like all my assignments."
msgstr "做了一半，跟我所有作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.2"
msgid "Another piece somewhere. Ugh, legwork."
msgstr "还有块零件在别处，烦，又要跑腿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.1"
msgid "More moon stuff. They really like building sets."
msgstr "又是月亮的东西，它们真爱拼套装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2"
msgid "Looks important. I'll pretend I understand it."
msgstr "看着挺重要，我就装作看得懂吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.1"
msgid "Patient thing. Unlike me."
msgstr "它挺有耐心，不像我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.2"
msgid "Feels like the teacher waiting for my answer."
msgstr "像老师在等我回答问题。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.1"
msgid "Who drops a crown in the ocean anyway?"
msgstr "谁会把王冠掉海里啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.2"
msgid "Carrying it slows me down. Annoying."
msgstr "扛着它走得好慢，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.1"
msgid "Picky rock. Wants a special spot."
msgstr "挑剔的石头，非要个特别的位置。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.2"
msgid "Sorry, Your Highness. Floor not good enough?"
msgstr "抱歉啊，殿下，地板配不上您？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.1"
msgid "Shaped like a weird trophy."
msgstr "长得像个奇怪的奖杯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.2"
msgid "Don't drop it. Don't drop it."
msgstr "别掉，别掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.1"
msgid "Heavier than my school bag. Barely."
msgstr "比我书包重，也就重一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.2"
msgid "Why does it keep staring at me."
msgstr "它干嘛一直盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.1"
msgid "Glowing like a festival stall. Nice."
msgstr "亮得像庙会的摊子，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.2"
msgid "Something big's about to happen. Should I nap first?"
msgstr "好像要出大事了，我先睡会儿？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.1"
msgid "Chip away at it. Carefully this time."
msgstr "一点点敲，这次轻一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.2"
msgid "Something shiny's trapped in there."
msgstr "里面困着亮晶晶的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.1"
msgid "Stubborn rock. Respect."
msgstr "石头挺倔，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.2"
msgid "One more swing and it's mine."
msgstr "再来一棒就归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.1"
msgid "Rocks with prizes inside. Like a gacha."
msgstr "里面带奖品的石头，跟扭蛋一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.2"
msgid "Dig it out before someone else does."
msgstr "趁别人还没动手，先挖出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.1"
msgid "Round and floaty. Like a sleepy balloon."
msgstr "圆滚滚飘着，像个犯困的气球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.2"
msgid "Middle of the altar, right? I think."
msgstr "放祭坛中间，对吧？大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.1"
msgid "Last piece? Please be the last piece."
msgstr "最后一块？求你是最后一块。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.2"
msgid "Looks like a giant chess piece."
msgstr "像个巨型棋子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.1"
msgid "Eat it and fall asleep. Honestly, tempting."
msgstr "吃了就睡着，说实话挺诱人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.2"
msgid "Smells like a cold hospital room."
msgstr "闻着像冷冰冰的病房。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "A little browner. Still looks suspicious."
msgstr "颜色深了点，看着还是可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells okay. Doesn't mean I trust it."
msgstr "闻着还行，但我不信它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.1"
msgid "This'll take forever. Wake me at stage two."
msgstr "这得弄到猴年马月，第二阶段再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.2"
msgid "Just a pile of parts. Like my room."
msgstr "就一堆零件，跟我房间一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.1"
msgid "Almost there. Don't make me haul more stuff."
msgstr "快好了，别再让我搬东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.2"
msgid "Starting to hum. That's good, right?"
msgstr "开始嗡嗡响了，是好事吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Done. What did we even build?"
msgstr "完工了。我们到底造了个啥？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something's pacing around in there."
msgstr "里面有东西在来回打转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bright crack. Like the moon's peeking out."
msgstr "发光的裂缝，像月亮在偷看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Weird. My brain feels like after a good nap."
msgstr "奇怪，脑子像刚睡了个好觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.1"
msgid "Lights off. Nobody's home."
msgstr "灯灭了，没人在家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.2"
msgid "Just a crack in the ground now."
msgstr "现在就是地上一道缝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.1"
msgid "Corked like a bottle. Good."
msgstr "像瓶子一样塞住了，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.2"
msgid "That should keep the weird stuff inside."
msgstr "这样奇怪的东西就出不来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Burning tree. Somebody grab water."
msgstr "树烧起来了，谁去拿水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Willow, was that you?"
msgstr "薇洛，是不是你干的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy. Good for charcoal at least."
msgstr "烧脆了，至少能当木炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Looks like my bedhead in the morning."
msgstr "像我早上起床的头发。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Stump. Free chair."
msgstr "树桩，免费的椅子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "My arms are done for today."
msgstr "我的手臂今天下班了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pale bark. Looks like it skipped breakfast."
msgstr "树皮这么白，像没吃早饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pretty tree. Shame I'm about to whack it."
msgstr "挺漂亮的树，可惜我马上要砍它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "Smells sweet. Can I eat it?"
msgstr "闻着甜甜的，能吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "Pink and soft. Put it in someone's hair."
msgstr "粉粉嫩嫩的，插谁头发上吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.1"
msgid "Crunchy now. Still not a snack."
msgstr "现在脆了，但还不是零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.2"
msgid "Pressed flower. Very schoolgirl of me."
msgstr "压花，好有女学生的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.1"
msgid "Huge egg. Breakfast for the whole camp?"
msgstr "这么大的蛋，够全营地吃早饭吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.2"
msgid "Something giant and angry is guarding this."
msgstr "肯定有又大又凶的东西守着它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.1"
msgid "Feathers everywhere. Somebody's been nesting."
msgstr "到处是羽毛，有人在筑巢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.2"
msgid "Nice spot. Too bad a giant goose owns it."
msgstr "地方不错，可惜被一只大鹅占了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.1"
msgid "Fish stew this good should be illegal."
msgstr "这么好吃的鱼汤该被禁止。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2"
msgid "Seconds. No, thirds."
msgstr "再来一碗，不，两碗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.1"
msgid "Louis, put that thing away before someone gets hurt."
msgstr "露易丝，快收起来，别伤到人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.2"
msgid "Creepy sword. My bat feels nicer."
msgstr "瘆人的刀，还是我的球棒顺手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.1"
msgid "Full of somebody's blood. Gross."
msgstr "装满不知道谁的血，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.2"
msgid "Squishy, like a water balloon from a nightmare."
msgstr "软乎乎的，像噩梦里的水气球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.1"
msgid "Tiny goose babies. Cute until they peck."
msgstr "小鹅宝宝，啄人之前还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.2"
msgid "Where's your mom? Actually, don't answer."
msgstr "你妈呢？算了，别回答。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.1"
msgid "Sorry. Didn't find anything good anyway."
msgstr "抱歉，反正也没挖到啥好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.2"
msgid "Somebody's gonna haunt me for this."
msgstr "肯定有人要为这个来缠着我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone's sleeping here. Lucky them."
msgstr "有人在这里长眠，真羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Digging graves feels like a bad idea."
msgstr "挖坟感觉不是好主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.1"
msgid "Surfing? Too much effort."
msgstr "冲浪？太费劲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.2"
msgid "Wonder if I can just lie on it and float."
msgstr "能不能就躺上面漂着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.1"
msgid "Hot and sweet. Perfect for a lazy day."
msgstr "又热又甜，最适合偷懒的日子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2"
msgid "Smells like cinnamon and holidays."
msgstr "闻着像肉桂和假期。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.1"
msgid "Ugly gate. Who designed this?"
msgstr "丑门，谁设计的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.2"
msgid "The way back home. If only it worked."
msgstr "回家的路，要是它能用就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.1"
msgid "Fancy upgrade. Still doesn't take me home."
msgstr "升级得挺花哨，还是不能送我回家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.2"
msgid "Moon rock makeover. Someone was bored."
msgstr "月岩改造，有人闲得慌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.1"
msgid "Wrapped up like a lazy burrito."
msgstr "裹得像条偷懒的卷饼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.2"
msgid "Wurt, your relatives need help."
msgstr "沃特，你亲戚需要帮忙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.1"
msgid "Waddling mushroom. Makes me want to sneeze."
msgstr "摇摇摆摆的蘑菇，看着就想打喷嚏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.2"
msgid "Little guy's got the same face as me in class."
msgstr "这小家伙跟我上课时一个表情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.1"
msgid "Run first, complain later."
msgstr "先跑，再抱怨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.2"
msgid "Toadstool's throwing snacks? Nope, explosives."
msgstr "毒菌蟾蜍在扔零食？不，是炸弹。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.1"
msgid "Fashion statement: walking mushroom."
msgstr "时尚宣言：会走路的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.2"
msgid "Makes me sleepy. Wait, that's just me."
msgstr "戴着就困。等等，我本来就困。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy mushroom. Shame there's no butter."
msgstr "烤蘑菇，可惜没黄油。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr "走好不送。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smash these before the toad gets stronger."
msgstr "趁蟾蜍还没变强，赶紧砸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Weeds, but mushrooms. Still annoying."
msgstr "就是蘑菇版的杂草，一样烦人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "Acid-glazed mushroom. Not on the menu."
msgstr "淋了酸的蘑菇，不在菜单上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "My bat would melt. Leave it."
msgstr "球棒会被腐蚀，别管它了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.1"
msgid "Red spores. Looks like it's sneezing."
msgstr "红色孢子，像它在打喷嚏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.2"
msgid "Achoo. Great, now I'm allergic."
msgstr "阿嚏。好了，我过敏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Red cap. Like a giant stop sign."
msgstr "红色伞盖，像个巨型停车标志。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Chop it for a red mushroom? Fair trade."
msgstr "砍了能掉红蘑菇？挺划算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.1"
msgid "Pale and wobbly. Looks undercooked."
msgstr "白白软软的，像没煮熟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.2"
msgid "Even the mushrooms got moon-touched."
msgstr "连蘑菇都沾了月亮的邪气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "Melty mushroom. Pass."
msgstr "融化的蘑菇，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "Hope my uniform's acid-proof. It isn't."
msgstr "希望我校服防酸。显然不防。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.1"
msgid "Green spores. Smells like old cheese."
msgstr "绿色孢子，一股陈年奶酪味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.2"
msgid "Ugh, it's in my hair now."
msgstr "啊，跑我头发里去了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Green mushroom tree. Kinda cute, actually."
msgstr "绿色蘑菇树，其实挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Still taller than our homeroom teacher."
msgstr "还是比我们班主任高。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "Acid rain did a number on it."
msgstr "酸雨把它折腾惨了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "Blue and dripping. Nasty."
msgstr "蓝的，还在滴，真恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.1"
msgid "Blue spores like snow. Ugly snow."
msgstr "蓝色孢子像雪，难看的雪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.2"
msgid "It's showing off again."
msgstr "它又在显摆了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big blue umbrella. Can I nap under it?"
msgstr "大蓝伞，下面能睡觉吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Glows at night. Free street lamp."
msgstr "晚上会亮，免费路灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "Spiders living in acid. Respect, I guess."
msgstr "蜘蛛住在酸里，佩服，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "Double gross. Moving on."
msgstr "双倍恶心，走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Webbed up like an abandoned classroom."
msgstr "到处是蛛网，像废弃的教室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Chop it and the spiders come out. Pass."
msgstr "一砍蜘蛛就冲出来，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.1"
msgid "Bearger in a skeleton costume. Very edgy."
msgstr "穿骨头装的熊獾，好中二。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.2"
msgid "Back from the dead and still hungry. Same, honestly."
msgstr "死了又回来，还是饿。说实话我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.1"
msgid "That beak isn't supposed to look like that."
msgstr "鸟嘴不该长那样吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.2"
msgid "Shoo. Go peck someone else."
msgstr "嘘，去啄别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Gross table manners."
msgstr "吃相真难看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Enjoy your meal. Don't mind me."
msgstr "慢慢吃，别管我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Circling like it's waiting for me to drop."
msgstr "绕着圈飞，像在等我倒下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Glowy vulture. Somehow creepier."
msgstr "发光的秃鹫，莫名更吓人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "Crystals all over? Show-off."
msgstr "浑身都是冰晶？爱显摆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "Last time was bad enough. Why's it back."
msgstr "上次就够惨了，怎么又回来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.1"
msgid "Stay down this time. Please."
msgstr "这回别再起来了，拜托。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.2"
msgid "Bones everywhere. Who's cleaning this?"
msgstr "满地骨头，谁来收拾？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Horror movie dog. Hard pass."
msgstr "恐怖片里的狗，坚决不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's missing half its body and still running?"
msgstr "身体少了一半还在跑？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Even zombie dogs need naps. Respect."
msgstr "连僵尸狗都要午睡，尊重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Tiptoe. Tiptoe."
msgstr "踮脚，踮脚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.1"
msgid "Big zombie dog. Bigger problem."
msgstr "大号僵尸狗，大号麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.2"
msgid "Run now, apologize to my legs later."
msgstr "先跑，回头再跟腿道歉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.1"
msgid "Rest in peace, weird bird."
msgstr "安息吧，怪鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.2"
msgid "Finally quiet. Thank goodness."
msgstr "终于安静了，谢天谢地。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pengull with a rock beak. Nope."
msgstr "长着石头嘴的企鸥，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Waddling and glaring. Like a hall monitor."
msgstr "摇摇摆摆还瞪人，像风纪委员。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. Let the creepy bird sleep."
msgstr "嘘，让怪鸟睡吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Snoring? Pengulls snore?"
msgstr "在打呼噜？企鸥也会打呼噜？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.1"
msgid "Festival vibes. Where's the takoyaki stand?"
msgstr "庙会的感觉，章鱼烧摊在哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.2"
msgid "Fox mask. Now I'm a mysterious transfer student."
msgstr "狐狸面具，我现在是神秘转校生了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.1"
msgid "Nope. Not touching. Not looking."
msgstr "不行，不碰，不看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.2"
msgid "Why is this just lying around?!"
msgstr "这种东西怎么会扔在这里？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.1"
msgid "Warm. Could fall asleep in it."
msgstr "暖和，裹着都能睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.2"
msgid "Pull it over my face and nobody bugs me."
msgstr "拉起来遮住脸，就没人烦我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Gardening plans. Too much effort, but nice."
msgstr "园艺图纸，太费劲，不过挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Wormwood would love this."
msgstr "沃姆伍德肯定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.1"
msgid "Crystals sprouting out of nowhere. Creepy."
msgstr "晶体凭空冒出来，吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.2"
msgid "Feels like it's growing just to block my way."
msgstr "感觉它长出来就是为了挡我路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.1"
msgid "Red glow means trouble. Got it."
msgstr "亮红光就是要出事，懂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.2"
msgid "Spooky lamp. Not the reading kind."
msgstr "诡异的灯，不是看书用的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.1"
msgid "Purple filling. Very suspicious."
msgstr "紫色馅料，非常可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.2"
msgid "Dessert is dessert. Fine, one bite."
msgstr "甜点就是甜点。行，就一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.1"
msgid "Smells like a chemistry lab."
msgstr "闻着像化学实验室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.2"
msgid "Rocky lump full of nitre. Swing away."
msgstr "满是硝石的石块，开砸吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.1"
msgid "Grippy dust. My shoes thank you."
msgstr "防滑粉，我的鞋谢谢你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.2"
msgid "Falling on my butt in front of everyone? Not again."
msgstr "当众摔个屁股蹲？不要再来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.1"
msgid "Extra grippy. Like brand new gym shoes."
msgstr "超级防滑，像新买的体育鞋。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.2"
msgid "Boosted grit. Fancy name for better sand."
msgstr "强化防滑粉，就是好一点的沙子换个名字。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.1"
msgid "Paddle in one hand, attitude in the other."
msgstr "一手船桨，一手脾气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.2"
msgid "Basically a bat with a flat end."
msgstr "说白了就是扁头的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Dry as my motivation."
msgstr "干得跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Mud and cracks. Great vacation spot."
msgstr "满是泥巴和裂缝，度假胜地呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Water in the desert. Can I take a nap here?"
msgstr "沙漠里有水，能在这儿午睡吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Fish in a desert lake. This world's weird."
msgstr "沙漠湖里还有鱼，这世界真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.1"
msgid "Ocean trash. Thanks, sea."
msgstr "海里的垃圾，谢谢你啊大海。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.2"
msgid "Not a fish. Disappointing."
msgstr "不是鱼，失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.1"
msgid "Just a line. The fish will laugh at me."
msgstr "光秃秃一根线，鱼会笑话我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.2"
msgid "Missing a float. Like losing my eraser during a test."
msgstr "少个浮标，跟考试时找不到橡皮一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.1"
msgid "Muddy fish. Tastes like a puddle, probably."
msgstr "泥鱼，吃起来估计像水坑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.2"
msgid "Ugly but filling. Like cafeteria food."
msgstr "丑，但顶饱，跟食堂饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.1"
msgid "Big fat bass. Dinner's sorted."
msgstr "大肥鲈鱼，晚饭有着落了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.2"
msgid "My arms are sore. It better be tasty."
msgstr "胳膊都酸了，它最好好吃点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3.1"
msgid "Spiky and smug. Like a senpai."
msgstr "又刺又得意，像个学长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_3.2"
msgid "Pretty fins. Bet they sting, though."
msgstr "鳍挺漂亮，不过肯定扎人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4.1"
msgid "Whiskers like a grumpy old man."
msgstr "胡子像个爱发牢骚的老头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_4.2"
msgid "Catfish. Doesn't meow. Disappointing."
msgstr "叫猫鱼却不会喵，失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5.1"
msgid "Fish and corn in one. Saves time cooking."
msgstr "鱼和玉米二合一，做饭省事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_5.2"
msgid "Yellow and bumpy. Smells a bit buttery."
msgstr "黄黄的、疙疙瘩瘩，有点黄油味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6.1"
msgid "Lucky fish. Make my next test easy."
msgstr "幸运鱼，下次考试保佑我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_6.2"
msgid "Too pretty to eat. Nah, I'm hungry."
msgstr "漂亮得舍不得吃。算了，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7.1"
msgid "Gold fish. Worth more than my allowance."
msgstr "金色的鱼，比我零花钱值钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_7.2"
msgid "Shiny scales. Wish my grades shone like this."
msgstr "鳞片闪闪发亮，我的成绩要是也这样就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8.1"
msgid "Frozen fish. Good for a hot day."
msgstr "冰冻的鱼，热天正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_8.2"
msgid "Feels like holding an ice pack."
msgstr "拿着跟冰袋一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9.1"
msgid "Candy fish? Finally, the ocean gets me."
msgstr "糖果鱼？大海终于懂我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_9.2"
msgid "Sweet and fishy. My stomach is confused."
msgstr "又甜又腥，我的胃糊涂了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1.1"
msgid "Tiny guppy. Throw it back? Nah."
msgstr "小孔雀鱼，扔回去？算了，不扔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_1.2"
msgid "Bait-sized. Or snack-sized, if I'm desperate."
msgstr "鱼饵大小，饿急了也算零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2.1"
msgid "Pointy nose. Don't poke me."
msgstr "尖鼻子，别戳我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_2.2"
msgid "Skinny thing. Needs to eat more, like me."
msgstr "瘦巴巴的，跟我一样该多吃点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3.1"
msgid "Basically a snack with fins."
msgstr "就是长了鳍的零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_3.2"
msgid "Tiny. Still counts as a catch."
msgstr "小是小，也算钓到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4.1"
msgid "Baby fish. I feel a little bad."
msgstr "小鱼苗，有点过意不去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_4.2"
msgid "Skinny little thing. Barely worth the bait."
msgstr "瘦小一条，差点不值鱼饵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5.1"
msgid "Movie night snack, ocean edition."
msgstr "电影夜零食，海洋版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_5.2"
msgid "Smells buttery. I'm not complaining."
msgstr "有股黄油味，我没意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6.1"
msgid "Autumn fish. Flat as my notebook."
msgstr "秋天的鱼，扁得像我的笔记本。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_6.2"
msgid "A leaf pretending to be a fish. Or the reverse."
msgstr "一片叶子假装成鱼，或者反过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7.1"
msgid "Spring fish. Smells like a garden."
msgstr "春天的鱼，闻着像花园。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_7.2"
msgid "Pretty enough for a hair clip. Fishy, though."
msgstr "漂亮得能当发夹，就是有腥味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8.1"
msgid "Free hand warmer for winter."
msgstr "冬天的免费暖手宝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_8.2"
msgid "Cooks itself? Lazy fish. I like it."
msgstr "自己会熟？懒鱼，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9.1"
msgid "Spits at me? Rude."
msgstr "冲我吐口水？没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_SMALL_9.2"
msgid "Reminds me of the kid behind me in class."
msgstr "让我想起班上坐我后面那家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.1"
msgid "Roots in the water. Don't they get soggy?"
msgstr "根泡在水里，不会泡烂吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.2"
msgid "Bumpy trunk. Great for climbing, if I cared."
msgstr "树干疙疙瘩瘩，适合爬，要是我想爬的话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.1"
msgid "Heavy nut. Could throw it at someone."
msgstr "沉甸甸的坚果，能拿来砸人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.2"
msgid "Plant it in the sea and wait. Easy."
msgstr "扔海里种着，等就行，简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "Giant tree. Makes my boat look like a toy."
msgstr "巨树，衬得我的船像玩具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "Stuff drops from up there. Watch your head."
msgstr "上面会掉东西下来，小心头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.1"
msgid "Swing on them? Too much work."
msgstr "荡藤蔓？太累了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.2"
msgid "Good for rope. Or tripping people."
msgstr "能做绳子，也能绊人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.1"
msgid "Hanging spider bag. Nope."
msgstr "挂着的蜘蛛袋，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.2"
msgid "Looks like a lumpy sock full of legs."
msgstr "像一只装满腿的臭袜子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy cocoon. No more spiders."
msgstr "烧脆的茧，没蜘蛛了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like burnt hair. Gross."
msgstr "一股烧头发味，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.1"
msgid "Spat out like a bad snack. Rude."
msgstr "被像难吃的零食一样吐出来，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.2"
msgid "Head's spinning. Give me a minute."
msgstr "头好晕，给我一分钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.1"
msgid "Big whirlpool. Like a giant bathtub drain."
msgstr "大漩涡，像巨型浴缸的下水口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.2"
msgid "Jump in? Sure, what could go wrong."
msgstr "跳进去？行啊，能出什么事呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.1"
msgid "Net's heavy. Dinner's here."
msgstr "网好沉，晚饭到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.2"
msgid "Free fish, zero effort. Perfect."
msgstr "零努力，白拿鱼，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.1"
msgid "Ugh, the fish outsmarted a net."
msgstr "唉，鱼居然比网聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.2"
msgid "Empty again. Fish are mocking me."
msgstr "又空了，鱼在嘲笑我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.1"
msgid "Patched up. Back to waiting."
msgstr "补好了，继续等。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.2"
msgid "Good as new. Probably."
msgstr "跟新的一样，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fishing without fishing. My kind of hobby."
msgstr "不用钓的钓鱼，我喜欢的爱好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A net that works while I nap. Love it."
msgstr "我睡觉它干活，爱了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.1"
msgid "Net's in. Time for a nap."
msgstr "网下去了，该午睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.2"
msgid "Come on, fish. Swim in."
msgstr "来吧鱼，游进来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.1"
msgid "I'm rich. Still hungry, though."
msgstr "我发财了，但还是饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.2"
msgid "Enough to buy every snack in town. Twice."
msgstr "够把镇上零食买两遍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.1"
msgid "Smells strong even before I cut it."
msgstr "还没切就冲鼻子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.2"
msgid "Cry over an onion? Not me. Never."
msgstr "为洋葱哭？我才不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.1"
msgid "Sweet and soft. Okay, I take it all back."
msgstr "又甜又软，好吧，我收回之前的话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Grilled onion. Needs a burger."
msgstr "烤洋葱，就差个汉堡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Giant onion. Everyone's gonna cry."
msgstr "巨型洋葱，大家都得哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Heavy. Good arm workout, at least."
msgstr "挺沉，至少能练胳膊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tiny seeds, big tears later."
msgstr "种子小小的，以后眼泪大大的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Onion seeds. Warly will want these."
msgstr "洋葱种子，沃利肯定要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.1"
msgid "Fancy rock. A pawnshop would love this."
msgstr "高级石头，当铺肯定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.2"
msgid "Shinier than anything in my locker."
msgstr "比我柜子里任何东西都亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.1"
msgid "A little moon on a stick. Fancy."
msgstr "棍子上顶着个小月亮，挺高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.2"
msgid "Summer nap buddy. Finally."
msgstr "夏天午睡的好伙伴，终于有了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.1"
msgid "Lazy gem for lazy people. Finally, a gem that gets me."
msgstr "懒人用的宝石。总算有块宝石懂我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.2"
msgid "Make a staff out of it and I never walk again."
msgstr "拿它做根法杖，我就再也不用走路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "Now everyone knows where I'm napping."
msgstr "这下大家都知道我在哪儿睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "Basically a sticky note, but with an eyeball."
msgstr "就是个长了眼珠子的便利贴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.1"
msgid "Those little paws are way too quick with my stuff."
msgstr "那小爪子拿我东西也太快了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.2"
msgid "Cute, sure. Still a thief."
msgstr "可爱是可爱，照样是小偷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells like wet fish and stolen goods."
msgstr "一股湿鱼和赃物的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Cozier than my room back home, honestly."
msgstr "说实话，比我家里的房间还舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.1"
msgid "Pretty sure half of that is ours."
msgstr "里面一半应该都是我们的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.2"
msgid "Finders keepers. My bat says so."
msgstr "谁捡到归谁，我的球棒说的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.1"
msgid "Nobody's home anymore."
msgstr "已经没人住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.2"
msgid "Guess the loot party's over."
msgstr "看来分赃派对散场了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.1"
msgid "Looks like a pinecone that went on vacation."
msgstr "像一颗跑去度假的松果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.2"
msgid "Shade, sea breeze... perfect nap spot."
msgstr "有树荫，有海风……睡午觉正合适。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Tiny. Grow up already."
msgstr "好小。快点长大啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "It and I both just want to sit in the sun."
msgstr "我跟它都只想晒太阳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.1"
msgid "Feels like a cheap roof tile."
msgstr "摸着像块劣质瓦片。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.2"
msgid "Monkeys probably want this more than I do."
msgstr "猴子大概比我更想要这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.1"
msgid "Looks crunchy. Sadly not a snack."
msgstr "看着脆脆的，可惜不是零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.2"
msgid "Toss it in the sand and hope for the best."
msgstr "往沙子里一扔，剩下的看运气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.1"
msgid "Fancy box means a fancy trap."
msgstr "盒子这么花哨，陷阱肯定也很花哨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.2"
msgid "Bat's ready. Okay, now open it."
msgstr "球棒准备好了。行，开吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.1"
msgid "Bread stuffed with candied fruit. Somebody gets me."
msgstr "面包里塞满蜜饯，总算有人懂我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.2"
msgid "Tall enough to use as a pillow."
msgstr "高得都能当枕头用了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.1"
msgid "Looks like a cloud wearing fruit."
msgstr "像一朵戴着水果的云。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.2"
msgid "Too pretty to eat. Eating it anyway."
msgstr "漂亮得舍不得吃。不过还是要吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.1"
msgid "Keep that drool away from my bat."
msgstr "口水离我的球棒远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.2"
msgid "Ugly, slimy, and it spits. Like the worst kid in class."
msgstr "又丑又黏还吐口水，跟班上最讨厌的家伙一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Roast pengull. Nope, still not hungry for that."
msgstr "烤企鸥……不行，这个我真吃不下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Somebody open a window. Oh wait, we're outside."
msgstr "谁去开个窗……哦对，我们在外面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Poor thing waddled its last waddle."
msgstr "可怜的家伙，再也摇摇摆摆不起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Not taking it home. Don't ask."
msgstr "不带回去，别问。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Nope. Lie back down."
msgstr "不行，给我躺回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Zombie birds weren't on today's schedule."
msgstr "今天的课表里可没有僵尸鸟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.1"
msgid "Red means danger. Even I know that."
msgstr "红色代表危险，连我都知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.2"
msgid "My tongue is already sweating just looking at it."
msgstr "光是看着，舌头就开始冒汗了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.1"
msgid "Looks cute. It's lying."
msgstr "看着挺可爱，全是骗人的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.2"
msgid "Dare Wolfgang to eat three in a row."
msgstr "赌沃尔夫冈连吃三个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.1"
msgid "Fire didn't calm it down at all."
msgstr "火一点都没让它消停。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells nice. My tongue disagrees."
msgstr "闻着挺香，舌头不同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "This thing could win a fight on its own."
msgstr "这玩意儿自己就能打赢一场架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Giant pepper. Giant regret."
msgstr "巨型辣椒，巨型后悔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tiny seeds, enormous pain later."
msgstr "种子小小的，以后能辣死人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Warly will be happy, at least."
msgstr "至少沃利会高兴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.1"
msgid "Hey, turkey. Those berries were mine."
msgstr "喂，火鸡，那些浆果是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.2"
msgid "Runs pretty fast for something that looks that dumb."
msgstr "长得那么傻，跑得倒挺快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.1"
msgid "Little pillows full of food. My kind of pillow."
msgstr "装满吃的小枕头，我喜欢的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.2"
msgid "Could eat a whole plate and nap right after."
msgstr "能吃一整盘，然后直接睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.1"
msgid "Crunchy flowers. Not exactly a snack."
msgstr "脆脆的花，可惜不算零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.2"
msgid "Like the ones pressed in old textbooks."
msgstr "像夹在旧课本里的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.1"
msgid "Who made these flowers so moody?"
msgstr "谁把花弄得这么阴沉的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.2"
msgid "Black petals. Edgy, but no thanks."
msgstr "黑色花瓣，挺中二的，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.1"
msgid "Drying them didn't make them any less creepy."
msgstr "晒干了也照样瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.2"
msgid "Maybe Maxwell wants them for tea."
msgstr "说不定麦斯威尔要拿来泡茶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.1"
msgid "Can't chop it. Can mine it. Weird tree."
msgstr "砍不动，倒是能挖。奇怪的树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.2"
msgid "Looks like it saw something scary."
msgstr "看着像是被什么吓僵了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.1"
msgid "Gross. Just gross."
msgstr "恶心，太恶心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.2"
msgid "Who sneezed this out?"
msgstr "这是谁打喷嚏打出来的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.1"
msgid "Sour fish. Strange, but I'll eat it."
msgstr "酸鱼。怪怪的，但我会吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.2"
msgid "Smells like a jar forgotten in the back of the fridge."
msgstr "闻着像冰箱最里面被遗忘的罐子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.1"
msgid "That glare's not scaring anyone."
msgstr "瞪我也没用，吓不到人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.2"
msgid "Want a staring contest? I'll fall asleep first."
msgstr "要比瞪眼？我会先睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.1"
msgid "Greedy pig. Share a little."
msgstr "贪心的猪，分一点啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.2"
msgid "Gold-grabbing champion of the year."
msgstr "年度抢金冠军。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3.1"
msgid "My skirt is not your target."
msgstr "我的裙子不是你的靶子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3.2"
msgid "Muddy pig, muddy fight."
msgstr "一身泥的猪，打的也是泥巴仗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4.1"
msgid "This one punches first and thinks never."
msgstr "这只先动手，从来不动脑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4.2"
msgid "Fine. Bat versus fists."
msgstr "行吧，球棒对拳头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1.1"
msgid "Go get 'em. I'm on break."
msgstr "上吧，我先休息一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1.2"
msgid "Our side, right? Don't forget."
msgstr "你是我们这边的吧？别忘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2.1"
msgid "Fight first, count gold later."
msgstr "先打，金子之后再数。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2.2"
msgid "Gold in your pocket won't win the match."
msgstr "口袋里的金子可赢不了比赛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3.1"
msgid "Fling the mud at them, not me."
msgstr "泥往他们身上甩，别甩我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3.2"
msgid "Messy fighter, but at least it's ours."
msgstr "打得一团乱，好歹是我们的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.1"
msgid "Punch harder. I want to go home."
msgstr "打用力点，我想回家了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.2"
msgid "If you win, I'll share my snacks. Maybe."
msgstr "赢了我就分你零食，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.1"
msgid "Grumpier than our discipline teacher."
msgstr "比我们教导主任还凶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.2"
msgid "Fine, I won't touch your torch."
msgstr "行，我不碰你的火把。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.1"
msgid "Smells like a barbecue nobody wanted."
msgstr "闻着像一顿没人想吃的烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.2"
msgid "Crispy and still creepy."
msgstr "烤脆了也照样吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Terrible decoration. Zero stars."
msgstr "装饰品太烂了，零星差评。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's watching me. I hate that."
msgstr "它在盯着我，我讨厌这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.1"
msgid "Smells like a pig. Obviously."
msgstr "一股猪味。废话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.2"
msgid "Could make a decent baseball out of this."
msgstr "这个能做个不错的棒球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.1"
msgid "Smells like pig sweat and old socks."
msgstr "一股猪汗和旧袜子的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.2"
msgid "Not even I would nap in there."
msgstr "连我都不想在里面睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.1"
msgid "Pigs camping out. No marshmallows, though."
msgstr "猪在露营，可惜没有棉花糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.2"
msgid "Warm spot, but the guards won't share."
msgstr "挺暖和的，可惜守卫不让靠近。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.1"
msgid "One coin and a pig fights for you. Good deal."
msgstr "一枚硬币就能让猪替你打，划算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.2"
msgid "Pocket money for lazy fighters like me."
msgstr "像我这种懒得打架的人的零花钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.1"
msgid "Shiny belt. The Pig King loves this stuff."
msgstr "亮闪闪的腰带，猪王最喜欢这种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.2"
msgid "Heavy for a belt. Not wearing it."
msgstr "当腰带也太重了，不戴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.1"
msgid "Could throw this at whoever's sleeping in class."
msgstr "可以拿来砸上课睡觉的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.2"
msgid "A whole tree packed in my pocket."
msgstr "我口袋里装了一整棵树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Small now. Give it a few days."
msgstr "现在还小，过几天吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Don't let anyone step on it."
msgstr "别让人踩到它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.1"
msgid "X marks the spot. Classic."
msgstr "叉号标地点，老套路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.2"
msgid "Digging is work. Treasure makes it worth it."
msgstr "挖土很累，不过有宝藏就值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.1"
msgid "Leafy meat. My brain doesn't know how to feel."
msgstr "长叶子的肉，脑子不知道该怎么反应。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.2"
msgid "Wormwood's cousin? Hope not."
msgstr "沃姆伍德的亲戚？希望不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Smells like grilled salad. Still meat, though."
msgstr "闻着像烤沙拉，但还是肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Good enough. Hunger wins."
msgstr "凑合吧，饿肚子赢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Mystery sprout. Surprise me."
msgstr "神秘的芽，给我点惊喜吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Whatever it is, hope it's edible."
msgstr "不管是什么，能吃就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.1"
msgid "Watching it grow is worse than math class."
msgstr "看它长比上数学课还难熬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.2"
msgid "Hurry up. I'm hungry here."
msgstr "快点长，我都饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.1"
msgid "Harvest time. The good part."
msgstr "收获时间，最棒的部分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.2"
msgid "Done growing? Then into my mouth."
msgstr "长好了？那就进我嘴里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Crispy. Not the good kind."
msgstr "脆了，不是好吃的那种脆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.2"
msgid "Should've watered it. Too late now."
msgstr "早该浇水的，现在晚了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.1"
msgid "Puppets doing drama? Sounds like nap time."
msgstr "人偶演戏？听起来能睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.2"
msgid "Memorizing lines? Worse than a pop quiz."
msgstr "背台词？比随堂测验还难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.1"
msgid "Princess role? Not me. Give me the knight."
msgstr "演公主？别找我，给我演骑士。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.2"
msgid "A princess story. Hope there's a fight scene."
msgstr "公主的故事，希望有打戏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.1"
msgid "Mysterious author, mysterious plot. I'll sleep through it."
msgstr "作者神秘，剧情神秘，我会睡过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.2"
msgid "Vaults usually have treasure. Plays usually don't."
msgstr "金库里一般有宝藏，戏里一般没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.1"
msgid "Sad plays make me sleepy."
msgstr "悲伤的戏让我想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.2"
msgid "Bring tissues. For Wendy, not me."
msgstr "带上纸巾，给温蒂的，不是给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.1"
msgid "You crossed the line. Bat time."
msgstr "你越线了，该球棒出场了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Hurt my friends again and you're done."
msgstr "再伤我朋友，你就完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone else is driving that body right now."
msgstr "那身体现在是别人在开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hey, give him back when you're done."
msgstr "喂，用完了记得还回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.1"
msgid "That's my face, but not my lazy energy."
msgstr "是我的脸，可没有我那股懒劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.2"
msgid "Creepy. I don't make that face."
msgstr "好吓人，我才不会做那种表情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.1"
msgid "Where's the rest of the deck?"
msgstr "剩下的牌去哪了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.2"
msgid "Card games are fun. One card is not."
msgstr "打牌好玩，一张牌可不好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.1"
msgid "Goes somewhere far. Up top or underground, maybe."
msgstr "通到很远的地方，大概是地上或者地下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.2"
msgid "Different world, same me. Still tired."
msgstr "换了个世界，我还是一样困。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda's shortcut. A lazy person's dream."
msgstr "旺达的捷径，懒人的梦想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Jump in and skip the walk. Perfect."
msgstr "跳进去就不用走路了，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.1"
msgid "Ow. That's not how you stick a landing."
msgstr "哎哟，落地可不是这么落的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.2"
msgid "Fell out of the sky again. Great."
msgstr "又从天上掉下来了，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.1"
msgid "Fancy cookies. Eat one, pocket three."
msgstr "精致的饼干，吃一块，揣三块。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.2"
msgid "Jam in the middle. Whoever made these has taste."
msgstr "中间夹果酱，做的人很有品味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.1"
msgid "Better at chores than I am."
msgstr "做家务比我强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.2"
msgid "Pick up my stuff too, birdie."
msgstr "小鸟，顺便把我的东西也捡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.1"
msgid "So many seeds, so little fruit."
msgstr "籽这么多，果肉这么少。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.2"
msgid "Stains everything red. Careful with the uniform."
msgstr "什么都能染红，小心校服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm seeds. Still annoying."
msgstr "热乎的籽，还是很烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Tastes fine. The effort doesn't."
msgstr "味道还行，费的劲不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "That's a lifetime supply of seeds."
msgstr "这是一辈子的籽量。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Could smash it open with my bat. Faster."
msgstr "用球棒砸开更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Plant them and let future me deal with it."
msgstr "种下去，让未来的我去烦吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny red trouble."
msgstr "红色的小麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.1"
msgid "Slippery. Stop wiggling."
msgstr "滑溜溜的，别扭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.2"
msgid "Eel rice bowl. That's the dream."
msgstr "鳗鱼饭，梦想啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.1"
msgid "Small fish, but a fish is a fish."
msgstr "鱼虽小，好歹是鱼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.2"
msgid "Still flopping. Calm down, you're dinner."
msgstr "还在扑腾，冷静点，你是晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.1"
msgid "Pond hair. Gross."
msgstr "池塘的头发，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.2"
msgid "Looks like seaweed, but sadder."
msgstr "像海带，就是更寒酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.1"
msgid "Carry my bed everywhere? Best invention ever."
msgstr "随身带床？史上最好的发明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.2"
msgid "Do not disturb. Seriously."
msgstr "请勿打扰，认真的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.1"
msgid "Fries. Mashed. Chips. So many possibilities."
msgstr "薯条，土豆泥，薯片，可能性太多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.2"
msgid "Dirty, lumpy, perfect."
msgstr "脏兮兮，疙疙瘩瘩，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.1"
msgid "Heavy for most people. Light for me."
msgstr "对别人来说重，对我来说轻。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.2"
msgid "Good arm workout. Not that I need it."
msgstr "挺练手臂的，虽然我用不着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.1"
msgid "Puffy and fancy. Don't poke it."
msgstr "蓬蓬的，很高级，别戳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.2"
msgid "Warly made this? Respect."
msgstr "沃利做的？佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.1"
msgid "Potato on a stick. Tastes like a festival."
msgstr "插在签子上的土豆，有庙会的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.2"
msgid "Spiral fries. My favorite shape."
msgstr "螺旋土豆，我最喜欢的形状。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Baked potato. Simple and perfect."
msgstr "烤土豆，简单又完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Needs butter. Or anything, really."
msgstr "要是有黄油就好了，别的也行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Biggest potato I've ever seen. I'm moved."
msgstr "这辈子见过最大的土豆，感动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Carrying it's easy. Eating it all, not so much."
msgstr "搬是好搬，吃完可就难了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Future fries. Patience."
msgstr "未来的薯条，忍住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant them in rows. Or don't, whatever."
msgstr "排成一排种，不排也行，随便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.1"
msgid "Not even bugs want it."
msgstr "连虫子都不想要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.2"
msgid "Could use it as a brick."
msgstr "能当砖头用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.1"
msgid "Little pirates, big trouble."
msgstr "小海盗，大麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.2"
msgid "Get off our deck, you thieving monkeys."
msgstr "下去，你们这些偷东西的猴子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.1"
msgid "Captain monkey. Looks bossy."
msgstr "猴子船长，看着就爱指挥人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.2"
msgid "Knock the hat off and see who's boss."
msgstr "把帽子打掉，看看谁才是老大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Colorful beak, chubby body. Cute."
msgstr "嘴巴彩色，身子圆滚滚，可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Floating around all day. Jealous."
msgstr "整天漂来漂去，好羡慕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.1"
msgid "Got you. You're kind of soft."
msgstr "抓到了，你还挺软。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.2"
msgid "Stop flapping. I'm not gonna eat you. Probably."
msgstr "别扑腾，我不会吃你的。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Same, buddy. Same."
msgstr "我懂，兄弟，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Napping on the waves. Teach me."
msgstr "在浪上睡午觉，教教我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.1"
msgid "Heavier than it looks. Not for me, though."
msgstr "比看着沉，不过对我来说不算啥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.2"
msgid "Could carve a face in it. A bored one."
msgstr "可以刻张脸，刻张无聊脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.1"
msgid "Carving a scary face? I'll do a sleepy one."
msgstr "刻吓人的脸？我刻张困脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.2"
msgid "Art class flashback."
msgstr "想起美术课了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.1"
msgid "Crunchy and sweet. Gimme."
msgstr "又脆又甜，给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.2"
msgid "These disappear way too fast."
msgstr "这东西消失得太快了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.1"
msgid "Autumn in a pie dish."
msgstr "一整盘的秋天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.2"
msgid "Whoever made this, I owe you one."
msgstr "谁做的？我欠你一个人情。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.1"
msgid "Pumpkin guts everywhere. Not cleaning that up."
msgstr "南瓜瓤溅得到处都是，我不打扫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.2"
msgid "Stand back. It's about to splatter."
msgstr "退后，要炸一地了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft, warm, a little sweet. Fine."
msgstr "软软的，热热的，有点甜，还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.2"
msgid "Tastes like autumn. Needs sugar, though."
msgstr "秋天的味道，就是缺点糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "That's not a pumpkin, that's furniture."
msgstr "这不是南瓜，是家具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Could make pie for the whole camp."
msgstr "够给整个营地做派了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Roasted seeds make a good snack too."
msgstr "烤南瓜子也是好零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny now, giant pumpkin later."
msgstr "现在小小的，以后是大南瓜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.1"
msgid "So bright it hurts my sleepy eyes."
msgstr "亮得我那双困眼都疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.2"
msgid "Looks expensive. Can I sell it?"
msgstr "看着很值钱，能卖吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "Purple eye. Like I need more people watching me."
msgstr "紫色的眼睛，好像我还嫌被盯得不够。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "Stick it on the map so nobody gets lost."
msgstr "放上地图，谁都不会迷路了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.1"
msgid "Busy chewing. Finally, a break."
msgstr "在忙着嚼，总算能歇会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.2"
msgid "Eat slowly, big guy. Really slowly."
msgstr "慢慢吃，大家伙，越慢越好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hungry mouth in the sky. I know the feeling."
msgstr "天上那张饿嘴，我懂那种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "If it gets mad, we're all toast."
msgstr "它要是发火，我们全完了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.1"
msgid "Little post, big job apparently."
msgstr "小柱子，好像任务挺重。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.2"
msgid "Could lean on it and nap. Tempting."
msgstr "能靠着打个盹，挺诱人的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.1"
msgid "Nobody's trimmed these in ages."
msgstr "好久没人修剪了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.2"
msgid "Vines everywhere. Lazy gardener, like me."
msgstr "到处是藤，园丁跟我一样懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.1"
msgid "She looks strict. Like a principal."
msgstr "看着很严肃，像校长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.2"
msgid "Somebody spent years carving this."
msgstr "有人花了好几年雕这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.1"
msgid "Moss on its face. Nobody cleans here."
msgstr "脸上都长苔藓了，没人打扫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.2"
msgid "Stone's patient. I'm not."
msgstr "石头有耐心，我可没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.1"
msgid "Creepy eyes. Hate it."
msgstr "眼神好吓人，讨厌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.2"
msgid "Feels like a teacher watching an exam."
msgstr "感觉像监考老师在盯着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.1"
msgid "Poor guy. Let it rest."
msgstr "可怜的家伙，让它歇着吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.2"
msgid "Skin and bones. Wish I had snacks for it."
msgstr "皮包骨了，真希望有零食给它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.1"
msgid "Empty. Just like my stomach."
msgstr "空的，跟我的肚子一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.2"
msgid "Someone beat me to it. Rude."
msgstr "有人先下手了，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.1"
msgid "Fancy bowl for a fancy eater."
msgstr "挑剔的食客配讲究的碗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.2"
msgid "Shiny. Don't scratch it."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，别刮花了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Carrots, start growing. I'm waiting."
msgstr "胡萝卜，快长，我等着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny seeds for a very hungry sky."
msgstr "给饿肚子的天空准备的小种子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.1"
msgid "Big dish, big meal, big nap after."
msgstr "大盘子，大餐，饭后大睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.2"
msgid "Heavy enough to swing. Not that I would."
msgstr "重得能抡起来，不过我不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.1"
msgid "Small dish. Small portion. Sad."
msgstr "小盘子，小份量，伤心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.2"
msgid "Cute size. Not filling, though."
msgstr "尺寸挺可爱，就是吃不饱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.1"
msgid "Pocket change. Literally."
msgstr "名副其实的零钱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.2"
msgid "Better than nothing, I guess."
msgstr "总比没有强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.1"
msgid "Looks fancier than the old ones."
msgstr "比旧的那种看着高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.2"
msgid "Now we're getting somewhere."
msgstr "这才像样嘛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.1"
msgid "Don't spend it all on salt."
msgstr "别全拿去买盐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.2"
msgid "Heavy little thing. I like it."
msgstr "小小的挺沉，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.1"
msgid "Looks like we finally impressed the big mouth."
msgstr "看来我们总算让那张大嘴满意了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.2"
msgid "Holding this, I can almost smell home."
msgstr "拿着这个，好像都闻到家的味道了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.1"
msgid "Crab meat. Fancy dinner tonight."
msgstr "蟹肉，今晚吃顿好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.2"
msgid "Took forever to pick out. Don't drop it."
msgstr "挑了半天才挑出来，别掉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Smells way too good. Just one bite."
msgstr "闻着太香了，就一口。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Cooked crab. Now I'm actually hungry."
msgstr "熟蟹肉，这下真饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.1"
msgid "Fishing for lazy people. Love it."
msgstr "懒人钓鱼法，喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.2"
msgid "Crabs walk in, I walk away. Fair."
msgstr "螃蟹进去，我走开，公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.1"
msgid "Pots and pans. No snacks. Disappointing."
msgstr "锅碗瓢盆，没有零食，失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.2"
msgid "Someone was planning a big dinner."
msgstr "有人在准备一顿大餐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.1"
msgid "Looks like something a goat would eat."
msgstr "看着像羊吃的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.2"
msgid "Salad from a swamp. Delicious, probably."
msgstr "沼泽沙拉，大概好吃吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.1"
msgid "Don't sneeze near it."
msgstr "别在旁边打喷嚏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.2"
msgid "Bread, cake, cookies... I'm drooling."
msgstr "面包，蛋糕，饼干……我流口水了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm salad. Not a fan."
msgstr "热沙拉，不喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells green. Tastes greener."
msgstr "闻着很绿，吃着更绿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Done cooking. Now feed the sky."
msgstr "做好了，喂天去吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks edible. Shame it's not for me."
msgstr "看着能吃，可惜不是给我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.1"
msgid "It'll love this. Trust me."
msgstr "它会喜欢的，相信我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.2"
msgid "Perfect order. Like a cafeteria pro."
msgstr "点单正确，跟食堂大妈一样专业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.1"
msgid "Snack size won't fill that mouth."
msgstr "零食分量填不饱那张嘴。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.2"
msgid "Good idea, small plate. Shame."
msgstr "主意不错，盘子太小，可惜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.1"
msgid "Wrong order. It's gonna sulk."
msgstr "点错了，它要闹脾气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.2"
msgid "Nope, not the dish it asked for."
msgstr "不对，不是它点的那道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.1"
msgid "Charcoal. That's what this is now."
msgstr "现在就是一块炭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.2"
msgid "Oops. I wasn't watching."
msgstr "糟了，我没看着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.1"
msgid "Keeps vampires away. And friends too."
msgstr "吸血鬼会退散，朋友也会退散。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.2"
msgid "Strong smell. My breath will be stronger."
msgstr "味道很冲，我嘴里会更冲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft and sweet now. Who knew."
msgstr "现在又软又甜，没想到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.2"
msgid "Roasted garlic. Rice, please."
msgstr "烤蒜，来碗饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Garlic growing garlic. Nature's weird."
msgstr "大蒜长大蒜，大自然真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Bury it and wait. Easy."
msgstr "埋下去等着就行，简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.1"
msgid "Tiny goat. Okay, it's cute."
msgstr "小羊，好吧，挺可爱的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.2"
msgid "Don't chew my skirt."
msgstr "别嚼我的裙子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.1"
msgid "Milk before bed. Good idea."
msgstr "睡前一杯奶，好主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.2"
msgid "Fresh from the goat. Don't think about it."
msgstr "刚挤的羊奶，别多想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.1"
msgid "Strict mom vibes. Like mine."
msgstr "严厉妈妈的感觉，跟我妈一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.2"
msgid "Let's see what she's selling."
msgstr "看看她卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.1"
msgid "Smells like a summer festival."
msgstr "有夏日祭的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.2"
msgid "Flip it before it turns into charcoal."
msgstr "翻一下，不然要变炭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.1"
msgid "A grill in pieces. Assembly required."
msgstr "拆开的烤架，得自己装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Instructions? Nah, I'll wing it."
msgstr "说明书？不用，随便装。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.1"
msgid "Tiny grill, tiny meals."
msgstr "小烤架，小饭菜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.2"
msgid "Good for one skewer at a time."
msgstr "一次烤一串刚好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.1"
msgid "Portable barbecue. Picnic time."
msgstr "便携烧烤，野餐时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Light enough to carry with one finger."
msgstr "轻得用一根手指就能拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.1"
msgid "Farm work again. Wake me when it's done."
msgstr "又是农活，干完叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.2"
msgid "Could swing it like a bat. Probably shouldn't."
msgstr "能像球棒一样挥，最好别。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.1"
msgid "Keys mean locked doors. Great."
msgstr "有钥匙就有锁着的门，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.2"
msgid "Heavy old key. Don't drop it in the mud."
msgstr "又旧又沉的钥匙，别掉泥里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.1"
msgid "Finally, somewhere to sit and do nothing."
msgstr "总算有地方坐着发呆了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.2"
msgid "Park opens, nap begins."
msgstr "公园开门，午觉开始。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.1"
msgid "Nice and bright. Less spooky."
msgstr "亮堂堂的，没那么吓人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.2"
msgid "Could lean on it and wait for a bus."
msgstr "靠着它都能等公交了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.1"
msgid "Short lamp. Cute, actually."
msgstr "矮矮的灯，挺可爱的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.2"
msgid "Knee-high light. Don't trip over it."
msgstr "到膝盖的灯，别绊倒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.1"
msgid "Round and round. So boring."
msgstr "转啊转，好无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.2"
msgid "My arms are strong, so fine, I'll grind."
msgstr "我手劲大，行吧，我来磨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.1"
msgid "Smells like fish and attitude."
msgstr "一股鱼腥加臭脾气的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.2"
msgid "Wurt would probably like it here."
msgstr "沃特大概会喜欢这里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.1"
msgid "A merm with a shop. Fancy."
msgstr "鱼人还开店，挺洋气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.2"
msgid "Window shopping counts as rest, right?"
msgstr "光逛不买也算休息吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.1"
msgid "Prices are way too high."
msgstr "价格太高了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.2"
msgid "Can I pay with naps?"
msgstr "能拿午觉付钱吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.1"
msgid "Mushroom soup, here I come."
msgstr "蘑菇汤，我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.2"
msgid "Picked fresh. Smells like rain."
msgstr "刚采的，有雨的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Free food on a log. Nice."
msgstr "木头上长免费食物，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pick them before someone else does."
msgstr "趁别人没来先摘。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.1"
msgid "Empty stump. Come back later."
msgstr "空树桩，晚点再来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.2"
msgid "Somebody was hungry. Me, probably."
msgstr "有人很饿，大概是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.1"
msgid "Strong smell. Stronger tears."
msgstr "味道冲，眼泪更冲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.2"
msgid "Layers on layers. Like my excuses."
msgstr "一层又一层，跟我的借口一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.1"
msgid "Sweet now. The onion grew up."
msgstr "现在甜了，洋葱长大了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Caramelized. Very fancy."
msgstr "焦糖化了，很高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.1"
msgid "More onions, more crying. Great."
msgstr "洋葱越多，哭得越多，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Into the dirt. Grow fast."
msgstr "进土里去，快长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.1"
msgid "Warm in here. Could nap next to it."
msgstr "这里暖和，能挨着睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.2"
msgid "Bakes slow. Like my mornings."
msgstr "烤得慢，跟我的早上一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.1"
msgid "Some assembly. Lots of complaining."
msgstr "组装一点点，抱怨一大堆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.2"
msgid "Heavy oven parts? Easy for me."
msgstr "沉的炉子零件？对我来说简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.1"
msgid "Pointy fence. Not for climbing."
msgstr "尖尖的栏杆，别想爬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.2"
msgid "Like the school gate after curfew."
msgstr "像门禁后的校门。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.1"
msgid "Peaceful. Makes me want to sleep."
msgstr "好安静，让我想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.2"
msgid "Somebody should dust her off."
msgstr "该有人给她掸掸灰了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.1"
msgid "Did it just blink?"
msgstr "它刚才眨眼了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.2"
msgid "Too real. I'm keeping my distance."
msgstr "太逼真了，我离远点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.1"
msgid "Dry fountain. I wanted to toss a coin."
msgstr "干了的喷泉，我还想扔个硬币呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.2"
msgid "Pigeons would've loved this place."
msgstr "鸽子肯定会喜欢这里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Gate's open. Let's go."
msgstr "门开了，走吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Finally unlocked. Took long enough."
msgstr "总算开了，真够久的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "My bat says it could open this faster."
msgstr "我的球棒说它开得更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "Locked gates are just walls with an attitude."
msgstr "锁着的门就是脾气差的墙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.1"
msgid "Reading it would feel like homework anyway."
msgstr "反正读了也跟写作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.2"
msgid "Tall, gray, and says nothing. Like my homeroom teacher."
msgstr "又高又灰还不说话，跟班主任一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.1"
msgid "Fancy jar. Probably no snacks inside."
msgstr "挺讲究的罐子，里面估计没零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.2"
msgid "One bump and I'm paying for it, right?"
msgstr "碰一下就得我赔吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.1"
msgid "Hey, rocks aren't supposed to have legs."
msgstr "喂，石头不该长腿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.2"
msgid "Skipping class like me, huh, little rock?"
msgstr "小石头，你也跟我一样逃课啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.1"
msgid "Guess that's dinner now."
msgstr "这下算是晚饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.2"
msgid "Sorry, bird. Nothing personal."
msgstr "抱歉了鸟，不是针对你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Walking around like it owns the place."
msgstr "走得跟这里是它家似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Plump. Not that I'm thinking about lunch."
msgstr "挺肥的。我可没在想午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Napping in the open? Respect."
msgstr "光天化日睡大觉？佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Lucky. I want to sleep too."
msgstr "真好，我也想睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.1"
msgid "Shiny. The gods better appreciate this."
msgstr "亮闪闪的，神明最好懂得欣赏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.2"
msgid "Too fancy for me. I eat out of the pot."
msgstr "太讲究了，我直接对着锅吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.1"
msgid "Saltier than my mood on Mondays."
msgstr "比我周一的心情还咸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.2"
msgid "Fish in there must be pre-seasoned."
msgstr "里面的鱼应该自带调味了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.1"
msgid "Can't it just drop me at home for once?"
msgstr "就不能直接把我送回家一次吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Where's this one dumping us now?"
msgstr "这次又要把我们扔哪去？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.1"
msgid "Please be the key to home, not more chores."
msgstr "拜托是回家的钥匙，别再是新差事了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.2"
msgid "Lose this and we're stuck cooking forever."
msgstr "弄丢了就得一直在这做饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.1"
msgid "Big pot means big leftovers. For me."
msgstr "锅大剩得多，都归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.2"
msgid "Heavy. Good thing I'm strong."
msgstr "挺沉的，还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.1"
msgid "Potatoes never let me down."
msgstr "土豆从来不会让我失望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.2"
msgid "Looks like a rock I'd actually eat."
msgstr "长得像块我真会吃的石头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Fluffy inside. Okay, I'm hungry now."
msgstr "里面松松软软的，好了，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Just one bite. For quality control."
msgstr "就咬一口，算质检。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Waiting for potatoes is torture."
msgstr "等土豆长出来简直是折磨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Grow faster. I'm starving here."
msgstr "快点长，我饿着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.1"
msgid "Better than holding the pot myself."
msgstr "总比我自己举着锅强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.2"
msgid "If it falls, I'm not cleaning up."
msgstr "要是掉了我可不收拾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.1"
msgid "Assembly required. Ugh."
msgstr "还得自己组装，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.2"
msgid "Some sticks and a hook. Easy enough."
msgstr "几根棍子加个钩子，不难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.1"
msgid "Cute pot. Barely fits one meal for me."
msgstr "小锅挺可爱，刚够我吃一顿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.2"
msgid "Less food, less dishes. Fine by me."
msgstr "饭少碗也少，我没意见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.1"
msgid "Sticky stuff. Hands off my uniform."
msgstr "黏糊糊的，别碰我制服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.2"
msgid "If I fall asleep, it burns. No pressure."
msgstr "我要是睡着了就糊了，没压力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.1"
msgid "Gross. Even I won't eat that."
msgstr "恶心，连我都不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.2"
msgid "Should've harvested it instead of napping."
msgstr "早知道别睡午觉，先收了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.1"
msgid "Two wheels and zero hope."
msgstr "两个轮子，零个希望。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.2"
msgid "Would've beat the school bell with this."
msgstr "有它我上学就不会迟到了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.1"
msgid "Somebody beat it up worse than I could."
msgstr "有人打得比我还狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.2"
msgid "No ride home today either."
msgstr "今天也没车回家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.1"
msgid "Big building, big mess."
msgstr "大房子，大烂摊子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.2"
msgid "Quiet here. Good spot for a nap, honestly."
msgstr "这里挺安静的，说实话适合睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.1"
msgid "No more warm dinners in this house."
msgstr "这家再也没有热饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.2"
msgid "Smoke's gone. People too, probably."
msgstr "烟没了，人估计也没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.1"
msgid "Another one down. This town had bad luck."
msgstr "又倒一根，这镇子运气真差。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.2"
msgid "Yep. Bricks everywhere."
msgstr "嗯，到处都是砖头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.1"
msgid "Can't be late if there's no clock."
msgstr "没有钟就不算迟到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.2"
msgid "Stuck at the same hour forever. Sounds like math class."
msgstr "永远卡在同一个钟点，跟数学课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.1"
msgid "Nobody's ringing the bell anymore. Nice."
msgstr "再也没人敲钟了，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.2"
msgid "Bet it used to wake everyone up. Annoying."
msgstr "以前肯定天天把人吵醒，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.1"
msgid "A door to nowhere. Great."
msgstr "一扇通往哪都不是的门，真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.2"
msgid "I was hoping for a snack counter."
msgstr "我还以为后面有零食柜台。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.1"
msgid "Now the sky's the ceiling."
msgstr "现在天就是天花板了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.2"
msgid "Guess the house gave up first."
msgstr "看来房子先放弃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Open now. Anything good in there?"
msgstr "开了，里面有好东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Hope it's snacks. Probably isn't."
msgstr "希望是零食。估计不是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I could just hit it really hard."
msgstr "我可以使劲砸一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "Keys, keys, always keys."
msgstr "钥匙钥匙，又是钥匙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.1"
msgid "Slippery. Stop flopping, I'm hungry."
msgstr "滑溜溜的，别扑腾了，我饿着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.2"
msgid "Sashimi would be faster, honestly."
msgstr "说实话直接做生鱼片更快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.1"
msgid "Smells too good. Can I steal a piece?"
msgstr "太香了，能偷吃一块吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.2"
msgid "Perfect pink. I'm impressed with myself."
msgstr "粉得刚好，我都佩服我自己。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.1"
msgid "A pinch. Not a fistful."
msgstr "一小撮，不是一大把。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.2"
msgid "Tiny white crystals of flavor."
msgstr "白白小小的，全是味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.1"
msgid "Licking it would be faster. Kidding."
msgstr "直接舔更快。开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.2"
msgid "Heavy rock, tiny amount of salt."
msgstr "石头挺沉，盐才一点点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Nothing yet. Wake me when it's done."
msgstr "还没好，好了叫醒我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Salt grows slower than my homework."
msgstr "长盐比我写作业还慢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.1"
msgid "Done already? Nice."
msgstr "已经好了？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.2"
msgid "Free salt. My favorite price."
msgstr "免费的盐，我最爱的价格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.1"
msgid "More stuff to carry around."
msgstr "又多一样要背的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.2"
msgid "Just stick it in the pond, right?"
msgstr "插进池子里就行吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.1"
msgid "Sticky. Don't let me lick my fingers."
msgstr "黏黏的，别让我舔手指。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.2"
msgid "Tree juice. Sounds healthier than it is."
msgstr "树汁，听着比实际健康。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.1"
msgid "A bucket that does the work for me. Perfect."
msgstr "替我干活的桶，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.2"
msgid "Like a drink machine, but slow."
msgstr "像自动售货机，就是慢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Bald little thing."
msgstr "秃秃的小东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Picked clean. Someone was hungry."
msgstr "被摘光了，有人挺饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.1"
msgid "Sour and gross. Toss it."
msgstr "又酸又恶心，扔了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.2"
msgid "Should've boiled it sooner. My bad."
msgstr "早该熬了，是我的错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "Gardening again? I'm not in the gardening club."
msgstr "又种地？我又不是园艺社的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "Mystery seeds. Hope they're snacks."
msgstr "神秘种子，希望长出零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.1"
msgid "Not my thing. I only hit stuff that hits back."
msgstr "这不是我的事，我只打会还手的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.2"
msgid "Nope. My bat's enough violence for me."
msgstr "算了，我有球棒就够暴力了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.1"
msgid "Sneezing in three, two..."
msgstr "三、二……要打喷嚏了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.2"
msgid "Sprinkle it on everything. That's my recipe."
msgstr "什么都撒点，这就是我的菜谱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Spotty bush. Did it catch something?"
msgstr "长斑的灌木，它生病了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks like it has freckles."
msgstr "看着像长了雀斑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left but sticks."
msgstr "只剩棍子了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.2"
msgid "Come back later, I guess."
msgstr "等会儿再来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.1"
msgid "Smells spicy. Makes me hungry."
msgstr "闻着挺冲，闻得我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.2"
msgid "Grinding is just smashing, but slower."
msgstr "磨碎就是慢慢砸碎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tree full of candy? Finally, a good tree."
msgstr "满肚子糖的树？终于有棵好树了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Tap it. Don't hug it. Okay, maybe hug it."
msgstr "接树液，别抱它。好吧，抱一下也行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.1"
msgid "Nobody's getting sweets from that now."
msgstr "这下谁也取不到甜的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.2"
msgid "Who chopped it? That was dessert."
msgstr "谁砍的？那可是甜点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.1"
msgid "Get lost, bugs. That sap is mine."
msgstr "虫子滚开，那是我的树液。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.2"
msgid "Even bugs have a sweet tooth."
msgstr "连虫子都爱吃甜的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing yet. Fine, I'll nap."
msgstr "还没东西，行，我去睡会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.2"
msgid "Hurry up, tree."
msgstr "树啊，快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.1"
msgid "Sweet. Literally."
msgstr "甜的，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.2"
msgid "Bucket's heavy. Lucky I'm strong."
msgstr "桶挺沉，还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.1"
msgid "Okay, okay, we'll stop tapping it."
msgstr "好好好，不接了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.2"
msgid "Poor thing's been drained dry."
msgstr "可怜，被抽干了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.1"
msgid "Fluffy pig. Does it ever get haircuts?"
msgstr "毛茸茸的猪，它从来不剪头发吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.2"
msgid "Looks warm. Smells like a swamp."
msgstr "看着挺暖和，闻着一股沼泽味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Granny pig. I'll be polite, promise."
msgstr "猪奶奶，我会有礼貌的，保证。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bet she has candy somewhere."
msgstr "她身上肯定藏着糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Napping on duty. I like her already."
msgstr "上班时间睡觉，我已经喜欢她了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Shh. Elders need their sleep."
msgstr "嘘，老人家要多睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.1"
msgid "Drafty. Like the gym in winter."
msgstr "四面漏风，跟冬天的体育馆一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.2"
msgid "Patchwork house for a patchwork town."
msgstr "东补西补的镇子，东补西补的房子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.1"
msgid "Flattened. Something stomped it."
msgstr "被压扁了，有东西踩过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.2"
msgid "Hope the pigs got out okay."
msgstr "希望猪们都跑出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.1"
msgid "Sugar in a jar. My kind of fuel."
msgstr "罐装的糖，我的燃料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.2"
msgid "One spoon for the gods, two for me."
msgstr "一勺给神明，两勺给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.1"
msgid "Juicy. Don't squeeze too hard, Shino."
msgstr "多汁的。志乃，别捏太用力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.2"
msgid "Could throw it, but that's a waste."
msgstr "可以拿来扔，不过太浪费了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft and warm. Bread would help."
msgstr "又软又热，配面包就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells like a cafeteria on a good day."
msgstr "闻着像食堂难得好吃的那天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tiny seeds, big hassle."
msgstr "种子小，麻烦大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Grow red and juicy. No pressure."
msgstr "长得又红又多汁，没压力啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.1"
msgid "Got anything good? I'm not paying full price."
msgstr "有好东西吗？我可不付原价。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.2"
msgid "Fish guy runs a shop. Weird day."
msgstr "鱼人开店，今天真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.1"
msgid "Discount for cute schoolgirls? No? Worth a try."
msgstr "可爱女学生打折吗？不打？试试也好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.2"
msgid "Everything here costs too many coins."
msgstr "这里什么都要好多硬币。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.1"
msgid "Plain. Like an eraser you can eat."
msgstr "平平无奇，像能吃的橡皮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.2"
msgid "Crunchy. Not exciting."
msgstr "脆的，不刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Mushy now. Kind of comforting."
msgstr "软塌塌的，还挺治愈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.2"
msgid "It's food. That's all I ask."
msgstr "能吃就行，我只要求这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Turnips. Thrilling."
msgstr "萝卜啊，真刺激。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Plant and sleep. Best kind of farming."
msgstr "种完就睡，最棒的种地方式。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.1"
msgid "Bread someday. Carbs, my friend."
msgstr "总有一天变面包，碳水是我朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.2"
msgid "Grinding sounds like effort. Who's doing it?"
msgstr "磨粉听着就累，谁来干？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Bread starts here. Painfully slowly."
msgstr "面包从这开始，慢得要命。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Grow up quick, little wheat."
msgstr "小麦，快快长大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.1"
msgid "Fancy torch. Somebody important owns it."
msgstr "挺讲究的火把，主人肯定来头不小。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.2"
msgid "Bet it doesn't go out in the rain."
msgstr "下雨估计也不会灭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.1"
msgid "Bunny ears on a delinquent? Nobody laugh."
msgstr "不良少女戴兔耳？谁也不许笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.2"
msgid "Fluffy. Sorry, little guy."
msgstr "毛茸茸的。对不起啊，小家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.1"
msgid "Toot it once and see what hops over."
msgstr "吹一下看看什么蹦过来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.2"
msgid "Calling a king with a horn. Bold."
msgstr "拿个号角叫国王，胆子真大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.1"
msgid "A rabbit-themed box. Cute, I guess."
msgstr "兔子主题的箱子，算是可爱吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.2"
msgid "Bet there's carrots in there somewhere."
msgstr "里面肯定藏着胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "Bodyguards? You guys look like mascots."
msgstr "保镖？你们看着像吉祥物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "Line up nicely and I'll bat you one by one."
msgstr "排好队，我一个一个打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.1"
msgid "Pointy. Not as fun as a bat."
msgstr "尖尖的，没球棒好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.2"
msgid "A carrot on a stick, but violent."
msgstr "像插在棍子上的胡萝卜，就是凶点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1"
msgid "Big ears, bad attitude."
msgstr "耳朵大，脾气也大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2"
msgid "Fine. You want a fight, you got one."
msgstr "行啊，想打就打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.1"
msgid "Lucky bunny? Mine now."
msgstr "幸运兔子？归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.2"
msgid "Shiny rabbit. Something good drops, right?"
msgstr "闪闪发光的兔子，会掉好东西吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1"
msgid "Polite king. Rare."
msgstr "有礼貌的国王，少见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2"
msgid "Hi, Your Fluffiness. Got anything to trade?"
msgstr "你好，毛茸茸陛下，有东西换吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.1"
msgid "Louis keeps showing it off. I get it, it's cool."
msgstr "路易斯老拿出来炫，知道了，很帅行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.2"
msgid "Lightning sword? My bat feels a little jealous."
msgstr "闪电刀？我的球棒有点嫉妒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.1"
msgid "Veggies in a pot. Healthy and boring."
msgstr "一锅蔬菜，健康又无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.2"
msgid "Where's the meat? I can't find any meat."
msgstr "肉呢？我一块肉都找不到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.1"
msgid "Jazzy cards music. I'd still lose."
msgstr "爵士味的打牌曲，我照样会输。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.2"
msgid "Makes me want to bet my snacks."
msgstr "听得我想拿零食当赌注。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.1"
msgid "Turn it off. It's creepy."
msgstr "关掉吧，太瘆人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.2"
msgid "Wendy would love this one."
msgstr "温蒂肯定喜欢这首。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.1"
msgid "Heart's racing. Is something coming?"
msgstr "心跳好快，有东西要来了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.2"
msgid "Perfect background for swinging a bat."
msgstr "挥球棒正好配这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.1"
msgid "Morning music. Five more minutes, please."
msgstr "早晨的曲子。再睡五分钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.2"
msgid "Sounds like an alarm I'd actually tolerate."
msgstr "像个我能忍受的闹钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.1"
msgid "Kind of funky. I'll allow it."
msgstr "有点带劲，准了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.2"
msgid "Weird beat. My foot's tapping anyway."
msgstr "节奏好怪，我脚还是跟着打拍子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.1"
msgid "Sunset music. Time to go home. If only."
msgstr "夕阳曲，该回家了。要是能回就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.2"
msgid "Feels like after-school on the rooftop."
msgstr "像放学后待在天台上的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.1"
msgid "Is it art? Is it noise? Who knows."
msgstr "是艺术？是噪音？谁知道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.2"
msgid "Maybe Wes gets it. He won't tell me."
msgstr "韦斯也许听得懂，可他不会说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.1"
msgid "Sounds like credits rolling. Can I go home?"
msgstr "听着像片尾字幕，我能回家了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.2"
msgid "Kind of sad. Don't look at me."
msgstr "有点伤感。别看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.1"
msgid "Spooky tune. Got any candy to go with it?"
msgstr "阴森的调子，配糖果吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.2"
msgid "Webber's probably dancing to this."
msgstr "韦伯估计正跟着跳呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.1"
msgid "This again? It's stuck in my head."
msgstr "又是这首？已经在我脑子里循环了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.2"
msgid "Classic. Like the school anthem, but better."
msgstr "经典，像校歌，但好听多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.1"
msgid "Work music? Hard pass."
msgstr "干活的曲子？免了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.2"
msgid "Catchy. Still not chopping trees."
msgstr "挺上头的，但我还是不砍树。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.1"
msgid "Like a hand warmer, but fancy."
msgstr "像暖宝宝，就是贵点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.2"
msgid "Red and pretty. Willow would steal it."
msgstr "红红的挺好看，薇洛会偷走的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.1"
msgid "Glowing red marker. Hard to miss."
msgstr "会发红光的标记，想看不到都难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.2"
msgid "Like a stoplight in the woods."
msgstr "像树林里的红灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.1"
msgid "Lucky envelope! Please be a lot."
msgstr "红包！拜托多一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.2"
msgid "Money? I can buy snacks with this, right?"
msgstr "钱？能拿来买零食吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Cooked poison is still poison, probably."
msgstr "煮熟的毒也还是毒吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells fine. Stomach says no."
msgstr "闻着还行，肚子说不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.1"
msgid "Old furniture. Nicer than my desk."
msgstr "老家具，比我的课桌强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.2"
msgid "Antiques. Don't make me carry them."
msgstr "古董，别让我搬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.1"
msgid "Second chances. Don't waste mine."
msgstr "第二次机会，别浪费我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.2"
msgid "Weird rock that brings you back. Handy."
msgstr "能把人拉回来的怪石头，挺方便。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.1"
msgid "Big horn, small brain."
msgstr "角很大，脑子很小。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.2"
msgid "Show-off. Hit it where it hurts."
msgstr "爱现的家伙，往它痛处打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.1"
msgid "Real meat! A whole bird! Mine."
msgstr "真肉！一整只！我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.2"
msgid "Drumstick first. Don't argue."
msgstr "先吃鸡腿，别跟我抢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Who designs beefalo outfits with gears?"
msgstr "谁会给牛设计带齿轮的衣服？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Blueprints make my head hurt."
msgstr "看图纸我就头疼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Stuck in there? Hang on, I'll break it."
msgstr "被困住了？等着，我砸开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.2"
msgid "Poor things. Somebody let them out already."
msgstr "真可怜，谁快把他们放出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.1"
msgid "Big rock. Bat versus rock, round one."
msgstr "大石头。球棒对石头，第一回合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.2"
msgid "Plain old rock. Still better than school."
msgstr "普通石头，还是比上学强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.1"
msgid "Melting a little? Serves you right."
msgstr "有点化了？活该。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.2"
msgid "Hurts, huh? Now's my chance."
msgstr "疼吧？轮到我出手了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.1"
msgid "Hiding in its shell like a kid skipping class."
msgstr "缩进壳里，像逃课的小孩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.2"
msgid "Wait it out. I'll take a breather."
msgstr "等它出来，我先歇会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Giant rock lobster. Is it all-you-can-eat?"
msgstr "巨型石虾，能敞开吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Rocky and grumpy. Kind of like me in the morning."
msgstr "又硬又凶，跟早上的我差不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Shadow version? It's like a harder retake exam."
msgstr "暗影版？跟更难的补考一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Dark and crabby. My least favorite combo."
msgstr "又黑又暴躁，我最讨厌的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.1"
msgid "Totally worn out. I know the feeling."
msgstr "彻底累垮了，我懂这种感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.2"
msgid "Needs fertilizer. Or a really long nap."
msgstr "得施肥，或者好好睡一大觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "Hey! Those were my snacks!"
msgstr "喂！那是我的零食！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Willow, was that you again?"
msgstr "薇洛，又是你干的吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Poor bush. Should dig it up before it spreads."
msgstr "可怜的灌木，趁没传开挖掉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Gray and droopy. No more stone fruit from you."
msgstr "又灰又蔫，以后别想结石果了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Something's off. Looks like it caught a cold."
msgstr "有点不对劲，像是感冒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Hang in there. Don't skip out on me."
msgstr "撑住啊，别给我掉链子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fruit made of rock. Who approved that?"
msgstr "石头做的果子，谁批准的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Stone fruit bush. My teeth are already scared."
msgstr "石果灌木，我的牙已经在发抖了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "Empty. Somebody beat me to it."
msgstr "空了，被人抢先了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "Nothing left but leaves. Leaves aren't lunch."
msgstr "只剩叶子了，叶子可不是午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.1"
msgid "Drooping in the heat. Same, buddy."
msgstr "热得蔫了。我也是，兄弟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.2"
msgid "Needs a parasol. Or summer vacation."
msgstr "要把遮阳伞，或者放个暑假。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.1"
msgid "Hard as a rock. Because it basically is one."
msgstr "硬得跟石头一样，因为它基本就是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.2"
msgid "Maybe my bat can crack it. Batter up."
msgstr "也许球棒能敲开。准备击球。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.1"
msgid "Cracked open. Smells kind of nice, actually."
msgstr "敲开了，闻着居然还挺香。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.2"
msgid "So much work for one little fruit."
msgstr "为一个小果子费这么大劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.1"
msgid "Creamy. Way better than biting rocks."
msgstr "滑溜溜的，比啃石头强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Worth the effort. Barely."
msgstr "值得费这个劲。勉强吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.1"
msgid "A baby rock tree. Grow up tough, kid."
msgstr "石头树宝宝，长得结实点啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.2"
msgid "Plant it and forget about it. My specialty."
msgstr "种下就忘，我的拿手好戏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Free shaved ice, if I had syrup."
msgstr "要是有糖浆，就是免费刨冰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bat versus glacier. I like my odds."
msgstr "球棒对冰川，我觉得我能赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.1"
msgid "Just a puddle now. Summer's a thief."
msgstr "只剩一滩水了，夏天是小偷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.2"
msgid "Gone. Should've grabbed some earlier."
msgstr "没了，早该先敲点的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.1"
msgid "Puddle. Not even a cold one."
msgstr "一滩水，连凉都不凉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.2"
msgid "Summer ate my shaved ice."
msgstr "夏天把我的刨冰吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Glowing hot. Like a giant stove nobody turned off."
msgstr "烫得发光，像没人关的大炉子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nice light. Just don't trip in."
msgstr "光挺亮的，别掉进去就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.1"
msgid "Getting dimmer. Like me after lunch."
msgstr "越来越暗了，跟我午饭后一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.2"
msgid "Cooling off. Bring a light soon."
msgstr "在冷却了，得赶紧备好光源。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "Toasty. Could nap right here."
msgstr "暖烘烘的，就在这睡一觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Lava campfire. No marshmallows though."
msgstr "熔岩篝火，可惜没有棉花糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.1"
msgid "Dark now. Bring your own light."
msgstr "暗下来了，自带光源吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.2"
msgid "Cold and crusty. Like day-old rice."
msgstr "又冷又硬，像隔夜饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.1"
msgid "Moon rock. Looks pretty normal, honestly."
msgstr "月岩，说实话看着挺普通。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.2"
msgid "The sky threw this at us? Rude."
msgstr "天上扔下来砸我们的？没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.1"
msgid "Stone tree. Pickaxe time, I guess."
msgstr "石头树，该换镐了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.2"
msgid "Got scared stiff. Literally."
msgstr "吓僵了，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.1"
msgid "Old stone stump. Very quiet. I like it."
msgstr "老石头桩子，很安静，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.2"
msgid "Looks like a museum exhibit nobody visits."
msgstr "像没人看的博物馆展品。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.1"
msgid "Big round charger. Sidestep, then smack."
msgstr "圆滚滚的冲锋家伙，闪开再揍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.2"
msgid "Clockwork bull. Olé, I guess."
msgstr "发条斗牛，那就来吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "Rusty and angry. Worst combo."
msgstr "生锈又暴躁，最差组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "Leaking shadows everywhere. Gross."
msgstr "到处漏暗影，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Ugh! That smell is a crime!"
msgstr "呃！这味道简直犯罪！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Perfect for throwing. At someone else."
msgstr "正适合扔。扔别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.1"
msgid "Queen bee's dessert. Mine now."
msgstr "蜂后的甜点，现在归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.2"
msgid "Tastes amazing. Worth every sting."
msgstr "好吃到爆，被蛰也值了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.1"
msgid "Pieces everywhere. Not my fault this time."
msgstr "到处是碎块，这次真不是我干的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.2"
msgid "Old ruins, older dust."
msgstr "老遗迹，更老的灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.1"
msgid "More rubble. Who keeps breaking these?"
msgstr "又一堆碎石，谁老弄坏这些？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.2"
msgid "Cracked. Give me rocks and I'll fix it."
msgstr "裂开了，给我石头我来修。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Ancient box. Bossy, too."
msgstr "古老的箱子，还很霸道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Like a vending machine that judges you."
msgstr "像会审视你的自动售货机。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.1"
msgid "Closed tight. It's thinking. Slowly."
msgstr "关得死死的，在想呢，慢慢想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.2"
msgid "Judging my offering, huh? Rude."
msgstr "在评我的贡品？真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.1"
msgid "Spicy! Way too spicy!"
msgstr "辣！太辣了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.2"
msgid "Chips? Where are the chips?"
msgstr "薯片呢？薯片在哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.1"
msgid "Salty rock. Don't lick it, Shino."
msgstr "咸石头。志乃，别舔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.2"
msgid "Seasoning in rock form. Heavy seasoning."
msgstr "石头形状的调料，很重的调料。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Free salt in the ocean? Nice."
msgstr "海上有免费的盐？不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Weird white tower. Looks like a giant sugar cube."
msgstr "奇怪的白塔，像个巨型方糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.1"
msgid "Slowly coming back. Take your time."
msgstr "慢慢长回来了，不急。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.2"
msgid "Growing slower than my grades."
msgstr "长得比我的成绩还慢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.1"
msgid "Done. Nothing left to whack."
msgstr "没了，没东西可敲了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.2"
msgid "Come back later for more."
msgstr "晚点再来拿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.1"
msgid "Sniffing around for fish again?"
msgstr "又在嗅鱼吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.2"
msgid "Soggy pup. Want a pat? Fine, just one."
msgstr "湿漉漉的小狗，要摸？行，就一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.1"
msgid "Smells like the sea. Not bad."
msgstr "有股海的味道，还行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.2"
msgid "Comfy. Don't tell anyone I like it."
msgstr "挺舒服的，别跟人说我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.1"
msgid "Wall of sand? Seriously?"
msgstr "沙墙？认真的吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.2"
msgid "Antlion's throwing a tantrum again, huh?"
msgstr "蚁狮又在耍脾气了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.1"
msgid "Ouch! Sand isn't supposed to be pointy!"
msgstr "哎哟！沙子不该是尖的吧！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.2"
msgid "Spiky sand. Watch your step."
msgstr "带刺的沙子，小心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Shadow wall. Nope."
msgstr "暗影墙，不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Freaky. Let's go around."
msgstr "怪吓人的，绕路吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "Sunk into the ground. Weird."
msgstr "沉到地下去了，好怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "Just a stump now. Safe enough to walk over."
msgstr "现在只是个桩子，踩过去也没事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.1"
msgid "Robot homework. Not mine, thankfully."
msgstr "机器人的作业，还好不是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.2"
msgid "WX scanned this? Total nerd."
msgstr "WX扫描的？十足书呆子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.1"
msgid "Burnt bones. Somebody stood too close to the fire."
msgstr "烧焦的骨头，有人离火太近了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.2"
msgid "Yikes. Poor person."
msgstr "天哪，可怜的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.1"
msgid "Notes! At least it's not homework."
msgstr "笔记！至少不是作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.2"
msgid "Someone's diary? I won't peek. Much."
msgstr "谁的日记？我不偷看。就看一点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.1"
msgid "Junk helmet. Kind of cool, actually."
msgstr "破烂头盔，其实有点酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.2"
msgid "Scrap metal on my head. Clunky but safe."
msgstr "废铁顶在头上，笨重但安全。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.1"
msgid "Monocle? I'm not a detective."
msgstr "单片眼镜？我又不是侦探。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.2"
msgid "Looks smart. Doesn't make me smart."
msgstr "看着聪明，又不会让我变聪明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.1"
msgid "Old statue under all that marble. Kinda creepy."
msgstr "大理石里裹着的老雕像，有点吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.2"
msgid "Dusty old thing. Somebody chip it out."
msgstr "满是灰的老东西，谁来凿出来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED.1"
msgid "Whole again. Something feels off, though."
msgstr "又完整了，不过感觉不太对。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.FINISHED.2"
msgid "Complete. Hope it stays still."
msgstr "拼完了，希望它别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY.1"
msgid "Uh-oh. Bat time."
msgstr "不妙，球棒时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.READY.2"
msgid "Get ready, it's waking up."
msgstr "准备好，它要醒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED.1"
msgid "Missing its head. Rough day."
msgstr "没了脑袋，挺惨的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.UNCOVERED.2"
msgid "Incomplete. Like my homework."
msgstr "不完整，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD.1"
msgid "Heavy head. Good thing I'm strong."
msgstr "好沉的脑袋，还好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPHEAD.2"
msgid "Statue head. Where's your body, buddy?"
msgstr "雕像的头，你身体呢，兄弟？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED.1"
msgid "Old knight statue buried in marble."
msgstr "埋在大理石里的老骑士雕像。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.COVERED.2"
msgid "Mysterious lump. Kinda cool."
msgstr "神秘的大块头，有点酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED.1"
msgid "Done. Hope nothing pops out."
msgstr "好了，希望别跳出东西来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.FINISHED.2"
msgid "Knight's back together. Good horsey."
msgstr "骑士拼好了，乖马儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY.1"
msgid "Uh oh. The horse statue just twitched."
msgstr "糟了，这匹石马刚抽了一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.READY.2"
msgid "Bat's ready. Whenever you are, horsey."
msgstr "球棒准备好了，小马，随时奉陪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED.1"
msgid "Somebody lost their head. Literally."
msgstr "有人把头弄丢了，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTBODY.UNCOVERED.2"
msgid "Great, a scavenger hunt for a horse head."
msgstr "好嘛，又要满地找马头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD.1"
msgid "Carrying a horse head across the map. Normal day."
msgstr "抱着马头横穿地图，日常而已。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_KNIGHTHEAD.2"
msgid "Heavy. Whose head is this, and why me?"
msgstr "好沉。这是谁的头，凭什么我来扛？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED.1"
msgid "More marble chipping. My arms aren't a pickaxe."
msgstr "又要凿大理石，我的手又不是镐子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.COVERED.2"
msgid "Something big is hiding under there."
msgstr "底下藏着个大家伙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED.1"
msgid "Done. Now nobody touch it."
msgstr "弄好了，谁都别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.FINISHED.2"
msgid "Looks like a castle piece from a giant's chess set."
msgstr "像巨人下棋用的城堡棋子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY.1"
msgid "That thing charges. Step aside."
msgstr "那玩意儿会冲撞，闪开点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.READY.2"
msgid "Yep, it's waking up. I wanted a nap, not this."
msgstr "嗯，醒了。我想要的是午睡，不是这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED.1"
msgid "Where's the rest of it? Under a rock somewhere?"
msgstr "剩下的呢？压在哪块石头底下？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKBODY.UNCOVERED.2"
msgid "Missing a nose. Kinda tragic."
msgstr "少了个鼻子，有点惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE.1"
msgid "Who needs a nose this big?"
msgstr "谁需要这么大的鼻子啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_ROOKNOSE.2"
msgid "Lifting this counts as my workout for the week."
msgstr "搬这个就算我这周的锻炼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.1"
msgid "Thick, hot, full of fish. Perfect."
msgstr "又稠又烫，满满的鱼，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.2"
msgid "Gimme a spoon. No, a bigger one."
msgstr "给我勺子。不，要大的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.1"
msgid "Rocks in the ocean. Who put these here?"
msgstr "海里竖着石头，谁放这儿的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.2"
msgid "Could whack it for rocks, I guess."
msgstr "敲一敲大概能出石头吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.1"
msgid "A cage with nothing in it. Like my lunchbox at noon."
msgstr "空笼子，跟我中午的饭盒一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.2"
msgid "Looks like it's waiting for something glowy."
msgstr "看着像在等什么会发光的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.1"
msgid "Caught it. Don't escape now, little guy."
msgstr "抓到了，小家伙别跑啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.2"
msgid "Buzzing in there like it's mad at me."
msgstr "在里面嗡嗡响，好像在生我的气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.1"
msgid "Roasted seeds. Tastes like a movie theater, sort of."
msgstr "烤种子，有点像电影院零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.2"
msgid "Gone in one bite. Still hungry."
msgstr "一口就没了，还是饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.1"
msgid "Nope. I'm not joining in."
msgstr "不了，我才不跟着跳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.2"
msgid "Worse than the school festival dance practice."
msgstr "比校庆舞蹈排练还难看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.1"
msgid "Keep digging. I'll supervise from over here."
msgstr "继续挖，我在这边监督。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.2"
msgid "Finally, a classmate who does the group work."
msgstr "总算有个肯干小组作业的同学了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.1"
msgid "Creepy. Put it back, Maxwell."
msgstr "瘆得慌。麦斯威尔，放回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.2"
msgid "Thump, thump. I really don't like that sound."
msgstr "咚、咚……我真不喜欢这声音。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.1"
msgid "If I drop my bat in there, it's gone forever."
msgstr "球棒掉进去就再也找不回来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Huge hole in the ground. Who's filling that?"
msgstr "地上这么大个洞，谁来填？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.1"
msgid "How many segments does this thing have?"
msgstr "这东西到底有多少节？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.2"
msgid "Hit the body, it just keeps coming. Annoying."
msgstr "打身子它还在爬，烦死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.1"
msgid "Belly up! Batter up!"
msgstr "肚子朝天！该我挥棒了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.2"
msgid "Now. Before it rolls back over."
msgstr "就现在，趁它还没翻回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.1"
msgid "That's the end with teeth. Avoid it."
msgstr "带牙的那头，躲开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.2"
msgid "Aim for the head. Probably. I think."
msgstr "打头。大概吧，我觉得。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.1"
msgid "Hands everywhere. Worse than a crowded train."
msgstr "到处是手，比挤电车还糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.2"
msgid "No touching. I bite. Well, I bat."
msgstr "不许碰。我会咬人的，好吧，是会挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.1"
msgid "Big horns, small brain. I know the type."
msgstr "角很大，脑子很小，这种我见多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.2"
msgid "Want to fight? Fine. Make it quick."
msgstr "想打？行，速战速决。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.1"
msgid "Brush your teeth before you come at me."
msgstr "冲过来之前先刷个牙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.2"
msgid "All mouth, no manners."
msgstr "光有张嘴，一点礼貌都没有。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.1"
msgid "I'm not a hat stand. Get lost."
msgstr "我不是帽架，滚开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.2"
msgid "Those poor guys are wearing it like a helmet. Gross."
msgstr "那些家伙被它当头盔戴着，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.1"
msgid "Get down here and fight fair."
msgstr "下来，堂堂正正打一场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.2"
msgid "Flapping around like a giant shadow moth."
msgstr "扑腾得像只巨大的影子飞蛾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.1"
msgid "Smithing with nightmares. Sure. Why not."
msgstr "拿噩梦打铁，行吧，有何不可。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.2"
msgid "Smells like burnt homework in here."
msgstr "这里一股烧焦作业的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.1"
msgid "It's pulsing in my hand. Nope."
msgstr "在我手里一跳一跳的，不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.2"
msgid "Gross veins. Somebody else carry this."
msgstr "全是血管，换个人拿吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.1"
msgid "Somebody's down there. Let them rest."
msgstr "底下有人，让人家好好歇着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.2"
msgid "A free shovel's worth of trouble."
msgstr "铲一下就能惹一身麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.1"
msgid "Big teeth. Bigger attitude."
msgstr "牙大，脾气更大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.2"
msgid "If it bites the boat, I'm swimming home. Wait, no."
msgstr "它要是咬船，我就游回去。等等，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.1"
msgid "A shark on ice. Now I've seen everything."
msgstr "冰上的鲨鱼，这下我什么都见过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.2"
msgid "Stop sliding at me! I'll swing!"
msgstr "别冲我滑过来！我要挥棒了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.1"
msgid "One good whack should do it."
msgstr "狠狠敲一下就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.2"
msgid "Seashells packed together like a school bento."
msgstr "贝壳挤成一团，像学校的便当。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.1"
msgid "A shield with teeth. Who designed this?"
msgstr "长牙的盾牌，谁设计的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.2"
msgid "Good boy. Chew on the bad guys, not me."
msgstr "乖，去咬坏人，别咬我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.1"
msgid "Bamboo sword. Doesn't hurt much, which is boring."
msgstr "竹刀，打人不怎么疼，真没劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.2"
msgid "Louis would probably make this look cool."
msgstr "路易丝拿着大概会很帅吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.1"
msgid "No guard on this? That's asking for trouble."
msgstr "连护手都没有？这是自找麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.2"
msgid "Plain wooden case. Scary sharp inside."
msgstr "朴素的木鞘，里面却锋利得吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.1"
msgid "Five more minutes... no, wait, it's the mushroom."
msgstr "再睡五分钟……不对，是蘑菇的问题。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.2"
msgid "Perfect for luring things. And me, apparently."
msgstr "拿来引诱东西正好，看来也能引诱我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.1"
msgid "Who puts mushrooms in dessert?"
msgstr "谁会往甜点里放蘑菇啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.2"
msgid "I'll eat it anyway. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "我还是会吃的，别告诉别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.1"
msgid "Warty and squishy. Like a toad's raincoat."
msgstr "又疙瘩又软，像癞蛤蟆的雨衣。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.2"
msgid "Toadstool's leftovers. Still kinda damp."
msgstr "毒菌蟾蜍剩下的，还有点潮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wait. Watch first, swing later."
msgstr "等等，先看清楚再挥棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "What is that thing even doing?"
msgstr "那东西到底在干嘛？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.1"
msgid "There! Smack the eyeball!"
msgstr "那里！照眼珠子打！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.2"
msgid "Got you now, puddle face."
msgstr "这下逮到你了，水坑脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.1"
msgid "Pretty blade. Feels a little cursed, though."
msgstr "刀很好看，就是感觉有点邪门。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.2"
msgid "Even I can tell this one's special."
msgstr "连我都看得出这把不一般。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bwoom. Sounds like my stomach."
msgstr "嗡……跟我肚子叫一个声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Deep and lazy. I like this one."
msgstr "低沉又慵懒，我喜欢这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Middle note. Very average. Like my grades."
msgstr "中间音，很普通，跟我的成绩一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Plink. Okay, that's kind of fun."
msgstr "叮。好吧，还挺好玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Shrill. Like the bell before a test."
msgstr "尖得像考试前的铃声。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Ow. Who needs a shell this squeaky?"
msgstr "哎哟，谁要这么尖的贝壳？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.1"
msgid "Poor guy. Should've brought snacks."
msgstr "可怜的家伙，早该带点零食的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.2"
msgid "Not gonna end up like that. Too lazy to die."
msgstr "我才不会变成那样，懒得死。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.1"
msgid "A skull helmet. Very delinquent of me."
msgstr "骷髅头盔，这下真像不良少女了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.2"
msgid "Shadows everywhere when I put this on. Hard pass."
msgstr "一戴上满眼都是影子，算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.1"
msgid "Some animal didn't make it."
msgstr "某只动物没撑过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.2"
msgid "Weird bones. Not touching them."
msgstr "奇怪的骨头，我才不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.1"
msgid "A sculpting guide? Art class all over again."
msgstr "雕塑图纸？又回到美术课了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.2"
msgid "Pretty drawing. I'll make it lumpy, guaranteed."
msgstr "图画得挺好，我做出来保证坑坑洼洼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.1"
msgid "A chest with a skull on it. Totally fine."
msgstr "箱子上有个骷髅头，完全没问题呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.2"
msgid "Open it. You first."
msgstr "打开吧，你先来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.1"
msgid "Did that rubber band just move?"
msgstr "那根皮筋刚才动了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.2"
msgid "Walter, I think your band is alive."
msgstr "沃尔特，你的皮筋好像是活的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.1"
msgid "A slingshot with gears. Walter, calm down."
msgstr "带齿轮的弹弓，沃尔特，冷静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.2"
msgid "Looks expensive. I'd just throw rocks."
msgstr "看着就贵，我直接扔石头算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.1"
msgid "Get off! I'm not your hat!"
msgstr "下去！我不是你的帽子！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.2"
msgid "A walking lightbulb with a big mouth."
msgstr "长了张大嘴的会走的灯泡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.1"
msgid "Soft. Weirdly nice to pet."
msgstr "软软的，摸起来意外舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.2"
msgid "Could make a scarf. A weird scarf."
msgstr "能做条围巾，很怪的围巾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.1"
msgid "Smells like cave. Wash it first."
msgstr "一股洞穴味，先洗洗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.2"
msgid "Fluffy pelt from a hat monster."
msgstr "从帽子怪身上剥的毛皮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.1"
msgid "Wearing a snail. Safe, but sticky."
msgstr "顶着个蜗牛壳，安全是安全，就是黏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.2"
msgid "My head's protected. My dignity isn't."
msgstr "脑袋保住了，面子没保住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.1"
msgid "Smells like slime and bad decisions."
msgstr "一股黏液和错误决定的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.2"
msgid "Don't set it on fire. It goes boom."
msgstr "别点火，它会炸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.1"
msgid "Explosive goo. Don't keep it in your pocket."
msgstr "会爆炸的黏液，别塞兜里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.2"
msgid "Ew, it's sticking to my fingers."
msgstr "咦，粘手上了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.1"
msgid "Shell bits. Somebody lost their house."
msgstr "壳的碎片，有谁的房子没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.2"
msgid "Good for crafting. Not good for puzzles."
msgstr "能拿来做东西，拼图就算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You keep following me. Fine. Whatever."
msgstr "你老跟着我。行吧，随你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Tiny legs, big eyes. Okay, it's cute."
msgstr "小短腿，大眼睛。好吧，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "Same, buddy. Same."
msgstr "我懂，小家伙，我也饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "Stop looking at me like I'm food."
msgstr "别用看饭的眼神看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. Don't wake it. I'll nap too."
msgstr "嘘，别吵醒它，我也睡会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Sleeps more than me. Respect."
msgstr "比我还能睡，佩服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.1"
msgid "Okay, okay! Don't peck me, I'm on it!"
msgstr "好啦好啦！别啄我，我在找了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.2"
msgid "It's starving. Fine, take my snack."
msgstr "它饿坏了。行，我的零食给你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.1"
msgid "Lost something? Okay. Just this once."
msgstr "丢东西了？好吧，就帮这一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.2"
msgid "Little ghost, don't follow me so close. ...Fine."
msgstr "小幽灵，别跟太近……算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Chewy. Jaw workout included."
msgstr "很有嚼劲，还附带下巴锻炼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Small jerky. I'll eat it in class."
msgstr "小肉干，上课偷偷吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.1"
msgid "Snap at me and I'll snap back."
msgstr "敢咬我，我就打回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.2"
msgid "All teeth. No thanks."
msgstr "全是牙，不用了谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.1"
msgid "Winter's best weapon. After my bat."
msgstr "冬天最强的武器，仅次于我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Wilson, you're open. Just kidding. Maybe."
msgstr "威尔逊，你没防备哦。开玩笑的，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Needs a face. Maybe a grumpy one, like mine."
msgstr "该加张脸，要那种臭脸，跟我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Done. Best art project I've ever turned in."
msgstr "完成了，我交过最好的美术作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.1"
msgid "Bigger snowball, bigger nap afterward."
msgstr "雪球越大，之后午觉越长。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.2"
msgid "Pushing this up a hill? No way."
msgstr "推着它上坡？想都别想。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.1"
msgid "Slow and spiraled. Kinda pretty, actually."
msgstr "慢吞吞，壳还卷卷的，其实挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.2"
msgid "A snail with style. More than I have."
msgstr "有格调的蜗牛，比我有格调。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.1"
msgid "Ugh, that smell. The plants can have it."
msgstr "呕，这味道，留给植物吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.2"
msgid "Stinky plant juice. Very effective, apparently."
msgstr "臭臭的植物汁，听说很有效。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.1"
msgid "Gross! Keep your snot to yourself."
msgstr "恶心！鼻涕自己留着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.2"
msgid "Big woolly sheep with a bad cold."
msgstr "得了重感冒的大毛羊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.1"
msgid "Fancy spear. Wigfrid would cry happy tears."
msgstr "好华丽的长矛，薇格弗德会感动哭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.2"
msgid "Point it forward and run. Easy."
msgstr "往前一指就冲，简单。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.1"
msgid "Poke from far away. Lazy fighting, I like it."
msgstr "站远了戳，偷懒打法，我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.2"
msgid "Heavy lance. My bat's easier to swing."
msgstr "长枪好沉，还是球棒好挥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Smells like burnt hair. Gross."
msgstr "一股烧头发的味道，恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Good. Burn it all."
msgstr "很好，全烧了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Done. Good riddance."
msgstr "完事了，走好不送。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Don't poke it. Just don't."
msgstr "别戳它，千万别。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Stay dead! Ugh!"
msgstr "给我老实躺着！烦死了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Wait, it's glowing? Moon nonsense again."
msgstr "等等，发光了？又是月亮那一套。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.1"
msgid "Gooey medicine. Hold your nose."
msgstr "黏糊糊的药，捏着鼻子用吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.2"
msgid "Better than nothing. Barely."
msgstr "总比没有强，勉强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.1"
msgid "A spider hat. Webber, how do you wear this?"
msgstr "蜘蛛帽，韦伯你怎么戴得下去？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.2"
msgid "Wearing their queen's face. Feels rude."
msgstr "顶着它们女王的脸，有点失礼吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.1"
msgid "Spiders inside a rock. Cozy, I guess."
msgstr "蜘蛛住在石头里，还挺舒服吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.2"
msgid "Smash it before they wake up."
msgstr "趁它们没醒先砸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.1"
msgid "Even the rocks are spidery here."
msgstr "这里连石头都是蜘蛛窝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.2"
msgid "Smash the rock, the spiders move out. Fair."
msgstr "把石头砸了，蜘蛛就搬家，公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.1"
msgid "Too many legs! Way too many!"
msgstr "腿太多了！多得离谱！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.2"
msgid "Big boss spider. I'm not babysitting her kids."
msgstr "蜘蛛大头目，她的孩子我可不帮带。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Burning queen. Nobody roast marshmallows on it."
msgstr "女王在烧，谁也别拿来烤棉花糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Smoky. My eyes are watering."
msgstr "好呛，眼泪都出来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "She's down. Finally. Time for a nap."
msgstr "终于倒了，该睡午觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Huge. Who's moving that?"
msgstr "这么大，谁来搬走？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "No. Absolutely not. Stay down."
msgstr "不行，绝对不行，给我躺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Round two? I didn't sign up for overtime."
msgstr "第二回合？我可没报名加班。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.1"
msgid "Spiders falling from the ceiling. Love that."
msgstr "蜘蛛从天花板掉下来，真棒呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.2"
msgid "Look up. Yep. More spiders."
msgstr "抬头看看。嗯，又是蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.1"
msgid "A nurse spider? Hit that one first."
msgstr "蜘蛛护士？先打它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.2"
msgid "Healing your friends is cheating."
msgstr "给同伴回血是作弊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.1"
msgid "Coming out of the shell? Didn't think so."
msgstr "要出壳吗？我就知道不会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.2"
msgid "Turtle spider. Hit it harder."
msgstr "乌龟蜘蛛，用力敲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.1"
msgid "Done. It's not glowing anymore."
msgstr "完事了，不发光了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.2"
msgid "One more poke. Just to be sure."
msgstr "再戳一下，保险起见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Crystal spikes on a spider. Upgrade nobody asked for."
msgstr "蜘蛛长满水晶刺，没人要的升级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Shiny and mean. Bad combo."
msgstr "又亮又凶，糟糕的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. Sleeping spiders are the best spiders."
msgstr "嘘，睡着的蜘蛛是最好的蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Tiptoe. Don't step on anything crunchy."
msgstr "踮脚走，别踩到会响的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.1"
msgid "Rude. Who spits at people?"
msgstr "没礼貌，谁会冲人吐口水？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.2"
msgid "Close in fast. Bat beats spit."
msgstr "快点靠过去，球棒打得过口水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.1"
msgid "Spiders that walk on water. Great. Just great."
msgstr "会在水上走的蜘蛛，太棒了，真是太棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.2"
msgid "Skating around like it owns the ocean."
msgstr "在海上溜来溜去，好像海是它家的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Smells worse than the school trash bin."
msgstr "比学校垃圾桶还臭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Rotten fish. Not even I'm that hungry."
msgstr "臭鱼，我也没饿到这份上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Throw it on the farm. Or in the trash."
msgstr "扔地里当肥料，或者扔垃圾桶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Gross. It's moving. Is it moving?"
msgstr "恶心，它在动？是在动吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Floating around all day. Living my dream."
msgstr "整天飘来飘去，过着我梦想的生活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Red little light. Like a lazy firefly."
msgstr "红色小光点，像只懒萤火虫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.1"
msgid "Got one. Pocket glowing red now."
msgstr "抓到一个，口袋现在泛红光了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.2"
msgid "Stop wiggling. You're mine now."
msgstr "别扭了，你现在是我的了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.1"
msgid "That thing pops. Run."
msgstr "那玩意儿会炸，快跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.2"
msgid "Glowy and explosive. Like Willow's hobbies."
msgstr "又亮又会炸，跟薇洛的爱好一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Tiny green glow, drifting by. Cute."
msgstr "小小的绿光飘过去，挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Floating with zero effort. Teach me."
msgstr "毫不费力地飘着，教教我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.1"
msgid "Caught a green one. Easy."
msgstr "抓到一只绿的，轻松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.2"
msgid "Pocket nightlight. Nice."
msgstr "口袋小夜灯，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Blue and floaty. No homework, no worries."
msgstr "蓝蓝的飘着，没作业，没烦恼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Lucky spore. Gets to slack off forever."
msgstr "幸运的孢子，可以永远摸鱼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.1"
msgid "Blue's in the bag. Collect them all, I guess."
msgstr "蓝的也到手了，那就集齐吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.2"
msgid "Quit glowing in my pocket. People will stare."
msgstr "别在我兜里发光，别人会盯着看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.1"
msgid "Blink at me one more time. I dare you."
msgstr "再冲我眨一次眼试试。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.2"
msgid "Watch out for the ink. My uniform's white."
msgstr "小心墨汁，我校服是白的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "Like standing in front of the open fridge."
msgstr "像站在开着的冰箱门前。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "Perfect for summer naps."
msgstr "夏天午睡刚好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.1"
msgid "A tiny sun. Brighter than my future."
msgstr "一个小太阳，比我的前途还亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.2"
msgid "Toasty. I could nap right next to it."
msgstr "暖洋洋的，靠着就能睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.1"
msgid "A table with a hand. Nope."
msgstr "长手的桌子，不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.2"
msgid "Creepy furniture. I'm sleeping somewhere else."
msgstr "瘆人的家具，我换个地方睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.1"
msgid "Just an end table. Totally normal. Sure."
msgstr "只是张小边桌，完全正常，当然了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.2"
msgid "Don't move, table. I'm watching you."
msgstr "别动，桌子，我盯着你呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.1"
msgid "Sitting all quiet. That's what I do before trouble too."
msgstr "安安静静坐着，我惹事前也这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.2"
msgid "Not moving. Yet."
msgstr "现在不动，暂时而已。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.1"
msgid "Hey! Hands off the uniform!"
msgstr "喂！别扯我校服！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.2"
msgid "Where are you dragging me? The stage? No thanks."
msgstr "要拉我去哪？舞台？不用了谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.1"
msgid "Smash it for rocks. My specialty."
msgstr "砸了出石头，我的拿手好戏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.2"
msgid "Pointy cave rock. Don't trip."
msgstr "尖尖的洞里石头，别绊倒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.1"
msgid "Tall rock. More swings. Ugh."
msgstr "高石头，要多挥几棒，唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.2"
msgid "Taller than me. Not hard, but still."
msgstr "比我还高。虽然不难，但还是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.1"
msgid "Walking bones. Should've left it in pieces."
msgstr "会走的骨头，早该让它散着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.2"
msgid "Okay, my bad. Let's just smack it."
msgstr "好吧，怪我，直接揍它吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.1"
msgid "The final boss? Can I skip this one?"
msgstr "最终头目？这关能跳过吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.2"
msgid "Big, angry, made of bones. Perfect."
msgstr "又大又凶，全身骨头，完美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.1"
msgid "Little shadow things. Shoo."
msgstr "小小的影子玩意儿，嘘，走开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.2"
msgid "Step on one, two more pop up. Annoying."
msgstr "踩掉一个冒出两个，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.1"
msgid "Hold on, it's not attacking? Weird."
msgstr "等等，它不打人？奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.2"
msgid "You talk? Okay, I'm listening. Barely."
msgstr "你会说话？好，我听着，勉强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.1"
msgid "X marks the snacks. Hopefully."
msgstr "叉号的地方有零食，但愿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.2"
msgid "Treasure map. Finally, a field trip worth going on."
msgstr "藏宝图，总算有个值得去的春游。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nothing left. Glommer took it, probably."
msgstr "什么都没了，大概被格罗姆拿走了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Empty statue. Like my wallet."
msgstr "空雕像，跟我的钱包一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A Glommer statue? Somebody's a fan."
msgstr "格罗姆的雕像？有人是铁粉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Full moon, and something's going to happen here."
msgstr "满月时这里肯定会出事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.1"
msgid "No head, still practicing. More dedicated than me."
msgstr "没头也在练琴，比我还用功。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.2"
msgid "Pretty harp. Shame about the neck."
msgstr "竖琴很漂亮，脖子可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.1"
msgid "Flowers everywhere. Still no face."
msgstr "到处是花，还是没有脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.2"
msgid "Pretty garden, weird statue. Classic."
msgstr "漂亮的花园，怪异的雕像，经典组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.1"
msgid "Maxwell, you gave yourself a height boost."
msgstr "麦斯威尔，你给自己雕高了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.2"
msgid "Somebody really likes himself."
msgstr "某人真的很喜欢自己。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Marble. Heavy. Smash or leave?"
msgstr "大理石，好重，砸还是不砸？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nice statue. Would look better as rubble."
msgstr "好雕像，砸碎了更好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.1"
msgid "Headless again. Is that the art style?"
msgstr "又没头，这是什么艺术风格？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.2"
msgid "Somebody here really hates heads."
msgstr "这里有人跟头有仇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.1"
msgid "Stiff pose. Like a class photo."
msgstr "姿势好僵，像拍毕业照。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.2"
msgid "Stands straighter than I ever do."
msgstr "站得比我直多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.1"
msgid "Fancy carving. Shame if somebody whacked it."
msgstr "雕得真精致，要是被人敲了就可惜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.2"
msgid "Somebody spent weeks on this. I'd give up in a minute."
msgstr "有人在这上面花了好几周，我一分钟就放弃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "Itchy fluff. Worse than a wool sweater."
msgstr "扎人的毛，比毛衣还痒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "Could scrub burnt pots with this."
msgstr "能拿来刷烧糊的锅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.1"
msgid "Driving the boat? No license, no problem."
msgstr "开船？没驾照，没关系。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.2"
msgid "Somebody else steer. I'll nap on deck."
msgstr "换人掌舵，我去甲板上睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.1"
msgid "Pointy bee butt. Lovely."
msgstr "尖尖的蜂屁股，真好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.2"
msgid "Ow. Yep, still sharp."
msgstr "哎哟，嗯，还是很尖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A table. Now where's the food?"
msgstr "桌子有了，饭呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Solid stone. Even I can't flip it. Probably."
msgstr "实心石头，连我都掀不动。大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "Someone left something. Mine now? No? Fine."
msgstr "有人放了东西，归我了？不行？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Looks set. Who's cooking?"
msgstr "摆好了，谁来做饭？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.1"
msgid "Poor thing. Did somebody kick it?"
msgstr "可怜，是不是被谁踢了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.2"
msgid "Busted robot. Winona, you're up."
msgstr "机器人坏了，薇诺娜，该你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Tidying up all day. Couldn't be me."
msgstr "整天收拾东西，换我可做不到。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Little robot, carry my stuff too."
msgstr "小机器人，也帮我搬东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.1"
msgid "Eggplant with filling. Fancy."
msgstr "茄子还有馅，真讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.2"
msgid "Warm and soft. I'll take two."
msgstr "又热又软，我要两个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.1"
msgid "Pile it on. Thanksgiving vibes."
msgstr "多堆点，有感恩节的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.2"
msgid "Bready mush. Weirdly delicious."
msgstr "面包糊糊，意外好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.1"
msgid "Little plant. Cute on a windowsill."
msgstr "小多肉，放窗台上挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.2"
msgid "Eating this feels like eating a classroom decoration."
msgstr "吃这个就像吃教室里的摆设。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.1"
msgid "Dried out. Like me after a long lecture."
msgstr "干巴巴的，跟我听完长课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.2"
msgid "Crunchy. Still not eating it."
msgstr "脆脆的，还是不吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.1"
msgid "Low maintenance. My kind of plant."
msgstr "不用费心照顾，合我胃口的植物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.2"
msgid "Chubby leaves. Kinda squishy looking."
msgstr "胖乎乎的叶子，看着软软的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Soggy treasure. Better be snacks."
msgstr "泡水的宝箱，最好有零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "All that pulling. My arms hate me."
msgstr "拉了这么久，我的手臂恨死我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.1"
msgid "Locked? I'll just hit it."
msgstr "锁着？那我直接砸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.2"
msgid "Need a key. Or a crowbar."
msgstr "要钥匙。或者撬棍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.1"
msgid "Fishing gear needs its own house now?"
msgstr "鱼具现在都要有自己的房子了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.2"
msgid "So many lures. Do fish even care?"
msgstr "这么多鱼饵，鱼真的在乎吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.1"
msgid "Quakes keep shaking stuff loose. Patch it."
msgstr "地震老是把东西震松，补一下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.2"
msgid "Rocks on my head? Hard pass."
msgstr "石头砸头上？算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.1"
msgid "Cracked. Run if the ceiling shakes."
msgstr "裂了，天花板一抖就跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.2"
msgid "Totally busted. Who's fixing this?"
msgstr "彻底坏了，谁来修？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.1"
msgid "Fixed. I can nap under it now."
msgstr "修好了，可以在底下睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.2"
msgid "Solid pillar. Good job, everyone. Mostly me."
msgstr "柱子很结实，大家辛苦了，主要是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "Still half done. Like my homework."
msgstr "还只弄了一半，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "More dreadstone? Ugh. Fine."
msgstr "还要绝望石？唉，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.1"
msgid "Cracked? What hit it, a giant?"
msgstr "裂了？被什么撞的，巨人吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.2"
msgid "Wasn't me. I swear."
msgstr "不是我干的，我发誓。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.1"
msgid "Sturdy. Even my bat would bounce off."
msgstr "真结实，我的球棒都会被弹开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.2"
msgid "Done. The ceiling can relax now."
msgstr "完工，天花板可以放心了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.1"
msgid "Steak and fish together? Best of both worlds."
msgstr "牛排配鱼？两全其美。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.2"
msgid "Gimme. I'm not sharing this one."
msgstr "给我，这份我不分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.1"
msgid "Roast it and it's basically candy."
msgstr "烤一烤就跟糖一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.2"
msgid "Sweet potatoes from the street cart. Miss those."
msgstr "想念路边摊的烤红薯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.1"
msgid "Warm and sweet. Problems can wait."
msgstr "暖暖的甜甜的，麻烦事先放一边。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.2"
msgid "Tea time. Nobody bother me."
msgstr "下午茶时间，谁也别来烦我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.1"
msgid "A box just for bait. Fancy."
msgstr "专门装鱼饵的盒子，讲究。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.2"
msgid "Organized. Unlike my locker."
msgstr "整整齐齐，不像我的储物柜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.1"
msgid "More instructions. It's like shop class."
msgstr "又是说明书，跟手工课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.2"
msgid "Drawings of bait. Riveting."
msgstr "鱼饵的图纸，真是太精彩了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.1"
msgid "Chewy sugar. My jaw's gonna get tired."
msgstr "嚼劲十足的糖，下巴要酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.2"
msgid "Sweet. Sticks to everything, including my skirt."
msgstr "很甜，什么都粘，包括我的裙子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.1"
msgid "Huge fried egg. Breakfast for a week."
msgstr "超大煎蛋，够吃一周早饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Sorry, tallbird. It's delicious, though."
msgstr "对不起了高脚鸟，不过真好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.1"
msgid "Shivering egg. Get it by a fire."
msgstr "蛋在发抖，放火边去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.2"
msgid "Cold. Want my jacket? Kidding. Sort of."
msgstr "冷了。要我的外套吗？开玩笑的，算是吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cracking open. Don't peck my fingers."
msgstr "要破壳了，别啄我手指。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something's wiggling in there."
msgstr "里面有东西在扭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.1"
msgid "Sweating egg. Move it into the shade."
msgstr "蛋在冒汗，挪到阴凉处。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.2"
msgid "Cooking it by accident. Not yet."
msgstr "差点不小心煮熟了，还不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.1"
msgid "Babysitting an egg. Wake me when it hatches."
msgstr "看着一个蛋，孵出来再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.2"
msgid "Ugh. This takes forever."
msgstr "唉，这要等到天荒地老。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.1"
msgid "Any second now. Don't blink."
msgstr "随时会出来，别眨眼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.2"
msgid "Come on, hatch already."
msgstr "快点，快破壳吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big egg, bigger angry mom."
msgstr "大蛋，更大的暴躁老妈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Grab and run. That's the plan."
msgstr "抢了就跑，计划就这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing left. Somebody beat me to it."
msgstr "什么都没了，被人抢先了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.2"
msgid "Empty nest. Mom's gonna be mad."
msgstr "空窝了，鸟妈要生气了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.1"
msgid "Huge egg. Stealing it was the hard part."
msgstr "超大的蛋，偷的时候最难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.2"
msgid "Enough for the whole class's breakfast."
msgstr "够全班吃早饭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.1"
msgid "Wrapped in a leaf like a present."
msgstr "用叶子包着，像个礼物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.2"
msgid "Spicy and filling. Okay, maybe two."
msgstr "又辣又顶饱。好吧，也许吃两个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Teenage phase already? It gives attitude like a first-year."
msgstr "叛逆期这么快就到了？跟一年级新生一样会甩脸色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Its legs got longer than mine. Rude."
msgstr "腿都比我长了，没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "It eats more than me, and that's saying something."
msgstr "它比我还能吃，这可不容易。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "Okay, okay, stop pecking my skirt."
msgstr "好啦好啦，别啄我裙子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. If it wakes up, I'm not dealing with it."
msgstr "嘘，它要是醒了我可不管。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Sleeps through everything. Just like me in math class."
msgstr "什么都吵不醒，跟我上数学课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.1"
msgid "Its stomach is louder than mine. That's a first."
msgstr "它肚子叫得比我还响，头一回见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.2"
msgid "Hang in there, I'm going. Don't eat my hand."
msgstr "撑住，我这就去。别啃我的手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "It's humming. Please take me somewhere with beds."
msgstr "它在嗡嗡响了。拜托送我去有床的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Here goes. If this is a prank, I'm swinging."
msgstr "来吧。要是恶作剧，我就抡棒子了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A big wooden thing. Whoever built it got bored halfway."
msgstr "一大坨木头装置，做的人肯定做一半就腻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something's missing. Like a puzzle with the box thrown out."
msgstr "少了点什么，像扔了包装盒的拼图。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "Won't budge. Guess I'm hunting parts again."
msgstr "动都不动，看来又得找零件了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "Hitting it won't help. Probably."
msgstr "敲它应该没用吧。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.1"
msgid "Just a bit more. Don't make me cross the whole map again."
msgstr "再差一点。别让我再跑遍全图了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.2"
msgid "Halfway there. That's further than my homework ever got."
msgstr "完成一半了，比我的作业进度强多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.1"
msgid "A box full of gizmos. Shake it? No, better not."
msgstr "里面装着机关的盒子。摇一摇？算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.2"
msgid "Heavy. Lucky I'm the strong one."
msgstr "挺沉的，幸好我力气大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.1"
msgid "Turn it and something happens. Hopefully something good."
msgstr "转一转就会有事发生，希望是好事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.2"
msgid "Looks like the pencil sharpener in class. Way bigger, though."
msgstr "像教室里的卷笔刀，不过大多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.1"
msgid "Metal potato. My stomach got excited for nothing."
msgstr "金属土豆，害我肚子白激动了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.2"
msgid "Who sculpts a potato? Seriously, who does that?"
msgstr "谁会雕个土豆啊？说真的，到底谁啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.1"
msgid "Too big for a bracelet. Too heavy for a frisbee."
msgstr "当手镯太大，当飞盘太沉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.2"
msgid "One more piece. My arms are getting tired."
msgstr "又一个零件，我手都酸了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.1"
msgid "A sword that can't cut people? Weird, but I like it."
msgstr "砍不了人的刀？奇怪，不过我喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.2"
msgid "If it brings people back, keep it close, Louis."
msgstr "要是能把人带回来，Louis你可要收好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.1"
msgid "Still slimy. My bat would never treat me like this."
msgstr "还是黏糊糊的。我的球棒才不会这样对我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.2"
msgid "Swing it fast before it drips on me."
msgstr "趁它还没滴到我身上，赶紧挥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.1"
msgid "Squishy. I'm washing my hands for a week."
msgstr "软趴趴的，我要洗一礼拜手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.2"
msgid "Wilson would want this for science. He can have it."
msgstr "威尔逊肯定说要拿去做研究，送他了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.1"
msgid "A whole field of tentacles. Nope, nope."
msgstr "一整片触手。不要，不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.2"
msgid "Somebody planted these on purpose? Gardening club gone wrong."
msgstr "有人故意种的？园艺社走歪了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "That's not a pillar, that's a giant noodle that hates me."
msgstr "那不是柱子，是讨厌我的巨型面条。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "Huge. Even my bat looks small next to it."
msgstr "好大，我的球棒在它旁边都显小了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.1"
msgid "Tiny tentacles. Still slapping, though."
msgstr "小触手，照样抽人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.2"
msgid "Shoo. Go back to your big brother."
msgstr "去去，回你大哥那儿去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.1"
msgid "Jump into a slimy hole? Fine. Just this once."
msgstr "跳进黏糊糊的洞？行吧，就这一次。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.2"
msgid "Where does it go? Better not be detention."
msgstr "通到哪儿？别是禁闭室就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Recharging. Same as me after lunch."
msgstr "在充电，跟我午饭后一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "Nothing's happening. I'll nap till it's ready."
msgstr "什么动静都没有，我先睡到它好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.1"
msgid "Red means two eyes now, right? Wonderful."
msgstr "红了就是两只眼睛了吧？真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.2"
msgid "Looks angry. Who fed it nightmare fuel?"
msgstr "看着很生气，谁喂它噩梦燃料了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.1"
msgid "The eye's coming. Bat's ready, I guess."
msgstr "眼睛要来了，球棒准备好了，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.2"
msgid "Oh, it's glowing. That's never good news."
msgstr "哦，发光了，从来不是好消息。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tiny tree in a box. Cute, kind of creepy."
msgstr "盒子里的小树，可爱，又有点瘆人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Feels like something's looking back at me."
msgstr "感觉有东西在回看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.1"
msgid "Done. It's just a decoration now."
msgstr "结束了，现在只是个摆设。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.2"
msgid "No more giant eyeballs. I can sleep in peace."
msgstr "没有大眼珠子了，可以安心睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.1"
msgid "Night owl, huh? We'd get along, actually."
msgstr "夜猫子啊？我们其实挺合得来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.2"
msgid "Daytime's no good. Fine, I'll go eat something first."
msgstr "白天不行。好吧，我先去吃点东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.1"
msgid "Toasted. Hope nothing good was in there."
msgstr "烤焦了，希望里面没好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Ash and regret. Mostly ash."
msgstr "灰烬和后悔，主要是灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A chest just sitting here? Totally not a trap."
msgstr "箱子就这么摆着？肯定不是陷阱呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bat first, questions later."
msgstr "先上球棒，再问问题。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.1"
msgid "It's sparkling like an idol stage. Suspicious."
msgstr "闪闪发光，像偶像舞台一样，可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.2"
msgid "Glowing chest, glowing trouble. I know how this goes."
msgstr "发光的箱子就是发光的麻烦，我懂套路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.1"
msgid "Little crumbs of the fancy rock. Like cookie leftovers."
msgstr "高级石头的碎渣，像饼干屑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.2"
msgid "Six of these make a whole one, right? Math, ugh."
msgstr "六块拼一块对吧？数学，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.1"
msgid "Swinging it around feels like a temple ritual."
msgstr "甩来甩去，像寺庙里做法事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.2"
msgid "Smells like a festival. The creepy kind."
msgstr "闻着像庙会，阴森版的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Fine, go. Didn't need you anyway."
msgstr "行，走吧，本来也不需要你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "Dumped by a cat. Today's great."
msgstr "被猫甩了，今天真棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A detective cat. Better at searching than me."
msgstr "侦探猫，比我会找。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Fluffy tail. Can I just pet it instead?"
msgstr "尾巴毛茸茸的，能光摸不找吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.1"
msgid "Beaten to it. All that walking for nothing."
msgstr "被抢先了，白走那么多路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.2"
msgid "Lost it. Don't look at me, I wasn't napping."
msgstr "跟丢了。别看我，我可没打瞌睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.1"
msgid "Close. It's getting all twitchy."
msgstr "近了，它都开始躁动了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.2"
msgid "Around here somewhere. Check under the bushes."
msgstr "就在这附近，看看草丛底下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1"
msgid "Nothing left. Can we go home now?"
msgstr "什么都没了，能回家了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2"
msgid "It's just sitting there. Same mood, kid."
msgstr "它就坐着不动。懂你，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.1"
msgid "Good kitty. You've earned a snack."
msgstr "好猫猫，奖励你零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.2"
msgid "Look at that. Better partner than most humans."
msgstr "看看，比大部分人靠谱多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.1"
msgid "It says too far. My legs agree."
msgstr "它说太远了，我的腿也同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.2"
msgid "Way out of range. Pick something closer."
msgstr "远得够不着，挑个近点的吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.1"
msgid "Lead the way. Don't run, I'm lazy."
msgstr "带路吧，别跑，我很懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.2"
msgid "On the trail. Feels like skipping class to chase cats."
msgstr "在追踪了，感觉像逃课去追猫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.1"
msgid "Not my cat. Traitor."
msgstr "不是我的猫，叛徒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.2"
msgid "Working for someone else? Then don't look at me."
msgstr "在给别人干活？那别看我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.1"
msgid "It tills the dirt by itself? Hire it for farm duty."
msgstr "它自己会翻土？雇它去种地吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.2"
msgid "Pull it out before it takes over the garden."
msgstr "趁它还没占满菜园，赶紧拔掉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.1"
msgid "Dry and crunchy. Not snack crunchy, sadly."
msgstr "又干又脆，可惜不是零食那种脆。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.2"
msgid "Salve material, I think. Smells like medicine."
msgstr "能做药膏吧，闻着有药味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Nobody home. Good."
msgstr "没人在家，很好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.2"
msgid "The big toad left. Hopefully for good."
msgstr "大蛤蟆走了，希望别回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A suspicious mushroom. Hitting it sounds like a bad idea."
msgstr "可疑的蘑菇，打它感觉不是好主意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something huge lives under this. I can hear snoring."
msgstr "这下面住着大家伙，我能听到打呼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.1"
msgid "Ground's rumbling. That's my cue to leave."
msgstr "地在震，我该撤了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.2"
msgid "Here it comes. Wish I'd eaten first."
msgstr "要来了，早知道先吃饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It's whispering. Swords shouldn't whisper."
msgstr "它在嘀咕，刀不该会嘀咕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Gross vibes. My bat's way more honest."
msgstr "气场好恶心，我的球棒老实多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.1"
msgid "Louis, your face looks scary. Drop it, okay?"
msgstr "Louis，你脸色好吓人。放下它，好吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.2"
msgid "That thing's eating at you. Let's go get food instead."
msgstr "那东西在啃你的心，我们去吃东西吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.1"
msgid "Juicy. Don't squeeze it, I learned the hard way."
msgstr "多汁，别捏，我吃过亏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.2"
msgid "Red and round. Lunchbox regular."
msgstr "又红又圆，便当里的常客。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Warm tomato goop. Not bad on rice."
msgstr "热乎乎的番茄糊，拌饭不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Soft now. My shirt better stay clean."
msgstr "软了，我的衣服可别溅上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Giant tomato. That's a week of ketchup."
msgstr "巨型番茄，够做一礼拜番茄酱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Could hit a home run with this. Messy one, though."
msgstr "能拿它打本垒打，就是会很脏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Tomato seeds. Grow faster, I'm hungry."
msgstr "番茄种子，快点长，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny. Hard to believe a tomato comes out."
msgstr "这么小，很难相信能长出番茄。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.1"
msgid "Meat pie! Hands off, everyone."
msgstr "肉派！谁都别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.2"
msgid "Smells amazing. Who made this, Warly?"
msgstr "好香，谁做的，沃利吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "It's buzzing. Free ride home."
msgstr "它在嗡嗡响，免费坐车回家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Glowing. Best invention for lazy people."
msgstr "发光了，懒人最好的发明。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A rock that saves walking. My favorite kind of rock."
msgstr "能省路的石头，我最爱的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Pocket it. Shortcuts are life."
msgstr "揣兜里，捷径就是人生。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.1"
msgid "Nuts and berries. Hiking snack, but I hate hiking."
msgstr "坚果加浆果，远足零食，可我讨厌远足。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.2"
msgid "Crunchy. Better than eating grass."
msgstr "嘎嘣脆，比啃草强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.1"
msgid "Big gorilla pig. Looks like the P.E. teacher."
msgstr "大猩猩猪，像体育老师。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.2"
msgid "Those arms are bigger than me. Let's see whose punch is harder."
msgstr "胳膊比我还粗，比比谁拳头硬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.1"
msgid "Snap. Glad it wasn't my foot."
msgstr "咔嚓，幸好不是我的脚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.2"
msgid "Closed up. Wait till it opens again."
msgstr "合上了，等它再张开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pretty starfish? No way, it's got teeth."
msgstr "漂亮的海星？才怪，它长牙了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Poke it with a stick. Not with my hand."
msgstr "拿棍子戳，别用手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.1"
msgid "Maxwell's toys. Very mature, old man."
msgstr "麦斯威尔的玩具。真成熟啊，老头。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.2"
msgid "Teeth in the ground. Watch your step, everyone."
msgstr "地里有牙齿，大家看路。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.1"
msgid "Free loot? Nothing's free here."
msgstr "免费宝箱？这里什么都不免费。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.2"
msgid "If it bites, I bite back. With my bat."
msgstr "它要是咬我，我就用球棒咬回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.1"
msgid "Can't walk through. Can I bat through?"
msgstr "走不过去。能打过去吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.2"
msgid "Who parked trees here? Move."
msgstr "谁把树停在这儿的？让开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.1"
msgid "A stone tree on fire. Nothing makes sense here."
msgstr "石头树着火了，这地方什么都不讲道理。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.2"
msgid "Wow, burning rocks. Willow would love this."
msgstr "哇，石头在烧，薇洛肯定爱死了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Just a stump. My arms are sore."
msgstr "只剩树桩了，手好酸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Done. Wake me when it grows back."
msgstr "完事，长回来再叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Half tree, half rock. Can't decide what it wants to be."
msgstr "一半树一半石头，没想好自己是什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Rocks for fruit? My axe is already crying."
msgstr "结的是石头？我的斧头已经在哭了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.1"
msgid "A baby rock tree. Already hard-headed."
msgstr "石头树宝宝，从小就倔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Tiny pebble sprout. Weirdly cute."
msgstr "小石子芽，可爱得莫名其妙。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.1"
msgid "Is this a seed or a rock? Both?"
msgstr "这是种子还是石头？都是？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.2"
msgid "Heavy for a seed. Don't throw it at anyone."
msgstr "种子还挺沉，别拿它砸人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.1"
msgid "Melted marbles. Someone left them in the sun way too long."
msgstr "化掉的弹珠，太阳底下晒太久了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.2"
msgid "Can't play with these anymore. Pretty colors, though."
msgstr "已经玩不了了，颜色倒挺好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.1"
msgid "Second-hand teeth. I'm not touching them."
msgstr "二手牙齿，我才不碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.2"
msgid "They're grinning at me. Stop that."
msgstr "它们在冲我笑，别笑了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.1"
msgid "It lies nonstop. Like my excuses for skipping class."
msgstr "满嘴谎话，跟我逃课的借口一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.2"
msgid "WX-78 would call it a disgrace. Probably."
msgstr "WX-78大概会说它丢机器人的脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.1"
msgid "Dried tentacle. Like squid jerky, but no."
msgstr "干触手，像鱿鱼干，但不行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.2"
msgid "Shriveled up. Still gross."
msgstr "皱巴巴的，照样恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.1"
msgid "A lady gnome. The gnome got a girlfriend?"
msgstr "女地精，那只地精有女朋友了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.2"
msgid "Her smile's too wide. Not trusting it."
msgstr "她笑得太开了，信不过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.1"
msgid "Leaky teacup. Perfect for tea that disappears."
msgstr "漏水的茶杯，适合会消失的茶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom would scold whoever broke it."
msgstr "薇克伯顿会骂把它弄坏的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.1"
msgid "A bishop. Don't ask me how it moves."
msgstr "主教，别问我它怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.2"
msgid "White piece. Who's even playing?"
msgstr "白棋，到底谁在下？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.1"
msgid "Black bishop. The pair's complete."
msgstr "黑主教，凑成一对了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.2"
msgid "Chess again. I fall asleep at chess club."
msgstr "又是国际象棋，我在棋社都能睡着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.1"
msgid "Bent spork. I could straighten it. Or snap it."
msgstr "弯掉的叉勺。我能掰直，也可能掰断。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.2"
msgid "Half spoon, half fork, all useless."
msgstr "半勺半叉，全无用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.1"
msgid "Little wooden horse. Rattles when shaken."
msgstr "小木马，摇一摇会响。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.2"
msgid "Someone's history homework, probably."
msgstr "大概是谁的历史作业。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.1"
msgid "Wobbly top. Lazy, like me."
msgstr "歪歪扭扭的陀螺，跟我一样懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.2"
msgid "One more try. Okay, it fell again."
msgstr "再试一次。好吧，又倒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.1"
msgid "A kazoo that can't kazoo. Sad."
msgstr "吹不响的卡祖笛，好惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.2"
msgid "Fake kazoo. Good, nobody can annoy me with it."
msgstr "假卡祖笛，好，没人能用它烦我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.1"
msgid "Back scratcher. Finally, I can reach that spot."
msgstr "痒痒挠，终于能挠到那块了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.2"
msgid "Looks like a tiny hand on a stick. Creepy, but useful."
msgstr "像根棍子上的小手，瘆人，但好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.1"
msgid "Busted whisk. Did someone use it as a weapon?"
msgstr "坏掉的打蛋器，有人拿它当武器了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.2"
msgid "Wasn't me who bent it. Probably."
msgstr "不是我弄弯的。大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.1"
msgid "Frayed yarn. A cat would be thrilled."
msgstr "磨破的毛线，猫肯定开心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.2"
msgid "Knitting? Too much patience. Pass."
msgstr "织毛衣？太费耐心，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.1"
msgid "Shoehorn. Who's too lazy to bend over? Oh. Me."
msgstr "鞋拔子。谁懒到不想弯腰？哦，是我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.2"
msgid "Could swat a bug with it. That's about it."
msgstr "能用来拍虫子，也就这样了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.1"
msgid "Lucky cat. Bring me snacks, then."
msgstr "招财猫，那就给我招点零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.2"
msgid "Waving at me. I'm not waving back."
msgstr "在冲我招手，我才不招回去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.1"
msgid "Air unfreshener. Smells like the boys' locker room."
msgstr "空气污染剂，闻着像男生更衣室。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.2"
msgid "Ugh. Who invented this, and why?"
msgstr "呃，谁发明的，图什么？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.1"
msgid "Potato cup. Drink, then snack. Genius."
msgstr "土豆杯，喝完再吃，天才。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.2"
msgid "Is it rude to bite the cup? Asking for me."
msgstr "咬杯子算不算没礼貌？替我自己问的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.1"
msgid "Coat hanger. My uniform deserves better."
msgstr "衣架，我的校服值得更好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.2"
msgid "Bend it into a hook? Fishing for snacks."
msgstr "掰成钩子？钓零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.1"
msgid "Looks like a little castle. Too small to nap in."
msgstr "像个小城堡，小得没法在里面睡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.2"
msgid "Rook. Moves straight, like me to the cafeteria."
msgstr "城堡棋，直着走，跟我冲食堂一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.1"
msgid "Matching castle. Someone's collecting the whole set."
msgstr "配套的城堡，有人在集全套。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.2"
msgid "Black tower piece. Very edgy."
msgstr "黑色城堡棋，挺中二的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.1"
msgid "Could cut it. Or just smash it. Either works."
msgstr "能剪开，也能直接砸，都行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.2"
msgid "Tangled like my earphones every morning."
msgstr "跟我每天早上的耳机线一样乱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.1"
msgid "A horsey. The only chess piece I like."
msgstr "小马，我唯一喜欢的棋子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.2"
msgid "Knight piece. Moves funny, like Wes."
msgstr "骑士棋，走法古怪，跟韦斯一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.1"
msgid "Black horsey. Looks grumpier than the white one."
msgstr "黑小马，比白的看着更不爽。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.2"
msgid "Another knight. Do these things breed?"
msgstr "又一个骑士，这东西会繁殖吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.1"
msgid "Shiny ball. All I see is my sleepy face."
msgstr "亮晶晶的球，只看到我困倦的脸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.2"
msgid "Tell me tomorrow's lunch menu, then."
msgstr "那告诉我明天午饭吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.1"
msgid "Spider ring. Webber would think it's stylish."
msgstr "蜘蛛戒指，韦伯会觉得很时髦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.2"
msgid "Cheap jewelry. Not wearing it to school."
msgstr "廉价首饰，不戴去学校。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.1"
msgid "Monkey paw. Wishes always backfire with these."
msgstr "猴爪，这种东西许愿必翻车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.2"
msgid "Wrinkly little hand. Gross but fascinating."
msgstr "皱巴巴的小手，恶心又让人好奇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.1"
msgid "Empty. Someone drank the good stuff."
msgstr "空的，好东西被人喝光了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.2"
msgid "Smells like old medicine. Not licking it."
msgstr "一股陈年药味，不舔。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.1"
msgid "Plastic fangs. Rawr. Nah, embarrassing."
msgstr "塑料尖牙，嗷呜。算了，太丢人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.2"
msgid "Vampire costume leftovers. Halloween was rough."
msgstr "吸血鬼服装的剩货，万圣节过得不太好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.1"
msgid "Broken stake. Did the vampire win?"
msgstr "断掉的木桩，是吸血鬼赢了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.2"
msgid "Pointy. My bat's still the better weapon."
msgstr "尖尖的，还是我的球棒更好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.1"
msgid "Binoculars. Spotting snacks from far away, nice."
msgstr "望远镜，远远就能看见零食，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.2"
msgid "Looking through backward makes everything tiny. Fun for five seconds."
msgstr "反着看什么都变小了，好玩五秒钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.1"
msgid "Where's the other one? Lost, like my P.E. shoes."
msgstr "另一只呢？跟我的体育鞋一样丢了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.2"
msgid "One glove. Half a fashion statement."
msgstr "一只手套，半个时尚宣言。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.1"
msgid "Garden gnome. Its eyes follow you around."
msgstr "花园地精，眼睛会跟着你转。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.2"
msgid "The Pig King loves these. No idea why."
msgstr "猪王很爱这个，想不通为什么。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.1"
msgid "Snail scale. For weighing slow things."
msgstr "蜗牛秤，专称慢吞吞的东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.2"
msgid "Cute little scale. Don't weigh my lunch."
msgstr "可爱的小秤，别称我的午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.1"
msgid "Green goop inside. Not drinking that."
msgstr "里面是绿色黏液，不喝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.2"
msgid "Looks like a science-class experiment gone wrong."
msgstr "像理科实验做砸了的产物。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.1"
msgid "Toy snake. Got me for a second."
msgstr "玩具蛇，吓了我一跳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.2"
msgid "Rubber cobra. Perfect for pranking Wilson."
msgstr "橡胶眼镜蛇，拿来整威尔逊正好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.1"
msgid "Crocodile toy. Hops like it skipped breakfast."
msgstr "鳄鱼玩具，跳得像没吃早饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.2"
msgid "Wind it up again. Nope, still sad."
msgstr "再上一次发条。不行，还是很惨。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.1"
msgid "Broken terrarium. The plant's still trying, though."
msgstr "碎掉的玻璃花房，里面的植物还在努力。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.2"
msgid "Wormwood might get upset seeing this."
msgstr "沃姆伍德看到可能会难过。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.1"
msgid "Static, static, more static. Like math lectures."
msgstr "沙沙、沙沙，还是沙沙，跟数学课一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.2"
msgid "Old radio. Any music stations? No? Boring."
msgstr "旧收音机，有音乐台吗？没有？无聊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.1"
msgid "Broken hairdryer. My bed hair stays, then."
msgstr "坏吹风机，那我的乱发就保持原样吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.2"
msgid "Weak breeze. Not fixing my bangs with that."
msgstr "风这么弱，靠它弄不好刘海。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.1"
msgid "Toy rocket. Take me to the moon, then."
msgstr "玩具火箭，那带我去月亮吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.2"
msgid "Whoosh. Okay, that was childish."
msgstr "咻——好吧，有点幼稚。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.1"
msgid "Fried wires. Winona might want them."
msgstr "烧坏的电线，薇诺娜可能要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.2"
msgid "Don't touch. I learned that from the classroom projector."
msgstr "别碰，我从教室投影仪那学到教训了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.1"
msgid "Ball and cup. I'll get it eventually. Maybe."
msgstr "杯球，我总会接住的。也许。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.2"
msgid "Missed again. This toy hates me."
msgstr "又没接住，这玩具恨我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.1"
msgid "Hardened rubber plug. Bounce it? Nope, too hard."
msgstr "硬掉的橡胶塞，弹一下？不行，太硬了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.2"
msgid "A bath sounds so nice right now."
msgstr "现在好想泡个澡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.1"
msgid "Mismatched buttons. My uniform's missing one, actually."
msgstr "不配对的扣子，正好我校服掉了一颗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.2"
msgid "Sew them on wrong and start a trend."
msgstr "钉歪了说不定还能带起潮流。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.1"
msgid "Even sharper now. Louis, careful with that."
msgstr "更锋利了，Louis，小心点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.2"
msgid "That blade gives me chills. Good chills? Not sure."
msgstr "这刀让我发寒，好的那种？不确定。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.1"
msgid "Big upgrade. My bat feels a little left out."
msgstr "大升级，我的球棒有点被冷落了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.2"
msgid "Shiny and serious. Very Louis."
msgstr "闪亮又严肃，很有Louis的风格。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.1"
msgid "The real lightning sword. My hair's standing up."
msgstr "真正的雷切，我头发都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.2"
msgid "Sparks everywhere. Do not swing that near me."
msgstr "到处冒火花，别在我旁边挥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.1"
msgid "Plain sheath, scary blade. Like a quiet kid who's secretly strong."
msgstr "朴素的刀鞘，可怕的刀，像不爱说话但很能打的人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.2"
msgid "Polished up nice. Louis must've stayed up all night."
msgstr "磨得真亮，Louis肯定熬了个通宵。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.1"
msgid "Trunk steak. Chewy, but I'm hungry enough."
msgstr "象鼻排，有嚼劲，反正我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.2"
msgid "Smells great. Looks weird. Eating it anyway."
msgstr "闻着香，看着怪，照吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.1"
msgid "A whole trunk. Poor koalefant."
msgstr "一整根鼻子，可怜的考拉象。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.2"
msgid "Raw and floppy. Cook it, please."
msgstr "生的，软塌塌的，拜托煮了它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.1"
msgid "Fuzzy trunk. Like a scarf, but meat."
msgstr "毛茸茸的鼻子，像围巾，但是肉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.2"
msgid "Winter koalefants are chunky. Lots to eat."
msgstr "冬天的考拉象可真壮，有得吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.1"
msgid "Rolling away. Even it skips out on stuff."
msgstr "滚走了，它也会开溜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.2"
msgid "Wait! Okay, it's faster than me."
msgstr "等等！好吧，它比我快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.1"
msgid "Cracked dirt. Like the school field in August."
msgstr "龟裂的土，像八月的学校操场。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.2"
msgid "Rough ground. Bad place for a nap."
msgstr "地面粗糙，不适合睡午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.1"
msgid "Dirt. Very exciting. Wow."
msgstr "泥土，好刺激哦，哇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.2"
msgid "Plain ground. Matches my motivation."
msgstr "普普通通的地，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY.1"
msgid "Sand in my shoes again. Every time."
msgstr "鞋里又进沙子了，每次都这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_SANDY.2"
msgid "Beach floor. No ocean, no vacation."
msgstr "沙滩地板，没有海，也没有假期。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER.1"
msgid "Turkey dinner! I'm calling the drumstick."
msgstr "火鸡大餐！鸡腿是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER.2"
msgid "Smells like a holiday. Can I skip chores today?"
msgstr "闻着像过节，今天能不干活吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP.1"
msgid "Turnip. Bland, but it fills you up."
msgstr "芜菁，没什么味道，但能填饱肚子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP.2"
msgid "Pulled it up myself. Easy, with my strength."
msgstr "我自己拔的，以我的力气，轻松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Soft turnip. Needs soy sauce."
msgstr "软软的芜菁，要加酱油。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Cooked. Still a turnip, sadly."
msgstr "熟了，可惜还是芜菁。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Turnip seeds. More turnips, yay."
msgstr "芜菁种子，更多芜菁，好开心哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Toss them in the dirt and hope."
msgstr "撒进土里，然后祈祷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.1"
msgid "Spiky turtle. Hides in its shell when it's losing. Coward."
msgstr "带刺的乌龟，打不过就缩壳，胆小鬼。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.2"
msgid "Spinning attack? I can do a spinning bat swing too."
msgstr "旋转攻击？我也会转着抡球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Twigs make good kindling. Too good."
msgstr "树枝太好烧了，好过头了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Well, that's a campfire now."
msgstr "好吧，现在是篝火了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Crispy. Nothing worth picking up."
msgstr "焦脆的，没什么好捡的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Looks like burnt toast. Now I'm hungry."
msgstr "像烤焦的吐司，我饿了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Down it goes. Easy."
msgstr "倒了，轻松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "Stump. It'll be back, probably."
msgstr "树桩，大概还会长回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Looks sick. Don't let it spread."
msgstr "看着生病了，别让它传开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Even the tree's having a bad day."
msgstr "连树都过得不顺。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A tree made of twigs. Very efficient."
msgstr "全是树枝的树，挺高效。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Scrawny thing. Needs to eat more, like me."
msgstr "瘦巴巴的，跟我一样需要多吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.1"
msgid "Pointy nut. Not the snack kind."
msgstr "尖尖的果子，不是零食那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.2"
msgid "Plant it somewhere and walk away."
msgstr "随便种个地方就走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.1"
msgid "Baby twig tree. Grow up quietly, okay?"
msgstr "小树枝树，安安静静长大哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.2"
msgid "Small and thin. Water it? Nah, rain'll do it."
msgstr "又小又细，浇水？算了，等下雨吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.1"
msgid "Old and tired. Same, buddy."
msgstr "又老又累，我懂你，兄弟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.2"
msgid "Dried-out tree. Chop it before it falls on someone."
msgstr "干枯的树，趁它没倒在人身上先砍了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.1"
msgid "A laser eye. Is that even fair?"
msgstr "会放激光的眼睛，这公平吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.2"
msgid "Mechanical eyeball. WX-78's cousin?"
msgstr "机械眼珠，WX-78的亲戚？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.1"
msgid "This one breathes fire. Of course it does."
msgstr "这只还喷火，当然了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.2"
msgid "Twin eyeballs. Double the homework, double the pain."
msgstr "双胞胎眼珠，作业翻倍，痛苦翻倍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.1"
msgid "Grilled eel on rice. This is paradise."
msgstr "烤鳗鱼盖饭，这就是天堂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.2"
msgid "Sweet sauce, crispy skin. I'm not sharing."
msgstr "甜酱汁，脆皮，谁都不分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.1"
msgid "Under construction. Like my homework."
msgstr "施工中，跟我的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.2"
msgid "Somebody forgot to finish this. Relatable."
msgstr "有人忘了做完，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.1"
msgid "Fangs on a bunny? Cute's ruined."
msgstr "兔子长尖牙？可爱全毁了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.2"
msgid "Keep it away from my neck."
msgstr "别让它靠近我的脖子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.1"
msgid "Smashed chandelier. Glad I wasn't under it."
msgstr "砸碎的吊灯，幸好我没站下面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.2"
msgid "Too dark. My eyes want to close anyway."
msgstr "太暗了，反正我眼睛也一直想闭上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It points somewhere. Better than my sense of direction."
msgstr "它指着某个方向，比我的方向感强。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Compass, right? Don't spin, just point."
msgstr "指南针对吧？别转了，指就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.1"
msgid "This is it. Grab stuff and go home."
msgstr "就是这儿，拿完回家。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.2"
msgid "Finally. My legs were about to quit."
msgstr "终于到了，我的腿都要罢工了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.1"
msgid "It's just spinning. Useless out here."
msgstr "它就一直转，在外面没用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.2"
msgid "Wrong place, little compass. Nap time for you."
msgstr "地方不对，小罗盘，你睡觉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Ceiling bug! Get off, get off!"
msgstr "天花板上的虫！下去，下去！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Look up next time. Lesson learned."
msgstr "下次记得抬头看，长记性了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.1"
msgid "Stuck in place. Good, stay there."
msgstr "卡住了，很好，待着别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.2"
msgid "Plugged in like a toaster. Something better happen."
msgstr "像烤面包机一样插上了，最好有点反应。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.1"
msgid "A lever. Pulling it is always a gamble."
msgstr "拉杆，拉了总是赌运气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.2"
msgid "If bugs drop on me after this, I'm blaming Wilson."
msgstr "拉完要是又掉虫子，我就怪威尔逊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.1"
msgid "Fancy door. Do I need a student ID?"
msgstr "高级门，要刷学生证吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.2"
msgid "Sealed tight. Feels like a hospital."
msgstr "封得死死的，像医院。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.1"
msgid "A sprayer. Free shower, I guess."
msgstr "喷雾器，算是免费淋浴吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.2"
msgid "Don't spray my hair, I just fixed it."
msgstr "别喷我头发，刚弄好的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.1"
msgid "Shiny key. Don't lose it like my locker key."
msgstr "亮闪闪的钥匙，别像我的储物柜钥匙一样弄丢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.2"
msgid "A key this fancy must open something good."
msgstr "这么讲究的钥匙，开的肯定是好东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.1"
msgid "No power, no fun. Find the switch."
msgstr "没电就没意思，找开关去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.2"
msgid "Hitting it might work. Kidding. Mostly."
msgstr "敲一下也许管用。开玩笑的，大部分是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.1"
msgid "Nowhere to anchor here. Annoying."
msgstr "这里没地方固定，烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.2"
msgid "Rope won't hold on this. Let's look around."
msgstr "绳子在这挂不住，到处看看吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Something's sitting on there. Too easy?"
msgstr "上面放着东西，太简单了吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Grab it quick. If anything moves, run."
msgstr "快拿，有东西动就跑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.1"
msgid "Nothing here. Did I already take it? Probably."
msgstr "什么都没有。是我已经拿了吗？大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.2"
msgid "Bare pedestal. Kind of lonely."
msgstr "空荡荡的台子，有点寂寞。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.1"
msgid "The way out. Good, I want to go home."
msgstr "出口，好，我想回家了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.2"
msgid "Climbing up again? My arms say no."
msgstr "又要爬上去？我的胳膊说不要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.1"
msgid "Glowing ball. Don't drop it on my foot."
msgstr "发光的球，别砸我脚上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.2"
msgid "Round and heavy. The shot put club would love it."
msgstr "又圆又沉，铅球队会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1"
msgid "Big stone guy. Pick a fight? Maybe later."
msgstr "大石头家伙，打一架？以后再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2"
msgid "It's staring. I'll stare back, harder."
msgstr "它在盯着我，我盯回去，更狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.1"
msgid "Half-built. Like every project I start."
msgstr "做了一半，跟我开始的每件事一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.2"
msgid "More parts? Ugh, fine, I'll carry them."
msgstr "还要零件？唉，行，我来搬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.1"
msgid "Built it ourselves. Not bad, huh?"
msgstr "我们自己造的，还不错吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.2"
msgid "Big bodyguard. Now I can slack off."
msgstr "大保镖，现在我可以偷懒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.1"
msgid "Sleeping giant. Let's not be the alarm clock."
msgstr "沉睡的巨人，咱们别当闹钟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.2"
msgid "Totally still. Kind of creepy, kind of peaceful."
msgstr "一动不动，有点瘆人，又有点安详。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.1"
msgid "Looks like a guard taking a nap. Relatable."
msgstr "看着像在打盹的守卫，我懂你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.2"
msgid "Wake up already. Even I'm awake right now."
msgstr "快醒醒吧，连我都醒着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.1"
msgid "Heavy. Good thing my arms don't care."
msgstr "挺沉的，好在我手劲大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.2"
msgid "One piece down. Is this a puzzle or homework?"
msgstr "拿到一块了，这是拼图还是作业？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.1"
msgid "Older than the school building, and works better."
msgstr "比学校的楼还老，还比它好用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.2"
msgid "Where's the manual? Fine, I'll just poke it."
msgstr "说明书呢？算了，直接戳戳看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.1"
msgid "Looks like my notes after I fall asleep in class."
msgstr "像我上课睡着时记的笔记。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.2"
msgid "Squiggles. Wickerbottom would probably love these."
msgstr "一堆弯弯绕绕，薇克伯顿大概会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.1"
msgid "Statues that tell sad stories. Great, very cheerful."
msgstr "会讲悲惨故事的雕像，真是太欢乐了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.2"
msgid "Whoever carved this really didn't want anyone sleeping well."
msgstr "雕这个的人是不想让谁睡好觉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.1"
msgid "Even a pile of bones would hold a grudge after that."
msgstr "换成一堆骨头也会记仇吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.2"
msgid "Carved this detailed? Somebody wanted it remembered."
msgstr "雕得这么细，是有人想让人记住吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.1"
msgid "Chapter two. Don't tell me there's a quiz after."
msgstr "第二章了，别告诉我看完还要小测。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.2"
msgid "Okay, okay, I'm reading. No skipping, I promise."
msgstr "好啦好啦，在看了，保证不跳页。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.1"
msgid "Plot twist. Should've brought snacks for this."
msgstr "剧情反转了，早知道带点零食来看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.2"
msgid "Huh. That ending's darker than I expected."
msgstr "嗯……这结局比我想的还黑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.1"
msgid "Whacking it with my bat probably won't help. Probably."
msgstr "拿球棒敲大概也没用，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.2"
msgid "Great, a commute that's out of service."
msgstr "好嘛，通勤线路停运了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Hope it doesn't make me carsick."
msgstr "希望别让我晕车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Okay, last chance to grab snacks."
msgstr "好，最后一次机会拿零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.1"
msgid "Even teleporters need lunch, apparently."
msgstr "原来传送门也得吃午饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.2"
msgid "No power, no ride. Just like my phone."
msgstr "没电就走不了，跟我手机一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.1"
msgid "Under construction. Like the school gym, forever."
msgstr "施工中，跟学校体育馆一样，永远在修。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.2"
msgid "Guess I'll nap here until somebody finishes it."
msgstr "那我在这儿睡一觉，等谁修好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.1"
msgid "Dead torch. I'm not walking in the dark."
msgstr "灯坏了，我可不想摸黑走。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.2"
msgid "Maybe a good smack will fix it. No? Fine."
msgstr "拍一下也许就好了？不行啊，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Bright enough to see what's trying to eat me."
msgstr "亮到能看清是谁想吃我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nice. Now I can see where to nap."
msgstr "不错，现在能看清哪儿能睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.1"
msgid "Where's the ketchup? An omelette needs ketchup."
msgstr "番茄酱呢？煎蛋卷得配番茄酱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.2"
msgid "Eggs and veggies. Mom would approve, ugh."
msgstr "鸡蛋配蔬菜，我妈肯定会夸，唉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.1"
msgid "All that watering for a giant pile of mush."
msgstr "浇了那么多水，换来一大坨烂泥。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.2"
msgid "Smells like the back of the cafeteria. Gross."
msgstr "闻着像食堂后面，好恶心。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.1"
msgid "A drink with a vegetable sticking out? Adults are weird."
msgstr "饮料里插根菜？大人真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.2"
msgid "Tastes healthy. That's not a compliment."
msgstr "喝着很健康，这可不是夸它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Fancy beefalo outfit. It's dressed better than me."
msgstr "好讲究的牛衣服，穿得比我还体面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Ruffles on a beefalo? Somebody had way too much time."
msgstr "牛身上加花边？谁这么闲啊。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "Feels like touching nothing. Creepy, but comfy."
msgstr "摸着像什么都没摸到，怪吓人的，但挺舒服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "Darker than my mood on Monday mornings."
msgstr "比我周一早上的心情还黑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.1"
msgid "Jiggly and buzzing. My tongue's gonna go numb."
msgstr "又晃又带电，舌头要麻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.2"
msgid "Wakes you up better than coffee, I guess."
msgstr "提神效果比咖啡还好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.1"
msgid "Somebody's homework? I'm not debugging that."
msgstr "谁的作业？我才不帮你调代码。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.2"
msgid "Close it. Looking at code makes me sleepy."
msgstr "关掉吧，看代码我就犯困。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.1"
msgid "All those little squares are perfect for holding syrup."
msgstr "这些小格子就是用来装糖浆的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.2"
msgid "Breakfast I'd actually get up early for."
msgstr "这种早餐我愿意早起。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1"
msgid "Even my bat feels tiny next to that."
msgstr "站它旁边，我的球棒都显得好小。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2"
msgid "Who builds a robot this big and forgets the off switch?"
msgstr "造这么大的机器人，还忘了装开关？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.1"
msgid "Big tarp, big mystery. I'm not peeking."
msgstr "好大一块布，好神秘，我才不偷看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.2"
msgid "Somebody's building a giant toy back here."
msgstr "有人在这儿造大号玩具。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.1"
msgid "One leg less, so it's hopping now?"
msgstr "少了条腿，它要单脚跳了？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.2"
msgid "Heavy souvenir. Could make a nice bench."
msgstr "挺沉的纪念品，能当长椅坐。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.1"
msgid "Something's driving it, and it's not Wagstaff!"
msgstr "有东西在开它，而且不是瓦格斯塔夫！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.2"
msgid "Great, now the giant robot's haunted too!"
msgstr "好极了，大机器人还闹鬼了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.1"
msgid "A secret room? Better have snacks inside."
msgstr "密室？里面最好有零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.2"
msgid "Hidden stuff always means more trouble."
msgstr "藏起来的东西总意味着更多麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.1"
msgid "Like a hall monitor, but for robots."
msgstr "像风纪委员，只不过管的是机器人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.2"
msgid "Stay put, drones. Wanderers get detention."
msgstr "无人机都待着，乱跑的罚留校。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.1"
msgid "Crashed and busted. Dibs on the shiny bits."
msgstr "摔得稀烂，亮晶晶的零件归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.2"
msgid "Serves you right for buzzing over my head."
msgstr "活该，谁让你在我头上嗡嗡叫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Buzzing like a mosquito the size of a bike."
msgstr "嗡嗡响，像自行车那么大的蚊子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Get down here and fight properly!"
msgstr "下来好好打一架！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "Sleeping drone. Same, buddy."
msgstr "在睡觉的无人机，我懂你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "Quick, smack it before it wakes up."
msgstr "快，趁它没醒先拍下去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.1"
msgid "Screws and springs. Shop class flashbacks."
msgstr "螺丝和弹簧，想起了手工课。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.2"
msgid "Pocket them. Somebody's gonna want these later."
msgstr "揣兜里，回头肯定有人要。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.1"
msgid "It's rolling crooked now. Kinda sad, actually."
msgstr "现在滚得歪歪扭扭，还有点可怜。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.2"
msgid "Bent wheel. Shouldn't have rammed into me."
msgstr "轮子弯了，谁让你撞我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.1"
msgid "Good bot. Don't let the others bully you."
msgstr "乖机器人，别让别的欺负你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.2"
msgid "Finally, a robot on my side."
msgstr "总算有个站我这边的机器人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Rolling at me like a runaway shopping cart."
msgstr "冲我滚过来，跟失控的购物车一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Come any closer and I'm batting you into the sea."
msgstr "再靠近我就一棒把你打进海里。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "No buttons anywhere? It's lazier than me."
msgstr "连个按钮都没有？这东西比我还懒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "Maybe it needs a kick start. Literally."
msgstr "也许得踹一脚才启动，字面意思。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.1"
msgid "Scrap metal. Smells like the school workshop."
msgstr "废铁，一股学校工坊的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.2"
msgid "Jingly junk. Treasure, if you squint."
msgstr "叮当响的破烂，眯着眼看算宝贝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.1"
msgid "A cage wall. Feels like the school fence."
msgstr "笼子墙，好像学校的围栏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.2"
msgid "Who exactly is getting locked up here, them or me?"
msgstr "到底关的是它们还是我？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.1"
msgid "A lever. My hand's itching to pull it."
msgstr "有个拉杆，手好痒想扳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.2"
msgid "Pulling random levers is how horror movies start."
msgstr "乱扳拉杆，恐怖片都是这么开头的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.1"
msgid "More crafting. This is basically shop class."
msgstr "又要做东西，跟手工课没两样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.2"
msgid "Lots of gears. Can I just watch someone else do it?"
msgstr "这么多齿轮，我能在旁边看别人弄吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.1"
msgid "A real glove this time. Not some ghost thing."
msgstr "这回是真手套，不是什么幻影。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.2"
msgid "Smells like oil and old experiments."
msgstr "有股机油和老实验的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.1"
msgid "Notes on notes. He'd get along with Wickerbottom."
msgstr "笔记套笔记，他跟薇克伯顿应该很聊得来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.2"
msgid "Clipboards remind me of attendance. I'm leaving."
msgstr "记录板让我想起点名，我先溜了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.1"
msgid "Looks like a junk drawer exploded."
msgstr "像杂物抽屉炸开了一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.2"
msgid "Dig through it? Sure, I've got nothing better to do."
msgstr "翻一翻？行吧，反正我也没事干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.1"
msgid "His handwriting's worse than mine. Impressive."
msgstr "他的字比我还丑，厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.2"
msgid "Mutation notes. Biology class, but scarier."
msgstr "变异笔记，生物课的恐怖版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.1"
msgid "Old man, you're kinda see-through."
msgstr "老爷爷，你有点透明哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.2"
msgid "If I help, is there a reward? Food counts."
msgstr "帮你有奖励吗？吃的也算。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.1"
msgid "Studying mutants all day? Take a nap, old man."
msgstr "整天研究变异体？老爷爷，睡个午觉吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.2"
msgid "You get excited about the weirdest stuff."
msgstr "你激动的点也太奇怪了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.1"
msgid "Slow down, my legs aren't built for sprinting."
msgstr "慢点，我的腿可不是用来冲刺的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.2"
msgid "Another errand? I'm not your assistant, you know."
msgstr "又要跑腿？我又不是你的助手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.1"
msgid "Found it. Do I get a gold star?"
msgstr "找到了，有小红花吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.2"
msgid "Weird gadget. Better hand it over before I break it."
msgstr "奇怪的小玩意，趁我没弄坏赶紧交过去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.1"
msgid "I'm calling it the whatsit. Good enough."
msgstr "就叫它“那个啥”吧，够用了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.2"
msgid "Is this the one? Eh, close enough."
msgstr "是这个吗？差不多吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.1"
msgid "So many knobs. Don't touch, don't touch."
msgstr "这么多旋钮，别碰别碰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.2"
msgid "Probably does science stuff. That's my guess."
msgstr "大概是干科学的吧，我猜的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.1"
msgid "Matches the description. I actually listened for once."
msgstr "跟描述对得上，难得我认真听了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.2"
msgid "Good, this one I can just carry back."
msgstr "好，这个直接拿回去就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.1"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's his problem now."
msgstr "不管是啥，交给他头疼吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.2"
msgid "Looks like a spoon that went to college."
msgstr "像上过大学的勺子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.1"
msgid "Walk the plank? Not unless there's a snack bar down there."
msgstr "走跳板？下面有小卖部再说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.2"
msgid "This is a one-way ticket to swimming class."
msgstr "这是通往游泳课的单程票。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.1"
msgid "Fancy stone plank. Still ends in water."
msgstr "石头做的跳板，再讲究底下也是水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.2"
msgid "Old as dirt and still built for jumping off."
msgstr "古老成这样，还是用来往下跳的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.1"
msgid "Grass? I weigh more than this can hold."
msgstr "草编的？可撑不住我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.2"
msgid "One wrong step and I'm swimming."
msgstr "踩错一步我就得游泳了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.1"
msgid "Dragon decorations on a plank. Festive drowning."
msgstr "跳板上挂龙装饰，喜庆地落水。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.2"
msgid "Even the dragon looks like it doesn't want to jump."
msgstr "连龙都一副不想跳的样子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "Feels like it's watching me back."
msgstr "感觉它也在盯着我看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "Nightmares can't get through. Probably."
msgstr "噩梦应该穿不过来吧，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.1"
msgid "Hay and fire. Who saw that coming? Everyone."
msgstr "干草碰上火，谁想得到？所有人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.2"
msgid "Crispy wall. Doesn't even smell good."
msgstr "烤脆的墙，闻着都不香。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "One sneeze and it's gone."
msgstr "打个喷嚏就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Basically a pile of straw pretending to be a wall."
msgstr "基本就是装成墙的一堆草。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK.1"
msgid "Even my bat bounces off this."
msgstr "连我的球棒都会被弹回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK.2"
msgid "Moon wall. Fancy, and cold to lean on."
msgstr "月亮墙，高级，靠着还凉凉的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS.1"
msgid "Older than my teachers, and way sturdier."
msgstr "比我的老师们还老，还结实多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS.2"
msgid "Ancient walls, still doing their job. Unlike me."
msgstr "古代的墙还在尽职，不像我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2.1"
msgid "Another chunk of ancient wall. Still holding up."
msgstr "又一截古墙，还撑着呢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2.2"
msgid "Lean on it and it doesn't even budge. Nice."
msgstr "靠上去都纹丝不动，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP.1"
msgid "Looks like a garbage pile with ambition."
msgstr "像一堆有理想的垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP.2"
msgid "Rusty, noisy, and somehow still standing."
msgstr "又锈又吵，居然还立着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE.1"
msgid "Solid. I can finally nap behind something."
msgstr "挺结实，终于能躲后面睡觉了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE.2"
msgid "Stone's good. Even hounds can't chew it."
msgstr "石头好，猎犬也啃不动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2.1"
msgid "More stone wall. Good, more napping space."
msgstr "又是石墙，好，又多一块午睡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2.2"
msgid "Stacked nice and neat. Not like my desk."
msgstr "垒得整整齐齐，不像我的桌子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT.1"
msgid "Charcoal fence now. Very useful. Not."
msgstr "现在是木炭围栏了，真有用。才怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burned down. Should've gone with stone."
msgstr "烧没了，早该用石头的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pointy fence. Don't lean on this one."
msgstr "尖尖的围栏，这个可别靠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wooden wall. Good enough until something hits it."
msgstr "木墙，在被撞之前够用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.1"
msgid "Smells a little like a walrus. Because it was."
msgstr "有股海象味，毕竟以前就是海象的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.2"
msgid "Plaid and fuzzy. Very grandpa chic."
msgstr "格子加毛茸茸，很有老爷爷风。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Empty igloo. Can I move in?"
msgstr "空的冰屋，我能先住下吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Nobody's home. Snack raid time? No? Fine."
msgstr "没人在家，偷点零食？不行？好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "MacTusk's in there with those darts. Pass."
msgstr "麦克塔斯克在里面拿着吹箭，算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Knock knock? Nope, I hear growling."
msgstr "咚咚咚？不了，我听见低吼了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.1"
msgid "Big tooth. Good thing it's not mine."
msgstr "好大一颗牙，还好不是我的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.2"
msgid "Walrus dentist would be proud."
msgstr "海象的牙医会很骄傲的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Walter, that's not in the scout handbook."
msgstr "沃尔特，童子军手册上可没这条。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Hey, put the slingshot down before I take it."
msgstr "喂，弹弓放下，不然我没收了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.1"
msgid "Floating's not a merit badge, Walter."
msgstr "飘着可不是什么徽章，沃尔特。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.2"
msgid "Hang tight. Woby's waiting, so I'll hurry."
msgstr "撑住，沃比在等，我快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Wanda, can you rewind that fire, please?"
msgstr "旺达，能把这场火倒回去吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Burning stuff won't make time go faster."
msgstr "烧东西又不会让时间走快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.1"
msgid "Time's not up yet. I'll fix this."
msgstr "时间还没到，我来想办法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.2"
msgid "Even a clockmaker runs late sometimes. Hold on."
msgstr "钟表匠也会迟到嘛，等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Rewind all you want, I saw that!"
msgstr "随你怎么倒带，我都看见了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.2"
msgid "You can't undo this one, Wanda!"
msgstr "这次你可倒不回去了，旺达！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A beefalo with luggage? Where's it going?"
msgstr "带着行李的牛？要去哪儿啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something about it feels like a costume."
msgstr "总觉得它像穿着戏服。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.1"
msgid "So you were a trader all along. Show me the goods."
msgstr "原来你是商人啊，拿出来看看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.2"
msgid "Any food in there? I'll trade my homework."
msgstr "里面有吃的吗？我拿作业跟你换。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.1"
msgid "A dog boss. I'm a cat person now."
msgstr "狗老大，我决定当猫派了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.2"
msgid "Bring all your friends, my bat's got room."
msgstr "朋友都叫来吧，我的球棒管够。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Burn it all the way. No sequels."
msgstr "烧干净，别出续集。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Smells like a barbecue I didn't order."
msgstr "闻着像我没点的烧烤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Big dead dog. Poking it with my bat, just in case."
msgstr "死掉的大狗，拿球棒戳一下保险。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Is it really out? Last time something stood back up."
msgstr "真的断气了吗？上次就有东西站起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Seriously? Rest already!"
msgstr "认真的吗？安息吧你！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Round two? I didn't even finish my snack!"
msgstr "第二回合？我零食还没吃完！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.1"
msgid "A smaller varg. Still too big to pet."
msgstr "小一号的座狼，还是大到没法摸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.2"
msgid "Small boss, same bad attitude."
msgstr "小老大，脾气一样坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Warly, I'll eat anything, just stop swinging!"
msgstr "沃利，我什么都吃，别挥了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Is this about me sneaking snacks from the pot?"
msgstr "是因为我偷吃锅里的东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Chef, that's way overcooked!"
msgstr "主厨，这火候太过了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Warly, did you forget which thing to cook?"
msgstr "沃利，你是忘了该煮哪个了吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.1"
msgid "Who's cooking tonight if you're floating? Hold on."
msgstr "你飘着谁来做晚饭？等我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.2"
msgid "Wait right there. I still need your soup."
msgstr "在那儿等着，我还要喝你的汤。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Chefs feed people, not this!"
msgstr "厨师是喂饱大家的，不是干这个的！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Warly, what happened to you?!"
msgstr "沃利，你到底怎么了？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Battle armor for beefalo. Glad I'm not the target."
msgstr "牛的战甲，还好我不是对手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "Spikes and plates. It's ready for a school brawl."
msgstr "又是刺又是板，像要去打群架。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.1"
msgid "Killer bees. Even I'm not dumb enough to poke that."
msgstr "杀人蜂，我再傻也不会去捅。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.2"
msgid "That buzzing gets angrier the closer I get."
msgstr "越靠近，嗡嗡声越凶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.1"
msgid "Split it with one punch? Tempting."
msgstr "一拳劈开？挺心动的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.2"
msgid "Summer in a big green ball."
msgstr "绿色大球里装着夏天。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.1"
msgid "Cold and sweet. Brain freeze, here I come."
msgstr "又冰又甜，脑袋要冻住了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.2"
msgid "Eat it fast before it melts on my hand."
msgstr "赶紧吃，别化在手上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.1"
msgid "Who grills watermelon? Weirdos, that's who."
msgstr "谁会烤西瓜啊？怪人才会。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.2"
msgid "Warm watermelon. Tastes confused."
msgstr "热西瓜，味道很迷茫。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Giant watermelon! Bat practice or lunch?"
msgstr "巨型西瓜！拿来练球棒还是吃掉？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I could carry this one-handed. Probably."
msgstr "我单手就能抱起来，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.1"
msgid "Spit them out and they'll grow? Lazy farming."
msgstr "吐出去就能长？懒人种田法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.2"
msgid "Tiny seeds for a huge fruit. Unfair."
msgstr "这么小的种子长那么大的瓜，不公平。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.1"
msgid "Seaweed with a temper. Just like me in the morning."
msgstr "有脾气的海草，跟早上的我一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.2"
msgid "Pretty flower, nasty attitude."
msgstr "花挺漂亮，脾气挺坏。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.1"
msgid "Tiny sea weed. Grow up nice, okay?"
msgstr "小海草，长大了要乖哦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.2"
msgid "It's still too small to throw things. Enjoy that."
msgstr "还小到不会扔东西，珍惜吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.1"
msgid "Incoming! I'm batting that back!"
msgstr "飞过来了！我给它打回去！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.2"
msgid "Dodgeball, but with explosives. Gym class flashback."
msgstr "带炸药的躲避球，想起体育课了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.1"
msgid "Toss it in the sea and hope. My kind of farming."
msgstr "扔进海里听天由命，我喜欢的种法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.2"
msgid "Plant it on rocks? Weird, but okay."
msgstr "种在礁石上？怪，不过行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "Giant tree in the sea. Best nap spot ever."
msgstr "海里的大树，最棒的午睡地点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "Shade, water, quiet. Wake me in an hour."
msgstr "有树荫，有水，还安静，一小时后叫我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.1"
msgid "Roots in the water? Bonk, there goes the hull."
msgstr "水里有根？咚，船底没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.2"
msgid "Chop them later. Steer around for now."
msgstr "以后再砍，先绕开。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT.1"
msgid "Coated in wax. Like those fake fruits at grandma's."
msgstr "裹了蜡，像奶奶家那种假水果。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT.2"
msgid "Low maintenance. My favorite kind of plant."
msgstr "不用管，我最喜欢的植物类型。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Maxwell, put those shadows away before I bat them."
msgstr "麦斯威尔，影子收好，不然我打了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Fancy suit, rude manners."
msgstr "衣服挺讲究，礼貌不太行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Back to your old tricks, Maxwell?!"
msgstr "又回到老一套了，麦斯威尔？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Shadows or not, that's way over the line!"
msgstr "管你什么影子，这太过分了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Webber, quit biting! I'm not food!"
msgstr "韦伯，别咬了！我不是吃的！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Hey, I know you're sweet. Stop this."
msgstr "喂，我知道你是好孩子，别这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Webber, fire and spiders don't mix!"
msgstr "韦伯，火和蜘蛛可不搭！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Did someone teach you that? Stop it."
msgstr "谁教你的？快停下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL.1"
msgid "Let's give him a proper burial. Quietly."
msgstr "好好安葬他吧，安静点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL.2"
msgid "Even I don't feel like joking right now."
msgstr "这会儿连我都不想开玩笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION.1"
msgid "Friendly spiders. Still too many legs."
msgstr "友好的蜘蛛，腿还是太多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION.2"
msgid "Good spiders. Just don't sleep in my hair."
msgstr "乖蜘蛛，别在我头发里睡觉就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY.1"
msgid "Spiny bindweed. Touch it and it stings back."
msgstr "多刺旋花，一碰就扎人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY.2"
msgid "Pulling this barehanded? No thanks."
msgstr "空手拔这个？算了吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Wendy, stop! This isn't you!"
msgstr "温蒂，停下！这不像你！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Even for you, that's way too dark!"
msgstr "就算是你，这也太黑暗了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Mimes can't pretend fire away, Wes."
msgstr "韦斯，默剧可演不灭火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Invisible bucket won't work. Real water, now!"
msgstr "隐形水桶没用，快拿真水！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST.1"
msgid "Ghost mime. Even quieter than before."
msgstr "幽灵默剧演员，比以前还安静。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST.2"
msgid "Stop miming \"help me\". I got it."
msgstr "别比划“救命”了，我懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER.1"
msgid "No act gets you out of this, Wes!"
msgstr "这次怎么演都没用，韦斯！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Wes! That's not a performance!"
msgstr "韦斯！这可不是表演！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP.1"
msgid "Cafeteria mystery meat, but worse."
msgstr "比食堂的神秘肉还糟。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP.2"
msgid "Even I won't eat this. That says a lot."
msgstr "连我都不吃，这说明问题了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER.1"
msgid "Soggy like my homework after the rain."
msgstr "软塌塌的，跟淋了雨的作业一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER.2"
msgid "Reading it? Everything's smudged anyway."
msgstr "看？字早就糊了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH.1"
msgid "Something's sloshing inside. Gross, but I'm curious."
msgstr "里面有东西在晃，恶心，但好奇。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH.2"
msgid "Fished up a soggy bag. Treasure? Maybe."
msgstr "捞上来个湿袋子，宝贝？说不定。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Librarians burning stuff? That's backwards!"
msgstr "图书管理员烧东西？反了吧！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom, the fire's way too close to the shelves!"
msgstr "薇克伯顿，火离书架太近了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER.1"
msgid "That's not a lesson, that's a crime!"
msgstr "这不是上课，是犯罪！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Wickerbottom, put the book down. Now."
msgstr "薇克伯顿，把书放下，马上。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Willow, Bernie's crying. Okay, he's not, but stop!"
msgstr "薇洛，伯尼在哭。好吧没哭，但快停下！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Seriously, find a hobby that isn't arson."
msgstr "说真的，找个不放火的爱好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Willow, put the lighter away! This isn't fun!"
msgstr "薇洛，打火机收起来！这一点都不好玩！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Stop it! We're supposed to be friends!"
msgstr "住手！我们不是朋友吗！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Is this an experiment? Because I'm hitting back."
msgstr "这是实验吗？我可要还手了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Wilson, science doesn't mean punching me."
msgstr "威尔逊，科学可不包括揍我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wilson, your hair's doing the thing again."
msgstr "威尔逊，你的头发又竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Science guy. Can you invent a nap machine?"
msgstr "科学家，能发明个睡觉机器吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST.1"
msgid "Floating Wilson. Very scientific. Hang on."
msgstr "飘着的威尔逊，很科学，等着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST.2"
msgid "Your hair still sticks up as a ghost. Impressive."
msgstr "当了鬼头发还竖着，厉害。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Winona, that's not how you test equipment!"
msgstr "薇诺娜，测试设备不是这么测的！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Fire hazard! Didn't you lecture us about safety?"
msgstr "火灾隐患！你不是还给我们讲过安全吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.1"
msgid "Hold on, boss. I'll patch you up."
msgstr "等着，老大，我来把你修好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.2"
msgid "Don't worry, I'm faster than a repair crew."
msgstr "别急，我比维修队快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1"
msgid "Smells like cinnamon and holiday cheer."
msgstr "闻着有肉桂和过节的味道。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2"
msgid "Festive fuel? Can I eat it? No? Lame."
msgstr "节日燃料？能吃吗？不能？没劲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.1"
msgid "Head first. That's just how I am."
msgstr "先咬头，我就这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.2"
msgid "Sorry, little guy. You look delicious."
msgstr "对不起啦小家伙，你看着太好吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.1"
msgid "One more. Okay, two more."
msgstr "再来一块。好吧，两块。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.2"
msgid "Crunchy and sweet. My kind of holiday."
msgstr "脆脆甜甜，我喜欢的节日。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.1"
msgid "Shaped like a hook. Perfect for grabbing more candy."
msgstr "形状像钩子，刚好用来勾更多糖。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.2"
msgid "Peppermint. Freshens my breath after all that snacking."
msgstr "薄荷味，吃完零食正好清清口气。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.1"
msgid "Fruitcake that never goes bad? Suspicious."
msgstr "永远不会坏的水果蛋糕？可疑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.2"
msgid "Hard enough to use as a bat."
msgstr "硬得能当球棒用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.1"
msgid "A chocolate log. Best kind of firewood."
msgstr "巧克力木头，最好的柴火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.2"
msgid "Chocolate! I'm taking the end piece."
msgstr "巧克力！末端那块归我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.1"
msgid "Plum pudding. Fancy name, tasty face."
msgstr "李子布丁，名字讲究，长得也好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.2"
msgid "Rich and sweet. Gone in three bites."
msgstr "浓浓甜甜，三口就没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.1"
msgid "Warm and fruity. My hands finally thawed out."
msgstr "暖暖的果香，手终于不冻了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.2"
msgid "Drink it, then eat the cup. Zero dishes to wash."
msgstr "喝完再吃杯子，一个碗都不用洗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.1"
msgid "Cocoa! Marshmallows would make it perfect."
msgstr "可可！再加棉花糖就完美了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.2"
msgid "Better than any blanket on a cold night."
msgstr "冷天晚上比被子还管用。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.1"
msgid "Sweet and creamy. Milk moustache included."
msgstr "又甜又浓，喝完还送一圈白胡子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.2"
msgid "Is it eggs? Is it milk? Who cares, it's good."
msgstr "是蛋还是奶？管它呢，好喝就行。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.1"
msgid "Shiny ball. Don't drop it, it breaks."
msgstr "亮晶晶的球，别摔了，会碎。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.2"
msgid "Pretty. Doesn't do anything, but pretty."
msgstr "好看，没什么用，但好看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.1"
msgid "A trophy you can hang on a tree. Nice."
msgstr "能挂树上的奖杯，不错。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.2"
msgid "Earned the hard way. Gets the top branch."
msgstr "辛苦打来的，要挂最高那根枝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.1"
msgid "Hot and sweaty memories. Not my favorite."
msgstr "又热又出汗的回忆，不太喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.2"
msgid "Lava arena in ornament size. Cute, actually."
msgstr "熔岩竞技场的缩小版，还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.1"
msgid "Shaped like food but tastes like plastic. Rude."
msgstr "长得像吃的，尝起来像塑料，过分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.2"
msgid "Don't hang it near me. I might bite it."
msgstr "别挂我旁边，我可能会咬。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.1"
msgid "Twinkly. Kind of like a nightlight."
msgstr "一闪一闪的，像小夜灯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.2"
msgid "Plug it in. Wait, where's the outlet?"
msgstr "插上电。等等，插座在哪？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.1"
msgid "From Pearl? Guess it's special."
msgstr "珀尔给的？那应该挺特别的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.2"
msgid "Shiny like a pearl. Because it kinda is."
msgstr "像珍珠一样亮，毕竟算是珍珠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Who set the holiday on fire?!"
msgstr "谁把节日点着了？！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Water! Snow! Anything!"
msgstr "水！雪！什么都行！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "No tree, no gifts. Worst holiday ever."
msgstr "没树没礼物，最糟的节日。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Crispy ornaments. I'm going back to bed."
msgstr "装饰都烤焦了，我回去睡了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.1"
msgid "Bare branches. Gimme the ornaments."
msgstr "光秃秃的，装饰给我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.2"
msgid "Decorating sounds like work. Fun work, though."
msgstr "装饰听着像干活，不过是好玩的活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.1"
msgid "A baby tree. Grow faster, holidays won't wait."
msgstr "小树苗，长快点，节日不等人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.2"
msgid "Too tiny. One ornament and it'd tip over."
msgstr "太小了，挂一个就倒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.1"
msgid "A wobster apartment. No rent, nice view."
msgstr "龙虾公寓，免租金，景色好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.2"
msgid "Fish them out and dinner's settled."
msgstr "钓出来，晚饭就有着落了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "Glassy lobster. Can't even eat it, what a scam."
msgstr "玻璃龙虾，还不能吃，骗人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "Sparkly shell. Looks crunchy in a bad way."
msgstr "亮晶晶的壳，看着脆得不好吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.1"
msgid "Big claws, small brain. Dinner."
msgstr "大钳子，小脑袋，晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.2"
msgid "Snap all you want, I'm hungrier."
msgstr "随便夹，我比你饿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.1"
msgid "Lobster dinner, here we come."
msgstr "龙虾大餐，我来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.2"
msgid "Stopped snapping. Good, my turn."
msgstr "不夹了，好，轮到我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.1"
msgid "Red and steaming. Best color for food."
msgstr "红红的还冒热气，食物最好看的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll crack the shell myself. Easy."
msgstr "壳我自己掰，轻松。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Want an arm-wrestle instead? Quit punching."
msgstr "要不改掰手腕？别打了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Wolfgang, I'm stronger than I look. Back off."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈，我比看起来有劲，退后。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.1"
msgid "Mighty man, tiny ghost. I'll be quick."
msgstr "大力士变小幽灵了，我快点。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.2"
msgid "Don't cry, Wolfgang. I'll fix it."
msgstr "别哭，沃尔夫冈，我来想办法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Wolfgang, use your muscles for good!"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈，力气要用在正道上！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Strength isn't for this, Wolfgang!"
msgstr "力气不是这么用的，沃尔夫冈！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Monkey business! Knock it off!"
msgstr "猴子捣乱！快住手！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Throw one more thing and I'm swinging back."
msgstr "再扔一样，我就挥棒了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Monkeys and fire? That's a terrible combo."
msgstr "猴子加火？太糟的组合。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Hey, banana brain, put that out!"
msgstr "喂，香蕉脑袋，快灭火！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Cursed trinkets again? Told you not to grab them."
msgstr "又是被诅咒的小玩意？说了别乱捡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "You smell like bananas now. Just saying."
msgstr "你现在一股香蕉味，说一下而已。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.1"
msgid "A monkey ghost. That's new."
msgstr "猴子幽灵，第一次见。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.2"
msgid "Hang in there. Like, from a branch."
msgstr "挺住，像挂在树枝上那样挺住。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Even monkeys know that's wrong!"
msgstr "连猴子都知道这样不对！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "That's way past monkeying around!"
msgstr "这可不是猴子捣乱那么简单了！"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.1"
msgid "Saved by a monkey. Don't tell anyone."
msgstr "被猴子救了，别告诉别人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.2"
msgid "You're hairy, but you're a good friend."
msgstr "你毛茸茸的，但是个好朋友。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.1"
msgid "Honking at me won't make me run laps, Woodie."
msgstr "冲我嘎嘎叫也没用，伍迪，我不跑圈。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.2"
msgid "Perfect. Now go fetch me snacks at that speed."
msgstr "正好，用这速度帮我去买点零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.1"
msgid "Even your ghost has feathers. Kind of impressive."
msgstr "连鬼魂都带羽毛，挺厉害的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.2"
msgid "Hold still, goose boy. I'll fix this."
msgstr "鹅先生别乱飘，我来想办法。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.1"
msgid "Okay, you can carry the heavy stuff today."
msgstr "行，今天重活归你了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.2"
msgid "Arm wrestle later? I'm curious who wins."
msgstr "等会儿掰手腕？我挺好奇谁赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.1"
msgid "A ghost moose. Now I've seen everything."
msgstr "鹿鬼都见到了，我算是长见识了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.2"
msgid "Lucy's gonna nag me if I leave you like this."
msgstr "把你丢着不管，露西肯定要念叨我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Woodie, people aren't trees. Put the axe down."
msgstr "伍迪，人又不是树，把斧头放下。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Even Lucy looks embarrassed for you right now."
msgstr "连露西都替你丢人了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Great, charcoal furniture. Very trendy."
msgstr "好嘛，木炭家具，真时髦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Lunch is canceled. Blame whoever played with fire."
msgstr "午饭取消，去找玩火的人算账。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Good height for napping on. Like a school desk."
msgstr "高度正好趴着睡，跟课桌一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A table with no food on it. Tragic."
msgstr "桌上一点吃的都没有，太惨了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "Whoever put that there, it's mine now."
msgstr "不管谁放的，现在归我了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "Finally, the table's doing its job."
msgstr "总算有桌子该有的样子了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.1"
msgid "Dirt doesn't wiggle. Something's under there."
msgstr "土又不会扭，底下肯定有东西。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.2"
msgid "If it pops up, it meets my bat."
msgstr "敢冒出来就尝尝我的球棒。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.1"
msgid "Free glowing fruit? Yeah, nothing's free."
msgstr "白送会发光的果子？天下没这种好事。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.2"
msgid "Classic bait. I fall for that at the bakery, not here."
msgstr "典型的诱饵，我只在面包店上这种当。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.1"
msgid "Ugh, it's way bigger than a garden worm."
msgstr "呃，这比花园里的蚯蚓大太多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.2"
msgid "Batter up. Hold still, noodle."
msgstr "准备击球，面条你别动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.1"
msgid "It looks like me during finals week."
msgstr "跟我期末周的样子一模一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.2"
msgid "Gross. I'm not jumping into a sick mouth."
msgstr "好恶心，生病的嘴我才不跳。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.1"
msgid "My stomach would glow if I ate it. Tempting."
msgstr "吃下去肚子会发光吧，有点心动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.2"
msgid "Nice nightlight. Smells weirdly sweet, though."
msgstr "当小夜灯不错，就是闻着甜得奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.1"
msgid "Small glow, small snack. Still counts."
msgstr "光小一点，零食也算零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.2"
msgid "Like a phone on one percent battery."
msgstr "就跟手机只剩百分之一电一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.1"
msgid "Pretty light. Probably a trap. Most pretty things are."
msgstr "挺好看的光，八成是陷阱，好看的都这样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.2"
msgid "I'll poke it with my bat first."
msgstr "先拿球棒戳戳看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.1"
msgid "Hey, plant buddy. Don't wilt on me."
msgstr "喂，植物小伙伴，别给我枯了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.2"
msgid "Your flowers fell off. I'll get you back."
msgstr "你的花都掉了，我带你回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. Wormwood's gonna be sad."
msgstr "可怜的小家伙，沃姆伍德要难过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'm not telling him. You tell him."
msgstr "我可不去说，你去跟他说。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A carrot with legs. Food that runs is cheating."
msgstr "长了腿的胡萝卜，会跑的食物太犯规了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Relax, I won't eat Wormwood's pal. Probably."
msgstr "放心，我不吃沃姆伍德的朋友，大概。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.1"
msgid "It's tickling me. Cut it out."
msgstr "好痒，别闹了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.2"
msgid "Pockets are for snacks, not for living snacks."
msgstr "口袋是装零食的，不是装活零食的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Lucky. I want a nap too."
msgstr "真好，我也想睡午觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Shh. If it wakes up, it's your fault."
msgstr "嘘，吵醒了算你的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A dragon fruit that's an actual dragon. Cute."
msgstr "火龙果真成龙了，还挺可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Wormwood keeps the weirdest pets."
msgstr "沃姆伍德养的宠物一个比一个怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1"
msgid "It smells delicious. I'm trying very hard here."
msgstr "闻着好香，我在拼命忍着。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2"
msgid "Red means angry or tasty. Not sure which."
msgstr "红了是生气还是好吃，我分不清。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Snoring fruit. Now I've heard it all."
msgstr "会打呼的水果，真是什么都见过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "Let it sleep. Grumpy dragons are the worst."
msgstr "让它睡吧，起床气的龙最麻烦。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.1"
msgid "A flying lamp. Saves me carrying a torch."
msgstr "会飞的灯，省得我举火把了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.2"
msgid "Can it follow me to the toilet at night?"
msgstr "晚上上厕所它能跟着我吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.1"
msgid "That's not a worm. That's a whole train."
msgstr "这哪是虫子，根本是一列火车。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.2"
msgid "My bat feels really small right now."
msgstr "我的球棒突然显得好小。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Its shadow is bigger than our whole camp."
msgstr "它的影子比我们营地还大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Great, now the ground has teeth."
msgstr "好极了，现在连地面都长牙了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.1"
msgid "Not so bouncy now, huh, horn head?"
msgstr "角先生，现在蹦不起来了吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.2"
msgid "You owe me a soul for this. Joking."
msgstr "这回你欠我一个灵魂，开玩笑的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Nobody's laughing, Wortox."
msgstr "沃拓克斯，没人在笑。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.2"
msgid "That joke went way too far. Cut it out."
msgstr "这玩笑开过头了，给我住手。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Wurt, fish people and fire don't mix."
msgstr "沃特，鱼人跟火可合不来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Even I know matches aren't toys. And I skip class."
msgstr "连我这种逃课的都知道火柴不能玩。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Hey, little fish. This isn't like you."
msgstr "喂，小鱼，这不像你。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Glurgh all you want, I'm still taking that spear."
msgstr "随你咕噜，矛我还是要没收。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY.1"
msgid "Can it bring me lunch? Asking for me."
msgstr "能给我送午饭吗？替我自己问的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_DELIVERY.2"
msgid "Finally, a delivery guy who never sleeps in."
msgstr "总算有个从不睡过头的快递员了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP.1"
msgid "Buzzing over my head like a mosquito with attitude."
msgstr "在我头上嗡嗡转，像只拽拽的蚊子。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_DRONE_ZAP.2"
msgid "One zap at me and it's a home run."
msgstr "敢电我一下就把它打出全垒打。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I bit it. My tooth lost."
msgstr "我咬了一口，牙输了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Even cafeteria bread is softer than this."
msgstr "食堂的面包都比这软。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET.1"
msgid "Now it's a soggy rock. Big improvement."
msgstr "现在成了泡软的石头，进步真大。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_FOODBRICK.WET.2"
msgid "Smells like wet cardboard. I'll pass."
msgstr "闻着像湿纸箱，我就不吃了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A robot backpack. Can I borrow it for homework? No wait."
msgstr "机器人书包，借来装作业？算了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_INVENTORYCONTAINER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Bet it just stores spare bolts in there."
msgstr "里面肯定全是备用螺丝。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY.1"
msgid "Creepy. It moves like it skipped warm-ups."
msgstr "好吓人，动作跟没热身似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_POSSESSEDBODY.2"
msgid "Hey, WX! Is that you or not? Answer me."
msgstr "喂，WX！是你还是不是你？回个话。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Don't scan me. I'm not interesting."
msgstr "别扫我，我没什么好看的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Works harder than I ever have."
msgstr "比我这辈子都勤快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING.1"
msgid "It looks lost. Same."
msgstr "它看起来迷路了，我也是。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.HUNTING.2"
msgid "Keep searching, little guy. I'll nap meanwhile."
msgstr "小家伙慢慢找，我先睡会儿。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING.1"
msgid "Beep beep. Like a supermarket checkout."
msgstr "哔哔哔，跟超市收银似的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER.SCANNING.2"
msgid "Freeze, critter. Let it finish taking notes."
msgstr "小东西别动，让它记完。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED.1"
msgid "Homework's done. Wish mine did itself like that."
msgstr "作业写完了，我的要是也能自己写就好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WX78_SCANNER_SUCCEEDED.2"
msgid "WX is gonna be smug about this."
msgstr "WX又要得意了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.1"
msgid "A pointy stick with manners. Louis would like it."
msgstr "有礼貌的尖棍子，路易斯肯定喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.2"
msgid "My bat's shorter, but it hits harder."
msgstr "我的球棒短一点，可打得更狠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.1"
msgid "Shiny like a lemon candy. Not edible, sadly."
msgstr "亮得像柠檬糖，可惜不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.2"
msgid "Yellow. Like the stars I never got on tests."
msgstr "黄的，就像我考试从没拿过的小星星。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.1"
msgid "It's staring at me. Rude."
msgstr "它一直盯着我，真没礼貌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.2"
msgid "A map pin that blinks. Fancy."
msgstr "会眨眼的地图图钉，挺高级。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Grr. It's trying so hard to look scary."
msgstr "嗷，它在很努力地装凶。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "This one looks like the guys who pick fights with me."
msgstr "这只跟那些找我打架的人一个样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB.1"
msgid "Fierce look, fierce score. Hopefully."
msgstr "长得凶，分数也凶吧，希望如此。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.YOTB.2"
msgid "Go win something so I can sleep."
msgstr "快去拿个奖，我好去睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Fluffy. Good pillow material."
msgstr "毛茸茸的，当枕头正合适。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Don't tell anyone I hugged it."
msgstr "别跟人说我抱过它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB.1"
msgid "Cute counts as points, right?"
msgstr "可爱也算分吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_DOLL.YOTB.2"
msgid "Judges love fluffy stuff. Trust me."
msgstr "评委最吃毛茸茸这一套，信我。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "So many decorations. Is it a cake?"
msgstr "装饰这么多，是蛋糕吗？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks like it's about to start a parade."
msgstr "看起来马上要去游行了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.YOTB.1"
msgid "Festive enough to win, I bet."
msgstr "这么喜庆，我赌能赢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FESTIVE.YOTB.2"
msgid "Holiday spirit. Points, please."
msgstr "过节气氛拉满了，快给分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Dressed better than me on graduation day."
msgstr "比我毕业那天穿得还体面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A tiny tux. Who is it trying to impress?"
msgstr "小小的礼服，它想讨好谁啊？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.YOTB.1"
msgid "Classy wins contests. Probably."
msgstr "有格调就能赢，大概吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_FORMAL.YOTB.2"
msgid "Stand up straight, little guy. Judge is watching."
msgstr "小家伙站直，评委在看。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Looks nice for summer. Hug it when it's hot."
msgstr "夏天看着就凉快，热了就抱它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Frosty fur. Like a popsicle that moos."
msgstr "毛上结霜，像一根会哞的冰棍。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.YOTB.1"
msgid "Cool look. Literally."
msgstr "造型很酷，字面意思上的酷。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ICE.YOTB.2"
msgid "Hopefully the judge isn't cold-hearted."
msgstr "希望评委别太冷漠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wormwood would want this one."
msgstr "沃姆伍德会想要这个。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It smells like a flower shop. Kind of nice."
msgstr "闻着像花店，还挺舒服的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.YOTB.1"
msgid "Flowers are a safe bet. Everyone likes flowers."
msgstr "放花准没错，谁都喜欢花。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_NATURE.YOTB.2"
msgid "Go on, bloom for the judge."
msgstr "去吧，给评委开个花。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "WX would call this an upgrade."
msgstr "WX肯定说这是升级版。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Beep moo. Weird combo."
msgstr "哔哔哞，组合真怪。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.YOTB.1"
msgid "Robots are cool. Judges should know that."
msgstr "机器人很酷，评委应该懂。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_ROBOT.YOTB.2"
msgid "If it loses, blame the wiring."
msgstr "要是输了，就怪线路吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Frills on a beefalo. Somebody had free time."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛穿荷叶边，有人真闲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks like it drinks tea with its pinky out."
msgstr "看着像会翘着小指喝茶的那种。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.YOTB.1"
msgid "Fancy enough for the judge, I think."
msgstr "这么讲究，评委应该会喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_VICTORIAN.YOTB.2"
msgid "Elegant. Unlike me. Go win it."
msgstr "很优雅，跟我不一样，去拿奖吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Tiny armor. Tiny war. Cute."
msgstr "小盔甲，小战争，好可爱。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Looks ready to fight a pillow."
msgstr "看起来随时要去跟枕头决斗。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.YOTB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.YOTB.1"
msgid "March on, tiny soldier. Win me a prize."
msgstr "前进吧小士兵，给我赢个奖回来。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.YOTB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_WAR.YOTB.2"
msgid "Battle-ready. Judge, don't mess with it."
msgstr "全副武装了，评委别惹它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST.1"
msgid "A post. My beefalo will chew on it, I know it."
msgstr "一根柱子，我家牛肯定要啃它。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST.2"
msgid "Stand here and look pretty. That's the whole job."
msgstr "站这里装好看就行，就这么点活。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.1"
msgid "Sewing for a cow. My life took a turn."
msgstr "给牛做衣服，我人生拐了个大弯。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.2"
msgid "Home ec was the only class I didn't skip. Kinda."
msgstr "家政课是我唯一没逃的课，差不多吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.1"
msgid "Somebody's hiding in there. Creepy."
msgstr "里面有人躲着，好诡异。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.2"
msgid "A whole stage for cows. Okay then."
msgstr "专门给牛搭的舞台，行吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT.1"
msgid "It's toast. Like my motivation."
msgstr "烧成炭了，跟我的干劲一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Guess we'll just run in circles now."
msgstr "那就只能原地转圈了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Left, right. Even I struggle with this."
msgstr "左、右，连我都容易弄混。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Turn signals for carrots. Seriously?"
msgstr "给胡萝卜练转向，认真的？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT.1"
msgid "Good. Now don't forget it by tomorrow."
msgstr "很好，明天别又忘了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.RAT.2"
msgid "Nope, other way. Ugh, fine, close enough."
msgstr "不对，另一边。唉，算了，差不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT.1"
msgid "Too slow to dodge the fire, I guess."
msgstr "看来反应不够快，没躲过火。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burnt. Training's canceled. Yay."
msgstr "烧了，训练取消，太好了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Like a pop quiz, but for vegetables."
msgstr "跟随堂测验一样，就是给蔬菜考的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Quick reflexes. Something I only have for food."
msgstr "反应要快，我只在抢吃的时候快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT.1"
msgid "Whoa, it actually flinched in time."
msgstr "哇，它居然及时反应过来了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_REACTION.RAT.2"
msgid "Nice dodge. Better than my teacher's chalk aim."
msgstr "躲得好，比老师扔粉笔准多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT.1"
msgid "Gym's closed forever. My favorite kind of gym."
msgstr "健身房永久关门，我最喜欢这种健身房。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.BURNT.2"
msgid "Smells like roasted carrot in there."
msgstr "里面一股烤胡萝卜味。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A hamster wheel for veggies. Okay."
msgstr "给蔬菜用的仓鼠轮，好吧。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Running for fun? Can't relate."
msgstr "为了好玩去跑步？理解不了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT.1"
msgid "Go go go! Pretend I've got snacks at the end."
msgstr "冲冲冲！就当终点有零食。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_SPEED.RAT.2"
msgid "Look at those little legs spin."
msgstr "看那小短腿转得飞快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT.1"
msgid "Rest day. I approve."
msgstr "休息日，我同意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.BURNT.2"
msgid "Burned out. Same here, buddy."
msgstr "烧没了，我也一样，伙计。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Endurance training. My worst subject."
msgstr "耐力训练，我最差的科目。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Like the school marathon. I hid behind the gym."
msgstr "跟学校长跑一样，我当时躲在体育馆后面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT.1"
msgid "You're doing better than I would."
msgstr "你比我能坚持多了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_STAMINA.RAT.2"
msgid "Keep going. Carrots don't sweat, right?"
msgstr "继续跑，胡萝卜不会出汗吧？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.1"
msgid "No shortcuts. Trust me, I tried."
msgstr "别想抄近路，我试过了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.2"
msgid "A checkpoint. Like roll call, but for carrats."
msgstr "检查点，跟点名一样，只不过点的是胡萝卜鼠。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.1"
msgid "No finish line means nobody loses. Nice."
msgstr "没终点就没人输，挺好。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.2"
msgid "Who burns a finish line? Seriously."
msgstr "谁会去烧终点线啊，真是的。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Finish line. My favorite part of any race."
msgstr "终点线，比赛里我最喜欢的部分。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Whoever crosses first gets bragging rights."
msgstr "谁先冲过去谁就能吹牛。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.1"
msgid "Told you. Mine's the fastest."
msgstr "早说了，我家的最快。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.2"
msgid "Victory snack time. Don't argue."
msgstr "胜利零食时间，别跟我抢。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START.1"
msgid "On your marks. Don't trip on the start."
msgstr "各就各位，起跑别摔了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START.2"
msgid "Whoever wins, I'm napping after."
msgstr "谁赢都行，跑完我要睡觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Good. Nobody gets judged today."
msgstr "挺好，今天谁都不用被评价。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Weighs nothing now. Except ash."
msgstr "现在什么都称不了，除了灰。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.1"
msgid "Meh. Like my report card."
msgstr "一般，跟我的成绩单一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.2"
msgid "Weak numbers. Back to the gym, carrot."
msgstr "数据太弱，胡萝卜，回去练。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.1"
msgid "Look at those stats. Proud of you. Kinda."
msgstr "看看这数据，我有点为你骄傲。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.2"
msgid "Champion material. Don't let it go to your head."
msgstr "冠军苗子，别太得意。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A scale for carrats. Not stepping on it myself."
msgstr "称胡萝卜鼠的秤，我才不站上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Time for a check-up. Like a health exam."
msgstr "体检时间，跟学校体检差不多。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.1"
msgid "Heavy. I could still throw it, though."
msgstr "挺沉的，不过我还是扔得动。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.2"
msgid "Anchor's down. Nap time on the boat."
msgstr "锚下了，船上睡午觉时间。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.1"
msgid "Steering a dragon boat. Sounds tiring."
msgstr "开龙舟，听着就累。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.2"
msgid "I'll steer. Someone else rows."
msgstr "我来掌舵，划船的另找人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.1"
msgid "A horse head on my head. Very dignified."
msgstr "头上顶个马头，真是体面。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.2"
msgid "Clip-clop. Okay, I'll stop."
msgstr "嘚嘚嘚。好，我不闹了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.1"
msgid "Bet I could hit a home run with this. Long one."
msgstr "用这个打球，肯定能打得特别远。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.2"
msgid "Jousting? I'd rather just swing it."
msgstr "骑马对冲？我宁可直接抡。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.1"
msgid "Cute ears. Glows better than my phone."
msgstr "耳朵挺可爱，比我手机屏幕还亮。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.2"
msgid "Lights like this make me want rice cakes."
msgstr "看到这种灯就想吃年糕。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.1"
msgid "Poor bunny. Lost its glow."
msgstr "可怜的兔子，没光了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.2"
msgid "Dark bunny. Kinda creepy now."
msgstr "黑掉的兔子，现在有点吓人。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.1"
msgid "Pretty. I'd sit under it and do nothing."
msgstr "好看，我想坐在下面什么都不干。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.2"
msgid "More bunnies. Festival vibes, I guess."
msgstr "又多一只兔子，节日气氛算是有了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.1"
msgid "Somebody forgot to feed it light."
msgstr "有人忘了给它续光。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.2"
msgid "Gone dark. Like me after lunch."
msgstr "暗掉了，跟我吃完午饭一样。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pillow fight soon. I'm unbeatable at this."
msgstr "马上枕头大战，这个我无敌。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Ring it and I'll grab my pillow. Or nap on it."
msgstr "敲响我就拿枕头，或者直接睡上去。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.1"
msgid "Pillow fight! Holding back is so hard."
msgstr "枕头大战！手下留情好难。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.2"
msgid "Feathers everywhere. This is the best."
msgstr "满天羽毛，太爽了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.1"
msgid "So much for the festival mood."
msgstr "节日气氛就这么没了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Lanterns and fire. Who saw that coming?"
msgstr "灯笼配火，谁想得到呢？"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Pretty. Feels like a summer festival."
msgstr "好看，有夏日祭的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Needs food stalls nearby. Then it's perfect."
msgstr "旁边再来几个小吃摊就完美了。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.1"
msgid "Baby worm. Still not petting it."
msgstr "小虫宝宝，我还是不摸。"

#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.2"
msgid "Wiggly little noodle. Kind of cute, actually."
msgstr "扭来扭去的小面条，其实还挺可爱。"


#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Could I earn a water rescue badge with that?"
msgstr "用这个能拿到水上救援徽章吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That's a knife for grown-ups. I'll leave it be."
msgstr "这是大人用的小刀，我还是别碰了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Woby's keeping her distance from this one."
msgstr "沃比离这把刀远远的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "First rule of camp cooking: don't grab the hot metal."
msgstr "营地炊事第一条规矩：别抓烫手的金属。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "It still needs a handle. And somewhere safe to put it."
msgstr "还缺个刀柄，也得找个安全的地方收起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Is this what a sword looks like before they sharpen it?"
msgstr "刀磨锋利之前就是这个样子吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "You'd have to be pretty brave to take on a giant with that."
msgstr "敢拿这把刀对付巨人，胆子一定很大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "I could wear it for the camp play."
msgstr "营地演戏的时候我可以戴上它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Can you get a badge for identifying a metal nobody knows?"
msgstr "认出没人认识的金属，能得一枚徽章吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "I bet there's a story behind those red and white robes."
msgstr "这件红白长袍背后一定有个故事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "The sword was buried deep underground. That's a good start to a campfire story."
msgstr "这把刀埋在地下深处。拿来开个篝火故事正好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Could a board count toward my boating badge?"
msgstr "用一块板子也能考航行徽章吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Woby, guess who? It's still me!"
msgstr "沃比，猜猜我是谁？还是我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Hold still, Woby. I'll show you my square knot."
msgstr "别动，沃比。我给你看看我打的平结。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Can a sword make thunder, too?"
msgstr "刀也能打出雷声吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "A practice sword! I'd better clear some space."
msgstr "练习用的刀！我先腾块空地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The plain ones always turn out to be magic in the stories."
msgstr "故事里越不起眼的刀，往往越有法力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "That blade's as dark as the woods after lights-out."
msgstr "刀刃像熄灯后的树林一样黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "That one's for telling stories about from a safe distance."
msgstr "离它远一点，再讲它的故事吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "I think the story gets gruesome from here on out."
msgstr "我觉得故事从这里开始就有点吓人了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "What if the giants hear we're carrying that?"
msgstr "要是巨人听说我们带着这把刀呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Woby, if it thunders, you can hide behind me."
msgstr "沃比，要是打雷，你就躲到我身后。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "If it keeps away demons, can we take it camping?"
msgstr "它要是能赶走妖怪，我们露营能带上吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "That's a funny little box. Is there a telegraph key on it?"
msgstr "这小盒子真怪。上面有电报键吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Too long to take into a tent."
msgstr "太长了，带不进帐篷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Can it heal a dog's sore paw?"
msgstr "它能治好小狗疼痛的爪子吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Look, Woby! A sword in a stone!"
msgstr "看啊，沃比！石头里插着一把刀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "A sword that big ought to have a story of its own."
msgstr "那么大一把刀，该有个自己的故事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Room for a compass, biscuits, and Woby's biscuits."
msgstr "放得下指南针、饼干，还有沃比的饼干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "We should keep that away from the campfire shadows."
msgstr "别让它靠近篝火边的影子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Somebody forgot to take in their washing."
msgstr "有人忘了收洗好的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "How many tins of biscuits could we buy with that?"
msgstr "这么多钱能买多少罐饼干？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "That'll lift the lid off a supply crate."
msgstr "用它能撬开补给箱的盖子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "We'd need gloves to clear a scrap heap full of those."
msgstr "要清理满是这种钢筋的废料堆，得戴手套。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Woby, get ready to fetch! First I need to find a ball."
msgstr "沃比，准备捡球！我得先找个球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "The rain's on the blade. How come the ground's dry?"
msgstr "刀上有雨水，地上怎么还是干的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALTER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Is that written in a cipher? I haven't learned that badge yet."
msgstr "这是用密码写的吗？我还没拿到破译徽章呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "I can already see myself regretting this crossing."
msgstr "我已经能想见自己后悔渡这趟水的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "I'd rather spend my remaining years elsewhere."
msgstr "我还想把剩下的年月用在别处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "I can think of better things to wake up."
msgstr "有些东西还是让它继续睡着吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "I'll come back in five minutes. Its five minutes."
msgstr "我五分钟后再来。得等它过完五分钟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "A fraction off at the tang. It'll show when the hilt goes on."
msgstr "刀茎差了一点。装上刀柄就看得出来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Give the smith time. Good work takes it."
msgstr "让铁匠慢慢来。好活需要时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I try to be elsewhere whenever giants enter the picture."
msgstr "每次巨人现身，我都尽量离远些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "That's one uniform I never had time to wear."
msgstr "我可从没腾出时间穿这样的制服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I wonder how many firings it'll take before I know what this is."
msgstr "不知道得烧几回，才能看出是什么金属。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "That hem will take an afternoon to mend if you step on it."
msgstr "裙边踩坏了，可得缝上一下午。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "I've spent rather a long time avoiding precisely that blade."
msgstr "我一直在躲的，正是这种刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "By the time I've learned to use it, I'll need a dry coat."
msgstr "等我学会站上去，肯定得换件干外衣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "How much of one's face does a mask like that really hide?"
msgstr "这点面具究竟遮得住多少脸？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "A good scarf saves a great deal of time spent thawing out."
msgstr "围巾戴得好，能省下不少取暖的时间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Lightning is notorious for arriving ahead of schedule."
msgstr "闪电向来不肯按时到，总是来得太早。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Practice is time well spent. Up to a point."
msgstr "练习值得花时间，适可而止就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Plain fittings are easier to replace. Sensible."
msgstr "配件做得素净，换起来也容易。想得周到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "That edge has aged remarkably well."
msgstr "过了这么些年，刀刃还保存得真好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I've enough shadows following me as it is."
msgstr "跟着我的影子已经够多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "One cut, and the wound outlasts you. Unpleasant business."
msgstr "一刀下去，伤口比人的命还长。真叫人不快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I'd have to be considerably younger to carry that all day."
msgstr "我得再年轻许多，才能整天提着它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Some things are over in a flash. With that around, I'd count on it."
msgstr "有些事转眼就结束了。见到这把刀，我就有了数。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "I'll give it a wide berth. I don't care to see what it calls a demon."
msgstr "我要绕远些。我可不想知道它认得哪些妖魔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Without a dial, how does one tell what it's measuring?"
msgstr "连个表盘都没有，怎么知道它量的是什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "The point arrives rather a long time before the person holding it."
msgstr "持枪的人还远着，枪尖已经先到了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "If only bringing someone back were as simple as that."
msgstr "要是把人带回来真有这么容易就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Good heavens. How long has it been down there?"
msgstr "天哪，它在下面埋了多久了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "That blade looks perfectly sound. I'd worry about whatever it touches."
msgstr "刀身很完好。我担心的是它碰到的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "My spare springs would fit, though they'd tangle in the lining."
msgstr "备用发条倒装得下，恐怕会缠在衬里上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "The things in the dark are quite near enough, thank you."
msgstr "黑暗里的东西已经离我够近了，多谢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Leave them on the washing line. They'll dry eventually."
msgstr "留在晾衣绳上吧，总会干的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "A million? I hope exact change isn't required."
msgstr "一百万？希望不用找零。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "That can wait until I have something larger than a watch to open."
msgstr "等我有比怀表更大的东西要拆，再用它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Far too thick for a spring. It's hardly got any give."
msgstr "做发条太粗了，压根弯不动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I tried batting once. The ball took a dreadful amount of time to find."
msgstr "我打过一回球。后来找球花了好半天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Just the thing if you want all your other tools to rust."
msgstr "想让别的工具都生锈，把它放在旁边就成。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Whose handwriting is this? I can't make out a word."
msgstr "这是谁写的？我一个字也认不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "We'll have to eat before we shove off. There's nowhere to set a pot."
msgstr "下水前得先吃饭，板上没地方放锅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That little knife has no business in my kitchen."
msgstr "这种小刀不该出现在我的厨房里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "I smell iron. That blade hasn't come from a butcher's shop."
msgstr "有铁腥味。这把刀可不是肉铺里的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "With that much heat, I could sear both sides in seconds."
msgstr "这么烫，几秒钟就能把肉两面煎好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "A sharp edge and nothing to hold. A terrible kitchen knife."
msgstr "刃口太利，又没地方握。拿来切菜糟透了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Some things must rest before you finish them. Is metal the same?"
msgstr "有些食材得静置再加工。金属也是这样吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Mon dieu, what a knife! What could possibly need a cut that deep?"
msgstr "天哪，好大一把刀！什么东西需要切这么深？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "I'll keep my chef's hat. It covers more hair."
msgstr "我还是戴厨师帽吧，能多遮住些头发。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I'd keep that out of the stew until we know what it is."
msgstr "弄清这是什么之前，可别往炖汤里放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Those sleeves would trail into every dish I serve."
msgstr "我要是穿这么长的袖子，上每道菜都会袖口沾汤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "There are some things I'd rather not learn to carve."
msgstr "有些东西，我宁愿永远学不会怎么切。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "With a line and a little luck, one could bring back supper on it."
msgstr "带根鱼线，再有点运气，就能踩着它带晚饭回来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "How am I to taste the sauce through that?"
msgstr "戴上它，我还怎么尝酱汁？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Very smart. Tuck the ends in before you come near the stove."
msgstr "很体面。到炉边之前，先把围巾两头掖好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "You'd hear that blade even above the sizzle of a pan."
msgstr "就算锅里煎得滋滋响，也盖不过这把刀的声音。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "That's more like a wooden spoon than anything in my knife roll."
msgstr "我那卷厨刀里可没这种刀。它倒更像把木勺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Such plain wood around such a fine blade. I like it."
msgstr "好刀配这么朴素的木鞘，真合我意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "You could see every onion skin against that black blade."
msgstr "黑色刀面衬着，连一片洋葱皮都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I wouldn't have that thing at a dinner table."
msgstr "我可不愿让这东西出现在餐桌上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "That knife has tasted quite enough. Put it away, please."
msgstr "这把刀尝得够多了。请把它收起来吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A giant's cutlery. I wonder how big a serving is."
msgstr "巨人用的刀。不知道一人份得有多大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "If you strike down there, my soufflé will collapse up here."
msgstr "你在那边一打雷，我这边的舒芙蕾就塌了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "It drives demons out? There are nights I'd make room for that in the kitchen."
msgstr "真能驱魔？有几个晚上，我倒希望厨房里备着这一把。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Can that little printing box take down a recipe?"
msgstr "那台小小的印字机能记食谱吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "It'd need a very large fire to roast anything on that."
msgstr "拿它串东西烤，得生好大一堆火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "If it can bring back a life, could it save a split sauce?"
msgstr "既然它能救命，能不能救一锅油水分离的酱汁？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Something's been put away here for a very long time."
msgstr "有件东西在这里存了很久。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "What a clean edge for a sword with such a terrible reputation."
msgstr "名声这么可怕的一把刀，刃口倒很干净。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "It'll carry the picnic, if I wrap the jar well."
msgstr "把罐子包好，它就能装下野餐吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Even with the stove lit, the edge stays in shadow."
msgstr "炉火点起来了，刀刃还是藏在暗处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "The laundry goes outside, far from the food."
msgstr "换洗衣服放外面，离吃的远一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "That would keep a restaurant in butter for years."
msgstr "这些钱够给一家餐馆买好几年的黄油。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "At last, something to open a crate of good wine."
msgstr "总算有工具能撬开装好酒的木箱了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Too heavy for a skewer. The roast would fall straight into the coals."
msgstr "当烤签太沉，烤肉会直接掉进炭里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I wouldn't use it to roll pastry. What would I do about the handle?"
msgstr "我可不拿它擀面皮。碍手的柄该怎么办？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Wipe that down before you put it with the other knives."
msgstr "跟别的刀收在一起前，先把它擦干。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Is this a recipe? I can't read a word of it."
msgstr "这是食谱吗？我一个字也读不懂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "A worthy vessel for a skirmish on the waves!"
msgstr "好一艘在浪涛间交战的小船！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A dagger for a grim rite."
msgstr "一柄用于凶险仪式的短刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "What deeds gave thee that baleful edge?"
msgstr "何种战绩，磨出了你这凶刃？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Fresh from the fires of the forge!"
msgstr "才从锻炉的烈火里出来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "A blade awaiting its hilt and its first battle."
msgstr "刃已成形，只待刀柄与初战。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "The smith hath yet to grind its edge."
msgstr "铁匠尚未磨出它的锋刃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Let a giant come and test its steel!"
msgstr "让巨人前来试试它的钢刃吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "That crown is for one who tends the hall."
msgstr "这头饰属于照料厅堂的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "What fine steel might be wrought from this?"
msgstr "此锭能锻出怎样的好钢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "A robe fit for a keeper of the shrine."
msgstr "这长袍配得上守护神社之人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Even the undying should fear that edge."
msgstr "即使是不死者，也该畏惧此刃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "A plank to ride across the sea!"
msgstr "且踏这块木板横渡大海！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "A fox has no need of a helm to be cunning."
msgstr "狐狸用不着戴头盔便足够狡猾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "A good mantle for the cold watch before dawn."
msgstr "一条好围巾，足以守过黎明前的寒夜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "A blade bold enough to challenge the storm!"
msgstr "好一把敢于向雷暴挑战的刀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "To drill with wood is to be ready when steel is drawn!"
msgstr "以木刀操练，真刀出鞘时方能迎战！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The plain scabbard does honour to the steel within."
msgstr "素净的刀鞘衬得起其中的好钢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Its dark steel will show no glint to the foe."
msgstr "敌人休想看见黑刃上的反光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I will not bargain with the spirit in that steel."
msgstr "我绝不与钢刃里的妖灵做交易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Let those who forged it answer for its thirst."
msgstr "就让锻造此刀的人去偿它的血债。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A weapon worthy of the deeds sung in the hall!"
msgstr "这把刀配得上大厅里传唱的战绩！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Now the thunder follows the strike!"
msgstr "刃光一闪，雷鸣便至！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Fear this blade, foul spawn of the dark!"
msgstr "黑暗中的邪祟，且畏惧此刃吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "What runes does this little machine set in order?"
msgstr "这小机器排的是何种符文？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "A spear to hold the line!"
msgstr "一杆能守住战线的长枪！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Could this call a fallen warrior home?"
msgstr "此刃能唤回阵亡的勇士吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "A blade waits in the stone for a hand to claim it."
msgstr "刀在石中，待人拔起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "There is strength enough in that sword to break a shield wall."
msgstr "这把刀有足以破开盾阵的力量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "There is room here for the spoils of a small skirmish."
msgstr "这里装得下一场小战的战利品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "The dark wrought into the shape of a blade."
msgstr "黑暗被锻成了刀刃的形状。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Even a warrior must put out the washing."
msgstr "勇士也得晾晒自己的衣物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "A lord could pay a company of warriors with that."
msgstr "这么多钱，够领主付给一队勇士作军饷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "A good iron hook to prise open a barred door."
msgstr "一道门闩，有这根铁钩就能撬开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "It wants a point before I'd carry it to battle."
msgstr "得先添上枪尖，我才带它上阵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I can see how the game would train a warrior's swing."
msgstr "这游戏倒能练出战士挥击的手劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "The steel carries the dew of morning into battle."
msgstr "此刃带着晨露上阵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "The runes of this scroll are hidden from me."
msgstr "我无法参透这卷轴上的符文。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "I prefer a vessel with room for a chair."
msgstr "我喜欢能摆下一把椅子的船。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A nasty little implement. Leave it where it is."
msgstr "好一件阴森的小玩意。放在原处吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "I recognise a bad bargain when I see one."
msgstr "这种不划算的买卖，我一眼就认得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Do set it down before it burns through your gloves."
msgstr "趁它还没烧穿手套，赶紧放下吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "A fine blade in need of some proper furniture."
msgstr "刃做得好，还得配个像样的柄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Someone has left the smith's work unfinished."
msgstr "铁匠的活才做到一半。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A quite unnecessary amount of steel, until the giant appears."
msgstr "巨人没现身前，谁都会嫌它用料太多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "You won't find me wearing that, pal."
msgstr "我可没有戴它的打算，朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I'd have paid to know what that was, once."
msgstr "从前我倒肯花钱弄清这是什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "A costume for someone altogether more devout."
msgstr "这身打扮适合比我虔诚得多的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Some promises are worth breaking. Others come with a blade."
msgstr "有的承诺值得违背，有的承诺会招来一把刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "You may have my turn. In fact, you may have all my turns."
msgstr "这次让给你。往后每次也可以让给你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "I've seen better disguises at a children's matinee."
msgstr "我在给孩子看的日场演出里都见过更好的伪装。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Decent enough wool. The fringe is another matter."
msgstr "料子还算好，流苏就另说了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Lightning. An old effect, and still quite a good one."
msgstr "闪电。老把戏了，效果倒还不错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "We all start with stage props, I suppose."
msgstr "想必谁都是从舞台道具开始的吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "All that care taken to make it look unremarkable."
msgstr "费这么大心思，就为了让人看不出它的特别。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "It would vanish completely against black velvet."
msgstr "衬在黑天鹅绒上，整把刀就看不见了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Take some advice from someone who's heard the whispers. Leave it."
msgstr "我听过这种低语。听我一句，把它放下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "You'll find the interest rather dear, sooner or later."
msgstr "总有一天，你会发现这笔利息贵得很。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "For the giant who insists on sitting in the front row."
msgstr "专给非要坐头一排的巨人预备的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "They'll see that trick from the cheap seats."
msgstr "坐最便宜的位子也能看清这一手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Let me know how it defines a demon before you take it out."
msgstr "拔刀之前，先告诉我它认哪些东西是妖魔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "A little magic-lantern show in a box. Where's the lamp?"
msgstr "盒子里装着一台幻灯机。灯在哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "It has the advantage of keeping one's company at a decent distance."
msgstr "有一点倒好，能让旁人保持应有的距离。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Don't make promises on behalf of the dead."
msgstr "别替死者许诺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Some things are entombed for excellent reasons."
msgstr "有些东西被封起来，自有充分的理由。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "When a sword looks that expensive, the price is usually more than money."
msgstr "一把刀看起来值这么多，代价通常也不止是钱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Two buckles? I need only the one to keep my secrets in."
msgstr "两道扣？锁住我的秘密，一道就够了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "I might once have found that tempting."
msgstr "换作从前，我也许会对它动心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "I'd thank you to put the laundry away before we have company."
msgstr "有客人来之前，劳驾把晾的衣物收好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "A million of the local currency. How agreeable."
msgstr "整整一百万当地钱币。倒是令人愉快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "The work of opening crates is best done before the audience arrives."
msgstr "撬开木箱这种事，最好在观众到场前做完。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "There must be some perfectly useful concrete missing that."
msgstr "不知哪块好好的混凝土少了这根钢筋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I'll leave the athletics to someone dressed for them."
msgstr "这种运动就留给穿得适合上场的人吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "A sword that needs drying even when it hasn't been used."
msgstr "连用都没用，就得擦干的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "The penmanship is deliberate enough. I can't decipher it."
msgstr "字写得倒很用心。我却一个字也解不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "If we sit very still, maybe both of us can fit."
msgstr "只要我们坐稳一点，也许两个都能坐上去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "We ought to ask a grown-up about that one."
msgstr "这把刀得先问问大人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Why's the hair on our legs standing up?"
msgstr "我们腿上的毛怎么都竖起来了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Ow! We said we'd wait!"
msgstr "哎哟！说好了要等它凉的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Could we wrap the end in silk, so it won't cut our hands?"
msgstr "我们能在一端缠些蛛丝，免得割到手吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "It looks like somebody's halfway through making a sword."
msgstr "好像有人做刀做到一半。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "We'd need a friend to help us lift it."
msgstr "得叫个朋友来搭把手，我们才举得动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "We could play house! Who wants to sweep?"
msgstr "我们可以玩过家家！谁想扫地？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Is it a rock or a metal? We can't agree."
msgstr "这是石头还是金属？我们两个意见不一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "We'd get those sleeves caught on all our arms."
msgstr "我们这么多只手，肯定会缠在袖子里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Can it hurt things that don't stay dead?"
msgstr "它能伤到那些死了还会活过来的东西吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Do you think the spiders could all fit on one board?"
msgstr "你说蜘蛛们能全挤在一块板上吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "How are we supposed to fit all our eyes behind two holes?"
msgstr "只有两个洞，我们这么多只眼睛怎么往外瞧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "This might be long enough to go around both of us."
msgstr "这条够长，也许能把我们两个一起围住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "We like watching lightning from under the covers."
msgstr "我们喜欢躲在被窝里看闪电。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Can we play knights? We'll be careful."
msgstr "我们能玩骑士游戏吗？会小心的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The scabbard looks like a big wooden pencil case."
msgstr "刀鞘好像一个大木铅笔盒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "It's so dark we can hardly see where the blade ends."
msgstr "黑得都快看不出刀刃到哪儿了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Can we please put it back before anything comes out of it?"
msgstr "能不能趁里面的东西还没出来，先把刀放回去？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "We don't like the look of that red edge at all."
msgstr "我们一点也不喜欢那道红色的刃口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "We'd look awfully small standing next to a giant."
msgstr "我们站在巨人身边，一定显得特别小。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "That one's going to be much louder than the other one."
msgstr "这把肯定比另一把响多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Would it think we were a monster, too?"
msgstr "它会不会也觉得我们是怪物？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "It looks like a typewriter, but where does the paper go?"
msgstr "像是打字机，可纸往哪里放呀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "We must be careful not to poke anybody with it."
msgstr "得小心，别戳到别人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "If it really works, there are some people we'd like to see again."
msgstr "如果它真管用，我们倒想再见几个人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Are we allowed to look inside the stone?"
msgstr "我们能往石头里面看看吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "We should leave that one for somebody with bigger hands."
msgstr "还是留给手比我们大的大人吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "One pocket each! Now we just need to agree what goes in them."
msgstr "一人一个口袋！接下来只要商量好各装什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "We don't mind the dark. We mind what's in that sword."
msgstr "我们不怕黑。可那把刀里的东西就另当别论了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Those aren't ours. We don't have enough legs left over for them."
msgstr "这不是我们的。我们还剩多少条腿能往里塞呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "We'd buy enough sweets for everyone. Would there be any money left?"
msgstr "我们要给每个人都买糖。钱还会有剩吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Useful when the lid's stuck and none of our hands can budge it."
msgstr "盖子卡住，我们这么多只手都掰不开时，它就有用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "It's too heavy to put in a snowman's arm."
msgstr "拿这个给雪人当胳膊太重了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Can we be the first to bat? We'll take turns, honest."
msgstr "能让我们先打吗？我们保证轮流来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Rain, rain, go away. Wait, it's just on the sword."
msgstr "雨呀雨呀快走开。等等，只有刀上有雨水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "We can't read it. Can you?"
msgstr "我们读不懂。你能读懂吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "A little vessel with nowhere to sit when one grows tired."
msgstr "这船小得很，累了也没地方坐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "There is no comfort in an edge like that."
msgstr "这样的刀刃给不了人半点安慰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "How many hands has that blade outlived?"
msgstr "它已经熬过多少任持刀人的一生了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Even embers grow cold in time."
msgstr "连余烬也终会冷却。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "It has nothing to keep its edge from the hand that holds it."
msgstr "拿起它的人，手和刀刃之间连一层遮挡也没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "It will be sharp soon enough."
msgstr "它迟早会变得锋利。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Even giants can be brought low."
msgstr "连巨人也有倒下的时候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "I should rather wear a veil."
msgstr "我宁愿戴一层面纱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "The earth keeps a few secrets even from its graves."
msgstr "即便在墓穴里，大地也留着一些秘密。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "What rites are performed for those who never return?"
msgstr "对永远回不来的人，人们会做什么仪式呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Everything ends. Even the things that were promised eternity."
msgstr "万物终有尽头。连曾被许诺永恒的事物也是如此。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "The sea takes more than it brings back."
msgstr "大海带回来的，总比带走的少。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "A fox can't disguise the weariness in a person's eyes."
msgstr "扮成狐狸，也遮不住眼里的疲倦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "It is easier to warm a neck than a heart."
msgstr "脖子比心容易暖和。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "The storm will come whether we call it or not."
msgstr "无论我们呼唤与否，暴风雨都会来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "We used to play at dying, Abigail."
msgstr "阿比盖尔，我们以前也玩过装死的游戏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "In plain wood, as though it were already laid to rest."
msgstr "朴素的木头裹着刀刃，仿佛它已经安息了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "So dark that the light in the room seems to end at its edge."
msgstr "黑得室内的光仿佛到它的刃口就止住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Even I would rather not hear what it has to say."
msgstr "连我也不愿听它说些什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "I think it has taken more than anyone meant to give."
msgstr "我想它夺走的，早已超过任何人愿意付出的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Once a giant falls, there is just more of him to bury."
msgstr "巨人倒下，也不过是多些要埋的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "A great deal of noise for something that leaves only silence."
msgstr "闹出这么大的声响，最后只剩寂静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "I hope it knows a ghost from a demon."
msgstr "我希望它分得清幽灵和妖怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "It seems to have light enough to read by. I can make nothing of the letters."
msgstr "亮得倒足够读书。我却看不懂上头的字。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "One can keep one's distance and still cause a great deal of hurt."
msgstr "离得远远的，也一样能让人伤得很深。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Would it work on you, Abigail? Would you want it to?"
msgstr "阿比盖尔，它能救你回来吗？你愿意回来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Something other than the dead lies buried here."
msgstr "这里埋着的另有其物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "There's no mourning a thing that has been utterly destroyed, I suppose."
msgstr "毁得一点痕迹都不留的东西，想必也无从悼念了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "I could carry the flowers in this, until they're needed."
msgstr "我可以先把花装在里面，等到用的时候再拿出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "There is no telling where the shadow ends."
msgstr "分不清影子到哪里才算尽头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Someone once took the trouble to fold them."
msgstr "曾经有人费心把它们叠好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "A fortune makes a grave no less cold."
msgstr "纵有一笔巨款，坟墓也还是一样冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "It can open a great many things. There are some I'd leave closed."
msgstr "它能撬开很多东西。有些我情愿让它们一直关着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "That's all that's left when the stone around it crumbles."
msgstr "外边的石料碎了，就只剩这一根了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I wonder who last put it away, expecting another game."
msgstr "上次收起它的人，也许还以为会有下一场球赛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "It looks as if it has been left out in the rain for years."
msgstr "仿佛已经落在雨里好多年了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "There is no voice left to tell me what these words mean."
msgstr "已经没有人能告诉我这些字是什么意思了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "A shallow-draft vessel, though its stability is questionable."
msgstr "吃水很浅，只是稳定性恐怕欠佳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A ceremonial blade. Please handle it with care, dear."
msgstr "一柄仪式用刀。请当心些，亲爱的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "An unusual stain for this alloy. I shall refrain from taking a sample."
msgstr "这种合金上有这样一层斑痕，颇为反常。我还是不取样了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Its colour alone is sufficient warning of the temperature."
msgstr "从颜色已经可以判断，温度相当高。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "The tang is exposed. It requires a hilt before it can be handled safely."
msgstr "刀茎还露着，得先安上刀柄才能安全持握。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "The rough profile has been established. Now comes the finer work."
msgstr "轮廓已经打出。接下来便是细工。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A rather specialised implement, judging by the weight and reach."
msgstr "以重量和长度来看，这是一件用途颇专的兵器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "A headpiece associated with domestic service."
msgstr "这种头饰通常是家事服务人员佩戴的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I cannot identify the alloy by colour alone."
msgstr "仅凭颜色，我还辨认不出这种合金。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "The cut is characteristic of Japanese shrine garments."
msgstr "这是日本神社服饰特有的剪裁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Immortality, dear, is a surprisingly ill-defined condition."
msgstr "亲爱的，「不死」的定义可比人想的含糊得多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "An excellent example of making use of buoyancy with very little material."
msgstr "只用少量材料便充分利用了浮力，堪称范例。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Those ears leave very little doubt which animal the maker intended."
msgstr "单看这对耳朵，就能认出匠人想做的是哪种动物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Do make sure the wool is dry before you put it on, dear."
msgstr "亲爱的，佩戴前务必看看毛料干了没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "There appears to be an electrical discharge along the cutting edge."
msgstr "刃口似乎有放电现象。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "A sensible means of practising fence without a sharpened blade."
msgstr "毋须真刀便能练习击剑，倒是稳妥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The undecorated wooden sheath is a handsome piece of joinery."
msgstr "木鞘未加装饰，接合工艺做得很漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "The dark finish is strikingly uniform."
msgstr "深色表面处理得格外均匀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "The presence I detect merits further study from a considerable distance."
msgstr "我察觉到了一种异样的存在。值得研究，但得站远些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "I recommend shelving the blade before it acquires another specimen."
msgstr "在它再添一份标本之前，我建议先将它收起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A tool of that size assumes an adversary of corresponding stature."
msgstr "如此尺寸的兵器，显然预设了同等体量的对手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Observe the discharge, dear. Observe it from over there."
msgstr "亲爱的，请观察放电。站到那边去观察。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The name implies an exorcistic function. I am in no hurry to verify it."
msgstr "名字暗示它有驱邪之用。我暂时无意验证。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Its illuminated characters seem to change without type or ink. Curious."
msgstr "这些发亮的字不用铅字或油墨就能变化，真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "A spearhead of Japanese design, fitted to a long shaft."
msgstr "日式枪头，装在一根长杆上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Its reputed properties would require a revision of several medical texts."
msgstr "若传说属实，有几本医书便该重修了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "The sword appears to have been deliberately sealed within the formation."
msgstr "似乎有人刻意把这柄刀封进了岩层。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "A single weapon scarcely accounts for the damage attributed to it."
msgstr "传说中的破坏程度，光靠一把刀很难解释。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "A well-made book satchel. The clasps should keep the contents in order."
msgstr "书包做得很牢靠，扣好便能防止书本散落。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "The outline is remarkably difficult to distinguish from its own shadow."
msgstr "它的轮廓与自己的影子几乎无法分辨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "I shall refrain from cataloguing somebody's undergarments."
msgstr "我就不替别人的内衣编目了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "An unusually large denomination. One wonders how it is redeemed."
msgstr "罕见的大面额。不知如何兑付。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "A straightforward application of the lever."
msgstr "杠杆原理的直接应用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "The ridges help it bind to the material cast around it."
msgstr "表面的凸条能使它和外面浇筑的材料牢牢结合。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "The wood has been shaped to concentrate the mass toward the striking end."
msgstr "木料的形状使重量更集中在击球的一端。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "No corresponding moisture on the sheath. I should like to know its source."
msgstr "鞘上没有同样的水迹。我想知道水从哪里来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I don't recognise the script. I shall need a reference work."
msgstr "我不认识这种文字，得查阅参考书。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "There's hardly any boat to burn. What's the point?"
msgstr "船身这么小，都没什么可烧的。有什么意思？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That's the sort of knife you put down and walk away from."
msgstr "看见这种刀，放下走开就好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "I'd like to see if it still looks so nasty after a good fire."
msgstr "我倒想看看，大火烧过，它还会不会这么凶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Aww, it's already hot. I wanted to do that part."
msgstr "唉，已经烧热了。我本来想自己烧的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Someone should put a handle on it before I drop it on my foot."
msgstr "趁我还没把它砸到脚上，谁来装个柄吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Stick it back in the fire. That ought to liven things up."
msgstr "送回火里吧。那样才有点意思。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "If you're fighting a giant, have you tried setting its trousers on fire?"
msgstr "要和巨人打架，你试过点着它的裤子吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Do I look like I came here to dust the furniture?"
msgstr "我看起来像是来掸家具灰的吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Wonder what colour it turns in a really hot fire."
msgstr "真想看看用大火烧，它会变成什么颜色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Those sleeves had better stay out of my fire."
msgstr "这两只袖子最好离我的火远点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "How about we see if the blade itself can burn?"
msgstr "要不看看这把刀自己能不能烧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Great. Another way to get soaked."
msgstr "好极了，又多了一种湿透的办法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Can I wear it when I scare people at the campfire?"
msgstr "我能戴着它，在篝火边吓大家吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "That's handy for winter, when the fire needs a little help."
msgstr "冬天光靠火还不够，这条正好派上用场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Lightning starts the nicest fires in dry grass."
msgstr "干草让闪电一劈，烧起来最好看了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "It only takes one match to make it more interesting."
msgstr "只要一根火柴，它就有意思多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Nice wooden sheath. It'd burn cleanly."
msgstr "好一个木刀鞘。肯定烧得干净。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Looks like it's already had a turn in the fire."
msgstr "看起来已经在火里过了一趟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "If I put it in the fire, will the thing inside come out?"
msgstr "把它放进火里，里面的东西会跑出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Ew. That's a horrible red, even for me."
msgstr "咦。这红色连我看着都嫌恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Fine, hit the giant with it. I'll take care of the trousers."
msgstr "行，你用它打巨人。我负责料理他的裤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Now that's a good loud crack. Do it again!"
msgstr "这一声够响。再来一下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Can it chase something into a fire? Asking for me."
msgstr "它能把妖怪赶进火里吗？我自己想知道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "It's lit up and there's no fire anywhere. How boring."
msgstr "明明亮着，哪儿也没有火。真没劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Long enough to reach the middle of a bonfire."
msgstr "够长，伸得到篝火正中间。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Why does this one make me feel like I ought to be nice?"
msgstr "这把刀怎么让我觉得该待人好一点？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Dig it up! I want to see what happens."
msgstr "挖出来！我想看看会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "If it breaks everything, I call dibs on the pieces."
msgstr "要是它真能把东西打碎，碎片都留给我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Plenty of room for matches. I don't need the books."
msgstr "能装不少火柴。书我就不用带了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "I could bring a torch and still lose sight of that thing."
msgstr "就算打着火把，我也找不着那东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "How fast do you think the stripes would burn?"
msgstr "你觉得这些条纹多久能烧完？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "They want me to go shopping with it. I want to see it burn."
msgstr "他们想让我拿它去买东西。我想看看它烧起来的样子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "It'll do for turning a log over in the fire."
msgstr "用来翻火堆里的木头正合适。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "That bit of iron would be fun to heat up."
msgstr "把那段铁烧热肯定好玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "It's a ball game till somebody sets the bat on fire."
msgstr "只要没人点着球棒，这就还是一场球赛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "It looks wet. It wants a little time by the fire."
msgstr "看起来湿漉漉的。拿到火边烘一烘吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Who writes this small? Make it bigger or I'm using it for tinder."
msgstr "谁把字写得这么小？写大些，不然我拿它引火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Check the seams before you trust it with your weight."
msgstr "承重前，先检查一下接缝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That one's staying off my workbench."
msgstr "这刀别往我工作台上放。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "There's a stain on that steel I'd rather not touch."
msgstr "钢上那块斑痕，我还是别去碰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Tongs first, kid. Then you pick it up."
msgstr "先拿火钳，再把它夹起来，孩子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Good grind. I'd fit a handle before I signed off on it."
msgstr "磨得不错。装上柄，我才肯验收。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "The blank's sound. Now comes the finish work."
msgstr "刀坯没问题。接下来该做精加工。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "That's a lot of steel to balance on one wrist."
msgstr "钢用得这么多，单靠手腕可不好掌控。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Wouldn't keep much dust out of your hair."
msgstr "这玩意遮不住多少灰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I'd want to know what it's made of before I put a load on it."
msgstr "承重前，我得先弄清它是什么料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "There's room to work in those sleeves. Too much room near machinery."
msgstr "那袖子伸得开手。到了机器旁，反倒嫌太宽了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "You don't need to read the label to know to keep clear."
msgstr "用不着看标签，也知道该离远点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "I could lash it down for shipping. I wouldn't ship anybody on it."
msgstr "当货物我倒能捆好。要我用它运人可不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "The eyeholes are all wrong for a shop mask."
msgstr "这眼孔开得不适合在工场里戴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Tuck it in before you get near a belt drive."
msgstr "靠近皮带传动装置前，把围巾掖好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "I'm going to stand somewhere well insulated."
msgstr "我去找个绝缘的地方站。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Practice is cheaper than a trip to the infirmary."
msgstr "多练几下，总比往医务室跑便宜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Nice joinery on the sheath. No gaps at all."
msgstr "刀鞘接得真好，一点缝也没有。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Hard to see a crack in steel that dark."
msgstr "钢这么黑，出了裂纹也难看清。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "There's something wrong with that blade, and it isn't the workmanship."
msgstr "这把刀有问题，毛病出在工艺之外。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "If that came through my shop, I'd tag it unsafe and call it a day."
msgstr "这东西要送到我的工场，我会挂个危险牌，到此为止。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I see why they built it heavy. I don't see who they built it for."
msgstr "为什么做这么重，我看得出来。给谁用，我还真想不出。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "I don't want that discharge anywhere near my tools."
msgstr "放电的东西可别挨着我的工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Do they make one that keeps the gremlins out of machinery?"
msgstr "他们有专门赶走机器里捣蛋鬼的刀吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "A keyboard without any typebars. How does that work?"
msgstr "有键盘，却没有字杆。这是怎么运作的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Mind the other end when you turn a corner with it."
msgstr "拿着它转弯，别忘了你身后还有一截。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Well, that'd put a first-aid box to shame."
msgstr "这本事可比急救箱强多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "The stone's cracked, but the blade's still in there tight."
msgstr "石头裂了，刀还卡得牢牢的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "With an edge like that, you'd better watch what you're cutting into."
msgstr "刃口这么利，下刀前可得看清楚要切什么。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Buckles look sound. I'd check the straps before loading it with tools."
msgstr "扣子挺结实。装工具以前，我会先检查背带。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "No good reaching for a tool when you can't see its edge."
msgstr "刃口都看不见，想伸手去拿可不行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Somebody's wash. Leave it folded."
msgstr "有人洗过的衣物。别把它摊开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Try getting a cashier to break that before opening time."
msgstr "还没开张就拿它去找零，看收银员怎么说。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "A good bar. That crate lid doesn't stand a chance."
msgstr "好一根撬棍。那箱盖肯定撬得开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "There's your reinforcement. Now where's the concrete?"
msgstr "钢筋有了，混凝土在哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Decent balance. You can tell which end they want you to swing."
msgstr "配重挺好。一握就知道该用哪头打。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Wet steel and a dry bench. That's worth a closer look."
msgstr "钢是湿的，台面是干的。这就值得细看了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I've read plenty of blueprints. This one's beyond me."
msgstr "我读过不少图纸。这张实在看不明白。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Is tiny boat. Wolfgang must sit very carefully."
msgstr "好小的船。沃尔夫冈得小心坐稳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "Wolfgang has no use for sad little knife."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈用不着这把令人难过的小刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Wolfgang is brave. Still will not touch scary sword."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈很勇敢。还是不碰这把吓人的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Wolfgang can lift it after it gets cold."
msgstr "等它凉了，沃尔夫冈就能举起来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Where does Wolfgang put big mighty hand?"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈强壮的大手该往哪儿握？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Is half a sword. Maybe is half as heavy?"
msgstr "才做了一半的刀。也只有一半重吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Is for little giants. Really big giant needs more sword."
msgstr "是对付小巨人的。真遇上大巨人，还得再大一号的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Is good hat for sweeping. Wolfgang can sweep very fast!"
msgstr "扫地戴这顶好。沃尔夫冈能扫得飞快！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Heavy little metal. Good for lifting with little finger."
msgstr "小小金属块还挺重。正好用小指练举重。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Does it come in mighty size?"
msgstr "有没有壮汉穿的大号？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Even mighty man does not want to try that edge."
msgstr "再强壮的人，也不想试它的刃口。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Wolfgang will stand in middle. Just in case."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈要站中间。稳妥一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Wolfgang is fox now! Very big fox."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈变成狐狸了！一只很大的狐狸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Keeps mighty neck from getting chills."
msgstr "护住强壮的脖子，免得着凉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Wolfgang is not afraid of thunder. Wolfgang just prefers quiet."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈不怕打雷。沃尔夫冈只是喜欢安静。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Good for practice. Wolfgang will try not to break it."
msgstr "练习用正合适。沃尔夫冈会尽量不把它打断。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Such plain case for such shiny sword."
msgstr "那么亮的刀，配了这么素的鞘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Is darker than top of stove."
msgstr "比炉子顶还黑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Wolfgang does not like when sword looks at him first."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈不喜欢刀先盯着自己看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Too much red on that one. Wolfgang puts it down now."
msgstr "这把刀红得太厉害。沃尔夫冈这就把它放下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Ha! Now giant can have fair fight with Wolfgang!"
msgstr "哈！现在巨人可以和沃尔夫冈公平比试了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Was that thunder? Wolfgang was only checking."
msgstr "刚才是雷声吗？沃尔夫冈只是问问。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Good sword can keep nasty things away at night."
msgstr "好刀能在晚上赶走讨厌的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Tiny box has words in it. Wolfgang cannot find the paper."
msgstr "小盒子里有字。沃尔夫冈找不到纸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Wolfgang can hold it straight with one hand!"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈单手就能把它举直！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Is gentle sword. Wolfgang likes gentle sword."
msgstr "是把温和的刀。沃尔夫冈喜欢温和的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Want Wolfgang to lift stone first?"
msgstr "要沃尔夫冈先把石头搬开吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "Looks heavy enough for both hands. Finally!"
msgstr "看着总算够沉，得用两只手了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Wolfgang can fill it with heavy things for a walk."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈可以装满沉东西，背着它散步。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Wolfgang will leave spooky shadow sword right here."
msgstr "沃尔夫冈要把这把吓人的影子刀留在原地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Someone's small clothes. Not Wolfgang's size."
msgstr "有人落下的小衣服。沃尔夫冈穿不了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Is big number. How many potatoes?"
msgstr "好大的数。能买多少土豆？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Can lift whole crate. But little iron helps with lid."
msgstr "整箱都举得动。开盖时这根小铁棍倒能帮上忙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Wolfgang can bend it! Should Wolfgang bend it?"
msgstr "沃尔夫冈能把它掰弯！要掰吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Wolfgang will try to keep ball inside field this time."
msgstr "这回沃尔夫冈会尽量把球留在场内。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Why sword wet? Wolfgang did not spill anything."
msgstr "刀怎么湿了？沃尔夫冈什么都没洒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Is very strange writing. Wolfgang cannot make it out."
msgstr "好奇怪的字。沃尔夫冈看不懂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "No room for a paddle on that thing, eh?"
msgstr "这东西连放桨的地方都没有，是吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That's a grim use of a perfectly good bit of steel."
msgstr "好端端一块钢，偏做成这么阴森的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Lucy, it's giving me the shivers just looking at it."
msgstr "露西，光看这玩意儿我就打寒战。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Careful. Hot iron looks an awful lot like cold iron at noon."
msgstr "当心。大中午的，热铁看起来跟冷铁差不多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Needs a handle that won't split in the cold."
msgstr "得配个天冷也不会裂的柄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Smith's still got a day's work in that, I'd say."
msgstr "依我看，铁匠还得在它身上花一天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "That's one big blade. Still wouldn't take it logging."
msgstr "刀是够大。我伐木可不会带它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Not much of a hat for the bush."
msgstr "戴这个进林子可不顶用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Heavy for its size. Won't be mistaking it for a lump of pine."
msgstr "这么小还挺沉。一上手就知道跟松木不一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Fancy sleeves. Good luck keeping the sap off them."
msgstr "袖子真讲究。沾上树脂可就麻烦了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "I've got enough troubles with things that come back."
msgstr "那些还会回来的东西，已经够让我发愁了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "I'd rather lash a few logs together and call it a raft."
msgstr "我宁愿捆上几根木头，搭个木筏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "I've seen real foxes that looked less shifty, eh?"
msgstr "我见过的真狐狸，看着都没这么鬼祟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Good for the first cold morning in the bush."
msgstr "入冬头一个冷早晨，进林子正好用得上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "A blade like that ought to stay clear of a tall stand of pines."
msgstr "这种刀可该离高松林远点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "It'd make fine kindling if we were short, Lucy."
msgstr "露西，要是缺引火柴，这木料倒好用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Nice straight grain on that sheath."
msgstr "这刀鞘的木纹够直。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Black as a stump after a forest fire."
msgstr "黑得像林火过后的树桩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I don't care to hear a weapon talk unless it's you, Lucy."
msgstr "露西，除了你，我可不想听别的兵器说话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "That's a colour I don't like seeing on a blade."
msgstr "我不愿在刀刃上见到这种颜色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "What do you reckon, Lucy? One axe for a tree, one sword for a giant?"
msgstr "露西，你说呢？树归斧头，巨人归大刀？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Last thing a dry bush needs is another lightning strike."
msgstr "树林干成那样，最经不起再来一道雷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Would it know the difference between a demon and a beaver?"
msgstr "它分得清妖怪和河狸吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Looks like a telegraph set. I don't see a wire on it, though."
msgstr "看着像电报机，却找不到接线。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Might be handy keeping a bear on the far side of the camp."
msgstr "营地外有熊时，拿它挡远一点也许管用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "What I'd give to have that work on the toughest days, eh?"
msgstr "最难熬的日子里，要是这刀真管用，我付什么都愿意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "That blade's wedged in tighter than an axe in green wood."
msgstr "这刀卡得可真紧，比斧头卡在生木里还紧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "That'd make short work of a log. Don't worry, Lucy. That's your job."
msgstr "用它劈木头倒是快。别担心，露西，这事归你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Room for lunch and a dry pair of socks. That's plenty."
msgstr "装得下一份午饭和一双干袜子。足够了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Steer clear of that one after sundown, Lucy."
msgstr "露西，日落后离那把刀远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Clothesline must've come down."
msgstr "一定是晾衣绳掉下来了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "That's a right pile of money for the company store."
msgstr "拿到工棚的商店去，可是一大笔钱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "It'll pry loose a board without hitting it. No offence, Lucy."
msgstr "不用敲就能撬开木板。露西，我可没有说你的坏话。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "That's the sort of thing you don't want to hit with an axe."
msgstr "斧头可别砍到这种东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Nice bit of turned wood. Wonder if that's ash."
msgstr "车出来的木料真漂亮。不知道是不是梣木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "I've dried tools after rain. It's odd when only one gets wet."
msgstr "雨后我擦过不少工具。只湿了一把，可真怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "That'd be a good deal easier to read if it were written in plain English."
msgstr "要是用明白的英文写，读起来就容易多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Little floaty wood."
msgstr "漂漂的小木头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "No cutting self."
msgstr "别割自己。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Sharp friend has red spots."
msgstr "尖朋友身上有红点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Hot! Wait for sleepy heat."
msgstr "烫！等热气睡着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Sharp end. No holding end."
msgstr "这头尖尖。没有能握的头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Sword still growing?"
msgstr "刀还在长吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Big sharp. For big trouble?"
msgstr "大刀。对付大麻烦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Frilly head leaves!"
msgstr "带褶的头顶叶子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Hard shiny dirt."
msgstr "硬硬的亮泥土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Pretty red and white. Like flower."
msgstr "漂亮的红和白。像花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Stops things growing back?"
msgstr "不让东西再长出来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Wood wants to go in water."
msgstr "木头想下水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Fox face. No fox smell."
msgstr "狐狸脸。没有狐狸味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Warm wrap for stem."
msgstr "暖暖的，裹住茎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Storm in metal?"
msgstr "金属里有雷雨？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Still smells like tree."
msgstr "闻着还是树的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Wood keeps sharp inside."
msgstr "木头把尖尖藏在里面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Dark sharp. Shiny in the dark?"
msgstr "黑黑的刀。黑里也会亮吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Bad feeling. Leave sleeping."
msgstr "感觉不好。让它睡着。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Red part isn't flower."
msgstr "红红的地方不是花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Very big cut for very big thing."
msgstr "很大一刀，切很大的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "Sky noise! Sky light!"
msgstr "天上的声！天上的光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Keeps bad things away from friends?"
msgstr "能让坏东西离朋友远点吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Little glow. No sun warmth."
msgstr "有一点光。没有太阳的暖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Long pokey stick."
msgstr "长长的戳戳棍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Makes hurt go away?"
msgstr "能让疼疼走掉吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Sharp thing growing out of rock."
msgstr "石头里长出了尖东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "Don't let it near roots."
msgstr "别让它挨着根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Soil in one pocket, seeds in other."
msgstr "一个口袋装土，一个装种子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Can't see where sharp ends."
msgstr "看不见尖尖到哪头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Stripes. No roots. Clothes."
msgstr "有条纹，没有根。衣服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Lots of buying? Can buy friends seeds?"
msgstr "能买很多东西？能给朋友买种子吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Bent metal helps lift stone."
msgstr "弯弯的铁能抬石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Like root. Hard and cold."
msgstr "像根。又硬又冷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Tree piece for hitting ball."
msgstr "树的一块，用来打球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Blade has rain. Can share with thirsty friends?"
msgstr "刀上有雨水。能分给口渴的朋友吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORMWOOD.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Not understanding."
msgstr "不明白。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "A board afloat, a little boat! Will it hold a hoof or two?"
msgstr "浮起来的木板，小小的船！能容下一只蹄，还是两只？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A grim little blade. I'd sooner leave it where it laid."
msgstr "阴森的小刀，原处放好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "That's a nasty stain. I doubt it came from berry juice."
msgstr "这污迹可难看。怕不是莓果汁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Glowing hot! Touch it? I shall not."
msgstr "烧得发红，碰了手疼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "No hilt to hold! Might be a very short trick, I'm told."
msgstr "无柄可握，戏还没开场就要出错。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Half a sword and twice the work. I'll leave it to the smith."
msgstr "刀成一半，活还一堆。我留给铁匠吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Surely a giant could be persuaded to sit down first."
msgstr "总能劝巨人先坐下，再谈别的吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "A frill upon my horns? I'd wear it to court!"
msgstr "角上绕一圈花边？我戴着它上宫廷去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Now what did the earth tuck away in there?"
msgstr "大地在里头藏了什么？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "That's far too fine to get tangled in my tail."
msgstr "这么讲究的料子，缠上我的尾巴可不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "It cuts the tie that lets a soul return. A cruel trick."
msgstr "它割断让灵魂归来的线。真是狠毒的把戏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "You keep the board. I'll take the very short way across."
msgstr "板留给你。我走条极短的路过去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "A fox? Hyuyu, how very convincing!"
msgstr "狐狸？嘿哟，可真像啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Wind, wind, away you go. My neck has somewhere warm to hide!"
msgstr "风呀风呀往别处去，我的脖子已经裹暖啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Thunder over here, a bright blade over there. Which is the trick?"
msgstr "这头雷响，那头刀亮。哪一处才有把戏？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "A clack and a whack. No souls for me today!"
msgstr "咔哒一响，啪地一敲。今天没有魂儿收！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Such humble wood for such a sharp surprise."
msgstr "好朴素的木头，里头却藏着锋利的惊喜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "It could slip out of sight while I was looking right at it."
msgstr "即使我目不转睛，它也能从眼前消失。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Oh, I know that sort of company. I'd sooner travel alone."
msgstr "这种同伴我可认得。我宁愿独自上路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Such hunger, such thirst. Which of us will be fed first?"
msgstr "如此饥，如此渴。我俩谁先吃上一口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Big for a giant, too, I'd wager."
msgstr "我敢打赌，巨人拿着也嫌大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "One flash, one fright. Hyuyu, there goes the night!"
msgstr "白光一闪，惊得一颤。嘿哟，这就天亮了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "It has such a noble name. I hope it won't take against me."
msgstr "名字可真高尚。我希望它别跟我过不去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Letters that light themselves? Mortals do devise queer tricks."
msgstr "自己会亮的字？凡人真会想些怪把戏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Long to the point. Very much to the point!"
msgstr "好长的杆，好尖的头。确实一眼见尖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Those souls have crossed already. Will they thank you for fetching them?"
msgstr "那些魂儿已经到了彼岸。你再去接它们，它们会道谢吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "A hide-and-seek champion, buried up to the hilt."
msgstr "藏到只剩柄，捉迷藏的头一名。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "One stroke and pieces everywhere. That's a very messy trick."
msgstr "一下过去，碎片满地。这把戏可真难收拾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "A pocket for each trick and a buckle on each pocket."
msgstr "一件道具一个袋，一个袋上一个扣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "A shadow with an edge! Who ever said the dark was empty?"
msgstr "有刃口的影子！谁说黑暗里空空如也？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "What clever stripes. They can stay right there."
msgstr "条纹倒有意思。就让它们待在那儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "All that coin, and it won't buy a single willing soul."
msgstr "钱虽多，也买不来一个心甘情愿的灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Press down here and up goes the lid. Mortals have their little tricks."
msgstr "这头一压，那头就起。凡人也有些小把戏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "A bit of the wall that didn't fall apart."
msgstr "墙倒了，这一截还在。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "A swing, a miss! I shall blame the ball for this."
msgstr "挥了一下，打空啦！这回可要怪球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Rain on the blade, dry in the glade. How was that trick made?"
msgstr "刀上有雨水，林地却干爽。这是什么把戏？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Squiggle on squiggle! What am I meant to do with that?"
msgstr "弯一道，绕一圈！这叫我怎么读啊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Wurt can swim faster than tiny boat, florp."
msgstr "沃特比小船游得快，浮噜噗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "Too small for big fight."
msgstr "太小，打不了大架。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Has yucky smell. Like old fish blood."
msgstr "味道难闻。像陈鱼血。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Hot metal! Put in pond? Wait, fish live there."
msgstr "好烫！丢池塘里？等等，鱼还住在里头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Where hand go if all of it sharp?"
msgstr "全是尖的，手放哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Sword still growing? Needs more time."
msgstr "刀还在长？要再等一等。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Big blade for big guard."
msgstr "大刀给大卫兵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Is fancy head thing for servants?"
msgstr "这是给仆从戴的漂亮头饰吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Heavy for a shinier rock."
msgstr "亮一点的石头，拿着还挺沉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Royal robes should have more room for fins."
msgstr "王室的长袍要给鳍多留点地方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Even things that keep coming back scared of this?"
msgstr "连老是回来的东西也怕它吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Wurt likes swimming beside it better."
msgstr "沃特更喜欢在它旁边游。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "Fox face won't fool a merm!"
msgstr "狐狸脸骗不过鱼人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Good for cold days. Bad if you go in water."
msgstr "天冷时好用。下水就不好用了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "Keep storm sword out of swamp!"
msgstr "别让打雷的刀进沼泽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Wurt can spar with guards and nobody gets cut."
msgstr "沃特能跟卫兵比试，还不会把谁割伤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Plain wood. Hiding shiny sword inside."
msgstr "素木头，里头藏着亮亮的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Look like dark water at night."
msgstr "像夜里黑黑的水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Glurgh. Wurt don't like sound coming from it."
msgstr "咕噜。沃特不喜欢里面传出的声音。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Too bloody. Wash somewhere else, not in Wurt's pond!"
msgstr "好多血。去别处洗，别在沃特的池塘洗！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "If giant comes to swamp, guards can use this."
msgstr "巨人要是来沼泽，卫兵就能用它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "No making thunder while Wurt is swimming!"
msgstr "沃特游泳的时候不许打雷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Does it scare away bad pigfolk, too?"
msgstr "它也能把坏猪人吓跑吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Little box with glow words. Wurt wants to know how they got in."
msgstr "小盒子里有会亮的字。沃特想知道它们怎么进去的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Good spear for the guards at the gate."
msgstr "好长枪，给守门的卫兵用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Can make sick merm feel better?"
msgstr "能让生病的鱼人好起来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Something sharp stuck in that rock!"
msgstr "石头里卡了个尖东西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "It better not break any of Wurt's houses."
msgstr "它最好别弄坏沃特的房子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Could fit many books. No fish inside, promise."
msgstr "能装好多书。沃特保证不放鱼进去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Is like swamp at night. Can't see where it ends."
msgstr "像夜里的沼泽，看不清到哪头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "That cloth belongs to somebody else, florp."
msgstr "那是别人的衣物，浮噜噗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Pig money. Wurt would rather have food."
msgstr "猪人的钱。沃特更想要吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Good for opening a stuck box!"
msgstr "盒子卡住了，用这个撬开好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Big ugly iron. Maybe use to hold up a wall."
msgstr "又大又丑的铁。也许可以撑住墙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Why does the hitter get to have all the fun?"
msgstr "为什么只有打球的人玩得开心？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Wet blade, dry ground. Where's the water coming from?"
msgstr "刀湿湿的，地干干的。水从哪儿来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WURT.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Wurt is learning letters. These ones aren't in her book."
msgstr "沃特在学认字。这些字书里没教。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "FLOATATION DEVICE. ONE UNIT CAPACITY. QUESTIONABLE STABILITY."
msgstr "浮具。容量一单位。稳定性存疑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "CEREMONIAL KNIFE. I HAVE NO USE FOR THE CEREMONY."
msgstr "仪式用刀。仪式无用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "ORGANIC RESIDUE DETECTED. DISGUSTING."
msgstr "检测到有机残留。恶心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "CAUTION: COMPONENT ABOVE HANDLING TEMPERATURE."
msgstr "注意：零件温度高于可接触上限。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "CUTTING SURFACE COMPLETE. GRIP ABSENT."
msgstr "切削面已完成。缺少握柄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "MANUFACTURING INCOMPLETE. RETURN TO FORGE."
msgstr "制造未完成。退回锻炉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "FINALLY, A BLADE SCALED FOR LARGER TARGETS."
msgstr "终于有适合大型目标的刀刃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "DECORATIVE HEAD ATTACHMENT. NO DEFENSIVE VALUE."
msgstr "装饰性头部附件。无防护价值。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "ALLOY UNKNOWN. FURTHER SAMPLES REQUIRED."
msgstr "合金未知。需要更多样本。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "CLOTH ARMOUR. WHAT A PECULIAR CHOICE."
msgstr "布料护甲。古怪的选择。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "TERMINATION OF OTHERWISE PERSISTENT ORGANISMS. PROMISING."
msgstr "可终止原本能持续存活的生物。前景可观。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "DESIGN REQUIRES OPERATOR TO RISK WATER EXPOSURE. REJECTED."
msgstr "设计要求操作者冒浸水风险。驳回。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "IMITATION OF A SMALL MAMMAL. HOW ASPIRATIONAL."
msgstr "模仿小型哺乳动物。好大的志向。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "THERMAL INSULATION FOR UPPER JOINT."
msgstr "上部关节保温层。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "ELECTRICAL OUTPUT DETECTED. FINALLY, SOMETHING USEFUL."
msgstr "检测到电力输出。终于有点用处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "NONLETHAL TRAINING EQUIPMENT. HOW VERY RESTRAINED."
msgstr "非致命训练器材。真克制。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "UNTREATED WOOD CASE CONCEALS A SUPERIOR TOOL."
msgstr "未经装饰的木盒藏着一件上等工具。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "MATTE FINISH. SATISFACTORY FOR OPERATIONS IN DARKNESS."
msgstr "哑光表面。满足夜间作业要求。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "UNAUTHORISED PRESENCE INSIDE WEAPON. EJECT IT."
msgstr "武器内存在未获授权的实体。将其逐出。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "EXCESS BIOLOGICAL CONTAMINATION."
msgstr "生物污染超标。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "STRUCTURAL LIMITS SUITABLE FOR GIANT REMOVAL."
msgstr "结构强度适合清除巨人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "HIGH-VOLTAGE DISCHARGE. ESTIMATING COMPATIBILITY."
msgstr "高压放电。正在估算兼容性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "A FILTER FOR UNDESIRABLE ORGANISMS. DEFINE UNDESIRABLE."
msgstr "用于筛除不良生物。请定义不良。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "SELF-ILLUMINATING DISPLAY. INPUT PROTOCOL UNKNOWN."
msgstr "自发光显示器。输入协议未知。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "POINTED IMPLEMENT. EXTENDED REACH."
msgstr "尖头器械。触及距离增大。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "ORGANIC REPAIR DEVICE. DOES IT ACCEPT SUPERIOR LIFE FORMS?"
msgstr "有机体修复装置。是否支持高级生命形态？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "WEAPON STORAGE. ACCESS OBSTRUCTED BY ROCK."
msgstr "武器储存处。取用通道被岩石阻塞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "PROPERTY DAMAGE POTENTIAL: SATISFACTORY."
msgstr "财物破坏潜力：令人满意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "PORTABLE STORAGE. CLOSURE REDUNDANCY: TWO BUCKLES."
msgstr "便携收纳装置。双扣提供闭合冗余。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "LOW VISIBILITY. CUT HAZARD REMAINS HIGH."
msgstr "可见度低。割伤风险仍高。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "ORGANIC LAUNDRY. NO COMPONENTS OF INTEREST."
msgstr "有机体洗晒物。无值得关注的零部件。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "MONETARY TOKEN. PURCHASING POWER UNVERIFIED."
msgstr "货币凭证。购买力未经核实。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "LEVER EFFICIENCY: ACCEPTABLE."
msgstr "杠杆效率：合格。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "SALVAGED STRUCTURAL STEEL. ACCEPTABLE STOCK."
msgstr "回收的结构钢材。可用原料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "HUMAN PASTIME: HIT SPHERE WITH WOODEN ROD. ASTONISHING."
msgstr "人类消遣：用木杆击打球体。令人惊叹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "PERSISTENT MOISTURE DETECTED. ISOLATING BLADE."
msgstr "检测到持续潮湿。正在隔离刀刃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WX78.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Error: Unable to read data"
msgstr "错误：无法读取数据"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "A buoyant platform with very little freeboard. Every ounce matters here."
msgstr "浮台的干舷很低。每多一盎司都要紧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A narrowly specialised blade. I see no useful application in the laboratory."
msgstr "用途极专的一把刀。在实验室里看不出有什么用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Is that discolouration in the metal, or on its surface?"
msgstr "变色是在金属内部，还是只在表面？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "I require a pyrometer. These fingers are unreliable instruments."
msgstr "我需要一支高温计。手指当仪器可不可靠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "The blade is ready for a load test once I can secure it."
msgstr "刀刃一固定好，就可以做载荷试验。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "Now I can take a measurement before they grind away the evidence."
msgstr "趁磨刀把痕迹去掉之前，正好量一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I'd like to measure the force at the tip when that blade is swung."
msgstr "我想测量挥刀时刀尖的力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Cotton, I'd venture. At least it won't throw a spark."
msgstr "依我看是棉布。至少它不会迸出火花。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Unfamiliar density. I shall need my scales."
msgstr "密度不寻常。我得用秤。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "I hope those cuffs can be drawn close about the wrists."
msgstr "希望袖口能在手腕处收紧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "A test would require a rather particular subject."
msgstr "要做试验，得先找到相当特殊的对象。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "I'd like to determine the point at which it will roll over. Preferably from shore."
msgstr "我想测出它在什么情况下会翻。最好站在岸上测。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "The maker has sacrificed peripheral vision for effect."
msgstr "工匠为了外形，牺牲了周边视野。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "I'll keep the loose ends well clear of my apparatus."
msgstr "围巾垂下来的两头可得离我的仪器远些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "I ought to measure that discharge before it finds ground."
msgstr "得趁电还没接地，先量一量放电。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Wood makes an excellent control for a test of the steel version."
msgstr "试验钢刀时，木刀可以当很好的对照。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "The join is so close I can scarcely see it through my spectacles."
msgstr "拼缝严密得很，戴上眼镜也几乎看不出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "An extraordinarily dark surface. What did they treat it with?"
msgstr "表面黑得出奇。用什么做过处理？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Something is vibrating, and the blade is perfectly still."
msgstr "有东西在振动，刀身却一动不动。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "The surface has changed. Whatever did it may still be active."
msgstr "表面已经变了。导致变化的东西可能还在起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "That mass would make it very difficult to arrest mid-swing."
msgstr "这么大的质量，挥到一半可难停下来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "An enviable source of current, if I can find a way to contain it."
msgstr "好一个电源，只要我能想法把电流控制住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "I am told it distinguishes demons. I should like to see the criterion."
msgstr "据说它能辨别妖魔。我想看看它凭什么辨别。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Curious. It puts out light without a filament I can see."
msgstr "有趣。明明在发光，却看不见灯丝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Increasing the length of the shaft increases reach at a cost in control."
msgstr "枪杆加长，触及距离更远，也更难控制。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "Where does the energy for such a restoration come from?"
msgstr "施行这种程度的修复，能量从哪儿来？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "The stone seems to have formed around the blade itself."
msgstr "岩石似乎是围着刀身生长的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "I'd test that blade only in a room with nothing in it worth saving."
msgstr "我只会在一间没什么贵重东西的屋子里试刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "I could put the lenses in one side and the tools in the other."
msgstr "镜片放一边，工具放另一边。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "The edge scarcely reflects light at all. That can't be accidental."
msgstr "刀刃几乎完全不反光。这恐怕并非偶然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Somebody has an eye for regular spacing in stripes."
msgstr "这些条纹的间距倒是排得很匀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Funding. At last, some funding."
msgstr "经费。总算有经费了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "The flattened end is just narrow enough to slip under a casing."
msgstr "压扁的那头够窄，恰好能伸进外壳底下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "The ridges give the cement something to grip."
msgstr "这几道凸条能让水泥裹得更紧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Observe how much wood they've left where it meets the ball."
msgstr "瞧，击球的那一端保留了多少木料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "It keeps its moisture in dry air. That's a useful property to have."
msgstr "在干燥空气中依旧潮湿。这性质有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "A fine drawing, but the notation eludes me."
msgstr "图画得很精细，我却看不懂那些符号。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Now there's a boat you can take over the breakers."
msgstr "这船倒能直接划过碎浪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "That isn't the kind of knife I bring to the beach."
msgstr "我可不会带这种小刀去海滩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "That thing gives me the creeps even in full sun."
msgstr "就算在大太阳下，它也让我发毛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Let's leave it to cool. I've got nowhere to be."
msgstr "放着凉一凉吧。我又不赶着去哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Put a grip on it and maybe I'll pick it up."
msgstr "先装个柄，我兴许会拿起来看看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "The smith can finish it after a nap. I certainly would."
msgstr "铁匠可以睡一觉再接着做。换我就会。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Seems like an awful lot of trouble to go to over a giant."
msgstr "为了一个巨人，也太费周折了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "I don't even dust my own place."
msgstr "我连自己屋里都懒得掸灰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Pretty heavy for a paperweight. It'll do, though."
msgstr "当镇纸嫌沉了些，倒也能用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Those sleeves would take all day to dry."
msgstr "那两只袖子得晒一整天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Sounds like someone went looking for a fight that never ends."
msgstr "听着像是有人专门去找一场永远打不完的仗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Good lines on that board. Mind if I take it out?"
msgstr "板形挺顺。介意我踩出去转一圈吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "That'd be fun till the first wave took it off."
msgstr "第一道浪打来、把它冲掉之前，戴着倒挺好玩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Good for sitting on the sand after sundown."
msgstr "日落以后坐在沙滩上，围着它正好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "I'll take it as a sign to get out of the water."
msgstr "看见它，我就知道该上岸了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "I'd rather paddle out than practise swordplay."
msgstr "我宁愿划板出去，也不想练刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Nice and plain. No decoration for the sand to get into."
msgstr "简简单单，没有藏沙子的装饰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Black like the water when the moon's gone."
msgstr "黑得像月亮落下后的海水。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "Whatever's whispering in there can find somebody else."
msgstr "躲在里面低语的家伙，可以去找别人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Put that away. This was going to be a nice day."
msgstr "收起来吧。我本来打算好好过今天。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "If the giant wants a fight, I'll be out past the breakers."
msgstr "巨人要是想打架，我已经划到浪外面去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "No thanks. I'll wait on shore till the weather clears."
msgstr "不了，谢谢。我在岸上等天晴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Maybe it could clear whatever's making that beach so spooky."
msgstr "说不定能赶走让那片海滩阴森森的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "That's a bright little box. I wonder if it minds salt air."
msgstr "真亮的小盒子。不知道它怕不怕咸海风。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "It might reach the sandy bottom from the shallows."
msgstr "在浅水里往下探，也许能够到沙底。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "A blade that mends things? That I could get used to."
msgstr "能修复东西的刀？我倒不介意有一把。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Wouldn't pull that out in the middle of a nice quiet afternoon."
msgstr "好好一个安静的下午，我才不会去拔它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "I'd be more comfortable if it had a sheath on it."
msgstr "要是给它套上刀鞘，我会安心些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Room for a towel and a bite to eat. Let's go."
msgstr "装得下一条毛巾和一点吃的。走吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "If I put it down in the shade, I'll never find it again."
msgstr "要是随手丢在阴影里，我就再也找不着它了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Someone's laundry, drying in the sun."
msgstr "有人洗过的衣服，正晒着太阳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "We could buy a place on the shore and never set an alarm again."
msgstr "能在海边买个住处，以后再也不用定闹钟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Does it come with someone who'll do the prying?"
msgstr "能不能顺便来个人，帮我把东西撬开？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Heavy, rusty, and an excellent reason to wear sandals."
msgstr "又沉又锈。见到它，我就知道该穿凉鞋了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Who's up for an easy game on the beach?"
msgstr "谁想在沙滩上随便打两球？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "I'm used to things getting wet. Usually I see the wave coming first."
msgstr "东西打湿是常事。不过平常我总能先看见浪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "Let's ask someone who can read it. I was about to lie down."
msgstr "去问个能读懂的人吧。我正打算躺下呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "Ye call that a ship? Where be the gun deck?"
msgstr "这也叫船？炮甲板在哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A dark purpose for a wee knife."
msgstr "一把小刀，偏有这么阴森的用处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "That's seen a grim day's work, by the look of it."
msgstr "瞧这模样，准干过一天可怕的活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Leave it off me deck till it cools!"
msgstr "凉透以前，别往我的甲板上放！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Put a proper grip on her, then we'll talk."
msgstr "先给它安个正经的柄，再来找我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "That be a blade with a ways to go."
msgstr "这把刀离完工还早得很。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I'd sooner take a broadside to a giant."
msgstr "打巨人？我宁愿拿舷炮齐射。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Ye won't catch this captain in a frilly cap."
msgstr "你休想看见本船长戴花边小帽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "What kind o' booty be this, then?"
msgstr "这又算是哪门子战利品？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Too much sail about the sleeves!"
msgstr "袖子上挂了太多帆布！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "Could be worth keepin' for the crew that won't stay buried."
msgstr "遇见埋了还不肯老实的船员，倒值得留着它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "That plank be for walkin', not sailin'!"
msgstr "这木板是用来走的，哪能航海！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "I don't need a fox face to look sly."
msgstr "不用顶着狐狸脸，老船长也够狡猾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Aye, that'll keep the spray off me neck."
msgstr "好啊，浪花再溅不到我的脖子了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "I've no wish to call a storm down on me mast."
msgstr "我可不想叫雷劈到自己的桅杆上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "A cutlass for a cabin boy, that."
msgstr "给小水手练手的刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Plain as driftwood till ye draw the steel."
msgstr "刀不出鞘，素得像块漂木。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "Black as the hold with the hatch shut."
msgstr "黑得像扣了舱门的货舱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I've heard enough whispers on a night watch, thanks."
msgstr "值夜班时我已经听够低语了，多谢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "A blade to leave at the bottom o' the sea."
msgstr "这种刀就该沉在海底。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Ye won't swing that in the captain's cabin."
msgstr "休想在船长室里挥这么大一把刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "A good crack o' thunder in the middle of a clear day!"
msgstr "大晴天里炸的一声好雷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Would it run off the ghosts that haunt me charts?"
msgstr "它能把缠着我海图的鬼赶走吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "Some kind o' signal lamp with letters in it, is it?"
msgstr "是肚子里藏着字的信号灯吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Good reach. I'd lash it down in a gale."
msgstr "够得远。起大风时我会把它绑牢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "The sea doesn't give up her dead so easy."
msgstr "大海可不会轻易交还亡者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "A sword buried in stone! Should've brought me pick."
msgstr "石头里埋着刀！我该带把镐来的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "That'll put a hole in a strongbox if there's no key to hand."
msgstr "找不着钥匙，拿它就能把保险箱打出个洞来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Two buckles or twenty, I'll want it lashed down in a blow."
msgstr "两个扣也好，二十个也好，起风时都得绑牢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "Who'd stow a sword where a man can't see to grab it?"
msgstr "谁会把刀放到看都看不见、伸手也摸不准的地方？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Who's been hanging their washing on me rigging?"
msgstr "谁把洗过的衣服晾在我的索具上了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Now that's a piece o' treasure worth the digging!"
msgstr "这才是值得挖的好宝贝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "A bar for persuadin' locked chests."
msgstr "专门对付上锁箱子的撬棍。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "A rusty length o' iron. Give it to the ballast."
msgstr "一段生锈的铁。塞到船底压舱去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Never played it on deck. We'd lose the ball to the first good hit."
msgstr "从没在甲板上打过这一出。头一回打中，球就得进海里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "I've seen drier blades after a storm at sea."
msgstr "刚过海上风暴的刀，我都见过比这干的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I can read some dreadful charts, but this defeats me."
msgstr "再难看的海图我也能读，这张却真读不懂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "It's got just enough room for an explorer and no room for her luggage."
msgstr "刚好够载一个探险家，行李可放不下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "I leave ceremonial knives right where I find them."
msgstr "找到这种仪式用刀，我向来原样放回。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "I don't think that stain came from the mud."
msgstr "这污渍恐怕和泥没关系。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "I've found another use for my tongs."
msgstr "我的火钳又多了个用处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Good steel. Now I need something that can hold it without cutting my hand."
msgstr "好钢。还得找个东西握着它，才不会割手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "That still needs some work before I'd pack it for an expedition."
msgstr "还得加工一下，我才会带它去探险。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "If there's a sword for giants, somebody must know where to find one."
msgstr "既然有专门对付巨人的刀，就该有人知道去哪儿找巨人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "Fancy, but it won't keep the sun out of my eyes."
msgstr "很讲究，可惜遮不住刺眼的太阳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "Unidentified metal. I'll make a note of where I found it."
msgstr "不知名的金属。我得记下发现它的地点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "Not a good choice for making your way through brush."
msgstr "穿这身可不好钻灌木丛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "If a warning can be made of steel, this is it."
msgstr "能用钢做警告的话，眼前这把就是。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "I'll try anything once. This one had better be in shallow water."
msgstr "什么我都愿意试一回。这个最好先在浅水里试。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "An excellent disguise, as long as nobody expects a real fox."
msgstr "只要没人真等着看狐狸，这伪装就很管用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "A bit of warmth for the early start."
msgstr "清早出发时，能暖和一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "I'd put some distance between that and my compass."
msgstr "我会让指南针离那把刀远些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Something to practise with before drawing the real thing."
msgstr "真刀出鞘前，正好拿它练手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "A plain sheath won't draw much attention when I travel."
msgstr "出门带个素刀鞘，也不太惹眼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "I'd have trouble finding that in the bottom of my pack."
msgstr "它要是落到包底，找起来都费劲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "There's trouble in that blade and I've already got my share."
msgstr "那把刀有麻烦，我碰上的麻烦已经够多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "I think I'll leave it out of my field report."
msgstr "这东西我就不写进考察报告了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I hope the giant isn't uphill. I wouldn't want to carry that up to meet it."
msgstr "希望巨人没在坡上。我可不想提这么重的刀去找它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "We can't call it clear weather with that thing along."
msgstr "带上它，就没法说今天天气晴朗了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "An exorcist's blade. One more thing to bring into a ruin, I suppose."
msgstr "驱邪用的刀。下次进遗迹，又得多带一件东西了吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "It shines like an electric lamp. Can it do anything else?"
msgstr "亮得像电灯。还有别的用处吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "I could use it to test the depth of the ford."
msgstr "我可以用它探探浅滩有多深。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "That's what I call emergency supplies."
msgstr "这才叫应急用品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "There's a sword in there. Now how do I bring back a sample of the stone?"
msgstr "里面有一把刀。这岩石倒要怎么带一份样本回去呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "Let's put that on the far side of the expedition crates."
msgstr "把它放到探险物资箱的另一头去吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "That's just the size for my maps and travel journal."
msgstr "尺寸刚好，能装地图跟旅行日记。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "I'd tie something bright to the handle before setting it down."
msgstr "放下之前，我会在柄上绑个醒目的东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Well, someone got a start on the washing."
msgstr "看来有人已经开始洗衣服了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "Finally, a budget for a proper expedition!"
msgstr "总算有经费办一次像样的探险了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "I've never opened an untouched ruin with a key."
msgstr "那些还没人进过的遗迹，我可从没用钥匙开过门。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "Could prop open a hatch in a pinch."
msgstr "急用时能拿它撑住舱盖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I could have a go at that once we set up camp."
msgstr "把营地搭好，我可以去打一回球。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "I'll pack that outside the bag. My maps need to stay dry."
msgstr "把它绑在包外面。地图不能受潮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WHEELER.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I've read plenty of maps. Whatever this is, it's beyond me."
msgstr "地图我读过不少。这东西是什么，我实在看不懂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "YON LITTLE SHIP HATH NO ROOM FOR A THRONE"
msgstr "那小船容不下一张王座"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "A GRIM AND LITTLE BLADE"
msgstr "一柄阴森的小刀"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "WITNESS YE THE ILL MARK UPON YON BLADE"
msgstr "且看那刀上的不祥斑痕"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "WILBA SHALL WAIT UNTIL IT CEASETH GLOWING"
msgstr "沃比娅要等到它不再发红"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "GIVETH WILBA A HILT TO HOLD"
msgstr "且给沃比娅一个能握的刀柄"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "WHEREFORE HATH THE SMITH LEFT IT UNFINISHED?"
msgstr "铁匠为何留它不做完？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "A SWORD FOR HIM WHO WOULD SMITE A GIANT"
msgstr "此刀可授给迎击巨人的勇士"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "WILBA DOTH NOT SWEEP IN HER CROWN"
msgstr "沃比娅可不戴着王冠扫地"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "WHAT METAL HATH THE EARTH GIVEN US?"
msgstr "大地赐予我等何种金属？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "THE FINE ROBE HATH NO ROOM FOR WILBA'S TAIL"
msgstr "好一件袍子，却没处容下沃比娅的尾巴"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "THAT EDGE DOTH MAKE AN END OF FOREVER"
msgstr "此刃能叫永恒也有尽头"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "SHALL WILBA STAND UPON A MERE PLANK?"
msgstr "难道要沃比娅站在区区一块木板上？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "WILBA WOULD KNOW A FALSE FOX ANY DAY"
msgstr "假狐狸休想骗过沃比娅"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "A WARM THING FOR A COLD PRINCESS"
msgstr "一件暖物，给受冷的公主"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "THE SKIES DO SPEAK THROUGH THE STEEL"
msgstr "苍天借此钢刃发声"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "BRING FORTH THE WOODEN SWORDS!"
msgstr "且取木刀来！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "A HUMBLE SHEATH FOR NOBLE STEEL"
msgstr "素木鞘中藏着高贵的钢刃"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "BLACK AS YON CASTLE CELLAR"
msgstr "和那城堡的地窖一样黑"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "GET THEE GONE, FOUL SPIRIT!"
msgstr "污秽之灵，退下！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "KEEP YON RED BLADE FAR FROM THE ROYAL HALL"
msgstr "莫让此红刃接近王室大厅"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "YON GIANT SHALL KNEEL BEFORE WILBA"
msgstr "那巨人定要向沃比娅屈膝"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "THUNDER IN THE COURT!"
msgstr "宫廷里打雷啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "WOULD IT SPARE A CURSED PRINCESS?"
msgstr "它可会放过一位受诅咒的公主？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "WHO LIT THE LETTERS INSIDE YON BOX?"
msgstr "谁点亮了盒里的字？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "A SPEAR FOR THE GUARD AT WILBA'S GATE"
msgstr "这把长枪该交给沃比娅门口的卫兵"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "THAT BLADE HATH A GENTLER DUTY"
msgstr "此刃身负更仁慈的职责"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "WHO BURIED YON SWORD IN LIVING STONE?"
msgstr "谁把刀封进了石中？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "LET NONE DRAW IT WITHIN THE PALACE WALLS"
msgstr "王宫墙内，谁也不得将它拔出"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "WILBA SHALL CARRY HER OWN BOOKS"
msgstr "沃比娅自己背书"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "WHAT SHADOW DARES TO WEAR AN EDGE?"
msgstr "什么影子胆敢带着锋刃？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "THE LAUNDRY HATH FALLEN"
msgstr "洗过的衣物掉了"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "TO THE ROYAL TREASURY WITH THEE!"
msgstr "送入王室库房！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "NOW THE STUBBORN CHEST SHALL OPEN"
msgstr "这下那口顽固的箱子该开了"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "WILBA HATH FOUND THE IRON FROM THE WALL"
msgstr "沃比娅找到了墙里的铁"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "WHO SHALL PITCH TO THEIR PRINCESS?"
msgstr "谁来给公主投球？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "YON SWORD IS WET WITH NO CLOUD IN SIGHT"
msgstr "不见一片云，那把刀却是湿的"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILBA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "WILBA KNOWETH NOT YON LETTERS"
msgstr "沃比娅不识那上头的字"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD"
msgid "One passenger. Little cover."
msgstr "只能载一人，没有多少掩护。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI"
msgid "Leave it sheathed."
msgstr "别拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI"
msgid "Something's soaked into the steel."
msgstr "有东西渗进了钢里。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT"
msgid "Use the tongs."
msgstr "用火钳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE"
msgid "Good edge. Finish the grip first."
msgstr "刃口不错。先把柄做完。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY"
msgid "The profile's set. The edge isn't."
msgstr "轮廓定了，刃还没开。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE"
msgid "Too heavy to carry unless you know what you're facing."
msgstr "太重了。确定要对付什么再带上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB"
msgid "It'd pass for part of a uniform."
msgstr "当成制服的一部分也说得过去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MINGOT"
msgid "I'll need a sample before I can identify it."
msgstr "给我一份样本，才能确认成分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR"
msgid "The sleeves would catch on my kit."
msgstr "袖子会勾住我的装备。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE"
msgid "So there is a way to make sure they stay down."
msgstr "原来有办法让他们倒下后再也起不来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM"
msgid "Low profile. No room for spare gear."
msgstr "目标小，放不下备用装备。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK"
msgid "It hides my face and cuts my field of view."
msgstr "能遮脸，也挡视野。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF"
msgid "Wrap it tight. Loose ends catch."
msgstr "围紧。垂下来的部分容易勾住东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI"
msgid "That flash tells them exactly where you are."
msgstr "一闪光，对面就知道你在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHINAI"
msgid "Good for drills. Clear the floor first."
msgstr "适合操练。先清空场地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA"
msgid "Plain wooden sheath. Easy to carry unnoticed."
msgstr "素木刀鞘，带在身上不显眼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI"
msgid "No glint off the blade. Useful."
msgstr "刀刃不反光。有用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN"
msgid "I don't take orders from people. A sword won't change that."
msgstr "我连人的命令都不听，更轮不到一把刀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI"
msgid "Keep it covered. I've seen enough of that colour."
msgstr "遮起来。那颜色我已经见够了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE"
msgid "I wouldn't carry it through a doorway in a hurry."
msgstr "赶时间过门时，我不会带它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI"
msgid "If we want to leave quietly, that stays behind."
msgstr "要悄悄离开，就把它留下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA"
msgid "I'd want to know what it considers a target."
msgstr "我得先弄清它会把谁当目标。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.VSCODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.VSCODE"
msgid "An editor. We'd need the project files for it to be useful."
msgstr "代码编辑器。得有项目文件才能派上用场。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.YARI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.YARI"
msgid "Good reach. Awkward in a confined space."
msgstr "够得远，在狭窄处不好使。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA"
msgid "A weapon that brings people back. I'd want proof."
msgstr "能救人回来的武器。我得先看证据。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "The blade's sealed in. Check the stone before touching it."
msgstr "刀封在里面。碰之前先检查石头。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "With that much force, I'd keep it away from anyone on my side."
msgstr "用起来力道太大，我会让它离自己人远点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "The buckles still close properly. I can use it."
msgstr "搭扣还能扣牢。能用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.KAGE"
msgid "If I can't see the edge, neither can the person in front of me."
msgstr "我看不见刃口，对面的人也一样。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU"
msgid "Leave it where it is."
msgstr "放在原处。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "It's only worth something where they'll accept it."
msgstr "得有人肯收，这钱才值钱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Useful when the door won't open and there's no key."
msgstr "门打不开，又没钥匙时能用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "It'll do. Keep the rust off whatever it's packed with."
msgstr "能凑合。收起来时，别让锈蹭到其他东西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "It's Shino's. I don't need to try it to be sure."
msgstr "志乃的。不用试也知道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "It's wet again. I just wiped it dry."
msgstr "又湿了。我刚擦干过。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.INOUE.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I can't verify what this says."
msgstr "这上面写的什么，我没法确认。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I can't make sense of these markings."
msgstr "我看不懂这些记号。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA"
msgid "There's an old story behind this blade."
msgstr "这把刀背后有个古老的传说。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "I could give it a swing if someone pitched."
msgstr "要是有人投球，我倒可以挥一棒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "That'll get the lid off."
msgstr "用它就能撬开盖子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Is that a sword hilt sticking out of the stone?"
msgstr "从石头里露出来的是刀柄吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "The blade is damp, but the hilt is dry."
msgstr "刀身是湿的，刀柄却是干的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "A heavy length of ribbed steel."
msgstr "一段沉甸甸的带肋钢筋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.ANNOUNCE_LNCOMPREHENSIBLE"
msgid "I can't read this. Is it even written right side up?"
msgstr "我看不懂。这张纸拿正了吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "That's my bat. Give it back when you're done."
msgstr "我的球棒。用完了记得还我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "The bent end's supposed to look like that. This one's fine."
msgstr "撬棍那头本来就是弯的。这根没坏。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "It's wedged in there. Want me to try pulling it out?"
msgstr "卡得还挺紧。要我试着拔出来吗？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Takina keeps hers done up. Mine's usually full of loose paper."
msgstr "泷奈的包总是扣好的。我包里通常塞满了散纸。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "Why's it wet? I didn't even take it outside."
msgstr "怎么湿了？我都没把它拿到外面去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.KIRITZUKA.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "I picked up a piece like this on the way home once."
msgstr "有一回放学路上，我也捡过这么一根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Shino's taught me to leave more room behind her when she swings."
msgstr "志乃教过我，她挥棒时得离她身后远一点。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR"
msgid "Better to pry it open with this than dull one of my blades."
msgstr "用这根撬棍开，比拿我的刀去撬钝了强。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Whoever sealed this blade in stone meant for it to stay there."
msgstr "把刀封进石头里的人，大概不想让它再出来。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK"
msgid "Takina keeps her things in good order. I should ask how she does it."
msgstr "泷奈的东西总收得整整齐齐。我该问问她是怎么做到的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.MURASAME"
msgid "There's fresh water on the blade. I'll wait before sliding it back into the saya."
msgstr "刀身还带着水汽。等一等再入鞘吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000"
msgid "I'd like to see the look on the shopkeeper's face."
msgstr "真想看看店主见到它时的表情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.MANUTSAWEE.DESCRIBE.REBAR"
msgid "It's got good weight, but I'd leave it to Shino."
msgstr "分量倒很好。我还是把它留给志乃吧。"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.BASEBALLBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.BASEBALLBAT"
msgid "Baseball Bat"
msgstr "棒球棒"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.CROWBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.CROWBAR"
msgid "Crowbar"
msgstr "撬棍"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB"
msgid "Dreadstone Tomb"
msgstr "绝望石封墓"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.MURASAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.MURASAME"
msgid "Murasame"
msgstr "村雨"

#. STRINGS.NAMES.REBAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.NAMES.REBAR"
msgid "Rebar"
msgstr "钢筋"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.1"
msgid "Oh, there's our host already."
msgstr "啊，主持人已经到了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.CARNIVAL_HOST_HERE.2"
msgid "No need to call the bird again."
msgstr "不必再叫那只鸟了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.1"
msgid "Not even a whisker inside."
msgstr "里面连根胡须也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.EMPTY_CATCOONDEN.2"
msgid "I suppose the little one's out."
msgstr "小家伙大概出门了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.1"
msgid "After you. I've time to wait."
msgstr "您先，我等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.HOSTBUSY.2"
msgid "Let me know when you're finished."
msgstr "用完了请叫我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.1"
msgid "We need a few more little players."
msgstr "还得再找几只小猫参加。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDERS.2"
msgid "Who else would like to hide?"
msgstr "还有哪只小猫想藏起来？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.1"
msgid "I'd see every kitten from here."
msgstr "站在这儿就能看见每一只。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_NOT_ENOUGH_HIDING_SPOTS.2"
msgid "Let's find them some better hiding places."
msgstr "得给小猫们找些合适的藏身处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.1"
msgid "We've played today's round already."
msgstr "今天那一轮已经玩过了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.KITCOON_HIDEANDSEEK_ONE_GAME_PER_DAY.2"
msgid "Same time tomorrow, kittens?"
msgstr "小猫们，明天这个时候再来？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.1"
msgid "The latch won't budge."
msgstr "门闩动不了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.LOCKED_GATE.2"
msgid "Who has the key to this gate?"
msgstr "谁有这扇门的钥匙？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.1"
msgid "The fit looks a little off."
msgstr "大小似乎不太合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.MANNEQUIN_EQUIPSWAPFAILED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own outfit on."
msgstr "我还是穿自己这套吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL.1"
msgid "All the booths are packed away."
msgstr "摊位都收起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOCARNIVAL.2"
msgid "I missed the birds this time."
msgstr "这次错过鸟儿们的游园会了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.1"
msgid "I haven't got the right machinery for this."
msgstr "我身上没有做这件事的机械。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTAROBOT.2"
msgid "Perhaps WX could give it a try."
msgstr "也许可以请WX来试试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.1"
msgid "They'd rather deal with a merm."
msgstr "它们更愿意和鱼人打交道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMERM.2"
msgid "Wurt, could you help me with this?"
msgstr "沃特，你能帮帮我吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.1"
msgid "Willow, I think he'd like you to do it."
msgstr "薇洛，他好像想让你来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.NOTMYBERNIE.2"
msgid "He doesn't know me well enough."
msgstr "他和我还不够熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.1"
msgid "I've come without my pillow."
msgstr "我忘了带枕头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ACTIVATE.PILLOWFIGHT_NO_HANDPILLOW.2"
msgid "One moment. A fair match needs two pillows."
msgstr "稍等，要公平得一人一个枕头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.1"
msgid "That's quite enough medicine already."
msgstr "药量已经够足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPLYELIXIR.TOO_SUPER.2"
msgid "I should save this dose for later."
msgstr "这份药先留着吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.1"
msgid "After you. I've time to wait."
msgstr "您先，我等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.APPRAISE.NOTNOW.2"
msgid "Let me know when you're finished."
msgstr "用完了请叫我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.1"
msgid "I haven't the strength to bind myself to it."
msgstr "我现在没有力气和它连结。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.ATTUNE.NOHEALTH.2"
msgid "A little rest before I try that."
msgstr "让我先歇口气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.1"
msgid "There's already something fizzing in there."
msgstr "里面已经在冒泡了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.ALREADY_BOMBED.2"
msgid "I'll save mine for the next bath."
msgstr "我的留到下次泡澡用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.1"
msgid "It's sealed under glass."
msgstr "上面封了一层玻璃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BATHBOMB.GLASSED.2"
msgid "I can't get to the water through that."
msgstr "隔着这层够不到水。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.1"
msgid "After you. I've time to wait."
msgstr "您先，我等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.BUSY_STATION.2"
msgid "Let me know when you're finished."
msgstr "用完了请叫我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.1"
msgid "I've already got company."
msgstr "我已经有个伴了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.HASPET.2"
msgid "I'd better look after the one with me."
msgstr "还是照顾好跟着我的这只吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.1"
msgid "My hands are on the reins."
msgstr "我手里还握着缰绳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.MOUNTED.2"
msgid "I'll get down and do it properly."
msgstr "我下来再做。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.1"
msgid "I've already got company."
msgstr "我已经有个伴了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ACTIONFAIL.BUILD.TICOON.2
