msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.1"
msgid "The mixture hasn't changed at all."
msgstr "那份药水一点变化也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOONPOTION_FAILED.2"
msgid "Perhaps the moon isn't right tonight."
msgstr "也许今晚的月相不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.1"
msgid "That buzzing is getting closer!"
msgstr "嗡嗡声越来越近了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOSQUITOS.2"
msgid "Ow! Please find another target!"
msgstr "疼！别围着我了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. You need a rest."
msgstr "慢些，朋友。你该歇歇了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MOUNT_LOWHEALTH.2"
msgid "I'd better look after my mount."
msgstr "得先照料我的坐骑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.1"
msgid "Keep an eye on those birds!"
msgstr "留意那些鸟！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_MUTATED_BUZZARD_ARRIVAL.2"
msgid "I don't like the look of those wings."
msgstr "那几双翅膀看起来不太对劲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK.1"
msgid "Let's get somewhere safe first."
msgstr "先去个安全的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERAFK.2"
msgid "I can't turn my back on that danger yet."
msgstr "危险就在身后，我还不能分心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.1"
msgid "Let's get somewhere safe first."
msgstr "先去个安全的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERGIFT.2"
msgid "I can't turn my back on that danger yet."
msgstr "危险就在身后，我还不能分心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.1"
msgid "Let's get somewhere safe first."
msgstr "先去个安全的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSIESTA.2
