msgstr "危险就在身后，我还不能分心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.1"
msgid "Let's get somewhere safe first."
msgstr "先去个安全的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODANGERSLEEP.2"
msgid "I can't turn my back on that danger yet."
msgstr "危险就在身后，我还不能分心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.1"
msgid "This is the wrong time for a nap."
msgstr "现在不是小睡的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP.2"
msgid "I'll lie down at a better hour."
msgstr "换个合适的时候再躺下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.1"
msgid "This is the wrong time for a nap."
msgstr "现在不是小睡的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NODAYSLEEP_CAVE.2"
msgid "I'll lie down at a better hour."
msgstr "换个合适的时候再躺下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.1"
msgid "I won't sleep with my stomach growling."
msgstr "饿得肚子直响，睡不着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSIESTA.2"
msgid "Supper first, bed second."
msgstr "先吃饭再休息。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.1"
msgid "I won't sleep with my stomach growling."
msgstr "饿得肚子直响，睡不着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOHUNGERSLEEP.2"
msgid "Supper first, bed second."
msgstr "先吃饭再休息。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.1"
msgid "I should get down to open it."
msgstr "先从坐骑上下来再拆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOMOUNTEDGIFT.2"
msgid "A present deserves both hands."
msgstr "得腾出两只手好好拆礼物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.1"
msgid "This is the wrong time for a nap."
msgstr "现在不是小睡的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA.2"
msgid "I'll lie down at a better hour."
msgstr "换个合适的时候再躺下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.1"
msgid "This is the wrong time for a nap."
msgstr "现在不是小睡的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NONIGHTSIESTA_CAVE.2"
msgid "I'll lie down at a better hour."
msgstr "换个合适的时候再躺下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.1"
msgid "Put the fire out first!"
msgstr "先把火扑灭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOPUMPKINCARVINGONFIRE.2"
msgid "I'm keeping my hands off those flames."
msgstr "我可不想把手伸进火里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT.1"
msgid "That light goes right through my eyelids."
msgstr "闭上眼都觉得亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPHASPERMANENTLIGHT.2"
msgid "Somewhere darker would be easier."
msgstr "换个暗些的地方才睡得着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.1"
msgid "Put the fire out first!"
msgstr "先把火扑灭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOSLEEPONFIRE.2"
msgid "I'm keeping my hands off those flames."
msgstr "我可不想把手伸进火里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.1"
msgid "Put the fire out first!"
msgstr "先把火扑灭！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NOWARDROBEONFIRE.2"
msgid "I'm keeping my hands off those flames."
msgstr "我可不想把手伸进火里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.1"
msgid "I can't find the trap."
msgstr "我没找到陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_NO_TRAP.2"
msgid "Did someone already take it?"
msgstr "有人已经把它收走了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.1"
msgid "The line fell short."
msgstr "线抛得太近了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_BADCAST.2"
msgid "Let me cast that again."
msgstr "我再抛一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.1"
msgid "It slipped the hook!"
msgstr "它脱钩了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_GOTAWAY.2"
msgid "Back into the deep it goes."
msgstr "看着它又游回深水里去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1.1"
msgid "Just a ripple."
msgstr "只是水纹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.1.2"
msgid "I'll wait a little longer."
msgstr "我再等一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2.1"
msgid "Was that a nibble?"
msgstr "刚才有鱼咬钩吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.2.2"
msgid "The float hasn't dipped."
msgstr "浮标还没沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3.1"
msgid "It's quiet out here."
msgstr "水面真静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.3.2"
msgid "Patience is part of practice."
msgstr "练习也得有耐心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4.1"
msgid "Steady hands, Louis."
msgstr "露易丝，手稳住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_IDLE_QUOTE.4.2"
msgid "I can hear the water lap the hull."
msgstr "能听见水拍船身的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.1"
msgid "I lost the tension on the line."
msgstr "线松了，手上没了拉力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINESNAP.2"
msgid "I'll have to mind the line more closely."
msgstr "得更仔细地留意鱼线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.1"
msgid "I lost the tension on the line."
msgstr "线松了，手上没了拉力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEANFISHING_LINETOOLOOSE.2"
msgid "I'll have to mind the line more closely."
msgstr "得更仔细地留意鱼线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.1"
msgid "There's something on the horizon."
msgstr "海平线上有东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OCEAN_SILHOUETTE_INCOMING.2"
msgid "That shape is coming toward us."
msgstr "那道影子在向我们靠近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.1"
msgid "Was it my turn to speak?"
msgstr "刚才该我念词了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OFF_SCRIPT.2"
msgid "Let me find my place in the script."
msgstr "让我找找剧本念到哪儿了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.1"
msgid "There goes the den."
msgstr "窝散开了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_DENBROKEN.2"
msgid "I hope the otters got clear."
msgstr "希望水獭们躲开了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.1"
msgid "The shallows are behind us now."
msgstr "浅滩已经在我们身后了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_OTTERBOAT_OUTOFSHALLOWS.2"
msgid "That's deeper water under the boat."
msgstr "船下的水深多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.1"
msgid "Ow, mind that beak!"
msgstr "疼，当心那张嘴！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PECKED.2"
msgid "My sleeve isn't bird feed."
msgstr "我的袖口可不是鸟食。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.1"
msgid "That sounded like wood turning to stone."
msgstr "那声音像是木头在石化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PETRIFED_TREES.2"
msgid "I should check the trees when it's quiet."
msgstr "等静下来，我得去看看那些树。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.1"
msgid "Those spots weren't there before."
msgstr "这些斑点以前还没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PICK_DISEASE_WARNING.2"
msgid "Keep that plant away from the healthy ones."
msgstr "得把这株和健康的植株分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.1"
msgid "Someone's coming alongside!"
msgstr "有船靠上来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PIRATES_ARRIVE.2"
msgid "Keep the cargo close! Pirates!"
msgstr "海盗！看好船上的货！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot and see what comes up."
msgstr "我做个记号，看它能长出什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RANDOMSEED.2"
msgid "I wonder what I've just planted."
msgstr "不知道我刚种下了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1.1"
msgid "I'll jot that down before I forget."
msgstr "趁还记得，我先把它记下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PLANT_RESEARCHED.1.2"
msgid "That should help with the garden."
msgstr "照料菜园时能用得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.1"
msgid "Oh! Give me a moment to get my bearings."
msgstr "啊，等我认一下方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.2"
msgid "I'd almost prefer the walk."
msgstr "我都觉得走路好些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.1"
msgid "There's no ground there!"
msgstr "那边没有落脚的地方！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_PREFALLINVOID.2"
msgid "Back from the edge!"
msgstr "离边缘远点！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.1"
msgid "Stones are coming loose overhead!"
msgstr "头顶的石头松了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_QUAKE.2"
msgid "Away from the falling rubble!"
msgstr "躲开落石！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.1"
msgid "His Majesty needs more room."
msgstr "得给陛下留点位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKINGHORN_BADSPAWNPOINT.2"
msgid "I'll sound the horn somewhere clearer."
msgstr "我找个空旷的地方再吹号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1"
msgid "His Majesty looks furious."
msgstr "陛下看上去很生气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2"
msgid "I think we'd better stand back."
msgstr "我们还是退开些吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.1"
msgid "What fine ears, Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下的耳朵真神气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKY.2"
msgid "A bow for the rabbit king."
msgstr "向兔王行礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.1"
msgid "What fine ears, Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下的耳朵真神气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_LUCKYCAUGHT.2"
msgid "A bow for the rabbit king."
msgstr "向兔王行礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1"
msgid "What fine ears, Your Majesty."
msgstr "陛下的耳朵真神气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2"
msgid "A bow for the rabbit king."
msgstr "向兔王行礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.1"
msgid "That barely left a mark."
msgstr "刚才那下连印子都没留下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REPELLED.2"
msgid "I'll need something stronger for this."
msgstr "得换件更有力的才行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.1"
msgid "Oh! I see how the pieces fit now."
msgstr "原来如此，这几处能连起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RESEARCH.2"
msgid "Let me try that once from memory."
msgstr "让我凭记忆试一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Ah... I can breathe again."
msgstr "啊……又能呼吸了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_FROM_CORPSE.2"
msgid "You came back for me. Thank you."
msgstr "你回来救我了。谢谢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Take my hand. I'll stay with you."
msgstr "把手给我，我就在这儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVED_OTHER_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Easy now. Take a breath."
msgstr "慢些，先喘口气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.1"
msgid "Take my hand. I'll stay with you."
msgstr "把手给我，我就在这儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_REVIVING_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Easy now. Take a breath."
msgstr "慢些，先喘口气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1.1"
msgid "My respects to the crown."
msgstr "请让我向陛下行礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.1.2"
msgid "Good day to you."
msgstr "祝您安好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2.1"
msgid "May I approach?"
msgstr "我可以上前吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.2.2"
msgid "A bow, as courtesy requires."
msgstr "依礼，应当鞠躬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3.1"
msgid "My respects."
msgstr "请受我一礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY.3.2"
msgid "I hope the court is well."
msgstr "愿宫中诸事安好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1.1"
msgid "My respects to the crown."
msgstr "请让我向陛下行礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.1.2"
msgid "Good day to you."
msgstr "祝您安好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2.1"
msgid "May I approach?"
msgstr "我可以上前吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.2.2"
msgid "A bow, as courtesy requires."
msgstr "依礼，应当鞠躬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3.1"
msgid "My respects."
msgstr "请受我一礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_ROYALTY_JOKER.3.2"
msgid "I hope the court is well."
msgstr "愿宫中诸事安好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.1"
msgid "I can hear the ruins stirring again."
msgstr "我又听见遗迹里有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_RUINS_RESET.2"
msgid "We'll have to be careful down there again."
msgstr "下次再下去又得小心了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.1"
msgid "It didn't accept my offering."
msgstr "它没收下我的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_NO.2"
msgid "I'll have to reconsider what I put inside."
msgstr "得重新想想该往里面放什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.1"
msgid "It accepted the offering."
msgstr "供品收下了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SACREDCHEST_YES.2"
msgid "I think we chose well."
msgstr "看来东西选对了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.1"
msgid "There's no room left on the page."
msgstr "纸上写不下了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SCRAPBOOK_FULL.2"
msgid "I'll need a fresh page for another entry."
msgstr "再记一条就得换新页了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.1"
msgid "Something's following me. Can you see it?"
msgstr "有东西跟着我。你看得见吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SECURITY_PULSE_FOLLOWING.2"
msgid "Quiet. I'm listening for it."
msgstr "轻声，我在听它的动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.1"
msgid "Something's following me. Can you see it?"
msgstr "有东西跟着我。你看得见吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOWTHRALL_STEALTH.2"
msgid "Quiet. I'm listening for it."
msgstr "轻声，我在听它的动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.1"
msgid "Something is forcing its way through!"
msgstr "有什么正从里面挤出来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHADOW_RIFT_MAX.2"
msgid "We'd better move away from that rift."
msgstr "得离那道裂隙远点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.1"
msgid "It's dry under here."
msgstr "这下面很干爽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SHELTER.2"
msgid "Come stand out of the weather."
msgstr "过来避一避吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.1"
msgid "My feet are caught!"
msgstr "脚被缠住了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED.2"
msgid "Hold on. I can't move yet."
msgstr "等等，我还动不了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.1"
msgid "My feet are caught!"
msgstr "脚被缠住了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNARED_IVY.2"
msgid "Hold on. I can't move yet."
msgstr "等等，我还动不了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.1"
msgid "There's no loose snow left here."
msgstr "这里没有松雪了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_NO_SNOW.2"
msgid "Let's try rolling it somewhere white."
msgstr "换个有积雪的地方滚吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.1"
msgid "I can't get it rolling anymore."
msgstr "我已经推不动它了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SNOWBALL_TOO_BIG.2"
msgid "I think that's big enough."
msgstr "这么大就够了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.1"
msgid "That's water running down my collar."
msgstr "水顺着领口流进来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SOAKED.2"
msgid "I'll need a dry change of clothes."
msgstr "得找一身干衣服换上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.1"
msgid "What was that?!"
msgstr "刚才那是什么？！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_SPOOKED.2"
msgid "My heart's still racing."
msgstr "心还跳得好快。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.1"
msgid "I felt that right through my soles."
msgstr "隔着鞋底都感觉到了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_STOMP_SHROUDEN.2"
msgid "That thing's underfoot!"
msgstr "那东西就在脚下！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1.1"
msgid "A new leaf today?"
msgstr "今天长新叶了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.1.2"
msgid "I'm glad you're doing well."
msgstr "长得好我就放心了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2.1"
msgid "I've brought water."
msgstr "我带了水来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.2.2"
msgid "I'll pull those weeds for you."
msgstr "我帮你把草拔了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3.1"
msgid "You've grown since yesterday."
msgstr "比昨天长高了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.3.2"
msgid "I won't tread on your roots."
msgstr "我会避开你的根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4.1"
msgid "Hello again, little sprout."
msgstr "小苗，我又来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.4.2"
msgid "How's the soil today?"
msgstr "今天的土还好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5.1"
msgid "Mind if I sit here?"
msgstr "我在这儿坐坐好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TALK_TO_PLANTS.5.2"
msgid "I should visit more often."
msgstr "我该常来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.1"
msgid "Ow, right through my glove."
msgstr "疼，扎穿手套了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THORNS.2"
msgid "I missed a thorn there."
msgstr "那里还有根刺没看见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.1"
msgid "The last ember just went dark."
msgstr "最后一点火星也灭了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_THURIBLE_OUT.2"
msgid "I'll need another light."
msgstr "得再找个照明的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.1"
msgid "I'll have to search on my own."
msgstr "接下来得自己找了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_ABANDONED.2"
msgid "No kitten in sight from here."
msgstr "这里看不见小猫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.1"
msgid "I'll have to search on my own."
msgstr "接下来得自己找了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_DEAD.2"
msgid "No kitten in sight from here."
msgstr "这里看不见小猫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.1"
msgid "Lead the way, I'll follow."
msgstr "你带路，我跟着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_GET_LEADER_ATTENTION.2"
msgid "Did you pick up a scent?"
msgstr "你闻到气味了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.1"
msgid "I'll have to search on my own."
msgstr "接下来得自己找了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_LOST_KITCOON.2"
msgid "No kitten in sight from here."
msgstr "这里看不见小猫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.1"
msgid "Lead the way, I'll follow."
msgstr "你带路，我跟着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NEAR_KITCOON.2"
msgid "Did you pick up a scent?"
msgstr "你闻到气味了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1"
msgid "I'll have to search on my own."
msgstr "接下来得自己找了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2"
msgid "No kitten in sight from here."
msgstr "这里看不见小猫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.1"
msgid "Lead the way, I'll follow."
msgstr "你带路，我跟着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_START_TRACKING.2"
msgid "Did you pick up a scent?"
msgstr "你闻到气味了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.1"
msgid "Lead the way, I'll follow."
msgstr "你带路，我跟着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TICOON_WAITING_FOR_LEADER.2"
msgid "Did you pick up a scent?"
msgstr "你闻到气味了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.1"
msgid "It's headed underground!"
msgstr "它要钻到地下去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPED.2"
msgid "Look where the toad went!"
msgstr "看，那只蟾蜍往那里去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.1"
msgid "It's headed underground!"
msgstr "它要钻到地下去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOADESCAPING.2"
msgid "Look where the toad went!"
msgstr "看，那只蟾蜍往那里去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.1"
msgid "My grip slipped!"
msgstr "手滑了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_SLIP.2"
msgid "I should dry the handle."
msgstr "得擦干手柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.1"
msgid "That barely left a mark."
msgstr "刚才那下连印子都没留下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOOL_TOOWEAK.2"
msgid "I'll need something stronger for this."
msgstr "得换件更有力的才行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.1"
msgid "The last ember just went dark."
msgstr "最后一点火星也灭了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TORCH_OUT.2"
msgid "I'll need another light."
msgstr "得再找个照明的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.1"
msgid "Oh! Give me a moment to get my bearings."
msgstr "啊，等我认一下方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TOWNPORTALTELEPORT.2"
msgid "I'd almost prefer the walk."
msgstr "我都觉得走路好些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.1"
msgid "I heard the trap spring."
msgstr "我听见陷阱触发了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_TRAP_WENT_OFF.2"
msgid "Mind your feet near the trap."
msgstr "靠近陷阱时当心脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.1"
msgid "I don't see a way to do that yet."
msgstr "我还没找到做法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_UNIMPLEMENTED.2"
msgid "I'll have to try another approach."
msgstr "得换个办法试试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.1"
msgid "Who helped me just then?"
msgstr "刚才是谁帮了我？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_SHADOW_ASSIST.2"
msgid "I saw movement in the shadows."
msgstr "我看见暗处有什么动了一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.1"
msgid "I'm still standing in the same place."
msgstr "我还站在原地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_VAULT_TELEPORTER_DOES_NOTHING.2"
msgid "Strange. I felt nothing happen."
msgstr "奇怪，什么动静都没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.1"
msgid "Sand under my hands. I made it."
msgstr "手底下是沙子，到岸了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WASHED_ASHORE.2"
msgid "I could stand to stay on land a while."
msgstr "我想在陆地上待一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.1"
msgid "Come on, little one. Find your feet."
msgstr "小家伙，试着站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAK_RAT.2"
msgid "Perhaps you need a rest before we try again."
msgstr "也许该先歇歇再试一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.1"
msgid "That barely left a mark."
msgstr "刚才那下连印子都没留下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEAPON_TOOWEAK.2"
msgid "I'll need something stronger for this."
msgstr "得换件更有力的才行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT.1"
msgid "The scale reads {weight}."
msgstr "秤上显示的是{weight}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT.2"
msgid "I make that {weight}."
msgstr "我称出来是{weight}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY.1"
msgid "The scale reads {weight}."
msgstr "秤上显示的是{weight}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WEIGHT_HEAVY.2"
msgid "I make that {weight}."
msgstr "我称出来是{weight}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.1"
msgid "That's water running down my collar."
msgstr "水顺着领口流进来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WET.2"
msgid "I'll need a dry change of clothes."
msgstr "得找一身干衣服换上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.1"
msgid "That's water running down my collar."
msgstr "水顺着领口流进来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WETTER.2"
msgid "I'll need a dry change of clothes."
msgstr "得找一身干衣服换上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.1"
msgid "The claw came up empty."
msgstr "爪子捞上来是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_MISS.2"
msgid "I'll line up the winch again."
msgstr "我把绞盘的位置再对准些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.1"
msgid "The claw came up empty."
msgstr "爪子捞上来是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINCH_CLAW_NO_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll line up the winch again."
msgstr "我把绞盘的位置再对准些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.1"
msgid "I can still feel the warmth of that feast."
msgstr "那顿盛宴的暖意还在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF.2"
msgid "I'd like to remember this supper."
msgstr "我会记得这顿晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.1"
msgid "That lovely warmth has faded."
msgstr "那阵暖意散了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WINTERS_FEAST_BUFF_OVER.2"
msgid "I'm glad we had that meal together."
msgstr "很高兴那顿饭是大家一起吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.1"
msgid "Oh! Give me a moment to get my bearings."
msgstr "啊，等我认一下方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMHOLE.2"
msgid "I'd almost prefer the walk."
msgstr "我都觉得走路好些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.1"
msgid "Listen. That's getting nearer."
msgstr "听，声音越来越近了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS.2"
msgid "I should warn the others before it gets here."
msgstr "得赶在它到之前提醒大家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.1"
msgid "Listen. That's getting nearer."
msgstr "听，声音越来越近了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORMS_BOSS.2"
msgid "I should warn the others before it gets here."
msgstr "得赶在它到之前提醒大家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.1"
msgid "I'm still standing in the same place."
msgstr "我还站在原地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_WORTOX_REVIVER_FAILTELEPORT.2"
msgid "Strange. I felt nothing happen."
msgstr "奇怪，什么动静都没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.1"
msgid "I'll remember that stitch."
msgstr "我会记得这个针法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTB_LEARN_NEW_PATTERN.2"
msgid "We can make that costume now."
msgstr "现在能做那套衣装了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.1"
msgid "We still need boats for the race."
msgstr "比赛用的船还不够。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOBOATS.2"
msgid "Let's count the boats before we start."
msgstr "开赛前再数数有几艘船吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.1"
msgid "Where are the course markers?"
msgstr "赛道标志在哪儿？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOCHECKPOINTS.2"
msgid "We need to mark the course first."
msgstr "得先标出赛道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.1"
msgid "We still need boats for the race."
msgstr "比赛用的船还不够。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTD_NOTENOUGHBOATS.2"
msgid "Let's count the boats before we start."
msgstr "开赛前再数数有几艘船吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.1"
msgid "Give it a moment to settle."
msgstr "让它缓一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANNOUNCE_YOTH_ONCOOLDOWN.2"
msgid "I'll try again in a little while."
msgstr "过一会儿我再试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Keep an eye on those birds!"
msgstr "留意那些鸟！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.ANOUNCE_MUTATED_BIRD_ATTACK.2"
msgid "I don't like the look of those wings."
msgstr "那几双翅膀看起来不太对劲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.DEER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.DEER.1"
msgid "There you are. I saw the antlers turn."
msgstr "找到你了，我看见鹿角转过来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.DEER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.DEER.2"
msgid "Easy. I won't lose my footing in the snow."
msgstr "稳住，不能在雪地上滑倒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A bow, then we begin!"
msgstr "行过礼，就开始！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "My blade is ready."
msgstr "刀已出鞘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PIG.1"
msgid "We could still settle this quietly, you know."
msgstr "还来得及好好谈谈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PIG.2"
msgid "Watch those hooves, Louis!"
msgstr "露易丝，留意它的蹄子！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PREY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PREY.1"
msgid "There! Into the clearing!"
msgstr "看，它往空地去了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PREY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.PREY.2"
msgid "I can still see where you went."
msgstr "我还看得见你往哪儿去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER.1"
msgid "I felt that web move!"
msgstr "我感觉到蛛丝动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER.2"
msgid "Mind the silk around my feet."
msgstr "得留意脚边的蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "Up it goes again!"
msgstr "它又跳起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.BATTLECRY.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "Those yellow markings mean trouble."
msgstr "得当心那身黄色斑纹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll sheathe my sword here."
msgstr "我就在这里收刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That's far enough for one encounter."
msgstr "这一场到这里就够了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.1"
msgid "Back to your village, then."
msgstr "回你的村子去吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PIG.2"
msgid "I won't follow anyone into their own home."
msgstr "我不想追进别人家里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.1"
msgid "I lost sight of it in the grass."
msgstr "跑进草里，就看不见了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.PREY.2"
msgid "Some other day. There's a camp to get back to."
msgstr "改天吧，我还得回营地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.1"
msgid "Back on its silk. I'll leave it there."
msgstr "它已经回到蛛网上了，就到这里吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER.2"
msgid "I won't follow that thread into the den."
msgstr "我可不会顺着蛛丝追进巢里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "That last leap put it out of reach."
msgstr "最后那一跳，我已经追不上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.COMBAT_QUIT.SPIDER_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "Let it guard its nest. We've room to pass."
msgstr "让它守着巢吧，我们已经有路可走了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1.1"
msgid "There you are, just by Wendy."
msgstr "你在这儿啊，就在温蒂身边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.1.2"
msgid "I'll give you two a little room."
msgstr "我给你们姐妹俩留些地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2.1"
msgid "A quiet day together, Abigail?"
msgstr "阿比盖尔，今天和妹妹过得好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL1.2.2"
msgid "She knows you're here, I'm sure of it."
msgstr "她一定知道你就在身边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1.1"
msgid "I can see you more clearly today."
msgstr "今天看得更清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.1.2"
msgid "You look steadier, Abigail."
msgstr "阿比盖尔，你看起来稳多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2.1"
msgid "There's more colour in your flower now."
msgstr "你花上的颜色更鲜明了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL2.2.2"
msgid "Would you like to walk with us?"
msgstr "要和我们一起走吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1.1"
msgid "I'll take this side, Abigail."
msgstr "阿比盖尔，这边交给我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.1.2"
msgid "I can feel you from all the way over here."
msgstr "隔着这么远也能感觉到你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2.1"
msgid "Wendy can count on both of us."
msgstr "我们两个都会照应温蒂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.LEVEL3.2.2"
msgid "How brightly you glow today!"
msgstr "你今天真亮！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT.1"
msgid "Even Tenseiga has its limits, Wendy."
msgstr "温蒂，天生牙也有做不到的事。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL.PROMPT.2"
msgid "I wish my blade could do more for your sister."
msgstr "真希望我的刀还能为你姐姐做些什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wendy, did you see the petals shift?"
msgstr "温蒂，看见花瓣动了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll hold it gently. I know who it's for."
msgstr "我会轻轻拿着的，我知道它属于谁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.1"
msgid "Wendy, did you see the petals shift?"
msgstr "温蒂，看见花瓣动了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND.2"
msgid "I'll hold it gently. I know who it's for."
msgstr "我会轻轻拿着的，我知道它属于谁。"

