msgid "I'll hold it gently. I know who it's for."
msgstr "我会轻轻拿着的，我知道它属于谁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the sequitor from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出追随者的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the sequitor again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看追随者。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the lever again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看杠杆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.1"
msgid "I'd draw the accomploshrine before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把奖杯画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.1"
msgid "A tree or a toasted snack? I'll plant this one."
msgstr "种一棵树，还是烤来吃？这颗我想种下去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN.2"
msgid "There's a whole canopy waiting in my palm."
msgstr "手心里这颗小东西，以后能长成一片树荫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.1"
msgid "It smells so much sweeter once the shell splits."
msgstr "壳一裂开，香味就浓多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll save a few for the walk tomorrow."
msgstr "我留几颗明天走路时吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the birchnut sapling growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让桦栗树树苗长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "给根边培些土会好一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the maxwell's door."
msgstr "从麦斯威尔之门回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the enlightened crown with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下启迪之冠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.1"
msgid "Even a piece this small holds the light."
msgstr "这么小一块也能透出光来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD.2"
msgid "I should wrap the broken edge in cloth."
msgstr "断口得用布包好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the lunar essence extractor in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的月亮精华提取器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. It lies so still."
msgstr "可怜，一动也不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll give it a quiet moment."
msgstr "让我安静陪它一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the celestial champion noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道天体英雄比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.1"
msgid "I wonder what the celestial revenant noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道天体仇灵比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.1"
msgid "I wonder what the pure gestalt noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道纯粹虚影比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.1"
msgid "There's no breath left in it."
msgstr "已经没气息了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll give it a quiet moment."
msgstr "让我安静陪它一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the celestial champion from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察天体英雄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the moonglass spike in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的月光玻璃尖刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.1"
msgid "Look, the celestial champion has noticed us."
msgstr "看，天体英雄注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.1"
msgid "I wonder what the defeated celestial champion looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，被击败的天体英雄是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.1"
msgid "That light stayed behind after the guardian fell."
msgstr "守卫倒下后，那团光还留着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB.2"
msgid "I'd like to look at it without standing quite so near."
msgstr "我很想看看，但不必站得这么近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the enlightening snare is set."
msgstr "我得记准启迪陷阱布置在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "别让回营地的人不小心踩上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.1"
msgid "I wonder what the celestial scion noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道天体后裔比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.1"
msgid "I feel something strange around the life giving amulet."
msgstr "靠近重生护符时有种奇怪的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AMULET.2"
msgid "I should save some for the heartrending ballad."
msgstr "我该给心碎歌谣留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.1"
msgid "I'll check the anchor before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查锚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the anchor kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看锚套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the boards to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the geode fruit."
msgstr "晶洞果深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it so it won't scratch against the others."
msgstr "我把它包好，免得和别的磨花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the nightberry to share."
msgstr "希望夜莓够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked nightberry cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟夜莓要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the sproutrock."
msgstr "照点光就能看清萌芽石的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it so it won't scratch against the others."
msgstr "我把它包好，免得和别的磨花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.1"
msgid "Nothing of the sproutrock above the stump now."
msgstr "萌芽石只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the gloomthorn in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看阴郁之棘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.1"
msgid "Nothing of the gloomthorn above the stump now."
msgstr "阴郁之棘只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see it growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让它长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.1"
msgid "I need to check the planting season."
msgstr "我得查查该在什么季节种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON.2"
msgid "Perhaps it'll do better when the weather turns."
msgstr "等换个时节，也许就长得好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.1"
msgid "This sapling needs a different patch of ground."
msgstr "这株苗得换块合适的地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE.2"
msgid "I'll look for soil that suits its roots."
msgstr "我去找适合它生根的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for it."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.1"
msgid "Such an odd beginning for something that grows so tall."
msgstr "长得那么高的东西，起初竟是这个样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED.2"
msgid "I wonder where I ought to plant it."
msgstr "我想知道种在哪里合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the ancient pseudoscience station here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把远古伪科学站留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the broken ancient pseudoscience station here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把损坏的远古伪科学站留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.1"
msgid "I'd draw the ancient remains before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把远古遗骸画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.1"
msgid "I'd draw the ancient statue before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把远古雕像画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the animal track in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的动物足迹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.1"
msgid "I could smell the ant-chovy from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了蚁头凤尾鱼的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I didn't expect the antlion to be quite this large."
msgstr "没想到蚁狮会这么大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nobody wander off alone, please."
msgstr "请别独自走远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.1"
msgid "Feel that trembling? I'd fetch an offering."
msgstr "感觉到震动了吗？得去取件供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY.2"
msgid "I'd give it some room until it settles down."
msgstr "等它平静些再靠近吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.1"
msgid "No more rumbling. I think it liked our gift."
msgstr "没有轰隆声了。它应该喜欢我们的礼物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY.2"
msgid "It seems we're on quite good terms today."
msgstr "看来今天我们相处得挺好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the turf-raiser helm with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下刮地皮头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the beach toy to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把沙滩玩具拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.1"
msgid "You can hear the ancient sentrypede long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到远古哨兵蜈蚣跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.1"
msgid "You can hear the sentrypede husk long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到哨兵蜈蚣壳跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the ancient kiln."
msgstr "远古窑烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "I can wait. Rushing the ancient kiln won't help."
msgstr "我等得起，催远古窑也没用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "I'll come back when that smell gets a little stronger."
msgstr "等香气再浓一点，我就回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "I think the ancient kiln is nearly finished."
msgstr "我看远古窑就快好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Just time to lay things out before it's done."
msgstr "趁还差那么一会儿，把东西摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.1"
msgid "Time to see what the ancient kiln has for us."
msgstr "该看看远古窑这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the ancient kiln at the moment."
msgstr "远古窑里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.1"
msgid "You can hear the distilled knowledge long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到蒸馏的知识跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the fountain of knowledge long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到知识饮水机跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the fountain of knowledge."
msgstr "知识饮水机现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.1"
msgid "You can hear the ancient moon statue long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到远古月亮雕像跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to hear all its parts moving together."
msgstr "真想听听所有部件一同运转的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN.2"
msgid "I wonder who remembers how to play this thing."
msgstr "不知道还有谁记得怎么演奏它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the sealed portal long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到封印的传送门跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the sealed portal."
msgstr "封印的传送门现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the astral detector long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到星象探测仪跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.1"
msgid "No note from it now."
msgstr "现在听不见共鸣声了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE.2"
msgid "Perhaps there's nothing left for it to find here."
msgstr "也许这里已经没有能探到的东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the astral detector before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开星象探测仪以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.1"
msgid "I think this follows the last carving."
msgstr "这似乎接着上一幅雕刻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1.2"
msgid "There's another mark right at the edge."
msgstr "边缘上还有一个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.1"
msgid "I want to make a rubbing of these marks."
msgstr "我想把这些刻痕拓下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2.2"
msgid "I'd need time to read the whole thing."
msgstr "读完整段得花点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.1"
msgid "I think this follows the last carving."
msgstr "这似乎接着上一幅雕刻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3.2"
msgid "I'll trace the line without touching it."
msgstr "我顺着线条看就好，不伸手去摸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.1"
msgid "Look at the spacing of those cuts."
msgstr "看这些刻痕之间的间距。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4.2"
msgid "I'll trace the line without touching it."
msgstr "我顺着线条看就好，不伸手去摸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.1"
msgid "That mark appears more than once."
msgstr "这个记号出现了不止一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5.2"
msgid "There's another mark right at the edge."
msgstr "边缘上还有一个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the ancient guard post long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到远古哨所跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the ancient guard post."
msgstr "远古哨所现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.1"
msgid "You can hear it long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到它跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.1"
msgid "I'll have to find the right piece for the ornate pedestal."
msgstr "我得给华丽基座找件合适的配件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS.2"
msgid "Something of the right shape should fit there."
msgstr "那个位置得放形状对得上的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the ornate pedestal."
msgstr "华丽基座的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "I could wear the scalemail over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层鳞甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the dreadstone armor."
msgstr "我想试试穿上绝望石盔甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the grass suit before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过草甲合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the marble suit."
msgstr "我想试试穿上大理石甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the thulecite suit."
msgstr "我想试试穿上铥矿甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the bone armor before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过骨头盔甲合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.1"
msgid "I could wear the belt of hunger over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层饥饿腰带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER.2"
msgid "I can see where the slurper pelt went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了啜食者皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.1"
msgid "I could wear the snurtle shell armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层蜗壳护甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the w.a.r.b.i.s. armor before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过W.A.R.B.I.S.盔甲合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the log suit."
msgstr "我想试试穿上木甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the bramble husk."
msgstr "我想试试穿上荆棘外壳还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.1"
msgid "I could wear the coat of carrots over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层胡萝卜外套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "I could wear the brightshade armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层亮茄盔甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1"
msgid "I could wear the brambleshade armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层荆棘茄甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the craggy carapace before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过嶙峋甲壳合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_ROCKY.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the night armor."
msgstr "我想试试穿上暗夜甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the papyrus to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "I could wear the void robe over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层虚空长袍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.1"
msgid "I could wear the gilded knight's chest plate over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层镀金骑士胸甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the directional sign before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到指路木牌旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd better check which way the arrow points."
msgstr "我得看清箭头朝哪边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone left directions for the rest of us."
msgstr "有人给后来的人指了路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "There's room for a drawing on the directional sign."
msgstr "指路木牌上还能添一幅画。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "I should decide what to put here before I start."
msgstr "落笔前得先想好画什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the directional sign stood."
msgstr "指路木牌原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "We'll be able to find our way back by the directional sign."
msgstr "回来的时候可以凭指路木牌认路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the boards to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "There's room for a drawing on the directional sign."
msgstr "指路木牌上还能添一幅画。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "I should decide what to put here before I start."
msgstr "落笔前得先想好画什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I could use the ashes back at the workbench."
msgstr "工作台上也许用得着灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the pumpkin pie."
msgstr "我该给南瓜派留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.1"
msgid "I can still make out the shape in the ashes."
msgstr "灰里还能看出一点原来的形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE.2"
msgid "I wish I'd seen it before the fire."
msgstr "要是起火前我能看它一眼就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.1"
msgid "I can still make out the shape in the ashes."
msgstr "灰里还能看出一点原来的形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER.2"
msgid "I wish I'd seen it before the fire."
msgstr "要是起火前我能看它一眼就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.1"
msgid "I can still make out the shape in the ashes."
msgstr "灰里还能看出一点原来的形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE.2"
msgid "I wish I'd seen it before the fire."
msgstr "要是起火前我能看它一眼就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.1"
msgid "I'd save the asparagus for after practice."
msgstr "我想把芦笋留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the asparagus soup differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给芦笋汤调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP.2"
msgid "I can taste the asparagus in every bite."
msgstr "每口都能尝出芦笋的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the roasted asparagus."
msgstr "吃烤芦笋我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant asparagus before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型芦笋再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'll mark the row where I sow the tubular seeds."
msgstr "播下筒状种子的那一行，我会做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the ancient gateway again."
msgstr "现在再用远古大门还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the ancient gateway again."
msgstr "现在再用远古大门还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.1"
msgid "I don't want to be caught beside the ancient gateway when the ritual ends."
msgstr "仪式结束时，我可不想还站在远古大门旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING.2"
msgid "Everyone ready? Something's about to happen."
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？马上要有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the ancient gateway."
msgstr "远古大门现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the ancient gateway from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出远古大门的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.1"
msgid "I don't want to be caught beside the ancient gateway when the ritual ends."
msgstr "仪式结束时，我可不想还站在远古大门旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.RITUAL_SUMMONING.2"
msgid "Everyone ready? Something's about to happen."
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？马上要有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.1"
msgid "Somewhere there's a lock made for the ancient key."
msgstr "一定有把锁和远古钥匙配套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY.2"
msgid "I won't leave this lying around."
msgstr "这个不能随手乱放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around the ancient beacon for the moment."
msgstr "远古灯柱这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.1"
msgid "There. the ancient beacon is working."
msgstr "好了，远古灯柱开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the ancient obelisk."
msgstr "我标一下发现远古方尖碑的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll watch the blighted larynx without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动枯萎喉头，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "I don't want to be caught beside the blighted larynx when the ritual ends."
msgstr "仪式结束时，我可不想还站在枯萎喉头旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_BAT.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Everyone ready? Something's about to happen."
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？马上要有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the blighted claw if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，枯萎钳爪也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "I don't want to be caught beside the blighted claw when the ritual ends."
msgstr "仪式结束时，我可不想还站在枯萎钳爪旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_ROCKY.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Everyone ready? Something's about to happen."
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？马上要有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd bring the blighted guts back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把枯萎内脏带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.1"
msgid "I don't want to be caught beside the blighted guts when the ritual ends."
msgstr "仪式结束时，我可不想还站在枯萎内脏旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RITUAL_ORGAN_WORM.IN_RITUAL.2"
msgid "Everyone ready? Something's about to happen."
msgstr "大家准备好了吗？马上要有动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.1"
msgid "That mark appears more than once."
msgstr "这个记号出现了不止一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1.2"
msgid "I'll trace the line without touching it."
msgstr "我顺着线条看就好，不伸手去摸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.1"
msgid "That mark appears more than once."
msgstr "这个记号出现了不止一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2.2"
msgid "I should sketch this before I forget it."
msgstr "我该趁还记得把它画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.1"
msgid "That mark appears more than once."
msgstr "这个记号出现了不止一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3.2"
msgid "Who carved this so far underground?"
msgstr "是谁在这么深的地下刻了字？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.1"
msgid "That mark appears more than once."
msgstr "这个记号出现了不止一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4.2"
msgid "I'd need time to read the whole thing."
msgstr "读完整段得花点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.1"
msgid "I want to make a rubbing of these marks."
msgstr "我想把这些刻痕拓下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5.2"
msgid "I'd need time to read the whole thing."
msgstr "读完整段得花点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.1"
msgid "I'd draw the ancient statue before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把远古雕像画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.1"
msgid "The haft fits my hand. Which tree did we mark?"
msgstr "柄很合手，我们给哪棵树做了记号？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.AXE.2"
msgid "I'll wipe the sap off before it dries."
msgstr "得趁树汁没干把它擦掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can just make out the baby beefalo from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见小皮弗娄牛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "I'll let the baby beefalo sleep a little longer."
msgstr "让小皮弗娄牛再睡一会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.1"
msgid "The straps sit better with the weight close to my back."
msgstr "重东西放靠背的地方，肩带就舒服些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK.2"
msgid "My glasses go on top, where I can reach them."
msgstr "眼镜放最上层，这样伸手就能拿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.1"
msgid "Could we take the bacon and eggs on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着培根煎蛋吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS.2"
msgid "I should save some for the friendly peeper."
msgstr "我该给友好窥视者留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.1"
msgid "I would give that blade a scabbard of its own."
msgstr "我想给这把刀单配一只鞘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAKUSAIGA.2"
msgid "That's an edge to examine with my eyes alone."
msgstr "看刀口就够了，不必伸手去摸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the jimbo."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护小丑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the balloon."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对气球了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOON.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the pile o' balloons to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了一堆气球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.1"
msgid "Would the balloon hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着气球帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.1"
msgid "I'd bring the party balloon back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把派对气球带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the pile o' balloons to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了一堆气球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.1"
msgid "It's lost the air that held it up."
msgstr "里面的气漏掉了，撑不起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED.2"
msgid "It won't rise again in that condition."
msgstr "这样是飘不起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the speedy balloon to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把迅捷气球带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the pile o' balloons if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些一堆气球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the pile o' balloons in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给一堆气球腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the speedy balloon with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做迅捷气球就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the inflatable vest before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过充气背心合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.1"
msgid "I want to look at the banana bush in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看香蕉丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.1"
msgid "I could make room for the banana shake at supper."
msgstr "晚饭还能给香蕉奶昔留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the banana pop aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点香蕉冻给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP.2"
msgid "I remember putting the banana in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了香蕉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the honey poultice in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给蜂蜜药膏腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the honey if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the flutter strip out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到扑腾绷带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the butterfly wings to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了蝴蝶翅膀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the barnacles."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给藤壶配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the pearl's light post with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做珍珠的灯柱就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the barnacle pita aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点藤壶皮塔饼给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.1"
msgid "I'd like a smaller plate, just this once."
msgstr "今天这道，我想换个小盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD.2"
msgid "Which part am I supposed to start with?"
msgstr "我该从哪个部位开始吃？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.1"
msgid "I could make room for the barnacle nigiri at supper."
msgstr "晚饭还能给藤壶握寿司留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI.2"
msgid "I might try a little more barnacles next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些藤壶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the cooked barnacles before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见熟藤壶，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the barnacle linguine aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点藤壶中细面给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the basalt again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看玄武岩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASALT.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT.1"
msgid "Shino rests it on her shoulder. Mine's sore already."
msgstr "志乃习惯把它扛在肩上，我才扛一会儿就酸了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BASEBALLBAT.2"
msgid "She can tell a good bat by the sound alone."
msgstr "她光听声就知道是不是好球棒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.ACID.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can just make out the batilisk from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见洞穴蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.1"
msgid "I'd give the bat bat room to turn."
msgstr "得给蝙蝠棒留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the batilisk wing went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了洞穴蝙蝠翅膀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the big bat cave by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清巨蝠洞，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the big bat cave. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，巨蝠洞里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATBOSSCAVE.VACANT.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the bat cave."
msgstr "从蝙蝠洞回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the bath bomb to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把沐浴球带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lune tree blossom to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了月树花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the naked nostrils."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给裸露鼻孔配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the sonic-invoker circuit."
msgstr "要做声波激发电路，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the milkmade hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下牛奶帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the charred nostrils cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "炭烤鼻孔要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the battle call canister before I could follow it."
msgstr "战斗号子罐得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "I wonder where she takes a breath in that verse."
msgstr "真想知道她唱这段时在哪儿换气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.1"
msgid "Wigfrid, will you sing the part for the weaponized warble?"
msgstr "薇格弗德，能把武器化的颤音这一段唱给我听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_DURABILITY.2"
msgid "That rhythm should carry over the noise of a fight."
msgstr "打起来再吵，也能听清这段节奏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the fireproof falsetto before I could follow it."
msgstr "防火假声得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_FIRERESISTANCE.2"
msgid "That rhythm should carry over the noise of a fight."
msgstr "打起来再吵，也能听清这段节奏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the heartrending ballad before I could follow it."
msgstr "心碎歌谣得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_HEALTHGAIN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the papyrus to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the startling soliloquy before I could follow it."
msgstr "惊心独白得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_PANIC.2"
msgid "I wonder where she takes a breath in that verse."
msgstr "真想知道她唱这段时在哪儿换气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.1"
msgid "Wigfrid, will you sing the part for the warrior's reprise?"
msgstr "薇格弗德，能把战士重奏这一段唱给我听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_REVIVE.2"
msgid "That rhythm should carry over the noise of a fight."
msgstr "打起来再吵，也能听清这段节奏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.1"
msgid "Wigfrid, will you sing the part for the rude interlude?"
msgstr "薇格弗德，能把粗鲁插曲这一段唱给我听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_INSTANT_TAUNT.2"
msgid "I wonder where she takes a breath in that verse."
msgstr "真想知道她唱这段时在哪儿换气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.1"
msgid "Wigfrid, will you sing the part for the enlightened lullaby?"
msgstr "薇格弗德，能把启迪摇篮曲这一段唱给我听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_LUNARALIGNED.2"
msgid "That rhythm should carry over the noise of a fight."
msgstr "打起来再吵，也能听清这段节奏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the bel canto of courage before I could follow it."
msgstr "英勇美声颂得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYAURA.2"
msgid "I can keep time with my heel while she sings."
msgstr "她唱的时候，我可以用脚跟打拍子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.1"
msgid "Wigfrid, will you sing the part for the clear minded cadenza?"
msgstr "薇格弗德，能把醍醐灌顶华彩这一段唱给我听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SANITYGAIN.2"
msgid "I can see where the papyrus went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.1"
msgid "I'd need to hear the dark lament before I could follow it."
msgstr "黑暗悲歌得听过一遍，我才跟得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATTLESONG_SHADOWALIGNED.2"
msgid "I can see where the papyrus went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the batilisk wing."
msgstr "不知洞穴蝙蝠翅膀能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING.2"
msgid "I should save some for the bat bat."
msgstr "我该给蝙蝠棒留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked batilisk wing."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份熟蝙蝠翅膀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BATWING_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.ACID.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the hound batilisk from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察猎犬蝙蝠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the bat hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下蝙蝠帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSSCORPSEHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I wonder what the blighted hound batilisk noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道枯萎猎犬蝙蝠比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BAT_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the beard hair out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到胡须。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARDHAIR.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the bernie."
msgstr "要做伯尼，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.1"
msgid "It's caught the scent of our pantry already."
msgstr "它已经闻到我们储粮的气味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER.2"
msgid "That's quite an appetite to bring to someone else's camp."
msgstr "带着这么大的胃口跑到别人营地来，可真不客气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Watch it! It isn't staying down!"
msgstr "留意它！它又要起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the polar bearger bin."
msgstr "该检查一下极地熊獾桶里已经装了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERFUR_SACK.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the thick fur to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了熊皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the hibearnation vest before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过熊皮背心合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGERVEST.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the thick fur if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些熊皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.1"
msgid "I'll keep the thick fur apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "熊皮得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEARGER_FUR.2"
msgid "There's no reason to let good material go to waste."
msgstr "好材料没理由白白浪费。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet hour to study the lucky beast costume pattern."
msgstr "我想静下心来仔细读读幸运兽礼服款式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEAST_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "One careful read now will save mistakes later."
msgstr "现在认真读一遍，等会儿就少出错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the fur roll in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给毛皮铺盖腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_FURRY.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the straw roll if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些草席卷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.1"
msgid "I'd bring the straw roll back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把草席卷带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEDROLL_STRAW.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the fur roll with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做毛皮铺盖就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I don't think the bee has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得蜜蜂一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the bee box."
msgstr "要做蜂箱，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEE.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the bee box but ash."
msgstr "蜂箱只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.1"
msgid "The comb is full right to the edges."
msgstr "蜂巢一直到边缘都装满了蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.FULLHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the bee box long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到蜂箱跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.1"
msgid "No honey to gather yet."
msgstr "还没有蜜可采。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.NOHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.1"
msgid "Time to see what the bee box has for us."
msgstr "该看看蜂箱这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.READY.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.1"
msgid "There's a little honey, but we can wait."
msgstr "已经有些蜜了，我们还可以再等。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX.SOMEHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the bee box but ash."
msgstr "蜂箱只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.1"
msgid "The comb is full right to the edges."
msgstr "蜂巢一直到边缘都装满了蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.FULLHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the bee box long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到蜂箱跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.1"
msgid "No honey to gather yet."
msgstr "还没有蜜可采。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.NOHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.1"
msgid "Time to see what the bee box has for us."
msgstr "该看看蜂箱这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.READY.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.1"
msgid "There's a little honey, but we can wait."
msgstr "已经有些蜜了，我们还可以再等。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEBOX_HERMIT.SOMEHONEY.2"
msgid "I can hear the bees working inside."
msgstr "我听得见里面蜜蜂忙碌的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.1"
msgid "There's no breath left in it."
msgstr "已经没气息了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.1"
msgid "I saved you a place by the hitching post."
msgstr "拴牛桩旁，我还给你留着位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DEAD_MYPARTNER.2"
msgid "You carried me so far. Rest now, friend."
msgstr "你驮着我走了那么远。歇歇吧，朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.1"
msgid "You don't shy away when I come near anymore."
msgstr "现在见我走近，你已经不躲了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.DOMESTICATED.2"
msgid "Shall we take the long way home together?"
msgstr "我们绕远路一起回家好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Easy, khwai. Let me stand where you can see me."
msgstr "慢慢来，小牛。我站到你看得见的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A warm flank is good company on a cold morning."
msgstr "清早天冷，挨着暖和的牛肚子真舒服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.1"
msgid "There's my friend. Have you eaten?"
msgstr "我的伙伴在这里。你吃过了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.MYPARTNER.2"
msgid "You know my step by now, don't you?"
msgstr "现在已经认得我的脚步声了吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.1"
msgid "Your coat will grow back. Till then, stay warm."
msgstr "毛会长回来的，这阵子要当心着凉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.NAKED.2"
msgid "I've brought something to eat after your shearing."
msgstr "剪完毛了，给你带了些吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.1"
msgid "There's a warning in that stance."
msgstr "那个架势是在警告我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.ORNERY.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for it to pass."
msgstr "给它留条路过去吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.1"
msgid "You've been eating well, haven't you?"
msgstr "最近伙食很好吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.PUDGY.2"
msgid "An easy walk might do us both good."
msgstr "咱们一起散个步也好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.1"
msgid "You don't shy away when I come near anymore."
msgstr "现在见我走近，你已经不躲了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.RIDER.2"
msgid "Shall we take the long way home together?"
msgstr "我们绕远路一起回家好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the beefalo, please."
msgstr "经过皮弗娄牛时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the steamed twigs dry on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上别让蒸树枝受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOFEED.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the pieces together."
msgstr "我把这些包在一起。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the beefalo hat."
msgstr "不知道牛角帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the beefalo horn if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些牛角。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.1"
msgid "I could use the beefalo treats back at the workbench."
msgstr "工作台上也许用得着皮弗娄牛零食。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOTREAT.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the pieces together."
msgstr "我把这些包在一起。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "I'd set the beefalo wool beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把牛毛放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the sunrise spinnerbait with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做日出旋转亮片就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the beefalo grooming station before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到皮弗娄牛美妆台旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the beefalo grooming station to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉皮弗娄牛美妆台。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the beefalo wool if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些牛毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "It looks rather crowded inside the beefalo grooming station."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛美妆台里面看着挺挤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "I'll wait until there's room."
msgstr "我等空出位置再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the grooming station kit."
msgstr "我先给美妆台套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEFALO_GROOMER_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the beefalo bell to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉皮弗娄牛铃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEF_BELL.2"
msgid "I can see where the flint went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.1"
msgid "I don't think the grumble bee has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得嗡嗡蜜蜂一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEGUARD.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the beekeeper hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下养蜂帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.1"
msgid "You can hear the beehive long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到蜂窝跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEHIVE.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.1"
msgid "I can hear the buzzing from inside."
msgstr "我能听到里面有嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE.2"
msgid "I'll remember to take the long way round this spot."
msgstr "我会记得经过这里要绕行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.1"
msgid "I can hear the buzzing from inside."
msgstr "我能听到里面有嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEMINE_MAXWELL.2"
msgid "I'll remember to take the long way round this spot."
msgstr "我会记得经过这里要绕行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.1"
msgid "I can hear her wings over the whole hive."
msgstr "整巢的蜂鸣都盖不过她的振翅声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEEN.2"
msgid "I'll let Her Majesty keep the honey for today."
msgstr "今天的蜂蜜就留给女王陛下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "You can hear the honey patch long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到小块蜂蜜跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.1"
msgid "There's more of the honey patch here than last time."
msgstr "比起上次来，小块蜂蜜长大了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVE.GROWING.2"
msgid "A little more time ought to do it."
msgstr "再等些时候就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.1"
msgid "You can hear the gigantic beehive long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到巨大蜂窝跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEEQUEENHIVEGROWN.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.1"
msgid "My thumb leaves a little dent in the wax."
msgstr "拇指按一下，蜡上就留下个浅印。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX.2"
msgid "I can warm it between my palms before I shape it."
msgstr "塑形前可以先用两只手掌把它焐软。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the embalming spritz out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到防腐喷雾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEESWAX_SPRAY.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the beeswax if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蜂蜡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the infernal swineclops from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见地狱独眼巨猪，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BEETLETAUR.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.1"
msgid "I should warn everyone before I ring it."
msgstr "敲响之前得先提醒大家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BELL.2"
msgid "That bell must carry quite a way."
msgstr "钟声一定能传得很远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the bernie?"
msgstr "伯尼平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the bernie! from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察伯尼！。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_BIG.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.1"
msgid "I can see the break in the bernie."
msgstr "能看见伯尼断在了什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.BROKEN.2"
msgid "I'll put the loose pieces somewhere safe."
msgstr "我把松脱的零件收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the bernie out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到伯尼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERNIE_INACTIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the beefalo wool went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了牛毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.1"
msgid "One for the basket. One for me."
msgstr "一颗放篮里，一颗留给我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES.2"
msgid "I'd better keep these off my white sleeves."
msgstr "白袖子离这些浆果远些才好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.1"
msgid "The skins split and the juice smells sweeter."
msgstr "果皮裂开了，汁水闻着更甜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_COOKED.2"
msgid "Pass me a spoon. I don't want to lose the syrup."
msgstr "递我把勺子吧，我可不想浪费这点果汁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.1"
msgid "I'll try the juicy berries the next time the water's calm."
msgstr "下次水面平静，我就试试多汁浆果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY.2"
msgid "I'd keep that where the hooks can't tangle."
msgstr "收好，别让钩子缠在一起。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the roasted juicy berries."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份烤多汁浆果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRIES_JUICY_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.1"
msgid "I should tend to the berry bush before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BARREN.2"
msgid "The leaves have lost their spring."
msgstr "叶片已经蔫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the berry bush over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到浆果丛的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the berry bush."
msgstr "碰浆果丛还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the berry bush."
msgstr "碰浆果丛还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the berry bush in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the berry bush time to grow back."
msgstr "得给浆果丛些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I hate seeing the berry bush in this condition."
msgstr "看到浆果丛成了这样，真让人难受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.1"
msgid "I should tend to the juicy berry bush before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下多汁浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BARREN.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the juicy berry bush!"
msgstr "离着火的多汁浆果丛远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the juicy berry bush."
msgstr "多汁浆果丛表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the juicy berry bush."
msgstr "多汁浆果丛表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.DISEASING.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the juicy berry bush changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时多汁浆果丛会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the juicy berry bush today."
msgstr "今天从多汁浆果丛上已经摘不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the juicy berry bush before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下多汁浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYBUSH_JUICY.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.1"
msgid "I'd set the merry berrysauce beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把快乐浆果酱放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BERRYSAUCE.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the bibingka out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到比宾卡米糕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIBINGKA.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.1"
msgid "That's one enormous footprint."
msgstr "这脚印也太大了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIGFOOT.2"
msgid "I'm glad I wasn't standing under that heel."
msgstr "幸好我没站在它脚跟底下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the birchnutter before it moves again."
msgstr "趁桦栗果精没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRCHNUTDRAKE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. It lies so still."
msgstr "可怜，一动也不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll give it a quiet moment."
msgstr "让我安静陪它一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the birdcage in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的鸟笼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "I should bring the birdcage something to eat."
msgstr "该给鸟笼带点吃的来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "I wouldn't leave a creature hungry if I could help it."
msgstr "能帮得上忙的话，我不想让它挨饿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "There's no space left in the birdcage."
msgstr "鸟笼里面已经没位置了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "I'll leave what's in there alone for now."
msgstr "里面的东西暂时先不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.1"
msgid "Just those tiny bones left on the floor."
msgstr "底下只剩一副小小的骨架。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SKELETON.2"
msgid "I should give the bird a decent burial."
msgstr "该给这只鸟找处地方好好安葬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "I'll let the birdcage sleep a little longer."
msgstr "让鸟笼再睡一会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.1"
msgid "I can tell it's been a while since the birdcage ate."
msgstr "看得出鸟笼很久没吃东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING.2"
msgid "I wouldn't leave a creature hungry if I could help it."
msgstr "能帮得上忙的话，我不想让它挨饿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the bird trap."
msgstr "放下捕鸟陷阱时要做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP.2"
msgid "I'll let the others know to tread carefully here."
msgstr "我去提醒大家经过这里要当心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.1"
msgid "I'll keep the egg away from the heavy things."
msgstr "我会把鸟蛋和重东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "壳比看起来的薄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked egg."
msgstr "吃熟鸟蛋我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.1"
msgid "I'd give the moonblind crow room to turn."
msgstr "得给月盲乌鸦留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "轻一点，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.1"
msgid "I can just make out the misshapen bird from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见奇形鸟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.1"
msgid "I'd watch the clockwork bishop from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看发条主教就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.1"
msgid "That jolt went right through my sleeves!"
msgstr "那一下放电隔着袖子都感觉到了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT.2"
msgid "Even my fingertips are tingling."
msgstr "连指尖都还麻着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "I don't think the damaged bishop has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得损坏的发条主教一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.1"
msgid "We'll be able to find our way back by the black flag."
msgstr "回来的时候可以凭黑旗认路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG.2"
msgid "I'll check that it's visible from the other direction too."
msgstr "我也从另一头看看醒不醒目。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.1"
msgid "I'll put a cover over the point before I carry it."
msgstr "带走前我会先把尖端套住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW.2"
msgid "The shaft is so light I can barely feel it in my sleeve."
msgstr "细杆真轻，放在袖袋里几乎感觉不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.1"
msgid "I feel something strange around the chilled amulet."
msgstr "靠近寒冰护符时有种奇怪的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it separately from my ordinary things."
msgstr "我把它和日常用品分开包好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.1"
msgid "Cold to the touch, even after a day in my pocket."
msgstr "在口袋里放了一天，摸着还是凉的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM.2"
msgid "The blue goes clear at the very edges."
msgstr "蓝色一直到边缘才淡得透亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the blue moonlens."
msgstr "照点光就能看清蓝色月眼的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the moon dial with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做月晷就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.1"
msgid "I'd put the blueprint in my collection."
msgstr "我愿意把蓝图收进收藏里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON.2"
msgid "I should look closely while I've got one in hand."
msgstr "趁手里正好有一个，我得仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.1"
msgid "I'd put the blueprint in my collection."
msgstr "我愿意把蓝图收进收藏里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE.2"
msgid "I should look closely while I've got one in hand."
msgstr "趁手里正好有一个，我得仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.1"
msgid "I can recognize the cap. Knowing when to eat it is another matter."
msgstr "我认得这菇帽，什么时候吃倒得再想想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP.2"
msgid "I'd ask about this mushroom before it went into the pot."
msgstr "这朵蘑菇下锅前，我想先问清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked blue cap."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份熟蓝蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The cap is quite firm at the edges."
msgstr "菇帽的边缘还很挺实。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll mark the patch. It might be worth coming back."
msgstr "我给这片地方做个记号，以后再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the blue mushroom is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出蓝蘑菇藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the blue mushroom time to grow back."
msgstr "得给蓝蘑菇些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "这时候还是别动根了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.1"
msgid "That edge needs a quick sanding before I carry it."
msgstr "搬之前得先把那道边磨一磨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARDS.2"
msgid "I can smell the fresh cut through my gloves."
msgstr "隔着手套也闻得到新木料的香气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the pit pig from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见战猪，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARON.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the grand forge boarrior from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见大熔炉猪战士，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.1"
msgid "I'd keep the boat fragment until we find the rest."
msgstr "在找到剩下的部分以前，先把船碎片留好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.1"
msgid "I'll try to find where the boat fragment fits."
msgstr "我想找出船碎片该装在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04.2"
msgid "That edge looks as if it ought to meet another."
msgstr "这道边缘应该还有另一半能对上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.1"
msgid "I'd keep the boat fragment until we find the rest."
msgstr "在找到剩下的部分以前，先把船碎片留好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.1"
msgid "I should check the boat patch before taking the boat out."
msgstr "出海前得检查好船补丁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the stinger if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些针刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.1"
msgid "I should check the kelp patch before taking the boat out."
msgstr "出海前得检查好海带补丁。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the kelp fronds to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了海带叶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.1"
msgid "I'll check the race checkpoint before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查比赛检查点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "I'll check the race checkpoint kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查比赛检查点套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the charlie's racer while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看查理的选手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.1"
msgid "I'll check the golden buoy before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查黄金浮标。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the thorny buoy."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时荆棘浮标表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "I'll check the thorny buoy kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查荆棘浮标套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the golden buoy kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看黄金浮标套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the lucky gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the broodling spectator while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看小龙蝇观赛者。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the start tower."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时起点塔表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.1"
msgid "I'll check the start tower kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查起点塔套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "I'll check the cargo hold before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查货舱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the archaic boat kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看古董船套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the crab king bumper."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时帝王蟹保险杠表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the crab king bumper kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看帝王蟹保险杠套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the kelp bumper while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看海带保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the kelp bumper kit."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时海带保险杠套装表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.1"
msgid "I'll check the shell bumper before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查贝壳保险杠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the shell bumper kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看贝壳保险杠套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the fanged bumper."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时獠牙保险杠表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll check the fanged bumper kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查獠牙保险杠套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT.2"
msgid "I can see where the lucky gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.1"
msgid "There's a shot in it already."
msgstr "里面已经装了一发。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED.2"
msgid "I'll keep clear of the muzzle."
msgstr "我会避开炮口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the cannon."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时大炮表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.1"
msgid "The barrel's empty."
msgstr "炮膛里是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO.2"
msgid "We haven't got a shot loaded."
msgstr "还没装上弹药。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the cannon kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看大炮套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the palmcone scale to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了棕榈松果树鳞片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the grass raft kit."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时草筏套装表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll check the boat kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查船套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.1"
msgid "I'll check the leak before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查漏洞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the nautopilot from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出自动航行仪的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll check the nautopilot before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查自动航行仪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.1"
msgid "There. the nautopilot beacon is working."
msgstr "好了，自动航行灯塔开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the nautopilot beacon."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时自动航行灯塔表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the nautopilot kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看自动航行仪套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.1"
msgid "Bare feet make it easier to feel the swell."
msgstr "光脚踩上去，更容易察觉浪的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MSURFBOARD.2"
msgid "I'll wait for a clean wave."
msgstr "我等一道平稳的浪再走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the rudder."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时转向舵表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR.2"
msgid "I won't go far from the dock until it's ready."
msgstr "准备妥当前，我不会离码头太远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the rudder kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看转向舵套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "I wouldn't mind trying the beefalo pillow armor in a pillow match."
msgstr "枕头赛我想试试皮弗娄牛枕头盔甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "I'd check the seam before the first swing."
msgstr "挥第一下之前得先看看缝线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the kelpy pillow armor."
msgstr "海带枕头盔甲的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the flowery pillow armor."
msgstr "花朵枕头盔甲的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS.2"
msgid "One round, then I want somewhere soft to sit."
msgstr "打一轮我就想找个软地方坐下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the steel wool pillow armor."
msgstr "钢丝绵枕头盔甲的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "I'd check the seam before the first swing."
msgstr "挥第一下之前得先看看缝线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "Wormwood knows which husks to save for this."
msgstr "沃姆伍德知道该给它留哪种外壳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "I'm keeping that well away from the vegetable basket."
msgstr "这个可不能放到菜篮子里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.1"
msgid "Wormwood knows which husks to save for this."
msgstr "沃姆伍德知道该给它留哪种外壳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD.2"
msgid "I'm keeping that well away from the vegetable basket."
msgstr "这个可不能放到菜篮子里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.1"
msgid "I'd keep the bone shards until we find the rest."
msgstr "在找到剩下的部分以前，先把骨头碎片留好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD.2"
msgid "That edge looks as if it ought to meet another."
msgstr "这道边缘应该还有另一半能对上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.1"
msgid "I'll save the bone bouillon for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "骨头汤要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.1"
msgid "I could smell the meaty stew from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了炖肉汤的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the bookcase stood."
msgstr "书架原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the bookcase together."
msgstr "我想知道书架是怎么组装的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.1"
msgid "I'd turn these pages well away from the honey pot."
msgstr "我会离蜜罐远一点再翻这本书。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES.2"
msgid "Which passage tells them I'm a friend?"
msgstr "有哪一段能让它们知道我是朋友吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.1"
msgid "I could name the bird outside camp if I found its picture here."
msgstr "找得到插画，就知道营地外面那只鸟叫什么了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS.2"
msgid "I think I've heard the wings on this page before."
msgstr "这一页上的鸟，我好像听过它拍翅的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.1"
msgid "Perhaps we could leave this one closed while everyone's in camp."
msgstr "大家都在营地时，这本还是先合着吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE.2"
msgid "I'll take a full step back if she starts reading."
msgstr "她开口朗读，我就往后退一大步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what answers the call before we make it."
msgstr "发出召唤前，我想先弄清会有什么回应。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL.2"
msgid "Ms. Wickerbottom, who is that passage addressed to?"
msgstr "薇克巴顿女士，这段话是在呼唤谁？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.1"
msgid "I should finish the part about putting fires out first."
msgstr "我想先读完讲灭火的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE.2"
msgid "I'd read this beside a full watering can."
msgstr "要读这本，我会在旁边备一壶水。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.1"
msgid "This drawing shows how the line runs. That's where I went wrong."
msgstr "图上画清了鱼线的走向。原来我是这里弄错了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH.2"
msgid "I'd take this to the dock with a slip of paper between the pages."
msgstr "我想夹张纸做书签，把它带去码头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.1"
msgid "I'd like to know how a movement can end up fixed in stone."
msgstr "我很想知道，一个动作怎么就能留在石头里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL.2"
msgid "These pages feel rather heavy for so slim a volume."
msgstr "薄薄一册，拿起来还真沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.1"
msgid "I'll check the page on seedlings before I plant the next row."
msgstr "种下一行前，我得看看讲育苗的那一页。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING.2"
msgid "I left a bookmark where it explains the roots."
msgstr "解释根系的地方我夹了书签。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.1"
msgid "I'll check the page on seedlings before I plant the next row."
msgstr "种下一行前，我得看看讲育苗的那一页。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE.2"
msgid "I left a bookmark where it explains the roots."
msgstr "解释根系的地方我夹了书签。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "A whole extra set of notes on growing things. I'll need another bookmark."
msgstr "种植笔记添了这么多，还得再找张书签。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "I want to compare this chapter with what happened in our garden."
msgstr "我想把这一章和菜园里的情况对照着看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.1"
msgid "A reading lamp that begins with reading. That's rather sweet."
msgstr "先读上一段才有灯可用，倒挺有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT.2"
msgid "I should learn this passage before night falls."
msgstr "天黑前得先学会这段。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "A reading lamp that begins with reading. That's rather sweet."
msgstr "先读上一段才有灯可用，倒挺有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "I should learn this passage before night falls."
msgstr "天黑前得先学会这段。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.1"
msgid "I keep looking up from the page to check the real moon."
msgstr "我读着读着就想抬头看看真的月亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON.2"
msgid "Let's read it where the sky is clear."
msgstr "我们挑处看得清天的地方读吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.1"
msgid "I'd bring the washing in before she reads a word."
msgstr "她还没开口，我就想先把晾的衣服收了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN.2"
msgid "A useful book to have when the garden is dry."
msgstr "菜园缺水的时候，有这本书真好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.1"
msgid "I could put the reference books in order on that shelf."
msgstr "能在那个架子上把参考书排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION.2"
msgid "Ms. Wickerbottom would know exactly where each volume goes."
msgstr "每本该放哪里，薇克巴顿女士一定都清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.1"
msgid "How far apart should I plant the saplings? There, that diagram."
msgstr "树苗之间该留多远？找到了，看这张图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE.2"
msgid "I could plan a little grove of our own with this."
msgstr "有它，我就能规划一小片自己的树林了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.1"
msgid "I'm only halfway down the page and my eyes are closing."
msgstr "我才看了半页，眼睛就快闭上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP.2"
msgid "I'd save a reading of this one for after the night watch changes."
msgstr "等值夜的人换好班，再来念这本吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.1"
msgid "I'd like to understand why the air changes when those words are read."
msgstr "为什么念出这几句，气温就会变？我想弄明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE.2"
msgid "I'll mark the passage we want before the weather turns."
msgstr "我先标好要用的段落，赶在天气变化前准备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.1"
msgid "My bookmark's slipped into the chapter on suckers. Oh dear."
msgstr "书签滑到了讲吸盘的那一章。哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES.2"
msgid "I'll read it sitting down, with my feet well off the marsh floor."
msgstr "我会坐下来念，把脚从沼泽地上抬起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.1"
msgid "I was hoping for advice on staying calm around spiders."
msgstr "我本来想找点面对蜘蛛时能沉住气的建议。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB.2"
msgid "Perhaps Webber could explain the illustrations."
msgstr "也许韦伯能给我讲讲那些插图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the boomerang."
msgstr "我想掂一下回旋镖的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.1"
msgid "I'd bring the bootleg getaway back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把出逃腿靴带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.1"
msgid "The pieces are worth saving for a repair."
msgstr "这些碎件值得留着修补。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM.2"
msgid "I'll bring the broken parts back to the forge."
msgstr "我把损坏的部件带回锻炉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.1"
msgid "The pieces are worth saving for a repair."
msgstr "这些碎件值得留着修补。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM.2"
msgid "I'll bring the broken parts back to the forge."
msgstr "我把损坏的部件带回锻炉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.1"
msgid "My grip on the brush feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住刷子的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BRUSH.2"
msgid "I can see where the gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.1"
msgid "I'd put the bug net within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把捕虫网放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUGNET.2"
msgid "I can see where the twigs went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the bull kelp grows."
msgstr "我要记住公牛海带长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the bull kelp time to grow back."
msgstr "得给公牛海带些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "这时候还是别动根了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the bull kelp stalk in the hands of someone who knows it."
msgstr "我想看看熟手是怎么用公牛海带茎的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT.2"
msgid "I should make time to practice before I need it."
msgstr "趁还不急用，我该抽空练练。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the bundled supplies."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对捆绑物资了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.1"
msgid "I'd keep the bundling wrap somewhere we can all reach."
msgstr "捆绑包装该放到大家都够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP.2"
msgid "I can see where the rope went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了绳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "I'll check my pack before I go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近前，我先检查一下背包。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "Good evening. I can smell the carrots from here."
msgstr "晚上好。我在这儿就闻得到胡萝卜了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.1"
msgid "Could we take the bunny stew on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着炖兔子吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW.2"
msgid "I might try a little more morsel next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些小肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the spiky bush for my notes."
msgstr "我想把尖刺灌木的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the bush hat."
msgstr "不知道灌木丛帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the butter to share."
msgstr "希望黄油够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTER.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "If I stand still it might come back to the flower."
msgstr "我站着不动，它也许会飞回花上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The wings hardly stir the air."
msgstr "翅膀扇动时几乎没有风。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.1"
msgid "I can feel it moving in my hands."
msgstr "能感觉到它在手里动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to know how Warly folds the wings in so neatly."
msgstr "真想知道沃利怎么把翅膀折得这么齐整。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN.2"
msgid "A little sweetness before a long walk sounds lovely."
msgstr "走远路前，来点甜的正好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the butterfly wings aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点蝴蝶翅膀给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the polish cookies with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做波兰饼干就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.1"
msgid "I'll watch the buzzard without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动秃鹫，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Watch it! It isn't staying down!"
msgstr "留意它！它又要起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the cabbage rolls in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给白菜卷腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the cactus."
msgstr "得记住回到仙人掌这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the cactus time to grow back."
msgstr "得给仙人掌些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.1"
msgid "I can pick out every little fold in the petals."
msgstr "花瓣上每一道褶皱都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER.2"
msgid "I'd carry this on top of my basket so it won't be crushed."
msgstr "我想放在篮子最上面，免得压坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.1"
msgid "I'd save the cactus flesh for after practice."
msgstr "我想把仙人掌肉留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked cactus flesh."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份熟仙人掌肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.1"
msgid "Could we take the california roll on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着加州卷吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL.2"
msgid "I remember putting the kelp fronds in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了海带叶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.1"
msgid "There's hardly a glow left in the campfire."
msgstr "营火只剩一点暗红了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借这点光几乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Room for another pair of cold hands?"
msgstr "还有地方给我暖暖手吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sit where the smoke won't reach my eyes."
msgstr "我挑个烟熏不到眼睛的位置坐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.1"
msgid "That's singeing the hem of my skirt from here!"
msgstr "站在这儿，裙角都快烤焦了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH.2"
msgid "No more wood. Pull the bedrolls back a little."
msgstr "别添柴了，把铺盖往后挪些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.1"
msgid "The ends of the sticks have stopped catching."
msgstr "柴枝末端都快点不着了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW.2"
msgid "Let me add a split log before we lose the flame."
msgstr "趁火还在，我添一块劈好的柴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the campfire for a while."
msgstr "我可以在营火旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.1"
msgid "Nothing to warm my hands over now."
msgstr "这下暖不了手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT.2"
msgid "I'll bring tinder. A log on its own won't catch."
msgstr "我去拿火绒，光放根木头点不着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I don't think the canary has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得金丝雀一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.1"
msgid "I can feel it moving in my hands."
msgstr "能感觉到它在手里动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.1"
msgid "Poor thing. Let's get you into clean air."
msgstr "小家伙真可怜，我带你去透透气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED.2"
msgid "That little chest is rising awfully fast."
msgstr "小小的胸脯起伏得好快。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the candy bag."
msgstr "该检查一下糖果袋里已经装了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留个不会压到眼镜的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.1"
msgid "I'd put the walking cane within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把步行手杖放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the lazy explorer with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做懒人魔杖就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll wedge it in place so it can't roll about the deck."
msgstr "我把它卡住，免得它在甲板上乱滚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM.2"
msgid "Nobody wants to meet one of these with a bare toe."
msgstr "船上光着脚时，可千万别踢到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "I'll give it a little more time."
msgstr "还得再给它一点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "I'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "等准备好了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The crows really brought it all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把它带了这么远？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have a look before the fair packs up."
msgstr "趁集市还没收摊，我得好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.1"
msgid "The crows really brought it all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把它带了这么远？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have a look before the fair packs up."
msgstr "趁集市还没收摊，我得好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.1"
msgid "The crows really brought the light catcher all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把光线捕捉器带了这么远？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER.2"
msgid "I'll take one more turn around the fair."
msgstr "我再逛一圈游园会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.1"
msgid "The crows really brought the light catcher kit all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把光线捕捉器套装带了这么远？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have a look before the fair packs up."
msgstr "趁集市还没收摊，我得好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show it to everyone back at camp."
msgstr "我想让营地里的大家也看看它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE.2"
msgid "I'd like to remember how they arranged everything."
msgstr "我想记住他们是怎么布置的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.1"
msgid "We arrived just in time to see it."
msgstr "来得正好，赶上看它了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll take one more turn around the fair."
msgstr "我再逛一圈游园会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to show it to everyone back at camp."
msgstr "我想让营地里的大家也看看它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take one more turn around the fair."
msgstr "我再逛一圈游园会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.1"
msgid "I'd put it in my collection."
msgstr "我愿意把它收进收藏里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE.2"
msgid "I should look closely while I've got one in hand."
msgstr "趁手里正好有一个，我得仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.1"
msgid "I'd put it in my collection."
msgstr "我愿意把它收进收藏里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON.2"
msgid "I should look closely while I've got one in hand."
msgstr "趁手里正好有一个，我得仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.1"
msgid "We arrived just in time to see the green mystery box."
msgstr "来得正好，赶上看绿色神秘盒子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have a look before the fair packs up."
msgstr "趁集市还没收摊，我得好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2.1"
msgid "The crows really brought the yellow mystery box all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把黄色神秘盒子带了这么远？"

