#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take one more turn around the fair."
msgstr "我再逛一圈游园会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.1"
msgid "I'll count the tickets before I choose a prize."
msgstr "挑奖品前，我先数数票。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK.2"
msgid "I'd rather not lose any of these on the way to the booth."
msgstr "去领奖的路上可别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.1"
msgid "I'll count the tickets before I choose a prize."
msgstr "挑奖品前，我先数数票。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK.2"
msgid "I'd rather not lose any of these on the way to the booth."
msgstr "去领奖的路上可别弄丢了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "We arrived just in time to see the seed clusters."
msgstr "来得正好，赶上看种子包了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "I'll have a look before the fair packs up."
msgstr "趁集市还没收摊，我得好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.1"
msgid "We arrived just in time to see the chirpy scarf."
msgstr "来得正好，赶上看叽叽喳喳围巾了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A.2"
msgid "I'd like to remember how they arranged everything."
msgstr "我想记住他们是怎么布置的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.1"
msgid "The crows really brought the chirpy cloak all this way?"
msgstr "乌鸦们真的把叽叽喳喳斗篷带了这么远？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B.2"
msgid "I'll take one more turn around the fair."
msgstr "我再逛一圈游园会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.1"
msgid "We arrived just in time to see the chirpy capelet."
msgstr "来得正好，赶上看叽叽喳喳小披肩了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the prize tickets to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了奖票。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the moon glass saw blade to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把月光玻璃锯片带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the moon moth if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些月蛾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the sawhorse before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到锯马旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the sawhorse."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护锯马。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll listen for any loose parts before I try it."
msgstr "试之前先听听有没有零件松动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. It lies so still."
msgstr "可怜，一动也不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "It's over. We can lower our guard."
msgstr "结束了，可以放松些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can just make out the carrat from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见胡萝卜鼠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.1"
msgid "I can feel it moving in my hands."
msgstr "能感觉到它在手里动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I can see the carrat breathing."
msgstr "轻点，能看见胡萝卜鼠呼吸的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll come by again when it's awake."
msgstr "等它醒了我再过来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the charlie's carrat in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的查理的胡萝卜鼠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.1"
msgid "I'll rinse the earth from the tip first."
msgstr "我先把尖头上的泥洗掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT.2"
msgid "That would make a sweet bite between drills."
msgstr "练习间隙咬一口，一定清甜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the roasted carrot."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份烤胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant carrots before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型胡萝卜再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "One harvest ought to feed a fair few people."
msgstr "这一收成够好些人吃了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.1"
msgid "I'd remember where that patch grows."
msgstr "我会记住这片植物长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling at the roots."
msgstr "我凑近看就好，不去拔根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'll mark the row where I sow the oblong seeds."
msgstr "播下椭圆形种子的那一行，我会做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the cartographer's desk over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到制图桌的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the cartographer's desk stood."
msgstr "制图桌原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the cartographer's desk?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用制图桌？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the catcoon before it moves again."
msgstr "趁浣猫没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOON.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the hollow stump. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，空心树桩里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the hollow stump quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近空心树桩时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the cat cap with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下猫帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the wind-up mouse toy to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把发条鼠玩具拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the boulder."
msgstr "我想细看一下岩石的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.1"
msgid "Even on tiptoe I can't reach it."
msgstr "踮脚也够不到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED.2"
msgid "That's well above my head."
msgstr "那比我头顶还高出一大截。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.1"
msgid "I can peel that on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上剥开就能吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA.2"
msgid "Who would have thought to look for bananas underground?"
msgstr "谁会想到能在地下找到香蕉呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.1"
msgid "I can smell the burnt peel from here."
msgstr "在这儿都闻得到香蕉皮的焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT.2"
msgid "We won't get breakfast out of that."
msgstr "早饭可指望不上它了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked banana."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份熟香蕉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.1"
msgid "I want to look at the cave banana tree in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看洞穴香蕉树。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the plugged sinkhole by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清被堵住的洞穴，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.1"
msgid "There's no room on the other side."
msgstr "另一头已经没有空位了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL.2"
msgid "We'll have to wait for someone to leave."
msgstr "得等有人先出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the sinkhole by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清洞穴，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.1"
msgid "There's a way through the sinkhole now."
msgstr "现在能从洞穴这里过去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN.2"
msgid "I should see where this leads."
msgstr "我去看看到底通向哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.1"
msgid "I'll mark the plugged hole on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下被堵住的陷洞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.1"
msgid "There's no room on the other side."
msgstr "另一头已经没有空位了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL.2"
msgid "We'll have to wait for someone to leave."
msgstr "得等有人先出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the stairs on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下楼梯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.1"
msgid "There's a way through the stairs now."
msgstr "现在能从楼梯这里过去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN.2"
msgid "I should see where this leads."
msgstr "我去看看到底通向哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.1"
msgid "I want to look at the fern in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看蕨类植物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.1"
msgid "I want to look at the withered fern in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看枯萎的蕨类。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD.2"
msgid "It's over. We can lower our guard."
msgstr "结束了，可以放松些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That little thing seems quite at home by the vent."
msgstr "那小家伙在通风口旁边待得真自在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd rather it didn't find its way into my clothes."
msgstr "我可不希望它钻进我的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I can see the geothermite breathing."
msgstr "轻点，能看见地热螨呼吸的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll come by again when it's awake."
msgstr "等它醒了我再过来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the fumarole by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清喷气孔，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT.2"
msgid "Much too hot for my bare hands."
msgstr "光着手碰太烫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the rope."
msgstr "得记住回到绳子这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.1"
msgid "I could smell the ceviche from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了酸橘汁腌鱼的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.1"
msgid "My fingers go black the instant I pick it up."
msgstr "一拿起来手指就黑了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL.2"
msgid "I'll pack it in cloth, away from my clean things."
msgstr "我会用布包好，和干净衣物分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.1"
msgid "I wonder what the dreadstone outcrop looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，绝望石矿苗是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_SPIKE.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the chasm in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的裂口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEARENA_TELEPORTER.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.1"
msgid "I wonder what the shrouded queen noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道藏影女王比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_BOSS.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.1"
msgid "I wonder what the beckoning hand looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，召唤之手是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the mockingbird."
msgstr "得记住回到嘲鸫这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.1"
msgid "I wonder what the playbill looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，剧本是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the charlie."
msgstr "得记住回到查理这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.1"
msgid "I wonder if that gesture was in the script."
msgstr "不知道那个手势是不是剧本里写好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE2.2"
msgid "I can't take my eyes off the stage."
msgstr "我有些移不开视线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.1"
msgid "I wonder if that gesture was in the script."
msgstr "不知道那个手势是不是剧本里写好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC.SCENE3.2"
msgid "I can't take my eyes off the stage."
msgstr "我有些移不开视线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.1"
msgid "We'll be able to find our way back by the stage."
msgstr "回来的时候可以凭舞台认路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST.2"
msgid "It would help to mark the path before dark."
msgstr "天黑前把路标好会方便很多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the broken clockworks."
msgstr "不知雕工在损坏的发条装置上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.1"
msgid "I can still see the maker's cuts in the broken clockworks."
msgstr "在损坏的发条装置上还能看见雕刻的刀痕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the broken clockworks."
msgstr "不知雕工在损坏的发条装置上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3.2"
msgid "The detail shows better from this angle."
msgstr "从这个角度看得清细节。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.1"
msgid "I recognize that silhouette in the carving."
msgstr "光看雕刻的轮廓就认出来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR.2"
msgid "It belongs somewhere we can see the whole shape."
msgstr "得放在能看见全貌的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.1"
msgid "Whoever carved the antlion figure had a steady hand."
msgstr "雕蚁狮雕塑的人手真稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION.2"
msgid "I'd leave the antlion figure a little space of its own."
msgstr "我想给蚁狮雕塑单独留些位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Whoever carved the blighted hound batilisk figure had a steady hand."
msgstr "雕枯萎猎犬蝙蝠雕塑的人手真稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BATBOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "Turn it toward the light to see the detail."
msgstr "转向光线就能看清细节。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER.1"
