#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE.1"
