msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "Whoever carved the blighted great depths worm figure had a steady hand."
msgstr "雕枯萎洞穴巨虫雕塑的人手真稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS_SHADOW.2
