msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.1"
msgid "Whoever carved the gilded depths worm figure had a steady hand."
msgstr "雕镀金洞穴蠕虫雕塑的人手真稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS.2"
msgid "I'd need both hands to move this piece."
msgstr "这件得用两只手才搬得动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.1"
msgid "I never thought I'd have to wait for my luggage to catch up."
msgstr "我以前从没停下来等过自己的行李。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER.2"
msgid "Come along, Chester. I left room by the fire for you."
msgstr "走吧，切斯特。火边给你留了位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Every time I pick this up, I hear little feet behind me."
msgstr "每次拿起它，身后就会传来小小的脚步声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Good, the eye's open. Chester can't be far."
msgstr "好，眼睛睁着。切斯特应该就在附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.1"
msgid "Nothing stirring in there. I'll give it time."
msgstr "里面静了下来，我再等一等。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING.2"
msgid "I hope my little friend comes back."
msgstr "希望我的小伙伴还会回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "I can put that to use in our most crowded chest."
msgstr "营地里最挤的箱子正用得上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "Perhaps now I'll finally get the lid shut."
msgstr "这样或许终于能合上箱盖了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.1"
msgid "My belongings don't usually come running after me!"
msgstr "我收起来的东西，平时可不会追着我跑！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED.2"
msgid "So those weren't hinges I heard creaking."
msgstr "原来刚才吱呀响的根本不是铰链。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.1"
msgid "I'd put the fish food within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把鱼食放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CHUM.2"
msgid "I can see where the barnacles went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了藤壶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I saw that clay flank move."
msgstr "我看见那泥塑的身子动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Those eyes look far too lively for clay."
msgstr "一尊泥塑的眼睛未免太灵动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.1"
msgid "I could have sworn the clay hound shifted just then."
msgstr "我敢说黏土猎犬刚才挪动过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYHOUND.STATUE.2"
msgid "I'll watch for movement before I go closer."
msgstr "先看有没有动静，再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I saw that clay flank move."
msgstr "我看见那泥塑的身子动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Those eyes look far too lively for clay."
msgstr "一尊泥塑的眼睛未免太灵动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.1"
msgid "I could have sworn the clay varg shifted just then."
msgstr "我敢说黏土座狼刚才挪动过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CLAYWARG.STATUE.2"
msgid "I'll watch for movement before I go closer."
msgstr "先看有没有动静，再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.1"
msgid "A breath of wind might finish the endothermic fire."
msgstr "再来一阵风，吸热营火就要灭了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借这点光几乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the endothermic fire looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，吸热营火是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut grass if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采下的草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the endothermic fire from several paces back."
msgstr "隔着好几步都能感觉到吸热营火的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "现在添的燃料够多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the endothermic fire going."
msgstr "够吸热营火用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.LOW.2"
msgid "I'll go fetch fuel before it runs out."
msgstr "我趁它没耗尽，去取点燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the endothermic fire for a while."
msgstr "我可以在吸热营火旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.1"
msgid "There isn't a flicker left in the endothermic fire."
msgstr "吸热营火里一点火光都没了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT.2"
msgid "We'll have to light it again."
msgstr "得重新点起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.1"
msgid "There's hardly a glow left in the endothermic fire pit."
msgstr "吸热火坑只剩一点暗红了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借这点光几乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the endothermic fire pit."
msgstr "我标一下发现吸热火坑的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the electrical doodad went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了电子元件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the endothermic fire pit from several paces back."
msgstr "隔着好几步都能感觉到吸热火坑的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "现在添的燃料够多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the endothermic fire pit going."
msgstr "够吸热火坑用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.LOW.2"
msgid "A little now will save me trouble later."
msgstr "现在添一些，等会儿就省事了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the endothermic fire pit for a while."
msgstr "我可以在吸热火坑旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.1"
msgid "I remember the endothermic fire pit giving rather more light than this."
msgstr "我记得吸热火坑亮着时可比这样有用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIREPIT.OUT.2"
msgid "I should find something to light it with."
msgstr "我该找些能引火的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.1"
msgid "I'll sort through what's left of the chest."
msgstr "我来清点一下箱子塌了以后还剩什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COLLAPSEDCHEST.2"
msgid "Mind the broken boards where you step."
msgstr "下脚时留心断木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.1"
msgid "The needle points east."
msgstr "指针朝东。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.E.2"
msgid "We're facing east."
msgstr "我们正朝东。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My grip on the compass feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住指南针的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the ocuvigil with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做月眼守卫就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.1"
msgid "The needle points north."
msgstr "指针朝北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.N.2"
msgid "We're facing north."
msgstr "我们正朝北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.1"
msgid "The needle points northeast."
msgstr "指针朝东北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NE.2"
msgid "We're facing northeast."
msgstr "我们正朝东北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.1"
msgid "The needle points northwest."
msgstr "指针朝西北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.NW.2"
msgid "We're facing northwest."
msgstr "我们正朝西北。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.1"
msgid "The needle points south."
msgstr "指针朝南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.S.2"
msgid "We're facing south."
msgstr "我们正朝南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.1"
msgid "The needle points southeast."
msgstr "指针朝东南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SE.2"
msgid "We're facing southeast."
msgstr "我们正朝东南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.1"
msgid "The needle points southwest."
msgstr "指针朝西南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.SW.2"
msgid "We're facing southwest."
msgstr "我们正朝西南。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.1"
msgid "The needle points west."
msgstr "指针朝西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPASS.W.2"
msgid "We're facing west."
msgstr "我们正朝西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.1"
msgid "I'd put the compost where everyone can see it."
msgstr "我会把堆肥放在大家都看得见的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOST.2"
msgid "It would help to mark the path before dark."
msgstr "天黑前把路标好会方便很多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.1"
msgid "A good mix. I'll leave it to break down."
msgstr "干湿刚好，让它慢慢沤吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BALANCED.2"
msgid "The garden will get the benefit of this later."
msgstr "以后菜园就用得上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the composting bin in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出堆肥桶的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.1"
msgid "It needs something moist in the mix."
msgstr "还得拌进些湿料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.DRY.2"
msgid "All those dry bits aren't breaking down."
msgstr "这些干料还没怎么分解。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the composting bin."
msgstr "我标一下发现堆肥桶的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rot to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了腐烂物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.1"
msgid "There's too much moisture in the bin."
msgstr "桶里湿料太多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTINGBIN.WET.2"
msgid "I'd add a handful of dry matter."
msgstr "我会再添一把干料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the compost wrap out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到肥料包。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COMPOSTWRAP.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the nitre if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些硝石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for it in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给它腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CONSTRUCTION_PLANS.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.1"
msgid "I'd bring the cookbook back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把烹饪指南带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKBOOK.2"
msgid "I can see where the carrot went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked mandrake."
msgstr "吃熟曼德拉草我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMANDRAKE.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.1"
msgid "I could smell the cooked meat before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见熟肉，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMEAT.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.1"
msgid "I'm leaving that off the dinner table."
msgstr "这东西可不能上饭桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDMONSTERMEAT.2"
msgid "Please put that away from the good food."
msgstr "请把它和能吃的东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.1"
msgid "I could smell the cooked morsel before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见熟小肉，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKEDSMALLMEAT.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the cookie cutter from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察饼干切割机。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTER.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the cookie cutter cap with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下饼干切割机帽子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.1"
msgid "I'll keep the cookie cutter shell apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "饼干切割机壳得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKIECUTTERSHELL.2"
msgid "I'll clean it before I take it back."
msgstr "带回去以前要清理一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll keep the ink dry. We might need to read this again."
msgstr "我会护着墨迹，之后也许还得翻看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKINGRECIPECARD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could copy this into my notebook back at camp."
msgstr "回营地后，我可以把它抄进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the crock pot."
msgstr "烹饪锅烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "I can wait. Rushing the crock pot won't help."
msgstr "我等得起，催烹饪锅也没用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "I'll come back when that smell gets a little stronger."
msgstr "等香气再浓一点，我就回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "I think the crock pot is nearly finished."
msgstr "我看烹饪锅就快好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Just time to lay things out before it's done."
msgstr "趁还差那么一会儿，把东西摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.1"
msgid "Time to see what the crock pot has for us."
msgstr "该看看烹饪锅这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the crock pot. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，烹饪锅里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the nucleation fluid in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给核化液腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COOLANT.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the cat tail."
msgstr "不知猫尾能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COONTAIL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the flailing slingshot band."
msgstr "我该给甩尾弹弓皮筋留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the corn differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给玉米调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN.2"
msgid "A smaller portion for me if we're sharing."
msgstr "如果大家分着吃，我少拿一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the popcorn cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "爆米花要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant corn before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型玉米再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'll mark the row where I sow the clustered seeds."
msgstr "播下簇状种子的那一行，我会做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CORN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.1"
msgid "Which scene calls for the blacksmith costume?"
msgstr "哪一场要用铁匠服？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_BLACKSMITH_BODY.2"
msgid "I should check the script before I step onstage."
msgstr "上台前得再核对一次剧本。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.1"
msgid "I'll leave the doll costume ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把玩偶服给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_DOLL_BODY.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.1"
msgid "I'll leave the fool costume ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把小丑服给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_FOOL_BODY.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the king costume from the audience's side."
msgstr "我想从观众席那边看看国王服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_KING_BODY.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.1"
msgid "I'll leave the mirror costume ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把镜子服给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_MIRROR_BODY.2"
msgid "Let's run that scene once before the audience comes in."
msgstr "等观众入场前，先排一遍吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.1"
msgid "I'll leave the princess costume ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把公主服给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_PRINCESS_BODY.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.1"
msgid "Which scene calls for the queen costume?"
msgstr "哪一场要用女王服？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_QUEEN_BODY.2"
msgid "I should check the script before I step onstage."
msgstr "上台前得再核对一次剧本。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the tree costume from the audience's side."
msgstr "我想从观众席那边看看树木服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COSTUME_TREE_BODY.2"
msgid "I should check the script before I step onstage."
msgstr "上台前得再核对一次剧本。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL1.LIT.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL2.LIT.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.1"
msgid "I should bring something for the little altar."
msgstr "得给这小祭台带点供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TABERNACLE_LEVEL3.LIT.2"
msgid "Someone built this as a place for prayer."
msgstr "有人在这里造了个祈祷的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.1"
msgid "Of all the things to turn up here, the red crown!"
msgstr "居然会在这里找到红眼冠！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COTL_TRINKET.2"
msgid "Whatever its worth, someone took the trouble to make it."
msgstr "不论值多少钱，毕竟有人认真做过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "I'd give the cozy bunnyman a little room to pass."
msgstr "我给舒适的兔人让一点路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.COZY_BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That's the crab king up ahead. Stay where we can see each other."
msgstr "前面是帝王蟹。大家别走出彼此的视线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.1"
msgid "Those empty sockets catch my eye."
msgstr "那几个空槽挺显眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT.2"
msgid "I wonder what gems were set in there."
msgstr "不知道这里以前镶过什么宝石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.1"
msgid "I'd give the cannon tower a little room to pass."
msgstr "我给加农炮塔让一点路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the imposing claw?"
msgstr "巨钳平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the ice barrier in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的冰障。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the crab guard before it moves again."
msgstr "趁蟹卫没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the crab knight?"
msgstr "蟹骑士平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.1"
msgid "I'd lay my materials out beside the rock den."
msgstr "我想在岩石巢穴旁把材料排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB.2"
msgid "I'd rather check the plan before I start."
msgstr "动手前我想再对一遍图纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.1"
msgid "I wonder if the bulbin would follow me home."
msgstr "不知芽葱愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN.2"
msgid "I'd leave a warm corner by my bed."
msgstr "床边可以留个暖和的角落。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.1"
msgid "I wonder if the broodling would follow me home."
msgstr "不知小龙蝇愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING.2"
msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.1"
msgid "I wonder if the eets would follow me home."
msgstr "不知一吃愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS.2"
msgid "You can come closer, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，可以再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.1"
msgid "I wonder if the friendly peeper would follow me home."
msgstr "不知友好窥视者愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR.2"
msgid "You can come closer, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，可以再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.1"
msgid "There's the glomglom. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小格罗姆。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING.2"
msgid "I'd leave a warm corner by my bed."
msgstr "床边可以留个暖和的角落。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.1"
msgid "I wonder if the kittykit would follow me home."
msgstr "不知浣猫崽愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN.2"
msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.1"
msgid "There's the ewelet. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小钢羊。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB.2"
msgid "You can come closer, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，可以再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.1"
msgid "There's the mothling. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小蛾子。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING.2"
msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.1"
msgid "There's the giblet. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小火鸡。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING.2"
msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.1"
msgid "There's the vargling. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小座狼。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY.2"
msgid "You can come closer, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，可以再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the crow from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看乌鸦就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the psychosis experiment."
msgstr "我该给精神病实验留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR.1"
msgid "I could use this to prise up a board at camp."
msgstr "我能用它把营地的木板撬起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CROWBAR.2"
msgid "Shino has left quite a few dents in this."
msgstr "这上面有好些志乃留下的凹痕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the cookie crumbles to share."
msgstr "希望饼干屑够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.1"
msgid "Didn't I empty this pocket already?"
msgstr "这个口袋我不是已经掏空了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN.2"
msgid "That little coin's harder to lose than I'd like."
msgstr "这枚小钱币想丢还丢不掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.1"
msgid "I can twist a handful into a decent cord."
msgstr "抓上一把就能搓出根结实的绳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS.2"
msgid "The cut ends tickle through my sleeve."
msgstr "草茎的断口隔着衣袖也扎得痒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.1"
msgid "My grip on the cutless feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住木头短剑的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS.2"
msgid "I'll make room so my sleeves don't catch."
msgstr "我让出些地方，免得衣袖被勾住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the lichen."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给苔藓配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN.2"
msgid "I should save some for the fungal turf."
msgstr "我该给真菌地皮留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.1"
msgid "I'd keep a clean bundle out of the damp."
msgstr "我会把干净的一束收好，别让它受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it before it goes in my pack."
msgstr "进背包前得先包起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the cut stone."
msgstr "我想细看一下石砖的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the nightmare werepig fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是梦魇疯猪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.1"
msgid "Those chains are holding fast."
msgstr "锁链绷得很紧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED.2"
msgid "I wonder who put the restraints on him."
msgstr "不知道是谁把他锁在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the scrappy werepig is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出拾荒疯猪藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the scrappy werepig fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是拾荒疯猪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.1"
msgid "There's a warning in that stance."
msgstr "那个架势是在警告我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for it to pass."
msgstr "给它留条路过去吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.1"
msgid "I can see the pillar beneath the covering."
msgstr "遮挡挪开后，就能看到柱子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED.2"
msgid "That surface has seen better days."
msgstr "这表面已经磨损了不少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the cracked pillar here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把开裂的柱子留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.1"
msgid "I'm leaving that off the dinner table."
msgstr "这东西可不能上饭桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST.2"
msgid "Please put that away from the good food."
msgstr "请把它和能吃的东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the sea bones."
msgstr "我标一下发现海骨的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the birchnut tree over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到桦栗树的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the birchnut tree before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到桦栗树旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the birchnut tree."
msgstr "桦栗树的断面还很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the birchnut tree changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时桦栗树会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.1"
msgid "The branches turned when I came near."
msgstr "我一靠近，树枝就转过来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON.2"
msgid "I'll give those roots a wide berth."
msgstr "我会远远绕开那些根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.1"
msgid "I'd set the deck of cards beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把牌堆放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.1"
msgid "I'll try to find where the art? fits."
msgstr "我想找出艺术？该装在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the table vase. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，餐桌花瓶里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.1"
msgid "The light is quite strong from fresh stems."
msgstr "新换的花枝发的光很亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can see the petals' glow on the table."
msgstr "花瓣的光映在桌上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A few fresh stems would look lovely here."
msgstr "摆几枝鲜花会很好看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll bring flowers back from my walk."
msgstr "下次散步回来，我带些花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "The light is fading. I should change the stems."
msgstr "光在变暗，得换花枝了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can see the petals' glow on the table."
msgstr "花瓣的光映在桌上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the table vase before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下餐桌花瓶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED.2"
msgid "The leaves have lost their spring."
msgstr "叶片已经蔫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the table lamp reaches."
msgstr "我想看看餐桌灯的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP.2"
msgid "I can see where the twigs went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the empty frame to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把空画框带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the log if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.1"
msgid "There's room for a drawing on the empty frame."
msgstr "空画框上还能添一幅画。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN.2"
msgid "I should decide what to put here before I start."
msgstr "落笔前得先想好画什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the pleasant portrait."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对愉快画像了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.1"
msgid "That's a fine sweep to its antler."
msgstr "这只角的弧度真漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER.2"
msgid "It turns its whole head to clear the branches."
msgstr "要避开树枝，它得把整个头转过去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd give the no-eyed deer a little room to pass."
msgstr "我给无眼鹿让一点路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "The snow crunches long before I see that eye."
msgstr "还没看见那只眼睛，先听见了踏雪声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "I want everyone well away from our tents."
msgstr "大家先离帐篷远一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on it!"
msgstr "它着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Watch it! It isn't staying down!"
msgstr "留意它！它又要起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the ice crystaleyezer again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看冰眼结晶器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.1"
msgid "There's an empty place for the eye."
msgstr "放眼球的地方还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL.2"
msgid "It won't be keeping watch like that."
msgstr "这样可看不了岗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the ice crystaleyezer kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开冰眼结晶器套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.1"
msgid "I'd save the deerclops eyeball for after practice."
msgstr "我想把独眼巨鹿眼球留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the eyebrella."
msgstr "我该给眼球伞留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the deer antler out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到鹿角。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the no-eyed deer from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察无眼鹿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the grass in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the desert goggles."
msgstr "不知道沙漠护目镜会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the desiccant pouch in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给小包干燥剂腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.1"
msgid "I'd bring the desiccant sack back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把大包干燥剂带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.1"
msgid "I think this belongs to whoever made the world."
msgstr "我想这是创造这个世界的人用的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL.2"
msgid "I wouldn't change anything until I knew how to undo it."
msgstr "还不知道怎么改回去，我可不想随便动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.1"
msgid "I think this belongs to whoever made the world."
msgstr "我想这是创造这个世界的人用的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DEVTOOL_NODEV.2"
msgid "I wouldn't change anything until I knew how to undo it."
msgstr "还不知道怎么改回去，我可不想随便动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the suspicious dirt pile."
msgstr "我标一下发现可疑的土堆的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.1"
msgid "The signal's faint here."
msgstr "这里的信号很弱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD.2"
msgid "I can barely hear it ticking."
msgstr "勉强能听见细微的响声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the divining rod to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把探测杖带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.1"
msgid "I can hardly hear myself over the signal!"
msgstr "信号响得快盖过我的声音了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT.2"
msgid "Whatever it's finding must be right here."
msgstr "它要找的东西一定就在这儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.1"
msgid "It's getting louder along this path."
msgstr "沿这条路走，声音越来越响。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM.2"
msgid "Keep this heading. The signal's stronger."
msgstr "就朝这边走，信号变强了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.1"
msgid "It's getting louder along this path."
msgstr "沿这条路走，声音越来越响。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER.2"
msgid "Keep this heading. The signal's stronger."
msgstr "就朝这边走，信号变强了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the divining rod holder."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对探测杖底座了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.1"
msgid "Time to see what the divining rod holder has for us."
msgstr "该看看探测杖底座这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the divining rod holder from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出探测杖底座的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.1"
msgid "That's a curious place to leave a rod."
msgstr "怎么把探测杖留在这种地方？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART.2"
msgid "I should see which way the signal leads."
msgstr "我该看看信号会指向哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the dock kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开码头套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the dock piling."
msgstr "我先给码头桩腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet hour to study the dolled-up costume pattern."
msgstr "我想静下心来仔细读读娃娃礼服款式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I should check the materials against the drawing."
msgstr "要对着图核一遍材料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll check the dragonfly boat kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查龙蝇船套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.1"
msgid "I'll check the decked-out dragonfly boat kit before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查豪华龙蝇船套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the lucky gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.1"
msgid "Would the lucky beast body leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着幸运兽躯体还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.1"
msgid "I could make room for the hot dragon chili salad at supper."
msgstr "晚饭还能给辣龙椒沙拉留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "Those scales glow a little brighter when it turns."
msgstr "它一转身，鳞片就亮上几分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY.2"
msgid "Even the air around its wings feels hot."
msgstr "翅膀旁边的空气都是烫的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the scaled chest."
msgstr "该检查一下龙鳞宝箱里已经装了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the scales went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了鳞片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "I can fit far more supplies in there now."
msgstr "现在能多装好多物资。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "All those extra provisions can finally go in one chest."
msgstr "那些多出来的储备终于可以收进同一只箱子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the scaled furnace looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，龙鳞火炉是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the scales to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了鳞片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.1"
msgid "I can see the break in the scaled furnace."
msgstr "能看见龙鳞火炉断在了什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HAMMERED.2"
msgid "It won't work in this state."
msgstr "这样已经没法用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.1"
msgid "I can feel the scaled furnace from several paces back."
msgstr "隔着好几步都能感觉到龙鳞火炉的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.HIGH.2"
msgid "That's quite enough fuel for now."
msgstr "现在添的燃料够多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the scaled furnace for a while."
msgstr "我可以在龙鳞火炉旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYFURNACE.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.1"
msgid "Could we take the dragon fruit on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着火龙果吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the prepared dragon fruit before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见熟火龙果，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant dragon fruit before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型火龙果再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的篮子可装不下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the bulbous seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把球茎状种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFRUIT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.1"
msgid "Would the lucky beast head leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着幸运兽脑袋还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONHEADHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the dragonpie after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃火龙果派。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONPIE.2"
msgid "I might try a little more dragon fruit next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些火龙果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the lucky beast tail."
msgstr "不知道幸运兽尾巴会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGONTAILHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.1"
msgid "I'll keep the scales apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "鳞片得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRAGON_SCALES.2"
msgid "I'll clean it before I take it back."
msgstr "带回去以前要清理一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the dreadstone if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，绝望石也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the dreadstone helm with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下绝望石头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONEHAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the pure horror went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了纯粹恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the dreadstone outcrop if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，绝望石矿苗也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the dreadstone tomb just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着绝望石封墓，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DREADSTONE_STACK_TOMB.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.1"
msgid "I could use the driftwood piece back at the workbench."
msgstr "工作台上也许用得着浮木桩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_LOG.2"
msgid "I should save some for the driftwood oar."
msgstr "我该给浮木桨留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the driftwood!"
msgstr "火快把浮木吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the driftwood."
msgstr "浮木烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Nothing of the driftwood above the stump now."
msgstr "浮木只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the driftwood changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时浮木会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRIFTWOOD_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.1"
msgid "Could we take the drumstick on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着鸟腿吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the fried drumstick cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "炸鸟腿要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DRUMSTICK_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the banana bush."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合香蕉丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BANANABUSH.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the berry bush."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "给根边培些土会好一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the juicy berry bush."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合多汁浆果丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_BERRYBUSH_JUICY.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the grass tuft growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让草丛长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_GRASS.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the spiky bush growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让尖刺灌木长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MARSH_BUSH.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the monkeytails."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合猴尾草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_MONKEYTAIL.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_SAPLING.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "给根边培些土会好一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the anenemy trap growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让海星陷阱长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUG_TRAP_STARFISH.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.1"
msgid "Wolfgang makes the dumbbell look awfully light."
msgstr "哑铃到了沃尔夫冈手里，显得真轻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL.2"
msgid "Both feet flat before I lift."
msgstr "两脚站实了再举。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.1"
msgid "Wolfgang makes the icebell look awfully light."
msgstr "冰铃到了沃尔夫冈手里，显得真轻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_BLUEGEM.2"
msgid "Both feet flat before I lift."
msgstr "两脚站实了再举。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.1"
msgid "I should warm up before I lift the gembell."
msgstr "举宝石哑铃前得先热身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GEM.2"
msgid "My arms will remember this tomorrow."
msgstr "明天胳膊肯定会酸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.1"
msgid "Wolfgang makes the golden dumbbell look awfully light."
msgstr "黄金哑铃到了沃尔夫冈手里，显得真轻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_GOLDEN.2"
msgid "I'll start with a few careful repetitions."
msgstr "我先稳稳地做几次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.1"
msgid "I should warm up before I lift the thermbell."
msgstr "举热铃前得先热身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_HEAT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rocks to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.1"
msgid "I should warm up before I lift the marbell."
msgstr "举大理石哑铃前得先热身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_MARBLE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the marble to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了大理石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.1"
msgid "I should warm up before I lift the firebell."
msgstr "举火铃前得先热身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUMBBELL_REDGEM.2"
msgid "My arms will remember this tomorrow."
msgstr "明天胳膊肯定会酸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.1"
msgid "Could we take the durian on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着榴莲吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the extra smelly durian cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "超臭榴莲要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Who'll help me carry the giant durian back to camp?"
msgstr "谁来帮我把巨型榴莲搬回营地？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the brittle seed pods for planting day."
msgstr "我得把脆籽荚留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'll keep a few back for a second sowing."
msgstr "我会留些给下一拨播种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.1"
msgid "A bit of the amberosia is worth setting aside."
msgstr "琥珀美食值得留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMERINGUE.2"
msgid "I'm beginning to recognize useful materials by touch."
msgstr "我渐渐能用指尖认出常用的材料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the dust moth from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察尘蛾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTH.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.1"
msgid "I'd approach the tidy hidey-hole quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近整洁洞穴时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.DUSTMOTHDEN.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.1"
msgid "Would the rabbit earmuffs leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着兔耳罩还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EARMUFFSHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.1"
msgid "I could smell the eel from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了鳗鱼的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked eel cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟鳗鱼要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EEL_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.1"
msgid "I could make room for the eggplant at supper."
msgstr "晚饭还能给茄子留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the braised eggplant."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份烤茄子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Who'll help me carry the giant eggplant back to camp?"
msgstr "谁来帮我把巨型茄子搬回营地？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的篮子可装不下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the swirly seeds in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把漩涡种子收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EGGPLANT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "I'd watch the picnic casket at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看野餐盒怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ELIXIR_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I took the cover off."
msgstr "拆开外壳之前我会先问一声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the fire ball reaches."
msgstr "我想看看火球的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EMBERLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the end table."
msgstr "茶几烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the end table at the moment."
msgstr "茶几里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.1"
msgid "The light is quite strong from fresh stems."
msgstr "新换的花枝发的光很亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.FRESHLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can see the petals' glow on the table."
msgstr "花瓣的光映在桌上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "A few fresh stems would look lovely here."
msgstr "摆几枝鲜花会很好看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll bring flowers back from my walk."
msgstr "下次散步回来，我带些花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "The light is fading. I should change the stems."
msgstr "光在变暗，得换花枝了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.OLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can see the petals' glow on the table."
msgstr "花瓣的光映在桌上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the end table before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下茶几。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ENDTABLE.WILTED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the evergreen!"
msgstr "火快把常青树吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the evergreen."
msgstr "常青树烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the evergreen."
msgstr "常青树的断面还很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I can count the rings from here."
msgstr "站在这里都能数年轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's resin on the bark where a branch came off."
msgstr "折枝的地方渗出了一点树脂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I like the smell of the needles after rain."
msgstr "我喜欢雨后松针的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the lumpy evergreen!"
msgstr "臃肿常青树着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the lumpy evergreen in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出臃肿常青树的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Nothing of the lumpy evergreen above the stump now."
msgstr "臃肿常青树只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's resin on the bark where a branch came off."
msgstr "折枝的地方渗出了一点树脂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I like the smell of the needles after rain."
msgstr "我喜欢雨后松针的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.1"
msgid "Would the eyebrella leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着眼球伞还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEBRELLAHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the eye mask."
msgstr "不知道眼面具会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEMASKHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.1"
msgid "I felt the eye of terror move through the soles of my feet."
msgstr "脚底都能感觉到恐怖之眼在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the suspicious peeper from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察可疑窥视者。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.1"
msgid "I saw the shell twitch."
msgstr "我看见壳动了一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEOFTERROR_MINI_GROUNDED.2"
msgid "I'd step back before the little eye hatches."
msgstr "趁小眼睛还没孵出来，我先退开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.1"
msgid "Look, the eye plant has noticed us."
msgstr "看，眼球草注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYEPLANT.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.1"
msgid "I wonder what the houndius shootius looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，眼睛炮塔是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the houndius shootius."
msgstr "我先给眼睛炮塔腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.EYETURRET_ITEM.2"
msgid "I can see where the deerclops eyeball went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了独眼巨鹿眼球。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where it stood."
msgstr "它原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see it in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.1"
msgid "There's a new leaf since yesterday."
msgstr "比昨天多长了一片叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.GROWING.2"
msgid "I should water round the roots."
msgstr "该沿着根部浇点水。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.1"
msgid "I hate seeing it in this condition."
msgstr "看到它成了这样，真让人难受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARMPLOT.NEEDSFERTILIZER.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.1"
msgid "I'd put the garden hoe within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把园艺锄放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_HOE.2"
msgid "I can see where the twigs went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the crop over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到作物的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.1"
msgid "That's come on nicely since my last visit."
msgstr "比起上次来，真是长得不错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL.2"
msgid "I should bring a basket for the harvest."
msgstr "我该拿个篮子来收菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "All that from a single seed?"
msgstr "一颗种子竟然长得这么大？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "A harvest like that needs a bigger basket."
msgstr "这收成得换个大篮子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.1"
msgid "That's not the leaf I remember sowing for."
msgstr "这叶子看着不像我种的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.FULL_WEED.2"
msgid "I'll pull the weed before it scatters seeds."
msgstr "趁还没结籽，我得把草拔掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the crop grows."
msgstr "我要记住作物长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.1"
msgid "There's fresh growth on the crop."
msgstr "能看出作物已经长了不少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.GROWING.2"
msgid "I should mark the height and come back tomorrow."
msgstr "我可以记下高度，明天再来比比。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.1"
msgid "The smell of the crop is quite enough from here."
msgstr "站在这儿已经闻够作物的味道了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN.2"
msgid "I should handle it with gloves."
msgstr "我还是戴上手套再碰吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "All that from a single seed?"
msgstr "一颗种子竟然长得这么大？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.ROTTEN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "Too late to eat any of it now."
msgstr "现在一口也吃不得了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.1"
msgid "I've marked the spot so I won't step on it."
msgstr "我做了记号，免得一脚踩上去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLANT.SEED.2"
msgid "I'll check for the first green tip tomorrow."
msgstr "我明天来看看有没有冒出小绿芽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the garden digamajig in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的耕地机。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the garden digamajig, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放耕地机够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_PLOW_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the garden detritus."
msgstr "得记住回到农田杂物这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FARM_SOIL_DEBRIS.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.1"
msgid "I can see every fine strand on the luxury fan."
msgstr "羽毛扇上的细纹一根根都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERFAN.2"
msgid "It barely stirs the palm of my hand."
msgstr "落在手心，几乎感觉不到重量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the feather hat between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把羽毛帽夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERHAT.2"
msgid "So much colour in something that weighs so little."
msgstr "这么轻的东西，颜色却如此鲜明。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the feather pencil between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把羽毛笔夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHERPENCIL.2"
msgid "It barely stirs the palm of my hand."
msgstr "落在手心，几乎感觉不到重量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the saffron feather between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把黄色羽毛夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CANARY.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the electric dart."
msgstr "要做雷电吹箭，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.1"
msgid "I can see every fine strand on the jet feather."
msgstr "黑色羽毛上的细纹一根根都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_CROW.2"
msgid "So much colour in something that weighs so little."
msgstr "这么轻的东西，颜色却如此鲜明。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the crimson feather between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把红色羽毛夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN.2"
msgid "It barely stirs the palm of my hand."
msgstr "落在手心，几乎感觉不到重量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the azure feather between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把蓝色羽毛夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEATHER_ROBIN_WINTER.2"
msgid "It barely stirs the palm of my hand."
msgstr "落在手心，几乎感觉不到重量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Can you hear me in there?"
msgstr "你在那里听得见我吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FEM_PUPPET.2"
msgid "I wish I could untangle whatever's holding you."
msgstr "真想替你解开那些束缚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.1"
msgid "With the wood fence here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了木栅栏，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE.2"
msgid "Better leave a way for everyone to get through."
msgstr "得给大家留条能过的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.1"
msgid "With the t.i.n.g.l.e. node here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了麻刺节点，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better leave a way for everyone to get through."
msgstr "得给大家留条能过的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the t.i.n.g.l.e. node."
msgstr "麻刺节点的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC.LINKED.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.1"
msgid "With the t.i.n.g.l.e. node here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了麻刺节点，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ELECTRIC_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better leave a way for everyone to get through."
msgstr "得给大家留条能过的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.1"
msgid "With the wood gate here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了木门，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下够皮弗娄牛通过的开口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll check the alignment of the wood gate against the next section."
msgstr "我看看木门跟下一段齐不齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_GATE_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll look along the top to see if it's straight."
msgstr "我顺着顶边看一眼齐不齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.1"
msgid "With the wood fence here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了木栅栏，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ITEM.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下够皮弗娄牛通过的开口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.1"
msgid "I'll check the alignment of the junky fence against the next section."
msgstr "我看看垃圾栅栏跟下一段齐不齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_JUNK.2"
msgid "I'll look along the top to see if it's straight."
msgstr "我顺着顶边看一眼齐不齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.1"
msgid "With the fencing sword here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了栅栏击剑，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FENCE_ROTATOR.2"
msgid "Better leave a way for everyone to get through."
msgstr "得给大家留条能过的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the bucket-o-poop out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到便便桶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FERTILIZER.2"
msgid "I should save some for the gardeneer hat."
msgstr "我该给耕作先驱帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the festive fish dish away."
msgstr "一点水纹暴露了节庆鱼料理的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVEFISH.2"
msgid "I'll stay still until the surface clears."
msgstr "我站稳不动，等水面清下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet hour to study the festive costume pattern."
msgstr "我想静下心来仔细读读节日盛装款式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FESTIVE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "One careful read now will save mistakes later."
msgstr "现在认真读一遍，等会儿就少出错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.1"
msgid "I'll try the fig the next time the water's calm."
msgstr "下次水面平静，我就试试无花果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the tree jam with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做树果酱就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.1"
msgid "I could smell the figatoni from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了无花果意面的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGATONI.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.1"
msgid "I could smell the figkabab from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了无花果烤串的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIGKABAB.2"
msgid "I can taste the fig in every bite."
msgstr "每口都能尝出无花果的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked fig."
msgstr "吃熟无花果我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIG_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'll keep the infernal staff where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把地狱魔杖放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREBALLSTAFF.2"
msgid "My teacher always checked the fittings first."
msgstr "老师总会先检查装具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.1"
msgid "I'd set the red firecrackers beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把红鞭炮放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRECRACKERS.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like the fireflies near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让萤火虫靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREFLIES.HELD.2"
msgid "It's much smaller this close."
msgstr "拿到跟前显得真小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.1"
msgid "I'd give the fire hound room to turn."
msgstr "得给火焰猎犬留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREHOUND.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.1"
msgid "I'd save the fire nettle fronds for after practice."
msgstr "我想把火荨麻叶留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried fire nettle frond wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干火荨麻叶包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRENETTLES_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.1"
msgid "My grip on the fiery pen feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住火焰笔的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPEN.2"
msgid "A dry handle makes all the difference."
msgstr "柄干燥，握起来就稳多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.1"
msgid "A breath of wind might finish the fire pit."
msgstr "再来一阵风，火坑就要灭了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.EMBERS.2"
msgid "I can barely see my hands by this light."
msgstr "借这点光几乎看不清手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Room for another pair of cold hands?"
msgstr "还有地方给我暖暖手吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sit where the smoke won't reach my eyes."
msgstr "我挑个烟熏不到眼睛的位置坐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.1"
msgid "That's singeing the hem of my skirt from here!"
msgstr "站在这儿，裙角都快烤焦了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.HIGH.2"
msgid "No more wood. Pull the bedrolls back a little."
msgstr "别添柴了，把铺盖往后挪些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.1"
msgid "The ends of the sticks have stopped catching."
msgstr "柴枝末端都快点不着了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.LOW.2"
msgid "Let me add a split log before we lose the flame."
msgstr "趁火还在，我添一块劈好的柴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the fire pit for a while."
msgstr "我可以在火坑旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.1"
msgid "Nothing to warm my hands over now."
msgstr "这下暖不了手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIREPIT.OUT.2"
msgid "I'll bring tinder. A log on its own won't catch."
msgstr "我去拿火绒，光放根木头点不着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.1"
msgid "The fire staff takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "火魔杖的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the ice flingomatic going."
msgstr "够雪球发射器用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.LOWFUEL.2"
msgid "A little now will save me trouble later."
msgstr "现在添一些，等会儿就省事了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the ice flingomatic."
msgstr "雪球发射器现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the ice flingomatic from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出雪球发射器的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FIRESUPPRESSOR.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the fish away."
msgstr "一点水纹暴露了鱼的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光线变化真大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the fishing net to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把渔网带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGNET.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the freshwater fishing rod this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把淡水钓竿做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHINGROD.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the twigs to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.1"
msgid "Could we take the raw fish on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着生鱼肉吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the fish steak cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "鱼排要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the fishy jerky wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把鱼肉干包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜欢能塞进袖兜里的口粮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.1"
msgid "I could smell the fish morsel from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了小鱼块的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked fish morsel cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟小鱼块要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the small fishy jerky along without a bowl."
msgstr "带上小鱼干就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHMEAT_SMALL_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.1"
msgid "I could smell the fishsticks from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了炸鱼排的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHSTICKS.2"
msgid "I can taste the fish morsel in every bite."
msgstr "每口都能尝出小鱼块的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the fish tacos differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给鱼肉玉米卷调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISHTACOS.2"
msgid "I remember putting the fish morsel in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了小鱼块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.1"
msgid "I'd keep the tin fishin' bin somewhere we can all reach."
msgstr "锡鱼罐该放到大家都够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_BOX.2"
msgid "I can see where the cut stone went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked fish."
msgstr "吃熟鱼我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FISH_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.1"
msgid "A fresh edge, right where it split."
msgstr "裂开的地方正好有一道新刃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLINT.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the sharp pieces before I pocket them."
msgstr "锋利的碎片要包好才能进口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.1"
msgid "It's lost the air that held it up."
msgstr "里面的气漏掉了，撑不起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.DEFLATED.2"
msgid "It won't rise again in that condition."
msgstr "这样是飘不起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd set the sky lantern beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把天灯放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the lucky gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOATINGLANTERN.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.1"
msgid "I should check the personal floater before taking the boat out."
msgstr "出海前得检查好个人漂浮装置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOTATIONCUSHION.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the mosquito sack to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了蚊子血囊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I nearly stepped on it. A little colour right by my boot."
msgstr "差点就踩着了，靴边一点亮色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave this bloom for the butterflies."
msgstr "这朵我留给蝴蝶吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.1"
msgid "I like the red right at the tips of the petals."
msgstr "我喜欢花瓣边缘的那点红。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER.ROSE.2"
msgid "I'll mind the thorns while I admire it."
msgstr "赏花的时候得当心刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the garland."
msgstr "不知道花环会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the petals if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.1"
msgid "I'd never have thought to serve those petals on a plate."
msgstr "我以前没想到花瓣还能这样上桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWERSALAD.2"
msgid "A dish that looks lovely even before the dressing goes on."
msgstr "还没浇酱汁，光看就很漂亮了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the light flower changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时荧光花会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.1"
msgid "I want to look at the withered light flower in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看枯萎的荧光花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_CAVE_WITHERED.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the evil flower grows."
msgstr "我要记住邪恶花长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_EVIL.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.1"
msgid "I want to look at the withered flower in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看枯萎的花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FLOWER_WITHERED.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the foliage to share."
msgstr "希望蕨叶够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the slimy turf."
msgstr "要做黏滑地皮，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried foliage wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干蕨叶包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOLIAGE_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜欢能塞进袖兜里的口粮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the football helmet with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下橄榄球头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOOTBALLHAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the pig skin went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了猪皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.1"
msgid "I could smell the forget-me-lots from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了必忘我的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the ghastly experience with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做恐怖经历就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the dried forget-me-lots along without a bowl."
msgstr "带上干必忘我就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORGETMELOTS_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜欢能塞进袖兜里的口粮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the formal costume pattern flat in my pack."
msgstr "我把正式礼服款式平平整整地收进包里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FORMAL_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "One careful read now will save mistakes later."
msgstr "现在认真读一遍，等会儿就少出错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.1"
msgid "I'll try to find where the fossil fragments fits."
msgstr "我想找出化石碎片该装在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_PIECE.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.1"
msgid "Every bone finally has its place."
msgstr "每根骨头终于都归了位。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.COMPLETE.2"
msgid "It looks rather different standing at full height."
msgstr "全部立起来，看着真不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.1"
msgid "I've put a bone in the wrong place, haven't I?"
msgstr "是不是有根骨头装错了？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.FUNNY.2"
msgid "That doesn't look like a comfortable way to stand."
msgstr "照这个姿势站着，可真够难受的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the odd skeleton."
msgstr "得记住回到奇异的骨架这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FOSSIL_STALKER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.1"
msgid "You look as though someone put you back together."
msgstr "你看起来像是被人重新拼起来过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRANKEN_PIG.2"
msgid "I'll stay where you can see me."
msgstr "我会待在你能看见我的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the fresh fruit crepes."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给鲜果可丽饼配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRESHFRUITCREPES.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.1"
msgid "I'd watch the friendly fruit fly from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看友好果蝇就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRIENDLYFRUITFLY.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see its throat puff up before it croaks."
msgstr "它一开口，喉咙就先鼓起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Keep your tongue out of my pockets, please."
msgstr "请别把舌头伸进我的口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the frog, please."
msgstr "经过青蛙时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROG.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.1"
msgid "Could we take the fish cordon bleu on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着蓝带鱼排吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGFISHBOWL.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the froggle bunwich to share."
msgstr "希望蛙腿三明治够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGGLEBUNWICH.2"
msgid "I remember putting the frog legs in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了蛙腿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.1"
msgid "Could we take the frog legs on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着蛙腿吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the phobic experiment with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做恐惧实验就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the cooked frog legs before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见熟蛙腿，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGLEGS_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.1"
msgid "I'd save the figgy frogwich for after practice."
msgstr "我想把无花果蛙腿三明治留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROGNEWTON.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.1"
msgid "Could we take the frozen banana daiquiri on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着冰香蕉冻唇蜜吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FROZENBANANADAIQUIRI.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the saladmander from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察沙拉蝾螈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1"
msgid "That fruit has come into its colour."
msgstr "果子已经长出了熟透的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2"
msgid "It's time to bring a basket."
msgstr "该拿个篮子来收了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the saladmander, please."
msgstr "经过沙拉蝾螈时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.1"
msgid "I don't think the fruit fly has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得果蝇一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLY.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the friendly fruit fly fruit in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给友好果蝇果腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITFLYFRUIT.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the fruit medley to share."
msgstr "希望水果圣代够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FRUITMEDLEY.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The ardent axe takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "炽热斧的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLEAXE.GENERIC.2"
