msgstr "只剩一丝余温。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.WARM.2"
msgid "Still warm against my palm."
msgstr "贴近手心还有暖意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the fur tuft to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把毛丛带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FURTUFT.2"
msgid "I should save some for the thick fur."
msgstr "我该给熊皮留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.1"
msgid "I don't think the fused shadeling has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得熔合暗影一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.1"
msgid "I'd watch the dread mite from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看绝望螨就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.FUSED_SHADELING_BOMB.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.1"
msgid "I can hear the suspicious moonrock moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到可疑的月岩就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_HOUND.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the suspicious moonrock in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的可疑的月岩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARGOYLE_WEREPIG.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the garlic aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点大蒜给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the eets with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做一吃就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the roasted garlic."
msgstr "吃烤大蒜我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Who'll help me carry the giant garlic back to camp?"
msgstr "谁来帮我把巨型大蒜搬回营地？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the seed pods in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把种子荚收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GARLIC_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.1"
msgid "I could smell the asparagazpacho from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了芦笋冷汤的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GAZPACHO.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.1"
msgid "Someone filed each of these teeth to fit another wheel."
msgstr "有人把每个齿都锉得能咬合另一只轮子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEARS.2"
msgid "I like the little click when the teeth meet."
msgstr "我喜欢齿轮咬合时那一声轻响。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the icker from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察恶液。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.1"
msgid "Give me your hand if you can!"
msgstr "够得到就把手给我！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_CHARACTER.2"
msgid "There's someone inside that slime!"
msgstr "黏液里困着人！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "I can just make out something through the slime."
msgstr "隔着黏液，隐约能看见里面的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I hope that can still be cleaned up."
msgstr "希望取出来以后还洗得干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the icker jar to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把恶液罐带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_BOTTLE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the icker preserve kit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做恶液储存箱套件就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.1"
msgid "It looks rather crowded inside the icker preserve."
msgstr "恶液储存箱里面看着挺挤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.FULL.2"
msgid "I'll wait until there's room."
msgstr "我等空出位置再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the icker preserve in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的恶液储存箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the icker preserve kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放恶液储存箱套件够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GELBLOB_STORAGE_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.1"
msgid "I'll have to find the right piece for the gem stand."
msgstr "我得给宝石底座找件合适的配件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.GEMS.2"
msgid "Something of the right shape should fit there."
msgstr "那个位置得放形状对得上的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the gem stand."
msgstr "宝石底座的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GEMSOCKET.VALID.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GENERIC_CORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Quick, give it room!"
msgstr "快退开！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.1"
msgid "I don't think the gestalt has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得虚影一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.1"
msgid "There's no space left in the phasmo-encapsulator."
msgstr "幻灵捕获机里面已经没位置了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.FILLED.2"
msgid "I'll leave what's in there alone for now."
msgstr "里面的东西暂时先不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the phasmo-encapsulator before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂幻灵捕获机的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_CAGE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the thulecite bug net went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了铥矿捕虫网。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.1"
msgid "I'd watch the greater gestalt from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看大虚影就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.1"
msgid "I'd watch the inimical gestalt from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看敌意虚影就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GESTALT_GUARD_EVOLVED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.1"
msgid "Look, the ghost has noticed us."
msgstr "看，幽灵注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.1"
msgid "I can see the colour through my fingers when I hold it up."
msgstr "举起来看，能隔着指间看见它的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWER.2"
msgid "Wendy might know why these petals are so pale."
msgstr "温蒂也许知道这花瓣为什么这么淡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the wraith's wreath."
msgstr "不知道幽魂花冠会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTFLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the nightshade nostrum."
msgstr "温蒂清楚夜影万金油该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_ATTACK.2"
msgid "Her sister can make use of things I can't."
msgstr "有些东西我用不上，她姐姐却用得着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the spectral cure-all."
msgstr "温蒂清楚灵魂万灵药该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_FASTREGEN.2"
msgid "I can see where the telltale heart went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了告密的心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the luminous wrath."
msgstr "温蒂清楚光之怒该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_LUNAR.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bottle upright for them."
msgstr "我帮她们把瓶子拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the distilled vengeance."
msgstr "温蒂清楚蒸馏复仇该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_RETALIATION.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bottle upright for them."
msgstr "我帮她们把瓶子拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the ghastly experience."
msgstr "温蒂清楚恐怖经历该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_REVIVE.2"
msgid "I'll carry the bottle upright for them."
msgstr "我帮她们把瓶子拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I'd ask Wendy before I gave Abigail the cursed vexation."
msgstr "给阿比盖尔用诅咒之苦之前，我会先问问温蒂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHADOW.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the pure horror to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了纯粹恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.1"
msgid "I'd ask Wendy before I gave Abigail the unyielding draught."
msgstr "给阿比盖尔用不屈药剂之前，我会先问问温蒂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SHIELD.2"
msgid "Her sister can make use of things I can't."
msgstr "有些东西我用不上，她姐姐却用得着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.1"
msgid "Wendy knows the measure for the revenant restorative."
msgstr "温蒂清楚亡者补药该用多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SLOWREGEN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the spider gland to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了蜘蛛腺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.1"
msgid "I'd ask Wendy before I gave Abigail the vigor mortis."
msgstr "给阿比盖尔用强健精油之前，我会先问问温蒂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOSTLYELIXIR_SPEED.2"
msgid "I can see where the mourning glory went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了哀悼荣耀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.1"
msgid "Rest now. There's nothing more to fear."
msgstr "安息吧，已经没什么可怕的了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GHOST_KILL.2"
msgid "May you find your way home."
msgstr "愿你找到回家的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the gift."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对礼物了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFT.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.1"
msgid "Is there room in the gift wrap for our spare supplies?"
msgstr "礼物包装里还能装下备用物资吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GIFTWRAP.2"
msgid "I can see where the papyrus went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.1"
msgid "I'd approach the gingerbread pig house quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近姜饼猪屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADHOUSE.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the gingerbread pig from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察姜饼猪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADPIG.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.1"
msgid "I'd watch the gingerbread varg from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看姜饼座狼就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GINGERBREADWARG.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.1"
msgid "I'd set the glass castle beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把玻璃城堡放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSBLOCK.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.1"
msgid "My grip on the glass cutter feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住玻璃刀的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSCUTTER.2"
msgid "I can see where the moon shard went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了月亮碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the glass spike in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给玻璃尖刺腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLASSSPIKE.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the glommer from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察格罗姆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I can see the glommer breathing."
msgstr "轻点，能看见格罗姆呼吸的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "It's found a good place to rest."
msgstr "它找了个休息的好地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.DEAD.2"
msgid "It's over. We can lower our guard."
msgstr "结束了，可以放松些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder if Glommer can smell this from far away."
msgstr "不知格罗姆隔多远能闻到这花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFLOWER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it where its little friend can find it."
msgstr "我把花放在它的小伙伴找得到的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.1"
msgid "Could we take the glommer's goop on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着格罗姆的黏液吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERFUEL.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the glomglom."
msgstr "要做小格罗姆，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the glommer's wings to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把格罗姆翅膀带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOMMERWINGS.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.1"
msgid "Could we take the glow berry mousse on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着发光浆果慕斯吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GLOWBERRYMOUSSE.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.1"
msgid "It must feel strange without that horn."
msgstr "少了那只角，想必很不习惯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN.2"
msgid "There's a rough edge where the horn broke."
msgstr "断角处的边缘都还不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.BROKENHORN_FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the gnarwail before it moves again."
msgstr "趁一角鲸没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the gnarwail horn."
msgstr "不知一角鲸的角能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GNARWAIL_HORN.2"
msgid "The texture isn't what I expected."
msgstr "摸起来和我想的不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the electric milk aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点带电的羊奶给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOATMILK.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the electrification circuit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做电气化电路就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "Would the fashion goggles leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着时髦的护目镜还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the luxury axe before taking it out."
msgstr "带黄金斧头出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENAXE.2"
msgid "My teacher always checked the fittings first."
msgstr "老师总会先检查装具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.1"
msgid "The opulent pickaxe takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "黄金鹤嘴锄的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPICKAXE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the pick/axe with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做多用斧镐就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.1"
msgid "I'd put the snazzy pitchfork within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把黄金干草叉放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENPITCHFORK.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.1"
msgid "I'll keep the regal shovel where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把黄金铲子放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDENSHOVEL.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.1"
msgid "My grip on the splendid garden hoe feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住黄金园艺锄的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDEN_FARM_HOE.2"
msgid "I can see where the twigs went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.1"
msgid "A glint in the dust. Good thing I looked twice."
msgstr "尘土里有点亮光，还好我多看了一眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOLDNUGGET.2"
msgid "A single nugget feels so heavy in my palm."
msgstr "就这么一块，落在手心里也很沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.1"
msgid "I'd like to keep the down feather between two dry pages."
msgstr "我想把麋鹿鹅羽毛夹在两页干纸之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GOOSE_FEATHER.2"
msgid "I should save some for the warrior's reprise."
msgstr "我该给战士重奏留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.1"
msgid "I should tend to the grass before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BARREN.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the grass!"
msgstr "火快把草吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the grass."
msgstr "草表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the grass."
msgstr "草表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.DISEASING.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd cut a handful and leave the roots to grow."
msgstr "我剪一把草，留下根接着长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A day in the sun and that'll twist into good rope."
msgstr "晒上一天，就能搓成好绳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the grass time to grow back."
msgstr "得给草些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "这时候还是别动根了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the grass before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.1"
msgid "Look, the grass gator has noticed us."
msgstr "看，草鳄鱼注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGATOR.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the grass gekko."
msgstr "碰草壁虎还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.DISEASED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Where would I find the grass gekko after dark?"
msgstr "不知道草壁虎天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASSGEKKO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "I'd set the pretty parasol beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把花伞放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRASS_UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut grass if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采下的草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the spirit vessel."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对灵魂容器了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the broken shell if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些外壳碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.1"
msgid "I'll leave a quiet moment for whoever rests here."
msgstr "我想安静待一会儿，陪陪长眠在这里的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVEURN.HAS_SPIRIT.2"
msgid "Someone has made a home for a wandering soul."
msgstr "有人给漂泊的灵魂留了个安身处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.1"
msgid "I'd set the good gravy beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把好肉汁放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GRAVY.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the marks on the construction amulet up close."
msgstr "我想贴近看清建造护符上的纹路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENAMULET.2"
msgid "Perhaps I should ask about it before I put it on."
msgstr "佩戴前还是先问问来历好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the green gem."
msgstr "照点光就能看清绿宝石的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENGEM.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the green moonlens."
msgstr "绿色月眼深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENMOONEYE.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the deconstruction staff."
msgstr "我想掂一下拆解魔杖的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREENSTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the nightmare fuel if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些噩梦燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.1"
msgid "I can recognize the cap. Knowing when to eat it is another matter."
msgstr "我认得这菇帽，什么时候吃倒得再想想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP.2"
msgid "I'd ask about this mushroom before it went into the pot."
msgstr "这朵蘑菇下锅前，我想先问清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the cooked green cap."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份熟绿蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The cap is quite firm at the edges."
msgstr "菇帽的边缘还很挺实。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll mark the patch. It might be worth coming back."
msgstr "我给这片地方做个记号，以后再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the green mushroom is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出绿蘑菇藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the green mushroom today."
msgstr "今天从绿蘑菇上已经摘不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GREEN_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the vitreoasis."
msgstr "从玻璃绿洲回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_BIG.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the small vitreoasis."
msgstr "从小玻璃绿洲回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GROTTO_POOL_SMALL.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the guacamole to share."
msgstr "希望鳄梨酱够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUACAMOLE.2"
msgid "I might try a little more moleworm next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些鼹鼠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the guano."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对鸟粪了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUANO.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the guano turf."
msgstr "要做鸟粪地皮，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.1"
msgid "I'd set the gunpowder beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把火药放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.GUNPOWDER.2"
msgid "I should save some for the kablooies."
msgstr "我该给轰轰弹留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the candy apple."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝糖果苹果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_1.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the tentacle lolli on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些触手棒棒糖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_10.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.1"
msgid "Would you share the choco pigs with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份巧克力猪吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_11.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the candy lice on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些糖果虱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_12.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the otherworldly jawbreaker."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝无敌硬糖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_13.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the lava pepper."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝熔岩椒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_14.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the candy corn."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝糖果玉米。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_2.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the not-so-candy corn on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些不太甜的玉米。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HALLOWEENCANDY_3.2
