msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.1"
msgid "I can hear the ham bat moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到火腿棒就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMBAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the pig skin if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些猪皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.1"
msgid "A light tap tells me whether the joint is loose."
msgstr "轻轻敲一下，就知道接缝松没松。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER.2"
msgid "I'll take things apart from the top down."
msgstr "拆的时候我会从上往下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the forging hammer to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把锻锤带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAMMER_MJOLNIR.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the beefalo wool pillow."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛毛枕头的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL.2"
msgid "One round, then I want somewhere soft to sit."
msgstr "打一轮我就想找个软地方坐下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the kelp-stuffed pillow."
msgstr "海带枕头的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_KELP.2"
msgid "I'd check the seam before the first swing."
msgstr "挥第一下之前得先看看缝线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.1"
msgid "Someone chose an interesting filling for the flowery pillow."
msgstr "花朵枕头的填料选得真有意思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_PETALS.2"
msgid "One round, then I want somewhere soft to sit."
msgstr "打一轮我就想找个软地方坐下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "I wouldn't mind trying the steel wool pillow in a pillow match."
msgstr "枕头赛我想试试钢丝绵枕头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HANDPILLOW_STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.1"
msgid "Give me a quiet moment before we speak of this."
msgstr "说起它之前，让我安静一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HARAKIRI.2"
msgid "I would rather bring everyone home alive."
msgstr "我更想带大家平安回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.1"
msgid "I could smell the hare ball from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了兔毛球的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAREBALL.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see myself in the floral shirt before we leave."
msgstr "出发前我想看看自己穿戴花衬衫的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HAWAIIANSHIRT.2"
msgid "I can see where the silk went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE.1"
