msgid "I'll have to set aside the marble if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些大理石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the thermal balm back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把避火膏带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSALVE_FUMAROLE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the flint to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the living staff before taking it out."
msgstr "带生命魔杖出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEALINGSTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD.2"
msgid "That chill went straight to my fingers."
msgstr "寒意直往指尖钻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.FROZEN.2"
msgid "I can feel the frost through the wrapping."
msgstr "隔着包裹也摸得出冰霜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can keep it close to my ribs under my coat."
msgstr "我可以把它放在外衣里面贴着身子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll check the temperature before I tuck it in."
msgstr "得先试试温度再往怀里塞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT.2"
msgid "Much too hot for my bare hands."
msgstr "光着手碰太烫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.WARM.2"
msgid "Still warm against my palm."
msgstr "贴近手心还有暖意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.1"
msgid "I'll watch the briar wolf without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动蔷薇狼，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the briar grows."
msgstr "我要记住蔷薇长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HEDGEHOUND_BUSH.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.1"
msgid "I can see the crabby hermit through the water."
msgstr "隔着水也看得见寄居蟹隐士。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光线变化真大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the fire nettle tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝火荨麻茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FIRENETTLES.2"
msgid "I'll wait for the leaves to settle first."
msgstr "等茶叶沉下去再喝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the foliage tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝蕨叶茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FOLIAGE.2"
msgid "I brought enough cups to share."
msgstr "我带的杯子够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the forget-me-lots tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝必忘我茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_FORGETMELOTS.2"
msgid "I'll wait for the leaves to settle first."
msgstr "等茶叶沉下去再喝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "I should ask how long to steep the lune tree blossom tea."
msgstr "得问问月树花茶泡多久合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "I brought enough cups to share."
msgstr "我带的杯子够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the petal tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝花瓣茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS.2"
msgid "I brought enough cups to share."
msgstr "我带的杯子够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.1"
msgid "I should ask how long to steep the dark petal tea."
msgstr "得问问深色花瓣茶泡多久合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_PETALS_EVIL.2"
msgid "I brought enough cups to share."
msgstr "我带的杯子够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the succulent tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝多肉茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_SUCCULENT_PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll wait for the leaves to settle first."
msgstr "等茶叶沉下去再喝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.1"
msgid "I'd like to sit down with the tillweed tea when my hands are warm."
msgstr "手暖和些就想坐下来喝犁地草茶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRABTEA_TILLWEED.2"
msgid "I'll wait for the leaves to settle first."
msgstr "等茶叶沉下去再喝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Nobody seems to be tending it now."
msgstr "看来暂时没人照看了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "I wonder when someone last came this way."
msgstr "不知道上次有人来是什么时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like the pearl's light post near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让珍珠的灯柱靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the pearl's light post kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开珍珠的灯柱套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_LIGHTPOST_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the hermit rehomer before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开隐士迁居套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATION_KIT.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the portage conch."
msgstr "不知搬运海螺能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_SHELL.2"
msgid "There's no reason to let good material go to waste."
msgstr "好材料没理由白白浪费。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "There. the pearl's tea shop is working."
msgstr "好了，珍珠的茶店开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.1"
msgid "I can wait. Rushing the pearl's tea shop won't help."
msgstr "我等得起，催珍珠的茶店也没用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BREWING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when that smell gets a little stronger."
msgstr "等香气再浓一点，我就回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the pearl's tea shop."
msgstr "珍珠的茶店烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the pearl's tea shop again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看珍珠的茶店。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITCRAB_TEASHOP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.1"
msgid "The water's fizzing all along the edge."
msgstr "水边冒了一圈细泡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.BOMBED.2"
msgid "That ought to make a lovely bath."
msgstr "用这样的水泡澡应该很舒服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Room to spare in the pearl's hot spring."
msgstr "珍珠的温泉里面还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the pearl's hot spring."
msgstr "从珍珠的温泉回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.1"
msgid "I can see where the sides of the bath will go."
msgstr "能看出池壁要砌在哪里了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOTSPRING_CONSTR.2"
msgid "We'll have earned a soak when we finish the work."
msgstr "等干完活，我们也该好好泡个澡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.1"
msgid "It looks much more like a home now."
msgstr "现在更像一处能安心住下的家了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.BUILTUP.2"
msgid "I'm glad we could leave her somewhere comfortable."
msgstr "能让她住得舒服些，我很高兴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the hermit home quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近隐士之家时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at it today."
msgstr "不知道今天它里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_LAUNDRY.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the wind charm today."
msgstr "不知道今天风铃里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMITHOUSE_ORNAMENT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the broken shell if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些外壳碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the bundle of thanks out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到一包谢意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.1"
msgid "I can hear the shells knocking together inside."
msgstr "听得见里面的贝壳相碰。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_BUNDLE_SHELLS.2"
msgid "Pearl tied this bundle very neatly."
msgstr "珍珠把这包东西扎得真整齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the cracked pearl to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把开裂珍珠带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_CRACKED_PEARL.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the pearl's pearl to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把珍珠的珍珠带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HERMIT_PEARL.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.1"
msgid "My hand tightens on its own. Time to let go."
msgstr "手指不知不觉攥紧了。该松手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HITOKIRI.2"
msgid "I don't like who I become holding this."
msgstr "我不喜欢自己握着它时的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.1"
msgid "You can hear the bee queen crown long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到蜂王冠跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HIVEHAT.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.1"
msgid "I can see the grain in the metal."
msgstr "能看见金属里的纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HMINGOT.2"
msgid "I'll set a piece aside for the smithy."
msgstr "我留一块给锻造用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.1"
msgid "Someone has a place to sleep here."
msgstr "这里有人安睡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOME.2"
msgid "I'll wait outside instead of waking the whole household."
msgstr "我在外面等，省得吵醒住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the sign before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到木牌旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "We'll be able to find our way back by the sign."
msgstr "回来的时候可以凭木牌认路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It would help to mark the path before dark."
msgstr "天黑前把路标好会方便很多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.1"
msgid "There's room for a drawing on the sign."
msgstr "木牌上还能添一幅画。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOMESIGN.UNWRITTEN.2"
msgid "I should decide what to put here before I start."
msgstr "落笔前得先想好画什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.1"
msgid "That last thread of honey never wants to let go of the spoon."
msgstr "勺子上最后那丝蜂蜜，总也滴不干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEY.2"
msgid "A spoonful in hot tea would be lovely."
msgstr "热茶里调上一勺刚刚好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.1"
msgid "I'd set the honeycomb beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把蜜脾放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYCOMB.2"
msgid "I should save some for the beeswax."
msgstr "我该给蜂蜡留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the honey ham after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃蜜汁火腿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYHAM.2"
msgid "I can taste the honey in every bite."
msgstr "每口都能尝出蜂蜜的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.1"
msgid "Could we take the honey nuggets on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着蜜汁卤肉吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS.2"
msgid "I might try a little more honey next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.1"
msgid "I'll keep the beefalo horn apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "牛角得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORN.2"
msgid "I'll clean it before I take it back."
msgstr "带回去以前要清理一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the pure horror in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给纯粹恐惧腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORRORFUEL.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the nightmare saddle with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做梦魇鞍具就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the lucky horseshoe back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把幸运马蹄铁带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HORSESHOE.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.1"
msgid "I'll save the spicy chili for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "辣椒炖肉要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTCHILI.2"
msgid "I might try a little more meat next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.1"
msgid "The water's fizzing all along the edge."
msgstr "水边冒了一圈细泡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.BOMBED.2"
msgid "That ought to make a lovely bath."
msgstr "用这样的水泡澡应该很舒服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the hot spring at the moment."
msgstr "温泉里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the hot spring by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清温泉，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.1"
msgid "The surface has set hard and smooth."
msgstr "表面已经凝固得又硬又光滑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOTSPRING.GLASS.2"
msgid "I can see a faint reflection in it."
msgstr "能在上面看见一点倒影。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.1"
msgid "There's a fresh set of teeth I could do without meeting."
msgstr "我可不想去认识那一口新牙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUND.2"
msgid "That bark carries much farther than my voice."
msgstr "它那声吠叫传得比我的声音远多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.1"
msgid "I'll watch the bones without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动犬骨，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of it!"
msgstr "离着火的它远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.1"
msgid "I can hear the hound mound moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到猎犬丘就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDMOUND.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.1"
msgid "I'd give the hound's tooth room to turn."
msgstr "得给犬牙留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.1"
msgid "I can just make out the howlitzer from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见嚎弹炮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDSTOOTH_BLOWPIPE.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.1"
msgid "I'll watch the lucky whistle without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动幸运哨子，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDWHISTLE.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.1"
msgid "Someone had a name once. Put that down."
msgstr "这曾是个有名字的人。放下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT.2"
msgid "Please keep that well away from our supper."
msgstr "请把它从饭桌上拿走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone had a name once. Put that down."
msgstr "这曾是个有名字的人。放下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Please keep that well away from our supper."
msgstr "请把它从饭桌上拿走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "Someone had a name once. Put that down."
msgstr "这曾是个有名字的人。放下吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUMANMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Please keep that well away from our supper."
msgstr "请把它从饭桌上拿走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at Hutch today."
msgstr "不知道今天哈奇里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the star-sky quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近星空时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.1"
msgid "Nothing stirring in there. I'll give it time."
msgstr "里面静了下来，我再等一等。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.HUTCH_FISHBOWL.WAITING.2"
msgid "I hope my little friend comes back."
msgstr "希望我的小伙伴还会回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.1"
msgid "It's already dripping through my fingers."
msgstr "它已经开始从指缝滴水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE.2"
msgid "I'll carry it in a bowl and save every drop."
msgstr "我拿碗装，化掉的水也能留下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Look how low it sits in the water."
msgstr "看它在水里沉得多深。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll give the ice plenty of room when we sail round."
msgstr "船绕过去的时候，我会离冰远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.1"
msgid "The ice is all water now."
msgstr "冰已经全化成水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG.MELTED.2"
msgid "We'll have to wait for the cold to return."
msgstr "得等天气重新冷下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.1"
msgid "The ice is all water now."
msgstr "冰已经全化成水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBERG_MELTED.2"
msgid "We'll have to wait for the cold to return."
msgstr "得等天气重新冷下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.1"
msgid "I'd keep the ice box somewhere we can all reach."
msgstr "冰箱该放到大家都够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEBOX.2"
msgid "I can see where the cut stone went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the ice cream to share."
msgstr "希望冰淇淋够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICECREAM.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.1"
msgid "Would the ice cube leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着冰帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.1"
msgid "I'd give the ice hound room to turn."
msgstr "得给寒冰猎犬留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEHOUND.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the insulated pack."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把保鲜背包里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICEPACK.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留个不会压到眼镜的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.1"
msgid "There are tiny ice crystals on the head."
msgstr "杖头上结了一层细小的冰晶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the cold end before I carry it."
msgstr "得先把冰冷的那一端包好再带走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.1"
msgid "There are tiny ice crystals on the head."
msgstr "杖头上结了一层细小的冰晶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF2.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the cold end before I carry it."
msgstr "得先把冰冷的那一端包好再带走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.1"
msgid "There are tiny ice crystals on the head."
msgstr "杖头上结了一层细小的冰晶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICESTAFF3.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the cold end before I carry it."
msgstr "得先把冰冷的那一端包好再带走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the frostbitten costume pattern flat in my pack."
msgstr "我把寒霜礼服款式平平整整地收进包里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ICE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I'll trace the outline before I start."
msgstr "先顺着轮廓看一遍再动手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "There. the obelisk is working."
msgstr "好了，方尖碑开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "All quiet around the obelisk for the moment."
msgstr "方尖碑这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the inspectacles."
msgstr "不知道检查专用镜会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTACLESHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.1"
msgid "Glasses, hair tie, sword. All here."
msgstr "眼镜、发绳、刀。都在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.INSPECTSELF.2"
msgid "There's a little dirt on my sleeve, but I'm quite well."
msgstr "袖子上蹭了点泥，别的都还好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.1"
msgid "Could we take the syrup of ipecaca on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着泻根糖浆吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IPECACSYRUP.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rot to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了腐烂物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the binding roots."
msgstr "得记住回到缠绕根须这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.IVY_SNARE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.1"
msgid "Could we take the fist full of jam on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着果酱吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JAMMYPRESERVES.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.1"
msgid "Could we take the jellybeans on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着彩虹糖豆吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JELLYBEAN.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the junk pile in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的垃圾堆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "Something on paper between those scraps!"
msgstr "那些废料里夹着一张纸！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I'd like to look at the plans before the ink fades."
msgstr "趁字迹还清楚，我想看看那张图纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the teetering junk pile looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，摇摇欲坠的垃圾堆是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUNK_PILE_BIG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the plain omelette."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给普通煎蛋配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.JUSTEGGS.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the kabobs."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给肉串配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KABOBS.2"
msgid "I might try a little more meat next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.1"
msgid "I traced the last words on its plan twice."
msgstr "图纸末尾那行字，我用手指描过两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KAGE.2"
msgid "The inscription is easier to read in the shade."
msgstr "在阴凉处反而看得清那行题字。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.1"
msgid "I'll wrap it before I carry it anywhere."
msgstr "得先包好才能带走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABLADE.2"
msgid "The tang still needs a proper hilt."
msgstr "刀茎上还要装个合适的柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.1"
msgid "The binding feels snug under my thumb."
msgstr "拇指按下去，缠绳很紧实。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KATANABODY.2"
msgid "I'd like to check the balance once more."
msgstr "我想再掂掂它的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.1"
msgid "I could smell the kelp fronds from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了海带叶的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP.2"
msgid "I should save some for the seawreath."
msgstr "我该给海花环留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the seawreath."
msgstr "不知道海花环会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELPHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked kelp fronds."
msgstr "吃熟海带叶我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the dried kelp fronds along without a bowl."
msgstr "带上干海带叶就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KELP_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the killer bee from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看杀人蜂就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KILLERBEE.HELD.2"
msgid "It's much smaller this close."
msgstr "拿到跟前显得真小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the king's staff at the moment."
msgstr "国王魔杖里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the king's staff this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把国王魔杖做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KING_CANE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make room so my sleeves don't catch."
msgstr "我让出些地方，免得衣袖被勾住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.1"
msgid "The kittens keep batting at it when it swings."
msgstr "它一晃，小猫们就抬爪子拍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.BURNT.2"
msgid "I could sit here and watch them play for ages."
msgstr "我能坐在这儿看它们玩很久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDECOR1.GENERIC.1"
