msgstr "我能坐在这儿看它们玩很久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the kitcoon nursery before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到小浣猫托儿所旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the kitcoon nursery quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近小浣猫托儿所时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.1"
msgid "Nobody give away the kittens' hiding places."
msgstr "可别说出小猫们躲在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK.2"
msgid "I'll look around the den again."
msgstr "我再绕着窝找一圈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.1"
msgid "Nobody give away the kittens' hiding places."
msgstr "可别说出小猫们躲在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN.PLAYING_HIDEANDSEEK_TIME_ALMOST_UP.2"
msgid "I'll look around the den again."
msgstr "我再绕着窝找一圈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the kitcoon nursery kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放小浣猫托儿所套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOONDEN_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.1"
msgid "There's the kitcoon. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小浣猫。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DECIDUOUS.2"
msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.1"
msgid "I wonder if the kitcoon would follow me home."
msgstr "不知小浣猫愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_DESERT.2"
msgid "I'd leave a warm corner by my bed."
msgstr "床边可以留个暖和的角落。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.1"
msgid "There's the kitcoon. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小浣猫。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_FOREST.2
