msgid "I should find out what it likes to eat."
msgstr "我得打听一下它喜欢吃什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.1"
msgid "I ought to learn the kitten's habits before I choose a name."
msgstr "我想先认清小猫的习性，再给它起名。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_NAMETAG.2"
msgid "I'll write large enough to read when that tail's in motion."
msgstr "字得写大些，尾巴动着的时候也能认清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.1"
msgid "There's the kitcoon. I'll crouch down to say hello."
msgstr "是小浣猫。我蹲下来打个招呼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_ROCKY.2"
msgid "I'd leave a warm corner by my bed."
msgstr "床边可以留个暖和的角落。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.1"
msgid "I wonder if the kitcoon would follow me home."
msgstr "不知小浣猫愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_SAVANNA.2"
msgid "I'd leave a warm corner by my bed."
msgstr "床边可以留个暖和的角落。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.1"
msgid "I wonder if the kitcoon would follow me home."
msgstr "不知小浣猫愿不愿意跟我回家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KITCOON_YOT.2"
msgid "You can come closer, little one."
msgstr "小家伙，可以再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.1"
msgid "That's the klaus up ahead. Stay where we can see each other."
msgstr "前面是克劳斯。大家别走出彼此的视线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.1"
msgid "I'll keep the stag antler in its own pocket."
msgstr "麋鹿茸得单独装一个口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUSSACKKEY.2"
msgid "I won't leave this lying around."
msgstr "这个不能随手乱放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the loot stash."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进赃物袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KLAUS_SACK.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留个不会压到眼镜的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.1"
msgid "I'd watch the clockwork knight from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看发条骑士就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "I'd watch the damaged knight from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看损坏的发条骑士就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.1"
msgid "You've already got someone to follow."
msgstr "你已经有要跟的人了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.FOLLOWING_OTHER.2"
msgid "I won't get between you two."
msgstr "我就不挡在你们中间了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I don't often meet a knight with a gait like that."
msgstr "这么走路的骑士，我可不常遇见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KNIGHT_YOTH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Shall we try a ceremonial bow?"
msgstr "要不要依礼互相鞠个躬？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_CARCASS.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.1"
msgid "I'd give the koalefant a little room to pass."
msgstr "我给考拉象让一点路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_SUMMER.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the koalefant before it moves again."
msgstr "趁考拉象没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFANT_WINTER.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the fig-stuffed trunk."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给无花果酿象鼻配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOALEFIG_TRUNK.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.1"
msgid "Everything sits snugly, from guard to pommel."
msgstr "从刀镡到柄头，每处都装得很牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KOSHIRAE.2"
msgid "I tied the cord myself. It had better hold."
msgstr "柄绳是我亲手缠的，可得结实些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the krampus from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察坎普斯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the krampus sack."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进坎普斯背包。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.KRAMPUS_SACK.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd set the lantern beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把提灯放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LANTERN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rope to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了绳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the latkes to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把土豆饼带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LATKES.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.1"
msgid "I could wear the steadfast stone armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层坚固的石质护甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOREXTRAHEAVY.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the stone splint mail."
msgstr "我想试试穿上石头板条甲还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the reed tunic."
msgstr "我想试试穿上芦苇外衣还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the feathered reed tunic before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过羽饰芦苇外衣合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.1"
msgid "I could wear the wood armor over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层木质护甲。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the jagged wood armor before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过锯齿木甲合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the silken wood armor before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过丝带木甲合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in it."
msgstr "我想试试穿上它还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP.2"
msgid "I can mend a small tear before it gets worse."
msgstr "小破口要趁还没扯大时补好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the battle standard."
msgstr "我标一下发现战旗的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the bernie."
msgstr "得记住回到伯尼这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the battlemaster pugna again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看战斗大师普格纳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the resplendent nox helm with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下华丽的司夜女神头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the magma golem in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的岩浆傀儡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the clairvoyant crown."
msgstr "不知道洞察皇冠会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.1"
msgid "Would the feathered wreath leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着羽毛头环还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.1"
msgid "I'd bring the hearthsfire crystals back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把炉火晶石带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the flower headband with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下花饰头带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.1"
msgid "Would the blossomed wreath leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着绽放花环还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the blacksmith's edge out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到铁匠的刀刃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.1"
msgid "I can see where the piece is supposed to fit."
msgstr "看得出这件东西该嵌在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE.2"
msgid "The opening is shaped quite precisely."
msgstr "开口的形状做得很精确。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.1"
msgid "I can see where the piece is supposed to fit."
msgstr "看得出这件东西该嵌在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL.2"
msgid "The opening is shaped quite precisely."
msgstr "开口的形状做得很精确。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the barbed helm with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下带刺头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.1"
msgid "I'd bring the riled lucy back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把暴怒的露西带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the ancient gateway."
msgstr "从远古大门回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.1"
msgid "There. the ancient gateway is working."
msgstr "好了，远古大门开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the crystal tiara with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下水晶头饰。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the forge portal."
msgstr "得记住回到熔炉传送门这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the nox helm."
msgstr "不知道司夜女神头盔会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the woven garland."
msgstr "不知道编织花环会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the lavae?"
msgstr "岩浆虫平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the chilled lavae out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到冷冻虫卵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the broodling."
msgstr "要做小龙蝇，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping the lavae egg on the way back."
msgstr "带岩浆虫卵回去的时候得拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "壳比看起来的薄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD.2"
msgid "That chill went straight to my fingers."
msgstr "寒意直往指尖钻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.1"
msgid "Something shifted under the shell."
msgstr "壳里的东西动了一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY.2"
msgid "I'll sit quietly and watch for the first crack."
msgstr "我坐着等，看它什么时候啄开第一道缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.1"
msgid "Look how peacefully it's resting."
msgstr "看它待得多安稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT.2"
msgid "You've had a good meal, haven't you?"
msgstr "你已经吃饱了，对吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Where would I find the extra-adorable lavae after dark?"
msgstr "不知道超级可爱岩浆虫天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "I can tell it's been a while since the extra-adorable lavae ate."
msgstr "看得出超级可爱岩浆虫很久没吃东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "One moment, I have food somewhere."
msgstr "等一下，我找找有没有吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.1"
msgid "I can tell it's been a while since the extra-adorable lavae ate."
msgstr "看得出超级可爱岩浆虫很久没吃东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING.2"
msgid "I wouldn't leave a creature hungry if I could help it."
msgstr "能帮得上忙的话，我不想让它挨饿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the lavae tooth to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把岩浆虫尖牙带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL.2"
msgid "Cool enough to go near now."
msgstr "凉下来了，现在能靠近了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT.2"
msgid "Much too hot for my bare hands."
msgstr "光着手碰太烫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.1"
msgid "I'll mark the magma on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下岩浆池。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.1"
msgid "I'll mark the rock on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下岩石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.1"
msgid "I'll save the leafy meatloaf for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "叶肉糕要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF.2"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to try a bite now."
msgstr "我现在就有点想尝一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the leaf pile."
msgstr "得记住回到落叶堆这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFPILE.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.1"
msgid "I'd save the veggie burger for after practice."
msgstr "我想把素食堡留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the jelly salad to share."
msgstr "希望果冻沙拉够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.1"
msgid "That's the treeguard up ahead. Stay where we can see each other."
msgstr "前面是树精守卫。大家别走出彼此的视线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.1"
msgid "That tree just turned to face me."
msgstr "那棵树刚才转过来面对我了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL.2"
msgid "I'll put the axe away and back off slowly."
msgstr "我先收起斧头，慢慢退开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.1"
msgid "That tree just turned to face me."
msgstr "那棵树刚才转过来面对我了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE.2"
msgid "I'll put the axe away and back off slowly."
msgstr "我先收起斧头，慢慢退开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the cave lichen in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的洞穴苔藓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LICHEN.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the booster shot out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到强心针。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR.2"
msgid "I can see where the stinger went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了针刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.1"
msgid "I could smell the light bulb from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了荧光果的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the illumination circuit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做照明电路就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.1"
msgid "A little ripple gave the crustashine away."
msgstr "一点水纹暴露了发光蟹的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光线变化真大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the willow's lighter this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把薇洛的打火机做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.1"
msgid "I'd watch the bulbous lightbug from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看球状光虫就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.1"
msgid "There's a full charge in the volt goat now."
msgstr "伏特羊里的电已经充足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED.2"
msgid "I can feel the fine hairs on my arm lift."
msgstr "胳膊上的汗毛都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd give the volt goat room to turn."
msgstr "得给伏特羊留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the volt goat horn."
msgstr "不知伏特羊角能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN.2"
msgid "I'll clean it before I take it back."
msgstr "带回去以前要清理一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.1"
msgid "There's a full charge in the lightning rod now."
msgstr "避雷针里的电已经充足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED.2"
msgid "I can feel the fine hairs on my arm lift."
msgstr "胳膊上的汗毛都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the lightning rod."
msgstr "我标一下发现避雷针的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.1"
msgid "Where would I find the wee mactusk after dark?"
msgstr "不知道小海象天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.1"
msgid "I could use the living log back at the workbench."
msgstr "工作台上也许用得着活木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the dark sword."
msgstr "要做暗夜剑，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the totally normal tree grows."
msgstr "我要记住完全正常的树长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.1"
msgid "I want to look at the totally normal root in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看完全正常的树根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the totally normal sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合完全正常的树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "给根边培些土会好一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.1"
msgid "I'll save the lobster bisque for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "龙虾汤要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the lobster dinner differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给龙虾正餐调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER.2"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to try a bite now."
msgstr "我现在就有点想尝一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the log!"
msgstr "离着火的木头远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Good solid wood. I'll keep it off the damp earth."
msgstr "好结实的木头，得垫高些免得受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can count the years across that cut."
msgstr "沿着断面能数出它长了多少年。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the lord of the fruit flies fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是果蝇王。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY.2"
msgid "Nobody wander off alone, please."
msgstr "请别独自走远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the lost marbles to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把遗失的玻璃球拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.1"
msgid "Someone must have been fond of the missing teeth."
msgstr "一定曾有人很喜欢缺少的牙齿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_10.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.1"
msgid "Someone must have been fond of the cherished toy robot."
msgstr "一定曾有人很喜欢珍贵的玩具机器人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_11.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.1"
msgid "Someone must have been fond of the mother's favorite teacup."
msgstr "一定曾有人很喜欢妈妈最爱的茶杯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_14.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.1"
msgid "Someone must have been fond of the treasured toy trojan horse."
msgstr "一定曾有人很喜欢宝贵的玩具木马。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_18.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the favorite spinning top to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把最爱的陀螺拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_19.2"
msgid "It looks well handled. That usually means well loved."
msgstr "表面都摸旧了，想必很受喜爱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.1"
msgid "Someone must have been fond of the sentimental kazoo."
msgstr "一定曾有人很喜欢多愁善感的卡祖笛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_2.2"
msgid "It looks well handled. That usually means well loved."
msgstr "表面都摸旧了，想必很受喜爱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the misplaced toy cobra to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把装错的玩具眼镜蛇拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_42.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the beloved crocodile toy to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把宠爱的鳄鱼玩具拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_43.2"
msgid "It looks well handled. That usually means well loved."
msgstr "表面都摸旧了，想必很受喜爱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the prized ball and cup to the children at camp."
msgstr "我想把珍视的抽线陀螺拿给营地里的孩子们看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_7.2"
msgid "I'd keep it somewhere small hands can reach."
msgstr "我会放在小孩子够得着的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.1"
msgid "I'll keep the lucky gold nugget dry on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上别让幸运金块受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCKY_GOLDNUGGET.2"
msgid "I should save some for the claw anchor kit."
msgstr "我该给巨爪船锚套装留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the lucy the axe this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把露西斧做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUCY.2"
msgid "I should save some for the wooden walking stick."
msgstr "我该给木手杖留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the lumpy sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合臃肿树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUMPY_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.1"
msgid "I'd give the bright-eyed frog room to turn."
msgstr "得给明眼青蛙留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARFROG.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the brightshade helm."
msgstr "不知道亮茄头盔会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANTHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the brightshade husk?"
msgstr "上次站在亮茄外壳前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_HUSK.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the brightshade repair kit."
msgstr "要做亮茄修补套件，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the brightshade repair kit."
msgstr "我先给亮茄修补套件腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARPLANT_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to it."
msgstr "得记住回到它这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_CRYSTAL.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the rift on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下裂隙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARRIFT_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the deadly brightshade changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时致命亮茄会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.1"
msgid "That's a searching motion, right at the tip."
msgstr "藤尖在四处试探。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNARTHRALL_PLANT_VINE_END.2"
msgid "I'd rather it didn't find my ankle."
msgstr "最好别让它碰到我的脚踝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the brightsmithy?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用辉煌铁匠铺？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE.2"
msgid "I'd rather check the plan before I start."
msgstr "动手前我想再对一遍图纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the brightsmithy kit."
msgstr "我先给辉煌铁匠铺套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_FORGE_KIT.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.1"
msgid "I wonder what the grazer noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道牧者比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_GRAZER.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the celestial jewel to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把天体珠宝带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUNAR_SEED.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.1"
msgid "Where would I find the lureplant after dark?"
msgstr "不知道食人花天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANT.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.1"
msgid "I'd set the fleshy bulb beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把食人花种子放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUREPLANTBULB.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.1"
msgid "I'd bring the lutefisk back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把苏打鱼带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LUTEFISK.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK.1"
msgid "Takina can find things in here without looking."
msgstr "泷奈伸手进包，连看都不用看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.LYCORIS_BACKPACK.2"
msgid "A pocket for everything. Even my glasses would be safe."
msgstr "每件东西都有位置，连我的眼镜都能收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the mad scientist lab?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用疯狂科学家实验室？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MADSCIENCE_LAB.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut stone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the magician's chest."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把魔术师箱子里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAGICIAN_CHEST.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.1"
msgid "Is the bow straight? It's hard to tell from here."
msgstr "蝴蝶结正了吗？我自己看不清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAID_HB.2"
msgid "That should keep my fringe out of the tea."
msgstr "这样刘海就不会落进茶杯里了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "I don't think the malbatross has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得邪天翁一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the malbatross bill in the hands of someone who knows it."
msgstr "我想看看熟手是怎么用邪天翁喙的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_BEAK.2"
msgid "I should save some for the empty waterfowl can."
msgstr "我该给空鸟嘴壶留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.1"
msgid "I can see every fine strand on the malbatross feather."
msgstr "邪天翁羽毛上的细纹一根根都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHER.2"
msgid "So much colour in something that weighs so little."
msgstr "这么轻的东西，颜色却如此鲜明。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the feathery canvas back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把羽毛帆布带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALBATROSS_FEATHERED_WEAVE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the winged sail kit."
msgstr "要做飞翼风帆套装，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Can you hear me in there?"
msgstr "你在那里听得见我吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MALE_PUPPET.2"
msgid "I wish I could untangle whatever's holding you."
msgstr "真想替你解开那些束缚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the mandrake."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给曼德拉草配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the pan flute with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做排箫就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.1"
msgid "I'll save the mandrake soup for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "曼德拉草汤要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKESOUP.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the mandrake from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察曼德拉草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let it cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "它要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.1"
msgid "I'd remember where that patch grows."
msgstr "我会记住这片植物长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKE_PLANTED.2"
msgid "I want to see how it grows in this soil."
msgstr "我想看看它在这片土里怎么长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.1"
msgid "I'll keep the bunny puff apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "兔绒得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MANRABBIT_TAIL.2"
msgid "I'll clean it before I take it back."
msgstr "带回去以前要清理一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.1"
msgid "I want a quiet moment to look over the map scroll."
msgstr "我想静下来仔细看看地图卷轴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL.2"
msgid "The writing's easier to see in daylight."
msgstr "日光下字迹清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the marble in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给大理石腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the red mosaic flooring."
msgstr "我该给红色马赛克地板留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the marble bean in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给大理石豌豆腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the marble to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了大理石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the marble sprout growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让大理石芽长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEBEAN_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the marble pillar again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看大理石柱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLEPILLAR.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the marble shrub."
msgstr "得记住回到大理石灌木这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLESHRUB.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the marble tree grows."
msgstr "我要记住大理石树长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARBLETREE.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the spiky bush!"
msgstr "火快把尖刺灌木吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the spiky bush but ash."
msgstr "尖刺灌木只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the spiky bush for my notes."
msgstr "我想把尖刺灌木的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the spiky bush today."
msgstr "今天从尖刺灌木上已经摘不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the plant changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时植物会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_PLANT.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the spiky tree!"
msgstr "离着火的针刺树远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the spiky tree."
msgstr "针刺树烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the spiky tree."
msgstr "针刺树的断面还很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the spiky tree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把针刺树的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MARSH_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.1"
msgid "I'd save the creamy potato purée for after practice."
msgstr "我想把奶油土豆泥留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASHEDPOTATOES.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the visionist's mask ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把远见者面具给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_ARCHITECTHAT.2"
msgid "Let's run that scene once before the audience comes in."
msgstr "等观众入场前，先排一遍吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the elytra's mask ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把鞘翅面具给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_HANDMAIDHAT.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the artificer's mask ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把工匠面具给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_ANCIENT_MASONHAT.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the blacksmith mask ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把铁匠面具给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_BLACKSMITHHAT.2"
msgid "Let's run that scene once before the audience comes in."
msgstr "等观众入场前，先排一遍吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the queen's visage from the audience's side."
msgstr "我想从观众席那边看看女王面容。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_CHARLIE_BOSSHAT.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave the cracked doll mask ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把开裂玩偶面具给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASK_DOLLBROKENHAT.2"
msgid "I should check the script before I step onstage."
