#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the mast while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看桅杆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST.2"
