msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the deck illuminator while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看甲板照明灯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_ITEM.2"
