msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时龙蝇灯表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LAMP_YOTD.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.1"
