msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看避雷导线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MASTUPGRADE_LIGHTNINGROD_ITEM.2"
