msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_MALBATROSS.1"
