msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时龙翼桅杆表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAST_YOTD.2"
