msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.1"
msgid "You have our attention, Maxwell. What now?"
msgstr "麦斯威尔，我们在听。接下来呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELL.2"
msgid "I'd like a straight answer from you this time."
msgstr "这次希望你能直接回答我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.1"
msgid "You have our attention, Maxwell. What now?"
msgstr "麦斯威尔，我们在听。接下来呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLHEAD.2"
msgid "I'd like a straight answer from you this time."
msgstr "这次希望你能直接回答我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'd like the maxwell's light near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让麦斯威尔灯靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.1"
msgid "That keyhole looks very particular."
msgstr "这锁孔的形状真特别。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLLOCK.2"
msgid "I wonder who was trusted with the key."
msgstr "不知道钥匙交给了谁保管。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.1"
msgid "The music carries a long way from that horn."
msgstr "声音从那只喇叭里传出去好远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLPHONOGRAPH.2"
msgid "I'd like to know who's choosing the records."
msgstr "不知道是谁在挑唱片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.1"
msgid "I think I'll remain standing, thank you."
msgstr "谢谢，我想还是站着吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MAXWELLTHRONE.2"
msgid "That seat has cost someone dearly."
msgstr "坐过那个位置的人一定付出了很大代价。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.1"
msgid "I'll take this straight to the cookpot."
msgstr "我得把这块肉直接送到锅边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT.2"
msgid "A clean board first, then I can portion it."
msgstr "先备块干净的板，再来分肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.1"
msgid "I'll leave the last meatball for the one who made supper."
msgstr "最后一颗肉丸留给做饭的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATBALLS.2"
msgid "A whole pot of these after practice? Yes, please."
msgstr "练完能吃上一锅这个？那我不客气了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the drying rack but ash."
msgstr "晾肉架只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.1"
msgid "Time to see what the drying rack has for us."
msgstr "该看看晾肉架这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "I think the drying rack is ready now."
msgstr "我看晾肉架这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING.2"
msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
