msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the drying rack looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，晾肉架是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the rope went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了绳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the drying rack before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到晾肉架旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.1"
msgid "I think the drying rack is ready now."
msgstr "我看晾肉架这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "I think the drying rack is ready now."
msgstr "我看晾肉架这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING.2"
msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the drying rack again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看晾肉架。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Nobody seems to be tending it now."
msgstr "看来暂时没人照看了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "I wonder when someone last came this way."
msgstr "不知道上次有人来是什么时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the large drying rack stood."
msgstr "晾肉巨架原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.1"
msgid "I think the large drying rack is ready now."
msgstr "我看晾肉巨架这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "Time to see what the large drying rack has for us."
msgstr "该看看晾肉巨架这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.1"
msgid "I think the large drying rack is ready now."
msgstr "我看晾肉巨架这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DONE_SALT.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the large drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉巨架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING.2"
msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the large drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉巨架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "The rain's getting to the large drying rack!"
msgstr "雨都淋到晾肉巨架上了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "How is anything supposed to dry in this weather?"
msgstr "这天气，挂什么也晾不干吧？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.1"
msgid "I'll leave this on the large drying rack a while longer."
msgstr "还得在晾肉巨架上再挂一阵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT.2"
msgid "Still a little too damp in the middle."
msgstr "中间还有些潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the large drying rack again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看晾肉巨架。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the barnacles if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些藤壶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.1"
msgid "I'll save the beefy greens for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "牛肉绿叶菜要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD.2"
msgid "I remember putting the leafy meat in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了叶肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the jerky along without a bowl."
msgstr "带上肉干就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜欢能塞进袖兜里的口粮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the hostile flare back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把敌对信号弹带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MEGAFLARE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the flare if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些信号弹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.1"
msgid "I'd watch the merm from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看鱼人就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.1"
msgid "I could wear the swamp brawler helmet over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层沼泽斗士头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORHAT.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the swamp warrior helmet before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过沼泽战士头盔合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMARMORUPGRADEDHAT.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over it!"
msgstr "火快把它吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.1"
msgid "I don't think the loyal merm guard has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得忠诚鱼人守卫一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.1"
msgid "I'd watch the mutated merm guard from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看变异鱼人守卫就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I'd watch the shadow merm guard from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看暗影鱼人守卫就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the clever disguise with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下聪明的伪装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the freshwater fish if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些淡水鱼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the merm head before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到鱼人头旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the merm head."
msgstr "我标一下发现鱼人头的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the leaky shack."
msgstr "漏雨的小屋烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the leaky shack quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近漏雨的小屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the craftsmerm house in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出鱼人工艺屋的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the craftsmerm house today."
msgstr "不知道今天鱼人工艺屋里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.1"
msgid "I wonder what the king of the merms noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道鱼人之王比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMKING.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the royal tapestry but ash."
msgstr "皇家地毯只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the royal tapestry."
msgstr "我标一下发现皇家地毯的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the diy royalty kit in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出皇家手工套装的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the diy royalty kit in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给皇家手工套装腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.1"
msgid "I wonder who the merms will choose to wear the crown."
msgstr "不知鱼人们会选谁戴上王冠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING.2"
msgid "There's quite a fuss in the marsh whenever the throne is empty."
msgstr "王位一空，沼泽里就热闹起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to it."
msgstr "得记住回到它这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.1"
msgid "I want to see whether I can turn freely in the armermry."
msgstr "我想试试穿上鱼人军械库还能不能灵活转身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "I could wear the superior armermry over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层高级鱼人军械库。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.1"
msgid "I don't think the mutated merm has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得变异鱼人一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.1"
msgid "I wonder who the merms will choose to wear the crown."
msgstr "不知鱼人们会选谁戴上王冠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE.2"
msgid "There's quite a fuss in the marsh whenever the throne is empty."
msgstr "王位一空，沼泽里就热闹起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I don't think the shadow merm has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得暗影鱼人一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.1"
msgid "My grip on the shoddy tool feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住劣质工具的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL.2"
msgid "Better wipe it down before I put it away."
msgstr "收起来以前得先擦一遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.1"
msgid "I wonder what the shoddy tool shed looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，劣质工具棚是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the rocks to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the slightly less shoddy tool shed again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看不那么劣质的工具棚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "I can see where the twigs went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.1"
msgid "I'd put the slightly less shoddy tool within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把不那么劣质的工具放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED.2"
msgid "Better wipe it down before I put it away."
msgstr "收起来以前得先擦一遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.1"
msgid "I'll keep the message in a bottle safe from the rain."
msgstr "得保护瓶中信，别让雨淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE.2"
msgid "Dry hands first. I don't want to smudge it."
msgstr "先擦干手，别把字蹭花了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.1"
msgid "I'll keep the empty bottle safe from the rain."
msgstr "得保护空瓶子，别让雨淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY.2"
msgid "The writing's easier to see in daylight."
msgstr "日光下字迹清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the mighty gym."
msgstr "强大健身房烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the mighty gym."
msgstr "得记住回到强大健身房这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the rope went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了绳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the milky whites to share."
msgstr "希望乳白物够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the friendly peeper with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做友好窥视者就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the miner hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下矿工帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.1"
msgid "I can see the grain in the metal."
msgstr "能看见金属里的纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINGOT.2"
msgid "I'll set a piece aside for the smithy."
msgstr "我留一块给锻造用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd bring the floating lantern back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把漂浮灯笼带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN.2"
msgid "I can see where the lucky gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the whirly fan together."
msgstr "我想知道旋转的风扇是怎么组装的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the twigs to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the flare back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把信号弹带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the hostile flare."
msgstr "要做敌对信号弹，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd put the mini sign where everyone can see it."
msgstr "我会把小木牌放在大家都看得见的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll check that it's visible from the other direction too."
msgstr "我也从另一头看看醒不醒目。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.1"
msgid "There's room for a drawing on the mini sign."
msgstr "小木牌上还能添一幅画。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN.2"
msgid "I should decide what to put here before I start."
msgstr "落笔前得先想好画什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the mini sign."
msgstr "我先给小木牌腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the ancient guardian fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是远古守护者。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAUR.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the large ornate chest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进大号华丽箱子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURCHEST.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with the guardian's horn."
msgstr "不知守护者之角能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MINOTAURHORN.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the houndius shootius with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做眼睛炮塔就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.COLD.2"
msgid "That chill went straight to my fingers."
msgstr "寒意直往指尖钻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd save the heat gland for after practice."
msgstr "我想把火腺留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the searing shovel."
msgstr "我该给呲啦铲留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked heat gland."
msgstr "吃熟火腺我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MITEGLAND_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.1"
msgid "I'll straighten the sleeves before I go out."
msgstr "出门前得把袖口理齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MMIKO_ARMOR.2"
msgid "I like the way the robe sits when I bow."
msgstr "鞠躬时这身衣服的垂感真好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.1"
msgid "The long shaft changes my stance quite a bit."
msgstr "长柄一握，站姿也得跟着变。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MNAGINATA.2"
msgid "I need a more open patch to practice with this."
msgstr "要练这个，得找块宽敞的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.1"
msgid "There's its nose, just above the soil."
msgstr "鼻尖露出土面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.ABOVEGROUND.2"
msgid "Wait a moment and we'll see the rest of it."
msgstr "再等一下，它就会整个钻出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.HELD.2"
msgid "It's much smaller this close."
msgstr "拿到跟前显得真小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the moleworm is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出鼹鼠藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLE.UNDERGROUND.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.1"
msgid "I'd give the naked mole bat room to turn."
msgstr "得给裸鼹蝠留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBAT.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "轻一点，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the naked mole bat burrow."
msgstr "得记住回到裸鼹蝠丘这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEBATHILL.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the moggles with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下鼹鼠帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the burrow."
msgstr "我标一下发现鼹鼠丘的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOLEHILL.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.1"
msgid "I'll watch the splumonkey without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动穴居猴，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.1"
msgid "Those monkeys seem quite at home around it."
msgstr "那些猴子对这里倒是熟门熟路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYBARREL.2"
msgid "I'll keep my pack shut while I have a look."
msgstr "我看看就好，背包得系紧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the monkey hut in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出猴子小屋的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the monkey hut quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近猴子小屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYHUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the unnatural portal by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清非自然传送门，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the broken machinery."
msgstr "从损坏的机器回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYISLAND_PORTAL_DEBRIS.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.1"
msgid "Those monkeys seem quite at home around it."
msgstr "那些猴子对这里倒是熟门熟路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYPILLAR.2"
msgid "I'll keep my pack shut while I have a look."
msgstr "我看看就好，背包得系紧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.1"
msgid "I'll watch the queen of moon quay without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动月亮码头女王，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYQUEEN.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.1"
msgid "I'll watch the monkeytails without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动猴尾草，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEYTAIL.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the captain's tricorn."
msgstr "不知道船长的三角帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_MEDIUMHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.1"
msgid "Would the pirate's bandana leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着海盗头巾还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONKEY_SMALLHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.1"
msgid "I'm leaving that off the dinner table."
msgstr "这东西可不能上饭桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERLASAGNA.2"
msgid "Please put that away from the good food."
msgstr "请把它和能吃的东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.1"
msgid "I'm leaving that off the dinner table."
msgstr "这东西可不能上饭桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT.2"
msgid "Please put that away from the good food."
msgstr "请把它和能吃的东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'm leaving that off the dinner table."
msgstr "这东西可不能上饭桌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "Please put that away from the good food."
msgstr "请把它和能吃的东西分开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.1"
msgid "I could smell the monster tartare from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了怪物鞑靼的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MONSTERTARTARE.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.1"
msgid "I can see the break in the moon stone."
msgstr "能看见月亮石断在了什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.BROKEN.2"
msgid "It won't work in this state."
msgstr "这样已经没法用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the moon stone."
msgstr "得记住回到月亮石这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the moon stone."
msgstr "月亮石的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.MOONSTAFF.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the moon stone."
msgstr "月亮石的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.STAFFED.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'll have to find the right piece for the moon stone."
msgstr "我得给月亮石找件合适的配件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBASE.WRONGSTAFF.2"
msgid "Something of the right shape should fit there."
msgstr "那个位置得放形状对得上的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the moon moth from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看月蛾就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the moon glass saw blade."
msgstr "要做月光玻璃锯片，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the moon moth wings."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给月蛾翅膀配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLYWINGS.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the lunar grimoire."
msgstr "要做月之魔典，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the lune tree sapling growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让月树苗长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONBUTTERFLY_SAPLING.2"
msgid "A little earth around the roots should help."
msgstr "给根边培些土会好一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.1"
msgid "There's no moonlight to catch down here."
msgstr "地下没有月光可照。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.CAVE.2"
msgid "I should check the dial under open sky."
msgstr "得去露天的地方看月相盘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the moon dial."
msgstr "得记住回到月晷这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the blue moonlens if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蓝色月眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.1"
msgid "The surface has set hard and smooth."
msgstr "表面已经凝固得又硬又光滑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.GLASSED.2"
msgid "I can see a faint reflection in it."
msgstr "能在上面看见一点倒影。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.1"
msgid "A perfect round moon in the water."
msgstr "水里映着一轮圆月。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_FULL.2"
msgid "It's a good night to walk without a torch."
msgstr "这样的夜晚，不打火把也看得清路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.1"
msgid "Hardly a trace of the moon tonight."
msgstr "今晚几乎看不见月亮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_NEW.2"
msgid "The surface is dark under a new moon."
msgstr "新月下，盘面暗了下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.1"
msgid "A little less moon than last night."
msgstr "月亮比昨晚缺了一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WANE.2"
msgid "We're on our way to a darker sky."
msgstr "接下来几晚，天色会越来越暗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.1"
msgid "More moonlight on the dial tonight."
msgstr "今晚盘面上的月光多了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONDIAL.NIGHT_WAX.2"
msgid "It'll be round before long."
msgstr "再过些日子就要圆了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "I'll keep the moon shard dry on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上别让月亮碎片受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the moon glass saw blade with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做月光玻璃锯片就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.1"
msgid "I'll keep the moon glass axe where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把月光玻璃斧放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASSAXE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the moon shard to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了月亮碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.1"
msgid "I could use the infused moon shard back at the workbench."
msgstr "工作台上也许用得着注能月亮碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_CHARGED.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the brightshade bomb."
msgstr "要做亮茄炸弹，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the moon glass just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着月光玻璃，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_ROCK.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想问问铁匠，这东西能怎么用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.1"
msgid "I'd approach the moon glass mound quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近月光玻璃窝时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONGLASS_WOBSTER_DEN.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the cratered moonrock."
msgstr "我想细看一下带孔月岩的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKCRATER.2"
msgid "I can see where the moon rock went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了月岩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the moon rock idol if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，月岩雕像也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKIDOL.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the moon rock."
msgstr "我想细看一下月岩的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKNUGGET.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想问问铁匠，这东西能怎么用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.1"
msgid "Such an odd beginning for something that grows so tall."
msgstr "长得那么高的东西，起初竟是这个样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCKSEED.2"
msgid "I wonder where I ought to plant it."
msgstr "我想知道种在哪里合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the moon rubble."
msgstr "我想细看一下月亮石碎块的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONROCK_PIECES.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the shattered spider hole today."
msgstr "不知道今天破碎蜘蛛洞里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSPIDERDEN.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the charged glassy rock in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的充能玻璃石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.1"
msgid "There's a little glow inside the glass."
msgstr "玻璃里面透着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GLASS.INFUSED.2"
msgid "It holds the light even when I shade it."
msgstr "即使用手遮着，还是能看见亮光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the astroggles."
msgstr "不知道星象护目镜会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_GOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.1"
msgid "I'd set the moongleam beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把月熠放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_SPARK.2"
msgid "I should save some for the incomplete experiment."
msgstr "我该给未完成的实验留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the energetic static."
msgstr "我标一下发现能量静电的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.1"
msgid "I'd set the static restrainer beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把静电约束仪放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_CATCHER.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.1"
msgid "I can still see sparks under the covering."
msgstr "隔着外层还能看见里面的电火花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll set this down before I touch anything metal."
msgstr "碰金属前，我得先把这个放下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.1"
msgid "I wonder what the unrestrained static looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，未约束的静电是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOONSTORM_STATIC_ROAMER.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the celestial altar before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把天体祭坛画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.1"
msgid "One more section and we'll see the shape of it."
msgstr "再装一段，就能看出轮廓了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR.MOON_ALTAR_WIP.2"
msgid "I'll check which pieces we still need."
msgstr "我来核一下还缺哪些部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the celestial sanctum?"
msgstr "上次站在天体圣殿前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ASTRAL.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the celestial tribute before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把天体贡品画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_COSMIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.1"
msgid "Would the inactive celestial tribute leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着未激活天体贡品还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_CROWN.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the celestial altar base?"
msgstr "上次站在天体祭坛底座前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_GLASS.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.1"
msgid "I'd draw the celestial sanctum icon before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把天体圣殿象征画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ICON.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the celestial altar idol here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把天体祭坛雕像留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_IDOL.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the mysterious energy here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把神秘能量留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_LINK.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the inviting formation just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着吸引人的结构，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_GLASS.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the inviting formation."
msgstr "我想细看一下吸引人的结构的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_IDOL.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the inviting formation if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，吸引人的结构也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_ROCK_SEED.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the celestial altar orb?"
msgstr "上次站在天体祭坛宝球前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_SEED.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the celestial sanctum ward?"
msgstr "上次站在天体圣殿卫戍前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_ALTAR_WARD.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.1"
msgid "I'd save the moon shroom for after practice."
msgstr "我想把月亮蘑菇留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP.2"
msgid "I should save some for the lunar funcap."
msgstr "我该给月亮蘑菇帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked moon shroom."
msgstr "吃熟月亮蘑菇我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.1"
msgid "One more section and we'll see the shape of it."
msgstr "再装一段，就能看出轮廓了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION1.2"
msgid "I'll check which pieces we still need."
msgstr "我来核一下还缺哪些部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.1"
msgid "One more section and we'll see the shape of it."
msgstr "再装一段，就能看出轮廓了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.CONSTRUCTION2.2"
msgid "I'll check which pieces we still need."
msgstr "我来核一下还缺哪些部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the lunar siphonator at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看月亮虹吸器怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_DEVICE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I took the cover off."
msgstr "拆开外壳之前我会先问一声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the celestial fissure looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，天体裂缝是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the celestial fissure."
msgstr "天体裂缝现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE.NOLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.1"
msgid "There's a stopper wedged into the crack."
msgstr "裂隙里紧紧塞了个东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_FISSURE_PLUGGED.2"
msgid "I'd leave that seal as it is."
msgstr "我还是不动那个封口了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the lune tree!"
msgstr "火快把月树吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the lune tree stood."
msgstr "月树原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "That's a fresh cut on the lune tree."
msgstr "月树的断面还很新。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for a new tree."
msgstr "我留块空地种棵新的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the lune tree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把月树的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "I can pick out every little fold in the petals."
msgstr "花瓣上每一道褶皱都看得清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "I'd carry this on top of my basket so it won't be crushed."
msgstr "我想放在篮子最上面，免得压坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried lune tree blossom wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干月树花包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOON_TREE_BLOSSOM_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.1"
msgid "I wonder what it noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道它比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping it on the way back."
msgstr "带它回去的时候得拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSEEGG.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "壳比看起来的薄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.1"
msgid "I'd approach it quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近它时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOOSE_NESTING_GROUND.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the moqueca to share."
msgstr "希望海鲜杂烩够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOQUECA.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.1"
msgid "My fingers always pause at this hilt."
msgstr "每次按住这把刀的柄，我都会停一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MORTALBLADE.2"
msgid "I'll leave it sheathed a little longer."
msgstr "还是让它再在鞘里待一会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the mosquito moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到蚊子就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITO.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the skeeter bomb before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂蚊子炸弹的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOBOMB.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the mosquito sack if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蚊子血囊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the fertilizzzer in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给嗡嗡肥料腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOFERTILIZER.2"
msgid "I can see where the manure went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了粪肥。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the blood shot is safe."
msgstr "我得问问蚊血注射液用多少才合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMERMSALVE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the mosquito sack to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了蚊子血囊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.1"
msgid "I'd bring the lil' itchy back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把小痒痒带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOMUSK.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the beefalo wool if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些牛毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the mosquito sack."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进蚊子血囊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSQUITOSACK.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.1"
msgid "I'd watch the mosling from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看麋鹿鹅幼崽就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOSSLING.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.1"
msgid "Someone has already turned the earth here."
msgstr "这片土已经被翻开了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.DUG.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my feet."
msgstr "我会小心落脚的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the grave looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，坟墓是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.1"
msgid "Bare feet make it easier to feel the swell."
msgstr "光脚踩上去，更容易察觉浪的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MSURFBOARD_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll wait for a clean wave."
msgstr "我等一道平稳的浪再走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the mulled punch to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把香料潘趣酒带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULLEDDRINK.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the florid postern on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下绚丽之门。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the celestial portal by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清天体传送门，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTIPLAYER_PORTAL_MOONROCK.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.1"
msgid "The pick/axe takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "多用斧镐的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MULTITOOL_AXE_PICKAXE.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.1"
msgid "You look as though someone put you back together."
msgstr "你看起来像是被人重新拼起来过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUMMY_MERM.2"
msgid "I'll stay where you can see me."
msgstr "我会待在你能看见我的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME.1"
msgid "There are droplets on the steel again."
msgstr "钢刃上又凝了一层水珠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MURASAME.2"
msgid "My oilcloth never stays dry around this one."
msgstr "保养这把刀，油布总是湿的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the mush gnome before it moves again."
msgstr "趁蘑菇地精没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHGNOME.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the boomshroom again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看炸弹蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMBOMB.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the funcap."
msgstr "不知道蘑菇帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the sporecap stood."
msgstr "孢子帽原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the sporecap again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看孢子帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOMSPROUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the mushroom planter."
msgstr "蘑菇农场烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I'd have to put something in before I could harvest anything."
msgstr "想有收成，得先放些东西进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.EMPTY.2"
msgid "An empty bed won't give us much."
msgstr "空着可没什么收成。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.1"
msgid "I can see fresh caps coming up."
msgstr "能看到新长出来的菇帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.LOTS.2"
msgid "A good crop of mushrooms for our little camp."
msgstr "这些蘑菇够营地收一阵了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.1"
msgid "The smell of the mushroom planter is quite enough from here."
msgstr "站在这儿已经闻够蘑菇农场的味道了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.ROTTEN.2"
msgid "I should handle it with gloves."
msgstr "我还是戴上手套再碰吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.1"
msgid "I can hardly see the bed through the snow."
msgstr "隔着积雪，几乎看不到种植箱了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SNOWCOVERED.2"
msgid "I'll check again after the thaw."
msgstr "等雪融了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.1"
msgid "I can see fresh caps coming up."
msgstr "能看到新长出来的菇帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.SOME.2"
msgid "A good crop of mushrooms for our little camp."
msgstr "这些蘑菇够营地收一阵了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.1"
msgid "I can see fresh caps coming up."
msgstr "能看到新长出来的菇帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_FARM.STUFFED.2"
msgid "A good crop of mushrooms for our little camp."
msgstr "这些蘑菇够营地收一阵了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the mushlight in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出蘑菇灯的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the mushlight."
msgstr "蘑菇灯现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.1"
msgid "There. the mushlight is working."
msgstr "好了，蘑菇灯开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the glowcap stood."
msgstr "菌伞灯原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the glowcap."
msgstr "菌伞灯现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.1"
msgid "There. the glowcap is working."
msgstr "好了，菌伞灯开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHROOM_LIGHT2.ON.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the red mushtree."
msgstr "碰红蘑菇树还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.1"
msgid "There are spores drifting between the caps."
msgstr "菇帽之间有孢子飘下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.BLOOM.2"
msgid "I'll step back before I breathe them in."
msgstr "我退开些，别把它们吸进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the red mushtree in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看红蘑菇树。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the lunar mushtree changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时月亮蘑菇树会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_MOON.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the green mushtree."
msgstr "碰绿蘑菇树还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.1"
msgid "There are spores drifting between the caps."
msgstr "菇帽之间有孢子飘下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.BLOOM.2"
msgid "I'll step back before I breathe them in."
msgstr "我退开些，别把它们吸进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the green mushtree grows."
msgstr "我要记住绿蘑菇树长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_SMALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the blue mushtree."
msgstr "蓝蘑菇树表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.1"
msgid "There are spores drifting between the caps."
msgstr "菇帽之间有孢子飘下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.BLOOM.2"
msgid "I'll step back before I breathe them in."
msgstr "我退开些，别把它们吸进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the blue mushtree changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时蓝蘑菇树会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the webbed blue mushtree."
msgstr "碰蛛网蓝蘑菇树还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.ACIDCOVERED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the webbed blue mushtree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把蛛网蓝蘑菇树的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUSHTREE_TALL_WEBBED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the armored bearger fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是装甲熊獾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBEARGER.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.1"
msgid "I can just make out the bright-beaked bird from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见亮喙鸟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBIRD.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.1"
msgid "I'll leave it to its meal."
msgstr "我不去打扰它进食。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.EATING_CORPSE.2"
msgid "Better not get between that beak and its food."
msgstr "可别挡在它的嘴和食物之间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll watch the crystal-crested buzzard without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动水晶冠秃鹫，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDBUZZARD_GESTALT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the crystal deerclops fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是晶体独眼巨鹿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDDEERCLOPS.2"
msgid "What an extraordinary thing to see up close."
msgstr "能亲眼见到，实在难得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd give the horror hound room to turn."
msgstr "得给恐怖猎犬留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "轻一点，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the horror hound, please."
msgstr "经过恐怖猎犬时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDHOUND.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll come by again when it's awake."
msgstr "等它醒了我再过来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.1"
msgid "I'd watch the possessed varg from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看附身座狼就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATEDWARG.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. It lies so still."
msgstr "可怜，一动也不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll give it a quiet moment."
msgstr "让我安静陪它一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the permafrost pengull from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看永冻企鸥就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the permafrost pengull, please."
msgstr "经过永冻企鸥时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATED_PENGUIN.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll come by again when it's awake."
msgstr "等它醒了我再过来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.1"
msgid "I'll leave the dangler switcherdoodle with Webber and his little friends."
msgstr "我把悬蛛变身涂鸦留给韦伯和他的小伙伴们。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_DROPPER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the monster meat to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了怪物肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.1"
msgid "I'll leave the nurse switcherdoodle with Webber and his little friends."
msgstr "我把护士变身涂鸦留给韦伯和他的小伙伴们。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HEALER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the monster meat to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了怪物肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.1"
msgid "I'll leave the cave switcherdoodle with Webber and his little friends."
msgstr "我把洞穴变身涂鸦留给韦伯和他的小伙伴们。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_HIDER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the monster meat to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了怪物肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.1"
msgid "Webber, did you make the shatter switcherdoodle yourself?"
msgstr "韦伯，破碎变身涂鸦是你亲手做的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_MOON.2"
msgid "I should label that before anyone mistakes it for a snack."
msgstr "得加个标记，免得有人当成点心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.1"
msgid "Webber, did you make the spitter switcherdoodle yourself?"
msgstr "韦伯，喷吐变身涂鸦是你亲手做的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_SPITTER.2"
msgid "I should label that before anyone mistakes it for a snack."
msgstr "得加个标记，免得有人当成点心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.1"
msgid "Webber, did you make the warrior switcherdoodle yourself?"
msgstr "韦伯，战士变身涂鸦是你亲手做的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WARRIOR.2"
msgid "I should label that before anyone mistakes it for a snack."
msgstr "得加个标记，免得有人当成点心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.1"
msgid "I'll leave the strider switcherdoodle with Webber and his little friends."
msgstr "我把海黾变身涂鸦留给韦伯和他的小伙伴们。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MUTATOR_WATER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the monster meat to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了怪物肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.1"
msgid "I can see through the eyes if I tilt it just so."
msgstr "稍稍调个角度，眼孔就对上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_FOXMASK.2"
msgid "I'll fix the ties before I wear it."
msgstr "我先把系带理好再戴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.1"
msgid "I'd appreciate a little privacy."
msgstr "请让我独处片刻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_PANTSU.2"
msgid "Who left these out here?"
msgstr "谁把这个丢在外面了？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.1"
msgid "One more turn round my neck should do."
msgstr "颈上再绕一圈就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.M_SCARF.2"
msgid "I like tucking my chin into it on cold mornings."
msgstr "清早天冷，我喜欢把下巴藏在里面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the flowery costume pattern flat in my pack."
msgstr "我把花朵礼服款式平平整整地收进包里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NATURE_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I should check the materials against the drawing."
msgstr "要对着图核一遍材料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the nightcap."
msgstr "不知道睡帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTCAPHAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the lucky gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the night light reaches."
msgstr "我想看看暗夜灯的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTLIGHT.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.1"
msgid "My hand feels cold long after I put it down."
msgstr "放下好一会儿，手心还是冷的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREFUEL.2"
msgid "I'll keep that pouch closed when I'm trying to sleep."
msgstr "睡前还是把那个袋口扎紧吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.1"
msgid "I wonder what the nightmare rampart looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，梦魇城墙是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREGROWTH.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the nightmare light reaches."
msgstr "我想看看梦魇灯座的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARELIGHT.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the grim galette differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给恐怖国王饼调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMAREPIE.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.1"
msgid "The pulse is faint now."
msgstr "脉动很微弱了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.CALM.2"
msgid "A quieter reading. Let me check it once more."
msgstr "读数平静了，我再确认一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.1"
msgid "The pulse is faint now."
msgstr "脉动很微弱了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.DAWN.2"
msgid "A quieter reading. Let me check it once more."
msgstr "读数平静了，我再确认一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.1"
msgid "The pulse is faint now."
msgstr "脉动很微弱了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.NOMAGIC.2"
msgid "A quieter reading. Let me check it once more."
msgstr "读数平静了，我再确认一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.1"
msgid "I can feel the pulse growing stronger."
msgstr "手里能感觉到脉动越来越强。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.STEADY.2"
msgid "We should watch the ruins closely now."
msgstr "现在得仔细留意遗迹里的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.1"
msgid "The pulse is faint now."
msgstr "脉动很微弱了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WANING.2"
msgid "A quieter reading. Let me check it once more."
msgstr "读数平静了，我再确认一次。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.1"
msgid "I can feel the pulse growing stronger."
msgstr "手里能感觉到脉动越来越强。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WARN.2"
msgid "We should watch the ruins closely now."
msgstr "现在得仔细留意遗迹里的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.1"
msgid "I can feel the pulse growing stronger."
msgstr "手里能感觉到脉动越来越强。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTMARE_TIMEPIECE.WAXING.2"
msgid "We should watch the ruins closely now."
msgstr "现在得仔细留意遗迹里的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the morning star this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把晨星锤做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSTICK.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the electrical doodad to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了电子元件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dark sword where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把暗夜剑放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NIGHTSWORD.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.1"
msgid "Those pale crystals come off on my glove."
msgstr "浅色的晶粒都蹭到了手套上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE.2"
msgid "Better put this in a pouch with its own label."
msgstr "最好单独放一袋，写清是什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.1"
msgid "I wonder what the nitre formation looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，硝石堆是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NITRE_FORMATION.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the grit duster out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到防滑粉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRIT.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.1"
msgid "I'd bring the grit grinder back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把防滑颗粒带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NONSLIPGRITBOOSTED.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.1"
msgid "Would the premier gardeneer hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着高级耕作先驱帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.NUTRIENTSGOGGLESHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the oar this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把桨做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the log to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the driftwood oar this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把浮木桨做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_DRIFTWOOD.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the driftwood piece to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了浮木桩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.1"
msgid "Someone's put a lot of sea miles on this oar."
msgstr "这支桨显然已经划过很远的海路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OAR_MONKEY.2"
msgid "I wonder if the monkeys row to a rhythm too."
msgstr "不知道猴子们划桨时也讲不讲节拍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the lake. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，湖泊里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the lake in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的湖泊。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OASISLAKE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the ocean debris out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到海洋残骸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHABLEFLOTSAM.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.1"
msgid "I could follow the wooden ball bobber by eye from the deck."
msgstr "站在甲板上也能盯住木球浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_BALL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the angler's survival guide."
msgstr "我该给垂钓者生存指南留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the saffron quill float in calmer water."
msgstr "我想在平静些的水面试试黄羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CANARY.2"
msgid "A bright speck makes the waiting easier."
msgstr "水面有个亮点，等鱼时好盯些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the jet quill float in calmer water."
msgstr "我想在平静些的水面试试黑羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_CROW.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the jet feather if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些黑色羽毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the down quill float in calmer water."
msgstr "我想在平静些的水面试试鹅羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_GOOSE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the down feather if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些麋鹿鹅羽毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.1"
msgid "I could follow the malbatross quill float by eye from the deck."
msgstr "站在甲板上也能盯住邪天翁羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_MALBATROSS.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the malbatross feather to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了邪天翁羽毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the fish hook in calmer water."
msgstr "我想在平静些的水面试试鱼钩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_NONE.2"
msgid "A bright speck makes the waiting easier."
msgstr "水面有个亮点，等鱼时好盯些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.1"
msgid "I could follow the hardened slip bobber by eye from the deck."
msgstr "站在甲板上也能盯住硬物浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_OVAL.2"
msgid "I should check that the line runs freely."
msgstr "得检查一下鱼线滑不滑顺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.1"
msgid "I could follow the crimson quill float by eye from the deck."
msgstr "站在甲板上也能盯住红羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN.2"
msgid "I'll watch for the first little dip."
msgstr "等它第一次轻轻下沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.1"
msgid "I could follow the azure quill float by eye from the deck."
msgstr "站在甲板上也能盯住蔚蓝羽浮漂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGBOBBER_ROBIN_WINTER.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the azure feather if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蓝色羽毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the stupefying lure under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看麻醉鱼饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_DROWSY.2"
msgid "I'll keep the hooks away from my sleeves."
msgstr "鱼钩得离衣袖远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.1"
msgid "A fish sees the heavy weighted lure from beneath the waves."
msgstr "鱼是在水下看重量级鱼饵的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_HEAVY.2"
msgid "I'd try this where I saw the last ripple."
msgstr "我想在刚才有水纹的地方试试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the rainy day lure under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看雨天鱼饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_RAIN.2"
msgid "A short cast should tell me how it swims."
msgstr "先抛近些，看它怎么游。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the snow day lure under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看雪天鱼饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_HERMIT_SNOW.2"
msgid "A short cast should tell me how it swims."
msgstr "先抛近些，看它怎么游。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.1"
msgid "A fish sees the nightflyer spinnerbait from beneath the waves."
msgstr "鱼是在水下看夜间旋转亮片的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_BLUE.2"
msgid "I'd try this where I saw the last ripple."
msgstr "我想在刚才有水纹的地方试试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the dusky spinnerbait under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看黄昏旋转亮片在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_GREEN.2"
msgid "A short cast should tell me how it swims."
msgstr "先抛近些，看它怎么游。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.1"
msgid "A fish sees the sunrise spinnerbait from beneath the waves."
msgstr "鱼是在水下看日出旋转亮片的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPINNER_RED.2"
msgid "I can see where the flint went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the nightflyer spoon under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看夜间匙型假饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_BLUE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the blue cap if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采摘的蓝蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the dusky spoon under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看黄昏匙型假饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_GREEN.2"
msgid "A short cast should tell me how it swims."
msgstr "先抛近些，看它怎么游。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the movement of the sunrise spoon under the surface."
msgstr "我想看看日出匙型假饵在水下怎么动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGLURE_SPOON_RED.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the flint if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the sea fishing rod before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂海钓竿的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISHINGROD.2"
