msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_1.1"
