msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.1"
msgid "I don't think the deep bass has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得斑鱼一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANFISH_MEDIUM_2.2
