#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the knobbly tree changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时疙瘩树会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.1"
msgid "Such an odd beginning for something that grows so tall."
msgstr "长得那么高的东西，起初竟是这个样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREENUT.2"
msgid "I wonder where I ought to plant it."
msgstr "我想知道种在哪里合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "I want to look at the above-average tree trunk in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看高出平均值的树干。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANTREE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the mossy vine."
msgstr "我标一下发现苔藓藤条的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the sea strider nest."
msgstr "我标一下发现海黾巢穴的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.1"
msgid "Water all around and it still burned."
msgstr "周围都是水，居然还是烧坏了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANVINE_COCOON_BURNT.2"
msgid "The water hasn't washed away the scorch marks."
msgstr "烧焦的痕迹还没被水冲掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the ocean detritus by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清海洋漂浮物，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLBIGPORTALEXIT.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the whirlportal on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下漩涡传送门。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEANWHIRLPORTAL.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.1"
msgid "There's a good weight in the net."
msgstr "这网捞起来挺有分量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.CAUGHT.2"
msgid "I'll bring the catch in before it slips away."
msgstr "趁它还没溜走，先把渔获收上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.1"
msgid "It found a way out of the net."
msgstr "它找到网里的空隙逃了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.ESCAPED.2"
msgid "Just a ripple where our catch should be."
msgstr "原本有渔获的地方只剩一圈水纹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the ocean trawler."
msgstr "海洋拖网捕鱼器的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.FIXED.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should check the ocean trawler before taking the boat out."
msgstr "出海前得检查好海洋拖网捕鱼器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It's easier to get things right while the shore is close."
msgstr "趁离岸还近，处理起来容易些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.1"
msgid "The net's in the water now."
msgstr "网已经下水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER.LOWERED.2"
msgid "I'll leave it down while we wait."
msgstr "先让它沉着，我们等一等。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the ocean trawler kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放海洋拖网捕鱼器套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OCEAN_TRAWLER_KIT.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the communal kelp dish again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看食堂海带盘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut reeds if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采下的芦苇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.1"
msgid "The kelp's already laid out inside."
msgstr "里面已经放了海带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.LOTS_OF_KELP.2"
msgid "I wonder who will accept our offering."
msgstr "不知谁会收下我们的供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.1"
msgid "The kelp's already laid out inside."
msgstr "里面已经放了海带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT.SOME_KELP.2"
msgid "I wonder who will accept our offering."
msgstr "不知谁会收下我们的供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the superior communal kelp dish."
msgstr "得记住回到高级食堂海带盘这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the boards to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.1"
msgid "The kelp's already laid out inside."
msgstr "里面已经放了海带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.LOTS_OF_KELP.2"
msgid "I wonder who will accept our offering."
msgstr "不知谁会收下我们的供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.1"
msgid "The kelp's already laid out inside."
msgstr "里面已经放了海带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OFFERING_POT_UPGRADED.SOME_KELP.2"
msgid "I wonder who will accept our offering."
msgstr "不知谁会收下我们的供品。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.1"
msgid "I'd like a receipt if I spend this coin."
msgstr "花掉这枚钱币，我可得留张收据。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OINC1000000.2"
msgid "How would a shopkeeper even make change?"
msgstr "店主拿什么给我找零呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.1"
msgid "I might wear the one-man band to camp today."
msgstr "今天回营地，也许可以穿戴独奏乐器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONEMANBAND.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the onion to share."
msgstr "希望洋葱够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the bulbin."
msgstr "要做芽葱，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the roasted onion cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "烤洋葱要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant onion before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型洋葱再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的篮子可装不下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the pointy seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把尖形种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the iridescent gem."
msgstr "彩虹宝石深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the lunar grimoire."
msgstr "要做月之魔典，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the moon caller's staff."
msgstr "我想掂一下唤月者魔杖的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.1"
msgid "I feel something strange around the lazy forager."
msgstr "靠近懒人护符时有种奇怪的感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET.2"
msgid "I can see where the thulecite went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了铥矿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the orange gem."
msgstr "照点光就能看清橙宝石的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the lazy forager with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做懒人护符就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the orange moonlens."
msgstr "橙色月眼深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it so it won't scratch against the others."
msgstr "我把它包好，免得和别的磨花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the lazy explorer before taking it out."
msgstr "带懒人魔杖出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.1"
msgid "Look, the marotter has noticed us."
msgstr "看，水獭掠夺者注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTER.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the marotter den quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近水獭掠夺者窝点时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.1"
msgid "They've tucked their finds away in there."
msgstr "它们把找到的东西都藏在里面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT.2"
msgid "Quite a collection for such small paws."
msgstr "爪子那么小，收集的东西倒真不少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.1"
msgid "The raft is coming apart beneath the den."
msgstr "窝下面的筏子正在散架。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD.2"
msgid "We ought to step back onto firm ground."
msgstr "我们得退回结实的地面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.1"
msgid "I want to look at the palmcone tree in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看棕榈松果树。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the palmcone sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合棕榈松果树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.1"
msgid "I'd set the palmcone scale beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把棕榈松果树鳞片放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the cannon kit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做大炮套装就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.1"
msgid "I'd set the palmcone sprout beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把棕榈松果树芽放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the ornate chest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进华丽箱子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留个不会压到眼镜的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.1"
msgid "I'd set the panettone beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把托尼甜面包放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the pan flute before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂排箫的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the mandrake to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了曼德拉草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.1"
msgid "I'd bring the papyrus back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把莎草纸带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the imitation ruins turf blueprints with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做仿废墟地皮蓝图就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.1"
msgid "I'd bring the pavlova back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把巴甫洛娃蛋糕带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the scorpeon from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见酸蚀蝎，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.1"
msgid "I don't think the pengull has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得企鸥一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Watch it! It isn't staying down!"
msgstr "留意它！它又要起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Quick, give it room!"
msgstr "快退开！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.1"
msgid "I'd save the pepper for after practice."
msgstr "我想把辣椒留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the chili flakes with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做辣椒碎就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.1"
msgid "Could we take the stuffed pepper poppers on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着爆炒填馅辣椒吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER.2"
msgid "I might try a little more pepper next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些辣椒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the roasted pepper."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份烤辣椒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant pepper before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型辣椒再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的篮子可装不下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the lumpy seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把块状种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.1"
msgid "I don't think the gobbler has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得火鸡一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERD.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the lucky fan."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护幸运扇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the lucky gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the gobbler shrine but ash."
msgstr "火鸡神龛只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the gobbler shrine at the moment."
msgstr "火鸡神龛里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the gobbler shrine?"
msgstr "上次站在火鸡神龛前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the pierogi."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给波兰水饺配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.1"
msgid "Pressed between pages, these will keep a little colour."
msgstr "夹在书页间，多少能留住些颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS.2"
msgid "There's still a little scent on my fingers."
msgstr "指尖上还留着些花香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.1"
msgid "I can take the dried petals along without a bowl."
msgstr "带上干花瓣就不必拿碗了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.1"
msgid "I'd save the dark petals for after practice."
msgstr "我想把深色花瓣留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the nightmare fuel."
msgstr "我该给噩梦燃料留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried dark petals wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干深色花瓣包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how it changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时它会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the phlegm to share."
msgstr "希望脓鼻涕够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the pumpkin pie."
msgstr "要做南瓜派，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the gramophone."
msgstr "我标一下发现留声机的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.1"
msgid "There's grit where the head meets the handle."
msgstr "镐头和柄的接缝里全是石屑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE.2"
msgid "I can hear the difference when I strike a seam."
msgstr "敲到矿脉时，声音听起来不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "My grip on the brightshade smasher feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住亮茄粉碎者的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the brightshade husk if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些亮茄外壳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the pickled herring."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对腌鲱鱼了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.1"
msgid "The Pig King has picked quite a team."
msgstr "猪王真会挑选队员。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1.2"
msgid "Have you been training for the contest too?"
msgstr "你也在为比赛练习吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2.1"
msgid "The Pig King has picked quite a team."
