#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.1"
msgid "The Pig King has picked quite a team."
msgstr "猪王真会挑选队员。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4.2"
msgid "Have you been training for the contest too?"
msgstr "你也在为比赛练习吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.1"
msgid "Where would I find the guard pig after dark?"
msgstr "不知道猪人守卫天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see myself in the piggyback before we leave."
msgstr "出发前我想看看自己穿戴猪皮包的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the silk to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the pig head in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出猪头的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the pig head looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，猪头是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the pig house in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出猪屋的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.1"
msgid "There's no space left in the pig house."
msgstr "猪屋里面已经没位置了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL.2"
msgid "I'll wait until there's room."
msgstr "我等空出位置再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the pig house quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近猪屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the pig house."
msgstr "猪屋现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.1"
msgid "I suppose I should bow before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前，我想应该先行个礼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGKING.2"
msgid "Your Majesty, have you a moment to spare?"
msgstr "陛下，可否占用您一点时间？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I've come to visit. Is it all right if I stay a while?"
msgstr "我来串门，可以留一会儿吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I brought food, in case you felt like company."
msgstr "我带了些吃的，要不要一起坐坐？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.1"
msgid "He's keeping his post. I won't get in his way."
msgstr "他在守岗，我不挡他的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD.2"
msgid "Do they give you any time off duty?"
msgstr "你有换班休息的时候吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.1"
msgid "I don't think he recognizes me now."
msgstr "我觉得他现在认不出我了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG.2"
msgid "Those tusks are coming straight this way."
msgstr "那对獠牙正朝这里来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the pig shrine in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出猪神龛的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the pig shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，猪神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the pig shrine before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把猪神龛画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.1"
msgid "I'd cut the sound parts for straps."
msgstr "我会把结实的部分裁成皮带。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN.2"
msgid "This leather bends without splitting."
msgstr "这皮子弯过去也不裂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.1"
msgid "Someone has a place to sleep here."
msgstr "这里有人安睡的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT.2"
msgid "I'll wait outside instead of waking the whole household."
msgstr "我在外面等，省得吵醒住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the pig torch reaches."
msgstr "我想看看猪火炬的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the clout snout to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把猪鼻铸币带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the golden belt."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对金腰带了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.1"
msgid "I'll plant it a few steps back from camp."
msgstr "我想退开营地几步再种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.2"
msgid "A little cone today, shade for the camp one day."
msgstr "今天种下松果，以后营地就有树荫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the evergreen sapling growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让常青树苗长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the moon quay pirate banner again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看月亮码头海盗旗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE.2"
msgid "I can see where the black flag went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了黑旗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the x again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看X。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.1"
msgid "I'd put the pitchfork within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把干草叉放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK.2"
msgid "I can see where the flint went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the leafy meat to share."
msgstr "希望叶肉够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked leafy meat cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟叶肉要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.1"
msgid "Would the gardeneer hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着耕作先驱帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the crop looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，农作物是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.1"
msgid "There's a new leaf since yesterday."
msgstr "比昨天多长了一片叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING.2"
msgid "I should water round the roots."
msgstr "该沿着根部浇点水。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.1"
msgid "I think the crop is ready now."
msgstr "我看农作物这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I hate seeing the crop in this condition."
msgstr "看到农作物成了这样，真让人难受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see “The Enchanted Doll” from the audience's side."
msgstr "我想从观众席那边看看《附魔玩偶》。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.1"
msgid "I'll leave “My Knights Four and I” ready for the next performance."
msgstr "我把《我的四骑士与我》给下次演出备好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH.2"
msgid "I should check the script before I step onstage."
msgstr "上台前得再核对一次剧本。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.1"
msgid "Which scene calls for “A Task Complete”?"
msgstr "哪一场要用《任务完成》？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT.2"
msgid "Is it my cue yet?"
msgstr "该我出场了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.1"
msgid "Which scene calls for “The Pall”?"
msgstr "哪一场要用《黑罩》？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL.2"
msgid "Let's run that scene once before the audience comes in."
msgstr "等观众入场前，先排一遍吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Good morning, %s. Have you had anything to eat?"
msgstr "%s，见到你真好。吃过东西了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, there's room beside me by the fire."
msgstr "%s，火边我身旁还有位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Where would I find the inthralled corpse after dark?"
msgstr "不知道被附身的尸体天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.1"
msgid "Wait, I recognize those hands... they're mine!"
msgstr "慢着，我认得那双手……是我的！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYER_HOSTED.ME.2"
msgid "I'd like my own body back, please."
msgstr "请把我的身体还给我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the playing card out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到扑克牌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PLAYING_CARD.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the clockmaker's tools?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看钟表匠工具吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_DISMANTLER.2"
msgid "Time runs differently around one of her watches."
msgstr "她的表在旁边，时间都显得不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the ageless watch?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看不老表吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the ageless watch again."
msgstr "现在再用不老表还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_HEAL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the time pieces?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看时间碎片吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PARTS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the works in the rift watch from here."
msgstr "隔着这么远都听得见裂缝表里的机芯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "I'll give the rift watch a little more time."
msgstr "还得再给裂缝表一点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "等准备好了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.1"
msgid "That's a long way from this world."
msgstr "那在离这个世界很远的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.DIFFERENTSHARD.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it opens before I step through."
msgstr "迈进去之前，我想知道出口会在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the works in the time rift from here."
msgstr "隔着这么远都听得见时间裂缝里的机芯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_ENTRANCE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.1"
msgid "I can hear the works in the time rift from here."
msgstr "隔着这么远都听得见时间裂缝里的机芯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_PORTAL_EXIT.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the backtrek watch?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看溯源表吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the rift watch."
msgstr "我该给裂缝表留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "I'll give the backtrek watch a little more time."
msgstr "还得再给溯源表一点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_RECALL.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the second chance watch?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看第二次机会表吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the time pieces to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了时间碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the second chance watch again."
msgstr "现在再用第二次机会表还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_REVIVE.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wanda, may I look at the backstep watch?"
msgstr "旺达，可以让我看看倒走表吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wouldn't dare adjust it myself."
msgstr "我可不敢自己调。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the backstep watch again."
msgstr "现在再用倒走表还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WARP.RECHARGING.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the works in the alarming clock from here."
msgstr "隔着这么远都听得见警钟里的机芯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKETWATCH_WEAPON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to see how the hands move when she winds it."
msgstr "我想看看她上弦时表针怎么走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the pocket scale to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把弹簧秤带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POCKET_SCALE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut stone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.1"
msgid "I'll save the polish cookies for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "波兰饼干要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLISHCOOKIE.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.1"
msgid "I don't think the polly roger has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得波莉·罗杰一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERS.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the polly roger's hat."
msgstr "不知道波莉·罗杰的帽子会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POLLY_ROGERSHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.1"
msgid "I'd save the pomegranate for after practice."
msgstr "我想把石榴留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the sliced pomegranate."
msgstr "吃切片熟石榴我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Who'll help me carry the giant pomegranate back to camp?"
msgstr "谁来帮我把巨型石榴搬回营地？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I'll need more than my usual basket."
msgstr "我常用的篮子可装不下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the windblown seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把风刮来的种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POMEGRANATE_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the pond."
msgstr "从池塘回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the live eel on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下活鳗鱼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDEEL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.1"
msgid "I'll mark the freshwater fish on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下淡水鱼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PONDFISH.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the algae on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下水藻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POND_ALGAE.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.1"
msgid "I'd bring the manure back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把粪肥带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POOP.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the festive tree planter with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做盛宴树盆就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the portable grinding mill."
msgstr "我先给便携研磨器腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEBLENDER_ITEM.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.1"
msgid "I can wait. Rushing the portable crock pot won't help."
msgstr "我等得起，催便携烹饪锅也没用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_LONG.2"
msgid "I'll come back when that smell gets a little stronger."
msgstr "等香气再浓一点，我就回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.1"
msgid "I think the portable crock pot is nearly finished."
msgstr "我看便携烹饪锅就快好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.COOKING_SHORT.2"
msgid "Just time to lay things out before it's done."
msgstr "趁还差那么一会儿，把东西摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.1"
msgid "I think the portable crock pot is ready now."
msgstr "我看便携烹饪锅这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the portable crock pot at the moment."
msgstr "便携烹饪锅里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the portable crock pot before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开便携烹饪锅以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLECOOKPOT_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the portable campfire."
msgstr "我先给便携营火腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLEFIREPIT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.1"
msgid "I think the portable seasoning station is ready now."
msgstr "我看便携香料站这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.DONE.2"
msgid "I got here just in time."
msgstr "我来得正是时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the portable seasoning station before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开便携香料站以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLESPICER_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.1"
msgid "I wonder what the camper's tent looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，宿营帐篷是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the tent roll, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放帐篷卷够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PORTABLETENT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the potato differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给土豆调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the astroggles with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做星象护目镜就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the potato sack."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把土豆袋里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSACK.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the puffed potato soufflé to share."
msgstr "希望蓬松土豆蛋奶酥够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOSOUFFLE.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.1"
msgid "Could we take the fancy spiralled tubers on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着花式回旋块茎吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATOTORNADO.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the roasted potato before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤土豆，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant potato before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型土豆再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the fluffy seeds in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把毛茸茸的种子收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the potted fern changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时蕨类盆栽会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POTTEDFERN.2"
msgid "I can see where the foliage went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蕨叶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the powdercake after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃粉末蛋糕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWCAKE.2"
msgid "I might try a little more honey next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.1"
msgid "I'd give the powder monkey room to turn."
msgstr "得给火药猴留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.POWDER_MONKEY.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the empty waterfowl can at the moment."
msgstr "空鸟嘴壶里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the empty waterfowl can in the hands of someone who knows it."
msgstr "我想看看熟手是怎么用空鸟嘴壶的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PREMIUMWATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the malbatross bill if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些邪天翁喙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.1"
msgid "Look, the prime mate has noticed us."
msgstr "看，大副注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PRIME_MATE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the puffin noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道海鹦鹉比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the puffin, please."
msgstr "经过海鹦鹉时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUFFIN.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I'll come by again when it's awake."
msgstr "等它醒了我再过来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the pumpkin to share."
msgstr "希望南瓜够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the faceless pumpkin."
msgstr "要做无面南瓜，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.1"
msgid "I'd set it beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把它放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCARVER.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the pumpkin cookies differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给南瓜饼干调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINCOOKIE.2"
msgid "I can taste the pumpkin in every bite."
msgstr "每口都能尝出南瓜的味道。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Let me try the faceless pumpkin with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下无面南瓜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the pumpkin to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了南瓜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.1"
msgid "I haven't given it a face yet."
msgstr "我还没给它刻上脸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINHAT.UNCARVED.2"
msgid "I'll mark the eyes before I cut."
msgstr "下刀以前先画好眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the pumpkin pie differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给南瓜派调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKINPIE.2"
msgid "A smaller portion for me if we're sharing."
msgstr "如果大家分着吃，我少拿一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the pumpkin bomb before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂南瓜炸弹的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_BOMB.2"
msgid "I should make time to practice before I need it."
msgstr "趁还不急用，我该抽空练练。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the hot pumpkin before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤南瓜，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd like the pumpkin lantern near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让南瓜灯靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_LANTERN.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "Who'll help me carry the giant pumpkin back to camp?"
msgstr "谁来帮我把巨型南瓜搬回营地？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the sharp seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把尖种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the punching bag."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把拳击袋里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the pure brilliance back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把纯粹辉煌带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE.2"
msgid "I should save some for the brightshade smasher."
msgstr "我该给亮茄粉碎者留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the marks on the nightmare amulet up close."
msgstr "我想贴近看清梦魇护符上的纹路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it separately from my ordinary things."
msgstr "我把它和日常用品分开包好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the purple gem."
msgstr "紫宝石深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEGEM.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the purple moonlens."
msgstr "照点光就能看清紫色月眼的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.PURPLEMOONEYE.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it so it won't scratch against the others."
msgstr "我把它包好，免得和别的磨花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.1"
msgid "There's no space left in the altar of gnaw."
msgstr "饕餮祭坛里面已经没位置了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.FULL.2"
msgid "I'll leave what's in there alone for now."
msgstr "里面的东西暂时先不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the altar of gnaw here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把饕餮祭坛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.1"
msgid "I'd draw the post before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把柱子画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_BOLLARD.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.1"
msgid "The ivy's worked its way right round the altar."
msgstr "常春藤已经顺着祭坛绕了一圈。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_IVY.2"
msgid "I could trace an entire vine without finding its roots."
msgstr "沿着这根藤找了半天，也没找到根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the queen beast here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把女王野兽留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.1"
msgid "I'd draw the beast of hunger before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把饥饿之兽画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE1.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.1"
msgid "I'd draw the beast of hunger before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把饥饿之兽画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_STATUE2.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.1"
msgid "I'll watch the old beefalo without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动老皮弗娄牛，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BEEFALO.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "轻一点，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.1"
msgid "I'll remember where it grows."
msgstr "我要记住它长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BERRYBUSH.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.1"
msgid "We'll need the silver bowl close to the kitchen."
msgstr "银碗得留在厨房近处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_BOWL_SILVER.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep it in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把它收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CARROT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.1"
msgid "I'd bring the large casserole dish over to the cook."
msgstr "我把大法国砂锅拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.1"
msgid "I'd bring the small casserole dish over to the cook."
msgstr "我把小法国砂锅拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CASSEROLEDISH_SMALL.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.1"
msgid "I should count this twice before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前我得数上两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN1.2"
msgid "There's a particular clink to the local currency."
msgstr "这里的钱币碰起来有种特别的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.1"
msgid "I should count this twice before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前我得数上两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN2.2"
msgid "There's a particular clink to the local currency."
msgstr "这里的钱币碰起来有种特别的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.1"
msgid "I should count this twice before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前我得数上两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN3.2"
msgid "There's a particular clink to the local currency."
msgstr "这里的钱币碰起来有种特别的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.1"
msgid "I should count this twice before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前我得数上两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_COIN4.2"
msgid "There's a particular clink to the local currency."
msgstr "这里的钱币碰起来有种特别的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the crab meat."
msgstr "我想到一道能用蟹肉的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked crab meat."
msgstr "吃熟蟹肉我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABMEAT_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the crab trap."
msgstr "放下螃蟹陷阱时要做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRABTRAP.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "别让回营地的人不小心踩上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.1"
msgid "Something's packed under those boards."
msgstr "木板里面装着东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_CRATE.2"
msgid "I wonder what the kitchen's been sent."
msgstr "不知给厨房送来了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.1"
msgid "I'll remember where the fern grows."
msgstr "我要记住蕨类植物长在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FERN.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.1"
msgid "I'd bring the flour back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把面粉带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FLOUR.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked foliage cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟蕨叶要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOLIAGE_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to share it after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.1"
msgid "The Gnaw should be pleased with that dish."
msgstr "暴食饕餮该会喜欢这道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH.2"
msgid "We cooked what it asked for."
msgstr "我们照它的要求做好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.1"
msgid "The flavour's right. I wish there were more of it."
msgstr "味道对了，可惜分量少了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MATCH_BUT_SNACK.2"
msgid "This is only a mouthful for the Gnaw."
msgstr "对暴食饕餮来说，这只够吃一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.1"
msgid "This isn't the dish it asked for."
msgstr "它点的不是这道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD.MISMATCH.2"
msgid "Back to the kitchen. We still have a chance."
msgstr "回厨房去，还有机会。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.1"
msgid "I think I can smell that from outside the tent."
msgstr "站在帐篷外都能闻到这气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_FOOD_BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll keep this well away from the fresh ingredients."
msgstr "得让它离新鲜食材远点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the garlic."
msgstr "我想到一道能用大蒜的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the roast garlic cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "烤大蒜要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save it for planting day."
msgstr "我得把它留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GARLIC_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the billy."
msgstr "得记住回到比利这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATKID.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.1"
msgid "The cook will want this while it's fresh."
msgstr "得趁这奶还新鲜时交给厨师。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMILK.2"
msgid "I'd take a little in my tea, if there's any to spare."
msgstr "如果有剩，我想倒一点在茶里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the mumsy again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看玛姆茜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GOATMUM.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.1"
msgid "We'll need the large grill close to the kitchen."
msgstr "大烤架得留在厨房近处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.1"
msgid "We'll need the large grill close to the kitchen."
msgstr "大烤架得留在厨房近处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.1"
msgid "I'd bring the small grill over to the cook."
msgstr "我把小烤架拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd bring the small grill over to the cook."
msgstr "我把小烤架拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_GRILL_SMALL_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the hoe in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给锄头腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_HOE.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.1"
msgid "I'll keep the key in its own pocket."
msgstr "钥匙得单独装一个口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得记住钥匙齿朝哪边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.1"
msgid "I'll keep the iron key in its own pocket."
msgstr "铁钥匙得单独装一个口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_KEY_PARK.2"
msgid "I won't leave this lying around."
msgstr "这个不能随手乱放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.1"
msgid "I'd put the streetlight where everyone can see it."
msgstr "我会把街灯放在大家都看得见的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_POST.2"
msgid "It would help to mark the path before dark."
msgstr "天黑前把路标好会方便很多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.1"
msgid "It's just high enough to light the path."
msgstr "这高度刚好能照亮小路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_LAMP_SHORT.2"
msgid "I'd stand beside this to read the order."
msgstr "我想借这盏灯看看点了什么菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.1"
msgid "I can feel the grit on the grinding surface."
msgstr "能摸到碾面上粗糙的纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MEALINGSTONE.2"
msgid "I'll work slowly, so nothing spills over the edge."
msgstr "慢慢磨，才不会洒到外面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.1"
msgid "I'd approach the rundown house quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近鱼人屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERMHOUSE.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.1"
msgid "A trader! I'd like to see the wares."
msgstr "是商贩！我想看看都卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART1.2"
msgid "Do you take coins here?"
msgstr "这里收钱币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.1"
msgid "A trader! I'd like to see the wares."
msgstr "是商贩！我想看看都卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MERM_CART2.2"
msgid "Do you take coins here?"
msgstr "这里收钱币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.1"
msgid "I'd bring the mushroom back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把蘑菇带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMS.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the mushroom in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的蘑菇。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the mushroom time to grow back."
msgstr "得给蘑菇些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_MUSHROOMSTUMP.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the onion."
msgstr "我想到一道能用洋葱的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION.2"
msgid "We should check the order before we start cooking."
msgstr "做菜前得先看看点单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the roast onion."
msgstr "吃烤洋葱我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save it for planting day."
msgstr "我得把它留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ONION_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'll keep a few back for a second sowing."
msgstr "我会留些给下一拨播种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.1"
msgid "I'd set the oven beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把烤箱放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the oven."
msgstr "我先给烤箱腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_OVEN_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the iron fence."
msgstr "我标一下发现铁栅栏的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARKSPIKE.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the gnaw worshipper when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过饕餮敬拜者看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the gnaw worshipper when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过饕餮敬拜者看看。"

