msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_ANGEL2.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

