msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the fountain when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过喷泉看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_FOUNTAIN.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the iron gate when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过铁门看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the iron gate when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过铁门看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_GATE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the stone pillar when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过石柱看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_OBELISK.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet walk past the urn when the kitchen closes."
msgstr "等厨房收工，我想静静走过骨灰瓮看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PARK_URN.2"
msgid "I wonder how this park looked when it was busy."
msgstr "不知道以前人多的时候，这座公园是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.1"
msgid "I can see the pebble crab through the water."
msgstr "隔着水也看得见石蟹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PEBBLECRAB.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光线变化真大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.1"
msgid "I don't see any movement now."
msgstr "现在看不到动静了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the pigeon with its wings spread."
msgstr "我想画下鸽子展翅的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "There's a feather caught in the breeze."
msgstr "有根羽毛被风吹起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the pigeon, please."
msgstr "经过鸽子时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PIGEON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.1"
msgid "I'd bring the silver plate over to the cook."
msgstr "我把银盘拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PLATE_SILVER.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the salt pond."
msgstr "从盐池回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POND_SALT.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the ancient gateway by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清远古大门，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the ancient key."
msgstr "从远古钥匙回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_PORTAL_KEY.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.1"
msgid "I'd bring the large cookpot over to the cook."
msgstr "我把大锅拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.1"
msgid "I'd bring the potato over to the cook."
msgstr "我把土豆拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd bring the roast potato over to the cook."
msgstr "我把烤土豆拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'd bring it over to the cook."
msgstr "我把它拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POTATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.1"
msgid "I'd bring the pot hanger over to the cook."
msgstr "我把挂锅装置拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.1"
msgid "We'll need the pot hanger close to the kitchen."
msgstr "挂锅装置得留在厨房近处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_HANGER_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.1"
msgid "We'll need the cookpot close to the kitchen."
msgstr "锅得留在厨房近处。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SMALL.2"
msgid "I'll set it down where nobody will knock it over."
msgstr "我把它放到不会被碰翻的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.1"
msgid "I'd bring the syrup pot over to the cook."
msgstr "我把糖浆锅拿给掌勺的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_POT_SYRUP.2"
msgid "I'd clean it before the next course."
msgstr "上下一道菜前得先洗净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.1"
msgid "We waited too long before collecting this."
msgstr "收的时候已经太迟了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ROTTEN_CROP.2"
msgid "I wouldn't serve that to anyone."
msgstr "我不会端这个给人吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.1"
msgid "I'd draw the wrecked bicycle before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把损毁的自行车画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_BIKE.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the broken carriage?"
msgstr "上次站在破烂的马车前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CARRIAGE.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the dilapidated cathedral?"
msgstr "上次站在残破的大教堂前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CATHEDRAL.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.1"
msgid "I'd draw the dilapidated chimney before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把残破的烟囱画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.1"
msgid "I'd draw the dilapidated chimney before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把残破的烟囱画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CHIMNEY2.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the smashed clock?"
msgstr "上次站在砸烂的时钟前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCK.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.1"
msgid "I'd draw the dilapidated clocktower before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把残破的钟楼画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_CLOCKTOWER.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1.1"
msgid "There used to be a doorway here."
msgstr "这里曾经有扇门。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.1.2"
msgid "A family ate their supper here once."
msgstr "曾有一家人在这里吃晚饭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2.1"
msgid "I can make out the hearth."
msgstr "我认得出原本的炉灶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.2.2"
msgid "There's nobody left to ask."
msgstr "如今找不到能问的人了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3.1"
msgid "Someone must remember this street."
msgstr "一定还有人记得这条街。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_HOUSE.3.2"
msgid "I'll take care not to tread on their things."
msgstr "我会小心，不踩到他们的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.1"
msgid "I'd draw the dilapidated door before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把残破的门画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_PUBDOOR.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.1"
msgid "I'd draw the dilapidated roof before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把残破的屋顶画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_RUBBLE_ROOF.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the safe in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的保险箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I can't get the safe open right now."
msgstr "现在打不开保险箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAFE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my fingers clear of the fastening."
msgstr "手指还是离扣合处远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.1"
msgid "I'd take the salmon straight to the cook."
msgstr "我想把三文鱼直接送进厨房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the cooked salmon cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "熟三文鱼要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALMON_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the salt."
msgstr "我想到一道能用盐的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT.2"
msgid "We should check the order before we start cooking."
msgstr "做菜前得先看看点单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the salt crystals just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着盐晶，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALTROCK.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd bring the salt rack back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把盐架带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.1"
msgid "Time to see what the salt rack has for us."
msgstr "该看看盐架这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK.READY.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the salt rack before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开盐架以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SALT_RACK_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the sap to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把汁液带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the tree tapping kit out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到树液采集工具包。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPBUCKET.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I'd like to see it growing near camp."
msgstr "我想让它长在营地附近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.1"
msgid "We waited too long before collecting this."
msgstr "收的时候已经太迟了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SAP_SPOILED.2"
msgid "I wouldn't serve that to anyone."
msgstr "我不会端这个给人吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "I'll mark the row where I sow it."
msgstr "播下它的那一行，我会做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "I'll keep a few back for a second sowing."
msgstr "我会留些给下一拨播种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the slaughter tools."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对屠宰工具了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SLAUGHTERTOOL.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the spot spice."
msgstr "我想到一道能用斑点香料的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_GROUND.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the spotty shrub."
msgstr "我想到一道能用带斑点的小灌木的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "We should check the order before we start cooking."
msgstr "做菜前得先看看点单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.1"
msgid "I have a dish in mind for the spotty shrub."
msgstr "我想到一道能用带斑点的小灌木的菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SHRUB.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.1"
msgid "I'd take the spotty sprig straight to the cook."
msgstr "我想把带斑点的小枝直接送进厨房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SPOTSPICE_SPRIG.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the sugarwood tree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把糖木树的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.1"
msgid "Nothing of the sugarwood tree above the stump now."
msgstr "糖木树只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.STUMP.2"
msgid "I can count the rings from here."
msgstr "站在这里都能数年轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.1"
msgid "Little bugs have found the sap bucket."
msgstr "小虫子找到树液桶了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_BUGS.2"
msgid "I should clear them out before the sap spoils."
msgstr "得赶在树液变坏前把虫清出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.1"
msgid "The bucket hasn't caught any sap yet."
msgstr "桶里还没接到树液。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll leave it hanging a little longer."
msgstr "让它再挂一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.1"
msgid "I think the sugarwood tree is ready now."
msgstr "我看糖木树这边已经准备好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.1"
msgid "The bark has a deep wound."
msgstr "树皮上有一道深伤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.WOUNDED.2"
msgid "I'd rather give this tree time to heal."
msgstr "我想给这棵树一点恢复的时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.1"
msgid "I wonder what it looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，它是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the swamp pig elder."
msgstr "得记住回到沼泽猪长老这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the swamp pig elder, please."
msgstr "经过沼泽猪长老时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIGELDER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the worn pig house today."
msgstr "不知道今天破烂的猪屋里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.1"
msgid "I'd approach the house rubble quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近房子碎石时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SWAMPIG_HOUSE_RUBBLE.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the syrup to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把糖浆带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SYRUP.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.1"
msgid "I'd take the toma root straight to the cook."
msgstr "我想把番茄直接送进厨房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO.2"
msgid "We should check the order before we start cooking."
msgstr "做菜前得先看看点单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the roast toma root."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份烤番茄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep it in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把它收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TOMATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.1"
msgid "A trader! I'd like to see the wares."
msgstr "是商贩！我想看看都卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM.2"
msgid "Do you take coins here?"
msgstr "这里收钱币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.1"
msgid "A trader! I'd like to see the wares."
msgstr "是商贩！我想看看都卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TRADER_MERM2.2"
msgid "Do you take coins here?"
msgstr "这里收钱币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.1"
msgid "I'd take the turnip straight to the cook."
msgstr "我想把大萝卜直接送进厨房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP.2"
msgid "We should check the order before we start cooking."
msgstr "做菜前得先看看点单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the roast turnip before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤大萝卜，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep it in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把它收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_TURNIP_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'll keep a few back for a second sowing."
msgstr "我会留些给下一拨播种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.1"
msgid "I'd take the wheat straight to the cook."
msgstr "我想把小麦直接送进厨房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT.2"
msgid "I'll set some aside for the next recipe."
msgstr "我留一些给下一道菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I'll mark the row where I sow it."
msgstr "播下它的那一行，我会做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_WHEAT_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.1"
msgid "I'd like the queen's torch near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让女王火炬靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.QUEEN_TORCH.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "That twitch of the ears means it's seen me."
msgstr "耳朵动了，它已经看见我了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sit still. No need to frighten it."
msgstr "我坐着不动，别吓到它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBIT.HELD.2"
msgid "It's much smaller this close."
msgstr "拿到跟前显得真小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the warren wreath."
msgstr "不知道洞穴花环会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the rabbit hole."
msgstr "从兔洞回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.1"
msgid "The mouth of the burrow has closed up."
msgstr "洞口已经封住了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOLE.SPRING.2"
msgid "I don't see any little tracks outside today."
msgstr "今天没看见洞口外有小脚印。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the rabbit hutch."
msgstr "兔屋烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the rabbit hutch quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近兔屋时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITHOUSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.1"
msgid "I'll keep the burrowing horn apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "挖洞兔号角得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN.2"
msgid "There's no reason to let good material go to waste."
msgstr "好材料没理由白白浪费。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the portable den."
msgstr "该检查一下便携式巢穴里已经装了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGHORN_CHEST.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the royal rabbit enforcer from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察皇家兔子警卫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGMINION_BUNNYMAN.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.1"
msgid "I'll keep the rabbit king cudgel where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把兔王棍放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKINGSPEAR.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.1"
msgid "Look, the wrathful rabbit king has noticed us."
msgstr "看，暴戾兔王注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_AGGRESSIVE.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.1"
msgid "Look, the fortuitous rabbit has noticed us."
msgstr "看，机缘兔子注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_LUCKY.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the benevolent rabbit king before it moves again."
msgstr "趁和善兔王没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RABBITKING_PASSIVE.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.1"
msgid "I still check the edge after every storm."
msgstr "每场雷雨过后，我都会再看一眼刀刃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAIKIRI.2"
msgid "When thunder rolls, my hand finds this hilt."
msgstr "一听见雷声，我的手就会去找这把刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.1"
msgid "I might wear the rain coat to camp today."
msgstr "今天回营地，也许可以穿戴雨衣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINCOAT.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the tentacle spots to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了触手皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the rain hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下雨帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the rainometer but ash."
msgstr "雨量计只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the rainometer in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的雨量计。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAINOMETER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.1"
msgid "I could smell the ratatouille from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了蔬菜杂烩的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RATATOUILLE.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the razor in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给剃刀腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RAZOR.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REBAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REBAR.1"
msgid "I'd rather wrap the grip before I carry that."
msgstr "我得先把握的地方缠起来再拿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REBAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REBAR.2"
msgid "It weighs more than it looks. Just ask my wrist."
msgstr "看着不沉，我的手腕可不同意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the record out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到唱片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD.2"
msgid "I can see where the batilisk wing went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了洞穴蝙蝠翅膀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.1"
msgid "I could put it on after supper."
msgstr "吃过晚饭我想放它听听。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_BALATRO.2"
msgid "I'd best hold it by the edges."
msgstr "最好只拿边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.1"
msgid "I could put “Creepy Forest” on after supper."
msgstr "吃过晚饭我想放《惊悚森林》听听。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_CREEPYFOREST.2"
msgid "Would you stay and listen with me?"
msgstr "愿意留下来和我一起听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.1"
msgid "I could put it on after supper."
msgstr "吃过晚饭我想放它听听。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DANGER.2"
msgid "Would you stay and listen with me?"
msgstr "愿意留下来和我一起听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.1"
msgid "I could put it on after supper."
msgstr "吃过晚饭我想放它听听。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DAWN.2"
msgid "I'll listen to the end before I change the music."
msgstr "我想听到最后再换曲子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.1"
msgid "I wonder how “D.R. Style” sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听《D.R.风格》是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DRSTYLE.2"
msgid "I'd best hold it by the edges."
msgstr "最好只拿边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.1"
msgid "I wonder how it sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听它是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_DUSK.2"
msgid "I'll listen to the end before I change the music."
msgstr "我想听到最后再换曲子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.1"
msgid "I wonder how “E.F.S.” sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听《E.F.S.》是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_EFS.2"
msgid "Would you stay and listen with me?"
msgstr "愿意留下来和我一起听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.1"
msgid "I wonder how it sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听它是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_END.2"
msgid "I'll listen to the end before I change the music."
msgstr "我想听到最后再换曲子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.1"
msgid "I wonder how “Hallowed Night” sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听《万圣夜》是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_HALLOWEDNIGHTS.2"
msgid "Would you stay and listen with me?"
msgstr "愿意留下来和我一起听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.1"
msgid "I could put it on after supper."
msgstr "吃过晚饭我想放它听听。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_MAIN.2"
msgid "Would you stay and listen with me?"
msgstr "愿意留下来和我一起听吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.1"
msgid "I wonder how it sounds from across the camp."
msgstr "不知在营地另一头听它是什么感觉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RECORD_WORKTOBEDONE.2"
msgid "I'd best hold it by the edges."
msgstr "最好只拿边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.1"
msgid "The red shows even when I close my fingers over it."
msgstr "就算手指合着，那点红色还是透得出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDGEM.2"
msgid "I should keep it in a padded pouch."
msgstr "我得给它找个有衬垫的小袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.1"
msgid "I'd bring the red lantern back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把红灯笼带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDLANTERN.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.1"
msgid "A little light brings the colour out in the red moonlens."
msgstr "照点光就能看清红色月眼的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDMOONEYE.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.1"
msgid "I should count this twice before we trade."
msgstr "做买卖前我得数上两遍。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REDPOUCH.2"
msgid "There's a particular clink to the local currency."
msgstr "这里的钱币碰起来有种特别的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.1"
msgid "I can recognize the cap. Knowing when to eat it is another matter."
msgstr "我认得这菇帽，什么时候吃倒得再想想。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP.2"
msgid "I'd ask about this mushroom before it went into the pot."
msgstr "这朵蘑菇下锅前，我想先问清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the cooked red cap."
msgstr "吃熟红蘑菇我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_CAP_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The cap is quite firm at the edges."
msgstr "菇帽的边缘还很挺实。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll mark the patch. It might be worth coming back."
msgstr "我给这片地方做个记号，以后再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the red mushroom is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出红蘑菇藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.INGROUND.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the red mushroom time to grow back."
msgstr "得给红蘑菇些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RED_MUSHROOM.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the reeds!"
msgstr "离着火的芦苇远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the reeds for my notes."
msgstr "我想把芦苇的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the reeds today."
msgstr "今天从芦苇上已经摘不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REEDS.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "这时候还是别动根了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.1"
msgid "A bit of the collected dust is worth setting aside."
msgstr "尘土块值得留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFINED_DUST.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the thulecite bug net."
msgstr "要做铥矿捕虫网，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.1"
msgid "I'd check the fit of the summer frest before I rely on it."
msgstr "得先试过清凉夏装合不合身，再指望它护着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REFLECTIVEVEST.2"
msgid "I'll check the fastening twice."
msgstr "我得再检查一次搭扣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the relic here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把遗物留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RELIC.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the science machine in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出科学机器的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the science machine?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用科学机器？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the log to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the alchemy engine."
msgstr "炼金引擎烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the alchemy engine?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用炼金引擎？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB2.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the shadow manipulator stood."
msgstr "暗影操控器原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd lay my materials out beside the shadow manipulator."
msgstr "我想在暗影操控器旁把材料排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the nightmare fuel to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了噩梦燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the prestihatitator."
msgstr "灵子分解器烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd lay my materials out beside the prestihatitator."
msgstr "我想在灵子分解器旁把材料排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESEARCHLAB4.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the clean sweeper."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对清洁扫把了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESKIN_TOOL.2"
msgid "I can see where the petals went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the meat effigy in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出肉块雕像的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the meat effigy here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把肉块雕像留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTATUE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the touch stone if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，试金石也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RESURRECTIONSTONE.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the telltale heart in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给告密的心腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.REVIVER.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the spectral cure-all."
msgstr "要做灵魂万灵药，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the rhinocebro snapback from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见后扣帽犀牛兄弟，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RHINODRILL.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.1"
msgid "I'll keep the roasted turkey in its own pocket."
msgstr "烤火鸡得单独装一个口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROASTTURKEY.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得记住钥匙齿朝哪边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the redbird from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看红雀就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.1"
msgid "I can feel it moving in my hands."
msgstr "能感觉到它在手里动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the snowbird from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看雪雀就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBIN_WINTER.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the ironclad costume pattern flat in my pack."
msgstr "我把铁甲礼服款式平平整整地收进包里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "One careful read now will save mistakes later."
msgstr "现在认真读一遍，等会儿就少出错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.1"
msgid "Can you hear me in there?"
msgstr "你在那里听得见我吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROBOT_PUPPET.2"
msgid "I wish I could untangle whatever's holding you."
msgstr "真想替你解开那些束缚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.1"
msgid "There's a grain to it if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，它也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想问问铁匠，这东西能怎么用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.1"
msgid "I'll keep the flatter stones for the fire ring."
msgstr "平些的石块留着围火。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKS.2"
msgid "There's stone dust in every pocket now."
msgstr "现在每个衣袋里都有石粉了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.ACID.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.1"
msgid "I'll wait until it uncurls."
msgstr "我等它舒展开来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.BOULDER.2"
msgid "Easy to miss it among the rocks when it does that."
msgstr "它这样缩起来，很容易被当成石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The shell moved before I noticed the claws."
msgstr "我先看见壳在动，才注意到那对钳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Even at rest it takes up most of the passage."
msgstr "它光趴着就占了大半条路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.1"
msgid "I'll keep clear of that stuff."
msgstr "我可得离这东西远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.ACID.2"
msgid "Cover up before you go any nearer."
msgstr "再靠近以前，先护好自己。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.1"
msgid "I'll wait until it uncurls."
msgstr "我等它舒展开来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.BOULDER.2"
msgid "Easy to miss it among the rocks when it does that."
msgstr "它这样缩起来，很容易被当成石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The shell moved before I noticed the claws."
msgstr "我先看见壳在动，才注意到那对钳子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Even at rest it takes up most of the passage."
msgstr "它光趴着就占了大半条路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the blighted rock master if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，枯萎岩石大师也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCKY_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.1"
msgid "I should tend to the stone fruit bush before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下石果灌木丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BARREN.2"
msgid "I ought to check the soil here."
msgstr "我得看看这里的土。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over the stone fruit bush!"
msgstr "火快把石果灌木丛吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the stone fruit bush."
msgstr "碰石果灌木丛还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the stone fruit bush."
msgstr "石果灌木丛表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.DISEASING.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the stone fruit bush changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时石果灌木丛会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the stone fruit bush time to grow back."
msgstr "得给石果灌木丛些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I should tend to the stone fruit bush before I leave."
msgstr "离开前得照料一下石果灌木丛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_BUSH.WITHERED.2"
msgid "The leaves have lost their spring."
msgstr "叶片已经蔫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.1"
msgid "I wonder how much of it is pit and how much is fruit."
msgstr "不知道里面有多少是核，多少是果肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT.2"
msgid "The outside could fool me into leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "光看外面，我真会当石头留在地上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.1"
msgid "I wonder how much of it is pit and how much is fruit."
msgstr "不知道里面有多少是核，多少是果肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE.2"
msgid "The outside could fool me into leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "光看外面，我真会当石头留在地上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.1"
msgid "I wonder how much of it is pit and how much is fruit."
msgstr "不知道里面有多少是核，多少是果肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_RIPE_COOKED.2"
msgid "The outside could fool me into leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "光看外面，我真会当石头留在地上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.1"
msgid "I wonder how much of it is pit and how much is fruit."
msgstr "不知道里面有多少是核，多少是果肉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_AVOCADO_FRUIT_SPROUT.2"
msgid "The outside could fool me into leaving it on the ground."
msgstr "光看外面，我真会当石头留在地上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the mini glacier if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，迷你冰川也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.1"
msgid "The ice is all water now."
msgstr "冰已经全化成水了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE.MELTED.2"
msgid "We'll have to wait for the cold to return."
msgstr "得等天气重新冷下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.1"
msgid "No ice to collect from that puddle now."
msgstr "那滩水里已经采不到冰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_ICE_MELTED.2"
msgid "I'll remember this spot when the ground freezes again."
msgstr "等地面再结冰，我会记得来这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's a glow coming up from the ground."
msgstr "光是从地底下透出来的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see the stones at my feet by that glow."
msgstr "借着这点光，可以看清脚下的石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.1"
msgid "There's not much left to keep the lava pit going."
msgstr "够熔岩坑用的燃料不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.LOW.2"
msgid "I'll go fetch fuel before it runs out."
msgstr "我趁它没耗尽，去取点燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.1"
msgid "I could sit beside the lava pit for a while."
msgstr "我可以在熔岩坑旁边坐一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.NORMAL.2"
msgid "Just right. No need to feed it yet."
msgstr "这样正好，暂时不用添燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.1"
msgid "I remember the lava pit giving rather more light than this."
msgstr "我记得熔岩坑亮着时可比这样有用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_LIGHT.OUT.2"
msgid "We'll have to light it again."
msgstr "得重新点起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the boulder just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着岩石，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_MOON.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想问问铁匠，这东西能怎么用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.1"
msgid "I'd like a drawing of the petrified tree for my notes."
msgstr "我想把石化树的样子画进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how it changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时它会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROCK_PETRIFIED_TREE_OLD.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.1"
msgid "I'd watch the clockwork rook from just over here."
msgstr "我站在这边看发条战车就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK.2"
msgid "I'll wait and see which way it turns."
msgstr "我等一等，看它会朝哪边转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.1"
msgid "I wonder what the damaged rook noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道损坏的发条战车比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROOK_NIGHTMARE.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.1"
msgid "I can feel each strand under my thumb."
msgstr "拇指能摸出每一股草绳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE.2"
msgid "I'll coil it now so it pays out cleanly later."
msgstr "我先盘好，要用时就不会缠成结。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the spelunker's bridge kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开洞穴探险者的桥梁套件以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROPE_BRIDGE_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Would the rose-colored glasses leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着玫瑰色眼镜还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROSEGLASSESHAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the petals if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I think I can smell that from outside the tent."
msgstr "站在帐篷外都能闻到这气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROTTENEGG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep this well away from the fresh ingredients."
msgstr "得让它离新鲜食材远点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.1"
msgid "I wonder if Warly would season the royal jelly differently."
msgstr "不知道沃利会怎么给蜂王浆调味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.ROYAL_JELLY.2"
msgid "I'm hungry enough to try a bite now."
msgstr "我现在就有点想尝一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.1"
msgid "I'd draw the rubble before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把碎石画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUBBLE.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the thulecite crown with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下铥矿皇冠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINSHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.1"
msgid "I'd give the thulecite club room to turn."
msgstr "得给铥矿棒留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_BAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the living log if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些活木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the broken relic?"
msgstr "上次站在破损遗物前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.RUINS_RUBBLE.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to check what's already in the ancient chest."
msgstr "该检查一下远古宝箱里已经装了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I can't get the ancient chest open right now."
msgstr "现在打不开远古宝箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SACRED_CHEST.LOCKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my fingers clear of the fastening."
msgstr "手指还是离扣合处远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.1"
msgid "I'll keep the saddlehorn apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "鞍角得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLEHORN.2"
msgid "There's no reason to let good material go to waste."
msgstr "好材料没理由白白浪费。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the saddle to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_BASIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the beefalo wool went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了牛毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the glossamer saddle to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉闪亮鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_RACE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the butterfly wings if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蝴蝶翅膀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the nightmare saddle to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉梦魇鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_SHADOW.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the pure horror if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些纯粹恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the war saddle to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉战争鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WAR.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the steel wool if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些钢丝绵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the battle saddle to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉战斗鞍具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SADDLE_WATHGRITHR.2"
msgid "I can see where the marble went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了大理石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the salsa fresca aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点生鲜萨尔萨酱给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALSA.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.1"
msgid "Is there room in the salt box for our spare supplies?"
msgstr "盐盒里还能装下备用物资吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTBOX.2"
msgid "I can see where the salt crystals went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了盐晶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the salt lick to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉舔盐块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the nitre to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了硝石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the gourmet salt lick to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉美味舔盐块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTLICK_IMPROVED.2"
msgid "I can see where the salt crystals went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了盐晶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the salt crystals just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着盐晶，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTROCK.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the salt formation."
msgstr "我标一下发现盐堆的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll walk round it once for a better look."
msgstr "我绕一圈，看得仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.1"
msgid "There's fresh growth on the salt formation."
msgstr "能看出盐堆已经长了不少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.GROWING.2"
msgid "I should mark the height and come back tomorrow."
msgstr "我可以记下高度，明天再来比比。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.1"
msgid "No salt left to gather here."
msgstr "这里的盐已经采完了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTSTACK.MINED_OUT.2"
msgid "I'll check the other stacks."
msgstr "我去看看别的盐堆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the salty dog before it moves again."
msgstr "趁咸狗没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOG.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the salty dog's hat."
msgstr "不知道咸狗帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SALTY_DOGHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the sand castle in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的沙堡。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDBLOCK.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the sand spike in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的沙刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANDSPIKE.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "There. the obelisk is working."
msgstr "好了，方尖碑开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the obelisk."
msgstr "方尖碑现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SANITYROCK.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the sapling!"
msgstr "树苗着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the sapling."
msgstr "树苗表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASED.2"
msgid "Don't let that spread any farther."
msgstr "不能让它继续扩散。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.1"
msgid "I'll keep my gloves on around the sapling."
msgstr "碰树苗还是戴着手套好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.DISEASING.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Those thin branches bend before they break."
msgstr "细枝要先弯下去才会折断。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can take a twig without hurting the roots."
msgstr "我可以折根细枝，不伤到根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the sapling time to grow back."
msgstr "得给树苗些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.1"
msgid "I hate seeing the sapling in this condition."
msgstr "看到树苗成了这样，真让人难受。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SAPLING.WITHERED.2"
msgid "The leaves have lost their spring."
msgstr "叶片已经蔫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the bio data."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对生物数据了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCANDATA.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the processing circuit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做处理器电路就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the friendly scarecrow!"
msgstr "离着火的友善的稻草人远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the friendly scarecrow in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出友善的稻草人的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the friendly scarecrow again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看友善的稻草人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCARECROW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut grass if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采下的草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.1"
msgid "I wonder what the crispy skeleton looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，易碎骷髅是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCORCHED_SKELETON.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.1"
msgid "I'll try to find where the lost scrapbook page fits."
msgstr "我想找出丢失的图鉴页面该装在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPBOOK_PAGE.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the scrappy chapauldron."
msgstr "不知道拾荒尖帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAPHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the horizon expandinator with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下视界扩展器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCRAP_MONOCLEHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.1"
msgid "The stone's in place for the sculptor."
msgstr "雕刻用的石头已经就位。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BLOCK.2"
msgid "I should step back to judge the proportions."
msgstr "我得退几步才看得准比例。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the potter's wheel."
msgstr "陶轮烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Room to spare in the potter's wheel."
msgstr "陶轮里面还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTINGTABLE.SCULPTURE.1"
