msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.1"
msgid "Now I can see how the marble pieces meet."
msgstr "现在能看清几块大理石是怎样拼合的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SCULPTURE_BISHOPBODY.COVERED.2"
msgid "I'll look at the sculpture from the other side too."
msgstr "我也想从另一面看看雕像。"

