msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the think tank in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出智囊团的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd lay my materials out beside the think tank."
msgstr "我想在智囊团旁把材料排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFARING_PROTOTYPER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.1"
msgid "I could make room for the seafood gumbo at supper."
msgstr "晚饭还能给海鲜浓汤留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEAFOODGUMBO.2"
msgid "A smaller portion for me if we're sharing."
msgstr "如果大家分着吃，我少拿一点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sea stack looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，海蚀柱是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEASTACK.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the spark ark back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把火花柜带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the spark ark in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给火花柜腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SECURITY_PULSE_CAGE_FULL.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the ice crystaleyezer kit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做冰眼结晶器套装就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.1"
msgid "I'd try the seed pack-it on with my hair tied back."
msgstr "试穿种子袋之前，我想先把头发扎好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDPOUCH.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the broken shell to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了外壳碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the seeds in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把种子收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the toasted seeds before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤种子，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED.2"
msgid "I should eat before practice this time."
msgstr "这次得记得先吃饭再练习。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the ocuvigil in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的月眼守卫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SENTRYWARD.2"
msgid "I can see where the purple moonlens went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了紫色月眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the sewing kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放针线包够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_KIT.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the mannequin."
msgstr "假人烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the mannequin."
msgstr "得记住回到假人这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_MANNEQUIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the silk went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the trusty tape."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对可靠的胶布了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SEWING_TAPE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the winona's g.e.m.erator."
msgstr "要做薇诺娜的宝石发电机，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDANCER.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWDIGGER.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the shadow atrium."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对暗影心房了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWHEART.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.1"
msgid "I'll mark the rift on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下裂隙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWRIFT_PORTAL.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.1"
msgid "Watch how the rest of it follows the head."
msgstr "看它的身子怎么跟着头转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.BODY.2"
msgid "I'll keep the whole length of it in sight."
msgstr "我得让它的全身都在视线里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.1"
msgid "There! It hasn't righted itself yet."
msgstr "看，它还没恢复原状！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.FLIPPED.2"
msgid "I'll move while there's an opening."
msgstr "趁现在有空隙，我得动身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.1"
msgid "Watch how the rest of it follows the head."
msgstr "看它的身子怎么跟着头转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_CENTIPEDE.HEAD.2"
msgid "I'll keep the whole length of it in sight."
msgstr "我得让它的全身都在视线里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HANDS.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_HORNS.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_MOUTH.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_PARASITE.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.1"
msgid "The shadow moved before I did."
msgstr "我还没动，那影子就先动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOWTHRALL_WINGS.2"
msgid "I'll keep my own shadow where I can see it."
msgstr "我要站在能看得见自己影子的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the shadow maul."
msgstr "我想掂一下暗影槌的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BATTLEAXE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the possessed shadow atrium to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了附身暗影心房。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.1"
msgid "I'll introduce the beefalo gloom bell to my mount a little at a time."
msgstr "我得让坐骑慢慢熟悉阴郁皮弗娄牛铃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_BEEF_BELL.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the dark tatters to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了暗影碎布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the shadowcraft plinth?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用暗影术基座？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE.2"
msgid "I should leave the next person a clear work space."
msgstr "用完还得给下一个人留个整洁的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the shadowcraft plinth kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放暗影术基座套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_FORGE_KIT.2"
msgid "I can see where the nightmare fuel went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了噩梦燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the shadow atrium tendril in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的暗影心房卷须。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHADOW_HEART_VEIN.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the shallow grave."
msgstr "我标一下发现矮坟的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHALLOW_GRAVE.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.1"
msgid "I can just make out the rockjaw from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见岩石大白鲨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARK.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the frostjaw fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是大霜鲨。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHARKBOI.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the combriner?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用盐晶组合机？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELLWEAVER.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cookie cutter shell if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些饼干切割机壳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the shell cluster in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给贝壳堆腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHELL_CLUSTER.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.1"
msgid "My grip on the shield of terror feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住恐怖盾牌的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIELDOFTERROR.2"
msgid "A dry handle makes all the difference."
msgstr "柄干燥，握起来就稳多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.1"
msgid "Bamboo leaves a bruise too. Shall we bow first?"
msgstr "竹刀打着也会青。先行礼好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHINAI.2"
msgid "My first lesson was how to hold one of these."
msgstr "我上的第一课，就是怎么握这把竹刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.1"
msgid "Plain wood, snug at the mouth. A good place for a blade to rest."
msgstr "朴木贴合鞘口，正适合养刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHIRASAYA.2"
msgid "No fittings to catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "没有外装，衣袖也不会勾住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.1"
msgid "I'll clean the earth off the blade before it dries."
msgstr "铲口上的泥得趁没干擦掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL.2"
msgid "A neat hole makes replanting much easier."
msgstr "坑挖得齐整些，移栽就容易多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the brightshade shoevel before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂亮茄锄铲的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHOVEL_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the brightshade husk if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些亮茄外壳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the stuffed night cap to share."
msgstr "希望酿夜帽够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMBAIT.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the mushy cake after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃蘑菇蛋糕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOMCAKE.2"
msgid "I'd set a serving aside for the late watch."
msgstr "得给守后半夜的人留一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the shroom skin in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给蘑菇皮腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROOM_SKIN.2"
msgid "I should save some for the napsack."
msgstr "我该给睡袋留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the umbral abomination quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近暗影憎恶时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.1"
msgid "There! It hasn't righted itself yet."
msgstr "看，它还没恢复原状！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHROUDEN.PUDDLE.2"
msgid "I'll move while there's an opening."
msgstr "趁现在有空隙，我得动身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.1"
msgid "That black blade takes a lovely polish."
msgstr "这把黑刀磨过以后真好看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SHUSUI.2"
msgid "Give me the oilcloth. I'll look after Shusui myself."
msgstr "把油布给我吧，秋水我想自己保养。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the siesta lean-to."
msgstr "遮阳篷烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd approach the siesta lean-to quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近遮阳篷时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SIESTAHUT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.1"
msgid "Fine enough to disappear against my sleeve."
msgstr "贴在袖子上，细得都快看不见了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SILK.2"
msgid "If I wind it round a stick, it won't tangle."
msgstr "缠到小木棍上，就不容易打结。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd bring the baritone shell bell back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把低音贝壳钟带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE3.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the chorusbox circuit."
msgstr "我该给合唱盒电路留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd bring the alto shell bell back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把中音贝壳钟带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE4.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the soprano shell bell in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给高音贝壳钟腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SINGINGSHELL_OCTAVE5.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sisturn looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，姐妹骨灰罐是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut stone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.1"
msgid "Someone's taken care with the flowers here."
msgstr "有人仔细打理过这里的花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS.2"
msgid "I could leave a few petals of my own."
msgstr "我也可以留几片花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.1"
msgid "Someone's taken care with the flowers here."
msgstr "有人仔细打理过这里的花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_BLOSSOM.2"
msgid "I could leave a few petals of my own."
msgstr "我也可以留几片花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.1"
msgid "Someone's taken care with the flowers here."
msgstr "有人仔细打理过这里的花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.LOTS_OF_FLOWERS_EVIL.2"
msgid "I could leave a few petals of my own."
msgstr "我也可以留几片花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.1"
msgid "Someone's taken care with the flowers here."
msgstr "有人仔细打理过这里的花。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SISTURN.SOME_FLOWERS.2"
msgid "I could leave a few petals of my own."
msgstr "我也可以留几片花瓣。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.1"
msgid "I wonder what the skeleton looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，骷髅是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.1"
msgid "Would the bone helm leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着骨头头盔还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETONHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the skeleton again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看骷髅。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_NOTPLAYER.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT.1"
msgid "Oh, %s... I'll remember to watch out for %s."
msgstr "啊，%s……我会记得当心%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.DEFAULT.2"
msgid "Rest here, %s. I'll warn the others about %s."
msgstr "安息吧，%s。我会提醒大家提防%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE.1"
msgid "Oh, %s... I'll remember to watch out for %s."
msgstr "啊，%s……我会记得当心%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.FEMALE.2"
msgid "Rest here, %s. I'll warn the others about %s."
msgstr "安息吧，%s。我会提醒大家提防%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE.1"
msgid "Oh, %s... I'll remember to watch out for %s."
msgstr "啊，%s……我会记得当心%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.MALE.2"
msgid "Rest here, %s. I'll warn the others about %s."
msgstr "安息吧，%s。我会提醒大家提防%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT.1"
msgid "Oh, %s... I'll remember to watch out for %s."
msgstr "啊，%s……我会记得当心%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER.ROBOT.2"
msgid "Rest here, %s. I'll warn the others about %s."
msgstr "安息吧，%s。我会提醒大家提防%s。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.1"
msgid "I'll keep the ink dry. We might need to read this again."
msgstr "我会护着墨迹，之后也许还得翻看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKETCH.2"
msgid "I could copy this into my notebook back at camp."
msgstr "回营地后，我可以把它抄进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the skullchest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进骷髅箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SKULLCHEST.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the napsack this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把睡袋做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLEEPBOMB.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the canary (volatile) if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金丝雀（中毒）。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the trusty slingshot."
msgstr "沃尔特在可靠的弹弓上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd ask him before I changed the fittings."
msgstr "要改配件，我得先问过他。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.1"
msgid "I can sort the rounds so Walter can find them by touch."
msgstr "我把弹丸分好，沃尔特摸一摸就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_CONTAINER.2"
msgid "A lid that closes properly is worth a lot with ammunition this small."
msgstr "弹丸这么小，盖子一定得扣得牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "I can tell the dread pebbles apart by its weight."
msgstr "我能凭分量认出绝望小石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the dreadstone to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了绝望石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the freeze rounds in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把冰冻弹药装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_FREEZE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the moon rock to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了月岩。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the ickies in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把恶液弹装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GELBLOB.2"
msgid "I'll keep the spare shots where they won't spill."
msgstr "备用弹丸要收在不易撒出来的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the gold rounds. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把黄金弹药单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GOLD.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.1"
msgid "I can tell the kablooies apart by its weight."
msgstr "我能凭分量认出轰轰弹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_GUNPOWDER.2"
msgid "I should count the rounds before we leave."
msgstr "出门前得数清有多少发。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.1"
msgid "I can tell the stickies apart by its weight."
msgstr "我能凭分量认出黏黏弹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HONEY.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the honey if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the pure horror rounds. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把纯粹恐惧弹药单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_HORRORFUEL.2"
msgid "I should count the rounds before we leave."
msgstr "出门前得数清有多少发。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the brightshade husk rounds in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把亮茄外壳弹药装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_LUNARPLANTHUSK.2"
msgid "I should count the rounds before we leave."
msgstr "出门前得数清有多少发。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.1"
msgid "I can tell the marbles apart by its weight."
msgstr "我能凭分量认出大理石弹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MARBLE.2"
msgid "I can see where the marble went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了大理石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the moonshots. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把月亮弹单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "Walter could tell me how these fly."
msgstr "沃尔特应该知道这种弹丸飞起来怎么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the poop pellets. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把便便弹单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_POOP.2"
msgid "I'll keep the spare shots where they won't spill."
msgstr "备用弹丸要收在不易撒出来的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the pure brilliance rounds in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把纯粹辉煌弹药装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_PUREBRILLIANCE.2"
msgid "Walter could tell me how these fly."
msgstr "沃尔特应该知道这种弹丸飞起来怎么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the pebbles in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把鹅卵石装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_ROCK.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the rocks if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the shockscrap shots. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把电击废料弹单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SCRAPFEATHER.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the saffron feather to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了黄色羽毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.1"
msgid "A separate pocket for the slow-down rounds. I can find the right shot by touch."
msgstr "我想把减速弹药单独装，伸手就能找到。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_SLOW.2"
msgid "I'll keep the spare shots where they won't spill."
msgstr "备用弹丸要收在不易撒出来的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the stinger zingers in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把针刺弹装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_STINGER.2"
msgid "Walter could tell me how these fly."
msgstr "沃尔特应该知道这种弹丸飞起来怎么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.1"
msgid "I'll leave room for the cursed rounds in the pouch."
msgstr "我看看怎么把诅咒弹药装进弹袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTAMMO_THULECITE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the nightmare fuel to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了噩梦燃料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the slingshot field kit."
msgstr "沃尔特在弹弓野外作业包上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOTMODKIT.2"
msgid "I can see where the papyrus went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了莎草纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the possessed slingshot band."
msgstr "沃尔特在附身弹弓皮筋上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_MIMIC.2"
msgid "It's a different sort of practice from mine."
msgstr "这和我平时练的不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the pig skin slingshot band."
msgstr "沃尔特在猪皮弹弓皮筋上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_PIGSKIN.2"
msgid "I can see where the pig skin went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了猪皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the flailing slingshot band fits his grip."
msgstr "我想看看甩尾弹弓皮筋在他手里合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_BAND_TENTACLE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the tentacle spots if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些触手皮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the bony slingshot frame."
msgstr "沃尔特在骨制弹弓框上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_BONE.2"
msgid "It's a different sort of practice from mine."
msgstr "这和我平时练的不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the thulecite slingshot frame."
msgstr "沃尔特在铥矿弹弓框上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_GEMS.2"
msgid "I can see where the red gem went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了红宝石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the scrappier slingshot frame."
msgstr "沃尔特在加量废料弹弓框上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK.2"
msgid "I'd ask him before I changed the fittings."
msgstr "要改配件，我得先问过他。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the scrappy slingshot frame fits his grip."
msgstr "我想看看废料弹弓框在他手里合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_FRAME_WAGPUNK_0.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the scrap to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了废料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the slingshot jelly grip."
msgstr "沃尔特在蜂王浆弹弓手柄上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_JELLY.2"
msgid "It's a different sort of practice from mine."
msgstr "这和我平时练的不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the slingshot grip tape."
msgstr "沃尔特在弹弓手柄缠带上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_SILK.2"
msgid "I can see where the silk went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the slingshot sticky grip."
msgstr "沃尔特在粘性弹弓手柄上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_STICKY.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the glommer's goop to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了格罗姆的黏液。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "Walter's really put thought into the slingshot void wrap."
msgstr "沃尔特在虚空弹弓手柄上花了不少心思。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLINGSHOT_HANDLE_VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "It's a different sort of practice from mine."
msgstr "这和我平时练的不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.1"
msgid "Look, the slurper has noticed us."
msgstr "看，啜食者注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.1"
msgid "I wonder what I could make with it."
msgstr "不知它能做成什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT.2"
msgid "There's no reason to let good material go to waste."
msgstr "好材料没理由白白浪费。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the slurper pelt apart from the food in my pack."
msgstr "啜食者皮得和背包里的食物分开收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT.2"
msgid "The texture isn't what I expected."
msgstr "摸起来和我想的不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.1"
msgid "Where would I find the slurtle after dark?"
msgstr "不知道蛞蝓龟天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the shelmet with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下背壳头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the blocking circuit with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做格挡电路就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the slurtle mound by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清蛞蝓龟窝，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the slurtle slime out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到蛞蝓龟黏液。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the slimy salve."
msgstr "要做黏糊糊的药膏，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.1"
msgid "I'd keep the broken shell until we find the rest."
msgstr "在找到剩下的部分以前，先把外壳碎片留好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the potted fern with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做蕨类盆栽就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll watch the smallbird without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动小鸟，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "I should bring the smallbird something to eat."
msgstr "该给小鸟带点吃的来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "I wouldn't leave a creature hungry if I could help it."
msgstr "能帮得上忙的话，我不想让它挨饿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I can see the smallbird breathing."
msgstr "轻点，能看见小鸟呼吸的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "It's found a good place to rest."
msgstr "它找了个休息的好地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.1"
msgid "I should bring the smallbird something to eat."
msgstr "该给小鸟带点吃的来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING.2"
msgid "One moment, I have food somewhere."
msgstr "等一下，我找找有没有吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.1"
msgid "Look, the pipspook has noticed us."
msgstr "看，小惊吓注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the morsel."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给小肉配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT.2"
msgid "I should get a clean plate for this."
msgstr "我得拿个干净盘子来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the small jerky wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把小肉干包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the crocommander from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见鳄鱼指挥官，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.1"
msgid "My gloves are wet through already."
msgstr "手套已经湿透了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll roll it where there's enough fresh snow."
msgstr "要滚大一点，就得找片新雪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the snowman."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对雪人了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.1"
msgid "A good round base to build on."
msgstr "这个圆底子堆得不错。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL.2"
msgid "I'll pack the snow a little firmer."
msgstr "我把雪再压实些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the snurtle?"
msgstr "蜗牛龟平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd set the growth formula starter beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把催长剂起子放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the ashes went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了灰烬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.1"
msgid "The smell of the growth formula starter is quite enough from here."
msgstr "站在这儿已经闻够催长剂起子的味道了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED.2"
msgid "I should handle it with gloves."
msgstr "我还是戴上手套再碰吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.1"
msgid "It needs a little longer in the bottle."
msgstr "还得在瓶里再放些时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE.2"
msgid "The smell is beginning to change."
msgstr "气味已经开始变了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.1"
msgid "I'd bring the super growth formula back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把超级催长剂带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the ewecus?"
msgstr "钢羊平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPAT.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.1"
msgid "The shaft is straight and the binding sits tight."
msgstr "杆很直，缠绳也贴合。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR.2"
msgid "I'll give the point a cover before I carry it back."
msgstr "带回去前得给尖端加个套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.1"
msgid "I'd like to feel the balance of the pith pike."
msgstr "我想掂一下尖齿矛的重心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.1"
msgid "I'll keep the spiral spear where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把螺旋矛放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.1"
msgid "The battle spear takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "战斗长矛的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "轻轻试一下，比用力挥更能感觉出分量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the elding spear before taking it out."
msgstr "带奔雷矛出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING.2"
msgid "I'll keep it dry on the walk back."
msgstr "回去路上得护着，不让它淋湿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the chef pouch."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把厨师袋里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.1"
msgid "I'll save the chili flakes for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "辣椒碎要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI.2"
msgid "I can see where the pepper went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了辣椒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the garlic powder out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到蒜粉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the garlic went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了大蒜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.1"
msgid "Just a pinch between finger and thumb."
msgstr "拇指和食指捏一点就够了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT.2"
msgid "I can smell the stew better after I sprinkle this in."
msgstr "撒进去一点，炖菜的香味就更明显了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.1"
msgid "I'd set the honey crystals beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把蜂蜜水晶放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR.2"
msgid "I can see where the honey went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.1"
msgid "Poor thing. It lies so still."
msgstr "可怜，一动也不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll give it a quiet moment."
msgstr "让我安静陪它一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can feel each footfall through the silk."
msgstr "隔着蛛丝能感觉到它每一次落脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll step round the web if it lets me pass."
msgstr "只要它肯让我过去，我会绕开蛛网。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "I'll let the spider sleep a little longer."
msgstr "让蜘蛛再睡一会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on it!"
msgstr "它着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "Watch it! It isn't staying down!"
msgstr "留意它！它又要起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "I should have waited another moment."
msgstr "我就该再多等一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the spider den today."
msgstr "不知道今天蜘蛛巢里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.1"
msgid "Webber, could you show me how the spiders respond to that?"
msgstr "韦伯，你能让我看看蜘蛛会怎么回应它吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER.2"
msgid "I'd leave the introductions to someone who speaks spider."
msgstr "打招呼的事，还是交给会说蜘蛛话的人吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the spider eggs."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进蜘蛛卵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.1"
msgid "A dab of this should help a scratch close up."
msgstr "抹上一点，擦伤应该能好得快些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND.2"
msgid "It can go in the medicine pouch, tightly wrapped."
msgstr "包严实些，可以收进药袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the spiderhat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下蜘蛛帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the spilagmite by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清蛛网岩，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of it just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着它，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.1"
msgid "I'll watch the spider queen without startling it."
msgstr "我尽量不惊动蜘蛛女王，看看它在做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN.2"
msgid "Quiet now. I don't want to get too close."
msgstr "轻一点，我不想靠得太近。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from it over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到它的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Quick, give it room!"
msgstr "快退开！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.1"
msgid "I'd give the dangling depth dweller room to turn."
msgstr "得给穴居悬蛛留点转身的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.1"
msgid "I can just make out the nurse spider from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见护士蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.1"
msgid "Webber has been busy taking care of his friends."
msgstr "韦伯一直忙着照料他的朋友们。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll let him decide which spider needs this."
msgstr "交给他决定哪只蜘蛛需要它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.1"
msgid "I can hear the cave spider moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到洞穴蜘蛛就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.1"
msgid "There's no breath left in it."
msgstr "已经没气息了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD.2"
msgid "It's over. We can lower our guard."
msgstr "结束了，可以放松些了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can just make out the shattered spider from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见破碎蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Shh. I can see the shattered spider breathing."
msgstr "轻点，能看见破碎蜘蛛呼吸的起伏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.1"
msgid "Webber, could you show me how the spiders respond to that?"
msgstr "韦伯，你能让我看看蜘蛛会怎么回应它吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT.2"
msgid "I'd leave the introductions to someone who speaks spider."
msgstr "打招呼的事，还是交给会说蜘蛛话的人吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.1"
msgid "I can just make out the spitter from here."
msgstr "我在这里刚好看得见喷吐蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER.2"
msgid "I'd like to know where it shelters."
msgstr "我想知道它在哪里歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.1"
msgid "There's no breath left in it."
msgstr "已经没气息了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD.2"
msgid "I wish there had been another way."
msgstr "真希望当时还有别的办法。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can feel each footfall through the silk."
msgstr "隔着蛛丝能感觉到它每一次落脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll step round the web if it lets me pass."
msgstr "只要它肯让我过去，我会绕开蛛网。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "I'll let the spider warrior sleep a little longer."
msgstr "让蜘蛛战士再睡一会儿吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I ought to move on before I wake it."
msgstr "我该在吵醒它之前离开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.1"
msgid "I can hear the sea strider moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到海黾就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER.2"
msgid "It knows this ground better than I do."
msgstr "这里的地形，它比我熟。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.1"
msgid "Webber, could you show me how the spiders respond to that?"
msgstr "韦伯，你能让我看看蜘蛛会怎么回应它吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE.2"
msgid "I'd leave the introductions to someone who speaks spider."
msgstr "打招呼的事，还是交给会说蜘蛛话的人吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I think I can smell that from outside the tent."
msgstr "站在帐篷外都能闻到这气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep this well away from the fresh ingredients."
msgstr "得让它离新鲜食材远点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I think I can smell that from outside the tent."
msgstr "站在帐篷外都能闻到这气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep this well away from the fresh ingredients."
msgstr "得让它离新鲜食材远点。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the red spore is safe."
msgstr "我得问问红色孢子用多少才合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep it away from the cooking things."
msgstr "得和做饭的东西分开放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the lunar spore is safe."
msgstr "我得问问月亮孢子用多少才合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON.2"
msgid "I'd like to know what's in it before I try it."
msgstr "我想先弄清里头有什么再用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd label the green spore before I put it with the supplies."
msgstr "把绿色孢子收进物资前，我要先贴好标记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should save some for the fungal turf."
msgstr "我该给真菌地皮留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.1"
msgid "I can feel it moving in my hands."
msgstr "能感觉到它在手里动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD.2"
msgid "Shall I set you down somewhere quieter?"
msgstr "我把你放到安静点的地方好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd label the blue spore before I put it with the supplies."
msgstr "把蓝色孢子收进物资前，我要先贴好标记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like to know what's in it before I try it."
msgstr "我想先弄清里头有什么再用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.1"
msgid "I have you, don't wriggle so much."
msgstr "我接住你了，别扭得那么厉害。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD.2"
msgid "It's much smaller this close."
msgstr "拿到跟前显得真小。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the skittersquid?"
msgstr "鱿鱼平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SQUID.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'd like the polar light near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让极光靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'd like the dwarf star near the path after dusk."
msgstr "黄昏后，我想让矮星靠小路近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "My grip on the brightshade staff feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住亮茄魔杖的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the pure brilliance if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些纯粹辉煌。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the weather pain before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂天气风向标的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the gears to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了齿轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.1"
msgid "I could have sworn the stagehand shifted just then."
msgstr "我敢说舞台之手刚才挪动过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE.2"
msgid "I'll watch for movement before I go closer."
msgstr "先看有没有动静，再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.1"
msgid "I could have sworn the stagehand shifted just then."
msgstr "我敢说舞台之手刚才挪动过。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING.2"
msgid "I'll watch for movement before I go closer."
msgstr "先看有没有动静，再靠近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.1"
msgid "I can't help watching those hands."
msgstr "我总忍不住去看那双手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING.2"
msgid "I'll find my own seat, thank you."
msgstr "谢谢，我自己找座位就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.1"
msgid "I can't help watching those hands."
msgstr "我总忍不住去看那双手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING.2"
msgid "I'll find my own seat, thank you."
msgstr "谢谢，我自己找座位就好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.1"
msgid "I can hear the stalagmite moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到石笋就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the stalagmite again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看石笋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the reanimated skeleton fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是复活的骨架。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.1"
msgid "I don't think the ancient fuelweaver has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得远古织影者一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.1"
msgid "I wonder what the woven shadow noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道编织暗影比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.1"
msgid "I can listen. Take your time."
msgstr "我愿意听，您慢慢说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC.2"
msgid "I wonder how long you've waited for someone to answer."
msgstr "不知道您等了多久，才等到有人回应。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.1"
msgid "I want a quiet moment to look over the pirate map."
msgstr "我想静下来仔细看看海盗地图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP.2"
msgid "Dry hands first. I don't want to smudge it."
msgstr "先擦干手，别把字蹭花了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the glommer's statue at the moment."
msgstr "格罗姆雕像里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can still see the maker's cuts in the glommer's statue."
msgstr "在格罗姆雕像上还能看见雕刻的刀痕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the harp statue."
msgstr "不知雕工在竖琴雕像上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP.2"
msgid "The detail shows better from this angle."
msgstr "从这个角度看得清细节。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the overgrown statue."
msgstr "不知雕工在荆棘密布的雕像上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the maxwell statue."
msgstr "不知雕工在麦斯威尔雕像上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder how long the sculptor spent on the marble sculpture."
msgstr "不知雕工在大理石雕像上花了多久。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the outline while I have the light."
msgstr "趁着有光，我想把轮廓画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.1"
msgid "The folds look almost soft, carved like that."
msgstr "褶皱刻得几乎有了布料的柔软感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the sculptor's first sketch."
msgstr "真想看看雕工最初那张画稿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.1"
msgid "The folds look almost soft, carved like that."
msgstr "褶皱刻得几乎有了布料的柔软感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the sculptor's first sketch."
msgstr "真想看看雕工最初那张画稿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.1"
msgid "The folds look almost soft, carved like that."
msgstr "褶皱刻得几乎有了布料的柔软感。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the sculptor's first sketch."
msgstr "真想看看雕工最初那张画稿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.1"
msgid "I'd set the steel wool beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把钢丝绵放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL.2"
msgid "I should save some for the brush."
msgstr "我该给刷子留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.1"
msgid "I wonder what a heavy swell would do to the steering wheel."
msgstr "想看看遇到海浪时方向舵表现如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll have a look at the steering wheel kit while the water's calm."
msgstr "趁海面平静，我看看方向舵套装。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the boards to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the stinger out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到针刺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STINGER.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the apicultural notes with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做养蜂笔记就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Let me sit and take the weight off my feet a moment."
msgstr "让我坐一会儿，歇歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see the rest of camp quite well from this seat."
msgstr "从这个位置，营地里看得挺清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "There's no space left in the stone chair."
msgstr "石椅里面已经没位置了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "I'll leave what's in there alone for now."
msgstr "里面的东西暂时先不动了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's space here for tea and two cups."
msgstr "这里放一壶茶、两只杯子刚好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wipe the top before we lay out supper."
msgstr "摆晚饭前，我先把桌面擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's something already set out on the table."
msgstr "桌上已经摆了东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll make room before I put anything else down."
msgstr "再放东西前，我先腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.1"
msgid "What's left of the w.o.b.o.t. still shows how it fitted together."
msgstr "从瓦器人的残件还能看出原来的构造。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN.2"
msgid "I'll put the loose pieces somewhere safe."
msgstr "我把松脱的零件收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the w.o.b.o.t.."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护瓦器人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I took the cover off."
msgstr "拆开外壳之前我会先问一声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the straw hat."
msgstr "不知道草帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT.2"
msgid "I should save some for the miner hat."
msgstr "我该给矿工帽留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.1"
msgid "I'll save the stuffed eggplant for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "酿茄子要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT.2"
msgid "I remember putting the eggplant in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了茄子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the stuffing in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给烤火鸡面包馅腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.STUFFING.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the succulent to share."
msgstr "希望多肉植物够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the potted succulent."
msgstr "要做多肉盆栽，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried succulent wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干多肉包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED.2"
msgid "I like provisions I can tuck into a sleeve."
msgstr "我喜欢能塞进袖兜里的口粮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.1"
msgid "I want to look at the succulent in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看多肉植物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the potted succulent again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看多肉盆栽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the succulent if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些多肉植物。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Takina would make a list of everything in the sunken chest."
msgstr "泷奈一定会把沉底宝箱里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "It pays to know where you put the spare supplies."
msgstr "知道备用物资收在哪儿，总归省心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I can't get the sunken chest open right now."
msgstr "现在打不开沉底宝箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my fingers clear of the fastening."
msgstr "手指还是离扣合处远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the spectackler box together."
msgstr "我想知道超级钓具箱是怎么组装的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER.2"
msgid "I'll listen for any loose parts before I try it."
msgstr "试之前先听听有没有零件松动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the support pillar here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把支柱留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.1"
msgid "I'd draw the support pillar wreckage before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把支柱瓦砾画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the reinforced support pillar?"
msgstr "上次站在加固支柱前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "I'd like a closer look at the surface of the dreadstone pillar."
msgstr "我想细看一下绝望石支柱的表面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the dreadstone pillar wreckage just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着绝望石支柱瓦砾，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN.2"
msgid "I should look for a natural crack first."
msgstr "得先找找天然的裂缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.1"
msgid "I can feel the weight of the reinforced dreadstone pillar just looking at it."
msgstr "光看着加固绝望石支柱，就能想见它有多沉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE.2"
msgid "I ought to ask the smith what to make of this."
msgstr "我想问问铁匠，这东西能怎么用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.1"
msgid "There's a grain to the dreadstone pillar scaffold if you look closely."
msgstr "仔细看，绝望石支柱脚手架也有纹理。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD.2"
msgid "The colour changes where the surface has worn away."
msgstr "表面磨去的地方，颜色有些不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the pillar scaffold?"
msgstr "上次站在支柱脚手架前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.1"
msgid "Could we take the surf 'n' turf on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着海鲜牛排吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.1"
msgid "I could wear the dapper vest over my training clothes."
msgstr "练习服外面还能再穿一层犬牙背心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST.2"
msgid "It has to leave my shoulders free."
msgstr "肩膀得活动得开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.1"
msgid "I'll save the sweet potato casserole for a meal we can eat sitting down."
msgstr "红薯焗饭要留到能好好坐下吃饭的时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.1"
msgid "I should ask how long to steep the soothing tea."
msgstr "得问问舒缓茶泡多久合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA.2"
msgid "I might try a little more forget-me-lots next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些必忘我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.1"
msgid "The brightshade sword takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "亮茄剑的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT.2"
msgid "My teacher always checked the fittings first."
msgstr "老师总会先检查装具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the winter's feast table before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到冬季盛宴餐桌旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the winter's feast table."
msgstr "得记住回到冬季盛宴餐桌这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.1"
msgid "Nobody need go hungry at this table."
msgstr "这桌饭够大家吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD.2"
msgid "I'll put out a plate for the last guest too."
msgstr "我给最后一位客人也摆个盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.1"
msgid "This table calls for a different kind of dish."
msgstr "这张桌上该放另一类菜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE.2"
msgid "We'll need a proper feast dish for this."
msgstr "得取一道节庆菜来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.1"
msgid "I'd watch the tackle box at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看钓具箱怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER.2"
msgid "I'll listen for any loose parts before I try it."
msgstr "试之前先听听有没有零件松动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.1"
msgid "I'll keep the ink dry. We might need to read this again."
msgstr "我会护着墨迹，之后也许还得翻看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH.2"
msgid "I could copy this into my notebook back at camp."
msgstr "回营地后，我可以把它抄进笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put the tackle receptacle together."
msgstr "我想知道钓具容器是怎么组装的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION.2"
msgid "I'll listen for any loose parts before I try it."
msgstr "试之前先听听有没有零件松动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the taffy aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点太妃糖给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAFFY.2"
msgid "I remember putting the honey in the pot for this."
msgstr "我还记得，做这道菜时往锅里放了蜂蜜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.1"
msgid "Such long legs. I couldn't keep up with a single stride."
msgstr "腿真长，它一步我得走好几步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD.2"
msgid "I can feel that one eye following me."
msgstr "能感觉到那只眼睛一直盯着我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping the tallbird egg on the way back."
msgstr "带高脚鸟蛋回去的时候得拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG.2"
msgid "The shell's thinner than it looks."
msgstr "壳比看起来的薄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.1"
msgid "Someone saved me a portion of the fried tallbird egg."
msgstr "有人给我留了一份煎高脚鸟蛋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD.2"
msgid "That chill went straight to my fingers."
msgstr "寒意直往指尖钻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wouldn't risk dropping the hatching tallbird egg on the way back."
msgstr "带孵化中的高脚鸟蛋回去的时候得拿稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd carry it cupped in both hands."
msgstr "最好用双手捧着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT.2"
msgid "Much too hot for my bare hands."
msgstr "光着手碰太烫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.1"
msgid "It'll be some time before that's ready to hatch."
msgstr "离破壳还有一阵子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG.2"
msgid "I'll make sure the egg stays at the right temperature."
msgstr "我得留心蛋的温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.1"
msgid "Something shifted under the shell."
msgstr "壳里的东西动了一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT.2"
msgid "I'll sit quietly and watch for the first crack."
msgstr "我坐着等，看它什么时候啄开第一道缝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the tallbird nest today."
msgstr "不知道今天高脚鸟巢里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.1"
msgid "There's nothing left to pick from the tallbird nest today."
msgstr "今天从高脚鸟巢上已经摘不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED.2"
msgid "Best to leave the roots undisturbed now."
msgstr "这时候还是别动根了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the tall scotch eggs."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给苏格兰高鸟蛋配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the tamales out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到塔马利。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TAMALES.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the smallish tallbird moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到小高脚鸟就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.1"
msgid "I should bring the smallish tallbird something to eat."
msgstr "该给小高脚鸟带点吃的来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY.2"
msgid "I wouldn't leave a creature hungry if I could help it."
msgstr "能帮得上忙的话，我不想让它挨饿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Quiet footsteps near the smallish tallbird, please."
msgstr "经过小高脚鸟时请放轻脚步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "It's found a good place to rest."
msgstr "它找了个休息的好地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.1"
msgid "I can tell it's been a while since the smallish tallbird ate."
msgstr "看得出小高脚鸟很久没吃东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING.2"
msgid "One moment, I have food somewhere."
msgstr "等一下，我找找有没有吃的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.1"
msgid "I'll have to find the right piece for the telelocator focus."
msgstr "我得给传送焦点找件合适的配件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS.2"
msgid "Something of the right shape should fit there."
msgstr "那个位置得放形状对得上的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the telelocator focus."
msgstr "传送焦点的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.1"
msgid "One more section and we'll see the shape of it."
msgstr "再装一段，就能看出轮廓了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL.2"
msgid "I'll check which pieces we still need."
msgstr "我来核一下还缺哪些部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.1"
msgid "I can see how this would join another part."
msgstr "看得出这里原本还要接另一件东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING.2"
msgid "I'll sketch the fitting before I go looking for the rest."
msgstr "我先画下接口的样子，再去找其余的部分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.1"
msgid "The telelocator staff takes a different grip from my katana."
msgstr "传送魔杖的握法和我的刀不同。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "轻轻试一下，比用力挥更能感觉出分量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.1"
msgid "A sword I can draw when someone needs help."
msgstr "有人需要我时，我愿意拔出这把刀。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENSEIGA.2"
msgid "Sometimes the kindest thing I carry has a hilt."
msgstr "有时候，能救人的东西也有刀柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the tent."
msgstr "帐篷烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll take my boots off before I crawl inside."
msgstr "进去前得先把靴子脱掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A roof of my own, even if it rolls up in the morning."
msgstr "早上卷起来也没关系，今晚我有屋顶了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the tentacle before it moves again."
msgstr "趁触手没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the tentacle spike this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把触手尖刺做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE.2"
msgid "A dry handle makes all the difference."
msgstr "柄干燥，握起来就稳多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.1"
msgid "I'd bring the tentacle spots back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把触手皮带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS.2"
msgid "I should save some for the slightly less shoddy tool shed."
msgstr "我该给不那么劣质的工具棚留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.1"
msgid "I wonder if anyone's home at the big tentacle today."
msgstr "不知道今天大触手里有没有住客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN.2"
msgid "I shouldn't stand right in the doorway."
msgstr "我可不该站在门口挡路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the big tentacle?"
msgstr "上次站在大触手前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the baby tentacle?"
msgstr "上次站在小触手前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the big slimy pit by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清硕大的泥坑，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE.2"
msgid "Let's keep the way back in sight."
msgstr "先别走到看不见来路的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the terrarium again."
msgstr "现在再用盒中泰拉还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN.2"
msgid "I can do something else while I wait."
msgstr "我可以趁这会儿做点别的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.1"
msgid "I can see an odd colour just under the surface."
msgstr "表面下面透出一抹奇怪的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON.2"
msgid "I'd like a closer look without touching it."
msgstr "我想靠近看看，先不伸手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.1"
msgid "There. the terrarium is working."
msgstr "好了，盒中泰拉开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd bring the terrarium back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把盒中泰拉带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.1"
msgid "I think we've seen the last of that eye here."
msgstr "我想那只眼睛不会再从这里出现了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED.2"
msgid "It's quiet on the other side."
msgstr "另一边安静下来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.1"
msgid "I should come back when the sun goes down."
msgstr "等太阳落下再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK.2"
msgid "Whatever's in there seems to be waiting for night."
msgstr "里面的东西似乎在等天黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the conspicuous chest."
msgstr "显眼箱子烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the conspicuous chest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进显眼箱子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.1"
msgid "I can see an odd colour just under the surface."
msgstr "表面下面透出一抹奇怪的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER.2"
msgid "I'd like a closer look without touching it."
msgstr "我想靠近看看，先不伸手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.1"
msgid "I'll keep the thulecite dry on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上别让铥矿受潮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the terra firma tamper."
msgstr "要做土地夯实器，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the thulecite bug net in the hands of someone who knows it."
msgstr "我想看看熟手是怎么用铥矿捕虫网的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET.2"
msgid "I should save some for the phasmo-encapsulator."
msgstr "我该给幻灵捕获机留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.1"
msgid "I'll try to find where the thulecite fragments fits."
msgstr "我想找出铥矿碎片该装在哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES.2"
msgid "Setting the pieces side by side might help."
msgstr "把部件排在一起也许能看明白。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the shadow thurible."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对暗影香炉了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE.2"
msgid "I should look it over in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮一点的地方好好看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.1"
msgid "Nobody seems to be tending it now."
msgstr "看来暂时没人照看了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED.2"
msgid "I wonder when someone last came this way."
msgstr "不知道上次有人来是什么时候。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the ticoon before it moves again."
msgstr "趁大虎没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.1"
msgid "No fresh scent? I'll try somewhere else."
msgstr "没闻到新气味吗？我换处找找。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK.2"
msgid "I'll have to look beyond this patch."
msgstr "我得找找这片地以外的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.1"
msgid "There, his ears moved! I'll follow his lead."
msgstr "看，他耳朵动了！我跟着他。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY.2"
msgid "Show me where the little one's hiding."
msgstr "带我去看看小家伙藏在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.1"
msgid "No fresh scent? I'll try somewhere else."
msgstr "没闻到新气味吗？我换处找找。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK.2"
msgid "I'll have to look beyond this patch."
msgstr "我得找找这片地以外的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.1"
msgid "There, his ears moved! I'll follow his lead."
msgstr "看，他耳朵动了！我跟着他。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS.2"
msgid "Show me where the little one's hiding."
msgstr "带我去看看小家伙藏在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.1"
msgid "No fresh scent? I'll try somewhere else."
msgstr "没闻到新气味吗？我换处找找。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY.2"
msgid "I'll have to look beyond this patch."
msgstr "我得找找这片地以外的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.1"
msgid "There, his ears moved! I'll follow his lead."
msgstr "看，他耳朵动了！我跟着他。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING.2"
msgid "Show me where the little one's hiding."
msgstr "带我去看看小家伙藏在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.1"
msgid "You've already got someone to follow."
msgstr "你已经有要跟的人了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE.2"
msgid "I won't get between you two."
msgstr "我就不挡在你们中间了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.1"
msgid "I could smell the tillweeds from the other side of camp."
msgstr "在营地另一头就闻到了犁地草的气味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the tillweed salve."
msgstr "要做犁地草膏，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.1"
msgid "I should ask what dose of the tillweed salve is safe."
msgstr "我得问问犁地草膏用多少才合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE.2"
msgid "I can see where the tillweeds went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了犁地草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.1"
msgid "I'll keep the dried tillweed wrapped for the walk home."
msgstr "我把干犁地草包好，留着路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED.2"
msgid "I'll tear off a small piece for the road."
msgstr "我掰一小块路上吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the toadstool moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到毒菌蟾蜍就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.1"
msgid "There's a warning in that stance."
msgstr "那个架势是在警告我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE.2"
msgid "I'll leave room for it to pass."
msgstr "给它留条路过去吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the toadstool. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，毒菌蟾蜍里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can hear the toadstool moving before I see it."
msgstr "还没见到毒菌蟾蜍就能听到它活动的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wait to see which way it goes."
msgstr "先等等，看它往哪儿去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.1"
msgid "I can just tell where the toadstool is hiding."
msgstr "还能看出毒菌蟾蜍藏在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND.2"
msgid "There's movement under the surface."
msgstr "底下有东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "The grip feels cold even through the wrapping."
msgstr "隔着柄绳也摸得出那股冷意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll choose carefully when to draw this one."
msgstr "这把刀何时出鞘，得慎重些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.1"
msgid "That malice runs right down to the hilt."
msgstr "连刀柄都透着那股怨气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOKIJIN.RESENTMENT.2"
msgid "I can feel it long after I let go."
msgstr "松开手之后，那股感觉还在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.1"
msgid "I'd save the toma root for after practice."
msgstr "我想把番茄留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO.2"
msgid "I should save some for the rude interlude."
msgstr "我该给粗鲁插曲留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the roasted toma root before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤番茄，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant toma root before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型番茄再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I keep the spiky seeds in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把带刺的种子收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.1"
msgid "I should tuck my fringe back before trying on the top hat."
msgstr "不知道高礼帽会不会压住刘海。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the magician's top hat."
msgstr "要做魔术师高礼帽，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.1"
msgid "Let me try the magician's top hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下魔术师高礼帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.1"
msgid "I'll hold it downwind of my hair."
msgstr "我拿到下风处，免得燎着头发。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TORCH.2"
msgid "Enough light to find my way back to camp."
msgstr "这点亮光够我走回营地。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.1"
msgid "I'd set the tourtiere beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把饕餮馅饼放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "There. the lazy deserter is working."
msgstr "好了，懒人传送塔开始运作了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "Good. We can make use of it now."
msgstr "好，现在可以用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the lazy deserter on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下懒人传送塔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the orange moonlens to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了橙色月眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.1"
msgid "I can see the change in the desert stone from here."
msgstr "站在这里也看得出沙之石的变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE.2"
msgid "I'll watch what happens next."
msgstr "我看看下一步会发生什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the desert stone by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清沙之石，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.1"
msgid "I'd like to know what Warly would serve with the trail mix."
msgstr "不知道沃利会给什锦干果配什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX.2"
msgid "I might try a little more roasted birchnut next time."
msgstr "下次我想试试多放些烤桦栗果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.1"
msgid "I'd rather see the boarilla from the stands than across the arena."
msgstr "比起在竞技场里迎面撞见野猪猩，我还是想在看台上看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAILS.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.1"
msgid "I'd set the electrical doodad beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把电子元件放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the w.i.n.bot with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做薇机人就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the trap."
msgstr "放下陷阱时要做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "别让回营地的人不小心踩上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the bramble trap is set."
msgstr "我得记准荆棘陷阱布置在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the living log to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了活木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the coals."
msgstr "放下煤炭时要做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "别让回营地的人不小心踩上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.1"
msgid "Easy, little one. My hand won't close any tighter."
msgstr "小家伙，放心，我不会再握紧了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD.2"
msgid "I hope I haven't frightened it."
msgstr "希望没把它吓坏。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT.2"
msgid "Much too hot for my bare hands."
msgstr "光着手碰太烫了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.1"
msgid "I can feel the temperature without taking off my glove."
msgstr "隔着手套也摸得出温度。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM.2"
msgid "Still warm against my palm."
msgstr "贴近手心还有暖意。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.1"
msgid "It shut before I could get a good look inside."
msgstr "我还没看清里面，它就合上了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED.2"
msgid "I'll keep my toes clear till it opens again."
msgstr "它再张开前，我先把脚挪远些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see the anenemy through the water."
msgstr "隔着水也看得见海星。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "The light changes so much beneath the waves."
msgstr "水下的光线变化真大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.1"
msgid "I'd mark the spot where we leave the tooth trap."
msgstr "放下犬牙陷阱时要做个记号。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH.2"
msgid "I'll let the others know to tread carefully here."
msgstr "我去提醒大家经过这里要当心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.1"
msgid "I want to know exactly where the maxwell's tooth trap is set."
msgstr "我得记准麦斯威尔的犬牙陷阱布置在什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL.2"
msgid "Nobody should stumble into this on the way home."
msgstr "别让回营地的人不小心踩上来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the chest before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到箱子旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the chest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进箱子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the boards to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.1"
msgid "I can fit far more supplies in there now."
msgstr "现在能多装好多物资。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE.2"
msgid "All those extra provisions can finally go in one chest."
msgstr "那些多出来的储备终于可以收进同一只箱子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.1"
msgid "I'd put the things I don't need yet in the treasure chest."
msgstr "暂时用不到的可以收进宝箱。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP.2"
msgid "I'd like one place where my glasses won't get crushed."
msgstr "我想留个不会压到眼镜的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how it changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时它会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP.2"
msgid "I'll take a closer look without pulling anything up."
msgstr "靠近点看就好，不必把它拔出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.1"
msgid "Just a little for the tree roots. I'd like to see what happens."
msgstr "往树根上用一点，我想看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION.2"
msgid "I should note the tree's height before I use it."
msgstr "用之前先记下树有多高。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on the boulderbough!"
msgstr "巨石枝着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Nothing of the boulderbough above the stump now."
msgstr "巨石枝只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I can count the rings from here."
msgstr "站在这里都能数年轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to look at the boulderbough in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看巨石枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the boulderbough sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合巨石枝树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'd better find a place where no one will tread on it."
msgstr "得找处没人会踩的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.1"
msgid "Such an odd beginning for something that grows so tall."
msgstr "长得那么高的东西，起初竟是这个样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED.2"
msgid "I wonder where I ought to plant it."
msgstr "我想知道种在哪里合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.1"
msgid "I'd put the strident trident within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把刺耳三叉戟放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT.2"
msgid "I can see where the gnarwail horn went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了一角鲸的角。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.1"
msgid "They're all stuck together. So much for a game of marbles."
msgstr "全黏在一起了，这还怎么打弹珠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1.2"
msgid "The colours survived the heat better than the shape."
msgstr "烧得都变形了，颜色倒还在。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.1"
msgid "Someone must be missing a rather important set of teeth."
msgstr "一定有人少了一副很要紧的牙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10.2"
msgid "I'll wrap those before they go anywhere near my bag."
msgstr "先包严实，再考虑往包里放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.1"
msgid "A robot I can fit in my palm. WX would have an opinion."
msgstr "掌心里都放得下的小机器人。WX见了准有话说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11.2"
msgid "It seems to be looking me right in the eye."
msgstr "它好像正和我对视呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.1"
msgid "It's curled up tight as it dried."
msgstr "晾干的时候蜷得这么紧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12.2"
msgid "I'd prefer a dried tentacle to one reaching for my ankle."
msgstr "比起会来缠我脚踝的触手，我更喜欢这个干的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.1"
msgid "That bonnet has weathered several seasons outdoors."
msgstr "这顶小帽子搁在外面，已经过了好几个季节了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13.2"
msgid "I know a little fellow in the garden who'd like some company."
msgstr "园子里有个小家伙，正好缺个伴。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.1"
msgid "I'd use a saucer. Most of the tea would end up there."
msgstr "得配个碟子，大半杯茶都会漏到那上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14.2"
msgid "Lovely cup. Perhaps it should hold buttons instead."
msgstr "杯子挺好看，也许拿来装纽扣更合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.1"
msgid "The little slit in the white bishop's hat is worn smooth."
msgstr "白主教帽子上那道槽都磨圆了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15.2"
msgid "A diagonal move. I do remember a little chess."
msgstr "它走斜线。我还记得一点棋规。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.1"
msgid "Straight onto a dark square with you, little bishop."
msgstr "黑主教，我把你放在深色格上。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16.2"
msgid "I can distinguish a bishop by touch if the top is cut like this."
msgstr "顶端有这么个切口，摸一下就认得出主教。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.1"
msgid "Someone tried to stir something much too stiff with this."
msgstr "有人大概用它搅过硬得过头的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17.2"
msgid "It'll sit in the cutlery drawer at a very odd angle."
msgstr "收进餐具抽屉也只能歪着放了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.1"
msgid "I wonder if the toy horse opens at the belly."
msgstr "不知这匹小木马的肚子能不能打开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18.2"
msgid "I'd count how many little passengers came with it."
msgstr "我想数数它一共带了几位小乘客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.1"
msgid "It drifts to one side no matter how I spin it."
msgstr "不论我怎么转，它都往一边歪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19.2"
msgid "The tip's off centre. That's why it won't stand upright."
msgstr "尖端偏了，难怪立不住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.1"
msgid "I've tried both ends. All I hear is my own breath."
msgstr "两头都试过了，只听得见自己吹气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2.2"
msgid "You could mime a tune on it. Wes might like that."
msgstr "可以拿来假装吹曲子，韦斯或许喜欢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.1"
msgid "Just long enough to reach between my shoulder blades."
msgstr "长短正好，够得着后背中间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20.2"
msgid "What a relief after a whole day in armour."
msgstr "穿了一天盔甲，拿这个挠一挠可真舒服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.1"
msgid "The whisk would turn better if those wires were straight."
msgstr "把这些铁丝理直，搅起来会顺些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21.2"
msgid "I'd ask before I gave this to Warly."
msgstr "要把这件给沃利，还得先问问他肯不肯收。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.1"
msgid "I can save a little yarn if I cut off the worn part."
msgstr "剪掉磨毛的部分，还能留下一小段纱线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22.2"
msgid "This wouldn't last two stitches on a cuff."
msgstr "拿它补袖口，恐怕缝两针就断了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.1"
msgid "That would save the heels of my good shoes."
msgstr "用它就不必硬踩好鞋的后跟了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_23.2"
msgid "I'd keep it by the door where I lace my boots."
msgstr "我想把它放在门边，平时系靴带的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.1"
msgid "A little beckoning paw. Shall I leave it a coin?"
msgstr "小爪子在招手呢。要给它放枚硬币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_24.2"
msgid "It would look quite at home by a shop counter."
msgstr "摆在店里的柜台边，倒是合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.1"
msgid "I opened it once. That was quite enough."
msgstr "我打开过一次。一回就够了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_25.2"
msgid "That smell doesn't belong anywhere near clean clothes."
msgstr "这种气味绝不能沾上刚洗好的衣服。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.1"
msgid "I'd never have thought to make a cup out of a potato."
msgstr "我可没想过拿土豆做杯子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_26.2"
msgid "Does everything you pour in come out tasting of supper?"
msgstr "往里倒什么，最后都会带点晚饭的味道吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.1"
msgid "A little twist here and it might hold my jacket again."
msgstr "这里再弯一下，也许又能挂我的外套了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_27.2"
msgid "Better fold that sharp wire end under first."
msgstr "还是先把扎手的铁丝头折进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.1"
msgid "White stone, little battlements. A rook, surely."
msgstr "白棋上刻着小城垛，这该是车。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_28.2"
msgid "I should save the corner square for this piece."
msgstr "棋盘角上的格子得给它留着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.1"
msgid "The dark rook has a chip on one of its corners."
msgstr "黑车有个角磕掉了一小块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_29.2"
msgid "Set it on the back rank and mind the long straight files."
msgstr "放在底线，还得留意那几条长长的直线。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.1"
msgid "I found an end, but it goes straight back under the knot."
msgstr "找到线头了，可它又从结底下绕回去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_3.2"
msgid "I could cut it. Now I rather want to untie it myself."
msgstr "剪断当然容易，我倒想亲手解开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.1"
msgid "They carved a mane on the white knight. How patient."
msgstr "白马的鬃毛都刻出来了，真有耐心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_30.2"
msgid "This is the one that can jump a crowded rank."
msgstr "棋子排得再密，这匹马也能跳过去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.1"
msgid "That dark little horse could use a chessboard."
msgstr "该给这匹小黑马找块棋盘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_31.2"
msgid "Two squares and one to the side. I remember now."
msgstr "直走两格再侧一格。我记起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.1"
msgid "The light breaks into little colours when I turn it."
msgstr "一转动，光就散成了好几种颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_32.2"
msgid "Clear enough to see my fingers on the far side."
msgstr "从这边看得见另一侧捏着它的手指。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.1"
msgid "I felt all eight little legs against my knuckle."
msgstr "戴上时，八只小脚都贴着指节。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_33.2"
msgid "Webber might like the design on this ring."
msgstr "韦伯也许会喜欢这枚戒指的样式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.1"
msgid "The fingers are curled. I won't try to prise them open."
msgstr "手指蜷着，我可不想把它们掰开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_34.2"
msgid "I'm quite content to leave my wishes unspoken."
msgstr "心愿留在心里，我就挺满足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.1"
msgid "Not a drop of the elixir left for me to examine."
msgstr "一滴药都没留下，没法看是什么成分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_35.2"
msgid "The label promises considerably more than the bottle delivers."
msgstr "标签上许的愿倒比瓶里剩下的多得多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.1"
msgid "Smile at the mirror and they'll look almost convincing."
msgstr "对着镜子一笑，还真能装得挺像。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_36.2"
msgid "I'd keep the false teeth for the costume trunk."
msgstr "这副假尖牙留给戏服箱吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.1"
msgid "The point broke off across the grain."
msgstr "尖端横着木纹断掉了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_37.2"
msgid "It'll need a new tip before it can hold anything in place."
msgstr "得重新削出个尖，才能再用它固定东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.1"
msgid "Let me adjust the distance between the eyepieces."
msgstr "我调一下两个目镜的距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_38.2"
msgid "I can look out to sea without squinting now."
msgstr "这下看海面总算不用眯起眼了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.1"
msgid "A glove with no partner. Which pocket did the other go in?"
msgstr "手套少了一只。另一只落在哪个衣袋里了？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_39.2"
msgid "It would keep one hand warm, at least."
msgstr "好歹还能暖一只手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.1"
msgid "Such a solemn face for someone in that little hat."
msgstr "帽子这么俏皮，神情却挺严肃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_4.2"
msgid "He could keep the radishes company."
msgstr "让他到菜园里陪着萝卜吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.1"
msgid "I hadn't realized anyone needed to weigh a snail."
msgstr "我还不知道有人需要给蜗牛称重。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_40.2"
msgid "I'd have to wait for the little passenger to sit still."
msgstr "得先等那位小乘客不再爬来爬去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.1"
msgid "The lid's holding. I'd rather it stayed that way."
msgstr "盖子还扣得紧。我想就这么留着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_41.2"
msgid "Something thick shifts when I tip the canister."
msgstr "罐子一斜，就感觉有团黏稠的东西在动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.1"
msgid "A wooden cobra. I still stepped back when I saw the hood."
msgstr "木头的眼镜蛇。可我看见蛇颈，还是退了一步。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_42.2"
msgid "I can see where the scales were painted on."
msgstr "这些鳞片是画上去的，能看出笔迹。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.1"
msgid "All those little teeth and you can't bite a thing."
msgstr "长了这么多小牙，偏偏什么也咬不动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_43.2"
msgid "I'd put the toy crocodile beside the pond, just for a moment."
msgstr "我想把鳄鱼玩具搁在池边看一眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.1"
msgid "The crack goes all the way down. It won't hold a little garden anymore."
msgstr "裂缝一直通到底，没法再拿它养个小花园了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_44.2"
msgid "I'll wrap the broken glass before someone reaches for it."
msgstr "趁还没人伸手，我先把碎玻璃包起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.1"
msgid "I keep turning the dial in case I hear a familiar voice."
msgstr "我一直在转旋钮，盼着能听见熟悉的声音。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_45.2"
msgid "Even a burst of static would be something."
msgstr "哪怕传出一点杂音也好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.1"
msgid "My hair will have to dry by the fire this evening."
msgstr "今晚还是只能靠着火把头发晾干了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_46.2"
msgid "The switch clicks but the fan doesn't turn."
msgstr "开关按下去有声音，风扇却没转。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.1"
msgid "Someone even put fins on this tiny rocket."
msgstr "这么小的火箭，连尾翼都有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_5.2"
msgid "I wonder where its owner imagined it would land."
msgstr "不知道做这个的人想让它落在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.1"
msgid "The ends have frayed right through the covering."
msgstr "断开的线头都戳出包皮了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_6.2"
msgid "Winona could tell me if any of this is worth keeping."
msgstr "这些还能不能留，问薇诺娜就知道了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.1"
msgid "One swing, then catch it in the cup. Let me try."
msgstr "甩一下，再拿杯子接住。我来试试。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_7.2"
msgid "I had the first catch and missed the second entirely."
msgstr "第一下明明接住了，第二下却落了个空。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.1"
msgid "I pressed my thumb into it and didn't leave a dent."
msgstr "拇指都按酸了，也没留下一点印。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_8.2"
msgid "That stopper's far too stiff to seal a bottle now."
msgstr "这个塞子太硬了，已经封不住瓶口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.1"
msgid "I'd put the odd button under my collar, where it wouldn't show."
msgstr "那颗不成对的可以缝在领子下面，就不显眼了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_9.2"
msgid "No two alike. Someone kept the spares from quite a few coats."
msgstr "没两颗一样的，怕是从好几件外套上攒下来的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the fish scale-o-matic over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到鱼类计重器的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNING.2"
msgid "Has anyone brought water?"
msgstr "谁带了水？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the fish scale-o-matic stood."
msgstr "鱼类计重器原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I can see the fish scale-o-matic through the water."
msgstr "隔着水也看得见鱼类计重器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the ice went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了冰。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "{weight}, landed by {owner}. That's worth recording."
msgstr "{weight}，由{owner}钓获。我得记下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I read {weight}. The angler signed as {owner}."
msgstr "秤上是{weight}，钓手署名是{owner}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.1"
msgid "{weight}! {owner} must have felt that on the line."
msgstr "{weight}！{owner}收线时一定很费力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.2"
msgid "A catch of {weight}. My respects to {owner}."
msgstr "足有{weight}。向钓手{owner}致敬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER.1"
msgid "{weight}, landed by {owner}. That's worth recording."
msgstr "{weight}，由{owner}钓获。我得记下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER.2"
msgid "I read {weight}. The angler signed as {owner}."
msgstr "秤上是{weight}，钓手署名是{owner}。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY.1"
msgid "{weight}! {owner} must have felt that on the line."
msgstr "{weight}！{owner}收线时一定很费力。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_FISH.OWNER_HEAVY.2"
msgid "A catch of {weight}. My respects to {owner}."
msgstr "足有{weight}。向钓手{owner}致敬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the produce scale!"
msgstr "离着火的农产品秤远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the produce scale but ash."
msgstr "农产品秤只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the produce scale."
msgstr "得记住回到农产品秤这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "{weight}, from the harvest on day {day}."
msgstr "{weight}，是第{day}天的收成。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll note the weight, {weight}, and the harvest day, {day}."
msgstr "我记一下，重量{weight}，收获日是第{day}天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.1"
msgid "{weight}! What a harvest on day {day}."
msgstr "{weight}！第{day}天的收成真了不起。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_HEAVY.2"
msgid "A whole {weight}. I'd circle day {day} in the garden journal."
msgstr "整整{weight}。我会在种植笔记上圈出第{day}天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.1"
msgid "The needle barely moved."
msgstr "秤针几乎没动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TROPHYSCALE_OVERSIZEDVEGGIES.HAS_ITEM_LIGHT.2"
msgid "I'll try this scale with a bigger vegetable."
msgstr "换棵大些的菜再用这台秤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.1"
msgid "Even the scabbard hasn't quieted it."
msgstr "即使收进鞘里也没能让它平静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_HITOKIRI.2"
msgid "I'll put this one away before I lose my temper."
msgstr "趁我还能沉住气，把它收起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.1"
msgid "That last fitting finally sits flush."
msgstr "最后那件刀装终于贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_KOSHIRAE.2"
msgid "I'd like to show my teacher how it turned out."
msgstr "真想把最后的成品给老师看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.1"
msgid "I know that note in the steel. Welcome back, Raikiri."
msgstr "我认得这声刀鸣。雷切，你回来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_RAIKIRI.2"
msgid "A flash along the edge, even under a clear sky."
msgstr "明明是晴天，刃上却有电光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.1"
msgid "Even sheathed, I know this blade by its weight."
msgstr "即使收在鞘里，这分量我也认得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUE_SHIRASAYA.2"
msgid "The wood has taken on the sheen of my hands."
msgstr "木鞘握得久了，已经泛起光泽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.1"
msgid "I might wear the breezy vest to camp today."
msgstr "今天回营地，也许可以穿戴透气背心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_SUMMER.2"
msgid "I can see where the koalefant trunk went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了象鼻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.1"
msgid "I'd try the puffy vest over my usual clothes first."
msgstr "我想看看松软背心能不能搭在平时的衣服外面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNKVEST_WINTER.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the beefalo wool if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些牛毛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.1"
msgid "I'd like a little salt with the koalefant trunk steak."
msgstr "吃象鼻排我想加一点盐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_COOKED.2"
msgid "I'll keep the last bit for the walk back."
msgstr "最后一点留给回程。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.1"
msgid "I'd save the koalefant trunk for after practice."
msgstr "我想把象鼻留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_SUMMER.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the breezy vest."
msgstr "要做透气背心，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.1"
msgid "Could we take the winter koalefant trunk on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着冬象鼻吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TRUNK_WINTER.2"
msgid "I should save some for the puffy vest."
msgstr "我该给松软背心留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.1"
msgid "I wonder what the tumbleweed looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，风滚草是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TUMBLEWEED.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.1"
msgid "A patch of the terra firma tamper would change the whole path."
msgstr "铺一块土地夯实器，路面就不同了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURFCRAFTINGSTATION.2"
msgid "I can see where the thulecite went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了铥矿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.1"
msgid "I'll lay the ancient stonework where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把远古石刻铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_ARCHIVE.2"
msgid "I can see where the thulecite fragments went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了铥矿碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.1"
msgid "A patch of it would change the whole path."
msgstr "铺一块它，路面就不同了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BADLANDS.2"
msgid "I could mark the turn in the path with this."
msgstr "可以用这个标出小路转弯的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.1"
msgid "I'll lay the beard hair rug where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把胡须地毯铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_BEARD_RUG.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "铺之前得先对齐边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.1"
msgid "A patch of the carpeted flooring would change the whole path."
msgstr "铺一块地毯地板，路面就不同了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR.2"
msgid "I could mark the turn in the path with this."
msgstr "可以用这个标出小路转弯的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "这种地面，踩上去就认得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CARPETFLOOR2.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.1"
msgid "I'll lay the guano turf where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把鸟粪地皮铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CAVE.2"
msgid "I can see where the guano went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了鸟粪。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.1"
msgid "I'll lay the checkered flooring where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把棋盘地板铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_CHECKERFLOOR.2"
msgid "I could mark the turn in the path with this."
msgstr "可以用这个标出小路转弯的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the brick flooring outside the gate."
msgstr "我想试着把砖地板铺在门外。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK.2"
msgid "I'll set one piece down before I do the whole yard."
msgstr "先铺一块看看，再决定要不要铺满院子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "这种地面，踩上去就认得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "铺之前得先对齐边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.1"
msgid "I'll lay the deciduous turf where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把落叶林地皮铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DECIDUOUS.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.1"
msgid "I'd like to try the sandy turf outside the gate."
msgstr "我想试着把沙漠地皮铺在门外。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DESERTDIRT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the rocks if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.1"
msgid "I know that ground by the feel of it underfoot."
msgstr "这种地面，踩上去就认得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DIRT.2"
msgid "I should line up the edges before I set it down."
msgstr "铺之前得先对齐边缘。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.1"
msgid "I'll lay the scaled flooring where the bare ground shows."
msgstr "我把龙鳞地板铺在露土的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURF_DRAGONFLY.2"
