#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS.2"
msgid "I'll wait and watch how it moves on the sand."
msgstr "我先看看它在沙地上怎么移动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the twiggy tree!"
msgstr "离着火的多枝树远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the twiggy tree but ash."
msgstr "多枝树只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.1"
msgid "Nothing of the twiggy tree above the stump now."
msgstr "多枝树只剩树桩露在外面了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED.2"
msgid "I can count the rings from here."
msgstr "站在这里都能数年轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.1"
msgid "Something's wrong with the surface of the twiggy tree."
msgstr "多枝树表面看着不太对。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED.2"
msgid "I'll look over the others nearby, too."
msgstr "附近的我也检查一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the twiggy tree changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时多枝树会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd leave room for new growth."
msgstr "得留些地方让它长开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.1"
msgid "I'd set the twiggy tree cone beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把多枝树种放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT.2"
msgid "Let me get my glasses. I'd like a closer look."
msgstr "让我戴上眼镜，我想看清楚些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.1"
msgid "I know a patch of soil for the twiggy sapling."
msgstr "我知道有块地适合多枝树苗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING.2"
msgid "I'll give the roots room to spread."
msgstr "给根留点长开的空间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.1"
msgid "The little branches have grown crooked with age."
msgstr "年头久了，小枝都长弯了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD.2"
msgid "I can gather the fallen twigs without disturbing it."
msgstr "我捡地上的细枝就好，不必动它。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.1"
msgid "I'll sort the straight ones from the crooked ones."
msgstr "我把直枝和弯枝分开放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWIGS.2"
msgid "Dry enough to snap between my fingers."
msgstr "已经干到用手指就能折断了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.1"
msgid "I didn't expect the retinazor to be quite this large."
msgstr "没想到激光眼会这么大。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1.2"
msgid "I want a clear way back to the others."
msgstr "先留出一条能回到同伴身边的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the spazmatism fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是魔焰眼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2.2"
msgid "Nobody wander off alone, please."
msgstr "请别独自走远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "I wonder what Wickerbottom could tell me about the umbrella."
msgstr "不知道薇克巴顿女士对雨伞了解多少。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "I can see where the silk went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.1"
msgid "Could we take the unagi on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着鳗鱼料理吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNAGI.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.1"
msgid "I have no idea what to call that yet."
msgstr "我还说不出那该叫什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED.2"
msgid "I'll remember the spot and look again later."
msgstr "我先记下位置，过些时候再看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.1"
msgid "I wouldn't offer this one my fingers to sniff."
msgstr "我可不会把手指递给这只兔子闻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAMPIRE_BUNNY.2"
msgid "Those teeth would make short work of more than a carrot."
msgstr "那对牙能轻松咬开的恐怕不止是胡萝卜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the sanctum lustre."
msgstr "我标一下发现圣殿华灯的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the waymark compass this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把路标导航仪做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make room so my sleeves don't catch."
msgstr "我让出些地方，免得衣袖被勾住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.1"
msgid "The needle brought us right to this room."
msgstr "指针把我们带到了这间屋子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM.2"
msgid "I should search this room before I move on."
msgstr "我先搜一搜这间屋子再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.1"
msgid "It won't point the way outside the vault."
msgstr "离开密库，它就指不了路了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT.2"
msgid "I'll put it away until we go back inside."
msgstr "先收起来，进密库再用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Is that the usual gait for the lustrous weevil?"
msgstr "辉光象鼻虫平时也是这样活动的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.1"
msgid "The pieces sit neatly together on the lustrous weevil."
msgstr "辉光象鼻虫的部件已经贴合了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED.2"
msgid "There. Let's see what that changes."
msgstr "好了，看看会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the lever in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的杠杆。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the inner sanctum barrier."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护内殿屏障。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the sanctum purifier in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的圣殿净化器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.1"
msgid "Somewhere there's a lock made for the keystone."
msgstr "一定有把锁和钥石配套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY.2"
msgid "I'd remember which way the teeth point."
msgstr "我得记住钥匙齿朝哪边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.1"
msgid "I'll keep the pulse cradle in its own pocket."
msgstr "脉冲基座得单独装一个口袋。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR.2"
msgid "I won't leave this lying around."
msgstr "这个不能随手乱放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the chasm by daylight before we go farther."
msgstr "我想趁天亮先看清裂口，再往前走。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Somewhere there's a lock made for the reliquary."
msgstr "一定有把锁和圣匣配套。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I won't leave this lying around."
msgstr "这个不能随手乱放。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.1"
msgid "We should give the reliquary time to grow back."
msgstr "得给圣匣些时间重新生长。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED.2"
msgid "I'll check it on my next walk."
msgstr "下次路过我再来看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.1"
msgid "I'll mark the chasm on my map."
msgstr "我在图上标一下裂口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT.2"
msgid "Better check the footing near the edge."
msgstr "靠近边缘先看清脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.1"
msgid "I'd set the portation orb beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把传送宝珠放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB.2"
msgid "I should save some for the portation orb fragment."
msgstr "我该给传送宝珠碎片留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the portation orb fragment out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到传送宝珠碎片。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED.2"
msgid "I can see where the portation orb went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了传送宝珠。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.1"
msgid "Who was the last person to stand before the ancient guard tower?"
msgstr "上次站在远古戍卫塔前面的人是谁呢？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the guard tower site here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把戍卫塔基址留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.1"
msgid "I'd draw the guard tower kit before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把戍卫塔套装画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the guard tower here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把戍卫塔留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.1"
msgid "I'd draw the ancient tower before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把远古之塔画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.1"
msgid "I'd draw it before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把它画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.1"
msgid "I'd draw it before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把它画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.1"
msgid "Who could show me how to work at the sanctum smithy?"
msgstr "谁能给我示范怎么用圣殿锻台？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL.2"
msgid "I'd rather check the plan before I start."
msgstr "动手前我想再对一遍图纸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the sanctum lunarune stone."
msgstr "得记住回到圣殿月符石这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.1"
msgid "I want to make a rubbing of these marks."
msgstr "我想把这些刻痕拓下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1.2"
msgid "I should sketch this before I forget it."
msgstr "我该趁还记得把它画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.1"
msgid "I think this follows the last carving."
msgstr "这似乎接着上一幅雕刻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1_STALKER.2"
msgid "Who carved this so far underground?"
msgstr "是谁在这么深的地下刻了字？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.1"
msgid "I want to make a rubbing of these marks."
msgstr "我想把这些刻痕拓下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2.2"
msgid "I'll trace the line without touching it."
msgstr "我顺着线条看就好，不伸手去摸。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.1"
msgid "The last few strokes are quite faint."
msgstr "最后几道刻痕已经很浅了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3.2"
msgid "Who carved this so far underground?"
msgstr "是谁在这么深的地下刻了字？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.1"
msgid "What's left of the sanctum waymark still shows how it fitted together."
msgstr "从圣殿路标的残件还能看出原来的构造。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN.2"
msgid "I'll put the loose pieces somewhere safe."
msgstr "我把松脱的零件收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd stop by the sanctum waymark again when we have more time."
msgstr "等我们有闲暇，我想再来看看圣殿路标。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.1"
msgid "All quiet around the sanctum waymark for the moment."
msgstr "圣殿路标这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.1"
msgid "One more section and we'll see the shape of it."
msgstr "再装一段，就能看出轮廓了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER_UNDERCONSTRUCTION.2"
msgid "I'll check which pieces we still need."
msgstr "我来核一下还缺哪些部件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.1"
msgid "I can see the break in the flummoxing flame."
msgstr "能看见谜之火焰断在了什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN.2"
msgid "I'll put the loose pieces somewhere safe."
msgstr "我把松脱的零件收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the flummoxing flame reaches."
msgstr "我想看看谜之火焰的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.1"
msgid "I hope there's enough of the breakfast skillet to share."
msgstr "希望早餐锅够大家分。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET.2"
msgid "I'd like to know how this was prepared."
msgstr "我想知道这是怎么备好的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.1"
msgid "We waited too long before collecting this."
msgstr "收的时候已经太迟了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN.2"
msgid "I wouldn't serve that to anyone."
msgstr "我不会端这个给人吃。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.1"
msgid "I'd save the vegetable stinger for after practice."
msgstr "我想把蔬菜鸡尾酒留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'll keep the victorian costume pattern flat in my pack."
msgstr "我把维多利亚礼服款式平平整整地收进包里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I'll trace the outline before I start."
msgstr "先顺着轮廓看一遍再动手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the dark tatters out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到暗影碎布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH.2"
msgid "I should save some for the beefalo gloom bell."
msgstr "我该给阴郁皮弗娄牛铃留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the void cowl with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下虚空风帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the gloomerang before taking it out."
msgstr "带阴郁回旋镖出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "轻轻试一下，比用力挥更能感觉出分量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the void repair kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开虚空修补套件以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the shadow reaper before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂暗影收割者的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the pure horror if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些纯粹恐惧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the umbralla in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给暗影伞腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA.2"
msgid "I can see where the dark tatters went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了暗影碎布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.1"
msgid "I'd like to share the volt goat chaud-froid after practice."
msgstr "练完以后，我想和大家分着吃伏特羊肉冻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY.2"
msgid "I'll get the plates out."
msgstr "我去取盘子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.1"
msgid "I think this belongs to whoever made the world."
msgstr "我想这是创造这个世界的人用的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.VSCODE.2"
msgid "I wouldn't change anything until I knew how to undo it."
msgstr "还不知道怎么改回去，我可不想随便动。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.1"
msgid "Could we take the waffles on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着华夫饼吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES.2"
msgid "Something to look forward to on the way home."
msgstr "回去路上也有个盼头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.1"
msgid "I can see the break in the warbler."
msgstr "能看见黄莺断在了什么地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED.2"
msgid "It won't work in this state."
msgstr "这样已经没法用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the warbler from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察黄莺。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's stay still and see what it does."
msgstr "先别动，看看它接下来做什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "All quiet around the warbler for the moment."
msgstr "黄莺这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the gyroscopic transduction core to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把陀螺传导核心带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS.2"
msgid "I wonder how long it's been here."
msgstr "不知道它在这儿多久了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.1"
msgid "What's left of the terramite still shows how it fitted together."
msgstr "从螨地爬的残件还能看出原来的构造。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED.2"
msgid "It won't work in this state."
msgstr "这样已经没法用了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.1"
msgid "Come along. I'll wait for you."
msgstr "跟上，我会等你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY.2"
msgid "We can go the rest of the way together."
msgstr "剩下的路一起走吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to watch the terramite from somewhere quiet."
msgstr "我想在安静的地方观察螨地爬。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the terramite."
msgstr "螨地爬现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the auto-mat-o-chanic, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放自动修理机够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the scrap if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些废料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the w.a.r.b.i.s. head gear with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下W.A.R.B.I.S.头戴齿轮。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT.2"
msgid "I should see how it feels when I turn my head."
msgstr "转转头试试合不合适。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.1"
msgid "I hadn't expected to find the scrap out here."
msgstr "没想到能在这里找到废料。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS.2"
msgid "I should save some for the w.a.r.b.i.s. armor."
msgstr "我该给W.A.R.B.I.S.盔甲留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the kinetoclasmic field expandinator."
msgstr "得记住回到动能场扩展器这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL.2"
msgid "Somebody at camp might know its story."
msgstr "也许营地里有人知道它的来历。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the substrate extrapolator before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开基底扩展器以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut stone if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些石砖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the fulcronial selector in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的杠杆选择器。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.1"
msgid "I'd watch the notional fabricator at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看概念制造器怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.1"
msgid "I'd set the glove beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把手套放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1.2"
msgid "I'll turn it over and have a look at the other side."
msgstr "我想翻过来看看另一面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.1"
msgid "I'd set the clipboard beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把剪贴板放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2.2"
msgid "I could save it for someone who needs it."
msgstr "可以留给需要的人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the abandoned junk in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的被丢弃的垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.1"
msgid "I want a quiet moment to look over the research notes."
msgstr "我想静下来仔细看看研究笔记。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE.2"
msgid "Dry hands first. I don't want to smudge it."
msgstr "先擦干手，别把字蹭花了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.1"
msgid "I'd like an explanation from the gentleman who built this."
msgstr "我想听听造这东西的那位先生怎么解释。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK.2"
msgid "Something about these machines has changed since my last visit."
msgstr "我上次来时，这些机器还不太一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.1"
msgid "I'd show the reticulating buffer to that gentleman with the goggles."
msgstr "我会把网状缓冲器给戴护目镜的先生看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1.2"
msgid "I wonder if that's the tool he was asking for."
msgstr "不知道他要的是不是这件工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.1"
msgid "I'd show the widget deflubber to that gentleman with the goggles."
msgstr "我会把装置除垢器给戴护目镜的先生看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2.2"
msgid "I wonder if that's the tool he was asking for."
msgstr "不知道他要的是不是这件工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.1"
msgid "I'd show the grommet scriber to that gentleman with the goggles."
msgstr "我会把垫圈开槽器给戴护目镜的先生看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3.2"
msgid "I wonder if that's the tool he was asking for."
msgstr "不知道他要的是不是这件工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.1"
msgid "I'd show the conceptual scrubber to that gentleman with the goggles."
msgstr "我会把概念刷洗器给戴护目镜的先生看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4.2"
msgid "I wonder if that's the tool he was asking for."
msgstr "不知道他要的是不是这件工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.1"
msgid "I'd show the calibrated perceiver to that gentleman with the goggles."
msgstr "我会把校准观察机给戴护目镜的先生看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5.2"
msgid "I wonder if that's the tool he was asking for."
msgstr "不知道他要的是不是这件工具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.1"
msgid "I'll check the plank before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查跳板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.1"
msgid "I'll check the archaic plank before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查古董跳板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.1"
msgid "I'll check the plank before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查跳板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS.2"
msgid "Someone keep an eye on the current while I do this."
msgstr "我忙这边的时候，谁来留意一下水流。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.1"
msgid "I'll check the scaled plank before we leave the shore."
msgstr "离岸前我要检查龙鳞跳板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD.2"
msgid "It's easier to sort things out here than in rough seas."
msgstr "总比到了风浪里再处理容易。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.1"
msgid "I'd bring the wooden walking stick back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把木手杖带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the charcoal if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木炭。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.1"
msgid "With the dreadstone wall here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了绝望石墙，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE.2"
msgid "Better leave a way for everyone to get through."
msgstr "得给大家留条能过的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll check the alignment of the dreadstone wall against the next section."
msgstr "我看看绝望石墙跟下一段齐不齐。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下够皮弗娄牛通过的开口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the hay wall."
msgstr "草墙烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

