msgid "With the wood wall here, the camp would have a proper boundary."
msgstr "这里有了木墙，营地的边界就清楚了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM.2"
msgid "We'll want an opening wide enough for our beefalo."
msgstr "得留下够皮弗娄牛通过的开口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.1"
msgid "Look, the mactusk has noticed us."
msgstr "看，海象注意到我们了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.1"
msgid "Would the tam o' shanter leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着贝雷帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Room to spare in the walrus camp."
msgstr "海象营地里面还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll mark the spot where we found the walrus camp."
msgstr "我标一下发现海象营地的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I want to know why it's here in this particular spot."
msgstr "我想知道它为什么偏偏在这个地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.1"
msgid "I'd like to show the walrus tusk to someone back at camp."
msgstr "我想把海象牙带回去给营地里的人看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK.2"
msgid "I should save some for the walking cane."
msgstr "我该给步行手杖留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s! Is Woby coming on the walk too?"
msgstr "%s！沃比也要一起散步吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Have you a new trail to show me, %s?"
msgstr "%s，今天有新发现的小路能带我看看吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER.1"
msgid "You took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER.2"
msgid "Thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the pinetree pioneer hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下松树先锋队帽子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "%s, please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "%s，请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "%s, keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "%s，别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Right on time, %s. Or was I early?"
msgstr "刚好赶上，%s。还是我来早了？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A minute for tea, %s?"
msgstr "%s，能匀出一分钟喝杯茶吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Where would I find the odd beefalo after dark?"
msgstr "不知道怪皮弗娄牛天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can tell more by watching than by chasing it."
msgstr "与其追过去，不如静下来观察。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.1"
msgid "A trader! I'd like to see the wares."
msgstr "是商贩！我想看看都卖什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED.2"
msgid "Do you take coins here?"
msgstr "这里收钱币吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the wardrobe!"
msgstr "离着火的衣柜远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the wardrobe in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出衣柜的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the wardrobe in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的衣柜。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the cut grass if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些采下的草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.1"
msgid "I don't think the varg has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得座狼一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARG.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on it!"
msgstr "它着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "It lies so still. I'll give it a little room."
msgstr "它静静躺着，我留点距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder what left it here like this."
msgstr "不知道它之前遇到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.1"
msgid "I saw it move again!"
msgstr "我看见它又动了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING.2"
msgid "Quick, give it room!"
msgstr "快退开！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.1"
msgid "I wonder what the varglet noticed before I did."
msgstr "不知道青年座狼比我先注意到了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGLET.2"
msgid "I'll keep my movements slow."
msgstr "动作还是放慢些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the varg shrine!"
msgstr "离着火的座狼神龛远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the varg shrine."
msgstr "座狼神龛烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Room to spare in the varg shrine."
msgstr "座狼神龛里面还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the varg shrine here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把座狼神龛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, do you need anything chopped for supper?"
msgstr "%s，晚饭有什么需要我帮忙切的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I followed the smell of cooking and found you, %s."
msgstr "%s，我循着饭香就找到你了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.1"
msgid "I'd like a quiet hour to study the warrior costume pattern."
msgstr "我想静下心来仔细读读战士礼服款式。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT.2"
msgid "I'll trace the outline before I start."
msgstr "先顺着轮廓看一遍再动手。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.1"
msgid "You can hear the killer bee hive long before you reach it."
msgstr "还没走到杀人蜂蜂窝跟前，就听得见嗡嗡声。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE.2"
msgid "I'll pass slowly and give the bees room."
msgstr "我慢慢走，给蜜蜂留地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.1"
msgid "I'd put the waterballoon within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把水球放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON.2"
msgid "I should save some for the pile o' balloons."
msgstr "我该给一堆气球留一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the empty watering can at the moment."
msgstr "空浇水壶里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "My grip on the empty watering can feels quite different from my sword grip."
msgstr "握住空浇水壶的感觉和握刀很不一样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.1"
msgid "I'd save the watermelon for after practice."
msgstr "我想把西瓜留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON.2"
msgid "That reminds me, we could make the fashion melon with some of this."
msgstr "说起来，做西瓜帽就能用上这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.1"
msgid "Would the fashion melon leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着西瓜帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the twigs if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些树枝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.1"
msgid "Could we take the melonsicle on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着西瓜冰棍吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE.2"
msgid "Mind if I have a taste?"
msgstr "我可以尝一口吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.1"
msgid "I could smell the grilled watermelon before I saw it."
msgstr "还没看见烤西瓜，先闻到香味了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED.2"
msgid "Shall I split this so we can both taste it?"
msgstr "要不要分开，一人尝一口？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.1"
msgid "I'd like to weigh the giant watermelon before we cut it."
msgstr "我想先称称巨型西瓜再切开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED.2"
msgid "I knew the garden was doing well, but goodness!"
msgstr "我知道菜长得好，也没想到能长成这样！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.1"
msgid "I should save the square seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把方形种子留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.1"
msgid "Where would I find the sea weed after dark?"
msgstr "不知道海草天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT.2"
msgid "Something made it turn just then."
msgstr "刚才好像有什么让它转了身。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sea sprout looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，海芽是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the seedshell before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂种壳的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB.2"
msgid "I can tell quite a lot from the wear on the handle."
msgstr "握柄上的磨痕能看出不少东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the sea sprout starter in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给海芽插穗腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after the fire pump."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护消防泵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP.2"
