msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些口水鱼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.1"
msgid "I want to look at the great tree trunk in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看大树干。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR.2"
msgid "I should mind where I step near the roots."
msgstr "在根边走，得留意脚下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.1"
msgid "I want to look at the great tree root in better light."
msgstr "我想在亮些的地方仔细看看大树根。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT.2"
