#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.1"
msgid "It's got hold of something below us."
msgstr "它抓住底下的东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let me see what's coming up on that line."
msgstr "让我看看这根绳要拉上来什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "%s, please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "%s，请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "%s, keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "%s，别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, need someone to hold a part steady?"
msgstr "%s，需要我帮忙扶着零件吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I heard the tools and thought of you, %s."
msgstr "%s，隔着老远听见工具响，我就猜到是你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from Winona's G.E.M.erator over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到薇诺娜的宝石发电机的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING.2"
msgid "The smoke's getting in my eyes!"
msgstr "烟熏得我睁不开眼！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of Winona's G.E.M.erator."
msgstr "薇诺娜的宝石发电机烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I want to see how they put Winona's G.E.M.erator together."
msgstr "我想知道薇诺娜的宝石发电机是怎么组装的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the trusty tape went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了可靠的胶布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.1"
msgid "The battery is nearly spent."
msgstr "电池快耗尽了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER.2"
msgid "I'll check what we've connected to it."
msgstr "我看看现在都接了些什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around Winona's G.E.M.erator for the moment."
msgstr "薇诺娜的宝石发电机这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.1"
msgid "Too much current! Step back."
msgstr "电流太大了！快退开。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED.2"
msgid "I'll check what we've connected to it."
msgstr "我看看现在都接了些什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of Winona's Generator!"
msgstr "离着火的薇诺娜的发电机远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of Winona's Generator."
msgstr "薇诺娜的发电机烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone must know how to look after Winona's Generator."
msgstr "一定有人懂得怎么维护薇诺娜的发电机。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the trusty tape to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了可靠的胶布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.1"
msgid "The battery is nearly spent."
msgstr "电池快耗尽了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.LOWPOWER.2"
msgid "I'll check what we've connected to it."
msgstr "我看看现在都接了些什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from Winona's Generator."
msgstr "薇诺娜的发电机现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.1"
msgid "Flames on Winona's Catapult!"
msgstr "薇诺娜的投石机着火了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of Winona's Catapult but ash."
msgstr "薇诺娜的投石机只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what Winona's Catapult looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，薇诺娜的投石机是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the rocks went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了石头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around Winona's Catapult for the moment."
msgstr "薇诺娜的投石机这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from Winona's Catapult."
msgstr "薇诺娜的投石机现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.1"
msgid "There's a full charge in the handy remote now."
msgstr "称手遥控器里的电已经充足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGED.2"
msgid "I can feel the fine hairs on my arm lift."
msgstr "胳膊上的汗毛都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the handy remote again."
msgstr "现在再用称手遥控器还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.CHARGING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "等准备好了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd set the handy remote beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把称手遥控器放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the electrical doodad went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了电子元件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around the handy remote for the moment."
msgstr "称手遥控器这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_REMOTE.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.1"
msgid "The fire's spreading over Winona's Spotlight!"
msgstr "火快把薇诺娜的聚光灯吞没了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNING.2"
msgid "Quick, before the next thing catches!"
msgstr "快，别让旁边也着起来！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached Winona's Spotlight before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到薇诺娜的聚光灯旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from Winona's Spotlight reaches."
msgstr "我想看看薇诺娜的聚光灯的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around Winona's Spotlight for the moment."
msgstr "薇诺娜的聚光灯这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from Winona's Spotlight."
msgstr "薇诺娜的聚光灯现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_SPOTLIGHT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.1"
msgid "There's a full charge in the w.i.n.bot now."
msgstr "薇机人里的电已经充足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGED.2"
msgid "I can feel the fine hairs on my arm lift."
msgstr "胳膊上的汗毛都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.1"
msgid "It's too early to use the w.i.n.bot again."
msgstr "现在再用薇机人还早了些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.CHARGING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "等准备好了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd watch the w.i.n.bot at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看薇机人怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around the w.i.n.bot for the moment."
msgstr "薇机人这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.OFF.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.1"
msgid "All quiet around the w.i.n.bot for the moment."
msgstr "薇机人这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_STORAGE_ROBOT.SLEEP.2"
msgid "I can get a closer look while it's still."
msgstr "趁它没动，我能靠近些看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.1"
msgid "There's a full charge in the portasol now."
msgstr "传送伞里的电已经充足了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGED.2"
msgid "I can feel the fine hairs on my arm lift."
msgstr "胳膊上的汗毛都竖起来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.1"
msgid "I'll give the portasol a little more time."
msgstr "还得再给传送伞一点时间。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.CHARGING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when it's ready."
msgstr "等准备好了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd set the portasol beside the rest of my supplies."
msgstr "我想把传送伞放在其他物资旁边。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the trusty tape went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了可靠的胶布。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.1"
msgid "All quiet around the portasol for the moment."
msgstr "传送伞这会儿很安静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEBRELLA.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.1"
msgid "Stand well clear of the teletransport station!"
msgstr "离着火的传送运输站远些！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of the teletransport station."
msgstr "传送运输站烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the teletransport station."
msgstr "我先给传送运输站腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.1"
msgid "No sign of activity from the teletransport station."
msgstr "传送运输站现在没什么动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINONA_TELEPORT_PAD_ITEM.OFF.2"
msgid "I wonder what would start it again."
msgstr "不知道怎样才能让它再动起来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.1"
msgid "Would the winter hat leave any room for my glasses?"
msgstr "戴着冬帽还能不能戴眼镜？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERHAT.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the silk if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些蜘蛛丝。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the thermal measurer before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到温度测量仪旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I wonder what the thermal measurer looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，温度测量仪是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTEROMETER.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the holiday cheer aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点节日欢愉给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2"
msgid "I'll need this if I decide to make the tourtiere."
msgstr "要做饕餮馅饼，就得用到这个。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.1"
msgid "I think the masonry oven is nearly finished."
msgstr "我看砖砌烤炉就快好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.ALMOST_DONE_COOKING.2"
msgid "Just time to lay things out before it's done."
msgstr "趁还差那么一会儿，把东西摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.1"
msgid "I can wait. Rushing the masonry oven won't help."
msgstr "我等得起，催砖砌烤炉也没用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.COOKING.2"
msgid "I'll come back when that smell gets a little stronger."
msgstr "等香气再浓一点，我就回来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.1"
msgid "Time to see what the masonry oven has for us."
msgstr "该看看砖砌烤炉这里有什么收获了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.DISH_READY.2"
msgid "I can take care of it now."
msgstr "现在可以动手了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd lay my materials out beside the masonry oven."
msgstr "我想在砖砌烤炉旁把材料排好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTERSFEASTOVEN.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see where the log went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木头。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.1"
msgid "Would you share the gingerbread cookie with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份小姜饼吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD1.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.1"
msgid "Would you share the sugar cookie with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份糖曲奇饼吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD2.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the candy cane."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝拐杖糖。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD3.2"
msgid "I'll save a taste for whoever's on watch."
msgstr "我要给守夜的人留一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.1"
msgid "Would you share the eternal fruitcake with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份永远的水果蛋糕吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD4.2"
msgid "I'll save a taste for whoever's on watch."
msgstr "我要给守夜的人留一口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.1"
msgid "Would you share the chocolate log cake with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份巧克力原木蛋糕吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD5.2"
msgid "We ought to let the youngest choose first."
msgstr "该让年纪最小的先挑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.1"
msgid "Would you share the plum pudding with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份李子布丁吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD6.2"
msgid "We ought to let the youngest choose first."
msgstr "该让年纪最小的先挑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the apple cider."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝苹果酒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD7.2"
msgid "We ought to let the youngest choose first."
msgstr "该让年纪最小的先挑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.1"
msgid "Would you share the hot cocoa with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份热可可吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD8.2"
msgid "We ought to let the youngest choose first."
msgstr "该让年纪最小的先挑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the heavenly eggnog on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些美味的蛋酒。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_FOOD9.2"
msgid "We ought to let the youngest choose first."
msgstr "该让年纪最小的先挑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.1"
msgid "I'd hang the festive bauble where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把圣诞小玩意放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENT.2"
msgid "Let me step back to see how it looks."
msgstr "我退后些看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.1"
msgid "There's a place for the magnificent adornment by the festivities."
msgstr "过节的地方可以给华丽的装饰留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTBOSS.2"
msgid "Let me step back to see how it looks."
msgstr "我退后些看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.1"
msgid "I'd hang the champion adornment where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把熔炉装饰放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTFORGE.2"
msgid "Let me step back to see how it looks."
msgstr "我退后些看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.1"
msgid "There's a place for the appeasing adornment by the festivities."
msgstr "过节的地方可以给暴食装饰留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTGORGE.2"
msgid "I'd like everyone to see it when they come home."
msgstr "希望大家回来时都能看得见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'd hang the festive light where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把圣诞灯放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTLIGHT.2"
msgid "I'd like everyone to see it when they come home."
msgstr "希望大家回来时都能看得见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.1"
msgid "I'd hang the sentimental adornment where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把感伤装饰放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_ORNAMENTPEARL.2"
msgid "I'd like everyone to see it when they come home."
msgstr "希望大家回来时都能看得见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.1"
msgid "I can feel the heat from the winter's feast tree over here."
msgstr "站在这儿都能感觉到冬季盛宴树的热气。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNING.2"
msgid "Let me get at those flames!"
msgstr "让我过去灭火！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the winter's feast tree but ash."
msgstr "冬季盛宴树只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.1"
msgid "I can already imagine ornaments on those branches."
msgstr "我已经能想象枝上挂着饰物的样子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.CANDECORATE.2"
msgid "I'll pick out something light for the top."
msgstr "树顶上得挑件轻的挂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.1"
msgid "I can already imagine ornaments on those branches."
msgstr "我已经能想象枝上挂着饰物的样子了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREE.YOUNG.2"
msgid "I'll pick out something light for the top."
msgstr "树顶上得挑件轻的挂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the festive tree planter but ash."
msgstr "盛宴树盆只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd hang the festive tree planter where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把盛宴树盆放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WINTER_TREESTAND.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'd like everyone to see it when they come home."
msgstr "希望大家回来时都能看得见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd put the witch's broom within reach when I pack."
msgstr "收拾行装时，我会把女巫扫帚放在顺手的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the cut grass to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了采下的草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.1"
msgid "It's moving without anyone holding the handle!"
msgstr "都没人握柄，它自己就动起来了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WITCHBROOM.LIVING.2"
msgid "I hope it's better at corners than I am."
msgstr "希望扫起墙角来比我强。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.1"
msgid "I'd approach the wobster mound quietly enough to hear who's in there."
msgstr "走近龙虾窝时轻一些，听听里面有没有动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_DEN.2"
msgid "I'll leave the entrance clear."
msgstr "我要把出入口让出来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.1"
msgid "Where would I find the lunar wobster after dark?"
msgstr "不知道月光龙虾天黑以后会去哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_MOONGLASS.2"
msgid "I'll stay downwind for a clearer look."
msgstr "我站在下风处看得更仔细些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.1"
msgid "I'd like to sketch the wobster before it moves again."
msgstr "趁龙虾没动，我想画下它的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER.2"
msgid "I won't stand between it and its way home."
msgstr "我不想挡住它回去的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.1"
msgid "I'd save the dead wobster for after practice."
msgstr "我想把死龙虾留到练习结束后。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD.2"
msgid "I'll take a small helping first."
msgstr "我先吃一小份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.1"
msgid "I should let the delicious wobster cool before I take a bite."
msgstr "美味的龙虾要放凉些才能入口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED.2"
msgid "Hot food is worth the wait."
msgstr "为一口热食等等也值得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1.1"
msgid "I know that wag, whatever size you are."
msgstr "不管变多大，我都认得你摇尾巴的样子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1.2"
msgid "There you are, Woby. Room for a pat?"
msgstr "沃比，我能摸摸你吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2.1"
msgid "I'd say hello properly, but you're taller than me now!"
msgstr "我想好好和你打招呼，可你比我还高了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2.2"
msgid "Walter won't have trouble spotting you from the trail."
msgstr "沃尔特在小路那头就能看清你。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1.1"
msgid "There's a good dog."
msgstr "真是只好狗。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1.2"
msgid "I know someone who'd like a treat."
msgstr "我知道有谁想吃零食了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2.1"
msgid "Woby, come here so I can scratch your ears."
msgstr "沃比，过来让我挠挠耳朵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2.2"
msgid "Oh! You're small enough to hide behind my knees."
msgstr "哎，你小得能藏在我膝盖后面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.1"
msgid "Could we take the woby snacks on the road with us?"
msgstr "路上能带着沃比零食吃吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT.2"
msgid "I can see where the monster jerky went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了怪物肉干。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Finished with your weights, %s? I'll take my turn."
msgstr "%s，哑铃用完了吗？我接着练。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, I brought a snack for after training."
msgstr "%s，我带了练完以后吃的点心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.1"
msgid "I'd test the balance of the coaching whistle before putting it to work."
msgstr "我想先掂掂训练哨的重心，再上手使用。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the flint if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些燧石。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Was that wave for me?"
msgstr "刚才是在向我招手吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I saved a little fruit for you."
msgstr "我给你留了点水果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.1"
msgid "You took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER.2"
msgid "Thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the hardwood hat with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下硬木帽。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT.2"
msgid "I'd take a look in a mirror before going out."
msgstr "出门前我想先照一下镜子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "%s, easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "%s，朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "%s, put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "%s，先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER.1"
msgid "I recognized your teeth first, %s."
msgstr "%s，我最先认出的是你的门牙。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER.2"
msgid "Mind the timber, %s. We need that tree for shade."
msgstr "%s，留心那棵树，我们还指望它遮阴呢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST.1"
msgid "Those are familiar ghostly teeth, %s."
msgstr "%s，这对幽灵门牙我可认得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST.2"
msgid "I'll bring a heart, %s. You stay with Lucy."
msgstr "%s，你陪着露西，我去取心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "%s, please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "%s，请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "%s, keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "%s，别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, I heard you and Lucy long before I saw you."
msgstr "%s，好远就听见你和露西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "There's fresh tea back at camp, %s. Bring Lucy."
msgstr "%s，营地刚泡好茶。带露西一起来吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.1"
msgid "Nice wings, %s. How's the view from up there?"
msgstr "%s，翅膀真漂亮。从上面看到的风景好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE.2"
msgid "I'd recognize that honk anywhere, %s."
msgstr "%s，隔多远我都认得这声鹅叫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.1"
msgid "I recognize my friend, even in that shape."
msgstr "即使变成这样，我也认得我的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST.2"
msgid "Hold on. I'll find something to bring you back."
msgstr "稍等，我去找能让你回来的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.1"
msgid "Those antlers won't fit through the camp gate!"
msgstr "这对角可过不了营地的门！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE.2"
msgid "Goodness, Woodie. Give me a moment to get used to this."
msgstr "伍迪，让我花点时间适应一下。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.1"
msgid "I recognize my friend, even in that shape."
msgstr "即使变成这样，我也认得我的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST.2"
msgid "Hold on. I'll find something to bring you back."
msgstr "稍等，我去找能让你回来的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the wooden chair before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到木椅旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Let me sit and take the weight off my feet a moment."
msgstr "让我坐一会儿，歇歇脚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see the rest of camp quite well from this seat."
msgstr "从这个位置，营地里看得挺清楚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.1"
msgid "It looks rather crowded inside the wooden chair."
msgstr "木椅里面看着挺挤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED.2"
msgid "I'll wait until there's room."
msgstr "我等空出位置再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I won't get any more use out of it."
msgstr "它烧成这样，用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "There's space here for tea and two cups."
msgstr "这里放一壶茶、两只杯子刚好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll wipe the top before we lay out supper."
msgstr "摆晚饭前，我先把桌面擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's something already set out on the table."
msgstr "桌上已经摆了东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'll make room before I put anything else down."
msgstr "再放东西前，我先腾点位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.1"
msgid "I ought to watch what happens under that light."
msgstr "我得留心那团光底下的动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT.2"
msgid "I'll keep a safe distance till I see the whole thing."
msgstr "没看清全貌前，我先留些距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.1"
msgid "I ought to watch what happens under that light."
msgstr "我得留心那团光底下的动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT.2"
msgid "I'll keep a safe distance till I see the whole thing."
msgstr "没看清全貌前，我先留些距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.1"
msgid "I ought to watch what happens under that light."
msgstr "我得留心那团光底下的动静。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM.2"
msgid "I'll keep a safe distance till I see the whole thing."
msgstr "没看清全貌前，我先留些距离。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the route back from the worm hole."
msgstr "从虫洞回去的路得记牢。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll make a note of the nearest shelter."
msgstr "我记一下最近的避风处在哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.1"
msgid "There's a way through the worm hole now."
msgstr "现在能从虫洞这里过去了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN.2"
msgid "I should see where this leads."
msgstr "我去看看到底通向哪儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.1"
msgid "I wonder what the sick worm hole looked like when this place was new."
msgstr "不知道这里刚建成时，生病的虫洞是什么样。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED.2"
msgid "I can see a little more from the other side."
msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the glow berry reaches."
msgstr "我想看看发光浆果的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT.2"
msgid "I'd rather have the light beside me than in my eyes."
msgstr "光放在身边好些，别正对着眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.1"
msgid "I'd set a little of the lesser glow berry aside for our guest."
msgstr "我想留一点小发光浆果给客人。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER.2"
msgid "Supper's better when we can all sit down together."
msgstr "大家能坐在一起吃，晚饭才香。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.1"
msgid "I'd like to see how the mysterious plant changes with the season."
msgstr "想看看换季时神秘植物会有什么变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT.2"
msgid "I could come back tomorrow to see what has changed."
msgstr "明天我可以回来看看有何变化。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC.1"
msgid "How's the garden today, %s?"
msgstr "%s，菜园里今天怎么样？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC.2"
msgid "%s, there's a sprout I'd like you to look at."
msgstr "%s，有株小苗想请你看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.1"
msgid "%s, stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "%s，跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST.2"
msgid "%s, we came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "%s，我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER.2"
msgid "Nobody else is getting hurt here."
msgstr "不能再有人受伤了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER.1"
msgid "%s, you took care of our friend. I won't forget it."
msgstr "%s，你救了我们的朋友，我会记得。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER.2"
msgid "%s, thank you for going back when someone needed help."
msgstr "%s，谢谢你在有人需要帮忙时赶了回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.1"
msgid "That fruit has come into its colour."
msgstr "果子已经长出了熟透的颜色。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE.2"
msgid "It's time to bring a basket."
msgstr "该拿个篮子来收了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.1"
msgid "Wormwood, did you raise this one yourself?"
msgstr "沃姆伍德，这是你亲自养大的吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER.2"
msgid "I can see why you'd call it a friend."
msgstr "我明白你为什么把它当成朋友。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.1"
msgid "Even at this distance the great depths worm fills my whole field of view."
msgstr "隔着这么远，眼里也全是巨大洞穴蠕虫。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS.2"
msgid "I should keep my eyes up and my footing sure."
msgstr "眼睛得看着前面，脚下也得站稳。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.1"
msgid "I don't think the blighted great depths worm has lost sight of me."
msgstr "我觉得枯萎洞穴巨虫一直看得见我。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS_SHADOW.2"
msgid "There's a good view if we stay still."
msgstr "站着不动，反而能看清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER.1"
msgid "Easy, friend. Shall we talk this through?"
msgstr "朋友，先缓缓。我们谈谈好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER.2"
msgid "Put your hands down. I'm listening."
msgstr "先把手放下来，我听你说。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER.1"
msgid "Please watch where those sparks land."
msgstr "请留意火星会落到哪里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER.2"
msgid "Keep the fire away from everyone's things."
msgstr "别让火烧到大家的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC.1"
msgid "%s, will you walk with me, or hop on ahead?"
msgstr "%s，要和我一起走，还是你先跳过去？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I heard a bell. Good to see you, %s."
msgstr "我听见铃铛响了。%s，见到你真好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.1"
msgid "Stay close. I'll see what I can do about a heart."
msgstr "跟紧我，我去想办法找颗心。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST.2"
msgid "We came here together. We're leaving together."
msgstr "我们一起来的，也一起回去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.1"
msgid "Stand back. I've seen what you've done."
msgstr "退后，我看见你做了什么。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER.2"
