msgstr "泷奈一定会把强抢袋里的东西列张清单。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG.2"
msgid "I'll keep the things we need first near the top."
msgstr "先要用的东西得放在最上面。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the twintailed heart in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给双尾心腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER.2"
msgid "I can see where the soul went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了灵魂。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR.1"
msgid "I'd keep the soul jar somewhere we can all reach."
msgstr "灵魂罐该放到大家都够得着的地方。"

