#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.W_RADIO.2"
msgid "I can see where the electrical doodad went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了电子元件。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.1"
msgid "The long shaft changes my stance quite a bit."
msgstr "长柄一握，站姿也得跟着变。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YARI.2"
msgid "I need a more open patch to practice with this."
msgstr "要练这个，得找块宽敞的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the marks on the magiluminescence up close."
msgstr "我想贴近看清魔光护符上的纹路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWAMULET.2"
msgid "I'll wrap it separately from my ordinary things."
msgstr "我把它和日常用品分开包好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the yellow gem."
msgstr "黄宝石深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWGEM.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.1"
msgid "I can see a reflection deep inside the yellow moonlens."
msgstr "黄色月眼深处映着一点光。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWMOONEYE.2"
msgid "I'd turn it over slowly to look for flaws."
msgstr "我想慢慢转一圈，看看有没有瑕疵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.1"
msgid "I'll keep the star caller's staff where it won't catch on my sleeve."
msgstr "我会把唤星者魔杖放在不勾袖口的位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YELLOWSTAFF.2"
msgid "I should wipe the handle before I put it away."
msgstr "收好前要把柄擦干净。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the beefalo shrine but ash."
msgstr "皮弗娄牛神龛只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the beefalo shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，皮弗娄牛神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the beefalo shrine here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把皮弗娄牛神龛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALOSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wish I could ask the people who made it."
msgstr "真想和造它的人说上几句。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_BEEFALO_DOLL_BEAST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I like the stitching on the lucky beast beefalo doll."
msgstr "我喜欢幸运兽皮弗娄牛玩偶上的针脚。"

