msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST.2"
msgid "It would help to mark the path before dark."
msgstr "天黑前把路标好会方便很多。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the beefalo stage."
msgstr "我先给皮弗娄牛舞台腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_POST_ITEM.2"
msgid "I can see where the boards went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.1"
msgid "I'd watch the sewing machine at work before adjusting anything."
msgstr "调整以前，我想先看看缝纫机怎么运作。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE.2"
msgid "I'm better with a blade than a set of gears."
msgstr "比起齿轮，我还是更熟悉刀具。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the sewing machine kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开缝纫机套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_SEWINGMACHINE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.1"
msgid "I'd bring the judge's booth back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把裁判席带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE.2"
msgid "I'll keep it separate until I know what it's for."
msgstr "弄清用途以前，我先单独收好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the judge's booth before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开裁判席以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTB_STAGE_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the carrat shrine in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出胡萝卜鼠神龛的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the carrat shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，胡萝卜鼠神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the carrat shrine before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把胡萝卜鼠神龛画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

