msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the checkpoint."
msgstr "得记住回到检查点这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT.2"
