msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the checkpoint kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开检查点套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_CHECKPOINT_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the finish line but ash."
msgstr "终点线只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I ought to remember the way back to the finish line."
msgstr "得记住回到终点线这里的路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I should make a quick sketch before we leave."
msgstr "走之前我该简单画个草图。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.1"
msgid "We crossed first! Well run, little one."
msgstr "我们第一个冲线！小家伙，跑得好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.I_WON.2"
msgid "I think my little runner has earned a treat."
msgstr "该给我的小选手一点奖赏了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON.1"
msgid "Well run, {winner}! I'll train for the next race."
msgstr "{winner}跑得好！我回去接着练。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH.SOMEONE_ELSE_WON.2"
msgid "First across was {winner}. Shall we line up again?"
msgstr "{winner}最先冲线。我们再比一场好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the finish line kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放终点线套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_FINISH_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

