msgstr "从另一边还能多看到一些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the starting point kit."
msgstr "我先给起点套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_RACE_START_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.1"
msgid "There's a black mark where the carrat scale stood."
msgstr "胡萝卜鼠秤原先的位置烧得一片黑。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.1"
msgid "Let's see what the training has done for you."
msgstr "来看看训练成果如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT.2"
msgid "I should record today's reading to compare tomorrow."
msgstr "我记下今天的读数，明天好作比较。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.1"
msgid "Let's see what the training has done for you."
msgstr "来看看训练成果如何。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.CARRAT_GOOD.2"
msgid "I should record today's reading to compare tomorrow."
msgstr "我记下今天的读数，明天好作比较。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd like to see the carrat scale in daylight."
msgstr "我想看看日光下的胡萝卜鼠秤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "Next time I'll bring my notebook."
msgstr "下次把笔记本带来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the carrat scale kit."
msgstr "我先给胡萝卜鼠秤套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_SCALE_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd lay the parts out in order before starting."
msgstr "开始前我会把部件依次摆好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.1"
msgid "I should save the packet of seeds for planting day."
msgstr "我得把种子包留到播种那天。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET.2"
msgid "I can spare a corner of the garden for these."
msgstr "菜园角上还能匀出一点地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.1"
msgid "I keep the premium seed packet in a dry pocket."
msgstr "我把高级种子包收在干燥的口袋里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTC_SEEDPACKET_RARE.2"
msgid "I'd like to see the first leaves when they come up."
msgstr "我想看它刚发芽时的叶子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.1"
msgid "If we stop here, that'll keep the boat in place."
msgstr "在这里停船，它就能把船固定好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR.2"
msgid "I'd check the anchor before the race starts."
msgstr "开赛前我得检查一下船锚。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the claw anchor kit."
msgstr "我先给巨爪船锚套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_ANCHOR_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the dragonfly shrine but ash."
msgstr "龙蝇神龛只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "We'd have to start over here."
msgstr "这里得从头再来了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "There's nothing in the dragonfly shrine at the moment."
msgstr "龙蝇神龛里面什么也没有。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the dragonfly shrine here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把龙蝇神龛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_DRAGONSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the boards if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些木板。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.1"
msgid "I ought to make a place for the claw oar in my pack."
msgstr "得在包里给利爪船桨腾个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_OAR.2"
msgid "I can see where the gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.1"
msgid "I can steer the dragon boat with both hands on this."
msgstr "双手握稳，就能给龙舟掌舵。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL.2"
msgid "I should know where the turns are before we race."
msgstr "开赛前得记清哪些地方要转弯。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'll make room to set up the dragonfly boat wheel kit."
msgstr "我先给龙蝇船方向舵套装腾块地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTD_STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the rocking mare kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放摇摇马套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_CHAIR_ROCKING_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.1"
msgid "Let me try the gilded knight's helmet with my hair tied back."
msgstr "我扎起头发试一下镀金骑士头盔。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTHAT.2"
msgid "I like to keep my line of sight clear."
msgstr "我喜欢眼前敞亮些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the clockwork knight shrine before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到发条骑士神龛旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "That smell stays on my sleeves."
msgstr "袖口都沾了焦味。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "Room to spare in the clockwork knight shrine."
msgstr "发条骑士神龛里面还空着。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "Well, I wasn't going to find much in there today."
msgstr "看来今天在这儿找不到东西了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the clockwork knight shrine before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把发条骑士神龛画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.1"
msgid "I wonder who first thought to make the shtick horse this shape."
msgstr "不知最早是谁想到把滑稽马做成这种形状。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSTICK.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.1"
msgid "I'd check the grip on the joust-a-dash before taking it out."
msgstr "带冲锋骑枪出门前，我想先检查握柄。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTH_LANCE.2"
msgid "A light touch tells me more than a hard swing."
msgstr "轻轻试一下，比用力挥更能感觉出分量。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.1"
msgid "Would you share the tribute roast with me?"
msgstr "你愿意和我分一份贡品烤肉吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD1.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the lucky gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the eight treasure mud pie on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些八宝泥馅饼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD2.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the fish heads on a stick."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝鱼头串。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTP_FOOD3.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.1"
msgid "I'd hang the short rabbit lamp where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把矮兔灯放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.GENERAL.2"
msgid "Let me step back to see how it looks."
msgstr "我退后些看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.1"
msgid "There isn't a flicker left in the short rabbit lamp."
msgstr "矮兔灯里一点火光都没了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1.OUT.2"
msgid "I should find something to light it with."
msgstr "我该找些能引火的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd hang the short rabbit lamp where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把矮兔灯放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_1_ITEM.2"
msgid "I can see where the lucky gold nugget went into it."
msgstr "看得出哪里用上了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.1"
msgid "There's a place for the tall rabbit lamp by the festivities."
msgstr "过节的地方可以给高兔灯留个位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.GENERAL.2"
msgid "Let me step back to see how it looks."
msgstr "我退后些看看效果。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.1"
msgid "There isn't a flicker left in the tall rabbit lamp."
msgstr "高兔灯里一点火光都没了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2.OUT.2"
msgid "I should find something to light it with."
msgstr "我该找些能引火的东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd hang the tall rabbit lamp where the light catches it."
msgstr "我想把高兔灯放在照得到光的地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_DECOR_2_ITEM.2"
msgid "I'd like everyone to see it when they come home."
msgstr "希望大家回来时都能看得见。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I should warn everyone before I ring it."
msgstr "敲响之前得先提醒大家。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.GENERIC.2"
msgid "That bell must carry quite a way."
msgstr "钟声一定能传得很远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.1"
msgid "My turn at the pillow fight bell soon?"
msgstr "快轮到我玩枕头大战钟了吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_BELL.PLAYING.2"
msgid "One more round if there's time."
msgstr "有时间我还想再来一局。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.1"
msgid "There's enough ground here for the pillow fight pit kit, I think."
msgstr "我看这里放枕头大战坑套装够宽敞。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT.2"
msgid "Better check the ground is level first."
msgstr "先看看地面平不平。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the bunny roll."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝兔子卷。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD1.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the moon cake."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝月饼。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD2.2"
msgid "I wonder how they make these for so many guests."
msgstr "不知道他们怎么做得出这么多份待客。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.1"
msgid "I'll set some of the moon jelly on the feast table."
msgstr "我想在节庆的餐桌上放些月冻。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD3.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.1"
msgid "The festival's a good excuse to try the skewered puffs."
msgstr "过节正好能尝尝泡芙串。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FOOD4.2"
msgid "I remember setting aside the lucky gold nugget to make this."
msgstr "我记得做它的时候，特地留了幸运金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the bunnyman shrine in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出兔人神龛的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll see what survived nearby."
msgstr "我去看看旁边的东西有没有保住。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the bunnyman shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，兔人神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'd draw the bunnyman shrine before the details wear away."
msgstr "我想趁细节还清楚，把兔人神龛画下来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_RABBITSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.1"
msgid "I'd bring the glove of challenge back for a closer look."
msgstr "我想把挑战手套带回去仔细看看。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTR_TOKEN.2"
msgid "I'll have to set aside the gold nugget if I make another."
msgstr "想再做一件，得多备些金块。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.1"
msgid "I wish I'd reached the jubilantern post before the fire did."
msgstr "要是我能赶在起火前来到喜庆灯笼柱旁边就好了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.1"
msgid "I'll see how far the light from the jubilantern post reaches."
msgstr "我想看看喜庆灯笼柱的光能照到多远。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I can find my way by a light this size."
msgstr "凭这么一点光，就能找到路。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.1"
msgid "I'd pick the spot for the jubilantern post kit before unpacking."
msgstr "拆开喜庆灯笼柱套装以前，得先挑好位置。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_LANTERN_POST_ITEM.2"
msgid "Let's decide which way it ought to face."
msgstr "得先商量好朝哪个方向。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "Nothing left of the depths worm shrine but ash."
msgstr "洞穴蠕虫神龛只剩下灰了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "Even the inside is charred."
msgstr "连里面都焦了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the depths worm shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，洞穴蠕虫神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I'll have to come back with something for it."
msgstr "下次得带点东西来放进去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the depths worm shrine here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把洞穴蠕虫神龛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_SNAKESHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "I'll be careful where I put my hands."
msgstr "手要往哪里放，得小心些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.1"
msgid "The little one burrows surprisingly fast."
msgstr "这小家伙钻地钻得真快。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOTS_WORM.2"
msgid "I can see a trail where it went under."
msgstr "它钻下去的地方，还看得见一道痕。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.1"
msgid "I can still make out the catcoon shrine in the ashes."
msgstr "从灰烬里还辨得出浣猫神龛的轮廓。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT.2"
msgid "I'll come back when the embers cool."
msgstr "等余烬冷了我再来。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.1"
msgid "I had a look inside the catcoon shrine. Empty."
msgstr "我看过了，浣猫神龛里面是空的。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY.2"
msgid "I can see right to the bottom."
msgstr "一眼就能看到底。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.1"
msgid "Someone went to great trouble to leave the catcoon shrine here."
msgstr "有人费了好大工夫，才把浣猫神龛留在这里。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.GENERIC.2"
msgid "A moment of quiet here seems fitting."
msgstr "我想在这里安静站一会儿。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.1"
msgid "I haven't seen one of these before."
msgstr "我以前没见过这种东西。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_GENERIC.2"
msgid "I wonder who could tell me about it."
msgstr "不知谁能教我认一认。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.1"
msgid "A healthy new leaf. Good."
msgstr "新叶长得好，放心了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTHAPPY.2"
msgid "I'll let it grow in peace."
msgstr "让它安心长吧。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.1"
msgid "Something in the garden needs tending."
msgstr "菜园里有些地方得照料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED.2"
msgid "I'll check the leaves and the soil."
msgstr "我看看叶片和土壤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.1"
msgid "It would do better beside its own kind."
msgstr "旁边种上同类会长得更好。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORFAMILY.2"
msgid "I should save another seed of this variety."
msgstr "得再留一颗这个品种的种子。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.1"
msgid "I haven't visited this one in a while."
msgstr "我有段时间没来看这株了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORHAPPINESS.2"
msgid "Shall I keep you company?"
msgstr "我陪你待一会儿好吗？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.1"
msgid "Those weeds have to come out."
msgstr "得把那些杂草拔掉。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORKILLJOYS.2"
msgid "I'll clear around the roots."
msgstr "我清一下根旁边的杂草。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.1"
msgid "The soil crumbles in my hand. Too dry."
msgstr "土一捏就散，太干了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORMOISTURE.2"
msgid "I'll fetch the watering can."
msgstr "我去拿浇水壶。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.1"
msgid "This patch could use some fertilizer."
msgstr "这块地该施肥了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORNUTRIENTS.2"
msgid "The soil hasn't much left to give."
msgstr "土里的养分已经不多了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.1"
msgid "There's no room for the leaves to spread."
msgstr "叶子都铺展不开了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSOROVERCROWDING.2"
msgid "I'll leave more space between rows."
msgstr "行与行之间得再空些地方。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.1"
msgid "I planted this one at the wrong time of year."
msgstr "这株我种错季节了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSORSEASON.2"
msgid "Next year I'll check the season first."
msgstr "明年先看好时节再种。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.1"
msgid "Something in the garden needs tending."
msgstr "菜园里有些地方得照料了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_PLANTVERYSTRESSED.2"
msgid "I'll check the leaves and the soil."
msgstr "我看看叶片和土壤。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.1"
msgid "There's smoke coming off it!"
msgstr "上面开始冒烟了！"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_SMOLDERING.2"
msgid "A little water now might save it."
msgstr "现在浇些水也许还来得及。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.1"
msgid "Even with my glasses, I can't make it out."
msgstr "戴着眼镜也看不清。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE_TOODARK.2"
msgid "Bring the light over here, please."
msgstr "请把灯拿近些。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.1"
msgid "Ow! What was in that mouthful?"
msgstr "疼！刚才那口里有什么？"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.2"
msgid "I'm going to chew more carefully."
msgstr "得仔细嚼才行。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.1"
msgid "Mm. I'm glad I saved room."
msgstr "嗯，还好我留了点胃口。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.EAT_FOOD.WINTERSFEASTFUEL.2"
msgid "I wouldn't mind another helping."
msgstr "我还想再来一份。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.1"
msgid "We didn't feed it in time."
msgstr "我们没赶上把吃的送过去。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_LOSE.2"
msgid "That sound doesn't promise a safe way home."
msgstr "听这声音，回家怕是难了。"

#. STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.MANUTSAWEE_SPEECH_VARIANTS.QUAGMIRE_ANNOUNCE_MEALBURNT.1"
